    "Season of Ghosts": {
      "name": "鬼季 Season of Ghosts",
      "description": "<p>柳岸镇这座小镇有个大麻烦——它被诅咒了！当一群英雄在一场送别春末、迎接夏日的庆典后于林中醒来——这段在当地被称为鬼季的时节——他们发现自己的家乡已被怪物、诡异的天气与骇人的幽灵入侵。然而，这些威胁柳岸镇的古老邪恶之显现，与《鬼季》中等待被揭开的令人不寒而栗的秘密相比，根本不算什么。</p>\n<p>The small town of Willowshore has a big problem—it´s cursed! When a group of heroes awaken in the woods after a festival to usher out the last day of spring and welcome in the summer—a time known locally as the season of ghosts, they find their hometown has been invaded by monsters, strange weather, and horrifying ghosts. Yet theses manifestations of the ancient evil that threatens Willowshore are nothing compared to the harrowing secrets awaiting discovery in Season of Ghosts.</p>",
