            "Grim Trophy": {
              "name": "阴森战利品 Grim Trophy",
              "description": "<p>它看起来像是一只仍然带血的人类耳朵。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p><hr /><p>这件护符有许多形态，最常见的是以某种骇人的方式展示的一段被切下的人形生物肢体。你启动该战利品时，进行一次威吓检定来通过 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{挫败士气} 影响至多两个目标，将你的威吓检定结果与他们两者的 DC 分别比较。</p>\n<p>It appears to be a still-bloody human ear.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p><hr /><p>This talisman comes in many forms, most often a severed piece of a humanoid creature displayed in some gruesome manner. When you activate the trophy, make an Intimidation check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} up to two targets, comparing your Intimidation check result to both of their DCs.</p>"
