              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名手上没有无效封印符文的生物接近到宅邸5英尺内，或试图对宅邸造成伤害</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 一阵爆炸性的魔法冲击猛烈撞向入侵者，入侵者必须进行一次@Check[reflex|dc:33] 豁免。如果触发生物不与宅邸相邻，则该次豁免的结果提高一级成功程度。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[1d12[force]] 伤害，并被推离宅邸5英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[(2d12+13)[force]] 伤害，并被推离宅邸5英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[(4d12+16)[force]] 伤害，并被抛飞向后20英尺，且被击倒@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}，并因坠落受到@Damage[10[bludgeoning]|options:fall-damage] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但向后100英尺并被击倒倒地，且因坠落受到@Damage[50[bludgeoning]|options:fall-damage] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature without a nullifying seal script on their hand approaches within 5 feet of the manor or attempts to damage the manor</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> An explosive blast of magic violently slams against the intruder, who must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:33] save. If the triggering creature isn't adjacent to the manor, it adjusts the result of this save up by one degree of success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[1d12[force]] damage and is pushed 5 feet away from the manor.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(2d12+13)[force]] damage and is pushed 5 feet away from the manor.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(4d12+16)[force]] damage and is thrown 20 feet back and knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, taking @Damage[10[bludgeoning]|options:fall-damage] damage from the fall.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but 100 feet back and knocked prone, taking @Damage[50[bludgeoning]|options:fall-damage] damage from the fall.</p>"
