          "disable": "<p>@Check[arcana|dc:35]、@Check[occultism|dc:35]或@Check[thievery|dc:35]（大师）以破坏魔法从而允许进入宅邸，@Check[athletics|dc:32]以强行穿过屏障并进入宅邸（不过这无法让其他PC跟在你身后进入！），或解除魔法（5环；反制DC 28）以反制这些护</p>\n<p>@Check[arcana|dc:35], @Check[occultism|dc:35], or @Check[thievery|dc:35] (master) to compromise the magic to allow entry into the manor, @Check[athletics|dc:32] to force your way through the barrier and enter the manor (this doesn't allow other PCs to enter behind you, though!), or dispel magic (5th level; counteract DC 28) to counteract the wards</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>层层符箓与印有祷文的布条被糊在宅邸的墙壁与各处入口上，划定出环绕整座庄园的一道界线，使任何幽灵或魂魄都无法穿越。</p>\n<p>Layers of fulus and strips of prayer-printed ribbons are plastered over the walls and entrances to the manor, demarcating a boundary around the mansion where no ghosts or spirits can pass.</p>",
