        "Shrine Maiden": {
          "name": "巫女 Shrine Maiden",
          "tokenName": "神社巫女 Shrine Maiden",
          "items": {
            "Divine Spontaneous Spells": {
              "name": "神术自发法术 Divine Spontaneous Spells"
            },
            "Sending": {
              "name": "发送 Sending",
              "description": "<p>你向该生物发送一段不超过25个词的心灵信息，它可以立即用一段不超过25个词的信息回应。</p>\n<p>You send the creature a mental message of 25 words or fewer, and it can respond immediately with its own message of 25 words or fewer.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Wrath": {
              "name": "神圣狂怒 Divine Wrath",
              "description": "<p>你引导神祇之怒对抗你的敌人。根据它们的强韧豁免，你对区域内的敌人造成4d10点魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全额伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物承受全额伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}；当它处于恶心状态时，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}; while it's sickened, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Cascade": {
              "name": "圣瀑冲击 Holy Cascade",
              "description": "<p>你呼唤神圣能量来增幅一瓶@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.z9T4c1hXwOotsMCp]{圣水}，并将其掷出不可思议的距离。它会爆炸成一次巨大的冲击，从倾泻的水流中对区域内的生物造成3d6钝击伤害。水会对区域内具有邪秽（特征）的生物造成额外的@Damage[((@item.level*2)-2)d6[spirit]]魂魄伤害。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 钝击伤害增加1d6，且额外的魂魄伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You call upon sacred energy to amplify a vial of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.z9T4c1hXwOotsMCp]{Holy Water}, tossing it an incredible distance. It explodes in an enormous burst that deals 3d6 bludgeoning damage to creatures in the area from the cascade of water. The water deals an additional @Damage[((@item.level*2)-2)d6[spirit]] damage to creatures with the unholy trait in the area.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The bludgeoning damage increases by 1d6, and the additional spirit damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Planar Tether": {
              "name": "位面系链 Planar Tether",
              "description": "<p>你将目标缝合在其当前的位面上。当目标受到<em>位面系缚</em>影响时，该法术会尝试反制任何会移动目标的传送效果，或任何会将其传送到不同位面的效果。<em>位面系缚</em>的持续时间由目标的意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该效果的持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该效果的持续时间为10分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该效果的持续时间为1小时。</p>\n<p>You stitch the target to its current plane. While the target is affected by <em>planar tether</em>, the spell attempts to counteract any teleportation effect that would move the target, or any effect that would transport it to a different plane. <em>Planar tether</em>'s duration is determined by the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The effect's duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The effect's duration is 10 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The effect's duration is 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Light": {
              "name": "圣光 Holy Light",
              "description": "<p>你射出一道耀眼的光线，带着圣洁能量。进行一次远程法术攻击。这道光线造成5d6火焰伤害。如果目标具有邪秽（特征），你额外造成5d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全额伤害。</p>\n<p>如果光线穿过一片魔法黑暗区域，或以受魔法黑暗影响的生物为目标，圣光会尝试反制黑暗。如果你需要判定光线是否穿过一片黑暗区域，在你与该法术的目标之间画一条线。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 火焰伤害增加2d6，而对邪秽生物的魂魄伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You shine a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Augury": {
              "name": "占卜 Augury",
              "description": "<p>你获得对未来的模糊一瞥。在施放该法术期间，询问某个特定行动方案的结果。该法术最多能预测未来30分钟内的结果，并揭示GM在以下结果中所做的最佳判断：好、坏、混合（结果将好坏参半）以及无（不会出现特别好或特别坏的结果）。</p>\n<p>GM暗中进行一次 @Check[flat|dc:6|showDC:all|traits:secret]。若为失败，结果总是“无”。这使得你无法判断“无”的结果是否准确。若在额外一次施放<em>预兆</em>时，有人询问与第一次施放<em>预兆</em>相同的主题，则GM使用第一次施放时的暗掷结果。不过，如果情况发生变化，也有可能得到不同的结果。</p>\n<p>You gain a vague glimpse of the future. During the casting of this spell, ask about the results of a particular course of action. The spell can predict results up to 30 minutes into the future and reveal the GM's best guess among the following outcomes: good, bad, mixed (the results will be a mix of good and bad), and nothing (there won't be particularly good or bad results).</p>\n<p>The GM rolls a secret @Check[flat|dc:6|showDC:all|traits:secret]. On a failure, the result is always \"nothing.\" This makes it impossible to tell whether a \"nothing\" result is accurate. If anyone asks about the same topic as the first casting of <em>augury</em> during an additional casting, the GM uses the secret roll result from the first casting. If circumstances change, though, it's possible to get a different result.</p>"
            },
            "Clear Mind": {
              "name": "澄明心智 Clear Mind",
              "description": "<p>你将心灵污染从目标的心智中驱逐出去。尝试反制一个你选择的、使目标承受以下状态之一的效果：@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}、以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}。如果你反制该效果失败，但若其反制阶位低2则你本可反制成功，则改为将该效果压制至你下个回合开始。效果被压制期间，其持续时间不会流逝。此法术无法反制或压制作为诅咒、疾病的一部分，或作为目标自然状态一部分的状态。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled}、以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed} 添加到状态列表中。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed} 添加到状态列表中。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} 添加到状态列表中。</p>\n<p>You drive mental contamination from the target's mind. Attempt to counteract an effect of your choice imposing one of these conditions on the target: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}. If you failed to counteract the effect but you would have if its counteract rank were 2 lower, instead suppress the effect until the beginning of your next turn. The effect's duration doesn't elapse while it's suppressed. This spell can't counteract or suppress conditions that are part of curses, diseases, or a natural state of the target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed} to the list of conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed} to the list of conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> Add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} to the list of conditions.</p>"
            },
            "Consecrate": {
              "name": "加持术 Consecrate",
              "description": "<p><strong>区域</strong> 以一座不可移动的祭坛、神龛或你的神祇之固定圣物为中心的40尺半径爆发</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你将一处地点奉献给你的神祇，吟诵赞歌并创造一片神圣空间。在该区域内，你的神祇之信徒在攻击骰、技能检定、豁免骰与察觉检定上获得+1状态加值；而对你的神祇而言属于禁忌的生物（例如对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{法莱斯玛}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}而言的不死）在这些骰上承受-1状态减值。若你的神祇的神圣圣化允许你选择神圣或亵渎，你也可以选择使该奉献地点成为神圣或亵渎。若该神祇的圣化<span class=\"fontstyle2\">必须</span>为神圣或亵渎，你必须使该地点与该圣化相符。你的神祇之信徒在该区域内进行的打击获得该地点的圣化特性（若有）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 加持术成功，且其持续时间改为10年而非1年，或覆盖半径加倍的区域。偶尔，在你的神祇恩宠之下，这可能产生更令人惊叹的效果，例如永久加持的区域，或效果覆盖整座大教堂。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 加持术成功。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 加持术失败。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 加持术以灾难性的方式失败并激怒你的神祇，祂会降下不悦的征兆。至少在1年内，进一步尝试为该地点加持术都会失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 该加持区域也获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{位面封印}法术的效果，但该效果不会尝试反制你的神祇之信徒所进行的传送。成本提高至200 gp ×法术环阶。</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 40-foot-radius burst around an immobile altar, shrine, or fixture of your deity</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You consecrate a site to your deity, chanting praises and creating a sacred space. While within the area, worshippers of your deity gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, skill checks, saving throws, and Perception checks, and creatures anathema to your deity (such as undead for @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{Pharasma} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}) take a -1 status penalty to those rolls. If your deity's divine sanctification allows you to choose holy or unholy, you can choose to make the consecrated site holy or unholy as well. If the deity's sanctification <span class=\"fontstyle2\">must </span>be holy or unholy, you must make the site match that sanctification. Strikes made by worshippers of your deity within the area gain the site's sanctification trait, if any.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The consecration succeeds, and it either lasts for 10 years instead of 1 or covers an area with twice the radius. Occasionally, with your deity's favor, this might produce an even more amazing effect, such as a permanently consecrated area or the effect covering an entire cathedral.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The consecration succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The consecration fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The consecration fails spectacularly and angers your deity, who sends a sign of displeasure. For at least 1 year, further attempts to consecrate the site fail.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The consecrated area also gains the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{Planar Seal} spell, but the effect doesn't attempt to counteract teleportation by worshippers of your deity. The cost increases to 200 gp × the spell rank.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你解开一个法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一件魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内成为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法性质。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "See the Unseen": {
              "name": "目睹无形者 See the Unseen",
              "description": "<p>你的目光能穿透幻象，发现@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的生物与魂魄。你能看见隐形生物，就如同它们并未隐形一般，但其细节会变得模糊，使它们处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}状态且难以辨认。你也能看见虚体生物（如幽灵）以相位穿过物体；当它们位于距某个物体表面10英尺以内、并从物体内部穿过时，你会透过那些物体看见它们呈现为模糊的形状。更细微的线索还使你在进行识破幻象的检定时获得+2状态加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>此法术的持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{法术效果：看见不可见之物}</p>\n<p>Your gaze pierces through illusions and finds @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} creatures and spirits. You can see invisible creatures as though they weren't invisible, although their features are blurred, making them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} and difficult to identify. You can also see incorporeal creatures, like ghosts, phased through an object from within 10 feet of an object's surface as blurry shapes seen through those objects. Subtler clues also grant you a +2 status bonus to checks you make to disbelieve illusions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> This spell has a duration of 8 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{Spell Effect: See the Unseen}</p>"
            },
            "Bless": {
              "name": "祝福 Bless",
              "description": "<p>来自彼岸的祝福帮助你的伙伴精准打击。你和你的盟友在处于该散发范围内时，攻击掷骰获得+1状态加值。在后续回合中每轮一次，你可以维持该法术，使该散发的半径增加10尺。</p>\n<p>祝福术可以反制 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.7ZinJNzxq0XF0oMx]{绝望术}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.RfCEHpMoEAZvB9IZ]{灵光：祝福术}</p>\n<p>Blessings from beyond help your companions strike true. You and your allies gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls while within the emanation. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet.</p>\n<p>Bless can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.7ZinJNzxq0XF0oMx]{Bane}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.RfCEHpMoEAZvB9IZ]{Aura: Bless}</p>"
            },
            "Cleanse Cuisine": {
              "name": "净化料理 Cleanse Cuisine",
              "description": "<p>你将区域内的所有食物和饮料变成美味佳肴，把水变成葡萄酒或其他优质饮品，或提升食物的味道与原料，使其成为精致美食。你也可以选择移除食物中的所有毒素与污染物。此法术无法防止未来的污染、自然腐坏或变质，也不会让食物更有营养。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 区域额外增加 1 立方英尺，且必须与其余部分相连。</p>\n<p>You transform all food and beverages in the area into delicious fare, changing water into wine or another fine beverage, or enhancing the food's taste and ingredients to make it a gourmet treat. You can also choose to remove all toxins and contaminations from the food. This spell doesn't prevent future contamination, natural decay, or spoilage, nor does it make the food any more nutritious.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> Add another cubic foot to the area, which must be contiguous with the rest.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道神圣能量光束。对目标的 AC 进行一次远程法术攻击。命中时，目标受到 2d4 点魂魄伤害（大成功时伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d4 点。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Forbidding Ward": {
              "name": "禁绝护 Forbidding Ward",
              "description": "<p>你守护一名盟友，使其免受目标敌人的攻击和敌对法术。目标盟友在对抗目标敌人的攻击、法术以及其他效果时，其护甲等级与豁免骰获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ctMxYPGEpstvhW9C]{法术效果：禁制守护}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 该状态加值提升至+2。</p>\n<p>You ward an ally against the attacks and hostile spells from the target enemy. The target ally gains a +1 status bonus to Armor Class and saving throws against the target enemy's attacks, spells, and other effects.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ctMxYPGEpstvhW9C]{Spell Effect: Forbidding Ward}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +2.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导生命能量来治疗活物或伤害不死。若目标是自愿的活体生物，你恢复其1d8点生命值。若目标是不死，你对其造成等量的生命力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 此法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 此法术的射程为30尺。若你在治疗一个活体生物，将恢复的生命值提高8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 你在一个@Template[emanation|distance:30]中散布生命能量。这以爆发内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8，并且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> You disperse vital energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctuary": {
              "name": "圣域术 Sanctuary",
              "description": "<p>你以防护能量护佑一名生物，令其足以阻吓攻击。生物每次尝试攻击该目标时，都必须进行一次意志豁免。若目标使用了敌对动作，则法术结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> <em>圣域术</em>结束。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物可以尝试进行其攻击，并且可以在本回合内对该目标进行任何其他攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物不能攻击该目标并浪费该动作。它在本回合内不能再尝试对该目标进行进一步的攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物浪费该动作，并且在<em>圣域术</em>的剩余持续时间内不能尝试攻击该目标。</p>\n<p>You ward a creature with protective energy that deters attacks. Creatures attempting to attack the target must attempt a Will save each time. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> <em>Sanctuary</em> ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can attempt its attack and any other attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't attack the target and wastes the action. It can't attempt further attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature wastes the action and can't attempt to attack the target for the rest of <em>sanctuary</em>'s duration.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "护盾 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你升起一道魔法力场护盾。这算作使用“举起护盾”动作，使你在下个回合开始前获得AC +1环境加值，但不需要空出一只手来使用。</p>\n<p>在法术生效期间，你可以用你的魔法护盾使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{盾牌格挡}反应动作（）。该护盾具有硬度5。你可以使用该法术的反应动作（）来减少来自任何法术或魔法效果的伤害，即使其不造成物理伤害亦然。在你使用盾牌格挡后，该法术结束，并且你在10分钟内无法再次施放它。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 护盾的硬度增加5。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. You can use the spell's reaction to reduce damage from any spell or magical effect, even if it doesn't deal physical damage. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The shield's Hardness increases by 5.</p>"
            },
            "Stabilize": {
              "name": "稳定伤势 Stabilize",
              "description": "<p>生命能量紧闭死亡之门。目标失去@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死（状态）}状态，但在生命值为0时仍保持@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}。</p>\n<p>Life energy shuts death's door. The target loses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} condition, though it remains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} at 0 Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Vitality Lash": {
              "name": "活力鞭笞 Vitality Lash",
              "description": "<p>你用来自造物熔炉的能量摧毁目标腐化的本质。你造成 @Damage[2d6[vitality]] 伤害，并要求一次基础强韧豁免。若该生物豁免大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，持续至你下个回合开始。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d6。</p>\n<p>You demolish the target's corrupted essence with energy from Creation's Forge. You deal @Damage[2d6[vitality]] damage with a basic Fortitude save. If the creature critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Void Warp": {
              "name": "虚空扭曲 Void Warp",
              "description": "<p>你召唤虚空来伤害生命力。目标受到2d4点虚空伤害，并进行一次基础强韧豁免。在大失败时，目标还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}状态，持续到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>You call upon the Void to harm life force. The target takes 2d4 void damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Water": {
              "name": "圣水 Holy Water",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> 打击</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这只小瓶内装着由一位仁善的神祇祝福过的清水。你通过将一瓶<em>圣水</em>作为一次打击投掷来启动它。它是一种简易投掷武器，射程增量为20尺。</p>\n<p><em>圣水</em>造成1d6魂魄伤害和1点魂魄溅射伤害。<em>圣水</em>只能伤害带有邪秽（特征）的生物。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This vial contains water blessed by a benevolent deity. You activate a vial of <em>holy water</em> by throwing it as a Strike. It's a simple thrown weapon with a range increment of 20 feet.</p>\n<p><em>Holy water</em> deals 1d6 spirit damage and 1 spirit splash damage. <em>Holy water</em> can damage only creatures with the unholy trait.</p>"
            },
            "Light Mace": {
              "name": "轻型钉锤 Light Mace"
            },
            "Composite Shortbow": {
              "name": "复合短弓 Composite Shortbow"
            },
            "Leather Armor": {
              "name": "皮甲 Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧与成型的煮制皮革混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时具备最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
            },
            "Key Ring": {
              "name": "钥匙圈 Key Ring"
            },
            "Arrows": {
              "name": "箭矢 Arrows",
              "description": "<p>这些投射物是弓所用的弹药。箭杆由木头制成。它通过一端的箭羽在飞行中保持稳定，另一端则装有金属箭头。</p>\n<p>These projectiles are the ammunition for bows. The shaft of an arrow is made of wood. It is stabilized in flight by fletching at one end and bears a metal head on the other.</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Arrows": {
              "name": "灵体箭矢 Spiritual Arrows",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 巫女搭上一支箭，在释放出数十支幽魂般发光的箭矢所化作的神圣力量洪流前低声吟诵咒文。处于@Template[line|distance:60]内的生物受到@Damage[10d6[force]|options:area-damage]伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:immobilized]豁免）。若大失败，该生物还会陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}（[[/act escape dc=28]]）1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The shrine maiden nocks an arrow and whispers a chant before unleashing a torrent of holy power in the form of dozens of ghostly glowing arrows. Creatures in a @Template[line|distance:60] take @Damage[10d6[force]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:immobilized] save). On a critical failure, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} ([[/act escape dc=28]]) for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Twang": {
              "name": "铮然一响 Twang",
              "description": "<p>巫女拨动她的弓弦，制造出一道能量脉冲，抽击20英尺内的一个目标。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:28] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 无效果。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标被从巫女身边向后推开5英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标被从巫女身边向后推开10英尺并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标被从巫女身边抛飞15英尺，倒地，并在1轮内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>The shrine maiden strums her bowstring, creating a pulse of energy that lashes out at a target within 20 feet. That creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> No effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is pushed 5 feet back from the shrine maiden.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is pushed 10 feet back from the shrine maiden and falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is flung 15 feet away from the shrine maiden, falls prone, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "人类通灵师\nHuman spiritualist",
          "prototypeToken": "巫女 Shrine Maiden"
        },
        "Slain Mandragoras": {
          "name": "被杀死的曼陀罗草 Slain Mandragoras",
          "tokenName": "被杀死的曼陀罗草 Slain Mandragoras",
          "items": {
            "Clot of Crystallized Blood": {
              "name": "结晶血块 Clot of Crystallized Blood",
              "description": "<p>这些凝块每一个都是一枚<em>恐惧宝石</em>护符。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（专注）</p><hr /><p>这枚黑曜石宝石内部似乎有黑烟翻涌。当你启动宝石时，进行一次近战打击。若你命中并造成伤害，目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态） 1}；若为大成功则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态） 2}。</p><p>若你拥有@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.lkcM4V3VDAtjlR9P]{威吓打击}专长，将该打击造成的惊惧（状态）数值提高为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态） 2}；若为大成功则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态） 3}。</p>\n<p>Each of these clots is a <em>fear gem</em> talisman.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate)</p><hr /><p>Dark smoke seems to writhe within this obsidian gem. When you activate the gem, make a melee Strike. If you hit and deal damage, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical hit.</p><p>If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.lkcM4V3VDAtjlR9P]{Intimidating Strike} feat, increase the frightened condition value caused by the Strike to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} on a critical hit.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "被杀死的曼陀罗草 Slain Mandragoras"
        },
        "High Shelf": {
          "name": "高架搁板 High Shelf",
          "tokenName": "高架搁板 High Shelf",
          "items": {
            "Valuable Bottles of Rice Wine and Liquor": {
              "name": "珍贵的米酒与烈酒酒瓶 Valuable Bottles of Rice Wine and Liquor"
            },
            "Ascendant Dragon Spirit": {
              "name": "登龙醇 Ascendant Dragon Spirit",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这款精心酿造的烈酒被调入一杯强效魔法鸡尾酒中，并装在一只葫芦里，葫芦上刻着一条盘绕其上的林地巨龙。饮用时，后味呈现出引人入胜的平衡：木烟、蜂蜜与明亮的花香调。饮下后，你的双臂会被林地巨龙的致命力量所灌注。持续1分钟，你的徒手打击额外造成1d6毒素伤害与额外1d6虚无伤害。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.vJfRASrNBBYW6MEC]{效果：登龙醇}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This masterfully crafted spirit is mixed into a potent magical cocktail and packaged in a gourd with an engraving of a forest dragon coiling around it. Drinking it imparts an intriguing balance of woodsmoke, honey, and bright floral notes on the back end. When consumed, your arms become infused with the deadly power of a forest dragon. For 1 minute, your unarmed Strikes deal an additional 1d6 poison damage and an additional 1d6 void damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.vJfRASrNBBYW6MEC]{Effect: Ascendant Dragon Spirit}</p>"
            },
            "Vengeful Demon's Tears": {
              "name": "厉魔之泪 Vengeful Demon's Tears",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<p>厉魔之泪是一种臭名昭著、极其刺鼻的魂魄，被混入一杯强效的魔法鸡尾酒中，并传统上装在一只葫芦里，葫芦上雕刻着一张可怖的恶魔面孔。饮下它的感觉就像点燃了你的喉咙，然后再用草药补剂将火浇灭。当你启动这瓶药水时，你获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{迅捷（状态）} 状态，持续3轮，并且每轮可以使用这额外的动作来进行打击、行走，或执行以下动作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>释放恶魔</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（专注，治疗）</p>\n<p>你将注意力集中在生命于血肉之中燃烧的感受上，并获得2d8点临时生命值，持续1轮。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.5S2jlx6WZMAF4sxg]{效果：厉魔之泪}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<p>Vengeful demon's tears is an infamously noxious spirit mixed into a potent magical cocktail and traditionally packaged in a gourd adorned with an engraving of a terrifying demonic face. Drinking it feels akin to lighting your throat on fire and putting it out with an herbal tonic. When you activate this potion, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} condition for 3 rounds and can use the extra action each round to Strike, Stride, or to take the following action.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Release the Demon</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, healing)</p>\n<p>You focus on the sensation of life burning within your flesh and gain 2d8 temporary Hit Points for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.5S2jlx6WZMAF4sxg]{Effect: Vengeful Demon's Tears}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "高架搁板 High Shelf"
        },
        "Myna's Gift": {
          "name": "米娜的赋礼 Myna's Gift",
          "tokenName": "米娜的赋礼 Myna's Gift",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Moderate)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（中等） Healing Potion (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色液体，饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时会带来刺痒般的感觉。你饮用一瓶<em>治疗药水</em>时，回复 @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Smoke Ball (Greater)": {
              "name": "烟雾球（强效） Smoke Ball (Greater)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>将这颗球砸在地上时，你立刻制造出一片浓厚、不透明的烟幕，范围为以你所在空间的一个角为中心的 @Template[burst|distance:20]。该区域内的所有生物都处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}，并且对他们而言，所有其他生物也都是隐蔽的。烟雾持续 1 分钟，或直到被强风吹散。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Upon smashing this ball on the ground, you instantly create a screen of thick, opaque smoke in a @Template[burst|distance:20] centered on one corner of your space. All creatures within that area are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all other creatures are concealed to them. The smoke lasts for 1 minute or until dispersed by a strong wind.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "迈娜的赋礼 Myna's Gift"
        },
        "Tenon": {
          "name": "榫头 Tenon",
          "tokenName": "榫头 Tenon",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Illusory Object": {
              "name": "幻象物体 Illusory Object",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个静止物体的虚幻视觉影像。整个影像必须完全包含在法术的区域内。该物体看起来会自然地活动，但不会发出声音或产生气味。例如，水看起来会沿着一条虚幻瀑布倾泻而下，但不会有任何声响。</p>\n<p>任何触碰该影像的生物，或使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 动作来检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 你的影像会发出恰当的声音，产生正常的气味，并且触感正确。该法术获得听觉与嗅觉（特征）特征。持续时间增加至1小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 如同2环版本，但持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You create an illusory visual image of a stationary object. The entire image must fit within the spell's area. The object appears to animate naturally, but it doesn't make sounds or generate smells. For example, water would appear to pour down an illusory waterfall, but it would be silent.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> Your image makes appropriate sounds, generates normal smells, and feels right to the touch. The spell gains the auditory and olfactory traits. The duration increases to 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> As the 2nd-rank version, but the duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你让目标物体看起来并摸起来仿佛其物理状况好得多或糟得多。当你施放此法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。被伪装成破败的物品看起来处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}状态且粗制滥造。一件完好的物品若被伪装得更好，会显得仿佛崭新出厂并高度抛光，或被精心维护。处于破损状态的物品会显得完好且可正常使用。已被摧毁的物品无法受到此法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Light": {
              "name": "光 Light",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个光球，以你选择的颜色在20英尺半径内提供明亮光照（并在接下来的20英尺内提供昏暗光照）。如果你在一个自愿的生物所在的同一空间内创造光，你可以将光附着在该生物身上，使其在该生物移动时漂浮在其附近。你可以维持该法术以将光移动至多60英尺；你可以将其作为这次移动的一部分，附着到一个生物身上或从其身上解除附着。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。如果你在已经有四个<em>光亮</em>法术处于生效中的情况下施放该法术，你必须选择其中一个现有效法术结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{法术效果：光亮}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 该光球在60英尺半径内提供光照（并在接下来的60英尺内提供昏暗光照）。</p>\n<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造一只漂浮的魔法手（隐形或如幽魂般），抓住目标物体，并使其缓慢地向任意方向悬浮移动至多20尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以让该物体额外移动20尺。若法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为2或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将一个处于射程内、松散且无人持用、负载为1或更低的物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若你命中，你造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——取决于你所投掷的物体。被掷出的物品不具有任何会影响此次攻击或伤害的特定特征或魔法属性。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成全额伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Touch": {
              "name": "接触 Touch"
            },
            "Inhabit Home": {
              "name": "栖身住宅 Inhabit Home",
              "description": "<p>逝宅神栖居在一栋不起眼的建筑中并控制它。当建筑被附身时，其装潢会随逝宅神的情绪而变化，例如充满明亮光照（当逝宅神开心时），或显得老旧而肮脏（如果他们情绪低落）。逝宅神无法自愿离开他们的家；若被迫离开他们的家，逝宅神在其每个回合开始时受到@Damage[3d10[force]]伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:25|basic]豁免）。</p>\n<p>The silsyche inhabits a modest building and controls it. While the building is possessed, its decor shifts to reflect the silsyche's mood, such as being filled with bright light (when the silsyche is happy) or appearing old and filthy (if they're depressed). A silsyche can't willingly leave their home; if forced out of their home, the silsyche takes @Damage[3d10[force]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:25|basic] save) at the start of each of their turns.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>当一名逝宅神被杀死时，他们会在其领地——那座废弃的家——内，于[[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后重新成形。只有当他们的家被彻底摧毁时，逝宅神才能被永久杀死。</p>\n<p>When a silsyche is slain, they re-form after [[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the abandoned home that serves as their domain. A silsyche can be permanently killed only if their home is completely destroyed.</p>"
            },
            "Hallucinatory Home": {
              "name": "幻觉住宅 Hallucinatory Home",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 逝宅神创造一个宜居但虚幻的环境，试图引诱其目标留下，包括食物和生活设施。建筑内的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:24] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物将宅邸感知为逝宅神幻象所呈现的样子，但不会被迫留下。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物对这座建筑变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{着迷} 并拒绝离开。该生物可以在每个回合结束时再尝试一次意志豁免。成功时，它不再着迷。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但该生物会对任何试图让其离开建筑的人变得敌对。该生物只能在其攻击盟友的任意回合结束时，再尝试一次意志豁免以终止该效果。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The silsyche creates a hospitable but illusory environment in an attempt to entice their targets into staying, including food and amenities. Creatures in the building must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature perceives the home to be as the silsyche's illusion presents it but isn't compelled to stay.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} with the building and refuses to leave. The creature can attempt another Will save at the end of each turn. On a success, they're no longer fascinated.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature becomes hostile to anyone who tries to make them leave the building. The creature can only attempt another Will save to end the effect at the end of any turn in which they attack an ally.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>当一座世代有人居住的房屋被遗弃时，有时这栋建筑本身会因失去家人而悲恸不已，以至于引来一位尚未选定护的神灵怜悯。类似于付丧神显现的方式，这种魂魄力量的结合可能会形成逝宅神——一种被遗弃之家的魂魄，渴求陪伴。逝宅神从不打算直接伤害进入它们所由之屋的人；它们只是迫切渴望建立联系，却不明白大多数人并不乐意被囚禁。</p>\n<p>逝宅神的真实形态是一道纤细、孩童般的闪烁身影，头饰类似于它最初显现的那座建筑结构。这些对逝宅神第一处居所的呈现，映照出它们所渴望的温暖与欢迎，甚至可能展示早已离去的住户留下的纪念物。</p>\n<h2>额外学识占据范围</h2>\n<p>大多数逝宅神会与一处住宅建立羁绊，通常是一栋一两层的小建筑。更强大的逝宅神能够与更大的结构建立羁绊，例如要塞或城堡，甚至还能与大型载具（如航行船只）建立羁绊。关于整座城镇被单一、强大到不可思议的逝宅神占据的传说，至今仍在故事中流传。</p>\n<p>When a home is abandoned after it has been lived in for generations, sometimes the building itself mourns the loss of its family so greatly that it attracts the pity of a kami who has yet to claim a ward. Similar to how a tsukumogami manifests, such a conjoining of spiritual power can result in the formation of a silsyche—a spirit of an abandoned home who craves companionship. A silsyche never aims to outright harm those who enter the homes they form from. They are merely desperate for connection and lack the understanding that most others don't take kindly to captivity.</p>\n<p>The silsyche's true form is a slender, childlike shimmering figure with a headpiece resembling the structure they initially manifested from. These representations of the silsyche's first home reflect the warmth and welcome they yearn for, potentially even displaying mementos of the house's inhabitants that have long gone.</p>\n<h2>Range Of Possession</h2>\n<p>Most silsyches bond with a single home, typically a small building with one or two floors. More powerful silsyches can bond with larger structures, like fortresses or castles, or even large vehicles like sailing ships. Legends of entire towns being claimed by a single, incredibly powerful silsyche persist in stories to this day.</p>",
          "hp": "rejuvenation",
          "prototypeToken": "榫头 Tenon"
        },
        "Goh's Shame": {
          "name": "吴的耻辱 Goh's Shame",
          "tokenName": "吴的耻辱 Goh's Shame",
          "items": {
            "Grasping Hands": {
              "name": "与手同去 Grasping Hands",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 吴踏入木棉河</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 一个看起来像在游泳的孩童的阴影身影出现，抓住吴的脚踝并开始将他拉向更深的水中；吴陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}。随后，此作祟掷骰先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Goh steps into the Ceiba River</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A shadowy figure that looks like a swimming child appears to grab ahold of Goh's ankles and begins to pull him deeper into the water; Goh becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}. The haunt then rolls initiative.</p>"
            },
            "Grapple": {
              "name": "擒拿 Grapple"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[交涉|dc:21]以安抚吴，直到作祟消散，@Check[宗教|dc:23]以驱除作祟，或@Check[intimidation|dc:25]以把吴的“羞耻吓出来”</p>\n<p>@Check[diplomacy|dc:21] to calm Goh enough that the haunt dissipates, @Check[religion|dc:23] to exorcise the haunt, or @Check[intimidation|dc:25] to \"scare the shame\" out of Goh</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一道诡异的阴影身影在吴脚下的水中翻涌。</p>\n<p>A strange shadowy figure churns in the waters at Goh's feet.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>若吴死亡，此作祟结束且不会重置。若吴被从水中拖出，此作祟会在其下个回合结束时终止，但当吴下一次进入河流时会立即重置。</p>\n<p>The haunt ends if Goh dies and doesn't reset. If Goh is dragged out of the water, the haunt ends at the end of its next turn but resets immediately the next time Goh enters the river.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（2 动作；情绪、惑控系、恐惧术、无力化、心灵、神秘）该作祟用第一个动作擒拿戈，并试图将他拉拽到水下。戈的强韧 DC 为 19。为了将戈拉到水下，该作祟必须在对抗他的擒拿检定中取得大成功或大失败，且结果为 29 或更高，才能成功使戈陷入束缚。戈被恐惧压倒，完全不尝试逃脱，因此必须由 PC 们将他从作祟手中救出。若戈处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} 状态并被拉入水下，该作祟必须在后续轮中持续擒拿他。若该作祟在戈被束缚时擒拿他取得大成功或大失败，此人将因惊惧与溺水的双重作用而死亡，此时该作祟立即结束。</p>\n<p>若戈被拉拽脱离并带离水面，该作祟失去 1 个动作，且不再尝试擒拿他。该作祟用第二个动作显现一具骇人的、充满水意的溺死幽灵影像，使其在 30 尺内所选定的一个目标生物进行一次 @Check[will|dc:22] 意志 豁免（若可能，该作祟总是以尝试将戈从其控制中救出的生物为目标）。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}，并在其保持惊惧期间为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}，并在其保持惊惧期间（或 1 分钟内，以较晚结束者为准）处于逃跑状态。</p>\n<p>(2 actions; emotion, enchantment, fear incapacitation, mental, occult) The haunt uses its first action to grapple with Goh and attempts to pull him underwater. Goh has a Fortitude DC of 19. In order to pull Goh underwater, the haunt must critically succeed at its grapple check against him with a result of 29 or higher to successfully restrain Goh. Goh is overwhelmed by terror and makes no attempt to escape, so it falls to the PCs to get him free from the haunt. If Goh is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} and pulled underwater, the haunt must continue to grapple him in following rounds. If the haunt manages to critically succeed at grappling Goh while he's restrained, the man dies from a combination of fright and drowning, at which point the haunt immediately ends.</p>\n<p>If Goh is pulled free and taken out of the water, the haunt loses one action and no longer attempts to grapple him. The haunt uses its second action to manifest the image of a frightening watery drowned ghost, causing one creature it targets within 30 feet to attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save (the haunt always targets a creature who attempted to free Goh from its grip if possible).</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it remains frightened.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and fleeing as long as it remains frightened, or for 1 minute, whichever comes second.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（专家）</p>\n<p>(expert)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "吴的羞耻 Goh's Shame"
        },
