            "Persona Mask (Greater)": {
              "name": "人格面具（强效） Persona Mask (Greater)",
              "description": "<p>尽管覆盖了整张脸，这副雪花石膏面具并不会妨碍视力或其他感官。佩戴面具时，在你表演、演说、进行喜剧表演或歌唱时进行的表演检定获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动—承担角色</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将面具的外观变为你所选择的某个戏剧角色的艺术化呈现。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动—牺牲角色</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span>（专注，幸运）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你进行一次从面具加值中获益的表演检定但失败</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你改变面具的角色并重骰该表演检定，采用第二次结果。</p>\n<p>Despite covering the entire face, this alabaster mask does not hinder vision or other senses. Wearing the mask grants a +2 item bonus to Performance checks while acting, orating, performing comedy, or singing.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Assume Role</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You change the mask's appearance into an artistic rendition of a dramatic character of your choice.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Sacrifice Role</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> (concentrate, fortune)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail a Performance check that benefits from the mask's bonus</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You change the mask's character and reroll the Performance check, using the second result.</p>"
            },
            "Desolation Locket": {
              "name": "荒寂坠饰 Desolation Locket",
              "description": "<p>这枚金色心形坠盒的表面几乎被裂纹磨穿。若将其打开，会显露出一幅肖像：那是持有者曾深深爱过却已经失去的人。通过启动该物品施放的任何法术，其法术DC为24。</p><ul><li><strong>护甲</strong> <em>荒寂坠盒</em>使你对进一步的绝望变得麻木，你获得对抗情绪效果的豁免骰获得+2物品加值。</li><li><strong>武器</strong>（情绪，心灵）当你通过启动<em>坠盒</em>施放一个非戏法法术后，直到你下个回合开始，你会在自身周围散发出一个无望灵光，范围为@Template[emanation|distance:5]。一个在灵光内结束其回合的生物必须成功通过一次对抗坠盒法术DC的@Check[will|dc:24|traits:emotion,mental]豁免骰，否则直到其下个回合结束时变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（大失败则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}）。</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.WJ9L6rgUTZVV7vEE]{效果：荒寂坠盒 - 护甲}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.NwEVRZmLbM9QKoIH]{效果：荒寂坠盒 - 武器}</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b5BQbwmuBhgPXTyi]{萦魂圣歌}。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D]{恐惧术}。</p>\n<p>The surface of this golden, heart-shaped locket is nearly worn through with cracks. If opened, it reveals a portrait of someone the bearer loved dearly and has lost. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 24.</p><ul><li><strong>Armor</strong> The <em>desolation locket</em> numbs you to further despair, and you gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws against emotion effects.</li><li><strong>Weapon</strong> (emotion, mental) After you cast a non-cantrip spell by activating the <em>locket</em>, you emanate an aura of hopelessness in a @Template[emanation|distance:5] until the start of your next turn. A creature that ends its turn in the aura must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:24|traits:emotion,mental] saving throw against the locket's spell DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} on a critical failure) until the end of its next turn.</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.WJ9L6rgUTZVV7vEE]{Effect: Desolation Locket - Armor}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.NwEVRZmLbM9QKoIH]{Effect: Desolation Locket - Weapon}</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b5BQbwmuBhgPXTyi]{Haunting Hymn}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D]{Fear}.</p>"
            }
