            "Vanishing Coin": {
              "name": "消失硬币 Vanishing Coin",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你尝试进行一次用于先攻的隐匿检定，但你还没有掷骰</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你受训于隐匿</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这枚铜币从穿过中心钻孔的皮条上垂下。在启动前，这枚硬币会在每隔几分钟的随机时刻变为隐形几秒钟。</p>\n<p>当你启动这枚硬币时，它会对你施放一个2环的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB]{Invisibility}法术，持续到你下个回合结束。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt a Stealth check for initiative, but you haven't rolled yet</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are trained in Stealth</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This copper coin dangles from a leather strip strung through a hole drilled in the center. Until activated, the coin becomes invisible for a few seconds at random intervals every few minutes.</p>\n<p>When you activate the coin, it casts a 2nd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB]{Invisibility} spell on you, lasting until the end of your next turn.</p>"
