            "Wand of Soothe (Rank 4)": {
              "name": "安抚术魔杖（4环） Wand of Soothe (Rank 4)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{安抚术}</p><hr /><p>这根短杖约一英尺长，内含一个法术。其外观通常与其中的法术相关。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次，外加过载</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你以标注的环阶施放该法术。</p>\n<p><strong>制作需求</strong> 提供一次以所列环阶施放该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要创建特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入 PC、NPC 或战利品演员的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{Soothe}</p><hr /><p>This baton is about a foot long and contains a single spell. The appearance typically relates to the spell within.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day, plus overcharge</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You Cast the Spell at the indicated rank.</p>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply a casting of the spell at the listed rank.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
