            "Serving Platter": {
              "name": "盛菜盘 Serving Platter",
              "description": "<p>这面极小的盾牌是决斗者与敏捷、轻甲战士的心头好。它通常由钢制成，并绑在你的前臂上。只要你那只手空着，或那只手拿着一个非武器的轻便物体，你就可以用你的圆盾执行“举起护盾”。</p>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>硬度</th>\n<th>HP</th>\n<th>BT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This very small shield is a favorite of duelists and quick, lightly armored warriors. It's typically made of steel and strapped to your forearm. You can Raise a Shield with your buckler as long as you have that hand free or are holding a light object that's not a weapon in that hand.</p>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hardness</th>\n<th>HP</th>\n<th>BT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
            },
            "Servant's Uniform": {
              "name": "仆役制服 Servant's Uniform",
              "description": "<p>普通服装注重实用性，只做基础剪裁，例如农民装束、僧袍或工作服。</p>\n<p>Ordinary clothing is functional with basic tailoring, such as peasant garb, monk's robes, or work clothes.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Protective Platter": {
              "name": "防护拼盘 Protective Platter",
              "description": "<p>仆从可以使用举起护盾动作举起他们的托盘。该托盘具有与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.1k3AsSW7lpU0kEpY]{圆盾}相同的属性，但需要一只手持握。</p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.4hfQEMiEOBbqelAh]{举起护盾}</p>\n<p>The servant can raise their serving platter using the Raise a Shield action. The platter has the same statistics as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.1k3AsSW7lpU0kEpY]{Buckler} but requires a hand to hold.</p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.4hfQEMiEOBbqelAh]{Raise a Shield}</p>"
            },
            "Quick Catch": {
              "name": "快速接住 Quick Catch",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 仆役触及范围内有一件仆役可以单手持握的物体掉落</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 仆役至少有一只手空闲</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 仆役在掉落的物体落地或离开其触及范围之前接住它。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An object the servant could hold in one hand is dropped within the servant's reach</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The servant has at least one hand free</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The servant catches the dropped object before it hits the floor or leaves their reach.</p>"
            },
            "Raise a Shield": {
              "name": "举起护盾 Raise a Shield",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 你正持用一面护盾。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你调整护盾的位置来保护自己。当你已举起护盾时，你获得其列出的 AC 环境加值。你的护盾将保持举起状态，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You position your shield to protect yourself. When you have Raised a Shield, you gain its listed circumstance bonus to AC. Your shield remains raised until the start of your next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Lore (any one subcategory related to their job, such as Alcohol Lore, Baking Lore, or Household Lore)": {
              "name": "学识（任何一个与其工作相关的子类别，例如酒精学识、烘焙学识或家务学识） Lore (any one subcategory related to their job, such as Alcohol Lore, Baking Lore, or Household Lore)"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>仆人可能是女仆或管家，维持家宅井然有序；也可能是在旅店等场所工作的侍者，负责点单并为顾客上菜。</p><hr /><p>社会是建立在劳动者的肩背之上的。</p>\n<p>A servant might be a maid or butler, keeping a home in working order, or a server in an establishment like an inn, taking orders and serving customers.</p><hr /><p>Society is built upon the backs of laborers.</p>",
          "ac": "(15 with platter raised)",
          "prototypeToken": "仆从 Servant"
        },
