              "name": "以绿色布料装订的大书 Large Book bound in Green Cloth",
              "description": "<p>一本以绿色布面装帧的大书，散发着清雅的茶香。本书包含以下魔茶的副本，以及 <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.oYxxcgszpT242sEi]{冬之息}</em> 仪式。</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ByaYlK0QmnqEbCE2]{立契茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.RK03uy9os4H0dUfS]{精力茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.n5xlR7ApXgfJRkbF]{长夜茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sq4MIaXhb2zcCT6y]{月花茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Cz0XxRVMma7cllCd]{安梦茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qyjaueXduvCUeDbp]{复活茶}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EMviiUBFb5hB1X5Q]{灵视茶}</p>\n<p>A large book bound in green cloth that exudes the fine scent of tea. This book contains copies of the below magic teas, as well as the <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.oYxxcgszpT242sEi]{Winter's Breath}</em> ritual.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ByaYlK0QmnqEbCE2]{Covenant Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.RK03uy9os4H0dUfS]{Energizing Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.n5xlR7ApXgfJRkbF]{Longnight Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sq4MIaXhb2zcCT6y]{Moon Blossom Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Cz0XxRVMma7cllCd]{Peace in Dreams Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qyjaueXduvCUeDbp]{Resurrection Tea}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EMviiUBFb5hB1X5Q]{Spiritsight Tea}</p>"
