        "Unholy Hunger": {
          "name": "邪秽饥渴 Unholy Hunger",
          "tokenName": "邪秽饥渴 Unholy Hunger",
          "items": {
            "Worse Than It Smells": {
              "name": "比闻起来更糟 Worse Than It Smells",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名非灵堕魔生物揭开烹饪锅的锅盖</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 锅子15尺内的所有生物必须在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:27] 豁免中成功，否则成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。作为触发生物的该生物则必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:24] 豁免，以抗拒将脸浸入炖汤并吞下一口汤料的强迫冲动（此效果具有惑控系与心灵特征）。失败时，触发生物受到 @Damage[5d6[poison]] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A non-nindoru creature takes the lid off the cooking pot</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> All creatures within 15 feet of the pot must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:27] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}. The triggering creature instead must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save to resist the compulsion to dip their face into the stew and swallow a mouthful of the stuff (this effect has the enchantment and mental traits). On a failure, the triggering creature takes @Damage[5d6[poison]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic] save).</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[cooking-lore|dc:19]以从附近架子上加入几种精选香料来中和这锅闹鬼的炖汤，或进行@Check[religion|dc:25]以驱除这次作祟</p>\n<p>@Check[cooking-lore|dc:19] to neutralize the haunted stew with the addition of a few select spices from nearby shelves, or @Check[religion|dc:25] to exorcise the haunt</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一团恶臭的瘴气从汤里冒出，蒸汽中的气泡里隐约可见尖啸的面孔。</p>\n<p>A miasma of foul-smelling vapor with shrieking faces barely visible in the steam bubbles up from the soup.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>作祟在烹饪锅的盖子重新盖上后 1 轮重置。</p>\n<p>The haunt resets 1 round after the lid is replaced on the cooking pot.</p>",
