        "Yu Er": {
          "name": "于尔 Yu Er",
          "tokenName": "于尔 Yu Er",
          "items": {
            "Shiv": {
              "name": "剃刀 Shiv"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Rock": {
              "name": "岩石 Rock"
            },
            "Collaborative Thievery": {
              "name": "协同盗窃 Collaborative Thievery",
              "description": "<p>街童在距一名拥有扒手能力的盟友10英尺内时，进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{偷窃} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ijZ0DDFpMkWqaShd]{藏匿物体} 时获得+1环境加值。</p>\n<p>The urchin gains a +1 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{Steal} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ijZ0DDFpMkWqaShd]{Palm an Object} while within 10 feet of an ally who has the pickpocket ability.</p>"
            },
            "Pickpocket": {
              "name": "扒窃 Pickpocket",
              "description": "<p>对一个街童而言，对一件被严密看守的物品进行[[/act steal]]或[[/act palm-an-object]]时，其DC不会增加5。他们可以窃取那些移走时会极其显眼或耗时的物体（例如穿着的鞋子、护甲或正被积极持用的物体）。</p>\n<p>For an urchin, the DC to [[/act steal]] or [[/act palm-an-object]] isn't increased by 5 for an item that's closely guarded. They can Steal objects that would be extremely noticeable or time-consuming to remove (like worn shoes, armor, or actively wielded objects).</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>尽管他们的冒险事迹可能恶名昭彰，但很少有街头孤儿是寻求刺激的人。对一些孤儿而言，当独自乞讨已不足以填饱肚子时，偷窃便成为可行的生存手段。许多地底势力也会把孤儿当作间谍与信使使用，同时训练他们成为未来的扒手、窃贼与步兵。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>不幸的是，每个社会都有生活在边缘的人。善良的社群会努力向其困苦之人提供协助与喘息之机，但有时——由于经济衰退、饥荒或战争——不幸者的人数会超过社群支援他们的能力。在冷酷的中立与邪恶社会里，贫穷被视为一种永远无法真正根除的必然，或更糟的是，被当作可操弄以谋取政治利益的工具。</p>\n<p>Although their escapades might be notorious, few urchins are thrill-seekers. For some urchins, when begging alone is not enough to fill their bellies, theft becomes a viable survival tactic. Many underworld powers also use urchins as spies and messengers, while training them to become future pickpockets, burglars, and foot soldiers.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Unfortunately, every society has people living on its fringes. While good communities work to grant aid and respite to their downtrodden, sometimes-due to economic downturn, famine, or war-the ranks of the less fortunate exceed the community's capacity to support them. In heartless neutral and evil societies, poverty is seen as an inevitability that can never be truly eradicated, or even worse, as a tool to be manipulated for political gain.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性人类流浪儿\nFemale human urchin",
          "prototypeToken": "余儿 Yu Er"
        },
        "Stables": {
          "name": "马厩 Stables",
          "tokenName": "马厩 Stables",
          "items": {
            "Bravo's Brew (Lesser)": {
              "name": "布拉沃的酿饮（次级） Bravo's Brew (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>这瓶起泡的啤酒赐予勇气。饮下这剂药液后的接下来1小时内，你的意志豁免获得+1物品加值；而在进行对抗恐惧术的意志豁免时，该加值为+2。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.eh7EqmDBDW30ShCu]{效果：喝彩麦酒}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>This flask of foaming beer grants courage. For the next hour after drinking this elixir, you gain a +1 item bonus to Will saves, or +2 when attempting Will saves against fear.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.eh7EqmDBDW30ShCu]{Effect: Bravo's Brew}</p>"
