        "Yix": {
          "name": "小伊 Yix",
          "tokenName": "小伊 Yix",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Read Omens": {
              "name": "阅读预兆 Read Omens",
              "description": "<p>你窥视未来。选择一个你计划在 1 周内进行的特定目标或活动，或一个你预计可能在 1 周内发生的事件。你会得知一条隐晦的线索或建议，可能有助于应对所选事件，通常以押韵诗句或预兆的形式出现。</p>\n<p>You peek into the future. Choose a particular goal or activity you plan to engage in within 1 week, or an event you expect might happen within 1 week. You learn a cryptic clue or piece of advice that could help with the chosen event, often in the form of a rhyme or omen.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其开口回答你向它提出的三个问题。该法术调用的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将亡者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须基本完好法术才能发挥作用。尸体受的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越支离破碎；而且它必须有喉咙和嘴才能说话。如果在过去一周内有人曾对该尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以使用其死亡时原本生物的数据尝试进行一次意志豁免，以抗拒回答问题，结果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实回答，但其回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你或试图拖延，使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且不那么重复，但仍然晦涩。它在进行以欺骗或误导你为目的的欺瞒检定时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)": {
              "name": "隐形（随意，自身限定） Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)",
              "description": "<p>幻术扭曲目标周围的光线，使其处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。这使其对所有生物而言都处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪}状态，不过这些生物可以尝试寻找目标，使其改为对它们处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿}状态。若目标使用敌对动作，则在该敌对动作完成后法术结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 法术持续1分钟，但即使目标使用敌对动作也不会结束。</p>\n<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"
            },
            "Noise Blast": {
              "name": "噪音爆破 Noise Blast",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音爆发而出，造成2d10点音波伤害。每个生物必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并在1轮内陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物承受双倍伤害，耳聋1分钟，并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>增幅（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Beak": {
              "name": "喙 Beak"
            },
            "Lifesense 60 feet": {
              "name": "生命感知 60尺 Lifesense 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Lifesense]</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟会呈现为渡鸦或鸣禽的外形。这不会改变它的速度，或它用打击进行攻击与造成伤害时的调整值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>The nosoi takes the appearance of a raven or songbird. This doesn't change its Speed or its attack and damage modifiers with its Strikes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Haunting Melody": {
              "name": "萦回旋律 Haunting Melody",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟哼唱一首令人着迷的歌。每个在@Template[emanation|distance:60]内的活体或不死生物都必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:18]豁免。该效果持续到疫鸟下个回合结束，但疫鸟可以维持它。豁免成功的生物在24小时内暂时免疫。尽管这是一个心灵效果，但此能力仍会影响无心智的不死。</p>\n<p>招魂者免疫此能力。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物对疫鸟处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{着迷}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物对疫鸟着迷，并且必须在其回合中将自己的每个动作都用于尽可能迅速地向疫鸟靠近，同时避开明显的危险。若着迷的生物与疫鸟相邻，它会停在原地且不采取动作。若该生物受到攻击，着迷结束。</p>\n<p>The nosoi croons an entrancing song. Each living or undead creature within a @Template[emanation|distance:60] must attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save. The effect lasts until the end of the nosoi's next turn, but the nosoi can Sustain it. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 24 hours. Despite being a mental effect, this ability affects mindless undead.</p>\n<p>Psychopomps are immune to this ability.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} with the nosoi.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is fascinated with the nosoi and must spend each of its actions on its turn to move closer to the nosoi as expediently as possible while avoiding obvious dangers. If a fascinated creature is adjacent to the nosoi, it stays still and doesn't act. If the creature is attacked, the fascination ends.</p>"
            },
            "Shepherd's Touch": {
              "name": "牧羊人的接触 Shepherd's Touch",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟的打击享有<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}</em>属性符文的好处，并且对活体生物造成额外的@Damage[1d6[void]]伤害，或对不死造成@Damage[1d6[vitality]]伤害。</p>\n<p>A nosoi's Strikes have the benefit of a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}</em> property rune and deal an additional @Damage[1d6[void]] damage to living creatures or @Damage[1d6[vitality]] damage to undead.</p>"
            },
            "Boneyard Lore": {
              "name": "骨园学识 Boneyard Lore"
            },
            "Library Lore": {
              "name": "司书学识 Library Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>疫鸟看起来像一只鞭鸣夜鹰、麻雀或其他戴着厚皮革瘟疫医生面具的小鸟。它们是骨园的文书、信使和书记员，见证审判、引导灵魂，并总体上承担维持骨园运转的行政杂务。大多数疫鸟都格外健谈，热衷于讨论它们认为自己各自任务有多么重要。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>招魂者是骨园中亡者的守护者与引路者——骨园是一片辽阔的坟冢位面，凡人的灵魂会在此受审，并被送往其永恒的奖励或诅咒。招魂者确保死者能够接受从凡俗状态过渡的事实，并被妥善分派到合适的来世。它们也会保护灵魂，不让其成为超自然掠食者的猎物。几乎所有招魂者都戴着面具，尤其是在它们可能与凡人接触时；不过，它们所戴的面具种类如同招魂者本身一样多样。骨园的法庭以雷奎安语进行审理——那是一种庄重而带旋律的语言，说话缓慢，并伴随多种声调变化。</p>\n<p>许多招魂者都深度参与骨园庞大的官僚体系。很少有招魂者追求怜悯、正义或个人利益；它们对法莱斯玛及其骨园的职责至高无上。尽管如此，不同的招魂者对自身职责的诠释方式各不相同，这可能会使它们与凡人、甚至彼此之间发生冲突。</p>\n<p>A nosoi resembles a whippoorwill, sparrow, or other small bird wearing a heavy leather plague doctor's mask. They are the clerks, messengers, and scribes of the Boneyard, witnessing judgments, directing souls, and generally performing the administrative grunt work that keeps the Boneyard functioning. Most nosois are particularly chatty and eager to discuss how important they consider their individual assignments to be.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Psychopomps are guardians and shepherds of the dead in the Boneyard, the vast plane of graves where mortal souls are judged and sent on to their eternal rewards or damnations. Psychopomps ensure that the dead come to terms with their transition from mortality and are properly sorted into the appropriate afterlife. They also protect souls from being preyed upon by supernatural predators. Nearly all psychopomps wear masks, especially when they're likely to be interacting with mortals, although the types of masks they wear are as varied as the psychopomps themselves. The courts of the Boneyard preside in Requian, a somber yet melodic language spoken slowly with various tonal shifts.</p>\n<p>Many psychopomps are intimately involved with the Boneyard's massive bureaucracy. Few pursue mercy, justice, or personal gain; their duties to Pharasma and her Boneyard are supreme. Nevertheless, individual psychopomps interpret their duties in different ways, which might put them in conflict with mortals or even with each other.</p>",
          "blurb": "雄性疫鸟招魂者\nMale nosoi psychopomp",
          "prototypeToken": "小伊 Yix"
        },
