          "name": "达米的感谢 Dami's Thanks",
          "tokenName": "达米的感谢 Dami's Thanks",
          "items": {
            "Antidote (Lesser)": {
              "name": "解毒剂（次级） Antidote (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>解毒剂能保护你免受毒素侵害。饮用解毒剂后，你在6小时内对抗毒素的强韧豁免骰获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.TjBxxlTvb6tJP1jS]{效果：解毒剂}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>An antidote protects you against toxins. Upon drinking an antidote, you gain a +2 item bonus to Fortitude saving throws against poisons for 6 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.TjBxxlTvb6tJP1jS]{Effect: Antidote}</p>"
