        "Dalgyal Gwishin": {
          "name": "蛋脸鬼 Dalgyal Gwishin",
          "tokenName": "蛋脸鬼 Dalgyal Gwishin",
          "items": {
            "Head": {
              "name": "头 Head"
            },
            "Lifesense (Precise) 120 feet": {
              "name": "生命感知（精确）120英尺 Lifesense (Precise) 120 feet",
              "description": "<p>蛋脸鬼能够感知所列射程内活体与不死生物的生命精粹。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Lifesense]</p>\n<p>The dalgyal gwishin senses the vital essence of living and undead creatures within the listed range.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Lifesense]</p>"
            },
            "Frightful Presence": {
              "name": "气势凶猛 Frightful Presence",
              "description": "<p>30英尺 @Check[will|dc:19]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>\n<p>30 feet @Check[will|dc:19]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"
            },
            "Stone-Faced": {
              "name": "石脸 Stone-Faced",
              "description": "<p>虽然蛋脸鬼没有实体躯体，但它的石质面孔是坚固的。它无法穿过坚固的物体。</p>\n<p>While the dalgyal gwishin has no physical body, its stone face is solid. It can't pass through solid objects.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Jealous Frenzy": {
              "name": "嫉妒狂暴 Jealous Frenzy",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 蛋脸鬼打击一个魅力调整值比自身更高的生物</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 蛋脸鬼在感知到其所打击的生物体内存在强烈的友谊与人格纽带后，陷入嫉妒狂暴。蛋脸鬼获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened}，但只能用其加速动作来打击触发该能力的生物。若蛋脸鬼在其回合中未能至少一次打击触发该能力的生物，则嫉妒狂暴结束。该状态也会在 1 分钟后结束。嫉妒狂暴结束后，蛋脸鬼在 1 分钟内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dalgyal gwishin Strikes a creature that has a higher Charisma modifier than itself</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dalgyal gwishin enters an envious frenzy as it senses strong ties of friendship and personality within the creature it struck. The dalgyal gwishin becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} but can only use its quickened action to Strike the triggering creature. If the dalgyal gwishin fails to Strike the triggering creature at least once during its turn, Jealous Frenzy ends. It also ends after 1 minute. After Jealous Frenzy ends, the dalgyal gwishin is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Peel Face": {
              "name": "剥取面容 Peel Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 蛋脸鬼在处于嫉妒狂暴时对一名生物造成大成功或大失败的命中，或将一名生物的生命值降至0</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 蛋脸鬼将它那石质的脸贴到该生物的脸上，导致那张脸的幽灵般印记被剥离并复制到它的头上。触发生物必须在一次 @Check[will|dc:22] 意志 豁免中成功，否则将变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（在大成功或大失败的失败时为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}）。蛋脸鬼的嫉妒狂暴结束，且它不会变为缓慢。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dalgyal gwishin critically hits a creature or reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points while in a Jealous Frenzy</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dalgyal gwishin presses its stony face to the creature's face, causing a ghostly imprint of that face to peel away and duplicate onto its head. The triggering creature must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:22] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure). The dalgyal gwishin's Jealous Frenzy ends, and it doesn't become slowed.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>蛋脸鬼是一种无面的不死魂魄，佩戴着一张石制面具。这种凄苦的不死生物由某个凡人在孤独中死去、无人记得其存在的灵魂凝成，也同样无法记起自己生前长什么样。蛋脸鬼在生者之地游荡，搜寻自己活着时是谁的任何痕迹。它们满怀怒火，依旧嫉恨那些备受喜爱或声名显赫、身边簇拥着挚友与仰慕者的人——那种永远不会落得与蛋脸鬼相同下场的人。</p>\n<p>蛋脸鬼除了一具由薄雾构成的幽灵之躯外几乎一无所有，但它头上所戴的那张无特征石面具却是坚实的。即便是它们所窃取面容得来的面孔也只是暂时的，会在一天后碎裂脱落，形成看起来类似脆弱瓷制死亡面具的东西。一些孤独的魂魄会保留这些面具，并将其加入自己在偏远而荒凉巢穴中的收藏，期望在那不断增长的无声面孔陈列中寻得陪伴。</p>\n<h2>无面骇物</h2>\n<p>蛋脸鬼最显著的身体特征——没有脸——也存在于被称为“noppera-bo”的活体异怪身上。尽管共享这一特征并同样具备窃取面容的能力，这两种生物并不合作，反而更常成为势不两立的仇敌。任何被蛋脸鬼杀死的人都会留下一个令人不安的无面尸体。</p>\n<p>A dalgyal gwishin is a faceless, undead spirit that wears a stone mask. This forlorn undead forms from the soul of a mortal who died a lonely death with no one to remember them, and is similarly unable to remember what it looked like in life. A dalgyal gwishin wanders the land of the living in search of any trace of who they were when they were alive. Full of anger, they remain envious of well-loved or famous individuals who are surrounded by close friends and admirers—the type of people who would never share the dalgyal gwishin's fate.</p>\n<p>While a dalgyal gwishin has little more than a ghostly body made of mist, the featureless stone mask it wears on its head is solid. Even the stolen faces it claims are transitory, cracking off after a day to form what looks akin to a fragile porcelain death mask. Some of these lonely spirits keep these masks and add them to a collection in a remote and forlorn lair, hoping to find companionship in an ever-growing display of silent faces.</p>\n<h2>Faceless Horror</h2>\n<p>The dalgyal gwishin's most significant physical trait—the lack of a face—is shared with the living aberrations known as noppera-bos. Despite this shared feature and the ability to steal faces, the two creatures don't cooperate and are more often bitter enemies. Anyone slain by a dalgyal gwishin leaves behind an unnerving faceless corpse.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "蛋脸鬼 Dalgyal Gwishin"
        },
        "Incense Burner": {
