              "description": "<p>一只精巧打造的银与橡木香炉，能保护其中的熏香不被风雨吹灭。这只香炉价值50 gp，造型为龙首，使烟雾从其鼻孔袅袅飘出。</p>\n<p>A cunningly crafted silver and oak incense burner that shields the incense within from being extinguished by wind and rain. This incense burner is worth 50 gp and is shaped like a dragon’s head, so that the smoke wafts from its nostrils.</p>"
