          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-GWvNMFFcM70LarYp\" class=\"secret\"><p>一名PC若对神龛进行搜寻，并在一次@Check[perception|dc:20|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search]检定中成功，也会发现一个制作精巧的银与橡木香炉，它能保护其中的香不被风雨吹灭</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-GWvNMFFcM70LarYp\" class=\"secret\"><p>A PC who Searches the shrine and succeeds at a @Check[perception|dc:20|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search] check also discovers a cunningly crafted silver and oak incense burner that shields the incense within from being extinguished by wind and rain</p></section>",
