        "Noppera-bo Trickster": {
          "name": "无面鬼骗子 Noppera-bo Trickster",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼骗子 Noppera-bo Trickster",
          "items": {
            "Shortbow": {
              "name": "短弓 Shortbow"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword"
            },
            "Leather Armor": {
              "name": "皮甲 Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧的与定型的煮制皮革混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时保有最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
            },
            "Arrows": {
              "name": "箭矢 Arrows",
              "description": "<p>这些投射物是弓用的弹药。箭杆由木头制成。它的一端装有羽翎以在飞行中保持稳定，另一端则装有金属箭头。</p>\n<p>These projectiles are the ammunition for bows. The shaft of an arrow is made of wood. It is stabilized in flight by fletching at one end and bears a metal head on the other.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30 尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无脸妖没有视觉，但它们的听觉很精准。它们不需要呼吸，并免疫于需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获得养分——传统上会将手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；它们也能用这种方式从消耗品（如药水或炼金灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>Noppera-bos have no sense of vision, but their sense of hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}状态，他们就会处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}状态。</p>\n<p>As long as a noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonate Shape": {
              "name": "乔装变形 Impersonate Shape",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼会变成其在过去24小时内接触过的一名小型或中型类人生物的样貌，并获得该目标生物的面容与声音。处于变形状态时，无面鬼在@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{乔装}成该生物时获得+2环境加值，并失去其无面能力以及所列的免疫。无面鬼可以再次使用此能力以变回原形。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo changes into a version of a Small or Medium humanoid they've touched during the last 24 hours, and gains the target creature's face and voice. While transformed, the noppera-bo gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{Impersonate} that creature and loses its no face ability and listed immunities. The noppera-bo can change back by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Remove Face": {
              "name": "移除面容 Remove Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 无面鬼骗子正在伪装成一名有脸的生物</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 无面鬼骗子的五官融化为虚无，并威吓30尺内的一名生物。该生物在一次失败的@Check[will|dc:17]豁免后变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}（大失败则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}）。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The noppera-bo trickster is Impersonating a creature with a face</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The noppera-bo trickster's facial features melt into nothingness, and they menace a creature within 30 feet. The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} on a failed @Check[will|dc:17] save (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼骗子对处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}状态的生物额外造成1d4点精准伤害。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo trickster deals an additional 1d4 precision damage to creatures that are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>这些无面鬼精通伪装的艺术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>无面鬼从背后看起来就像普通人类，甚至可能酷似你认识的某个人——直到它们转过身来，露出一张毫无五官的脸。</p>\n<h2>炉火纯青的行家</h2>\n<p>典型的无面鬼残忍无情，并以惊吓或折磨类人生物为乐，但并非所有无面鬼都沉溺于邪恶。中立的无面鬼往往是爱恶作剧的捣蛋鬼，会用自身能力来欺骗与戏弄；而少见的善良无面鬼则会用自身能力去致敬并崇拜它们所钦慕之人，同时把自己的时间用于发展艺术或工艺方面的技能。</p>\n<h2>无面鬼起源</h2>\n<p>关于无面鬼的起源有许多理论——从变形能力失控的化狸，到被诅咒扭曲的类人生物，再到自然生成的妖怪。甚至有人推测这种状态是一种可传播的诅咒，类似兽化症。大多数无面鬼不记得自己的起源，而且往往更热衷于假装自己完全是另一个人。</p>\n<p>These noppera-bos have mastered the art of disguise.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Noppera-bos appear to be regular humans from behind, and might even resemble someone you know, until they turn to reveal a featureless face.</p>\n<h2>Consummate Professionals</h2>\n<p>While the typical noppera-bo is cruel and revels in the act of frightening or tormenting humanoid creatures, not all of them wallow in evil. Neutral noppera-bos tend to be pranksters who use their abilities to trick and tease, while the rare good noppera- bos instead use their abilities to honor and idolize those they admire while focusing their own time on developing their skills at art or crafting.</p>\n<h2>Noppera-bo Origins</h2>\n<p>There are many theories on the origins of noppera-bos—from tanuki whose change shape ability went wrong, to humanoids who were warped by curses, to naturally spawning yokai. Some even theorize this condition is a transmissible curse like lycanthropy. Most noppera-bos don't recall their origins, and are often more interested in pretending to be someone else entirely.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼骗子 Noppera-bo Trickster"
        },
