        "Pan Fenfang": {
          "name": "潘芬芳 Pan Fenfang",
          "tokenName": "潘芬芳 Pan Fenfang",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Crushing Despair": {
              "name": "极度绝望 Crushing Despair",
              "description": "<p>你使区域内的生物陷入绝望。每个生物的效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续1轮，该生物无法使用反应动作，且必须在其回合开始时再尝试一次豁免；若失败，则它在该回合中因无法控制地啜泣而成为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物在1分钟内自动成为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为60尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Glibness": {
              "name": "花言巧语 Glibness",
              "description": "<p>谎言从你唇间滑出，如丝般顺畅。你在用于说谎的欺瞒检定上获得+4状态加值，且在对抗察觉检定以辨别你是否在说真话时获得+4状态加值，并且即使你未受训，你也将你的等级加入其中。若你谎言的不可信导致环境减值或DC提高，将该减值或提高减半。</p>\n<p>Falsehoods pass your lips as smoothly as silk. You gain a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to Lie and against Perception checks to discern if you are telling the truth, and you add your level even if you're untrained. If the implausibility of your lies prompts a circumstance penalty or a DC increase, reduce that penalty or increase by half.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其开口回答你向它提出的三个问题。该法术唤起的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须大体完整，法术才能发挥作用。尸体遭受的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越支离破碎；此外，它必须具备喉咙和嘴巴才能说话。若在过去一周内曾有人对这具尸体施放过该法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以尝试进行一次意志豁免，以其死亡时原本生物的数据来抗拒回答问题，并产生如下效果。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，且目标的魂魄会作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实作答，但其回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你，或试图拖延，以使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接、较不重复，尽管仍然晦涩。它在进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Creature": {
              "name": "幻象生物 Illusory Creature",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个大型或更小体型的幻象生物影像。它会产生恰当的声音、气味，并且触感可信。如果你与影像之间的距离曾经超过500尺，则法术结束。</p>\n<p>该影像无法说话，但你可以用你的动作通过该生物说话，法术会在适当情况下伪装你的声音。根据GM的裁定，你可能需要尝试一次欺瞒或表演检定来模仿该生物。若你试图模仿特定人物，并与认识那个人的对象互动，这尤其常见。</p>\n<p>在战斗中，该幻觉每回合可以使用2个动作，你在维持该法术时由它使用这些动作。它使用你的法术攻击调整进行攻击检定，并以你的法术DC作为它的AC。它的豁免调整值等于你的法术DC – 10。它足够实体化，以至于可以夹击其他生物。若影像被一次攻击命中或一次豁免失败，则法术结束。</p>\n<p>该幻觉可以通过让目标相信幻觉的攻击是真实的来造成伤害，但除此之外不能直接影响物质世界。若幻象生物以一次打击命中，目标受到@Damage[3d4[mental]]伤害。该幻觉的打击为非致命。若该伤害与怪物影像不相符——例如，一条幻象大型巨龙仅造成5点伤害——GM可能允许目标立即进行一次察觉检定以识破该法术。若目标认为相关抗力与弱点适用，则它们会照常适用，由GM裁定。例如，若幻觉挥舞战锤并攻击一名对钝击伤害有抗力的生物，该生物将承受更少的心灵伤害。然而，幻象伤害不会使再生失效，也不会触发其他需要特定伤害类型的效果。GM应记录该幻觉造成的幻象伤害。</p>\n<p>任何接触该影像的生物，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}动作检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻觉。当某个生物识破该幻觉时，它从自己已受到的该幻觉伤害中恢复一半（若有），并且不再受到该幻觉的进一步伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 影像打击的伤害提高1d4，并且你能创造的生物的最大体型提高一级（最多至超巨型）。</p>\n<p>You create an illusory image of a Large or smaller creature. It generates the appropriate sounds, smells, and feels believable to the touch. If you and the image are ever farther than 500 feet apart, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The image can't speak, but you can use your actions to speak through the creature, with the spell disguising your voice as appropriate. You might need to attempt a Deception or Performance check to mimic the creature, as determined by the GM. This is especially likely if you're trying to imitate a specific person and engage with someone that person knows.</p>\n<p>In combat, the illusion can use 2 actions per turn, which it uses when you Sustain the spell. It uses your spell attack modifier for attack rolls and your spell DC for its AC. Its saving throw modifiers are equal to your spell DC – 10. It is substantial enough that it can flank other creatures. If the image is hit by an attack or fails a save, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The illusion can cause damage by making the target believe the illusion's attacks are real, but it cannot otherwise directly affect the physical world. If the illusory creature hits with a Strike, the target takes @Damage[3d4[mental]] damage. The illusion's Strikes are nonlethal. If the damage doesn't correspond to the image of the monster—for example, if an illusory Large dragon deals only 5 damage—the GM might allow the target to attempt an immediate Perception check to disbelieve the spell. Any relevant resistances and weaknesses apply if the target thinks they do, as judged by the GM. For example, if the illusion wields a warhammer and attacks a creature resistant to bludgeoning damage, the creature would take less mental damage. However, illusory damage does not deactivate regeneration or trigger other effects that require a certain damage type. The GM should track illusory damage dealt by the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. When a creature disbelieves the illusion, it recovers from half the damage it had taken from it (if any) and doesn't take any further damage from it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage of the image's Strikes increases by 1d4, and the maximum size of creature you can create increases by one (to a maximum of Gargantuan).</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，以一道心灵冲击使其恍惚。该冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，且可进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个由简单声音构成的听觉幻觉，其最大音量相当于四名普通人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程增加至120英尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你让目标物体看起来并摸起来仿佛处于好得多或差得多的物理状况。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美如新。被弄得看起来破败的物品会显得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}且粗制滥造。一件完好无损的物品若被弄得看起来更好，会显得仿佛全新且高度抛光，或保养得宜。一件破损物品会显得完好并能正常使用。已被摧毁的物品不受该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "信息 Message",
              "description": "<p>你无声地做出口型，但这些话语并不会从你口中发出，而是直接传入目标的耳中。其他人无法比你平常做口型时听得更清楚，但目标能听见你的话，就仿佛他们正站在你身旁一样。目标可以用一个反应动作（）作出简短回应，或者如果他们愿意，也可以在其下一回合用一个自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你且在射程内才能这么做。若他们回应，其回应会像最初的传讯术一样，直接传入你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 该法术的射程增加至500尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4点心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害但不承受持续伤害，且该法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。如果目标从恶心中恢复，持续伤害结束且该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被恪尸魔杀死的生物很难复活或被唤起为不死生物。恪尸魔会自动尝试反制任何将其杀死的任意生物复活或唤起为不死生物的尝试（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+19 #Counteract]]{+19}，反制阶位 5）。如果杀死该生物的恪尸魔被杀死，该生物便可正常从死亡中复活或变为不死生物。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by an akashti are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The akashti automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+19 #Counteract]]{+19}, counteract rank 5). If the akashti who slew the creature is slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
            },
            "Manifest Body": {
              "name": "具现身躯 Manifest Body",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 恪尸魔在10分钟的专注期间，于其纤细的骸骨骨架外显现出一具空洞的人形躯体。若这段时间是在距离一具死亡未满一周的类人生物尸体10尺内度过，则恪尸魔显现出的躯体外貌会与该类人生物生前完全一致，并作为该生物的伪装发挥作用。若恪尸魔能吞食其所复制之尸体的一部分，则其进行欺瞒检定以乔装成该生物时获得+4环境加值。穿戴显现出的躯体期间，恪尸魔失去其爪打击，且其声音听起来也与死者相同；它不具备死者的任何记忆或技能，面对审视时必须依靠欺瞒来维持这场骗局。若恪尸魔不在每日一次花费10分钟来维持这层虚假血肉的显现，其显现出的躯体会迅速腐坏。该躯体具有10点生命值，且防御与恪尸魔相同。当躯体被摧毁时，恪尸魔会毫发无伤地脱出，而留下的血肉外壳会散成一团红色蝴蝶云，随即迅速消散为红雾。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The akashti manifests a hollow humanoid body around its slender skeletal frame over the course of 10 minutes of concentration. If this time is spent within 10 feet of a humanoid body that has been dead for less than a week, the akashti's manifested body looks identical to that of the dead humanoid when they lived and functions as a disguise of that creature. If the akashti can consume a portion of the body it's duplicating, it gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Deception checks to Impersonate the creature. While wearing a manifested body, the akashti loses its claw Strike, and its voice sounds like that of the dead creature; it doesn't possess any of the dead creature's memories or skills and must rely on deception to continue the charade in the face of scrutiny. An akashti's manifested body decays swiftly if it doesn't take 10 minutes once per day to maintain the manifestation of the false flesh. The body has 10 Hit Points and the same defenses as the akashti. When the body is destroyed, the akashti emerges unharmed and the fleshy shell left behind scatters into a cloud of red butterflies that swiftly fade into red mist.</p>"
            },
            "Stunning Despair": {
              "name": "震慑绝望 Stunning Despair",
              "description": "<p>恪尸魔爆发出令人窒息的绝望啜泣。30尺内的生物必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:29]意志豁免，否则将变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}（大失败则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 3}）。恪尸魔在[[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4轮}内无法再次使用震慑绝望。</p>\n<p>The akashti unleashes overwhelming sobs of despair. Creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 3} on a critical failure). The akashti can't use Stunning Despair again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            },
            "Pan Fenfang True Form": {
              "name": "潘芬芳真身 Pan Fenfang True Form"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>恪尸魔是狡诈的邪魔，专门捕食处于哀悼之中的人；它们会化作最近去世的至亲挚爱，以便潜入家中，随后谋杀并吞噬悲恸家庭的灵魂。有时它们也被称作“复制尸”。恪尸魔在其真实形态下，看起来像一具覆着皮肤的骷髅，手指末端长着锋利的爪，鲜血自其无眼睑的双眼淌下。它的头骨像碗一样敞开，里面栖着一把把猩红色的蝴蝶。当恪尸魔躲藏在它显现出的身体之内时，细致的观察有时能揭露真相：那位似乎死而复生的“挚爱”头皮会微微起伏鼓胀，仿佛其中的蝴蝶正在蠕动翻搅。恪尸魔体现了悲伤的复杂循环。</p>\n<h2>额外学识已死的入侵者</h2>\n<p>有时，恪尸魔伏击并杀害目标，并非为了沉浸在其至亲的悲痛之中，而是为了取而代之，化作其形态从内部渗透某个组织，腐蚀既有的情谊纽带。然而终究，这些恪尸魔会对欺瞒感到厌倦，并将它们的新盟友引入陷阱，予以屠戮。</p>\n<p>Akashtis are manipulative fiends who prey on those in mourning; they assume the form of a recently deceased loved one so they can infiltrate homes, then murder and consume the souls of grieving families. Sometimes called a \"copycorpse,\" an akashti in its true form appears as a skin-covered skeleton with sharp talons on its fingers and tears of blood dripping from its lidless eyes. Its skull appears open like a bowl, and inside nest handfuls of crimson butterflies. When an akashti hides within its manifested body, close investigation can sometimes reveal the truth when the scalp of the supposed beloved one returned to life seems to subtly ripple and bulge as the butterflies within writhe. Akashtis embody the complex cycle of grief.</p>\n<h2>Deathly Invaders</h2>\n<p>Sometimes, akashtis ambush and murder targets not to bask in the grief of their loved ones, but instead to assume their form and infiltrate an organization from within to corrupt established bonds of camaraderie. Inevitably, though, these akashtis grow bored with deception and lead their new allies into a trap for slaughter.</p>",
          "blurb": "恪尸魔 灵堕魔\nAkashti nindoru",
          "prototypeToken": "潘芬芳 Pan Fenfang"
        },
        "Bunk Bed Post": {
          "name": "双层床床柱 Bunk Bed Post",
          "tokenName": "双层床床柱 Bunk Bed Post",
          "items": {
            "Taljjae Tassel": {
              "name": "魌头君流苏 Taljjae Tassel",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> 想象</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你用所附着武器进行的打击为大成功或大失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>被称为TALJJAE TASSEL的生物那鲜红明亮的流苏，是嬛郭随处可见的主题图案，被用作魅惑术，以祈求好运，并为巨大努力祈得回报。它们装饰在衣物、武器，甚至饮水葫芦上。这些特定的流苏之中蕴藏着那神秘妖精强大力量的一部分。当你启动一条TALJJAE TASSEL的流苏时，在触发攻击的持续时间内，你的武器获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qUnDHEXteUQGE8yp]{Grievous}符文的特性。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> envision</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your Strike with the affixed weapon was a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The bright red tassels of the creature known as Taljjae are a ubiquitous motif in Hwanggot and are used as charms to pray for good fortune and reward for great effort. They adorn clothing, weapons, and even drinking gourds. These particular tassels carry within them a potent fraction of the mysterious fey's power. When you activate a Taljjae tassel, your weapon gains the properties of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qUnDHEXteUQGE8yp]{Grievous} rune for the duration of the triggering attack.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "双层床床柱 Bunk Bed Post"
        },
        "Third Home": {
          "name": "第三家园 Third Home",
          "tokenName": "第三家园 Third Home",
          "items": {
            "Supplies for an Alarm Snare": {
              "name": "警报圈套的材料 Supplies for an Alarm Snare",
              "description": "<p>你通过将一个或多个会发出噪音的物体布置在绊线上或压力板上来制作一个警报圈套。当你制作警报圈套时，你要指定一个100到500英尺的可听射程。当一名小型或更大的生物进入该方格时，圈套会发出足够响亮的噪音，使你所指定射程内的所有生物都能听见。</p>\n<p>You create an alarm snare by rigging one or more noisy objects to a trip wire or pressure plate. When you create an alarm snare, you designate a range between 100 to 500 feet at which it can be heard. When a Small or larger creature enters the square, the snare makes a noise loud enough that it can be heard by all creatures in the range you designated.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Charge (Lesser)": {
              "name": "幽灵冲锋（次等） Ghost Charge (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> 打击</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这些弹簧装填的金属罐内装有多种化学物质与盐类的混合物，能够汲取并瓦解附近的不死生物。</p>\n<p>一枚<em>镇魂炸药</em>造成1d8点活力伤害与1点活力溅射伤害；不过依照活力伤害的一贯规则，此伤害只会伤害不死以及具有虚无治疗的生物。受到<em>镇魂炸药</em>伤害的主要目标会变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><em>镇魂炸药</em>被设计为即便接触到灵体物质也会爆炸，因此非常适合用来伤害虚体不死。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>These spring-loaded metal canisters contain a mixture of chemicals and salts that drain and disintegrate nearby undead creatures.</p>\n<p>A <em>ghost charge</em> deals 1d8 vitality damage and 1 vitality splash damage, though as usual for vitality damage, this damage harms only undead and creatures with void healing. A primary target that takes damage from a <em>ghost charge</em> becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><em>Ghost charges</em> are designed to explode even on contact with a spiritual substance, making them ideal for damaging incorporeal undead.</p>"
            },
            "Silver Pieces": {
              "name": "银币 Silver Pieces"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "第三家园 Third Home"
        },
        "Hungry Ghost": {
          "name": "饿鬼 Hungry Ghost",
          "tokenName": "饿鬼（幽灵） Hungry Ghost",
          "items": {
            "Ghostly Touch": {
              "name": "幽魂接触 Ghostly Touch"
            },
            "Living Visage": {
              "name": "活化面容 Living Visage",
              "description": "<p>当其生命值高于30点时，饥饿鬼看起来像是活着的生物。他们在用于掩饰其不死身份的欺瞒检定与DC上具有固定结果34，并且能够隐秘地对活人进食。</p>\n<p>While they have more than 30 HP, the hungry ghost appears to be a living creature. They have an automatic result of 34 on Deception checks and DCs to conceal their undead status and can Feed on the Living covertly.</p>"
            },
            "Feed on the Living": {
              "name": "以活人为食 Feed on the Living",
              "description": "<p>饥饿幽灵接触触及范围内的一个活体生物以窃取其生命力。若幽灵处于其活人形貌，它可以将“以生饲食”伪装成无害的触摸，并将效果延迟至多1分钟，同时让目标不察觉该效果。一个生物同时只能受到一个延迟的“以生饲食”影响，且若幽灵在这1分钟内失去其活人形貌，则延迟的效果将消失。当“以生饲食”生效时，目标根据其@Check[fortitude|dc:24]豁免结果承受@Damage[(2d8+4)[void]]伤害。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标的生命能量压倒幽灵。饥饿幽灵受到@Damage[5[vitality]]伤害，且目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受一半伤害，且饥饿幽灵回复等同于造成伤害的HP。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全额伤害，并在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，且饥饿幽灵回复等同于造成伤害的HP。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害，并在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}，且饥饿幽灵回复等同于造成伤害的HP。</p>\n<p>The hungry ghost touches a living creature in reach to steal its life force. If the ghost is in their living visage, they can disguise Feed on the Living as a benign touch and delay the effects for up to 1 minute while keeping the target unaware of the effect. A creature can be affected by only one delayed Feed on the Living at a time, and if the ghost loses their living visage during that minute, the delayed effect is lost. When Feed on the Living takes effect, the target takes @Damage[(2d8+4)[void]] damage, depending on the result of its @Check[fortitude|dc:24] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target's life energy overpowers the ghost. The hungry ghost takes @Damage[5[vitality]] damage, and the target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage, and the hungry ghost regains HP equal to the damage dealt.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 minute, and the hungry ghost regains HP equal to the damage dealt.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} for 1 minute, and the hungry ghost regains HP equal to the damage dealt.</p>"
            },
            "Ravenous Undoing": {
              "name": "贪婪的抹消 Ravenous Undoing",
              "description": "<p>在每个 24 小时周期内，饥饿幽灵必须使用“以生者为食”来吞噬 30 点生命值（幽灵本应获得的任何生命值都计入该总数，即使幽灵的生命值已足够高，以至于实际上无法恢复全部数值）。如果幽灵未吞噬足够的生命值，它会毫无思考、肆无忌惮地吞食所遇到的任何活体生物，直到满足为止。</p>\n<p>In each 24-hour period, the hungry ghost must use Feed on the Living to consume 30 HP (any HP the ghost would gain count toward this total, even if the ghost has enough HP that they don't actually regain the full amount). If the ghost hasn't consumed enough HP, they mindlessly and recklessly feed on any living creature they come across until satiated.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>当饿鬼被摧毁时，它们会在[[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后于上次被摧毁的地点重塑，并完全恢复。只有在它们被妥善安葬、其坟墓被清理并维护至少一年，或被法莱斯玛判定已获得救赎时，它们才会被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>When a hungry ghost is destroyed, they reform after [[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} fully healed at the location where they were last destroyed. They're only permanently destroyed when they have been given a proper burial, have had their grave cleaned and maintained for at least a year, or have been judged to be redeemed by Pharasma.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>饿鬼源自那些未能得到妥善安葬或其坟墓遭到荒废之人。它们并不被束缚于某处地点或某件物品，而是被驱使去寻找行善的机会，希望借此获得恩惠，从而协助它们实现最终的安息。然而，它们对活体能量的摄食需求往往与这一目标相冲突。</p><hr /><p>幽灵在死后被尚未化解的强烈情绪系缚于世间，作为其往昔自我的悲伤回响而作祟于生者。创建幽灵的规则见《怪物核心》第160页。</p>\n<p>Hungry ghosts arise from those who didn't receive proper burials or whose graves were neglected. They are not bound to a site or item but are compelled to see opportunities to commit good deeds in hopes of gaining favors that can aid them in achieving a final rest. Their need to feed on living energy often conflicts with this goal, however.</p><hr /><p>Tethered to the world after death by powerful emotions that haven't been resolved, ghosts haunt the living as sad echoes of their former selves. Rules for creating a ghost start on page 160 of Monster Core.</p>",
          "hp": "rejuvenation, void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "饿鬼 Hungry Ghost"
        },
        "Sparrow": {
          "name": "麻雀 Sparrow",
          "tokenName": "麻雀 Sparrow",
          "items": {
            "Beak": {
              "name": "鸟喙 Beak"
            },
            "Cunning": {
              "name": "狡猾 Cunning",
              "description": "<p>渡鸦可以把简单的物品当作工具使用，比如用树枝去戳一个开口，把食物挑出来。它们也相当擅长偷窃物体。渡鸦不能使用盗窃来@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ijZ0DDFpMkWqaShd]{藏匿物体}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.cYdz2grcOcRt4jk6]{解除装置}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2EE4aF4SZpYf0R6H]{开锁}，但它可以使用盗窃来@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{偷窃}它能用喙或爪携带的轻型物体，或完成其他相对简单的任务。</p>\n<p>A raven can use simple items as tools, such as poking a stick at an opening to tease out a piece of food. They're also quite adept at stealing objects. A raven can't use Thievery to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ijZ0DDFpMkWqaShd]{Palm an Object}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.cYdz2grcOcRt4jk6]{Disable a Device}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2EE4aF4SZpYf0R6H]{Pick a Lock}, but it can use Thievery to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{Steal} light objects that it can carry in its beak or talons or to accomplish other relatively simple tasks.</p>"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>渡鸦的打击对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}的生物造成额外1d4点精准伤害。</p>\n<p>A raven's Strikes deal an additional 1d4 precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>这些杂食鸟类狡猾而善于投机，是机会主义的食腐者。它们能够解开简单的谜题以取回想要的物品；当不在荒野中狩猎时，渡鸦会聚集在文明的边缘，必要时便对其进行掠夺。渡鸦以诡计多端而闻名，并且常被训练以进一步强化这种本能。受训的渡鸦会等待破绽，啄击敌人脆弱的部位。</p><hr /><p>很少有鸟类能像渡鸦一样狡猾且善于社交。</p>\n<p>These omnivorous birds are cunning and opportunistic scavengers. Capable of solving simple puzzles to retrieve desired items, ravens gather at the periphery of civilization, raiding it as needed when they're not hunting in the wilds. Ravens are known for trickery and often trained to further this instinct. Trained ravens will wait for an opening and peck their foes in vulnerable spots.</p><hr /><p>Few birds are as cunning and social as the raven.</p>",
          "blurb": "受训渡鸦\nTrained Raven",
          "prototypeToken": "麻雀 Sparrow"
        },
        "Mugirou the Rebel": {
          "name": "叛逆者麦郎 Mugirou the Rebel",
          "tokenName": "叛逆者麦郎 Mugirou the Rebel",
          "items": {
            "Shortbow": {
              "name": "短弓 Shortbow"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword"
            },
            "Leather Armor": {
              "name": "皮甲 Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧的与定型的煮制皮革混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时兼具最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
            },
            "Arrows": {
              "name": "箭矢 Arrows",
              "description": "<p>这些投射物是弓的弹药。箭杆由木头制成。它在飞行中由一端的羽翎保持稳定，另一端装有金属箭头。</p>\n<p>These projectiles are the ammunition for bows. The shaft of an arrow is made of wood. It is stabilized in flight by fletching at one end and bears a metal head on the other.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30英尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面僧没有视觉，但它们的听觉十分敏锐。它们不需要呼吸，并且免疫需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上会将双手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用“饮用”；它们也能以这种方式从消耗品（如药水或炼金灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>Noppera-bos have no sense of vision, but their sense of hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}状态，他们就会处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}状态。</p>\n<p>As long as a noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonate Shape": {
              "name": "乔装变形 Impersonate Shape",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼变成其在过去24小时内触碰过的一名小型或中型类人生物的模样，并获得目标生物的脸与声音。处于变形状态时，无面鬼对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{乔装}该生物获得+2环境加值，并失去其无面能力与所列出的免疫。无面鬼可以再次使用此能力来变回原状。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo changes into a version of a Small or Medium humanoid they've touched during the last 24 hours, and gains the target creature's face and voice. While transformed, the noppera-bo gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{Impersonate} that creature and loses its no face ability and listed immunities. The noppera-bo can change back by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Remove Face": {
              "name": "移除面容 Remove Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 无面鬼骗子正在冒充一个有脸的生物</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 无面鬼骗子的面部特征融化成虚无，并威吓30英尺内的一个生物。该生物在一次失败的 @Check[will|dc:17] 豁免后获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}）。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The noppera-bo trickster is Impersonating a creature with a face</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The noppera-bo trickster's facial features melt into nothingness, and they menace a creature within 30 feet. The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} on a failed @Check[will|dc:17] save (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼骗子对处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}状态的生物额外造成1d4点精准伤害。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo trickster deals an additional 1d4 precision damage to creatures that are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>这些无面鬼已精通伪装的艺术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>无面鬼从背后看起来像普通人类，甚至可能长得像你认识的某个人——直到他们转过身来，露出一张毫无五官的脸。</p>\n<h2>炉火纯青的行家</h2>\n<p>典型的无面鬼残忍成性，沉迷于惊吓或折磨类人生物的行径，但并非所有无面鬼都沉沦于邪恶。中立的无面鬼往往是爱恶作剧的捣蛋鬼，运用其能力来戏弄与调笑；而罕见的善良无面鬼则会用自己的能力去致敬并崇拜他们所仰慕之人，同时将自己的时间投入到磨炼艺术或手艺的技能上。</p>\n<h2>无面鬼起源</h2>\n<p>关于无面鬼起源有许多理论——从变形能力出错的化狸，到被诅咒扭曲的类人生物，再到自然诞生的妖怪。甚至有人推测，这种状态是一种可传播的诅咒，如同兽化症一般。大多数无面鬼不记得自己的起源，而且往往更有兴趣去假扮成完全不同的另一个人。</p>\n<p>These noppera-bos have mastered the art of disguise.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Noppera-bos appear to be regular humans from behind, and might even resemble someone you know, until they turn to reveal a featureless face.</p>\n<h2>Consummate Professionals</h2>\n<p>While the typical noppera-bo is cruel and revels in the act of frightening or tormenting humanoid creatures, not all of them wallow in evil. Neutral noppera-bos tend to be pranksters who use their abilities to trick and tease, while the rare good noppera- bos instead use their abilities to honor and idolize those they admire while focusing their own time on developing their skills at art or crafting.</p>\n<h2>Noppera-bo Origins</h2>\n<p>There are many theories on the origins of noppera-bos—from tanuki whose change shape ability went wrong, to humanoids who were warped by curses, to naturally spawning yokai. Some even theorize this condition is a transmissible curse like lycanthropy. Most noppera-bos don't recall their origins, and are often more interested in pretending to be someone else entirely.</p>",
          "blurb": "精英无面鬼骗子\nElite noppera-bo trickster",
          "prototypeToken": "叛逆者麦郎 Mugirou the Rebel"
        },
        "Luda Bama": {
          "name": "卢达·巴马 Luda Bama",
          "tokenName": "卢达·巴马 Luda Bama",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w32themushro00]{蘑菇房}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w32themushro00]{The Mushroom House}</p>",
          "blurb": "善于操纵人心的女性半身人走私者\nmanipulative female halfling smuggler",
          "prototypeToken": "卢达·巴马 Luda Bama"
        },
        "Hu Deming": {
          "name": "胡德明 Hu Deming",
          "tokenName": "胡德明 Hu Deming",
          "items": {
            "Club": {
              "name": "短棒 Club"
            },
            "Padded Armor": {
              "name": "衬垫护甲 Padded Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲只是由厚重的绗缝布料构成的一层，但有时会因为非常便宜而被使用。软垫护甲比其他类型的护甲更容易受损并被摧毁。重型护甲的价格包含一件软垫护甲内衬，不过当它穿在重型护甲下面时，会失去“舒适”特征。若你的重型护甲被摧毁，或在其他未穿着完整重型护甲的情况下，你可以只穿那件软垫护甲内衬来睡觉。这样你就能让魔法护甲保持注入状态，并从与之对应的重型护甲上任何符文的力量中获益，但没有这件软垫护甲内衬，其他人无法穿上你的重型护甲。</p>\n<p>This armor is simply a layer of heavy, quilted cloth, but it is sometimes used because it's so inexpensive. Padded armor is easier to damage and destroy than other types of armor. Heavy armor comes with a padded armor undercoat included in its Price, though it loses the comfort trait when worn under heavy armor. You can wear just that padded armor undercoat to sleep in, if your heavy armor is destroyed, or when otherwise not wearing the full heavy armor. This allows you to keep magic armor invested and benefit from the power of any runes on the associated heavy armor, but no one else can wear your heavy armor without the padded undercoat.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Appraising Eye": {
              "name": "鉴定之眼 Appraising Eye",
              "description": "<p>商人可以使用商贸学识来对物品进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{回忆知识}，包括确定其价值。他们也可以使用商贸学识尝试@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法}，并且可以在事先不知道该物品是否具有魔法的情况下这么做。</p>\n<p>The merchant can use Mercantile Lore to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge} about items, including determining their value. They can also attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} using Mercantile Lore and can do so without first knowing whether the item is magical.</p>"
            },
            "Sales Specialist": {
              "name": "销售专员 Sales Specialist",
              "description": "<p>对于涉及谈判或商贸技能的遭遇，一名商人是一个4级挑战。</p>\n<p>For encounters involving negotiation or mercantile skill, a merchant is a 4th-level challenge.</p>"
            },
            "Mercantile Lore": {
              "name": "商贸学识 Mercantile Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>较小的聚居地通常只能供养一两名全能型商人，而较大的城市则有多名专门人士——某一类产品的专家。商人的范围从在公共广场上奔走叫卖的小贩，到经营整个商业组织的富有巨头。商人可能拥有一项关于某个特定物品类别（例如珠宝或魔法武器）的额外学识技能，其技能调整值等同于他们的商贸学识。</p><hr /><p>专精是通过多年的努力与往往枯燥的工作锻造而成的。工匠是其制作技艺的大师，能够创造既实用又美观的作品。</p>\n<p>Small settlements can typically support one or two generalist merchants, and larger cities house multiple specialists—experts in one type of product. Merchants range from vendors hustling in the public square to wealthy tycoons running entire commercial organizations. A merchant might have an additional Lore skill about a specific category of item (such as jewelry or magic weapons), with a skill modifier equal to their Mercantile Lore.</p><hr /><p>Expertise is forged through years of effort and often tedious work. Artisans are masters of their craft, able to create works both practical and beautiful.</p>",
          "blurb": "男性人类商人\nMale human merchant",
          "prototypeToken": "胡德明 Hu Deming"
        },
        "Spider Swarm": {
          "name": "蜘蛛群 Spider Swarm",
          "tokenName": "蜘蛛群 Spider Swarm",
          "items": {
            "Web Sense": {
              "name": "蛛网感知 Web Sense",
              "description": "<p>蜘蛛群拥有不精确的震感，以侦测触碰其蛛网术的生物所引起的振动。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>\n<p>The spider swarm has imprecise tremorsense to detect the vibrations of creatures touching its web.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>"
            },
            "Swarm Mind": {
              "name": "虫群心智 Swarm Mind",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwarmMind]</p>"
            },
            "Spider Swarm Venom": {
              "name": "蜘蛛群毒液 Spider Swarm Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 4 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1[poison]] 且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 且 力竭 1（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1[poison]] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] and enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Swarming Bites": {
              "name": "蜂拥噬咬 Swarming Bites",
              "description": "<p>每个处于蜘蛛群空间内的敌人受到 @Damage[1d4[piercing]] 伤害，并进行一次 @Check[reflex|dc:14|basic] 豁免。</p>\n<p>豁免失败的生物会暴露于蜘蛛群毒液之下。</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the spider swarm's space takes @Damage[1d4[piercing]] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:14|basic] save.</p>\n<p>A creature that fails its save is exposed to spider swarm venom.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>充足的食物、突然孵化的一窝卵，或魔法影响都可能导致较小的蜘蛛聚集成令人毛骨悚然、致命的群体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>很少有日常害虫能像臭名昭著的蜘蛛那样引发如此强烈的恐惧。</p>\n<p>An abundance of food, the sudden hatching of a clutch of eggs, or magical influence can cause smaller spiders to gather in terrifying, deadly masses.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Few everyday vermin inspire as much dread as the infamous spider.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "蜘蛛群 Spider Swarm"
        },
        "Ren Mei Li": {
          "name": "任美璃 Ren Mei Li",
          "tokenName": "任美璃 Ren Mei Li",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Mind Probe": {
              "name": "精神质询 Mind Probe",
              "description": "<p>你将思绪投射进一名生物的心智之中，筛选信息。你会接触到目标的记忆与知识，除非它以一次意志豁免将你挡开。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 在法术持续时间的每一轮中，你都可以维持该法术以提出一个不同的问题，并尝试揭示答案。对于每个问题，目标都可以进行一次欺瞒检定来对抗你的法术DC；若目标成功，你不会得知答案；若为大成功，目标会给出一个你相信为真实的虚假答案。一旦你就某个问题询问过目标，再次询问该问题——即使是以另一次施放精神质询——也会得到相同的结果。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且目标在针对你问题进行的欺瞒检定中承受–4环境减值。</p>\n<p>You cast your thoughts through a creature's mind, sifting for information. You access the target's memories and knowledge unless it fends you off with a Will save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Each round of the spell's duration, you can Sustain the spell to ask a different question and attempt to uncover the answer. For each question, the target can attempt a Deception check against your spell DC; if the target succeeds, you don't learn the answer, and on a critical success, the target gives you a false answer that you believe is truthful Once you've asked the target a given question, asking it again, even with a separate casting of mind probe, produces the same result.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the target takes a –4 circumstance penalty to Deception checks against your questions.</p>"
            },
            "Truespeech (Constant)": {
              "name": "真言（恒定） Truespeech (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>目标可以理解所有词语，不受语言限制，并且也能说其他生物的语言。当处于由多种生物组成的混合群体中时，每当目标开口说话，它都可以选择一个生物，并用该生物能理解的语言进行交流，即使目标并不知道那是什么语言。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（7环）</strong> 持续时间为 8 小时。</p>\n<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Outcast's Curse": {
              "name": "流放诅咒 Outcast's Curse",
              "description": "<p>你使目标遭受一道诅咒，使其存在感变得令人厌烦且惹人反感。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续10分钟，目标在尝试欺瞒、交涉、威吓或表演检定时必须掷骰两次并使用较差的结果；且其遭遇到的生物对它的初始态度会降低1级（例如，以@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{不友善}代替@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{不关心}）。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但效果为永久。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且目标所遭遇到的生物对它的初始态度会降低2级。</p>\n<p>You afflict the target with a curse that makes its presence abrasive and off-putting. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 10 minutes, the target must roll twice and use the worse result whenever attempting a Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, or Performance check, and creatures they encounter have an initial attitude toward them of one step worse (for instance, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{Unfriendly} instead of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{Indifferent}).</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect is permanent.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and creatures that the target encounters have an initial attitude toward them of two steps worse.</p>"
            },
            "Suggestion": {
              "name": "暗示术 Suggestion",
              "description": "<p>你甜言蜜语，令生物难以抗拒。你向目标提出一个行动方案，该方案的措辞必须让目标觉得这是合乎逻辑的行动方式，且不能是自我毁灭的，也不能明显违背目标自身利益。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并且知道你试图控制它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标立刻遵从你的暗示术。该法术的持续时间为1分钟，或直到目标完成一项有限的暗示，或该暗示变得具有自我毁灭性，或出现其他明显的负面效果为止。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但基础持续时间为1小时。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（8环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>Your honeyed words are difficult for creatures to resist. You suggest a course of action to the target, which must be phrased in such a way as to seem like a logical course of action to the target and can't be self-destructive or obviously against the target's self-interest. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and knows you tried to control it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target immediately follows your suggestion. The spell has a duration of 1 minute, or until the target has completed a finite suggestion or the suggestion becomes self-destructive or has other obvious negative effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the base duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "传送 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你会立刻将自己以及你穿戴或持有的所有物品，从你当前的空间传送到射程内你能看见的一处未被占据的空间。若这会把另一名生物一并带上——即使你正把它装在异次元容器里——该法术将失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（5环）</strong> 射程增加至1英里。你不需要能看见目的地，只要你过去曾到过那里，并且知道它相对于你的位置与距离即可。随后你在1小时内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Mind Reading (At Will)": {
              "name": "读心术（随意） Mind Reading (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你以一次粗略的心灵接触，尝试读取目标的心智。它必须进行一次意志豁免。随后目标在1小时内对你的读心术获得暂时免疫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 当你施放法术时，目标从你那里感知到模糊的表层思绪。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你得知目标的智力调整值是高于、等于还是低于你的。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 当你施放法术时，你从目标那里感知到模糊的表层思绪，并且你得知其智力是高于、等于还是低于你的。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，并且在法术的持续时间内，你可以维持该法术以再次侦测目标的表层思绪。目标不会获得任何额外的豁免。</p>\n<p>With a cursory mental touch, you attempt to read the target's mind. It must attempt a Will save. The target then becomes temporarily immune to your mind reading for 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target perceives vague surface thoughts from you when you Cast the Spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You find out whether the target's Intelligence modifier is higher than, equal to, or lower than yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You perceive vague surface thoughts from the target when you Cast the Spell, and you find out whether its Intelligence is higher than, equal to, or lower than yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and for the duration of the spell, you can Sustain the spell to detect the target's surface thoughts again. The target doesn't receive any additional saves.</p>"
            },
            "Speak with Animals (Constant, Spiders Only)": {
              "name": "动物交谈（恒定，仅限蜘蛛） Speak with Animals (Constant, Spiders Only)",
              "description": "<p>你可以向动物提问、从它们那里获得回答，并对动物使用交涉（技能）。该法术不会让它们比平时更友善。狡猾的动物往往言辞简短且闪烁其词，而不那么聪明的动物则经常发表愚蠢的评论。</p>\n<p>You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals. The spell doesn't make them more friendly than normal. Cunning animals are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>"
            },
            "Charm": {
              "name": "魅惑术 Charm",
              "description": "<p>对目标而言，你的言语如蜜一般甜美，你的面容仿佛笼罩在朦胧梦幻的薄雾中。它必须尝试一次意志豁免；如果你或你的盟友最近威胁过它或对它使用过敌对动作，则该豁免获得+4环境加值。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。若你对目标使用敌对动作，该法术结束。法术结束时，除非它与你之间的友谊或你说服它采取的动作与它的预期发生冲突，否则目标不一定会意识到自己曾被魅惑，这意味着你可能通过世俗手段说服目标继续做你的朋友。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响，并且知道你曾试图魅惑它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响，但除非它识别出该法术，否则会认为你的法术是某种无害的东西而非魅惑。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{友善}。如果它原本为友善，则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{乐于帮助}。它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为乐于帮助，并且它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间延长至你下次进行每日准备为止。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 持续时间延长至你下次进行每日准备为止，且你至多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of charm, unless it identifies the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{Friendly} toward you. If it was Friendly, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful}. It can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes Helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Summon Animal (Spiders Only)": {
              "name": "召唤动物（仅限蜘蛛） Summon Animal (Spiders Only)",
              "description": "<p>你召唤一个具有动物（特征）且等级为 –1 的生物为你战斗。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶</strong> 如召唤（特征）中所列</p>\n<p>You summon a creature that has the animal trait and whose level is –1 to fight for you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened</strong> As listed in the summon trait</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "利爪 Claw"
            },
            "Web": {
              "name": "蛛网术 Web"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "持续法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Darting Legs": {
              "name": "蛛腿拨挡 Darting Legs",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 络新妇伸展了自己的蜘蛛腿或已改变形态</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 络新妇成为一次攻击的目标</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 络新妇抬起一条腿，在对抗触发攻击的AC上获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The jorogumo has their spider legs extended or has Changed Shape</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The jorogumo is targeted with an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The jorogumo raises a leg, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>络新妇呈现为任意小型或中型蜘蛛的外形。这不会改变其速度或打击。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>The jorogumo takes on the appearance of any Small or Medium spider. This doesn't change their Speed or Strikes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Jorogumo Venom": {
              "name": "络新妇毒 Jorogumo Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:32]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 4小时</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]] 伤害并且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]] 伤害并且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[4d6[poison]] 伤害并且呆滞 2（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹} [[/gmr 1d4 #Duration Paralyzed]]{1d4小时}</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:32]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[4d6[poison]] damage and Stupefied 2 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for [[/gmr 1d4 #Duration Paralyzed]]{1d4 hours}</p>"
            },
            "Silver Mistwalk": {
              "name": "白银雾行 Silver Mistwalk",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 任美璃当前位于神门中她领地的边界之内</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每小时一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 一股旋转的银色薄雾漩涡自任美璃脚下升起，如缓缓旋转的龙卷风般缠绕她的身体，随后瞬间将她以及她身上穿戴与持握的所有物品，从她当前的空间传送至神门中她领地内任意一处她曾到访过的空旷空间，前提是她知道该地点相对她的位置与距离。由于任美璃过去曾到访过柳岸镇的废墟，她可以借由此能力出现在镇中任何地点，但若不在他人预料之中，她通常会避免直接出现在建筑物内部。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Ren Mei Li is currently located within the boundaries of her domain in Shenmen</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> A swirling vortex of silver mist rises up from Ren Mei Li's feet to wrap around her body like a slowly-rotating tornado, then instantly transports her and any items she's wearing and holding from her current space to a clear space anywhere within her domain in Shenmen that she has visited before, provided she knows its relative location and distance from her. Since Ren Mei Li has visited Willowshore's ruins in the past, she can appear anywhere in the town using this ability, but she generally avoids directly appearing inside a structure if she isn't expected.</p>"
            },
            "Spider Legs": {
              "name": "蜘蛛腿 Spider Legs",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 络新妇处于类人形态</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 八条巨大的蜘蛛腿从络新妇背后生出，给予其40尺的攀爬速度，并使其能够使用蛛腿拨挡反应动作（）。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The jorogumo is in humanoid form</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Eight large spider legs sprout from the jorogumo's back, granting them a 40-foot climb Speed and allowing them to use the Darting Legs reaction.</p>"
            },
            "Web Trap": {
              "name": "网缚 Web Trap",
              "description": "<p>被络新妇的蛛网术攻击命中的生物将@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}并被黏在最近的表面上，阻止该生物移动。</p>\n<p>对网缚进行[[/act escape dc=32]]或[[/act force-open dc=32]]的DC为32。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by the jorogumo's web attack is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and stuck to the nearest surface, preventing the creature from moving.</p>\n<p>The DC to [[/act escape dc=32]] or [[/act force-open dc=32]] the web trap is 32.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>络新妇外表看起来是美丽、衣着考究的人类，潜伏在高山之中，以旅人为食。这些邪恶的生物能够完全变成一只巨型蜘蛛，或从背上长出蜘蛛腿，并且常把巨型蜘蛛当作宠物饲养。络新妇通常会吃掉猎物，但有些类人生物会遭遇更为骇人的命运——成为络新妇卵的活体孵化器。尽管大多数络新妇都是独居的生物，仍有一些开始崇拜诺格博，并以该神“灰色大师”的化身之名，成为追随其教义的盗贼公会的宝贵盟友。</p>\n<p>Appearing as beautiful, well-dressed humans, jorogumo lurk in the high mountains and prey on travelers. These evil creatures can fully change into a giant spider or sprout spider legs from their backs, and they often keep giant spiders as pets. Jorogumo usually eat their prey, but some humanoids meet an even more gruesome fate as living incubators for jorogumo eggs. Though most jorogumos are solitary creatures, some have taken up worship of Norgorber and serve as valuable allies to thieves' guilds following that god's guise as the Gray Master.</p>",
          "blurb": "雌性络新妇\nFemale jorogumo",
          "prototypeToken": "任美璃 Ren Mei Li"
        },
        "Guhdggi": {
          "name": "孤寂 Guhdggi",
          "tokenName": "孤寂 Guhdggi",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Slow": {
              "name": "缓慢术 Slow",
              "description": "<p>你扩张目标周围的时间流动，减缓其动作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} 状态，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} 状态，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} 状态，持续1分钟。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You dilate the flow of time around the target, slowing its actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Wanderer's Guide": {
              "name": "旅者向导 Wanderer's Guide",
              "description": "<p>你祈求彼岸来指引你的路线。当你施放此法术时，选择一个目的地；你会获得一条通往该目的地的灵感路线，使你以及与你一同进行陆上旅行的盟友在持续时间内，只要不偏离这条灵感路线，就能将因困难地形造成的移动减值减半。此效果不会影响遭遇中的移动。若你在持续时间结束前再次使用此能力，此效果结束，并被新路线的效果所取代。</p>\n<p>You call upon the beyond to guide your route. When you Cast this Spell, choose a destination; you receive an inspired route to that destination, allowing you and allies who travel overland with you to reduce the movement penalty from difficult terrain by half for the duration, as long as you don't deviate from the inspired route. This doesn't have any effect on movement during encounters. If you use this ability again before the duration is over, this effect ends and is replaced by that of the new route.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Maneuver": {
              "name": "念动战技 Telekinetic Maneuver",
              "description": "<p>随着一股念动力量的冲击，你移动一个敌人或其携带的某件物品。你可以尝试对目标进行缴械、推撞或绊摔，并使用法术攻击掷骰代替运动检定。</p>\n<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to Disarm, Shove, or Trip the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标的心智变得混沌，并用一次心灵震荡使其目眩神迷。这次震荡造成等同于你施法关键属性调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加 1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你让目标物体看起来并摸起来仿佛其物理状况要好得多或糟得多。当你施放此法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。一件被弄得看起来破败不堪的物品，会显得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}且粗制滥造。一件完好的物品若被弄得看起来更好，则会显得仿佛崭新且高度抛光，或保养得当。一件破损物品会显得完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品不会受此法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Know the Way": {
              "name": "识途 Know the Way",
              "description": "<p>在你的心眼中，你以魔法重新校准方向。你立刻知道哪一边是北方（如果你当前位置存在北方），并且你可以选择一个你在过去24小时内到过的地点，得知它位于哪个方向。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>增幅（3环）</strong> 你可以选择一个你在过去一周内到过的地点。</p>\n<p><strong>增幅（7环）</strong> 你可以选择一个你到过的地点，不受你曾在多久以前到过那里的限制。</p>\n<p>In your mind's eye, you magically reorient yourself. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location), and you can choose a location you were at within the last 24 hours and learn what direction it lies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can choose a location you were at within the last week.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can choose a location you were at regardless of how long ago you were there.</p>"
            },
            "Ray of Enfeeblement": {
              "name": "衰弱射线 Ray of Enfeeblement",
              "description": "<p>一道汲取敌人力量的射线从你手中闪现。对目标进行一次远程法术攻击。若你成功，则该生物进行一次强韧豁免以决定法术的效果。若你的攻击掷骰为大成功，则使用其豁免结果降低一级的度数作为结果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 3}。</p>\n<p>A ray that saps a foe's strength flashes from your hand. Attempt a ranged spell attack against the target. If you succeed, that creature attempts a Fortitude save to determine the spell's effect. If your attack roll is a critical success, use the outcome for one degree of success worse than the result of its save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3}.</p>"
            },
            "Broken Spear": {
              "name": "破损的矛 Broken Spear"
