            "Hallucination": {
              "name": "镜花水月 Hallucination",
              "description": "<p>目标会持续把某个事物侦测成另一个事物，无法侦测到实际存在的某物，或侦测到并不存在的某物，但这不会改变其信念。你选择适用上述哪一种效果，并决定该镜花水月的具体内容。例如，你可以让目标把所有精灵看成是人类、无法侦测到其兄弟的存在、即使护身处并没有也会看到自己心爱的幸运符，或看到镇中心有一座高塔。</p>\n<p>目标可以尝试一次初始的意志豁免，效果如下。此后，目标每次进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜寻} 或直接与该镜花水月交互时，都会获得一次意志豁免以识破镜花水月。例如，目标每次与一名精灵交互、意外撞到自己的兄弟、试图检查自己的护符或研究那座高塔时，都可以尝试识破镜花水月。在GM决定的某些情境下，目标尝试识破时可以获得较大的环境加值，例如目标试图攀爬那座并不存在的高塔时。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物会感知到你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止，但它知道该镜花水月是什么。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物会感知到你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物会感知到你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止，且它信任自己虚假的感官，在进行识破的豁免检定时承受-4环境减值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 选择以下一项：以最多10个生物为目标，或将法术的持续时间改为直到你的下次每日准备。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 选择以下一项：以任意数量的生物为目标，或将法术的持续时间改为无限。</p>\n<p>The target consistently detects one thing as another, can't detect something that's there, or detects something that's not there, though it doesn't alter their beliefs. You choose which of these effects applies, and you determine the specifics of the hallucination. For example, you could make the target see all elves as humans, be unable to detect the presence of their brother, see their beloved good luck charm on their person even when it isn't, or see a tower in the center of town.</p>\n<p>The target can attempt an initial Will save, with effects below. They also receive a Will save to disbelieve the hallucination every time they @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} or directly interact with the hallucination. For example, the target could attempt to disbelieve the hallucination each time they interacted with an elf, bumped into their brother accidentally, tried to check their charm, or studied the tower. The target can attempt to disbelieve with a large circumstance bonus in situations determined by the GM, such as if the target attempted to climb the nonexistent tower.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, but it knows what the hallucination is.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, and it trusts its false senses, taking a -4 circumstance penalty to saves to disbelieve.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Choose to either target up to 10 creatures or change the spell's duration to until your next daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> Choose to either target any number of creatures or change the spell's duration to unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Subconscious Suggestion": {
              "name": "深层暗示 Subconscious Suggestion",
              "description": "<p>你在目标心灵深处植入一道深层暗示，使其在你指定的触发发生时遵循。你向目标提出一条行动方针。你的指令必须以一种对目标而言看似合乎逻辑的方式表述，且不能是自我毁灭的，或明显违背目标自身利益的。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响，并知道你试图控制它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并认为你只是正常与其交谈，而不是对其施放法术。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该暗示会留在目标的潜意识中，直到你下次进行准备为止。若在此之前触发发生，目标会立刻遵循你的暗示。该效果的持续时间为1分钟，或直到目标完成一个有限的暗示内容，或该暗示变得自我毁灭，或产生其他明显的负面效果为止。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但持续时间为1小时。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You implant a subconscious suggestion deep within the target's mind for them to follow when a trigger you specify occurs. You suggest a course of action to the target. Your directive must be phrased in such a way as to seem like a logical course of action to the target, and it can't be self-destructive or obviously against the target's self-interest. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and knows you tried to control it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected and thinks you were talking to them normally, not casting a spell on them.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The suggestion remains in the target's subconscious until the next time you prepare. If the trigger occurs before then, the target immediately follows your suggestion. The effect has a duration of 1 minute, or until the target has completed a finite suggestion or the suggestion becomes self-destructive or has other obvious negative effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Phantasmal Killer": {
              "name": "魅影杀手 Phantasmal Killer",
              "description": "<p>你为目标创造一个其所能想象到的最可怖生物的幻象。只有该法术的目标能看见这个杀手，不过你能看见那幻觉在冲上前发动攻击时的模糊轮廓。杀手的效果取决于目标的意志豁免结果。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[4d6[mental]] 伤害，并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] 伤害，并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标恐惧到可能会死。它必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] 豁免；若目标失败，则它死亡。若强韧豁免成功，目标受到 @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] 伤害，在其下个回合结束前陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 4}。此效果具有失能（特征）。</p><hr /><p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 失败时伤害增加 2d6，大失败时伤害增加 3d6。</p>\n<p>You create a phantasmal image of the most fearsome creature imaginable to the target. Only the spell's target can see the killer, though you can see the vague shape of the illusion as it races forth to attack. The effect of the killer is based on the outcome of the target's Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is so afraid it might die. It must attempt a @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] save; if the target fails, it dies. On a successful Fortitude save, the target takes @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} until the end of its next turn, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}. This effect has the incapacitation trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6 on a failure and by 3d6 on a critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Paralyze": {
              "name": "麻痹术 Paralyze",
              "description": "<p>你在目标的运动冲动离开其心智之前将其阻断，威胁要将目标冻结在原地。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标陷入Paralyzed，持续4轮。在其每个回合结束时，它可以尝试一次新的意志豁免，将剩余持续时间减少1轮；若大成功，则完全结束该效果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You block the target's motor impulses before they can leave its mind, threatening to freeze the target in place. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Paralyzed for 4 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, it can attempt a new Will save to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, or end it entirely on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Vampiric Feast": {
              "name": "吸血盛宴 Vampiric Feast",
              "description": "<p>你的接触汲取目标的生命精华，以强化你自己。你对目标造成6d6虚空伤害。你获得等同于目标所受虚空伤害一半的临时生命值（在应用抗力等效果之后）。1分钟后，你失去所有剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Inveigle": {
              "name": "诱骗 Inveigle",
              "description": "<p>你赢得目标的心智，使其将你视为亲近而值得信赖的朋友，并将你提出的每个建议都看作合理。目标对你乐于帮助，因此它会不遗余力地帮助你。如同任何其他乐于帮助的生物一样，你能要求它做的事也有其限度。若你曾要求目标去做完全违背其天性之事，或对目标或其利益而言毫无必要地有害之事，它不仅会拒绝，还可以尝试一次意志豁免以提前终止效果。由于施法时间与射程所限，除非目标是自愿的（也许被说服认为该仪式会产生其他效果）或被束缚，否则通常很难施放此仪式。若该生物不愿接受该仪式，它可以尝试一次意志豁免以抵消效果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 仪式成功，且目标在用于终止效果的意志豁免上承受-4状态减值。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 仪式成功。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 仪式失败。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 仪式失败，且目标转而憎恨你，在持续时间内对你变为敌对。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你可以在整个施法过程中，对1英里内的一名生物使用<em>inveigle</em>，前提是你拥有一缕头发、一滴血或该生物身体的其他部分，并将其混入花费中使用的油料里。基础花费增加至100 gp。持续时间比正常更短，取决于你使用了多大一块该生物的身体部分。血液、头发、鳞片等会使该仪式持续1周；而一只手或其他较大块的身体部位会使该仪式持续1个月。</p>\n<p>You win over the target's mind, causing it to see you as a close and trusted friend and look upon your every suggestion as reasonable. The target is helpful toward you, so it will go out of its way to help you. As with any other helpful creature, there are limits to what you can ask of it. If you ever ask the target to do something completely against its nature or needlessly harmful to the target or its interests, not only does it refuse, but it also can attempt a Will save to end the effect early. Because of the casting time and range, it's generally difficult to cast this ritual unless the target is willing (perhaps convinced the ritual will have some other effect) or restrained. If the creature is unwilling to accept the ritual, it can attempt a Will save to negate the effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The ritual succeeds and the target takes a -4 status penalty to Will saves to end the effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The ritual succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The ritual fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The ritual fails and the target instead hates you, becoming hostile to you for the duration.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can use <em>inveigle</em> on a creature up to 1 mile away throughout the casting, as long as you have a lock of hair, a drop of blood, or some other piece of the creature's body, which you mix into the oils used in the cost. The base cost increases to 100 gp. The duration is shorter than normal, based on how large a piece of the creature's body you use. Blood, hair, scales, and the like cause the ritual to last 1 week, while a hand or other substantial body part causes the ritual to last 1 month.</p>"
            },
            "Charm": {
              "name": "魅惑术 Charm",
              "description": "<p>对目标而言，你的话语如蜜般甜美，你的面容仿佛沐浴在梦幻般的薄雾之中。它必须尝试一次意志豁免；若你或你的盟友最近威胁过它或对它使用过敌对动作，则该豁免获得+4环境加值。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。若你对目标使用敌对动作，则该法术结束。当法术结束时，目标未必会意识到自己曾被魅惑，除非它对你的友谊或你说服它采取的动作与它的预期发生冲突；这意味着你可能可以通过世俗手段说服目标继续与你做朋友。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并且知道你试图魅惑它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响，但会认为你的法术是某种无害效果而非魅惑术，除非它辨识出该法术。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{友善}。若它原本已是友善，则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{乐于帮助}。它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为乐于帮助，并且它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间延长至你下次进行每日准备为止。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 持续时间延长至你下次进行每日准备为止，且你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of charm, unless it identifies the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{Friendly} toward you. If it was Friendly, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful}. It can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes Helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "传讯术 Message",
              "description": "<p>你轻声动唇，但这些话并不会从你口中发出，而是被直接传入目标的耳中。其他人听你的话并不会比你平常无声动唇时更清楚，但目标却能听得一清二楚，仿佛就站在你身旁。目标可以以反应动作（）作出简短回应，或者如果他们愿意，也可以在其下个回合以自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你且在射程内才能这么做。若他们回应，他们的回应也会像最初的传讯术一样，直接传入你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 该法术的射程提升至500英尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "盾牌 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你召唤一道由力场构成的魔法护盾。这视为使用“举起护盾”动作，使你在下个回合开始前获得 AC +1 环境加值，但不需要空出一只手来使用。</p>\n<p>当该法术处于效果期间，你可以用你的魔法护盾使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{盾牌格挡} 反应动作（）。该护盾的硬度为 5。你可以使用该法术的反应动作（）来减少来自任何法术或魔法效果的伤害，即使其不造成物理伤害也可以。在你使用盾牌格挡后，该法术结束，并且你在 10 分钟内无法再次施放该法术。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 护盾的硬度提高 5。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. You can use the spell's reaction to reduce damage from any spell or magical effect, even if it doesn't deal physical damage. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The shield's Hardness increases by 5.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造一只漂浮的魔法之手，它可以是隐形的或幽灵般的。这只手抓住目标物体，并使其缓慢地向任意方向悬浮移动，最远达20英尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以让该物体额外移动20英尺。如果法术结束时该物体仍在空中，物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，并且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，并且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为2或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你向目标投掷一个射程内、散落且无人看管、且负载不超过1的物体。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若你命中，你造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——取决于你所投掷物体的适用类型。被投掷物品的任何特定特征或魔法属性都不会影响该攻击或伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成完整伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Urumi": {
              "name": "乌鲁米 Urumi"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Breathsense (Precise) 60 feet": {
              "name": "吐息感知（精确）60尺 Breathsense (Precise) 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>僵尸除非凭借其气息感知，否则无法感知到5英尺以外的活着的生物。处于所列射程内且屏住呼吸的活着的生物，在其屏住呼吸期间对僵尸而言为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。为了以这种方式屏住呼吸，生物必须空出一只手来完全捏住鼻子或捂住嘴。</p>\n<p>A jiang-shi can't perceive living creatures beyond 5 feet except with their breathsense. A living creature within the listed range who holds its breath is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} to the jiang-shi for as long as it holds its breath. To hold its breath in this way, a creature must have one hand free to fully plug its nose or cover its mouth.</p>"
            },
            "Fast Healing 10": {
              "name": "快速治疗 10 Fast Healing 10",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FastHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Jiang-Shi Vulnerabilities": {
              "name": "僵尸易伤 Jiang-Shi Vulnerabilities",
              "description": "<p>所有僵尸都具有以下弱点。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>厌恶</strong> 僵尸无法自愿接近挥舞着的镜子或摇响手铃的声音10尺之内。生物可以用【交互】操作镜子或手铃，使其在1轮内处于挥舞或摇响状态（类似于举起盾牌）。如果僵尸非自愿地进入其厌恶之物10尺范围内，它获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑（状态）}，并从其厌恶之物处逃离，直到与该物体的距离达到或超过10尺。在暴露于其厌恶之物1轮后，僵尸可以以一个具有专注（特征）的单动作尝试一次@Check[will|dc:25]豁免。成功时，它在[[/gmr 1d6 #rounds]]{1d6轮}内克服其厌恶（大成功则为1小时）。</li>\n<li><strong>苦涩顿悟</strong> 当被提醒其堕落本性以及其与活物存在性断裂的真相时，僵尸会受到严重的忧郁折磨。当僵尸看见一座祭坛，其上有至少1负载的供奉祖先魂魄的食物祭品时，它必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:25]豁免。随后，它在1分钟内暂时免疫苦涩顿悟。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 僵尸不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 僵尸在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 僵尸在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 僵尸处于呆滞 2并在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}。</p>\n<p>All jiang-shi possess the following vulnerabilities.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revulsion</strong> A jiang-shi can't voluntarily come within 10 feet of a brandished mirror or the sound of ringing handbells. A creature can Interact with a mirror or handbell to brandish or ring the item for 1 round (similar to Raising a Shield). If the jiang-shi involuntarily comes within 10 feet of an object of their revulsion, they gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition, running from the object of their revulsion until they are 10 feet or farther from the object. After 1 round of being exposed to the object of their revulsion, a jiang-shi can attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save as a single action, which has the concentrate trait. On a success, they overcome their revulsions for [[/gmr 1d6 #rounds]]{1d6 rounds} (or 1 hour on a critical success).</li>\n<li><strong>Bitter Epiphany</strong> A jiang-shi is afflicted by severe melancholia when reminded of their debased nature and the truth of their existential disconnection from living beings. When a jiang-shi sees an altar with at least 1 Bulk of food offerings to ancestor spirits, they must attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save. They are then temporarily immune to Bitter Epiphany for 1 minute.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The jiang-shi is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The jiang-shi is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The jiang-shi is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The jiang-shi is stupefied 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "One More Breath": {
              "name": "再喘一口气 One More Breath",
              "description": "<p>与其他不死不同，僵尸在生命值降至 0 时不会被摧毁。相反，它们会陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}，并在 1 分钟后以 1 点生命值苏醒。将至少 1 负载的糯米或母鸡蛋撒在昏迷的僵尸身上，会将其永久摧毁。若僵尸是被一把由暮木制成的武器的攻击降至 0 生命值，它会立刻被摧毁。</p>\n<p>Unlike other undead, a jiang-shi isn't destroyed at 0 HP. Instead, they fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} and awaken in 1 minute with 1 Hit Point. Scattering at least 1 Bulk of glutinous rice or hen eggs on an unconscious jiang-shi destroys them permanently. If the jiang-shi was reduced to 0 HP by an attack from a weapon made of duskwood, they're destroyed immediately.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Warped Fulu": {
              "name": "扭曲符箓 Warped Fulu",
              "description": "<p>僵尸已腐化了贴在其额头上的符箓。僵尸免疫由魔法物品施放且不消耗法术位的法术，例如卷轴或魔杖施放的法术。一名生物可以 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{偷窃} 该符箓以将其移除，并以僵尸的察觉 DC 为目标进行掷骰。这会立刻终止僵尸对这些效果的免疫。如果一名生物随后以一个交互动作摧毁被移除的符箓，僵尸也会失去其快速治疗能力。僵尸可以花费 1 小时不受打扰的时间，用书写工具在一条纸片（或类似物）上书写，从而制作一张替代符箓。</p>\n<p>The jiang-shi has corrupted the fulu attached to their brow. The jiang-shi is immune to spells cast from a magic item without expending a spell slot, such as from a scroll or wand. A creature can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{Steal} the fulu to remove it, rolling against the jiangshi's Perception DC. This immediately ends the jiang-shi's immunity to these effects. If a creature then destroys the removed fulu with an Interact action, the jiang-shi also loses their fast healing ability. A jiang-shi can create a replacement fulu by spending 1 uninterrupted hour inscribing a strip of paper (or similar) with a writing instrument.</p>"
            },
            "Drain Qi": {
              "name": "汲取气 Drain Qi",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 一个位于僵尸触及范围内的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}或自愿的生物</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 僵尸通过呼吸汲取受害者的生命能量，即气。若受害者处于受擒状态，则需要进行一次对抗受害者强韧DC的@Check[athletics|defense:fortitude]检定；若受害者处于其他任一上述状态，则自动成功。受害者获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{流失 1}状态，且僵尸回复@Damage[12[healing]] HP，并将任何溢出量转化为临时生命值。对已处于流失状态的生物汲取气不会为僵尸恢复任何HP，但会使受害者的流失（状态）数值增加1；当其达到流失5时，受害者死亡。若受害者具有施放气法术的能力，它可以花费1点聚能点以避免陷入流失状态。此举仅能防护当前这次攻击，无法防护后续尝试汲取气。</p>\n<p>受害者的流失（状态）数值每周降低1。若该生物将饮食限制为糯米至少1天，并在成功通过一次@Check[athletics|dc:25]检定后花费10分钟跳舞、慢跑或以其他方式进行剧烈的体能活动，则其流失（状态）降低1。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}, or willing creature is within the jiang-shi's reach</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The jiang-shi drains the victim's life energy, or qi, through their breath. This requires an @Check[athletics|defense:fortitude] check against the victim's Fortitude DC if the victim is grabbed and is automatic for any of the other conditions. The victim is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} and the jiang-shi regains @Damage[12[healing]] HP, gaining any excess as temporary Hit Points. Draining qi from a creature that's already drained doesn't restore any HP to the jiang-shi but increases the victim's drained condition value by 1, killing the victim when it reaches drained 5. If the victim has the ability to cast ki spells, it can spend 1 Focus Point to avoid becoming drained. This protects it only from the current attack, not from subsequent attempts to Drain Qi.</p>\n<p>A victim's drained condition value decreases by 1 every week. If the creature restricts their diet to glutinous rice for at least 1 day and spends 10 minutes dancing, jogging, or otherwise engaging in vigorous physical activity by succeeding at a @Check[athletics|dc:25] check, it reduces its drained condition by 1.</p>"
            },
            "Rigor Mortis": {
              "name": "尸僵 Rigor Mortis",
              "description": "<p>僵尸无视困难地形，以及会使其陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地} 的效果。僵尸无法采取 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HYNhdaPtF1QmQbR3]{卧倒} 动作。当其进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{跳跃} 时，不会触发通常由移动动作触发的反应动作，例如借机攻击。</p>\n<p>The jiang-shi ignores difficult terrain and effects that would render them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. A jiang-shi can't take the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HYNhdaPtF1QmQbR3]{Drop Prone} action. When they @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{Leap} they don't trigger reactions that are normally triggered by move actions, such as Attacks of Opportunity.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>僵尸是来自天夏、令人恐惧的跳跃吸血鬼（特征）。它们与其他吸血鬼（特征）相似——它们是不死，会从活者身上汲取生命能量，并且只能用特定方式杀死——但僵尸并不啜饮鲜血，而是以活者的呼吸为食，也称为气或ki。它们拥有独特的力量，包括能偏转魔法的纸符箓、惊人的跳跃能力，以及对阳光的免疫；同时，僵尸也有独特的弱点，例如除非借由呼吸感知否则无法看见活的生物、对铃铛与镜子的厌恶，以及几近令人神智麻痹的忧郁。幸好，大多数僵尸无法制造吸血鬼（特征）衍生物。</p>\n<p>被粗暴地从噩梦般的沉眠中惊醒后，这种地方僵尸会在其领地周边的村落与墓地间游荡，寻找果腹之物以平息饥渴。</p>\n<p>Jiang-shi are terrifying hopping vampires from Tian Xia. Though similar to other vampires—they are undead, drain vital energy from the living, and can be slain only in specific ways—jiang-shi feast upon the breath of the living, also known as qi or ki, instead of blood. While they possess unique powers, including their magic-deflecting paper fulus, extraordinary jumping ability, and immunity to sunlight, jiang-shi also possess unique vulnerabilities, such as the inability to see living creatures save through breathsense, a revulsion to bells and mirrors, and near-stupefying melancholia. Thankfully, most jiang-shi can't create vampiric spawn.</p>\n<p>Roused rudely from their nightmarish slumber, the provincial jiang-shi roams the villages and graveyards around their domain searching for sustenance to slake their hunger.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性乡野僵尸\nFemale provincial jiang-shi",
          "hp": "fast healing 10, void healing, one more breath",
          "prototypeToken": "红玫瑰 Hong Meigui",
          "speed": "rigor mortis"
        },
        "Debris": {
          "name": "碎片 Debris",
          "tokenName": "碎片 Debris",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Moderate)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（中等） Healing Potion (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶红宝石般的深红液体，当饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时，会带来一种刺痛的感觉。当你喝下<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Healer's Gloves": {
              "name": "医者手套 Healer's Gloves",
              "description": "<p>这副洁白的手套总是纤尘不染，即使你用它来缝合伤口或治疗其他病症，也从不显现血迹。它使你的医疗检定获得+1物品加值。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动—治疗者之触</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你可以安抚一名自愿的、活着的、相邻的生物的伤口，使该生物恢复 @Damage[(2d6+7)[vitality,healing]|shortLabel:true] 生命值。这是一个治疗的活力效果。你无法用这次治疗来伤害不死。</p>\n<p>These clean, white gloves never show signs of blood, even when used to stitch up wounds or treat other ailments. They give you a +1 item bonus to Medicine checks.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Healer's Touch</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You can soothe the wounds of a willing, living, adjacent creature, restoring @Damage[(2d6+7)[vitality,healing]|shortLabel:true] Hit Points to that creature. This is a healing vitality effect. You can't harm undead with this healing.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "碎片 Debris"
        },
        "Lady Ren's Ring": {
          "name": "任女士之戒 Lady Ren's Ring",
          "tokenName": "任女士的戒指 Lady Ren's Ring",
          "items": {
            "Messenger's Ring": {
              "name": "信使戒指 Messenger's Ring",
              "description": "<p>这枚银质印戒会变化以匹配你所效忠的领主或组织的徽记（若你不效忠任何他人，则会变成你自己的脸）。它使你在交涉检定中获得+2物品加值，并让你能以奥术先天法术随意施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ]{Message}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动—派遣信使</strong> 1分钟（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 这枚戒指会依照你的指示施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yhz9fF69uwRhnHix]{Animal Messenger}。该动物是从戒指中跃出的魔法生物，其外观会契合这枚戒指所代表之领主或组织的图像符号或纹章。</p>\n<p>This silver signet ring changes to match the insignia of a lord or organization you serve (or your own face, if you serve no one else). It grants you a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks and lets you cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ]{Message} as an arcane innate spell at will.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Dispatch Messenger</strong> 1 minute (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ring casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yhz9fF69uwRhnHix]{Animal Messenger} to your specification. The animal is a magical creature that springs from the ring, and its appearance suits the iconography or heraldry of the lord or organization represented by the ring.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "任女士的戒指 Lady Ren's Ring"
        },
        "Summoning Rune": {
          "name": "召唤符文 Summoning Rune",
          "tokenName": "召唤符文 Summoning Rune",
          "items": {
            "Summon Monster": {
              "name": "召唤怪物 Summon Monster",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一个生物进入魔法感应器的云雾</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 此陷阱会召唤一个特定的1级生物，在制造陷阱时决定该生物。该生物掷先攻，并持续存在[[/br 2d6 #rounds]]{2d6轮}，之后法术结束，该生物消失。若在持续时间结束前有人解除该陷阱，该召唤出的生物也会消失。与大多数被召唤生物不同，该被召唤生物每轮可以使用3个动作，并且可以使用反应动作。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature enters the cloud of magical sensors</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> This trap summons a specific 1st-level creature, determined when the trap is created. The creature rolls initiative and remains for [[/br 2d6 #rounds]]{2d6 rounds}, after which the spell ends and the creature disappears. The creature also disappears if someone disables the trap before the duration expires. The summoned creature can use 3 actions each round and can use reactions, unlike most summoned creatures.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[acrobatics|dc:15|name:接近符文] 以在不触发陷阱的情况下接近，随后进行 @Check[thievery|dc:17|name:抹除符文|traits:action:disable-a-device]（受训）以抹除符文，或使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{解除魔法}（1环；反制DC 15）以反制该符文</p>\n<p>@Check[acrobatics|dc:15|name:Approach Rune] to approach without triggering the trap followed by @Check[thievery|dc:17|name:Erase Rune|traits:action:disable-a-device] (trained) to erase the rune, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic} (1st rank; counteract DC 15) to counteract the rune</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一团半径10英尺的隐形魔法感应器云笼罩着一面隐形墙壁或地板符文，其大小相当于将被召唤的生物。</p>\n<p>A cloud of invisible magical sensors in a 10-foot radius surrounds an invisible wall or floor rune the size of the creature to be summoned.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>该陷阱每天在黎明时重置。</p>\n<p>The trap resets each day at dawn.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（受训）</p>\n<p>(trained)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "召唤符文 Summoning Rune"
        },
        "Bundle-Cutting Reward": {
          "name": "割草绳奖励 Bundle-Cutting Reward",
          "tokenName": "割草绳奖励 Bundle-Cutting Reward",
          "items": {
            "Striking": {
              "name": "强击 Striking",
              "description": "<p><em>强击</em>符文将破坏性的魔法储存在武器中，将该武器造成的武器伤害骰从1个增加到2个。例如，一把<em>+1强击匕首</em>会造成2d4伤害，而不是1d4伤害。</p>\n<p>你可以将已经蚀刻在武器上的<em>强击</em>符文升级为更强的版本，将现有符文的数值提升为新符文的数值。你必须拥有更强符文的配方才能这么做，而升级的价格等于两枚符文价格之间的差额。</p>\n<p>A <em>striking</em> rune stores destructive magic in the weapon, increasing the weapon damage dice it deals to two instead of one. For instance, a <em>+1 striking dagger</em> would deal 2d4 damage instead of 1d4 damage.</p>\n<p>You can upgrade the <em>striking</em> rune already etched on a weapon to a stronger version, increasing the values of the existing rune to those of the new rune. You must have the formula of the stronger rune to do so, and the Price of the upgrade is the difference between the two runes' Prices.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Touch": {
              "name": "幽冥 Ghost Touch",
              "description": "<p>刻有此符文的武器能够伤害没有实体形态的生物。<em>幽冥</em>武器对虚体生物尤其有效，而虚体生物几乎总是对<em>幽冥</em>武器具有特定的弱点。</p>\n<p>虚体生物能够接触、持握并挥舞<em>幽冥</em>武器（不同于大多数实体物体）。</p>\n<p>A weapon etched with this rune can harm creatures without physical form. A <em>ghost touch</em> weapon is particularly effective against incorporeal creatures, which almost always have a specific vulnerability to <em>ghost touch</em> weapons.</p>\n<p>Incorporeal creatures can touch, hold, and wield <em>ghost touch</em> weapons (unlike most physical objects).</p>"
            }
          },
          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-TDiNc0OJ9jzxSvoQ\" class=\"secret\"><p>胜者从中选择一项。</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-TDiNc0OJ9jzxSvoQ\" class=\"secret\"><p>The victor chooses one of these.</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "割草绳奖励 Bundle-Cutting Reward"
        },
        "Front Porch": {
          "name": "前廊 Front Porch",
          "tokenName": "前廊 Front Porch",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Moderate)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（中等） Healing Potion (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶红宝石般的红色液体，在饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时会带来刺痒般的感觉。你饮用一瓶<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "前廊 Front Porch"
        },
        "Hu Ban-Niang": {
          "name": "胡板娘 Hu Ban-Niang",
          "tokenName": "胡板娘 Hu Ban-Niang",
          "items": {
            "Longsword": {
              "name": "长剑 Longsword"
            },
            "Spider Lily Tattoo": {
              "name": "彼岸花刺青 Spider Lily Tattoo",
              "description": "<p>彼岸花刺青标记你是胡太婆人脉网络中受信任的一员。这道猩红刺青在刺上后的1天内会褪色并变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}，只会在你启动它、你获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭（状态）}，或你死亡时重新显现。毁灭值越高，颜色就越鲜艳。</p>\n<p>如果你的刺青清晰可见，你在对所有能看到刺青的生物进行威吓检定时获得+1物品加值，但你在对那些理解彼岸花刺青真实含义的人（包括柳岸镇的所有居民）进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{建立印象}的交涉检定时承受–1物品减值。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 幻想（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你的刺青当前不可见</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你使刺青变为可见。你可以再次使用此启动使刺青变为不可见，除非你具有毁灭（状态）。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> 幻想（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名不死生物首次侦测到你，且你知晓该不死生物</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 彼岸花刺青操纵你的生命力，使你在短时间内看起来像是不死。针对触发的不死生物的察觉DC进行一次@Check[deception|defense:perception]检定。成功时，触发的不死生物相信你也是不死——无心智的不死很可能会无视你，而有智力的不死则可能以好奇或困惑作出反应。你可以在之后每个回合以单动作继续尝试欺瞒检定，以维持该效果，最长持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>The spider lily tattoo marks you as a trusted member of Granny Hu's network. This crimson tattoo fades and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} within a day of being applied, reappearing only when you Activate it, when you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed} condition, or when you die. The higher the doomed value, the more vivid the color.</p>\n<p>If your tattoo is plainly visible, you gain a +1 item bonus to Intimidation checks against all creatures that can see the tattoo, but you take a –1 item penalty to Diplomacy checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression} on those who understand the actual meaning of the spider lily tattoo (including all of Willowshore's citizens).</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> envision (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your tattoo isn't currently visible</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You make the tattoo visible. You can use this activation again to make the tattoo not visible, unless you have the doomed condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> envision (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An undead creature detects you for the first time, and you're aware of the undead creature</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The spider lily tattoo manipulates your life force to make you appear to be undead for a short time. Attempt a @Check[deception|defense:perception] check against the triggering undead creature's Perception DC. On a success, the triggering undead believes you're undead as well—a mindless undead is likely to ignore you, while a sapient undead might react with curiosity or confusion. You can continue attempting Deception checks each round as a single action to Sustain the effect for up to 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Smoking Pipe": {
              "name": "烟斗 Smoking Pipe"
            },
            "So Have You Heard?": {
              "name": "你听说了没？ So Have You Heard?",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 胡太婆可以在 2 小时的工作过程中改变一名 PC 在柳岸镇的名声。她进行一次欺瞒检定，对抗目标的 @Check[deception|defense:deception]{欺瞒}、@Check[deception|defense:diplomacy]{交涉} 或 @Check[deception|defense:intimidation]{威吓} DC（三者取最高者）。如果目标在柳岸镇至少被一个派系所钦佩或尊敬，胡太婆的检定承受 –1 状态减值；若目标被两个派系都钦佩或尊敬，则承受 –2 状态减值。随后，目标对你听说了没？在 1 周内暂时免疫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标在与柳岸镇居民互动时，所有基于魅力的技能检定承受 –2 环境减值，持续 1 周。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功，但只有 –1 环境减值，且仅持续 1 天。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 计划适得其反；目标不仅不受影响，而且胡太婆在 1 个月内无法使用你听说了没？。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Granny Hu can shift a PC's reputation in Willowshore over the course of 2 hours of work. She attempts a Deception check against the target's @Check[deception|defense:deception]{Deception}, @Check[deception|defense:diplomacy]{Diplomacy}, or @Check[deception|defense:intimidation]{Intimidation} DC, whichever is highest. If the target is admired or revered by at least one faction in Willowshore, Granny Hu takes a –1 status penalty to her check, or –2 if the target is admired or revered by both factions. The target is then temporarily immune to So Have You Heard? for 1 week.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes a –2 circumstance penalty to Charisma-based skill checks when interacting with Willowshore residents for a week.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but only a –1 circumstance penalty and for only 1 day.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The plan backfires; not only is the target unaffected, but Granny Hu can't use So Have You Heard? for 1 month.</p>"
            },
            "Are You Sure About That?": {
              "name": "你确定要这样？ Are You Sure About That?",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 30英尺内一个胡太婆可见、且在过去一周内曾受“真要试试看？”影响的生物，说了或做了某些违背胡太婆利益的事</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 胡太婆做出一个微妙的手势，提醒触发生物他们的秘密。该生物必须在一次 @Check[will|dc:22] 豁免中成功，否则触发的动作会被打断。无论结果如何，该生物随后在24小时内暂时免疫此能力。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet who's visible to Granny Hu and who has been exposed to Want to Try Me? in the past week says or does something that would be against Granny Hu's interests</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Granny Hu makes a subtle gesture, reminding the triggering creature of their secret. The creature must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:22] Save or the triggering action is disrupted. Regardless of the outcome, the creature then becomes temporarily immune to this ability for 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Nerves of Steel": {
              "name": "钢铁意志 Nerves of Steel",
              "description": "<p>若胡太婆在对抗恐惧术效果的豁免中成功，则改为大成功或大失败。</p>\n<p>If Granny Hu succeeds at a save against a fear effect, she gets a critical success instead.</p>"
            },
            "Want to Try Me?": {
              "name": "真要试试看？ Want to Try Me?",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 30尺内的一个生物尝试对一个生物使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.tHCqgwjtQtzNqVvd]{胁迫}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{挫败士气}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 胡太婆威胁要揭露触发生物的一个秘密。她进行一次@Check[intimidation|defense:will]检定，对抗触发生物的意志DC。她的名声意味着即使她实际上并不知道秘密，她也能威胁一名PC；但如果她确实知道一个尤其危险或羞耻的秘密，她的威吓检定获得+2环境加值。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}，且其胁迫或挫败士气尝试的结果降低一个成功等级。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同成功，但改为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响，其胁迫或挫败士气尝试获得+1环境加值，并在24小时内免疫真要试试看？。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.tHCqgwjtQtzNqVvd]{Coerce} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} a creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Granny Hu threatens to expose a secret of the triggering creature. She attempts an @Check[intimidation|defense:will] check against the triggering creature's Will DC. Her reputation means she can threaten a PC even if she doesn't actually know a secret, but if she does know an especially dangerous or shameful one, she gains a +2 circumstance bonus to her Intimidation check.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}, and the result of their Coerce or Demoralize attempt is reduced by one degree of success.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is unaffected, gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their Coerce or Demoralize attempt, and is immune to Want to Try Me? for 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Willowshore Lore": {
              "name": "柳岸镇学识 Willowshore Lore"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "女性人类卫兵队长\nFemale human guard captain",
          "allSaves": "+1 status vs. fear, nerves of steel",
          "prototypeToken": "胡板娘 Hu Ban-Niang"
        },
        "Ugly Cute": {
          "name": "丑小乖 Ugly Cute",
          "tokenName": "丑小乖 Ugly Cute",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Dream Message": {
              "name": "托梦术 Dream Message",
              "description": "<p>你将一段信息送入目标的梦境。信息为单向传递，至多为 1 分钟的讲话（约 150 个词）。如果目标正在睡觉，他们会立刻收到信息；如果没有，他们会在下次睡觉时收到信息。一旦他们收到信息，法术便会结束，而你会知道信息已送出。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 你可以以最多 10 个你知道姓名且曾亲自见过的生物为目标。你必须向他们全部发送相同的信息；对每个生物而言，法术会分别结束。</p>\n<p>You send a message to your target's dream. The message is one-way, up to 1 minute of speech (roughly 150 words). If the target is asleep, they receive the message instantly. If not, they receive it the next time they sleep. As soon as they receive it, the spell ends, and you know the message was sent.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures you know by name and have met in person. You must send the same message to all of them; the spell ends for each creature individually.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Alignment (At Will, Evil Only)": {
              "name": "侦测阵营（随意，限邪恶） Detect Alignment (At Will, Evil Only)",
              "description": "<p>你的双眼发光，你感知到同阵营的灵光。选择混乱、邪恶、善良或守序。你侦测到该阵营的灵光。你不会获得超出“存在或不存在”之外的任何信息。你可以选择不侦测你已知具有该阵营的生物或效果。</p>\n<p>只有6级或更高的生物——除非是神圣施法者、不死或来自外环的存在——才具有阵营灵光。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 你得知每道灵光的位置与强度。</p>\n<p>Your eyes glow as you sense aligned auras. Choose chaotic, evil, good, or lawful. You detect auras of that alignment. You receive no information beyond presence or absence. You can choose not to detect creatures or effects you're aware have that alignment.</p>\n<p>Only creatures of 6th level or higher-unless divine spellcasters, undead, or beings from the Outer Sphere-have alignment auras.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You learn each aura's location and strength.</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Web": {
              "name": "魂魄蛛网术 Spirit Web"
            },
            "Telepathy 60 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 60 尺 Telepathy 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Anchored Soul": {
              "name": "锚定灵魂 Anchored Soul",
              "description": "<p>石蜘蛛与某个特定的聚居地相连结，并且必须停留在距该聚居地边界 10 英里以内。</p>\n<p>The stone spider is bonded to a specific settlement and must remain within 10 miles of the settlement's border.</p>"
            },
            "Bonded Vessel": {
              "name": "绑定容器 Bonded Vessel",
              "description": "<p>石蜘蛛容器的状态决定其最大HP。未受损时，容器是一个具有62 HP（BT 31）的物体。当石蜘蛛处于魂魄形态时，伤害它不会伤到容器，但对容器造成伤害会对石蜘蛛造成等量的伤害。当石蜘蛛栖居其容器时，它们是同一个目标，伤害会同时降低石蜘蛛与容器的HP。若容器处于破损状态，石蜘蛛在栖居其中时仍可战斗且不会遭受不良效果；但一旦容器被摧毁，石蜘蛛会立即被杀死，且无法重新构成。</p>\n<p>The condition of a stone spider's vessel dictates its maximum HP. Undamaged, the vessel is an object with 62 HP (BT 31). When the stone spider is in spirit form, damaging it doesn't hurt the vessel, but damaging the vessel deals an equal amount of damage to the stone spider. When the stone spider Inhabits its Vessel, they're a single target, and damage reduces the HP of both the stone spider and the vessel. If the vessel is broken, the stone spider can still fight while inhabiting it and suffers no ill effect, but if the vessel is ever destroyed, the stone spider is instantly slain and can't reconstitute.</p>"
            },
            "Reconstitution": {
              "name": "重构 Reconstitution",
              "description": "<p>当石蜘蛛的生命值降至 0 时，它的魂魄消散。若其绑定容器完好无损，石蜘蛛会在 [[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4 天} 后于该容器中重新形成，并完全痊愈。若该容器已破损，则必须先进行修理，之后石蜘蛛会在 [[/gmr 3d4 #days]]{3d4 天} 后重新形成。</p>\n<p>When the stone spider reaches 0 Hit Points, its spirit dissipates. If its bonded vessel is intact, the stone spider re-forms in this vessel after [[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days}, fully healed. If the vessel is broken, it must first be Repaired, after which the stone spider re-forms in [[/gmr 3d4 #days]]{3d4 days}.</p>"
            },
            "Inhabit Vessel": {
              "name": "栖身容器 Inhabit Vessel",
              "description": "<p>蜘蛛触碰并融入其绑定容器，使其获得生命。它可以花费一个具有专注（特征）的单动作来停止栖居其容器。当栖居于容器内时，它失去飞行速度并获得</p>\n<p><strong>免疫</strong> 治疗，非致命</p>\n<p><strong>抗力</strong> 物理 6（钝击除外）</p>\n<p><strong>速度</strong> 25 尺，攀爬 25 尺</p>\n<p>以及以下打击。</p><ul><li><strong>近战</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 石质獠牙 +14（灵巧），<strong>伤害</strong> 2d8+7 穿刺</li></ul>\n<p>The spider touches and melds with its bonded vessel, bringing it to life. It can cease Inhabiting its Vessel by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While Inhabiting the Vessel, it loses its fly Speed and gains</p>\n<p><strong>Immunities</strong> healing, nonlethal</p>\n<p><strong>Resistances</strong> physical 6 (except bludgeoning)</p>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet, climb 25 feet</p>\n<p>and the following Strike.</p><ul><li><strong>Melee</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> stone fangs +14 (finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 2d8+7 piercing</li></ul>"
            },
            "Spirit Body": {
              "name": "魂魄躯体 Spirit Body",
              "description": "<p>当它未寄宿于其容器时，石蜘蛛为虚体，并获得对所有伤害的抗力6（除力场伤害与<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}</em>外；对非魔法的伤害抗力加倍）。</p>\n<p>When not Inhabiting its Vessel, the stone spider is incorporeal and gains resistance 6 to all damage (except force damage and <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}</em>; double resistance against non-magical).</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Web Trap": {
              "name": "精魂网缚 Spirit Web Trap",
              "description": "<p>被石蜘蛛的蛛网术攻击命中的生物会处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足} 状态，并被黏在最近的表面上，直到其 [[/act escape dc=22]]{逃脱}。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by the stone spider's web attack is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and stuck to the nearest surface until it [[/act escape dc=22]]{Escapes}.</p>"
            },
            "Settlement Lore (Regarding their Home Settlement)": {
              "name": "聚落传说（关于他们的家乡聚落） Settlement Lore (Regarding their Home Settlement)"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>将蜘蛛奉为用以抵御害虫、虫害以及一般邪祟的护的根源，远早于近代络新妇的统治时代；石蜘蛛所扮演的角色与石狮相近。石蜘蛛守护兽常见于城镇与村庄入口附近的基座上方静伏不动——在某些情况下甚至一动不动持续数代——以至于许多当地人早已忘了他们的本地守护者并非只是装饰品。</p>\n<p>The tradition of venerating spiders as wards against vermin, pests, and evil in general far predates the modern jorogumo rule, with stone spiders filling a role similar to stone lions. Stone spider guardian beasts can be found perched on plinths near town and village entrances, standing motionless—for generations in some cases—so that many locals have forgotten their local guardian is anything more than a decoration.</p>",
          "blurb": "无性别石蜘蛛\nAgender Stone Spider",
          "prototypeToken": "丑小乖 Ugly Cute"
        },
        "Cabinets": {
          "name": "橱柜 Cabinets",
          "tokenName": "橱柜 Cabinets",
          "items": {
            "Supplies for Brewing Magical Tea": {
              "name": "冲泡魔法茶所需的补给品 Supplies for Brewing Magical Tea"
            },
            "Well-seasoned Cast Iron Wok": {
              "name": "调味良好的铸铁炒锅 Well-seasoned Cast Iron Wok",
              "description": "<p>在用于烹饪餐食的制作检定中，其功能等同于一套专家级工匠工具。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你需要这些工具才能用制作技能将原材料制成物品。专家级工匠工具会使该检定获得+1物品加值。</p>\n<p>进行不同的工作需要不同的工具套装，由GM决定；例如，铁匠的工具包与木工的工具包不同。如果你穿戴着你的工匠工具包，你可以将其作为使用它的动作的一部分抽出并收起。</p>\n<p>Functions as a sterling artisan’s tool for Crafting checks to cook meals.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You need these tools to create items from raw materials with the Craft skill. Sterling artisan's tools give you a +1 item bonus to the check.</p>\n<p>Different sets are needed for different work, as determined by the GM; for example, a blacksmith's toolkit differs from a woodworker's toolkit. If you wear your artisan's toolkit, you can draw and replace it as part of the action that uses it.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "橱柜 Cabinets"
        },
        "Iogaka": {
          "name": "伊奥加卡 Iogaka",
          "tokenName": "伊欧加卡 Iogaka",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Coven Spells": {
              "name": "女巫团法术 Coven Spells"
            },
            "Control Weather": {
              "name": "控制天气 Control Weather",
              "description": "<p>你改变天气，使其平静并符合当季的正常状况，或根据季节选择至多两种效果。</p>\n<p>你无法精确控制具体的显现方式，例如龙卷风的确切路径或闪电打击的目标。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>秋季</strong> 寒冷天气、浓雾、温和炎热、雨夹雪</li>\n<li><strong>春季</strong> 毛毛雨、炎热、飓风、雨夹雪、雷暴、龙卷风</li>\n<li><strong>夏季</strong> 毛毛雨、暴雨、极端炎热、冰雹、炎热</li>\n<li><strong>冬季</strong> 暴风雪、温和寒冷、极端寒冷、解冻</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你如愿改变天气，并且可以影响更大的区域（半径至多5英里的圆形），或更长的持续时间（任意数量的额外d12小时，最多16d12）。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你如愿改变天气。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你未能如愿改变天气。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 天气以出乎意料的方式改变，由GM决定，但通常会尽可能与你真正的愿望相矛盾（例如，当你希望好天气时却出现一场可怕的风暴）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 你可以制造反季节的天气与相互矛盾的天气效果，例如极端寒冷与飓风。你可以让天气变为另一季节的平静且正常的天气，或从任意季节的列表中选择天气效果。</p>\n<p>You alter the weather, making it calm and normal for the season or choosing up to two effects based on the season.</p>\n<p>You can't specifically control the manifestations, such as the exact path of a tornado or the targets of lightning strikes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Autumn</strong> cold weather, fog, mild heat, sleet</li>\n<li><strong>Spring</strong> drizzle, heat, hurricane, sleet, thunderstorm, tornado</li>\n<li><strong>Summer</strong> drizzle, downpour, extreme heat, hail, heat</li>\n<li><strong>Winter</strong> blizzard, mild cold, extreme cold, thaw</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You change the weather as desired and can affect a larger area (up to a 5-mile-radius circle), or a longer duration (any number of additional d12 hours, up to 16d12).</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You change the weather as desired.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to change the weather as desired.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The weather changes in an unanticipated way, determined by the GM but generally as contradictory to your true desires as possible (for instance, a terrible storm emerges when you would prefer good weather).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You can create unseasonable weather and contradictory weather effects, such as extreme cold and a hurricane. You can make the weather calm and normal weather for a different season or choose weather effects from any season's list.</p>"
            },
            "Baleful Polymorph": {
              "name": "凶恶变形术 Baleful Polymorph",
              "description": "<p>你将目标生物变形为一种适合该区域的无害动物，其效果取决于其强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标的身体获得该无害动物的一些轻微特征。其内脏在部分变形时翻搅，使其陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心（状态） 1}。当其从恶心（状态）中恢复时，这些特征恢复正常。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标变形 1 分钟，但保留其心智。若它在其回合内将其所有动作都用于专注于其原本形态，它可以尝试一次意志豁免以立即结束该效果。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标在身体与心智上都变为所选的无害动物，持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You transform the target creature into a harmless animal appropriate to the area, with effects based on its Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's body gains minor features of the harmless animal. Its insides churn as they partially transform, causing it to be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. When it recovers from the Sickened condition, its features revert to normal.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target transforms for 1 minute but keeps its mind. If it spends all its actions on its turn concentrating on its original form, it can attempt a Will save to end the effect immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is transformed into the chosen harmless animal, body and mind, for an unlimited duration.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Scene": {
              "name": "幻象场景 Illusory Scene",
              "description": "<p>你塑造一个虚构的场景，其中包含至多10个彼此独立的生物或物体，体型各异，且都必须位于该法术的区域内。这些元素会产生恰当的声音与气味，并且触感真实。幻象场景的元素无法说话。与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature}法术不同，你场景中的生物不具备战斗能力与数据。你的场景不包含对其周围环境的改变，不过你可以将你的场景置于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage}法术的幻觉环境之中。</p>\n<p>当你创造该场景时，你可以选择让其静止或遵循一个程序。尽管静止场景是固定不动的，但它包含基本的自然移动。例如，风吹过一张幻象纸张会让它沙沙作响。一个程序最长可达1分钟，并在结束后重复。比如，你可以创造两个兽人互相战斗的场景，而这场战斗在每次重复时都会以同样的方式进行。如果你创造一个循环，这两名战士会在场景开始与结束时回到同一位置，但你可以润饰该程序，使人难以分辨循环何时结束、何时开始。任何观察该场景超过几分钟的人几乎总会注意到它在循环。你在创造幻象后无法更改该程序。</p>\n<p>任何生物只要接触影像的任何部分，或使用搜索动作对其进行检查，便可尝试识破你的幻象。若他们与幻象的一部分进行交互，他们只会识破该部分。只有在大成功或大失败时，他们才会识破整个场景。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你场景中的生物或物体可以说话。你在创建程序时必须为每个角色说出其特定台词。该法术会为每个角色伪装你的声音。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 如同6环版本，且持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You form an imaginary scene that includes up to 10 discrete creatures or objects of various sizes, all of which must be within the spell's area. These elements generate appropriate sounds and smells, and they feel right to the touch. Elements of an illusory scene are incapable of speech. Unlike with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature} spell, creatures in your scene lack combat abilities and statistics. Your scene doesn't include changes to the environment around it, though you can place your scene within the illusory environment of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage} spell.</p>\n<p>When you create the scene, you can choose to have it be static or follow a program. Though a static scene is stationary, it includes basic natural movement. For example, wind blowing on an illusory piece of paper would rustle it. A program can be up to 1 minute long and repeats when finished. For instance, you could create a scene of two orcs fighting each other, and the fight would go the same way for each repetition. If you create a loop, the two fighters end up in the same place at the start of the scene and at the end of it, but you can smooth the program so it's hard to tell when the loop ends and begins. Anyone observing the scene for more than a few minutes almost always notices it looping. You're unable to alter the program after you create the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches any part of the image or uses the Seek action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. If they interact with a portion of the illusion, they disbelieve only that portion. They disbelieve the entire scene only on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Creatures or objects in your scene can speak. You must speak the specific lines for each actor when creating your program. The spell disguises your voice for each actor.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As the 6th-rank version, and the duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Lightning Storm": {
              "name": "闪电风暴 Lightning Storm",
              "description": "<p>你创造一团黑色、轰鸣的暴风云，并在该法术的区域内召下一道闪电束。闪电束是一条从暴风云顶端垂直劈向下方地面的直线，对直线上的生物造成4d12点电击伤害（基础反射豁免）。在后续轮中，你每轮第一次维持该法术时，可以在该区域内再召下一道闪电束。若你在户外施放该法术，你可以创造两团互不重叠的云，而非一团，但你每回合仍只能召下一道闪电束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 每道闪电束的伤害增加1d12。</p>\n<p>You create a black, rumbling storm cloud and call down one lightning bolt within the spell's area. The bolt is a vertical line from the top of the storm cloud to the ground below, dealing 4d12 electricity damage to creatures in the line (basic Reflex save). On subsequent rounds, the first time you Sustain the Spell each round, you can call another lightning bolt within the area. If you Cast this Spell outdoors, you can create two non-overlapping clouds instead of one, though you can still call down only one bolt per turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage of each bolt increases by 1d12.</p>"
            },
            "Mariner's Curse": {
              "name": "水手的诅咒 Mariner's Curse",
              "description": "<p>你用翻涌而无情的海洋之诅咒折磨目标。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心（状态） 1}。将其恶心（状态）降低至0会结束该诅咒。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心（状态） 1}，且在诅咒持续期间，不能将其恶心（状态）降低至1以下。该诅咒可以通过移除诅咒或类似的魔法解除。每当目标处于恶心（状态），且在离岸至少1英里的水面上时，它也会变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心（状态） 2}。</p>\n<p>You afflict the target with the curse of the roiling, unforgiving sea. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. Reducing its Sickened condition to 0 ends the curse.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} and can't reduce its Sickened condition below 1 while the curse remains. The curse can be lifted by remove curse or similar magic. Whenever the target is Sickened and on the water at least a mile from shore, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>"
            },
            "Prying Eye": {
              "name": "窥视之眼 Prying Eye",
              "description": "<p>你在500英尺内你能看见的位置创造一只@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的、漂浮的眼睛，直径1英寸。它以你正常的视觉感官向各个方向观察，并持续将其所见传递给你。每轮你第一次维持该法术时，你可以选择将眼睛移动至多30英尺（仅看见眼睛前方的事物），或将其移动至多10英尺（看见其周围所有方向的一切）。眼睛离你能移动多远没有限制，但如果你与眼睛不再处于同一个位面，该法术会立刻结束。若你想用它进行察觉检定，你可以通过眼睛尝试进行搜索动作。对眼睛造成的任何伤害都会摧毁它并结束该法术。</p>\n<p>You create an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}, floating eye, 1 inch in diameter, at a location you can see within 500 feet. It sees in all directions with your normal visual senses and continuously transmits what it sees to you. The first time you Sustain the Spell each round, you can either move the eye up to 30 feet, seeing only things in front of the eye, or move it up to 10 feet, seeing everything in all directions around it. There is no limit to how far from you the eye can move, but the spell ends immediately if you and the eye ever cease to be on the same plane of existence. You can attempt Seek actions through the eye if you want to attempt Perception checks with it. Any damage dealt to the eye destroys it and ends the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Clairvoyance": {
              "name": "千里眼 Clairvoyance",
              "description": "<p>你在射程内的一个位置创造一只@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的漂浮眼（即使该位置在你的视觉线或效果线之外也可以）。这只眼睛无法移动，但你可以从该点像使用你正常的视觉感官一样向各个方向看见。</p>\n<p>You create an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} floating eye at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). The eye can't move, but you can see in all directions from that point as if using your normal visual senses.</p>"
            },
            "Hydraulic Torrent": {
              "name": "水流爆发 Hydraulic Torrent",
              "description": "<p>一道旋转的激流沿着一条直线显现，猛击路径上的生物与无人看管的物体，并可能将它们从你身边推开。该激流造成8d6钝击伤害。区域内的每个生物必须进行一次基础强韧豁免；无人看管的物体自动失败。失败的生物与物体还会被击退5英尺（大失败则击退10英尺）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>A swirling torrent of water manifests along a straight line, battering creatures and unattended objects in its path and possibly pushing them away from you. The torrent deals 8d6 bludgeoning damage. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic Fortitude save; unattended objects automatically fail. Creatures and objects that fail are also knocked back 5 feet (10 feet on a critical failure).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其开口回答你提出的三个问题。此法术唤起的是肉体所潜藏的记忆，而非召回死者的魂魄，因此尸体必须大体完整，法术才能生效。尸体受到的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越支离破碎，而且它必须有喉咙与嘴才能说话。若在过去一周内有人曾对这具尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以使用其死亡时原本生物的属性数据进行一次意志豁免，以抗拒回答问题，效果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄会作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实作答，但它的回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你或试图拖延，使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且较少重复，尽管仍然晦涩。它在进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Clairaudience": {
              "name": "千里耳闻 Clairaudience",
              "description": "<p>你在射程内的某个位置创造一只@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的漂浮耳朵（即使它在你的视觉线或效果线之外）。它无法移动，但你可以通过这只耳朵听到声音，如同使用你正常的听觉感官一样。</p>\n<p>You create an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} floating ear at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). It can't move, but you can hear through the ear as if using your normal auditory senses.</p>"
            },
            "Dream Message": {
              "name": "托梦术 Dream Message",
              "description": "<p>你将一段讯息送入目标的梦境。该讯息为单向传递，最多可包含 1 分钟的言语（约 150 个词）。若目标正在睡眠中，他们会立刻收到讯息；若不在睡眠中，则会在其下次睡眠时收到。目标一收到讯息，法术即结束，而你也会知道讯息已送达。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>你可以以最多 10 个你知道其姓名且曾亲自见过的生物为目标。你必须对他们全部发送相同的讯息；对每个生物而言，法术会分别结束。</p>\n<p>You send a message to your target's dream. The message is one-way, up to 1 minute of speech (roughly 150 words). If the target is asleep, they receive the message instantly. If not, they receive it the next time they sleep. As soon as they receive it, the spell ends, and you know the message was sent.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures you know by name and have met in person. You must send the same message to all of them; the spell ends for each creature individually.</p>"
            },
            "Lightning Bolt": {
              "name": "闪电束 Lightning Bolt",
              "description": "<p>一道闪电从你手中向外射出，造成4d12点电击伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d12。</p>\n<p>A bolt of lightning strikes outward from your hand, dealing 4d12 electricity damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
            },
            "Wall of Wind": {
              "name": "风墙 Wall of Wind",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一道呼啸的狂风屏障，阻碍任何试图穿过它的事物。旋卷风墙厚5英尺、长60英尺、高30英尺。风墙竖直矗立，但你可以塑造其延伸路径。尽管风墙会扭曲空气，它不会妨碍视线。风墙具有以下效果。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>来自实体远程攻击的弹药——如箭矢、弩矢、投石索弹丸，以及其他体型相近的物体——无法穿过风墙。若更大的远程武器（如标枪）的道穿过风墙，其攻击掷骰承受-2环境减值。巨型远程武器以及不会创造实体物体的法术效果可无减值穿过风墙。</li>\n<li>对试图经由地面穿越风墙的生物而言，风墙视为困难地形。气体（包括处于气态形态的生物）无法穿过风墙。</li>\n<li>生物若试图以一个移动动作飞行穿过风墙，必须进行一次强韧豁免。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物本回合可以正常穿过风墙移动。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该飞行生物本回合可以穿过风墙移动，但风墙视为困难地形。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 风墙阻止该飞行生物的移动，其当前动作中任何剩余移动都会被浪费。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物被推离风墙10英尺。</p>\n<p>You create a barrier of gusting winds that hinders anything moving through it. The wall of swirling winds is 5 feet thick, 60 feet long, and 30 feet high. The wall stands vertically, but you can shape its path. Though the wall of wind distorts the air, it does not hamper sight. The wall has the following effects.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ammunition from physical ranged attacks-such as arrows, bolts, sling bullets, and other objects of similar size-can't pass through the wall. Attacks with bigger ranged weapons, such as javelins, take a -2 circumstance penalty to their attack rolls if their paths pass through the wall. Massive ranged weapons and spell effects that don't create physical objects pass through the wall with no penalty.</li>\n<li>The wall is difficult terrain to creatures attempting to move overland through it. Gases, including creatures in gaseous form, can't pass through the wall.</li>\n<li>A creature that attempts to fly through the wall using a move action must attempt a Fortitude save.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature can move through the wall normally this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The flying creature can move through the wall this turn, but the wall is difficult terrain.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The wall stops the movement of the flying creature, and any remaining movement from its current action is wasted.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is pushed 10 feet away from the wall.</p>"
            },
            "Augury": {
              "name": "占卜 Augury",
              "description": "<p>你获得对未来的模糊一瞥。在施放该法术期间，询问某一特定行动方案的结果。该法术最多可预测未来30分钟内的结果，并揭示GM在以下结果中作出的最佳判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吉</strong> 结果会很好。</li>\n<li><strong>凶</strong> 结果会很糟。</li>\n<li><strong>吉</strong>与凶 结果将好坏参半。</li>\n<li><strong>无</strong> 不会有特别好或特别坏的结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GM进行一次秘密的 @Check[flat|dc:6|traits:secret]。在一次失败时，结果恒为“无”。这使得无法判断“无”的结果是否准确。如果在额外一次施放卜筮时，有人询问与第一次施放卜筮相同的主题，GM使用第一次施放的秘密掷骰结果。不过，如果情况发生变化，则有可能得到不同的结果。</p>\n<p>You gain a vague glimpse of the future. During the casting of this spell, ask about the results of a particular course of action. The spell can predict results up to 30 minutes into the future and reveals the GM's best guess among the following outcomes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Weal</strong> The results will be good.</li>\n<li><strong>Woe</strong> The results will be bad.</li>\n<li><strong>Weal</strong> and Woe The results will be a mix of good and bad.</li>\n<li><strong>Nothing</strong> There won't be particularly good or bad results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The GM rolls a secret @Check[flat|dc:6|traits:secret]. On a failure, the result is always \"nothing.\" This makes it impossible to tell whether a \"nothing\" result is accurate. If anyone asks about the same topic as the first casting of augury during an additional casting, the GM uses the secret roll result from the first casting. If circumstances change, though, it's possible to get a different result.</p>"
            },
            "Obscuring Mist": {
              "name": "朦胧迷雾 Obscuring Mist",
              "description": "<p>你召唤出一团雾云。雾中所有生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽} 状态，而雾外所有生物对雾中的生物而言也变为隐蔽。你可以解消该云雾。</p>\n<p>You call forth a cloud of mist. All creatures within the mist become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all creatures outside the mist become Concealed to creatures within it. You can Dismiss the cloud.</p>"
            },
            "Charm": {
              "name": "魅惑术 Charm",
              "description": "<p>对目标而言，你的话语如蜜般甜美，你的容貌仿佛笼罩在梦幻般的薄雾中。它必须尝试一次意志豁免；如果你或你的盟友最近威胁过它或对它使用过敌对动作，则该豁免获得+4环境加值。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。若你对目标使用敌对动作，该法术结束。法术结束时，目标不一定会意识到自己曾被魅惑，除非它对你的友善关系或你说服它采取的动作与它的预期相冲突；这意味着你有可能通过世俗手段说服目标继续把你当作朋友。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并且知道你试图魅惑它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响，但会认为你的法术是某种无害的法术而非魅惑术，除非它识别出该法术。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{友善}。若它原本已为友善，则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{乐于帮助}。它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标对你的态度变为乐于帮助，并且它不能对你使用敌对动作。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间延续到你下次进行每日准备时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 持续时间延续到你下次进行每日准备时，且你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of charm, unless it identifies the spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v66R7FdOf11l94im]{Friendly} toward you. If it was Friendly, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful}. It can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's attitude becomes Helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Gust of Wind (At Will)": {
              "name": "风之疾风（随意） Gust of Wind (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>一阵猛烈的狂风从你的掌心喷涌而出，从你施放法术时所在的点吹向线形区域的另一端。风会熄灭小型的非魔法火焰，驱散浓雾与薄雾，吹动负载为轻或更轻的物体，并推动更大的物体。区域内大型或更小的生物必须尝试一次强韧豁免。之后进入这阵狂风的阵风中的大型或更小生物，在进入时也必须尝试该豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物无法逆风移动。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物被击倒 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。如果它正在飞行，则改为承受大失败的效果。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物沿风向被推开30尺，被击倒倒地，并受到2d6钝击伤害。</p>\n<p>A violent wind issues forth from your palm, blowing from the point where you are when you cast the spell to the line's opposite end. The wind extinguishes small non-magical fires, disperses fog and mist, blows objects of light Bulk or less around, and pushes larger objects. Large or smaller creatures in the area must attempt a Fortitude save. Large or smaller creatures that later move into the gust must attempt the save on entering.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can't move against the wind.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. If it was flying, it suffers the effects of critical failure instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is pushed 30 feet in the wind's direction, knocked Prone, and takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Disguise": {
              "name": "幻象伪装 Illusory Disguise",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一道幻术，使你看起来像另一只具有相同体型的生物，并且身高（相差不超过6英寸）与体重（相差不超过50磅）都与你大致相近。该伪装通常足以隐藏你的身份，但不足以假扮某个特定个体。该法术不会改变你的声音、气味或举止。你可以改变你的衣物与穿戴物品的外观，例如让你的护甲看起来像一件裙子。手持物品不受影响，而你移除的任何穿戴物品都会恢复其真实外观。</p>\n<p>施放幻象伪装视为为使用欺瞒进行的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{乔装} 做好伪装准备；它无视你因把自己伪装成不相似生物而可能承受的任何环境减值；它给予你+4状态加值加到欺瞒检定上，以防止他人看穿你的伪装，并且即使你未受训也能将你的等级加入其中。你可以解消该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong>该法术也会伪装你的声音与气味，并获得听觉与嗅觉（特征）特征。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以看起来像任何与你体型相同的生物，甚至是某个特定个体。你必须见过该个体，才能呈现其外貌。该法术也会伪装你的声音与气味，并获得听觉与嗅觉（特征）特征。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{法术效果：幻象伪装}</p>\n<p>You create an illusion that causes you to appear as another creature of the same body shape, and with roughly similar height (within 6 inches) and weight (within 50 pounds), as yourself. The disguise is typically good enough to hide your identity, but not to impersonate a specific individual. The spell doesn't change your voice, scent, or mannerisms. You can change the appearance of your clothing and worn items, such as making your armor look like a dress. Held items are unaffected, and any worn item you remove returns to its true appearance.</p>\n<p>Casting illusory disguise counts as setting up a disguise for the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{Impersonate} use of Deception; it ignores any circumstance penalties you might take for disguising yourself as a dissimilar creature, it gives you a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to prevent others from seeing through your disguise, and you add your level even if you're untrained. You can Dismiss this spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell also disguises your voice and scent, and it gains the auditory and olfactory traits.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can appear as any creature of the same size, even a specific individual. You must have seen an individual to take on their appearance. The spell also disguises your voice and scent, and it gains the auditory and olfactory traits.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{Spell Effect: Illusory Disguise}</p>"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Wind Blast": {
              "name": "风爆 Wind Blast"
            },
            "Coven": {
              "name": "密会 Coven",
              "description": "<p>岚鬼婆将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Y3G6Y6EDgCY0s3fq]{水流爆发}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.JyT346VmGtRLsDnV]{闪电风暴}以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.z2mfh3oPnfYqXflY]{水手的诅咒}加入她的巢会法术中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Coven]</p>\n<p>A storm hag adds @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Y3G6Y6EDgCY0s3fq]{Hydraulic Torrent}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.JyT346VmGtRLsDnV]{Lightning Storm}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.z2mfh3oPnfYqXflY]{Mariner's Curse} to her coven's spells.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Coven]</p>"
            },
            "Stormsight": {
              "name": "风暴视界 Stormsight",
              "description": "<p>风、降水和云层不会妨碍岚鬼婆的视野；她会无视由风暴、薄雾、降水等造成的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽（状态）} 状态。</p>\n<p>Wind, precipitation, and clouds don't impair a storm hag's vision; she ignores the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} condition from storms, mist, precipitation, and the like.</p>"
            },
            "Voice of the Storm": {
              "name": "风暴之声 Voice of the Storm",
              "description": "<p>岚鬼婆可以借助风将口头信息或声音送到她见过且风能触及的任意地点，范围为50英里半径。她可以送出轻声耳语或高声尖叫，并决定其是否清晰可闻，或仅仅勉强盖过风声而被听见。无论是否有人在场聆听，该信息都会被送达。鬼婆可以用此能力以可怕的威胁或令人不安的厄运低语，对听到她信息的生物使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{挫败士气}。</p>\n<p>A storm hag can send spoken messages or sounds on the wind to any spot that she has seen and the wind can reach within a 50-mile radius. She can send a quiet whisper or a loud scream, and decides whether it's clearly audible or barely heard above the wind. The message is delivered regardless of whether anyone is present to hear it. The hag can use this ability to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} creatures that hear her message with dire threats or unnerving whispers of doom.</p>"
            },
            "Sickened by Incense": {
              "name": "被熏香熏得恶心 Sickened by Incense",
              "description": "<p>如果伊欧加卡在其回合开始时邻接点燃的熏香，她会变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}，并且必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:27] 豁免；若失败，则她改为因熏香而变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 3}。如果她在其回合结束时邻接点燃的熏香，她会因其引起的恶心而变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，直到她下个回合结束。</p>\n<p>If Iogaka begins her turn adjacent to lit incense, she becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} and must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:27] save; on a failure, she instead becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 3} by the incense. If she ends her turn adjacent to lit incense, she becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until the end of her next turn by the nausea it causes her.</p>"
            },
            "Stormcalling": {
              "name": "唤暴 Stormcalling",
              "description": "<p>岚鬼婆可以施展一种特殊的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XkDCzMIyc0YOjw05]{Control Weather}仪式，该仪式不需要次要施法者，以将其所在位置5英里范围内的天气改变持续[[/r 4d12 #Duration Stormcalling]]{4d12小时}。主要检定是一次@Check[occultism|dc:23]检定，且她不可能获得比失败更糟的结果。</p>\n<p>岚鬼婆只能制造飓风、雷暴和龙卷风，但她可以无视当前季节来这么做。她也可以平息自然天气事件，但绝不会自愿这样做。</p>\n<p>A storm hag can perform a special @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XkDCzMIyc0YOjw05]{Control Weather} ritual, which requires no secondary casters, to change the weather within 5 miles of her location for [[/r 4d12 #Duration Stormcalling]]{4d12 hours}. The primary check is a @Check[occultism|dc:23] check, and she can't get an outcome worse than a failure.</p>\n<p>The storm hag can create only hurricanes, thunderstorms, and tornadoes, but she can do so regardless of the current season. She can also quell natural weather events but never willingly does so.</p>"
            },
            "Wind Mastery": {
              "name": "御风精通 Wind Mastery",
              "description": "<p>岚鬼婆不受强风影响，无论是自然还是魔法造成的。多风环境对她而言不算困难地形。</p>\n<p>A storm hag is unaffected by strong winds, natural or magical. Windy conditions are not difficult terrain for her.</p>"
            },
            "Weather Lore": {
              "name": "天气学识 Weather Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>岚鬼婆是风暴狂怒的化身。这些老妪憎恨那些在风声咆哮、暴雨抽打陆地与海洋之时，仍与所爱之人挤在温暖干燥的庇护所里的人。岚鬼婆运用她们的力量，在她们常栖身的海岸洞窟或简陋窝棚附近的社区中掀起浩劫。</p>\n<p>这些鬼婆借风送声，在俯冲而下以利爪与邪恶魔法袭击凡人之前先令其胆寒。比起同类中的其他成员，她们更以幼者为食；她们吞噬孩子，不仅因鬼婆偏爱鲜嫩的血肉，更因为这能让孩子的父母与看护者承受同等的痛苦。</p>\n<p>岚鬼婆的领地有时会与海鬼婆和冬鬼婆的领地重叠。虽然这可能促成一个共同控制合并领地的鬼婆集会，但更多时候会引发对立。这类争斗只会加剧夹在敌对鬼婆纷争之间的无辜之人的悲惨。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>鬼婆是污秽的生物，外表如枯槁的老妪，与她们所恐吓的人形生物几乎毫无共同之处。她们是充满憎恨的存在，最大的快乐在于腐化并最终毁灭一切美好与高洁之物。创造最初鬼婆的力量已湮没于时代之中，但在年代流转间出现了众多鬼婆的变种，每一种都拥有各自的力量与能力，用以传播痛苦与折磨。</p>\n<p>Storm hags are the personification of a storm's rage. These crones hate those who huddle together with loved ones in warm, dry shelters while the wind howls and rain lashes the land and sea. Storm hags use their powers to wreak havoc on communities near the coastal caves or hovels where they often live.</p>\n<p>These hags send their voices on the wind to terrorize mortals before descending upon them with claws and fell magic. More than any others of their kind, they prey on the young, devouring children as much for the pain it causes their parents and caretakers as for the hags' love of young flesh.</p>\n<p>A storm hag's territory sometimes overlaps with that of sea hags and winter hags. While this may result in the formation of a coven that controls their combined territories, more often it leads to rivalries. Such feuds only increase the misery of innocent people caught between the rival hags' feuding.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Foul creatures who appear as wizened old women, hags share little in common with the humanoids they terrorize. They are hateful entities whose greatest joy lies in the corruption and ultimate destruction of anything good and virtuous. Whatever power created the first hags is lost to time, but numerous hag varieties have arisen over the ages, each with their own powers and abilities to spread pain and suffering.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体女性岚鬼婆\nVariant female storm hag",
          "prototypeToken": "伊奥加卡 Iogaka"
        },
        "Sojiruh": {
          "name": "索闹 Sojiruh",
          "tokenName": "索闹 Sojiruh",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Shatter": {
              "name": "粉碎音波 Shatter",
              "description": "<p>一次高频率的音波攻击会粉碎附近的一件物体。你对该物体造成2d10音波伤害；若该物体的硬度为4或更低，则无视其硬度。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10，且该法术可无视的硬度上限提高2。</p>\n<p>A high-frequency sonic attack shatters a nearby object. You deal 2d10 sonic damage to the object, ignoring the object's Hardness if it is 4 or lower.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10, and the Hardness the spell ignores increases by 2.</p>"
            },
            "Sound Burst": {
              "name": "音鸣爆 Sound Burst",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音轰然爆发，造成2d10音波伤害。每个生物必须进行一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全部伤害，并在1轮内陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{失聪}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：失败</strong> 该生物受到双倍伤害，陷入失聪1分钟，并陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is Deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧术 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你将恐惧植入目标；其必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你制造一个简单声音的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个普通人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120英尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你让目标物体看起来、摸起来都仿佛处于好得多或糟得多的物理状态。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。一个被弄得看起来破败的物品，会显得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损} 且粗劣。一个完好无损、被弄得看起来更好的物品，会显得仿佛全新一般，并且高度抛光或保养得当。一个破损物品会显得完好且可用。被摧毁的物品无法受到该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将一件在射程内且负载为1或更低的松散无主物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若命中，你造成钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——取决于你掷出的物体——数值等于1d6加上你的施法关键属性调整值。被掷出的物品不具有任何会影响此次攻击或伤害的特定特征或魔法属性。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成全额伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage-as appropriate for the object you hurled-equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Broken Shortsword": {
              "name": "破损短剑 Broken Shortsword"
            },
            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被索闹杀死的生物很难复活或作为不死被唤起。索闹会自动尝试反制任何复活或唤起它所杀死的任何生物的企图（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+11 #Counteract]]{+11}，反制阶位 2）。如果杀死该生物的索闹本身也被杀死，则该生物可以如常从死亡中被带回或成为不死。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by a sojiruh are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The sojiruh automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+11 #Counteract]]{+11}, counteract rank 2). If the sojiruh who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
            },
            "Manifest Armor": {
              "name": "具现护甲 Manifest Armor",
              "description": "<p>索闹在自己身上显现出一层护甲，看起来由相互咬合的骨骼与柳条编织物构成，使其 AC 提高至 21。该护甲是永久性的，但如果索闹受到一次造成钝击、力场或挥砍伤害的打击所导致的大成功或大失败，护甲就会崩塌并消失，使其 AC 降回 17。</p>\n<p>The sojiruh manifests a layer of armor on its body that appears to be made of interlocking bones and wicker weaves, increasing its AC to 21. The armor is permanent but collapses and vanishes if the sojiruh takes a critical hit from a Strike that inflicts bludgeoning, force, or slashing damage, reducing its AC back to 17.</p>"
            },
            "Ruin Wielder": {
              "name": "持骸者 Ruin Wielder",
              "description": "<p>当索闹挥舞一把破损的非魔法武器时，他们不会承受该武器处于破损状态的任何劣势。当索闹挥舞它时，该武器变为一把+1武器，并在成功命中时额外造成1d6心灵伤害。</p>\n<p>When a sojiruh wields a broken non-magical weapon, they do not take any of the disadvantages of the weapon being broken. While the sojiruh wields it, the weapon becomes a +1 weapon that deals an additional 1d6 mental damage on a successful hit.</p>"
            },
            "Stolen Scream": {
              "name": "窃取尖叫 Stolen Scream",
              "description": "<p>索闹以其能看见的30英尺内一名生物为目标，然后吸气，制造出与目标尖叫声完全相同的声音。该目标生物必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:21] 豁免，随后其在24小时内对该索闹的“灵魂尖叫”获得暂时免疫。若该生物因“窃取尖叫”而变为惊惧，且拥有前世，则索闹恢复 @Damage[(2d8+8)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[2d6[mental]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[4d6[mental]] 伤害，且获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[8d6[mental]] 伤害，且获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}。</p>\n<p>The sojiruh targets a creature within 30 feet that it can see and then inhales, creating a sound identical to that of the target's scream. The targeted creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:21] save, after which they're temporarily immune to that sojiruh's Soul Scream for 24 hours. If the creature becomes frightened as a result of Stolen Scream and has had a past life, the sojiruh restores @Damage[(2d8+8)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[2d6[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[8d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>索吉鲁的诞生，源于某个生物在多次生命中都致力于追求开悟，却在临死之前背弃了这些目标，并刻意将自己从轮回之循环中撕扯出来。这些怪物般的生物是最常见的灵堕魔，也最为善解的追随者所憎恨，因为这些恶魔中有太多是从这一哲学的堕落成员中崛起的。</p>\n<p>这种灵堕魔沉迷于屡经转世的灵魂之滋味，并认为当目标的肉体仍活着、仍在尖叫时吞噬其生命力最为可口。对索吉鲁而言，它所进食的肉体发出的完美尖叫声，就像晚餐时与佳肴完美搭配的美酒一般。</p>\n<p>索吉鲁的嘴被一缕缕自己的头发缝死。尽管如此，它们仍能自如说话，空洞的嗓音从封死的嘴唇间清晰传出。只有当它们选择尖啸与嘶喊时，才会拉扯这些缝线。它们的手臂修长，仿佛折断一般；胸腔几乎只剩肋骨笼，里面塞满红色、湿漉漉的蝴蝶，那些蝴蝶在肋骨与脏器间爬行并紧紧附着其上。当索吉鲁尖叫时，胸中蝴蝶的翅膀会疯狂扑动。</p>\n<p>索吉鲁象征着转世轮回之循环从纯净中崩解，继而陷入腐朽与堕坏。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一个已多次转世的邪恶凡人灵魂被从灵魂之循环中硬生生扯出并遭到腐化时，它便可能经历可怖的变形，成为一种名为灵堕魔的恶魔。作为熵增与打破循环之力，灵堕魔是丑恶骇人的怪物：它们的身体常呈扭曲畸变之态，挥舞着虽已破碎却仍能运作的武器，而它们真正的面孔也往往隐藏不见。它们展现出你在不死生物身上可能见到的特征，例如腐烂的血肉或外露的骨骼，然而灵堕魔却确实仍然活着。</p>\n<p>每一种灵堕魔都体现了某个特定循环的断裂——无论那循环来自自然界，还是源于社会传统。对灵堕魔而言，没有什么比吞噬一个多次转世的生物更为美味；而那些理论上即将抵达真正开悟者，更是最可口的佳肴。被灵堕魔杀死者同样会被从循环中撕离——幸运者会前往白骨庭接受裁决，但许多人反而会被腐化，化作更多这般可怖的恶魔。</p>\n<p>善解的追随者认为灵堕魔尤为可憎，并将其视为最难以想象的巨大威胁之一。灵堕魔最常见于轮回循环最为强盛的世界地区；而它们与罗刹和鬼一样，与物质界的关联最为紧密。</p>\n<h2>转世的灵魂</h2>\n<p>在某些情况下，你会知道灵堕魔袭击的生物是否拥有转世的灵魂。像萨姆萨兰这样的族裔永远都是转世的灵魂，而PC的背景故事甚至其背景也常能指示其前世的存在。《鬼季》中的所有PC都符合转世的灵魂的条件，因为他们在数十年间一遍又一遍地重活自己的人生。若你需要为了裁定灵堕魔能力而判断某个生物的灵魂是否转世，进行一次 @Check[flat|dc:11]——成功则其拥有转世的灵魂。</p>\n<h2>灵堕魔半神</h2>\n<p>最强大的灵堕魔是半神，尽管它们的教团相当罕见。灵堕魔半神如库伽普提在死后往往会再度转世，因此更恰当的称呼是“灵堕魔苦行者”。</p>\n<h2>灵堕魔叛徒</h2>\n<p>尽管大多数灵堕魔本性纯粹为混乱邪恶，但传说中有极其罕见的灵堕魔能设法逃离自身天性并得以超升，在死后转世为神侍或其他更为仁善的灵体，并在此过程中摆脱灵堕魔特征。当然，这些“叛徒”在其他仍留下来的灵堕魔眼中，被视为最令人垂涎的美餐。</p>\n<h2>灵堕魔蝴蝶</h2>\n<p>各类灵堕魔最怪异的共同特征之一，便是那些似乎总围着它们飞舞、在它们身上筑巢，或周期性地从伤口中钻出的血红色蝴蝶。这些令人不安的昆虫是灵堕魔思想的实体化显现，象征它们曾经经历却又背弃的无数前世。一旦灵堕魔蝴蝶离开其源头飞出数尺之外，便从不久留，会逐渐化作烟雾，迅速消散在空气中。</p>\n<h2>其他灵堕魔</h2>\n<p>除了这些页面上呈现的四种灵堕魔之外，还存在许多其他类型。其他例子包括：会复制尸体的恪尸魔（哭泣灵堕魔）、被称为痂苦魔（潜伏灵堕魔）的社会渗透者、亵渎死者的煞星魔（畸形灵堕魔），以及强大而残暴的稽折魔（无头灵堕魔）。</p>\n<p>A sojiruh comes into existence when a creature who has dedicated multiple lives to achieving enlightenment turns their back on these goals and deliberately tears themselves away from the cycle of reincarnation before their death. These monstrous creatures are the most common nindoru and are also the most hated by followers of Sangpotshi, since so many of these fiends rise from fallen members of that very philosophy.</p>\n<p>This type of nindoru relishes the flavor of an oft-reincarnated soul and finds this life force tastes best when consumed while the physical body still lives and screams. To sojiruhs, the sound of a perfect scream from the body it feeds upon is akin to the perfect wine pairing with dinner.</p>\n<p>A sojiruh's mouth is stitched shut with lengths of its own hair. Despite this, they can speak freely, their hollow-sounding voices issuing clearly from sealed lips. They only stretch these stitches when they choose to shriek and scream. Their arms are long and broken-looking, while their chests are little more than rib cages filled with red wet butterflies that crawl through and cling to the creature's ribs and organs. When a sojiruh screams, the wings of the butterflies in its chest flutter frantically.</p>\n<p>Sojiruhs symbolize the cycle of reincarnation come undone from its purity and becoming mired in decay and corruption.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When an evil mortal soul that has been reincarnated multiple times is wrenched from the cycle of souls and corrupted, it can undergo a horrific transformation into a fiend known as a nindoru. A force for entropy and the breaking of cycles, nindorus are hideous creatures whose bodies often appear distorted, who wield weapons that have been shattered yet still function, and whose true face is often hidden from view. They display traits one might expect to see in an undead creature, such as decaying flesh or exposed bones, yet a nindoru is very much still alive.</p>\n<p>Each nindoru epitomizes the fracture of a specific cycle, be it one from the natural world or from societal traditions. To the nindoru, nothing is more delicious than the consumption of a creature who has reincarnated multiple times, with those who are theoretically about to ascend to true enlightenment presenting the tastiest meal. Those slain by a nindoru are themselves torn from the cycle—the lucky ones move on to the Boneyard for judgment, but many are instead corrupted to form more of these horrific fiends.</p>\n<p>Followers of Sangpotshi find nindoru to be particularly abhorrent and count them among the greatest threats imaginable. Most commonly found in regions of the world where the reincarnation cycle is strongest, nindorus are, like rakshasas and oni, associated most strongly with the Material Plane.</p>\n<h2>Reincarnated Souls</h2>\n<p>In some cases, you'll know if a creature a nindoru attacks has a reincarnated soul. Ancestries like samsarans are always reincarnated souls, and a PC's backstory or even their background can often indicate the presence of a previous life. All of the PCs in Season of Ghosts qualify as reincarnated souls, as they've relived their lives over and over for decades. If you ever need to determine if a creature's soul is reincarnated for the purpose of adjudicating a nindoru's ability, attempt a @Check[flat|dc:11]—on a success, it has a reincarnated soul.</p>\n<h2>Nindoru Demigods</h2>\n<p>The most powerful nindorus are demigods, although their cults are quite rare. Prone to reincarnation after death, nindoru demigods like Kugaptee are more properly known as \"nindoru ascetics.\"</p>\n<h2>Nindoru Traitors</h2>\n<p>While most nindorus are purely chaotic evil in nature, legends tell of exceptionally rare nindorus who manage to escape their own nature and ascend, reincarnating after death into kami or other more benevolent spirits and shedding the nindoru trait as they do so. Of course, these \"traitors\" are regarded as the most delicious meals imaginable by the nindorus left behind.</p>\n<h2>Nindoru Butterflies</h2>\n<p>One of the strangest shared traits of the various types of nindoru are the blood-red butterflies that seem to follow them around, nest on their bodies, or periodically emerge from their wounds. These unnerving insects are physical manifestations of the nindorus' thoughts and symbolize the countless past lives they once lived but turned their backs on. Nindoru butterflies never last long once they flutter more than a few feet from their source, fading away into smoke that quickly dissipates into the air.</p>\n<h2>Other Nindorus</h2>\n<p>Many other types of nindorus exist beyond the four presented on these pages. Others include the corpse-copying akashtis (sobbing nindorus), infiltrators of society known as kagekumas (lurking nindorus), the dead defiling shisagishins (crooked nindorus), and the powerful and brutal argyrzeis (headless nindorus).</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "索闹 Sojiruh"
        },
