            "Horrifying Vision": {
              "name": "骇人幻景 Horrifying Vision",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名小型或更大的生物接近至房屋外部30尺以内</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 一波恶意充斥着庄园外60尺内所有活体生物的心智，使其被压倒性的恐惧所吞没；每个生物必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:29]豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响，并在24小时内对“骇人幻视”获得临时免疫。除这项临时免疫外，该生物还可以以自由动作进行一次@Check[occultism|dc:23]或@Check[religion|dc:23]检定，以察觉尽管立面上只有一张脸，但似乎有数道魂魄回响渗入这栋建筑。若大成功，该生物意识到：注入庄园的力量中只有最强大的那股是邪恶的，其他要素则是非敌对的魂魄，它们被那股单一力量压制并困在其中。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物经历一个短暂幻象：庄园的立面扭曲成一张巨大、可怖的脸，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1（状态）}。该生物可以如上尝试相同的神秘学或宗教检定，但DC提高至33。@Check[occultism|dc:33] @Check[religion|dc:33]</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同失败结果，但该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2（状态）}，且在其仍处于惊惧期间获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。该生物可以正常以回忆知识的方式尝试神秘学或宗教检定（DC 33）。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败结果，但该生物在1分钟内无法将其惊惧（状态）降低到1以下。此外，压倒性的恐惧使该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}；此状态持续至其被魔法治愈或该危害被停用为止。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A Small or larger creature approaches within 30 feet of the house's exterior</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A wave of malice fills the minds of all living creatures outside of the manor within 60 feet with overwhelming fear; each creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Horrifying Vision for 24 hours. In addition to this temporary immunity, the creature can attempt a @Check[occultism|dc:23] or @Check[religion|dc:23] check as a free action to notice that despite there being only one face in the facade, several spiritual echoes seem to infuse the building. On a critical success, the creature realizes that only the most powerful force infusing the manor is evil and that the other elements are non-hostile spirits who are overwhelmed and trapped by that singular force.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature experiences a brief vision of the manor's facade twisting into an immense, horrific face and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}. The creature can attempt the same Occultism or Religion check as above, but the DC increases to 33. @Check[occultism|dc:33] @Check[religion|dc:33]</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it remains frightened. The creature can attempt the Occultism or Religion check to Recall Knowledge normally (DC 33).</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature can't reduce its frightened condition below 1 for 1 minute. In addition, the overwhelming fear causes the creature to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1}; this condition persists until it's cured magically or the hazard is disabled.</p>"
