          "disable": "<p>@Check[occultism|dc:32]或@Check[religion|dc:32]以驱逐作祟，@Check[society|dc:35]以用恰当方式接近宅邸，表现出对其住户在社区中象征性地位的尊重；出示一份在法律上授予进入建筑许可的官方通行证，会使这两个DC都降低5（前提是PC从正门接近，而不是从其他方向）。</p>\n<p>@Check[occultism|dc:27] @Check[religion|dc:27] @Check[society|dc:30]</p>\n<p>@Check[occultism|dc:32] or @Check[religion|dc:32] to exorcise the haunt, @Check[society|dc:35] to approach the manor in a proper way that defers to its occupant's symbolic standing in the community; displaying an official pass that legally grants permission to enter the building reduces both of these DCs by 5 (provided the PCs approach the front door and not from another direction).</p>\n<p>@Check[occultism|dc:27] @Check[religion|dc:27] @Check[society|dc:30]</p>",
