              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 打击</p><hr /><p>黏胶炸弹是一种无害的爆炸装置，爆开时会喷溅大量黏稠物质。当你用黏胶炸弹命中一个生物时，该生物的各项速度在1分钟内承受–15尺的状态减值。你对攻击掷骰获得+1物品加值，且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{逃脱} DC为[[/act escape dc=19]]{19}。</p>\n<p>若为大成功，则与坚固表面接触的生物会黏在该表面上，并在1轮内@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}；而通过翅膀飞行的生物其翅膀会被缠住，导致其安全地落到地面上，并在1轮内无法再次飞行。对在水中的生物使用黏胶炸弹没有效果。</p>\n<p>目标可以通过逃脱，或累计花费3个交互动作小心移除黏稠物质，以结束任何效果。这些交互动作不必连续，其他生物也可以提供这些动作。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.sgQknR94qDt5ILBx]{效果：黏胶炸弹}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p><hr /><p>A glue bomb is a harmless explosive mechanism bursting with sticky substances. When you hit a creature with a glue bomb, that creature takes a –15-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls, and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} DC is [[/act escape dc=19]]{19}.</p>\n<p>On a critical hit, a creature in contact with a solid surface becomes stuck to the surface and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round, and a creature flying via wings has its wings tangled, causing it to fall safely to the ground and become unable to Fly again for 1 round. Glue bombs are not effective when used on a creature that is in water.</p>\n<p>The target can end any effects by Escaping or spending a total of 3 Interact actions to carefully remove the sticky substances. These Interact actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can provide the actions as well.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.sgQknR94qDt5ILBx]{Effect: Glue Bomb}</p>"
