            "Nimble Dodge": {
              "name": "灵巧闪避 Nimble Dodge",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 帮派头目成为其可见的攻击者所发动攻击的目标</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 帮派头目在对抗触发的攻击时，AC获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The gang leader is targeted with an attack by an attacker they can see</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gang leader gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.</p>"
            },
            "Surprise Attacker": {
              "name": "奇袭者 Surprise Attacker",
              "description": "<p>在战斗的第一轮，尚未行动的生物对帮派头目处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}状态。</p>\n<p>On the first round of combat, creatures that haven't acted are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to the gang leader.</p>"
            },
            "Brutal Rally": {
              "name": "残酷集结 Brutal Rally",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 帮派头目对一名生物掷出一次大成功</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 所有能看见帮派头目的盟友在进行攻击掷骰时获得+1环境加值，直到帮派头目下个回合开始。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.7x0O2GqWBJiAk5PF]{效果：残酷激励}</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The gang leader rolls a critical hit against a creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> All allies that can see the gang leader gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls until the start of the gang leader's next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.7x0O2GqWBJiAk5PF]{Effect: Brutal Rally}</p>"
            },
            "Gang Up": {
              "name": "围攻 Gang Up",
              "description": "<p>只要敌人同时处于帮派头目与其一名盟友的近战触及范围内，因夹击而使敌人在面对帮派头目的近战攻击时处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}。</p>\n<p>Any enemy is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against the gang leader's melee attacks due to flanking as long as the enemy is within melee reach of both the gang leader and one of the gang leader's allies.</p>"
            },
            "Quick Draw": {
              "name": "快速拔取 Quick Draw",
              "description": "<p>帮派头目用交互动作拔出一把武器，然后用该武器进行打击。</p>\n<p>The gang leader Interacts to draw a weapon, then Strikes with that weapon.</p>"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>帮派头目对 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及} 生物造成额外 2d6 精确伤害。</p>\n<p>The gang leader deals an extra 2d6 precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Underworld Lore": {
              "name": "黑街学识 Underworld Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>帮派头目指挥割喉者、杀手、盗贼和打手。帮派头目常与一伙强盗团或其他罪犯一同出现。</p><hr /><p>反派追求自私而残酷的目标，将任何挡路之人踩在脚下。</p>\n<p>Gang leaders direct cutthroats, killers, thieves, and toughs. The gang leader often appears alongside a bandit gang or other criminals.</p><hr /><p>Villains pursue selfish and cruel goals, trampling over anyone in their way.</p>",
          "blurb": "男性人类帮派头目\nMale human gang leader",
          "prototypeToken": "罗·库翁 Lo Kuon"
        },
        "Spiritual Disruptor": {
          "name": "灵性干扰器 Spiritual Disruptor",
          "tokenName": "灵性扰乱者 Spiritual Disruptor",
          "items": {
            "Manifest": {
              "name": "显现 Manifest",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> PC们进入该建筑物，或以其他方式与该建筑物及其内容物进行交互</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 在标记为<strong>A4</strong>的两个位置各显现出一个灵体扰乱器。随后两个危害都掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The PCs enter or otherwise interact with the building and its contents</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A spiritual disruptor manifests at both locations marked <strong>A4</strong>. Both hazards then roll initiative.</p>"
            },
            "Speed 20 feet": {
              "name": "速度20尺 Speed 20 feet"
            },
            "Smoking Torch": {
              "name": "冒烟的火把 Smoking Torch"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[intimidation|dc:23]（专家）扰乱作祟在生者世界中的专注并切断与思维空间的连接，@Check[religion|dc:27]（专家）将能量从思维空间中驱逐，或 @Check[occultism|dc:30]（专家）将作祟的能量反转以对抗其自身来抵消它</p>\n<p>@Check[intimidation|dc:23] (expert) to disrupt the haunt's concentration in the living world and break the link to the mindscape, @Check[religion|dc:27] (expert) to banish the energy from the mindscape, or @Check[occultism|dc:30] (expert) to turn the haunt's energy back against itself to cancel it out</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一个闪烁的人形身影，有四只金色眼睛，身披红袍黑袖，手持一支燃着赤红火焰与烟雾的火炬，目的明确地大步穿过地面，令其周围的现实发生扭曲，使木材扭曲腐朽，并让痛苦难当的剧痛贯穿血肉。</p>\n<p>A flickering humanoid shape with four gold eyes, clad in red robes with black sleeves and wielding a torch that burns with red fire and smoke, strides purposefully across the ground, creating distortions in reality around it that cause wood to twist and decay and send agonizing pain through the flesh.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>如果两个危害都被解除或摧毁，那么在 [[/gmr 1d4+2 #Rounds]] 轮后，会在坍塌建筑内仍然在场的一个随机决定的角色相邻处生成一个新的危害。一旦所有三名NPC都被救出或被驱邪，这些危害就不会重置。</p>\n<p>If both hazards are disabled or destroyed, a new one forms adjacent to a randomly determined character still inside the crumbling building after [[/gmr 1d4+2 #Rounds]] rounds. Once all three NPCs are rescued or exorcised, these hazards don't reset.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（三动作）灵性干扰者每轮的第一个动作恒为在一个 @Template[emanation|distance:10] 内制造一道涟漪般的能量脉冲，使周遭结构看起来迅速老化并发生扭曲，令该区域内的地面变为困难地形。若灵性干扰者与一个活体目标相邻，它会尝试以其冒烟的火炬进行一次打击，以扰乱该目标的生命能量。若灵性干扰者未与活体目标相邻，它会向最近的目标行走。若它有多个相邻目标，灵性干扰者会优先选择等级更高的目标；若有多个相邻且等级相同的目标，则随机选择其一。</p>\n<p>(three actions) The spiritual disruptor's first action each round is always to create a pulse of rippling energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:10] that causes the surrounding structure to appear to age rapidly and become distorted, causing the ground in this area to become difficult terrain. If the spiritual disruptor is adjacent to a living target, it attempts to disrupt that target's life energy by making a Strike with its smoking torch. If the spiritual disruptor isn't adjacent to a living target, it Strides toward the closest target. If it has multiple adjacent targets, the spiritual disruptor favors higher-level targets, selecting randomly from multiple adjacent equal-level targets.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（专家）</p>\n<p>(expert)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "灵体扰乱器 Spiritual Disruptor"
        },
        "Familiar Shadow": {
          "name": "魔宠之影 Familiar Shadow",
          "tokenName": "魔宠阴影 Familiar Shadow",
          "items": {
            "Shadow Hand": {
              "name": "影手 Shadow Hand"
            },
            "Light Vulnerability": {
              "name": "光弱点 Light Vulnerability",
              "description": "<p>一个散发魔法光芒的物体（例如来自 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4]{Light} 法术）在用于攻击影子时被视为魔法。</p>\n<p>An object shedding magical light (such as from the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4]{Light} spell) is treated as magical when used to attack the shadow.</p>"
            },
            "Infest Shadow": {
              "name": "侵染暗影 Infest Shadow",
              "description": "<p>当魔宠暗影将其所复制的PC的影子拉拽出来时，它会扭曲蠕动片刻，随后立刻又滑回到角色身旁。被侵染的影子似乎会自行扭动扭曲，仿佛有意无视其所依附角色的动作。被侵染的影子习惯做出令人分心且尴尬的动作，并使其依附的PC在欺瞒、交涉与隐匿检定上承受–2状态减值。若PC处于无法投下影子的情境（例如身处完全黑暗中或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}），这些减值会被压制，但会在其被侵染的影子重新出现后立刻恢复。若拥有被侵染影子的PC获得濒死（状态），该影子会挣脱并变为暗影衍生体（其运作方式与典型暗影所创造的暗影衍生体相同）。该暗影衍生体不会攻击它所源自的生物，但其他目标都在其攻击范围内。若濒死的角色恢复，该暗影衍生体会立刻死亡，而其影子恢复正常——否则，摆脱这一古怪诅咒的唯一方式，就是使用诸如移除诅咒之类的法术。</p>\n<p>When a familiar shadow pulls free the shadow of the PC that they duplicate, it twists and writhes for a moment before it immediately slithers back around the character. The infested shadow seems to writhe and twist on its own, as if willfully ignoring the actions of the character to whom it's attached. The infested shadow has a habit of making distracting and embarrassing motions, and imparts a –2 status penalty to its attached PC's Deception, Diplomacy, and Stealth checks. If the PC is in a situation where they aren't casting a shadow (such as when they're in complete darkness or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}), these penalties are suppressed, but return as soon as their infested shadow does. If a PC with an infested shadow gains the dying condition, the shadow breaks free and becomes a shadow spawn (which functions the same as a shadow spawn created by a typical shadow). This shadow spawn won't attack the creature it spawned from, but any other targets are fair game. If the dying character recovers, their shadow spawn immediately dies and their shadow returns to normal—otherwise the only way to be rid of this strange curse is through the use of a spell like remove curse.</p>"
            },
            "Shadow Spawn": {
              "name": "暗影孳生体 Shadow Spawn",
              "description": "<p>当一个生物的影子被“窃取影子”拉离本体时，它会成为一个 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.clzHAfegb9Rn6DOe]{Shadow Spawn}，并受创造它的那个影子的控制。这个影裔不具备“窃取影子”，并且永久且无法治愈地处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2} 状态。若影裔被拉离的那个生物死亡，影裔便会成为一个完整、独立的影子。若该生物从其 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeeblement} 中恢复，其影子会回到它身上，而影裔会被熄灭。</p>\n<p>When a creature's shadow is pulled free by Steal Shadow, it becomes a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.clzHAfegb9Rn6DOe]{Shadow Spawn} under the command of the shadow that created it. This shadow spawn doesn't have Steal Shadow and is perpetually and incurably @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}. If the creature the shadow spawn was pulled from dies, the shadow spawn becomes a full-fledged, autonomous shadow. If the creature recovers from its @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeeblement}, its shadow returns to it and the shadow spawn is extinguished.</p>"
            },
            "Slink in Shadows": {
              "name": "潜入阴影之中 Slink in Shadows",
              "description": "<p>阴影可以在一个生物或物体的阴影中@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{躲藏}或结束其@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{潜行}。</p>\n<p>The shadow can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} or end its @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{Sneak} in a creature's or object's shadow.</p>"
            },
            "Steal Shadow": {
              "name": "窃取阴影 Steal Shadow",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 影子在其上一动作中用影手打击命中了一个活着的生物。</p>\n<p>此能力只对影子看似在复制的那名PC生效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 影子拉拽目标的影子，使该生物 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭（状态） 1}。这会与其他由影子造成的力竭（状态）累加，至多累加到力竭（状态） 4。若这使生物的力竭（状态）值提高到3或更高，则目标的影子会与其身体分离。偷影造成的力竭（状态）每小时减少1点。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The shadow hit a living creature with a shadow hand Strike on its previous action.</p>\n<p>This ability only functions against the PC who the shadow appears to duplicate.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The shadow pulls at the target's shadow, making the creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}. This is cumulative with other enfeebled conditions from shadows, to a maximum of enfeebled 4. If this increases a creature's enfeebled value to 3 or more, the target's shadow is separated from its body. Enfeebled from Steal Shadow decreases by 1 every hour.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>被称为影子的神秘不死潜伏在黑暗之处，以那些离光明太远的人为食。与影子交涉的人通常会用一把发光的武器将它们逼退；他们或许能得知重大的秘密，因为影子是理想的间谍。</p>\n<p>The mysterious undead known as shadows lurk in dark places and feed on those who stray too far from the light. Those who parley with shadows, typically by keeping them at bay with a glowing weapon, may learn great secrets, for they are ideal spies.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "魔宠阴影 Familiar Shadow"
        },
        "Witherweird Runes": {
          "name": "枯萎诡符文 Witherweird Runes",
          "tokenName": "枯萎怪符文 Witherweird Runes",
          "items": {
            "Withering Wail": {
              "name": "枯萎哀嚎 Withering Wail",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 除和善保之外的某人打开副隔层</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 一个嚎叫的幽魂面孔自箱子中显现并发出尖啸，使<strong>C4</strong>区域内所有人都必须尝试一次@Check[fortitude|dc:33]豁免；这声音也会惊动<strong>C3</strong>a与<strong>C6</strong>区域内的僵尸，它们会迅速前来调查声音来源。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[7d6[void]]伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[15d6[void]]伤害。此外，其血肉枯萎衰弱，使其看起来苍老而衰朽——该生物在诅咒被移除前，获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[30d6[void]]伤害，并如同失败一般受到诅咒，但改为获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Someone other than Heh Shan-Bao opens the secondary compartment</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A howling, spectral face manifests out of the chest and screeches, causing all within area <strong>C4</strong> to attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:33] save; the sound also alerts the jiang-shi in areas <strong>C3</strong> a and <strong>C6</strong>, who quickly come to investigate the sound.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[7d6[void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[15d6[void]] damage. In addition, their flesh withers and weakens, leaving them to appear old and decrepit—the creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the curse is removed.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[30d6[void]] damage and becomes cursed as failure, but becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>[[/act disable-device dc=37]] 来刮除符文并无害地消散其魔法，@Check[arcana|dc:40] 来破坏该法术并使符文干涸后化作惰性粉末被吹散，或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{解除魔法}（7环；反制DC 31）来反制符文</p>\n<p>[[/act disable-device dc=37]] to scratch out the runes and dissipate their magic harmlessly, @Check[arcana|dc:40] to sabotage the spell and cause the runes to dry up and blow away as inert powder, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic} (7th rank; counteract DC 31) to counteract the runes</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>以骨粉与女妖之泪绘制的符文中储存的死灵魔法会鞭击任何打开副隔间、但并非和善保的人。</p>\n<p>Necromantic magic stored in runes painted in powdered bone and banshees' tears lash out at anyone other than Heh Shan-Bao who opens the secondary compartment.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（大师）</p>\n<p>(master)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "枯萎怪符文 Witherweird Runes"
        },
        "Phantom Gecko": {
          "name": "魅影壁虎 Phantom Gecko",
          "tokenName": "魅影壁虎 Phantom Gecko",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标心智混乱，并用一次心灵冲击使其昏沉。冲击造成等同于你的施法能力调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你向目标植入恐惧；它必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3} 且获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以以最多五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一种由简单声音构成的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂精细的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>强化（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚部 Jaws"
            },
            "Walk the Ethereal Line": {
              "name": "游于两界 Walk the Ethereal Line",
              "description": "<p>魅影行走在灵界与物质位面之间的细薄界线上，以便同时存在于两个位面上。</p>\n<p>他们可以通过再次使用该能力，转回仅位于灵界。</p>\n<p>The phantom walks the thin line between the Ethereal and Material Planes in order to exist on both planes simultaneously.</p>\n<p>They can shift back to solely the Ethereal Plane by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Susceptible to Death": {
              "name": "易于死亡 Susceptible to Death",
              "description": "<p>尽管魅影并非活物，它们也不是不死生物，并且对死亡效果格外脆弱。</p>\n<p>若魅影的生命值因死亡效果（例如来自如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute} 这样的法术）而降至 0，则会立刻被带往灵魂之河，在那里它们的灵魂会重新踏上通往来世的常规道路。</p>\n<p>Though phantoms aren't alive, neither are they undead, and they are uniquely vulnerable to the effects of death.</p>\n<p>A phantom whose Hit Points are reduced to 0 as a result of a death effect (such as from a spell like @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute}) is immediately whisked away to the River of Souls, where their soul resumes the usual path to the afterlife.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>据大多数神学家所言，转世的灵魂前往来世的典型轨迹相当直接明了。当凡人死亡时，他们的魂魄会进入灵魂之河，并最终抵达骨园，在那里接受法莱斯玛的裁决。被裁决的魂魄会前往其对应的最终安息之地——天堂、地狱、阿巴顿，诸如此类——并在那里成为祈求者。</p>\n<p>然而，当某个排队等待裁决的魂魄过早离开灵魂之河并被转移到灵界时，便会产生复杂情况。无论是由于诸如夜鬼婆之类的险恶闯入者、恶毒的位面魔法，甚至是命运使然，这些魂魄都会从生死的自然秩序中脱落，并在某种炼狱般的状态中徘徊。与祈求者不同，这些灵界魅影仍保留着死前的记忆；而与诸如幽灵之类的魂魄不同，魅影并未沾染不死的污秽影响——至少起初没有，尽管腐化的威胁沉沉笼罩着魅影的存在。有些最终屈服于那般命运，另一些则最终重返灵魂之河。在此之前，这些游荡的魂魄自成一类——一类没有真正家园、计划或目标的存在。</p>\n<p>许多魅影并不愿意继续维持这种诡异的炼狱状态，要么是因为他们渴望继续在灵魂之河中的旅程，要么是因为他们惧怕不死的腐化。为了完成自然的灵性循环并接受裁决，从而继续前往来世，魅影只需设法回到灵魂之河即可。然而，这样的追寻绝非易事——灵界朦胧的迷雾足以使最老练的旅人也迷失方向，而诸多掠食者在此境界中游荡，寻找离群的魂魄以将其束缚或吞噬。</p>\n<p>The typical trajectory for souls passing to the afterlife is fairly straightforward, according to most theologians. When a mortal dies, their soul enters the River of Souls and eventually reaches the Boneyard, where it is judged by Pharasma. The judged soul moves onto its appropriate domain of final rest-Heaven, Hell, Abaddon, and so forth-where it becomes a petitioner.</p>\n<p>Complications arise, however, when a soul in queue for judgment prematurely departs from the River of Souls and is shunted into the Ethereal Plane. Whether as a result of nefarious interlopers like night hags, malignant planar magic, or even fate, these souls become dislodged from the natural order of life and death and linger in a sort of purgatory. Unlike petitioners, these ethereal phantoms retain memories of their life before death, and unlike spirits such as ghosts, phantoms aren't tinged with the foul influences of undeath-at least, not at first, though the threat of corruption hangs heavy over a phantom's existence. Some eventually succumb to that fate, while others eventually rejoin the River of Souls. Until then, these wandering souls are a kind unto themselves-one without a true home, agenda, or purpose.</p>\n<p>Many phantoms have no desire to remain in their strange state of purgatory, either because they seek to continue their journey through the River of Souls or because they fear the corruption of undeath. In order to complete the natural spiritual cycle and become judged so they can continue to the afterlife, a phantom must simply find a way back into the River of Souls. Such a quest is no easy feat, however-the hazy mists of the Ethereal Plane can befuddle even the most experienced traveler, and numerous predators prowl the realm in search of stray souls to bind or devour.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体魅影\nVariant phantom",
          "prototypeToken": "魅影壁虎 Phantom Gecko"
        },
        "False Governor": {
          "name": "伪总督 False Governor",
          "tokenName": "和善保 Heh Shan-Bao",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Phantasmal Calamity": {
              "name": "魅影灾祸 Phantasmal Calamity",
              "description": "<p>末日般的毁灭景象充斥区域内每个生物的心智。该景象造成11d6心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。在大失败时，该生物还必须在一次@Check[reflex]豁免中成功，否则会相信自己被困住了（卡在裂缝中、在海上漂流，或与其景象相符的其他命运）。若它在第二次豁免中失败，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑（状态）}，持续1分钟。它可以在自己每个回合结束时尝试一次新的意志豁免，并在成功时识破该幻觉，并从震慑（状态）中恢复。</p><hr /><p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a @Check[reflex] save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it disbelieves the illusion and recovers from the stunned condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Wave of Despair": {
              "name": "绝望之波 Wave of Despair",
              "description": "<p>你使区域内的生物陷入绝望。每个生物的效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续1轮，该生物无法使用反应动作，并且必须在其回合开始时再次尝试一次豁免；若失败，它在该回合中会因无法控制地啜泣而成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物在1分钟内自动变为缓慢1。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为60尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically slowed 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Honeyed Words": {
              "name": "甜言蜜语 Honeyed Words",
              "description": "<p>谎言从你唇间滑出，如丝般顺畅。你在进行用于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ewwCglB7XOPLUz72]{说谎}的欺瞒检定时获得+4状态加值，并在对抗用于辨别你是否在说真话的察觉检定时也获得+4状态加值，且即使未受训也将你的等级加入其中。若你的谎言因不可信而引发环境减值或DC提高，将该减值减半，或将该提高减半。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.6vodhSeI3ClMfOGd]{法术效果：蜜语甜言}</p>\n<p>Falsehoods pass your lips as smoothly as silk. You gain a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ewwCglB7XOPLUz72]{Lie} and against Perception checks to discern if you are telling the truth, and you add your level even if untrained. If the implausibility of your lies prompts a circumstance penalty or a DC increase, reduce that penalty by half or increase it by half.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.6vodhSeI3ClMfOGd]{Spell Effect: Honeyed Words}</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的假象，它借此开口回答你提出的三个问题。该法术唤起的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须大体完好，法术才能生效。尸体所受的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确、越支离破碎，而且它必须有喉咙和嘴才能说话。如果在过去一周内有人曾对该尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以使用其死亡时原本生物的属性尝试进行一次意志豁免，以抗拒回答问题，其结果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄会作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实作答，但它的回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你或试图拖延，使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且较少重复，不过仍然晦涩。它在进行用于欺骗或误导你的欺瞒检定时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Creature": {
              "name": "幻象生物 Illusory Creature",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个大型或更小的生物的幻象影像。它会产生恰当的声音与气味，并且触感也足以令人信服。如果你与该影像之间的距离曾经超过500尺，法术结束。</p>\n<p>该影像无法说话，但你可以用你的动作通过该生物说话，法术会将你的声音适当地伪装。你可能需要进行一次欺瞒或表演检定来模仿该生物，由GM决定。若你试图模仿某个特定的人，并与认识那个人的对象互动，这种情况尤其常见。</p>\n<p>在战斗中，该幻觉每回合可以使用2个动作，这些动作在你维持该法术时使用。它用你的法术攻击调整进行攻击检定，并以你的法术DC作为它的AC。它的豁免调整值等于你的法术DC – 10。它足够有实体感，能够夹击其他生物。如果该影像被一次攻击命中或一次豁免失败，法术结束。</p>\n<p>该幻觉可以通过让目标相信幻觉的攻击是真实的来造成伤害，但除此之外无法直接影响物理世界。若该幻象生物以一次打击命中，目标受到@Damage[3d4[mental]]伤害。该幻觉的打击为非致命。若伤害与怪物的影像不相符——例如，一个幻象中的大型巨龙只造成5点伤害——GM可能允许目标立即尝试一次察觉检定以识破该法术。只要目标认为适用，任何相关的抗力与弱点都适用，由GM裁定。例如，若幻觉挥舞战锤并攻击一个对钝击伤害具有抗力的生物，该生物将受到更少的心灵伤害。然而，幻象伤害不会使再生失效，也不会触发其他需要特定伤害类型的效果。GM应当记录该幻觉造成的幻象伤害。</p>\n<p>任何接触该影像的生物，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}动作来检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻觉。当一个生物识破该幻觉时，它会从自己此前受到的该幻觉伤害中恢复一半（若有），并且不再受到该幻觉的进一步伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 影像的打击伤害提高1d4，并且你可创造的生物最大体型提高一级（最高至巨型）。</p>\n<p>You create an illusory image of a Large or smaller creature. It generates the appropriate sounds, smells, and feels believable to the touch. If you and the image are ever farther than 500 feet apart, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The image can't speak, but you can use your actions to speak through the creature, with the spell disguising your voice as appropriate. You might need to attempt a Deception or Performance check to mimic the creature, as determined by the GM. This is especially likely if you're trying to imitate a specific person and engage with someone that person knows.</p>\n<p>In combat, the illusion can use 2 actions per turn, which it uses when you Sustain the spell. It uses your spell attack modifier for attack rolls and your spell DC for its AC. Its saving throw modifiers are equal to your spell DC – 10. It is substantial enough that it can flank other creatures. If the image is hit by an attack or fails a save, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The illusion can cause damage by making the target believe the illusion's attacks are real, but it cannot otherwise directly affect the physical world. If the illusory creature hits with a Strike, the target takes @Damage[3d4[mental]] damage. The illusion's Strikes are nonlethal. If the damage doesn't correspond to the image of the monster—for example, if an illusory Large dragon deals only 5 damage—the GM might allow the target to attempt an immediate Perception check to disbelieve the spell. Any relevant resistances and weaknesses apply if the target thinks they do, as judged by the GM. For example, if the illusion wields a warhammer and attacks a creature resistant to bludgeoning damage, the creature would take less mental damage. However, illusory damage does not deactivate regeneration or trigger other effects that require a certain damage type. The GM should track illusory damage dealt by the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. When a creature disbelieves the illusion, it recovers from half the damage it had taken from it (if any) and doesn't take any further damage from it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage of the image's Strikes increases by 1d4, and the maximum size of creature you can create increases by one (to a maximum of Gargantuan).</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，用一道心灵冲击使其陷入恍惚。该冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标严重失败该豁免，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个由简单声音构成的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四名普通人同时大喊。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可辨识的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>高度化（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>高度化（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你使目标物体看起来和摸起来仿佛其物理状况好得多或差得多。当你施放此法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。一件被伪装得破败的物品看起来@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}且粗制滥造。一件完好的物品若被伪装得更好，看起来就像崭新的一样，并且高度抛光或保养得当。一件破损物品看起来像是完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品不能受到此法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "传讯术 Message",
              "description": "<p>你轻声默念词句，但它们并不会从你口中发出，而是直接传到目标的耳中。其他人听你的话并不会比你平常只动嘴唇时更清楚，但目标能听见你的话，就好像他们正站在你身旁一样。目标可以以反应动作（）作出简短回应，或者如果他们愿意，也可以在他们下一回合以自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你且处于射程内才能这样做。若他们回应，他们的回应也会像原本的传讯术一样，直接传入你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（第3环）</strong> 该法术的射程提高至500英尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4点心灵伤害，并造成@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害但不承受持续伤害，且法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。如果目标从恶心状态中恢复，持续伤害结束且法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
