            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被恪尸魔杀死的生物很难被复活或起成为不死。恪尸魔会自动尝试反制任何将其所杀死的生物复活或起成为不死的尝试（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+26 #Counteract]]{+26}，反制等级 6）。如果杀死该生物的恪尸魔被杀死，该生物便可正常从死亡中被带回或成为不死。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by an akashti are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The akashti automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+26 #Counteract]]{+26}, counteract level 6). If the akashti who slew the creature is slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
