            "Manifest Body": {
              "name": "具现身躯 Manifest Body",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 假总督在其纤细的骷髅骨架外显现出一个空洞的人形躯体，其外观与总督和善保的身体完全一致。穿着这一显现的身体时，假总督失去其爪打击，且其声音听起来与和善保相同。若假总督不在每日一次花费10分钟维持这层虚假血肉的显现，其显现之躯会迅速腐朽。该躯体具有10点生命值，且防御与假总督相同。躯体被摧毁时，假总督会毫发无伤地现身，而遗留的血肉外壳会散成一团红色蝴蝶云，并迅速消散为红雾。这一现身场面极其血腥且令人不安，使所有30尺内目睹此景的生物必须尝试一次@Check[fortitude|dc:29] 豁免，否则陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}（大失败则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 3}）；此效果具有心灵与视觉（特征）特征。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The false governor has manifested a hollow humanoid body around their slender skeletal frame that looks identical to that of Governor Heh Shan-Bao. While wearing this manifested body, the false governor loses their claw Strike, and their voice sounds like that of Heh Shan-Bao's. The false governor's manifested body decays swiftly if they don't take 10 minutes once per day to maintain the manifestation of the false flesh. The body has 10 Hit Points and the same defenses as the false governor. When the body is destroyed, the false governor emerges unharmed, and the fleshy shell left behind scatters into a cloud of red butterflies that swiftly fade into red mist. This emergence is so grisly and unsettling that all creatures within 30 feet who witness it must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 3} on a critical failure); this has the mental and visual traits.</p>"
            },
            "Stunning Despair": {
              "name": "震慑绝望 Stunning Despair",
              "description": "<p>伪总督释放出数声令人难以承受的绝望呜咽。30尺内的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:29] 意志豁免，以避免陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 3}）。伪总督在 [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4轮} 内无法再次使用震慑绝望。</p>\n<p>The false governor unleashes several overwhelming sobs of despair. Creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save to avoid becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 3} on a critical failure). The false governor can't use Stunning Despair again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>恪尸魔是善于操纵的邪魔，专门捕食处于哀悼之中的人；它们会变成最近去世的挚爱之人的模样，以便潜入民宅，随后杀害并吞噬悲痛家庭的转世的灵魂。有时恪尸魔也被称为“尸替”，而其真实形态看起来像一具覆着皮肤的骷髅（特征），手指长着锋利的爪，没眼睑的双眼淌下血泪。它的头骨像碗一样敞开，里面栖着一把把猩红色的蝴蝶。当恪尸魔躲藏在其显现的躯体之中时，细致的检查有时能揭示真相：那位据称死而复生的“挚爱”头皮会出现细微的起伏与鼓胀，仿佛其中的蝴蝶在蠕动。恪尸魔体现了悲伤这一复杂的循环。</p>\n<h2>额外学识已死的入侵者</h2>\n<p>有时，恪尸魔伏击并杀害目标，并非为了沉浸在其亲友的悲痛之中，而是为了取而代之、冒充其形貌，从内部渗透某个组织，腐化既有的情谊与同袍纽带。然而，最终这些恪尸魔终会厌倦欺骗，并将它们的新盟友引入陷阱，任其被屠戮。</p>\n<p>Akashtis are manipulative fiends who prey on those in mourning; they assume the form of a recently deceased loved one so they can infiltrate homes, then murder and consume the souls of grieving families. Sometimes called a \"copycorpse,\" an akashti in its true form appears as a skin-covered skeleton with sharp talons on its fingers and tears of blood dripping from its lidless eyes. Its skull appears open like a bowl, and inside nest handfuls of crimson butterflies. When an akashti hides within its manifested body, close investigation can sometimes reveal the truth when the scalp of the supposed beloved one returned to life seems to subtly ripple and bulge as the butterflies within writhe. Akashtis embody the complex cycle of grief.</p>\n<h2>Deathly Invaders</h2>\n<p>Sometimes, akashtis ambush and murder targets not to bask in the grief of their loved ones, but instead to assume their form and infiltrate an organization from within to corrupt established bonds of camaraderie. Inevitably, though, these akashtis grow bored with deception and lead their new allies into a trap for slaughter.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：恪尸魔 灵堕魔\nVariant akashti nindoru",
