            "Algriever Venom": {
              "name": "灵蜘蛛毒 Algriever Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免</strong> @Check[Will|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 6 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[心灵]]</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> 2d6 心灵并@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> 2d6 心灵并@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[will|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[mental]]</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 2d6 mental and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1}</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> 2d6 mental and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}</p>"
            },
            "Pilgrim's Ward": {
              "name": "朝圣御守 Pilgrim's Ward",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每月一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 哀悼者触碰一名自愿的生物，使其充满对其所缔约圣坛的崇敬。只要该目标生物遵守该哀悼者缔约圣坛的典范与禁忌，或直到该哀悼者将朝圣御守授予另一名生物为止，该生物在所有宗教检定与意志豁免上获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.zy4PDhXnaZh6e6iT]{效果：朝圣御守}</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per month</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The algriever touches a willing creature and fills it with reverence for their bonded shrine. As long as the target creature obeys the edicts and anathemas of the algriever's bonded shrine, or until that algriever grants Pilgrim's Ward to a different creature, that creature gains a +1 status bonus to all Religion checks and Will saves.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.zy4PDhXnaZh6e6iT]{Effect: Pilgrim's Ward}</p>"
            },
            "Web Trap": {
              "name": "网缚 Web Trap",
              "description": "<p>被悲伤蛛的蛛网术打击命中的生物将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足} 状态，并被黏在最近的表面上，直到其 [[/act escape dc=28]]{逃脱}。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by an algriever's web Strike is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and stuck to the nearest surface until it [[/act escape dc=28]]{Escapes}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>有人把这些蜘蛛般的魂魄误认为是在搜刮废弃神龛的拾荒者，但事实恰恰相反：它们是被遗忘礼拜之地的自封守护者，捍卫被丢弃信仰的神圣性，并照料那些无人看管的场所。有时，algriever 的职责带着悲伤与哀恸的色彩，因为它们会哀悼曾经来到它们所选神龛的人已不复存在。另一些则满怀挫败与怒火，把任何误闯其神龛之人视为至多是怠惰的信徒、甚至是亵渎者——理应受罚的罪人。</p>\n<p>algriever 对活物兴趣不大，除非对方闯入它们的领地。一旦 algriever 的神龛被侵入，它们便会封锁通行，直到闯入者表示敬意。好斗的 algriever 会从旅人身上偷窃，或挟持人质，直到它们对供品的要求得到满足。当 algriever 怀疑有人犯下亵渎时，任何赠礼都无法平息它们对复仇的渴求。</p>\n<h2>规则与建议反应惩罚</h2>\n<p>algriever 遵循其所系缚神龛对应的神祇或信仰的典范与禁忌，尽管它们在阵营上保持中立。不论神龛规模多大，algriever 都会在神龛内选择三件中型或更小的物体作为自身防御的焦点，并且可以对任何触碰或扰乱这些物体的生物使用助祭防御。</p>\n<p>Some mistake these spiderlike spirits as scavengers looking to loot abandoned shrines, but they're actually the opposite: self-appointed guardians of forgotten places of worship, defending the sanctity of discarded faiths and tending sites that have no caretakers. Sometimes, an algriever's duties are tinged with sadness and grief, as they mourn the loss of those who once attended their chosen shrine. Others are filled with frustration and rage, viewing any who stumble upon their shrine as lapsed faithful at best or blasphemers at worse—sinners who deserve punishment.</p>\n<p>Algrievers have little interest in living creatures until they wander into their territory. Once an algriever's shrine has been breached, they block passage until the interlopers pay their respects. Aggressive algrievers steal from travelers or take hostages until their demands for an offering are satisfied. When algrievers suspect someone of committing blasphemy, no gifts can slake their thirst for vengeance.</p>\n<h2>Reactive Punishment</h2>\n<p>An algriever follows the edicts and anathemas of the deity or faith of the shrine to which they're bonded, although they remain neutral in alignment. Regardless of how large the shrine is, an algriever chooses three Medium or smaller objects in the shrine as their own focus for defense, and can use Acolyte's Defense against any creature that touches or disturbs those objects.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "哀伤者 Algriever"
        },
