            "Divine Wrath": {
              "name": "神圣狂怒 Divine Wrath",
              "description": "<p>你引导神祇之怒对抗你的敌人。你根据敌人的强韧豁免，对区域内的敌人造成4d10魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}；在其处于恶心状态时，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}; while it's sickened, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其用来回答你向它提出的三个问题。本法术唤起的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须大体完整才能使法术生效。尸体受到的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越像拼凑出来的，而且它必须有喉咙和嘴巴才能说话。如果在过去一周内曾有人对该尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以使用其死亡时原生物的数值来尝试进行一次意志豁免，以抗拒回答问题，并产生以下效果。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄会作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实作答，但其回答可以简短、隐晦且重复。它仍可以误导你或试图拖延，使得在你问完所有问题之前法术的持续时间耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且更少重复，尽管仍然隐晦。它在进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Light": {
              "name": "圣光 Holy Light",
              "description": "<p>你射出一道炽烈的光线，其中夹杂着神圣能量。进行一次远程法术攻击。该光线造成5d6火焰伤害。若目标具有邪秽（特征），你额外造成5d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全额伤害。</p>\n<p>若光线穿过一片魔法黑暗的区域，或以受魔法黑暗影响的生物为目标，神圣之光会尝试反制该黑暗。若你需要判断光线是否穿过一片黑暗区域，在你与法术目标之间画一条线。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 火焰伤害增加2d6，且对邪秽生物的魂魄伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You shine a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Consecrate": {
              "name": "加持术 Consecrate",
              "description": "<p><strong>区域</strong> 以一座不可移动的祭坛、神龛或你神祇的固定圣物为中心的40尺爆发</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你将一处地点奉献给你的神祇，高声吟诵赞词并创造一处神圣空间。在该区域内，你神祇的信徒在攻击检定、技能检定、豁免骰与察觉检定上获得+1状态加值；而对你的神祇而言属于禁忌的生物（例如对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{法莱斯玛}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}而言的不死）在这些掷骰上承受-1状态减值。若你神祇的神圣祝圣允许你选择神圣或亵渎，你也可以选择让这处奉献之地同样成为神圣或亵渎。若该神祇的祝圣<span class=\"fontstyle2\">必须</span>为神圣或亵渎，你必须让地点与该祝圣相匹配。在该区域内，你神祇的信徒所做的打击会获得该地点的祝圣特性（若有）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献成功，并且其持续时间改为10年而非1年，或其覆盖区域的半径变为两倍。偶尔，在你神祇的恩宠下，这可能产生更惊人的效果，例如永久奉献的区域，或效果覆盖整座大教堂。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 奉献成功。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 奉献失败。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献以灾难性的方式失败并激怒你的神祇；祂会降下不悦的征兆。至少在1年内，任何进一步尝试奉献该地点都会失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 被奉献的区域也获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{位面封印}法术的效果，但该效果不会尝试反制你神祇信徒的传送。花费提升为200 gp × 法术环级。</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 40-foot-radius burst around an immobile altar, shrine, or fixture of your deity</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You consecrate a site to your deity, chanting praises and creating a sacred space. While within the area, worshippers of your deity gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, skill checks, saving throws, and Perception checks, and creatures anathema to your deity (such as undead for @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{Pharasma} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}) take a -1 status penalty to those rolls. If your deity's divine sanctification allows you to choose holy or unholy, you can choose to make the consecrated site holy or unholy as well. If the deity's sanctification <span class=\"fontstyle2\">must </span>be holy or unholy, you must make the site match that sanctification. Strikes made by worshippers of your deity within the area gain the site's sanctification trait, if any.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The consecration succeeds, and it either lasts for 10 years instead of 1 or covers an area with twice the radius. Occasionally, with your deity's favor, this might produce an even more amazing effect, such as a permanently consecrated area or the effect covering an entire cathedral.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The consecration succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The consecration fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The consecration fails spectacularly and angers your deity, who sends a sign of displeasure. For at least 1 year, further attempts to consecrate the site fail.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The consecrated area also gains the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{Planar Seal} spell, but the effect doesn't attempt to counteract teleportation by worshippers of your deity. The cost increases to 200 gp × the spell rank.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你解构法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一件魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内变为其同类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Peaceful Rest": {
              "name": "安宁休息 Peaceful Rest",
              "description": "<p>成为目标的尸体不会腐坏，也不能被转化为不死生物。如果该尸体受到需要其在一定时间内死亡的法术影响（例如，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{死者复活}），则不要将<em>安息</em>的持续时间计入该时间之内。该法术也会阻止普通的虫子与害虫（如蛆）啃食尸体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 该法术的持续时间为无限，但施放该法术需要多花费1个动作，并且需要一项花费（价值6 gp的防腐液）。</p>\n<p>The targeted corpse doesn't decay, nor can it be transformed into an undead. If the corpse is subject to a spell that requires the corpse to have died within a certain amount of time (for example, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{Raise Dead}), do not count the duration of <em>peaceful rest</em> against that time. This spell also prevents ordinary bugs and pests (such as maggots) from consuming the body.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The spell's duration is unlimited, but the spell takes one more action to cast and requires a cost (embalming fluid worth 6 gp).</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Weapon": {
              "name": "灵能武器 Spiritual Weapon",
              "description": "<p>一把由纯粹魔法力构成的武器显现出来，并攻击你在射程内指定的敌人。这把武器带有幽魂般的外观，会以棍棒、匕首或你的神祇偏好武器的形态显现。</p>\n<p>当你施放该法术时，武器出现在你于射程内选择的一名敌人旁边，并对其进行一次打击。每次你维持该法术时，你都可以将武器移动到射程内的一个新目标旁（如有需要），并用它进行一次打击。灵能武器会使用并计入你的多重攻击减值。</p>\n<p>该武器的打击为近战法术攻击。无论其外观如何，武器造成2d8力场伤害。你可以改为造成该武器通常造成的伤害类型，而非力场伤害（或对于一把多用武器而言，改为任一可用的伤害类型）。该武器的其他统计数据或特征均不适用，且即使是远程武器也只能攻击相邻的生物。尽管进行的是法术攻击，但就触发、抗力等用途而言，灵能武器仍被视为武器。</p>\n<p>该武器不占据空间，不提供夹击，也不具有生物所拥有的任何其他属性。该武器除其打击之外不能进行任何攻击，且影响武器的专长或法术都不适用于它。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 武器的伤害提高1d8。</p>\n<p>A weapon made of pure magical force materializes and attacks foes you designate within range. This weapon has a ghostly appearance and manifests as a club, a dagger, or your deity's favored weapon.</p>\n<p>When you cast the spell, the weapon appears next to a foe you choose within range and makes a Strike against it. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can move the weapon to a new target within range (if needed) and Strike with it. The spiritual weapon uses and contributes to your multiple attack penalty.</p>\n<p>The weapon's Strikes are melee spell attacks. Regardless of its appearance, the weapon deals 2d8 force damage. You can deal damage of the type normally dealt by the weapon instead of force damage (or any of the available damage types for a versatile weapon). No other statistics or traits of the weapon apply, and even a ranged weapon attacks adjacent creatures only. Despite making a spell attack, the spiritual weapon is a weapon for purposes of triggers, resistances, and so forth.</p>\n<p>The weapon doesn't take up space, grant flanking, or have any other attributes a creature would. The weapon can't make any attack other than its Strike, and feats or spells that affect weapons do not apply to it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The weapon's damage increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Bane": {
              "name": "绝望术 Bane",
              "description": "<p>你以疑虑充斥敌人的心智。区域内的敌人必须在意志豁免中成功，否则只要他们仍在该区域内，就会在攻击掷骰上承受–1状态减值。在后续回合中，每轮一次，你可以维持该法术来使散发半径增加10尺，并迫使区域内尚未受影响的敌人再次尝试进行一次豁免。</p>\n<p>绝望术可以反制 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{法术效果：绝望术}</p>\n<p>You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt. Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.</p>\n<p>Bane can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{Spell Effect: Bane}</p>"
            },
            "Command": {
              "name": "命令术 Command",
              "description": "<p>你高声下达一道难以无视的命令。你可以命令目标靠近你、逃离（如同具有 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑（状态）} 状态）、放开它正握着的东西、俯卧（如同变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}）、或原地不动。在它服从你的命令之前，它不能 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{延迟} 或进行任何反应动作。效果取决于目标的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 在其下个回合的第一个动作中，该生物必须用一个单动作照你命令行事。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标必须在其下个回合用尽其全部动作来服从你的命令。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 你最多可以选择10个生物作为目标。</p>\n<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道脉冲，用于登记周围是否存在魔法。除“有”或“无”之外，你不会获得任何信息。你可以选择忽略你已完全知晓的魔法，例如你和盟友的魔法物品与持续中的法术。你只有在幻术魔法的效果位阶低于你的<em>侦测魔法</em>法术位阶时，才能侦测到幻术魔法。然而，带有幻术灵光但外观并不具有欺骗性的物品（例如@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{隐形药水}）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你会得知该法术侦测到的最强魔法效果的位阶或等级，由GM判定。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 同3环，但你还会锁定最高位阶魔法的来源。与模糊感官类似，你不会得知确切位置，但你可以将来源缩小到一个5英尺立方体范围内（若目标大于此范围，则为最接近的范围）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道神性能量光束。对目标的AC进行一次远程法术攻击。若命中，目标受到2d4魂魄伤害（若大成功则伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导生命能量来治疗生者或伤害不死。若目标是自愿的活体生物，你恢复1d8点生命值。若目标是不死，你对其造成等量的生命力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放该法术时花费的动作数决定其目标、射程、区域及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>（专注）</strong> 该法术的射程为30英尺。若你在治疗活体生物，将恢复的生命值增加8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>（专注）</strong> 你在一个@Template[emanation|distance:30]内散布生命能量。这以爆发中的所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值增加1d8，而2动作版本的额外治疗增加8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> You disperse vital energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Produce Flame": {
              "name": "生火 Produce Flame",
              "description": "<p>一团小小的火焰球出现在你的掌心，你可以用它在近战或远程中挥击。对你的目标的 AC 进行一次法术攻击掷骰。这通常是一次远程攻击，但你也可以对你徒手触及内的一名生物进行一次近战攻击。</p>\n<p>成功时，你造成 2d4 火焰伤害。大成功时，目标受到双倍伤害，并受到 @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,fire]] 伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害提高 1d4，且在大成功时的持续伤害提高 1d4。</p>\n<p>A small ball of flame appears in the palm of your hand, and you lash out with it either in melee or at range. Make a spell attack roll against your target's AC. This is normally a ranged attack, but you can also make a melee attack against a creature in your unarmed reach.</p>\n<p>On a success, you deal 2d4 fire damage. On a critical success, the target takes double damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,fire]] damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 1d4 and the persistent damage on a critical hit by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你将注意力集中在作为目标的物体上，敞开心灵以感知魔法灵光。当施法完成时，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法。你或任何你向其说明该灵光的人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得+2环境加值。若该物体是幻象，只有当该效果的环阶低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的环阶时，你才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctuary": {
              "name": "圣域术 Sanctuary",
              "description": "<p>你用防护能量护住一个生物，令其对攻击产生威慑。生物每次尝试攻击目标时，都必须进行一次意志豁免。若目标使用敌对动作，则法术结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> <em>圣域术</em>结束。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物可以进行其攻击，以及本回合内对目标的任何其他攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物无法攻击目标并浪费该动作。它在本回合内不能再尝试对目标进行进一步的攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物浪费该动作，且在<em>圣域术</em>剩余的持续时间内都不能尝试攻击目标。</p>\n<p>You ward a creature with protective energy that deters attacks. Creatures attempting to attack the target must attempt a Will save each time. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> <em>Sanctuary</em> ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can attempt its attack and any other attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't attack the target and wastes the action. It can't attempt further attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature wastes the action and can't attempt to attack the target for the rest of <em>sanctuary</em>'s duration.</p>"
            },
            "Sigil": {
              "name": "印记 Sigil",
              "description": "<p>你无害地将你独特的魔法印记（约1平方英寸大小）置于指定的生物或物体上。该印记可以是可见或不可见的，你可以通过使用一个交互动作接触目标，将其从一种状态切换到另一种状态。该印记可以用5分钟的工作擦洗或刮除。如果印记在生物身上，它会在一周内自然褪去。印记褪去前的时间会随着你升阶后的等级而增加。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 该印记改为在1个月后褪去。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 该印记改为在1年后褪去。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 该印记永不褪去。</p>\n<p>You harmlessly place your unique magical sigil, which is about 1 square inch in size, on the targeted creature or object. The mark can be visible or invisible, and you can change it from one state to another by using an Interact action to touch the target. The mark can be scrubbed or scraped off with 5 minutes of work. If it's on a creature, it fades naturally over the course of a week. The time before the mark fades increases depending on your heightened level.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The sigil instead fades after 1 month.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The sigil instead fades after 1 year.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The sigil never fades.</p>"
            },
            "Spear": {
              "name": "矛 Spear"
            },
            "Hide Armor": {
              "name": "兽皮护甲 Hide Armor",
              "description": "<p>由毛皮、坚韧的皮革，有时还有塑形的煮制皮革混合制成，这种护甲凭借其多层皮革提供防护，但其臃肿会使穿戴者变慢并降低机动性。</p>\n<p>A mix of furs, sturdy hide, and sometimes molded boiled leather, this armor provides protection due to its layers of leather, though its bulkiness slows the wearer down and decreases mobility.</p>"
            },
            "Torch": {
              "name": "火把 Torch"
            },
            "Key": {
              "name": "钥匙 Key"
            },
            "Purifying Flames": {
              "name": "净化之焰 Purifying Flames",
              "description": "<p>驱魔师试图用火把对一名生物进行打击，以极高的精确度发动攻击，并使火把的火焰猛然窜起。此次打击的攻击掷骰获得+2状态加值，且命中时会额外造成2d6点火焰伤害，而非仅1d6点火焰伤害。被此攻击命中的不死、魂魄或转生生物还必须进行一次@Check[will|dc:26]豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受此额外效果影响，且部分火焰反卷到驱魔师身上，对驱魔师造成@Damage[2d6[fire]]伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:26|basic]豁免）。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受此额外效果影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 净化烈焰使该生物陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续至其下个回合结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>The exorcist attempts to Strike a creature with their torch, attacking with great precision and causing the torch's fires to flare up. This Strike gains a +2 status bonus to its attack roll and inflicts an additional 2d6 fire damage on a hit instead of just 1d6 fire damage. An undead, spirit, or transmigrated creature hit by this attack must also attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by this additional effect, and some of the fire flares back onto the exorcist, inflicting @Damage[2d6[fire]] damage to the exorcist (@Check[reflex|dc:26|basic] save).</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by this additional effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The purifying flames cause the creature to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Torch Wielder": {
              "name": "火把持用者 Torch Wielder",
              "description": "<p>驱魔师将火把视为一把轻型钉头锤，命中时额外造成 1d6 火焰伤害。</p>\n<p>The exorcist treats a torch as a light mace that deals an additional 1d6 fire damage on a hit.</p>"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "人类祭司\nHuman priest",
          "prototypeToken": "驱魔师 Exorcist"
        },
        "Armory": {
          "name": "军械库 Armory",
          "tokenName": "军械库 Armory",
          "items": {
            "Crossbow": {
              "name": "弩 Crossbow",
              "description": "<p>这种远程武器在一个带握把的框架上装有类似弓的结构，该框架称为枪托。枪托上有一种机构可将弓弦锁定到位，并连接到一个扳机机构；扣动扳机后会释放张力并发射弩矢。</p>\n<p>This ranged weapon has a bow-like assembly mounted on a handled frame called a tiller. The tiller has a mechanism to lock the bowstring in place, attached to a trigger mechanism that releases the tension and launches a bolt.</p>"
            },
            "Scale Mail": {
              "name": "鳞甲 Scale Mail",
              "description": "<p>鳞甲由许多金属鳞片缝在加固的皮革衬底上组成，常做成长衫的形式，用以保护躯干、手臂和腿部。</p>\n<p>Scale mail consists of many metal scales sewn onto a reinforced leather backing, often in the form of a long shirt that protects the torso, arms, and legs.</p>"
            },
            "Studded Leather Armor": {
              "name": "镶钉皮甲 Studded Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这套皮甲用金属铆钉加固，有时还会配有小型金属板，在保留皮甲大部分灵活性的同时提供更坚固的防护。</p>\n<p>This leather armor is reinforced with metal studs and sometimes small metal plates, providing most of the flexibility of leather armor with more robust protection.</p>"
            },
            "Bolts": {
              "name": "弩矢 Bolts",
              "description": "<p>比传统箭矢更短，但结构相似，弩矢是弩使用的弹药。</p>\n<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>"
            },
            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger",
              "description": "<p>这把小型刃器武器可单手持用，在近战中刺击生物。它也可以投掷。</p>\n<p>This small, bladed weapon is held in one hand and used to stab a creature in close combat. It can also be thrown.</p>"
            },
            "Club": {
              "name": "木棒 Club",
              "description": "<p>这是一块坚固的木头，被塑形或改造用来打击敌人。棍棒可以是精心雕刻的武艺作品，也可以简单到只是一根树枝或一块木头。</p>\n<p>This is a piece of stout wood shaped or repurposed to bludgeon an enemy. Clubs can be intricately carved pieces of martial art or as simple as a tree branch or piece of wood.</p>"
            },
            "Sap": {
              "name": "树液 Sap",
              "description": "<p>短棒的致密内芯外包着柔软的包覆层，通常是用皮革套住一根铅棒。它的棒头比握把更宽，以分散打击力道，因为这种武器的目的在于击昏受害者，而非令其流血。</p>\n<p>A sap has a soft wrapping around a dense core, typically a leather sheath around a lead rod. Its head is wider than its grip to disperse the force of a blow, as the weapon's purpose is to knock out its victim rather than to draw blood.</p>"
            },
            "Frost Vial (Lesser)": {
              "name": "霜冻瓶（次等） Frost Vial (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 打击</p><hr /><p>这个小瓶中的亮蓝色液态试剂在暴露于空气时会迅速吸收热量。寒霜小瓶造成1d6寒冷伤害和1点寒冷溅射伤害。命中时，目标的速度在其下一回合结束前受到–5英尺的状态减值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.LdmzgBOTjCete4F7]{效果：寒霜小瓶}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p><hr /><p>The bright blue liquid reagents in this vial rapidly absorb heat when exposed to air. A frost vial deals 1d6 cold damage and 1 cold splash damage. On a hit, the target takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speeds until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.LdmzgBOTjCete4F7]{Effect: Frost Vial}</p>"
            },
            "Buckler": {
              "name": "圆盾 Buckler",
              "description": "<p>这面极小的盾牌是决斗者以及迅捷、轻甲战士的最爱。它通常由钢制成，并绑在你的前臂上。只要你那只手空着，或那只手拿着一个非武器的轻型物体，你就可以用你的圆盾进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.xjGwis0uaC2305pm]{举起护盾}。</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>硬度</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This very small shield is a favorite of duelists and quick, lightly armored warriors. It's typically made of steel and strapped to your forearm. You can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.xjGwis0uaC2305pm]{Raise a Shield} with your buckler as long as you have that hand free or are holding a light object that's not a weapon in that hand.</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Hardness</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword",
              "description": "<p>这些刀刃有多种形状和样式，但通常长2英尺。</p>\n<p>These blades come in a variety of shapes and styles, but they are typically 2 feet long.</p>"
            },
            "Spear": {
              "name": "矛 Spear",
              "description": "<p>一根末端带有金属尖刺的长金属杆，矛可以作为单手近战武器使用，也可以投掷。</p>\n<p>A long metal shaft ending with a metal spike, a spear can be used one-handed as a melee weapon and can be thrown.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "军械库 Armory"
        },
        "Gurglegut": {
          "name": "辘肠 Gurglegut",
          "tokenName": "辘肠 Gurglegut",
          "items": {
            "Kukri": {
              "name": "库克里弯刀 Kukri"
            },
            "Crossbow": {
              "name": "弩 Crossbow"
            },
            "Studded Leather Armor": {
              "name": "镶钉皮甲 Studded Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种皮甲上加固了金属铆钉，有时还会加装小块金属板，既保留了皮甲的大部分灵活性，又提供了更坚实的防护。</p>\n<p>This leather armor is reinforced with metal studs and sometimes small metal plates, providing most of the flexibility of leather armor with more robust protection.</p>"
            },
            "Jug of Rice Wine": {
              "name": "米酒壶 Jug of Rice Wine",
              "description": "<p>酒精是一种常见物质，可获得的种类之多令人惊叹。一剂酒精的价格取决于具体饮品。在你受酒精影响期间，你无法从恶心（状态）中恢复。</p>\n<p>若你在对抗酒精的豁免骰中失败（初始豁免除外），该苦难的阶段不会增加；提升酒精苦难阶段的唯一方式是摄入更多酒精。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> 交互（摄入）</p>\n<p><strong>豁免骰</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:12]</p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期</strong> 10分钟</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 对抗恐惧术的豁免骰获得+1物品加值（10分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}，对抗恐惧效果的豁免骰获得+1物品加值（10分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，措手不及，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}（10分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}和@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心（状态） 2}（10分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 5</strong> 笨拙 2，恶心 2，以及呆滞 2（10分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 6</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}（8小时）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 7</strong> 死亡</p>\n<p>Alcohol is a common substance available in stunning variety. The Price of a dose of alcohol depends on the specific beverage. You can't recover from the sickened condition from alcohol while affected.</p>\n<p>If you fail a saving throw against alcohol other than initial saves, the affliction's stage doesn't increase; the only way to increase the stage of alcohol's affliction is to consume more alcohol.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact (Ingested)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:12]</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}, +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear effects (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, off-guard, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> clumsy 2, sickened 2, and stupefied 2 (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} (8 hours)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 7</strong> death</p>"
            },
            "Bolts": {
              "name": "弩矢 Bolts",
              "description": "<p>弩矢比传统箭矢更短，但构造相似，是弩使用的弹药。</p>\n<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>"
            },
            "Command Onidoshi": {
              "name": "命令术 鬼徒武士 Command Onidoshi",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 辘肠厉声向区域<strong>D1</strong>内的一个御怒鬼下达命令。该御怒鬼可以使用一个反应动作来尝试对一名相邻的敌人进行一次近战打击。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Gurglegut barks out a command to a single onidoshi in area <strong>D1</strong>. That onidoshi can use a reaction to attempt a melee Strike against an adjacent foe.</p>"
            },
            "Spit Fire": {
              "name": "喷火 Spit Fire",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 辘肠喝下他米酒壶中的内容物（消耗他壶中所含的一口），随后将其喷吐到他弩上一支弩矢的燃烧矢尖上，使一个 @Template[cone|distance:20] 充满火焰爆裂，对区域内所有生物造成 @Damage[10d8[fire]|options:area-damage] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic|options:area-effect] 豁免）。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Gurglegut drinks the contents of his jug of rice wine (consuming one of the gulps contained in his jug), then spews it out across the flaming tip of a bolt in his crossbow, filling a @Template[cone|distance:20] with a blast of fire that inflicts @Damage[10d8[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:32|basic|options:area-effect] save) to all creatures in the area.</p>"
            },
            "Alcohol Lore": {
              "name": "酒精学识 Alcohol Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>独眼怪是栖居树上的族群，内心始终翻涌着想要吞食他人血肉的欲望。他们在饮食中大量以树叶与根茎作物作为补充，掌握相当丰富的农业知识，并天生拥有操控植物及其生长的力量。然而谈到肉食时，独眼怪会拒绝野兽的血肉；他们转而食用其他类人生物。不仅他们觉得其他生物的味道令人作呕，他们的身体也会排斥非类人生物的肉，因为那对他们毫无营养价值，食用后只会令他们恶心而虚弱。</p>\n<p>独眼怪不寻常的饮食需求意味着他们几乎总是与邻近文化处于对立之中。他们通常只与地精维持尚可的关系，因为地精作为一个族群较不容易因饮食而评判他人。其他社群则畏惧独眼怪——而且这种畏惧并非毫无理由——不过除了偶尔外出“收割”某个人当作下一餐之外，独眼怪往往深居简出。在某些走投无路的地区，遭遇饥荒或其他自然灾害的社群甚至可能会寻求独眼怪的协助，以受害者作为交换，换取知识或魔法援助，从而拯救他们的社群，免于在饥饿中缓慢而可怖地死去。</p>\n<p>独眼怪的单眼有时会让他们被拿来与独眼巨人相提并论。然而，这两类生物都否认彼此有任何共同的族裔，而且他们最初是在世界上完全不同的地区各自独立出现，能力也大相径庭。就独眼怪而言，他们相信祖先的事迹促成了他们的独眼。当饥荒威胁到他们的存续时，这些祖先各自挖出自己的一只眼睛，作为献给森林中邪恶魂魄的祭品，祈求拯救。独眼怪说，这些被他们称为“busaw”的魂魄，赐予了他们农业知识、对植物的力量，以及对有感知者血肉的渴望。从此以后，他们将busaw尊敬为神祇，并自称为独眼怪：崇拜busaw之人。</p>\n<p>Busos are tree-dwelling folk with a simmering desire to consume the flesh of others. They to heavily supplement their food with leaves and root crops, possess significant knowledge of agriculture, and boast innate powers over plants and their growth. In regards to meat, however, busos reject the flesh of beasts; they instead consume other humanoids. Not only do they find the taste of other creatures repulsive, but their bodies reject non-humanoid meat since it provides them no nutritional value and consuming it leaves them sickened and weak.</p>\n<p>Busos' unusual dietary needs mean they're almost always at odds with neighboring cultures. They typically maintain decent relations only with goblins, who are as a people less prone to judging others based on diet. Other communities fear busos-with some justification-though aside from the occasional forays to harvest someone for their next meal, busos tend to keep to themselves. In some desperate locations, communities faced with famine or other natural disasters might even seek out busos' aid, offering victims in exchange for knowledge or magical assistance that might save their communities from slow and terrible deaths through starvation.</p>\n<p>A buso's single eye sometimes leads to them being compared to cyclopes. However, both types of creatures deny any common ancestry, and they first appeared independently in entirely different parts of the world with substantially divergent abilities. For their part, busos believe that their ancestors' deeds gave rise to their single eyes. When faced with a famine that threatened their existence, these ancestors each cut out one of their eyes as an offering to the malevolent spirits of the forest, imploring for their salvation. Busos say that these spirits, whom they call the busaw, gave them their knowledge of agriculture, power over plants, and craving for sentient flesh. Henceforth, they revered the busaw as gods and called themselves buso: those who worship the busaw.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体雄性独眼怪\nVariant male buso",
          "prototypeToken": "辘肠 Gurglegut"
        },
        "Ogre Spider": {
          "name": "食人魔蛛 Ogre Spider",
          "tokenName": "食人魔蛛 Ogre Spider",
          "items": {
            "Bite": {
              "name": "啃咬 Bite"
            },
            "Web": {
              "name": "蛛网术 Web"
            },
            "Web Sense": {
              "name": "蛛网感知 Web Sense",
              "description": "<p>梦魇蜘蛛拥有不精确的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW]{震动感知}，用于侦测触碰其蛛网的生物所产生的震动。</p>\n<p>The dream spider has imprecise @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW]{Tremorsense} to detect the vibrations of creatures touching its web.</p>"
            },
            "Eerie Flexibility": {
              "name": "诡异的灵活性 Eerie Flexibility",
              "description": "<p>食人魔蛛可以像大型生物一样穿过狭窄空间。在挤压通过时，它可以以其全速移动。</p>\n<p>An ogre spider can fit through tight spaces as if it were a Large creature. While Squeezing, it can move at its full Speed.</p>"
            },
            "Ogre Spider Venom": {
              "name": "食人魔蛛毒液 Ogre Spider Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:22]</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] 伤害，笨拙 1，以及 力竭 1（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}，以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:22]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, clumsy 1, and enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Web Trap": {
              "name": "网缚 Web Trap",
              "description": "<p>被食人魔蛛的蛛网术攻击命中的生物将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}，并粘在最近的表面上，直到它逃脱（DC 22）。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by the ogre spider's web attack is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and stuck to the nearest surface until it Escapes (DC 22).</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>这些可怖的生物能长到与大象一样大。它们的眼睛位于宽大颚肢之上，让人联想到食人魔狞笑时那张龇牙咧嘴的面孔。食人魔觉得食人魔蛛的脸既滑稽又可爱，但在大多数情况下，食人魔试图把这些蜘蛛当作宠物饲养的结果，是食人魔死亡而蜘蛛饱餐一顿。</p><hr /><p>蜘蛛的体型差异极大，但其中许多在某种程度上都带有毒性。</p>\n<p>These terrifying creatures grow as large as elephants. The placement of their eyes above their wide mandibles evokes the grimacing visage of an ogre's leer. Ogres find ogre spider faces simultaneously amusing and adorable, but in most cases, ogres' attempts to keep these spiders as pets result in dead ogres and well-fed spiders.</p><hr /><p>Spiders range dramatically in size, yet many are to some extent venomous.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "食人魔蛛 Ogre Spider"
        },
        "Goh": {
          "name": "吴 Goh",
          "tokenName": "吴 Goh",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog07turnin.JournalEntryPage.07week7anicygr00]{第7周 - 冰冷的纠缠}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog07turnin.JournalEntryPage.07week7anicygr00]{Week 7 - An Icy Grasp}</p>",
          "blurb": "毁灭的男性渔夫\ndoomed male fisher",
          "prototypeToken": "吴 Goh"
        },
        "Aruka": {
          "name": "阿鲁卡 Aruka",
          "tokenName": "阿鲁卡 Aruka",
          "items": {
            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger"
            },
            "Rugged Clothes with Tool Belt": {
              "name": "结实的衣服（带工具腰带） Rugged Clothes with Tool Belt",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲只是一层厚实的绗缝布料，但有时会因为非常便宜而被使用。软甲比其他类型的护甲更容易受到伤害并被摧毁。重甲的价格中包含一件软甲内衬，但当穿在重甲下时，它会失去舒适特征。若你的重甲被摧毁，或在其他未穿全套重甲的情况下，你可以只穿那件软甲内衬来睡觉。这让你可以继续投入魔法护甲，并从与之关联的重甲上任何符文的力量中获益，但没有软甲内衬，其他人无法穿戴你的重甲。</p>\n<p>This armor is simply a layer of heavy, quilted cloth, but it is sometimes used because it's so inexpensive. Padded armor is easier to damage and destroy than other types of armor. Heavy armor comes with a padded armor undercoat included in its Price, though it loses the comfort trait when worn under heavy armor. You can wear just that padded armor undercoat to sleep in, if your heavy armor is destroyed, or when otherwise not wearing the full heavy armor. This allows you to keep magic armor invested and benefit from the power of any runes on the associated heavy armor, but no one else can wear your heavy armor without the padded undercoat.</p>"
            },
            "Artisan's Toolkit": {
              "name": "工匠工具包 Artisan's Toolkit",
              "description": "<p>你需要这些工具来使用制作技能将原始材料制成物品。不同的工作需要不同的套装，由GM决定；例如，铁匠的工具包与木工的工具包不同。如果你穿戴你的工匠工具包，你可以将其取出并收回，作为使用它的动作的一部分。</p>\n<p>You need these tools to create items from raw materials with the Craft skill. Different sets are needed for different work, as determined by the GM; for example, a blacksmith's toolkit differs from a woodworker's toolkit. If you wear your artisan's toolkit, you can draw and replace it as part of the action that uses it.</p>"
            },
            "Assorted Maps": {
              "name": "杂项地图 Assorted Maps",
              "description": "<p>地图并不常见。你能找到的大多数地图都很简单且实用。测绘地图会以极佳的细节描绘单一地点。其中一张地图会在你进行生存检定以及任何用于回忆知识的技能检定时给予你+1物品加值，前提是这些检定与地图所详述的地点相关。GM决定在任何地点能获得哪些地图。</p>\n<p>Maps are uncommon. Most maps you can find are simple and functional. A survey map details a single location in excellent detail. One of these maps gives you a +1 item bonus to Survival checks and any skill checks to Recall Knowledge, provided the checks are related to the location detailed on the map. The GM determines what maps are available in any location.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Apprentice's Ambition": {
              "name": "学徒的野心 Apprentice's Ambition",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 一名直属上级正在监督学徒</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 学徒在其下个回合结束前获得+2环境加值，适用于攻击掷骰、伤害掷骰、豁免骰与技能检定。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A direct superior is supervising the apprentice</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The apprentice gains a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, saving throws, and skill checks until the end of their next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Geography Lore": {
              "name": "地理学识 Geography Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>雄心勃勃的学徒在所有城市都能找到。这些人通常更年轻，在学习自己的手艺时寻求师傅的认可。许多人渴望展现其技艺背后的艺术性，希望有朝一日自己也能成为大师。下方描绘的是一名学徒制图师。</p><hr /><p>专业能力是通过多年的努力与往往枯燥的工作锻造而成的。工匠是其技艺的大师，能够创作既实用又美观的作品。</p>\n<p>Ambitious apprentices can be found in all cities. These individuals are generally younger and seek the approval of their masters as they learn their craft. Many yearn to exemplify the artistry behind their craft, one day becoming masters themselves. Depicted below is an apprentice cartographer.</p><hr /><p>Expertise is forged through years of effort and often tedious work. Artisans are masters of their craft, able to create works both practical and beautiful.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性狐妖学徒\nFemale kitsune apprentice",
          "prototypeToken": "阿鲁卡 Aruka"
        },
        "Phantom Wolf": {
          "name": "魅影狼 Phantom Wolf",
          "tokenName": "魅影狼 Phantom Wolf",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标的思维陷入混沌，并用一道心灵冲击将其击晕。冲击造成等同于你施法能力调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免上大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害提高 1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你向目标植入恐惧；它必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，持续1轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个由简单声音构成的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>高度强化（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>高度强化（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120英尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Walk the Ethereal Line": {
              "name": "游于两界 Walk the Ethereal Line",
              "description": "<p>魅影行走在灵界与物质位面之间的细线上，以便同时存在于两个位面上。</p>\n<p>他们可以通过再次使用此能力，转回仅存在于灵界。</p>\n<p>The phantom walks the thin line between the Ethereal and Material Planes in order to exist on both planes simultaneously.</p>\n<p>They can shift back to solely the Ethereal Plane by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Susceptible to Death": {
              "name": "易于死亡 Susceptible to Death",
              "description": "<p>尽管魅影并非活着，但它们也不是不死，并且它们对死亡效果有着独特的脆弱性。</p>\n<p>若某个魅影的生命值因死亡效果（例如来自某个法术，如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute}）而降至 0，它会立刻被送往灵魂之河，在那里其灵魂会重新踏上通往来世的通常道路。</p>\n<p>Though phantoms aren't alive, neither are they undead, and they are uniquely vulnerable to the effects of death.</p>\n<p>A phantom whose Hit Points are reduced to 0 as a result of a death effect (such as from a spell like @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute}) is immediately whisked away to the River of Souls, where their soul resumes the usual path to the afterlife.</p>"
            },
            "Vulnerable to Kindness": {
              "name": "友善易伤 Vulnerable to Kindness",
              "description": "<p>魅影能看到且听到的30尺内任意生物，都可以以一个具有听觉、专注、语言以及心灵（特征）的两动作行动，向它发出平静而友善的问候。以这种方式向魅影问候的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[diplomacy|dc:17] 检定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[4d8[mental]] 伤害，并且处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[2d8[mental]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[1d8[mental]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 魅影不受影响，并且在1轮内不受该弱点影响。</p>\n<p>Any creature within 30 feet that the phantom can see and hear can issue a calm and friendly greeting to it as a two-action activity with the auditory, concentrate, linguistic, and mental traits. A creature greeting the phantom in this manner must attempt a @Check[diplomacy|dc:17] check.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[4d8[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[2d8[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[1d8[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The phantom is unaffected, and is not affected by this weakness for 1 round.</p>"
            },
            "Pack Attack": {
              "name": "群体攻击 Pack Attack",
              "description": "<p>魅影狼的打击对至少有一名其盟友在触及范围内的生物额外造成1d4点伤害。</p>\n<p>The phantom wolf's Strikes deal an additional 1d4 damage to creatures within reach of at least one of its allies.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>在大多数神学家看来，灵魂通往来世的典型轨迹相当直接。当凡人死亡时，其灵魂进入灵魂之河，并最终抵达骨园，在那里接受法莱斯玛的裁决。被裁决的灵魂会前往其适当的终极安息之域——天堂、地狱、阿巴顿，诸如此类——并在那里成为祈并者。</p>\n<p>然而，当排队等待裁决的灵魂过早离开灵魂之河、并被转移进灵界时，情况就会变得复杂。无论是由于夜鬼婆这类险恶的闯入者、恶性的位面魔法，还是甚至命运本身所致，这些灵魂都会从生死的自然秩序中被撬离，并在某种炼狱般的状态中徘徊。与祈并者不同，这些灵界魅影保留着死前生活的记忆；而与幽灵等魂魄不同，魅影并未沾染不死的污秽影响——至少起初没有，尽管堕化的威胁始终沉重地笼罩着魅影的存在。有些最终屈服于那样的命运，另一些则终会重新汇入灵魂之河。在此之前，这些游荡的灵魂自成一类——既无真正的归宿，也无明确的图谋或目的。</p>\n<p>许多魅影并不想继续维持这种诡异的炼狱状态，要么是因为他们想继续沿着灵魂之河完成旅程，要么是因为他们畏惧不死的堕化。为了完成自然的灵性循环并接受裁决，从而得以前往来世，魅影只需设法回到灵魂之河即可。然而，这样的追寻绝非易事——灵界朦胧的迷雾足以让最有经验的旅人也迷失方向，而诸多掠食者在这片领域中游弋，寻找走散的灵魂以将其束缚或吞噬。</p>\n<p>The typical trajectory for souls passing to the afterlife is fairly straightforward, according to most theologians. When a mortal dies, their soul enters the River of Souls and eventually reaches the Boneyard, where it is judged by Pharasma. The judged soul moves onto its appropriate domain of final rest-Heaven, Hell, Abaddon, and so forth-where it becomes a petitioner.</p>\n<p>Complications arise, however, when a soul in queue for judgment prematurely departs from the River of Souls and is shunted into the Ethereal Plane. Whether as a result of nefarious interlopers like night hags, malignant planar magic, or even fate, these souls become dislodged from the natural order of life and death and linger in a sort of purgatory. Unlike petitioners, these ethereal phantoms retain memories of their life before death, and unlike spirits such as ghosts, phantoms aren't tinged with the foul influences of undeath-at least, not at first, though the threat of corruption hangs heavy over a phantom's existence. Some eventually succumb to that fate, while others eventually rejoin the River of Souls. Until then, these wandering souls are a kind unto themselves-one without a true home, agenda, or purpose.</p>\n<p>Many phantoms have no desire to remain in their strange state of purgatory, either because they seek to continue their journey through the River of Souls or because they fear the corruption of undeath. In order to complete the natural spiritual cycle and become judged so they can continue to the afterlife, a phantom must simply find a way back into the River of Souls. Such a quest is no easy feat, however-the hazy mists of the Ethereal Plane can befuddle even the most experienced traveler, and numerous predators prowl the realm in search of stray souls to bind or devour.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体魅影\nVariant phantom",
          "prototypeToken": "魅影狼 Phantom Wolf"
        },
        "Nosoi": {
          "name": "疫鸟 Nosoi",
          "tokenName": "疫鸟 Nosoi",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Read Omens": {
              "name": "读取预兆 Read Omens",
              "description": "<p>你窥视未来。选择一个你计划在1周内参与的特定目标或活动，或一个你预计可能在1周内发生的事件。你会获知一条隐晦的线索或建议，可能有助于所选事件，通常以押韵诗句或预兆的形式呈现。</p>\n<p>You peek into the future. Choose a particular goal or activity you plan to engage in within 1 week, or an event you expect might happen within 1 week. You learn a cryptic clue or piece of advice that could help with the chosen event, often in the form of a rhyme or omen.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其开口回答你提出的三个问题。此法术唤起的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须大体完整，法术才能生效。尸体受到的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越像拼凑出来的内容，而且它必须具备喉咙与嘴巴才能说话。若在过去一周内有人曾对该尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以尝试进行一次意志豁免来抗拒回答问题，并使用该生物死亡时的原始数据进行豁免，其结果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄会作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实回答，但它的回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你或试图拖延，使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且较不重复，尽管仍然晦涩。它进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)": {
              "name": "隐形（意志施放，仅自身） Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)",
              "description": "<p>幻术使光线在目标周围发生弯曲，使其变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。这使其对所有生物而言均为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪}，尽管这些生物可以尝试寻找目标，从而使其对他们而言改为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿}。如果目标使用敌对动作，法术将在该敌对动作完成后结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 法术持续1分钟，但即使目标使用敌对动作也不会结束。</p>\n<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"
            },
            "Noise Blast": {
              "name": "噪音爆破 Noise Blast",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音爆发而出，造成 2d10 音波伤害。每个生物都必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全部伤害，并在 1 轮内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋} 状态。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到双倍伤害，在 1 分钟内耳聋，并且处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1} 状态。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Beak": {
              "name": "喙 Beak"
            },
            "Lifesense 60 feet": {
              "name": "生命感知 60尺 Lifesense 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Lifesense]</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟会呈现为渡鸦或鸣禽的外貌。这不会改变它的速度，或它以打击进行攻击和造成伤害时的调整值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>The nosoi takes the appearance of a raven or songbird. This doesn't change its Speed or its attack and damage modifiers with its Strikes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Haunting Melody": {
              "name": "萦绕旋律 Haunting Melody",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟吟唱一首令人着迷的歌。每个处于 @Template[emanation|distance:60] 内的活体或不死生物都必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:18] 意志豁免。该效果持续至疫鸟下个回合结束，但疫鸟可以维持它。豁免成功的生物在24小时内暂时免疫。尽管这是一个心灵效果，此能力仍会影响无心智的不死生物。</p>\n<p>招魂者免疫此能力。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物对疫鸟处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{着迷} 状态。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物对疫鸟着迷，并且必须在其回合中将其每个动作都用于尽可能迅速地向疫鸟靠近，同时避开明显的危险。如果一名着迷的生物与疫鸟相邻，它会保持不动且不采取动作。如果该生物受到攻击，着迷结束。</p>\n<p>The nosoi croons an entrancing song. Each living or undead creature within a @Template[emanation|distance:60] must attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save. The effect lasts until the end of the nosoi's next turn, but the nosoi can Sustain it. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 24 hours. Despite being a mental effect, this ability affects mindless undead.</p>\n<p>Psychopomps are immune to this ability.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} with the nosoi.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is fascinated with the nosoi and must spend each of its actions on its turn to move closer to the nosoi as expediently as possible while avoiding obvious dangers. If a fascinated creature is adjacent to the nosoi, it stays still and doesn't act. If the creature is attacked, the fascination ends.</p>"
            },
            "Shepherd's Touch": {
              "name": "牧羊人的接触 Shepherd's Touch",
              "description": "<p>疫鸟的打击具有<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}</em>属性符文的效果，并且对活体生物造成额外的 @Damage[1d6[void]] 伤害，或对不死造成 @Damage[1d6[vitality]] 伤害。</p>\n<p>A nosoi's Strikes have the benefit of a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}</em> property rune and deal an additional @Damage[1d6[void]] damage to living creatures or @Damage[1d6[vitality]] damage to undead.</p>"
            },
            "Boneyard Lore": {
              "name": "骨园学识 Boneyard Lore"
            },
            "Library Lore": {
              "name": "司书学识 Library Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>疫鸟看起来像啼鴂、麻雀或其他戴着厚重皮革瘟疫医生面具的小鸟。它们是骨园的文书、信使与抄写员，见证裁决、引导灵魂，并总体上承担维持骨园运转的行政杂务。大多数疫鸟都格外健谈，迫不及待地讨论它们认为自己各自任务有多么重要。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>招魂者是骨园中亡者的守护者与引路者；骨园是广阔的墓冢位面，在那里凡人的灵魂被审判，并被送往永恒的奖励或诅咒。招魂者确保亡者接受自己从凡世过渡的现实，并被恰当地分派到合适的来世。它们也保护灵魂不被超自然掠食者捕食。几乎所有招魂者都戴着面具，尤其是在它们很可能与凡人打交道时；不过它们所戴面具的种类如同招魂者本身一样多样。骨园的法庭以雷葵安语主持审理，这是一种庄重却富有旋律的语言，说话缓慢，并伴随各种音调变化。</p>\n<p>许多招魂者深度参与骨园庞大的官僚体系。很少有招魂者追求怜悯、正义或个人利益；它们对法莱斯玛及其骨园的职责至高无上。即便如此，个别招魂者会以不同方式解读自身职责，这可能使它们与凡人甚至彼此发生冲突。</p>\n<p>A nosoi resembles a whippoorwill, sparrow, or other small bird wearing a heavy leather plague doctor's mask. They are the clerks, messengers, and scribes of the Boneyard, witnessing judgments, directing souls, and generally performing the administrative grunt work that keeps the Boneyard functioning. Most nosois are particularly chatty and eager to discuss how important they consider their individual assignments to be.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Psychopomps are guardians and shepherds of the dead in the Boneyard, the vast plane of graves where mortal souls are judged and sent on to their eternal rewards or damnations. Psychopomps ensure that the dead come to terms with their transition from mortality and are properly sorted into the appropriate afterlife. They also protect souls from being preyed upon by supernatural predators. Nearly all psychopomps wear masks, especially when they're likely to be interacting with mortals, although the types of masks they wear are as varied as the psychopomps themselves. The courts of the Boneyard preside in Requian, a somber yet melodic language spoken slowly with various tonal shifts.</p>\n<p>Many psychopomps are intimately involved with the Boneyard's massive bureaucracy. Few pursue mercy, justice, or personal gain; their duties to Pharasma and her Boneyard are supreme. Nevertheless, individual psychopomps interpret their duties in different ways, which might put them in conflict with mortals or even with each other.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "疫鸟 Nosoi"
        },
        "Ithiniak": {
          "name": "伊西尼亚克 Ithiniak",
          "tokenName": "伊希尼亚克 Ithiniak",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Mirage": {
              "name": "蜃景 Mirage",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个幻觉，使自然地形在视觉、听觉、触觉与嗅觉上看起来像另一种地形。这不会伪装该区域内的任何建筑或生物。</p>\n<p>任何触碰该幻觉或使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 动作来检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 你的影像也能伪装建筑或创造虚幻的建筑（但仍不会伪装生物）。</p>\n<p>You create an illusion that causes natural terrain to look, sound, feel, and smell like a different kind of terrain. This doesn't disguise any structures or creatures in the area.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the illusion or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> Your image can also disguise structures or create illusory structures (but still doesn't disguise creatures).</p>"
            },
            "Blindness": {
              "name": "目盲术 Blindness",
              "description": "<p>你使目标目盲。效果由目标的强韧豁免决定。随后该目标获得持续 1 分钟的暂时免疫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲} 状态，直到其下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标目盲 1 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标永久目盲。</p>\n<p>You blind the target. The effect is determined by the target's Fortitude save. The target then becomes temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} until its next turn begins.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Blinded for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Blinded permanently.</p>"
            },
            "Cleanse Affliction (Curse Only)": {
              "name": "净化苦难（仅限诅咒） Cleanse Affliction (Curse Only)",
              "description": "<p>温和的恢复性魔法会击退毒素与更复杂病症的效果。选择目标身上的一种苦难，例如诅咒、疾病或毒素。若其已推进至第一阶段之后，将阶段降低1。对于同一例苦难，此降低仅能应用一次；当其被完全治愈时，该例即告结束。虽然无法再次进行该降低，但该法术的升阶版本会在每次施放时尝试反制。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>若该苦难为疾病或毒素，尝试反制该苦难。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>若该苦难为诅咒、疾病或毒素，尝试反制该苦难。</p>\n<p>Gentle restorative magic pushes back the effects of toxins and more complex maladies. Choose an affliction on the target, such as a curse, disease, or poison. If it has advanced past stage one, reduce the stage by one. This reduction can be applied only once to a given case of an affliction, with the case ending when it's completely cured. Although the reduction can't occur again, heightened versions of this spell attempt to counteract with each casting.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a disease or poison.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a curse, disease, or poison.</p>"
            },
            "Deafness": {
              "name": "耳聋术 Deafness",
              "description": "<p>目标失去听觉；它必须尝试一次强韧豁免。然后该目标在1分钟内暂时免疫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标处于耳聋状态10分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标永久耳聋。</p>\n<p>The target loses hearing; it must attempt a Fortitude save. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Deafened for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Deafened permanently.</p>"
            },
            "Tangle Vine": {
              "name": "缠结藤蔓 Tangle Vine",
              "description": "<p>一条藤蔓凭空出现，从你手中甩出并抽打着缠向目标。对目标尝试一次法术攻击掷骰。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{法术效果：纠缠藤蔓}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}状态，并在1轮内其速度承受–10尺的环境减值。它可以尝试@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{逃脱}来对抗你的法术DC，以移除该减值与禁足状态。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标在1轮内其速度承受–10尺的环境减值。它可以尝试逃脱来对抗你的法术DC，以移除该减值。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 效果持续2轮。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 效果持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>A vine appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack roll against the target.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{Spell Effect: Tangle Vine}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the immobilized condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Claws": {
              "name": "爪击 Claws"
            },
            "Scent Curse": {
              "name": "诅咒嗅觉 Scent Curse",
              "description": "<p>食厄精能够嗅到30尺内等级等于或低于其自身等级的诅咒存在；这是一种模糊感官。</p>\n<p>The imprecasia can smell the presence of curses of a level equal to or lower than their own level within 30 feet; this is an imprecise sense.</p>"
            },
            "Drink Death": {
              "name": "饮下死亡 Drink Death",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一个位于食厄精30英尺内的生物处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死（状态）}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 食厄精吸气，将一缕细长的蓝色雾气从濒死生物的身体中抽出并吸入口中。该濒死生物的濒死（状态）值降低1，且食厄精恢复@Damage[(2d10+9)[healing]]生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet of the imprecasia is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The imprecasia inhales, drawing a thin blue streak of vapor out of the dying creature's body into their mouth. The dying creature's dying condition is reduced by 1, and the imprecasia regains @Damage[(2d10+9)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Devour Curse": {
              "name": "吞噬诅咒 Devour Curse",
              "description": "<p>食厄精对一个受诅咒影响的生物施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{净化苦难}，但施放时间为2个动作而非10分钟。若其成功移除诅咒，它还会从该生物身上汲取生命力，使其除非在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:30] 豁免中成功，否则陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2}）。若诅咒被移除，食厄精不会消耗其作为原始系天生法术的移除诅咒的那次使用次数。</p>\n<h2>规则与建议以物品为目标</h2>\n<p>食厄精可以对受诅咒的物品施放移除诅咒，而非对生物施放，但它无法对该物品使用吞噬诅咒。它只能对等级不高于自身等级的物品如此做；成功时，若该物品等级等于或高于食厄精等级–4，则该物品在24小时内不再受诅咒；若该物品等级低于该值，则该物品永久不再受诅咒。</p>\n<p>The imprecasia casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{Cleanse Affliction} against a curse afflicting a creature, but with a cast of two actions rather than 10 minutes. If they succeed in removing the curse, they also drains vitality from the creature, causing it to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|dc:30] save (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure). If the curse is removed, the imprecasia doesn't expend that use of remove curse as a primal innate spell.</p>\n<h2>Targeting Items</h2>\n<p>An imprecasia can cast remove curse on a cursed item rather than on a creature, but they can't use Devour Curse on it. They can only do so on an item that's of a level equal to or less than their own level; on a success, the item is uncursed for 24 hours if it's of a level equal to or higher than the imprecasia's level –4, or uncursed permanently if it's lower level than that.</p>"
            },
            "Homeland's Hostility": {
              "name": "家园敌意 Homeland's Hostility",
              "description": "<p>被食厄精的爪击造成伤害的生物必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:30]意志豁免。若失败，它将把食厄精60尺内的所有地形视为困难地形。</p>\n<p>A creature that takes damage from the imprecasia's claws must attempt a @Check[will|dc:30] save. On a failure, it treats all terrain within 60 feet of an imprecasia as difficult terrain.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>食厄精，通常被称为食咒者，是一种离群独居的精类，会被诅咒所散发的能量吸引。它们看起来像消瘦的人形生物，长着阴影般的翅膀、带有锋利爪子的细长双手，以及昆虫般的头颅与羽状触角。</p>\n<p>食厄精出现在某个地区，意味着这片土地正受困扰，但它们并不招人厌恶。恰恰相反，食厄精的行踪是人人觊觎的情报，因为它们有能力将物体与生物身上的诅咒彻底吞噬。许多背负诅咒重担的人会去寻找食咒者，其中大多数会欣然收下毁灭的物体，或出于怜悯而摧毁某个人身上的诅咒。</p>\n<p>食厄精绝不会接受“治疗”一片被诅咒的土地或受侵蚀的区域这种想法。它甚至可能会试图强化某个地区的苦难，只为确保稳定的食物来源。更大胆的食厄精会追踪受诅咒的家族长达数代，以他们的不幸为食，直到诅咒终结或血脉断绝。任何试图破除这类诅咒的人，都可能发现自己成了食厄精的敌人——它正捍卫着自己的养分来源。</p>\n<p>An imprecasia, commonly known as a curse eater, is a solitary fey drawn to the energy emanating from curses. They appear as emaciated humanoid creatures with shadowy wings, long thin hands with sharp claws, and insectile heads with feathery antenna.</p>\n<p>An imprecasia's appearance in a region signifies the land is troubled, but they're not unpopular creatures. On the contrary, an imprecasia's whereabouts are coveted information, as they have the ability to fully consume curses on objects and creatures. Many carrying the weight of a curse seek out curse eaters, most of whom will gladly accept doomed objects or charitably destroy an individual's curse.</p>\n<p>An imprecasia will never accept the idea of healing a cursed land or blighted region. One might even seek to strengthen the afflictions on a region simply to ensure a regular supply of food. A bolder imprecasia tracks cursed families over generations, feeding off their misfortune until the curse ends or the bloodline dies off. Any who attempt to destroy such curses may find themselves the enemy of an imprecasia defending their source of sustenance.</p>",
          "blurb": "男性咒骂\nMale imprecasi",
          "prototypeToken": "伊西尼亚克 Ithiniak"
        },
        "Yeri": {
          "name": "耶里 Yeri",
          "tokenName": "耶里 Yeri",
          "items": {
            "Proboscis Tongue": {
              "name": "长喙舌 Proboscis Tongue"
            },
            "Entrails": {
              "name": "内脏 Entrails"
            },
            "Spewing Bile": {
              "name": "喷吐胆汁 Spewing Bile",
              "description": "<p>当庞南加兰受到挥砍伤害时，其伤口会向相邻的生物喷射胆汁，造成 @Damage[2d10[poison]] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:19|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p>庞南加兰失去其“喷射胆汁”和“庞南加兰胆汁”能力，直到其下一回合结束。</p>\n<p>When the penanggalan takes slashing damage, their wound spews bile on adjacent creatures, dealing @Damage[2d10[poison]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:19|basic] save).</p>\n<p>The penanggalan loses their spewing bile and penanggalan bile abilities until the end of their next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Constrict": {
              "name": "缠绕挤压 Constrict",
              "description": "<p>@Damage[(2d4+3)[钝击]], @Check[强韧|dc:21|基础]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>\n<p>@Damage[(2d4+3)[bludgeoning]], @Check[fortitude|dc:21|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>"
            },
            "Elongate Tongue": {
              "name": "伸长舌头 Elongate Tongue",
              "description": "<p>庞南加兰的舌头伸长，薄膜被拉伸并变得半透明。直到回合结束，庞南加兰的长鼻舌头打击拥有10英尺触及，且任何目标在该打击面前都处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}，除非其察觉DC为22或更高，或拥有精确感知@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}事物的能力。</p>\n<p>The penanggalan's tongue extends, the membrane stretching and becoming translucent. Until the end of the turn, the penanggalan's proboscis tongue Strikes have a 10-foot reach, and any target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against the Strike unless it has a Perception DC of 22 or higher or the ability to precisely sense @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} things.</p>"
            },
            "Penanggalan Bile": {
              "name": "庞南加兰胆汁 Penanggalan Bile",
              "description": "<p>休息不会降低庞南加兰胆汁造成的 drained 值</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:19]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}（1周）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2}（1周）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 3}（1周）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> 死亡</p>\n<p>Rest doesn't decrease the drained value from penanggalan bile</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:19]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (1 week)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} (1 week)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 3} (1 week)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> dead</p>"
            },
            "Ride Corpse": {
              "name": "骑乘尸体 Ride Corpse",
              "description": "<p>庞南加兰将自己的内脏塞入其类人生物的身体中，使其能够看起来并像普通人类一样四处行动。该身体拥有10点生命值，且防御与庞南加兰相同。</p>\n<p>当该身体被摧毁时，庞南加兰会毫发无伤地被弹出。该身体变为一具尸体；若既未被庞南加兰控制，也未存放于炼金缸中，则会如常腐烂。</p>\n<p>The penanggalan inserts their entrails into their humanoid body, allowing them to appear as and move about like a normal human. The body has 10 Hit Points and the same defenses as the penanggalan.</p>\n<p>When the body is destroyed, the penanggalan is ejected unharmed. The body becomes a corpse, and if it is neither controlled by the penanggalan nor stored in an alchemical vat, it decays as normal.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            },
            "Midwifery Lore": {
              "name": "产妇学识 Midwifery Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>庞南加兰以幼者的鲜血与内脏为食。当它们那嗜同类的饥渴发作时，庞南加兰会用一种带有醋味的炼金物质浸洗自己的身体。一旦没入这份调制液中，它们的脖颈便会从两侧撕裂开来，使头颅得以向上漂浮，并将肺、胃与肠子一并扯出。它们把身体留在醋浴里，犹如蜕壳的螃蟹丢下自己的老壳，随后飞去寻找一个充满血肉与脏器的受害者。</p>\n<p>这些生物饥饿时虽丑恶骇人，但庞南加兰在穿戴着自己的身体时，看起来却年轻而健康。这正是它们存在的本质：它们曾与异界存在相交，以换取一生的青春，代价则是对幼者的邪恶饥欲。但它们并非不死。它们会像曾经的凡人一样正常老去并死亡——只是在这一存在期间始终保有年轻的外貌。</p>\n<p>要在人群中辨认出庞南加兰可能颇为困难。它们颈部在分离处围成一圈的淡淡疤痕可以被解释为瑕疵，也能藏匿在华丽的项链之下。与此同时，庞南加兰那具被保存的身体散发出的微弱酸味虽显古怪，但在它们常出没的闷热热带地区、汗味浓重的环境里并不罕见。</p>\n<p>Penanggalans feed on the blood and entrails of the young. When their cannibalistic hunger strikes, penanggalans bathe their bodies in an alchemical substance that smells like vinegar. Once submerged in the concoction, their neck rips from side to side, allowing their head to float upward and pull out their lungs, stomach, and intestines. They leave their bodies in the vinegar bath much like a molting crab leaves its old shell, then fly off to find a victim filled with blood and guts.</p>\n<p>As grotesque as these creatures are when hungry, the penanggalan appears young and healthy while wearing their body. Such is the nature of their existence: they consorted with otherworldy beings, gaining a lifetime of youth in exchange for an evil hunger for the young. But they are not immortal. They age and die normally like the people they once were-they just retain their youthfulness throughout this existence.</p>\n<p>It can be difficult to spot a penanggalan among the populace. The faint scar ringing their neck at the point of separation can be explained away as a blemish, and it can be hidden under a flashy necklace. Meanwhile the faint, sour scent of a penanggalan's preserved body, while peculiar, is not uncommon in the sweaty tropics they frequent.</p>",
          "blurb": "精英雌性庞南加兰\nElite female penanggalan",
          "prototypeToken": "耶里 Yeri"
        },
        "Haunting Presence": {
          "name": "萦绕之灵 Haunting Presence",
          "tokenName": "萦魂之息 Haunting Presence",
          "items": {
            "Ghostly Menace": {
              "name": "幽魂威胁 Ghostly Menace",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 发生一次作祟遭遇</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 苦迦菩提的存在以一种令人恐惧的方式显现——一声突如其来的痛苦尖叫，一阵爆裂般涌出的红色蝴蝶，瞬间压倒性的腐朽气息，或类似情形。一名随机PC受到 @Damage[(2d6+3)[mental]] 伤害（@Check[will|dc:19|basic] 意志豁免），随后这股作祟的存在消失无踪，只留下心灵上的伤痕与创伤。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A haunt encounter occurs</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Kugaptee's presence makes itself known in a frightening way—a sudden shriek of agony, an explosive burst of red butterflies, a momentarily overwhelming air of decay, or the like. A random PC takes @Damage[(2d6+3)[mental]] damage (@Check[will|dc:19|basic] save), and then the haunting presence vanishes, leaving behind nothing but mental scars and trauma.</p>"
