          "disable": "<p>@Check[religion|dc:16] 以驱逐作祟，或点亮<em>长明灯</em>（自动解除这些作祟）</p>\n<p>@Check[religion|dc:16] to exorcise the haunt, or light the <em>Eternal Lantern</em> (automatically disables these haunts)</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>幽灵般的声响或幻影的惊鸿一瞥移动着，意在惊吓或分散那些行走在街道上的人。</p>\n<p>Ghostly sounds or glimpses of apparitions move to startle or distract those who walk the streets.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>注意到一种令人不安的感觉</p>\n<p>to notice an unsettling sensation</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "萦绕身影 Haunting Presence"
