          "tokenName": "瓦砾 Rubble",
          "items": {
            "Book of Warding Prayers": {
              "name": "护卫祷告之书 Book of Warding Prayers",
              "description": "<p>侍奉于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{法莱斯玛}。</p><hr /><p>此书书脊上装饰着以外层位面语言书写的文字，封面上蚀刻着一位神祇的圣徽。<em>护卫祷告之书</em>各自奉献给某位特定神祇，同时也是该神祇的宗教圣徽。</p><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注）</p><p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><p><strong>触发</strong> 你上一动作是施放一个由你的神祇赐予、且你已预备的神圣法术</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你与@Template[type:emanation|distance:30]内所有盟友获得魂魄伤害抗力10，持续1分钟。若你施放的法术具有圣洁（特征），你可以改为给予对圣洁效果的抗力，而非魂魄伤害；若你的法术具有邪秽（特征），你可以改为给予对邪秽效果的抗力，而非魂魄伤害。</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.GqXIV46JqB8x8eEN]{效果：护卫祷告之书}</p>\n<p>Devoted to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{Pharasma}.</p><hr /><p>Script in a language of the Outer Planes adorns this book's spine, and a deity's symbol is etched on its cover. <em>Books of warding prayers</em> are each devoted to a particular deity and are also a religious symbol of that deity.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your last action was to cast a prepared divine spell granted by your deity</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You and all your allies in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] gain resistance 10 to spirit damage for 1 minute. You can instead choose to grant resistance to holy effects instead of spirit damage if the spell you cast had the holy trait, or resistance to unholy effects instead of spirit if your spell had the unholy trait.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.GqXIV46JqB8x8eEN]{Effect: Book of Warding Prayers}</p>"
            }
          },
