            "Amphisbaena Venom": {
              "name": "双头蛇毒液 Amphisbaena Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免投掷</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]]伤害并@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段2</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]]伤害并@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭2}且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段3</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]]伤害并@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[3d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} (1 round)</p>"
