            "Battle Medic's Baton": {
              "name": "战地医师的警棍 Battle Medic's Baton",
              "description": "<p>这根短小的青铜杖呈一条盘绕其上的蛇的形状。持握它时，你在医疗检定上获得+1物品加值。</p>\n<p><strong>启用</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（专注，操作）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每小时一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你拥有@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.wYerMk6F1RZb0Fwt]{战斗医疗}动作</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你使用战斗医疗。该目标对你的战斗医疗暂时免疫1小时，而非1天。</p>\n<p>This short bronze rod has the form of a serpent coiled around it. While you hold it, you gain a +1 item bonus to Medicine checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.wYerMk6F1RZb0Fwt]{Battle Medicine} action</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You use Battle Medicine. The target is temporarily immune to your Battle Medicine for 1 hour instead of 1 day.</p>"
