            "Putrid Plague": {
              "name": "腐烂瘟疫 Putrid Plague",
              "description": "<p>由腐烂瘟疫造成的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{失去意识（特征）} 状态不会自行好转，直到疾病被治愈为止。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免投掷</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 携带者，无不良效果（[[/gmr 1d4 #hours]]{1d4 小时}）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}（1 天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> 恶心 1 且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（1 天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{失去意识（特征）}（1 天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 5</strong> 死亡</p>\n<p>The @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} conditions from putrid plague don't improve on their own until the disease is cured.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect ([[/gmr 1d4 #hours]]{1d4 hours})</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Sickened 1 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> dead</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>巨鼠是普通害兽的巨型版本。它们通常数量众多，但由于它们无法挤进寻常老鼠常用来躲藏的那些角落缝隙，所以更容易被发现并加以消灭。它们大多生活在下水道里，可以从上方街道捡食残渣；但也有一些巨鼠家族栖居在更偏远的地方，例如阴湿的洞穴、森林或丘陵。老鼠的生存能力极强，几乎在世界上任何地方都能找到，不过相比寒冷地区，它们更偏好温带或温暖的气候。</p>\n<p>尽管它单靠咬伤并不致命（除非对非常年幼或非常年迈者），巨鼠却携带着世界各地啮齿动物常见的腐臭鼠疫——这种瘟疫完全足以蹂躏乡村社区。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>老鼠是无处不在的威胁，几乎在世界上每一处聚居地的下水道与街道上都能见到它们穿梭乱窜。虽然一只普通老鼠从脚边窜过就可能让一般路人吃惊甚至害怕，但巨鼠与鼠群要危险得多。</p>\n<p>Giant rats are enormous versions of the common vermin. They are typically found in abundant numbers, but since they cannot fit in the nooks where mundane rats typically hide, they are much easier to locate and exterminate. They mostly live in sewers where they can scavenge from the streets above, but some families of giant rats live in more remote locations, such as dank caves, forests or hills. Rats are incredibly adept survivors and can be found nearly anywhere in the world, though they tend to favor temperate or warm climates as opposed to cold regions.</p>\n<p>Although its bite alone is not lethal except to the very young or very old, the giant rat carries the putrid plague common to rodents around the world—a pestilence more than capable of ravaging rural communities.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Rats are a ubiquitous menace, scurrying through the sewers and on the streets of nearly every settlement in the world. Though a regular rat darting underfoot might startle or even frighten the average passerby, giant rats and rat swarms are far more dangerous.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "巨鼠 Giant Rat"
        },
        "Slime Mold": {
          "name": "黏菌怪 Slime Mold",
          "tokenName": "黏菌怪 Slime Mold",
          "items": {
            "Pseudopod": {
              "name": "假足 Pseudopod"
            },
            "Motion Sense": {
              "name": "运动感知 Motion Sense",
              "description": "<p>黏菌怪能通过振动以及空气或水的移动来感知附近的生物。</p>\n<p>A slime mold can sense nearby creatures through vibration and air or water movement.</p>"
            },
            "Slime Rot": {
              "name": "黏液腐疫 Slime Rot",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期</strong> [[/gmr 1d4 #days]]{1d4天}</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1} 且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> 同阶段 1（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}，且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> 同阶段 3（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 5</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2} 外加 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}（无法通过察觉检定醒来）（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 6</strong> 死亡，且尸体爆裂以释放一只新的黏菌怪</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> [[/gmr 1d4 #days]]{1d4 days}</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> as stage 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> as stage 3 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} (no Perception check to wake up) (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> dead, and the body erupts to release a new slime mold</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>黏菌怪看起来像一堆泥土与碎屑的隆起物，上面覆盖着厚厚一层真菌，散发出淡淡的腐败臭味。实际上，这些真菌与黏菌怪是共生关系：它们充当外部消化系统，同时从黏菌怪那里获得所需的养分。这种软泥会一动不动地静止着，直到活体猎物进入其触及范围，随后便会用令人作呕的拟足猛然抽打而出。通过接触，黏菌怪能将一种名为“黏菌腐烂”的恶性传染病传给猎物——这是一种可怕的疾病，会痛苦地分解受害者的血肉。起初，疾病表现为疼痛的皮疹与关节剧痛；但在后续阶段，受影响生物的血肉会开始液化并成股流淌，因为该生物的孢子仍在持续起作用。死亡一旦发生，往往会迅速导致尸体裂开，并释放出一只全新的黏菌怪。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>由于其怪异的身体结构，以及分解并以多种材料为食的能力，软泥能够适应几乎任何气候，尤其是在魔法或炼金改造的帮助下。因此，探险者经常在遭遇中发现这些无定形生物全新而骇人的变种。</p>\n<p>A slime mold appears as a mound of earth and detritus covered in a thick layer of fungus that exudes a faint stink of decay. The fungus actually shares a symbiotic relationship with the slime mold, serving as an external digestive system while gaining access to the nutrients it needs. The ooze remains perfectly still until living prey passes within reach, then it lashes out with disgusting pseudopods. With a touch, a slime mold can infect its prey with a foul contagion known as slime rot, a horrific disease that painfully breaks down a victim's flesh. At first, the disease manifests as painful rashes and agonized joints. In the later stages, though, the flesh of the affected creature actually begins to liquefy and run in rivulets as the creature's spores continue to work. Death, when it occurs, swiftly causes the resulting body to split open and release a brand new slime mold.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Due to their bizarre physical structures and ability to break down and feed on a wide variety of materials, oozes are able to adapt to nearly any climate, especially when assisted by magical or alchemical tinkering. As a result, explorers frequently encounter new and terrifying varieties of these amorphous creatures.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "黏菌怪 Slime Mold"
        },
        "Xin Yue": {
          "name": "心月 Xin Yue",
          "tokenName": "新月 Xin Yue",
          "items": {
            "Divine Spontaneous Spells": {
              "name": "神术自发法术 Divine Spontaneous Spells"
            },
            "Air Walk": {
              "name": "凌空而行 Air Walk",
              "description": "<p>目标可以像在坚实地面上一样在空中行走。它可以用这种方式以最大 45 度角上升和下降。</p>\n<p>The target can walk on air as if it were solid ground. It can ascend and descend in this way at a maximum of a 45-degree angle.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Wrath": {
              "name": "神圣狂怒 Divine Wrath",
              "description": "<p>你引导神祇之怒对抗你的敌人。你对区域内的敌人造成4d10魂魄伤害，具体取决于他们的强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}；在其处于恶心期间，它同时获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}; while it's sickened, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Crisis of Faith": {
              "name": "信念崩塌 Crisis of Faith",
              "description": "<p>你冲击目标的信仰，使该生物充满疑虑与心灵动荡，造成6d6心灵伤害；若其能施放神术法术，则改为造成6d8心灵伤害。其效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<p>对许多神祇而言，在没有充分理由的情况下，对你自身神祇的追随者施放该法术属于禁忌。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到全额伤害；若目标能施放神术法术，则其获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标受到双倍伤害，获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1轮，并且1轮内无法施放神术法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6（若目标为神术施法者，则改为增加2d8）。</p>\n<p>You assault the target's faith, riddling the creature with doubt and mental turmoil that deal 6d6 mental damage, or 6d8 mental damage if it can cast divine spells. The effects are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<p>To many deities, casting this spell on a follower of your own deity without significant cause is anathema.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage; if the target can cast divine spells, it's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round, and can't cast divine spells for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6 (or by 2d8 if the target is a divine spellcaster).</p>"
            },
            "Vampiric Touch": {
              "name": "吸血鬼之触 Vampiric Touch",
              "description": "<p>你的接触会汲取目标的生命精华以强化自身。你对目标造成6d6虚无伤害。你获得等同于目标所受虚无伤害一半的临时生命值（在应用抗力等效果之后）。1分钟后，你失去所有剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害提高2d6。</p>\n<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Deafness": {
              "name": "耳聋术 Deafness",
              "description": "<p>目标失去听觉；它必须尝试一次强韧豁免。随后，目标在 1 分钟内暂时免疫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{失聪} 状态，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标失聪 10 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标永久失聪。</p>\n<p>The target loses hearing; it must attempt a Fortitude save. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Deafened for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Deafened permanently.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你揭开某个法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一件魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内变为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Sound Burst": {
              "name": "音鸣爆 Sound Burst",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音轰然爆发，造成2d10点音波伤害。每个生物必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：失败</strong> 该生物承受双倍伤害，在1分钟内处于耳聋，并处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is Deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Weapon": {
              "name": "灵能武器 Spiritual Weapon",
              "description": "<p>一把由纯粹魔法力场构成的武器显现出来，并攻击你在射程内指定的敌人。此武器外观幽灵般，可显现为一根短棒、一把匕首，或你神祇所偏好的武器。</p>\n<p>当你施放该法术时，武器会出现在你于射程内选择的一个敌人旁边，并对其进行一次打击。每次你维持该法术时，你都可以将武器移动到射程内的一个新目标旁（如有需要），并用其进行一次打击。灵能武器会使用并计入你的多重攻击减值。</p>\n<p>该武器的打击为近战法术攻击。无论其外观如何，该武器造成2d8力场伤害。你可以改为造成该武器通常造成的伤害类型，而非力场伤害（或多用武器可选的任一伤害类型）。该武器的其他数据与特征均不适用，即使是远程武器也只能攻击相邻的生物。尽管进行的是法术攻击，但就触发、抗力等用途而言，灵能武器仍视为武器。</p>\n<p>该武器不占用空间，不提供夹击，也不具有生物所拥有的任何其他属性。该武器除其打击外不能进行任何其他攻击，且影响武器的专长或法术都不会对其生效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 该武器的伤害提高1d8。</p>\n<p>A weapon made of pure magical force materializes and attacks foes you designate within range. This weapon has a ghostly appearance and manifests as a club, a dagger, or your deity's favored weapon.</p>\n<p>When you cast the spell, the weapon appears next to a foe you choose within range and makes a Strike against it. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can move the weapon to a new target within range (if needed) and Strike with it. The spiritual weapon uses and contributes to your multiple attack penalty.</p>\n<p>The weapon's Strikes are melee spell attacks. Regardless of its appearance, the weapon deals 2d8 force damage. You can deal damage of the type normally dealt by the weapon instead of force damage (or any of the available damage types for a versatile weapon). No other statistics or traits of the weapon apply, and even a ranged weapon attacks adjacent creatures only. Despite making a spell attack, the spiritual weapon is a weapon for purposes of triggers, resistances, and so forth.</p>\n<p>The weapon doesn't take up space, grant flanking, or have any other attributes a creature would. The weapon can't make any attack other than its Strike, and feats or spells that affect weapons do not apply to it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The weapon's damage increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Command": {
              "name": "命令 Command",
              "description": "<p>你大声喊出一道难以忽视的命令。你可以命令目标接近你、逃跑（如同具有@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑（状态）}）、放开它所持有的东西、倒地@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}，或原地不动。在它服从你的命令之前，它不能延后或进行任何反应动作。其效果取决于目标的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 在其下一回合的第一个动作中，该生物必须使用一个单动作按你的命令行事。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标必须在其下一回合使用所有动作来服从你的命令。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>强化（5环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't Delay or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你令目标的思维变得混乱，并用一道心灵冲击使其恍惚。该冲击造成等同于你施法关键属性调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害增加 1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道神圣能量的光束。对目标的 AC 进行一次远程法术攻击。命中时，目标受到 2d4 魂魄伤害（大成功时伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d4。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你将恐惧植入目标；它必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并在 1 轮内陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以以最多五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Guidance": {
              "name": "神导术 Guidance",
              "description": "<p>你请求神圣的指引，使目标在持续时间结束前尝试的一次攻击掷骰、察觉检定、豁免检定或技能检定中获得+1状态加值。目标必须在掷骰前选择将该加值用于哪一次掷骰。若目标使用了该加值，则法术结束。无论如何，目标随后在1小时内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3qHKBDF7lrHw8jFK]{法术效果：神导术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3LyOkV25p7wA181H]{效果：神导术免疫}</p>\n<p>You ask for divine guidance, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3qHKBDF7lrHw8jFK]{Spell Effect: Guidance}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3LyOkV25p7wA181H]{Effect: Guidance Immunity}</p>"
            },
            "Harm": {
              "name": "伤害术 Harm",
              "description": "<p>你引导虚空能量来伤害活物或治疗不死。若目标是活的生物，你对其造成1d8点虚空伤害，且其必须进行一次基础强韧豁免。若目标是一个自愿的不死生物，你恢复等量的生命值。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>（姿势）</strong> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>（言语，姿势）</strong> 该法术的射程为30尺。若你在治疗一个不死生物，将恢复的生命值提高8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>（材料，言语，姿势）</strong> 你在30尺散发中散布虚空能量。该法术以区域内所有活的与不死的生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8，且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel void energy to harm the living or heal the undead. If the target is a living creature, you deal 1d8 void damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. If the target is a willing undead creature, you restore that amount of Hit Points. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(verbal, somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing an undead creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(material, verbal, somatic)</strong> You disperse void energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Ray of Enfeeblement": {
              "name": "衰弱射线 Ray of Enfeeblement",
              "description": "<p>一道削弱敌人力量的射线从你手中闪现。对目标进行一次远程法术攻击。若你成功，则该生物进行一次强韧豁免以决定该法术的效果。若你的攻击掷骰为大成功，则使用其豁免结果低一级的结果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 3}。</p>\n<p>A ray that saps a foe's strength flashes from your hand. Attempt a ranged spell attack against the target. If you succeed, that creature attempts a Fortitude save to determine the spell's effect. If your attack roll is a critical success, use the outcome for one degree of success worse than the result of its save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3}.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你专注于目标物体，敞开心神以感知魔法灵光。当施法完成时，你会知道该物品是否为魔法物品。你或任何接受你关于该灵光建议的人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得+2环境加值。若该物体为幻象，只有当该效果的环级低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的环级时，你才会侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你最多可以以10个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong>你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctuary": {
              "name": "圣域术 Sanctuary",
              "description": "<p>你用防护能量守护一名生物，以阻止敌人的攻击。生物每次尝试攻击该目标时都必须进行一次意志豁免。若目标使用了敌对动作，则法术结束。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 圣域术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物可以尝试进行它的攻击，以及在本回合内对目标进行的任何其他攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物无法攻击目标并浪费该动作。它在本回合内无法再尝试对目标进行攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物浪费该动作，并且在圣域术的剩余持续时间内无法尝试攻击目标。</p>\n<p>You ward a creature with protective energy that deters enemy attacks. Creatures attempting to attack the target must attempt a Will save each time. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Sanctuary ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can attempt its attack and any other attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't attack the target and wastes the action. It can't attempt further attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature wastes the action and can't attempt to attack the target for the rest of sanctuary's duration.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "护盾 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你举起一道魔法力场护盾。这算作使用“举起护盾”动作，使你在你下个回合开始前的AC获得+1环境加值，但不需要占用一只手来使用。</p>\n<p>在该法术的效果持续期间，你可以用你的魔法护盾使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block}反应动作（）。该护盾的硬度为5。在你使用Shield Block后，法术结束，且你在10分钟内不能再次施放它。与普通的Shield Block不同，你可以用该法术的反应动作（）来对抗@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{Force Barrage}法术。</p>\n<p>升阶该法术会提高护盾的硬度。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 护盾的硬度为10。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 护盾的硬度为15。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 护盾的硬度为20。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 护盾的硬度为25。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes. Unlike a normal Shield Block, you can use the spell's reaction against the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{Force Barrage} spell.</p>\n<p>Heightening the spell increases the shield's Hardness.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The shield has Hardness 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 20.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 25.</p>"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword"
            },
            "Chastise Heretic": {
              "name": "惩戒异教徒 Chastise Heretic",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 薪月能够看见的60英尺内的一名生物施放一个神圣法术</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 薪月尝试使用她的法术攻击调整和4阶反制来反制触发的法术。若该法术被反制，施法者受到@Damage[1d10[persistent,mental]]伤害。若薪月反制该法术失败，则施法者在24小时内暂时免疫此能力的进一步使用。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> a creature within 60 feet who Xin Yue can see casts a divine spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Xin Yue attempts to counteract the triggering spell using her spell attack modifier and a counteract rank of 4. If the spell is counteracted, the caster takes @Damage[1d10[persistent,mental]] damage. If Xin Yue fails to counteract the spell, the caster is temporarily immune to further uses of this ability for 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Field of Past Regrets": {
              "name": "前尘憾事气场 Field of Past Regrets",
              "description": "<p>40尺。灵光范围内所有至少拥有一次前世的生物（包括《<em>鬼季</em>》中的所有PC）会回忆起前世的失败，并受到鼓舞以避免重蹈覆辙，获得+1状态加值，用于对抗心灵效果的豁免骰。灵光范围内活体、非灵堕魔的生物在承受心灵攻击时，会感受到其所有前世的痛苦，以及其自身当下的痛苦，并获得对心灵伤害的弱点3。</p>\n<p>40 feet. All creatures within the aura who have at least one past life (including all PCs in <em>Season of Ghosts</em>) recall failures in their past lives and are bolstered against repeating them, gaining a +1 status bonus to saving throws against mental effects. Living, non-nindoru creatures within the aura feel the pain of all their past lives, as well as their own current pain when they endure mental attacks, and gain weakness 3 to mental damage.</p>"
            },
            "Profane Reincarnation": {
              "name": "亵渎转生 Profane Reincarnation",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每1,000天一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 欣月的生命值降至0</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 欣月发出一声尖啸，她的不死之躯裂开，她的短剑变为破损。她立即转世为一只带有精英生物调整的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.season-of-ghosts-bestiary.Actor.TVi4RDeqw7GDsxp0]{索闹} 灵堕魔。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once every 1,000 days</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Xin Yue is reduced to 0 Hit Points</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Xin Yue utters a shriek as her undead body splits open and her shortsword becomes broken. She's instantly reincarnated as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.season-of-ghosts-bestiary.Actor.TVi4RDeqw7GDsxp0]{Sojiruh} nindoru with the elite creature adjustment.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Near-Death Experience": {
              "name": "濒死体验 Near-Death Experience",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 辛月将一个生物降至 0 生命值并使其获得濒死（状态）</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 对濒死的生物而言，时间仿佛慢了下来；其濒死体验带来的巨大压力令其大脑进入超负荷运转。目标看见自己的一生在眼前闪过，抵御死亡的冲动愈发强烈。目标的复苏检定 DC 降低 2，但若其失去濒死（状态），则必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:25] 意志豁免。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.3HaT8gBo8krdVniF]{效果：濒死体验}</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物因这次体验而被激励，并在 1 分钟内获得快速治疗 5。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物因这次体验而被激励，并在 1 分钟内获得快速治疗 1。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物因这次体验而变得消沉，并在 24 小时内变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物被这次体验所震慑。其变为呆滞 1 并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭 1}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.ejnUAEdbvj6uPuNJ]{效果：濒死体验治疗}</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Xin Yue reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points and causes them to gain the dying condition</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Time appears to slow down to the dying creature as the immense stress of their near-death experience pushes their brain into overdrive. The target sees their life flash before their eyes, and the urge to resist death grows strong. The target reduces the DC of their recovery checks by 2, but if they lose the dying condition, they must attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.3HaT8gBo8krdVniF]{Effect: Near-Death Experience}</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is empowered by the experience and gains fast healing 5 for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is empowered by the experience and gains fast healing 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes depressed by the experience and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature reels from the experience. They become stupefied 1 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.ejnUAEdbvj6uPuNJ]{Effect: Near-Death Experience Healing}</p>"
            },
            "Sangpotshi Lore": {
              "name": "善解学识 Sangpotshi Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>无死侍徒通常出现在神祇或其使者耗费少量力量，使一名低阶祭司复生之时。有些祭司在生前足够强大，能够凭自身意志复生——但力量会大幅削弱。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>无死侍徒在不死之中十分特殊：既非自愿转化，也不能严格地说是违背其意愿而被转化。创造无死侍徒是神祇直接干预的行为，通常是一种双刃的奖赏与诅咒，赐予那位虔诚的祭司——其因自身无法控制的情势而未能完成一项神圣使命。</p>\n<p>Deathless acolytes typically arise when a deity or their herald expends a minor amount of power to return a low-ranking priest. Some priests are powerful enough in life to return, greatly lessened, of their own volition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Deathless acolytes are an oddity among undead, neither willingly transformed nor, strictly speaking, transformed against their will. The creation of a deathless acolyte is an act of direct intervention by a deity, typically as a double-edged reward and curse granted to a faithful priest who failed in completing a divine mandate due to circumstances beyond their control.</p>",
          "blurb": "苦迦菩提的不死侍僧（女性变体）\nFemale variant deathless acolyte of Kugaptee",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "心月 Xin Yue"
        },
        "Nosois' Payment": {
          "name": "疫鸟的报酬 Nosois' Payment",
          "tokenName": "疫鸟的报酬 Nosois' Payment",
          "items": {
            "Gallows Tooth": {
              "name": "绞刑架之牙 Gallows Tooth",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这颗骇人的臼齿用一根绳子吊着，绳子穿过其干枯外露的牙根上方不远处的一个孔洞。当你启动此护符时，对一名相邻生物进行一次近战打击。该生物在此次打击中以及直到你回合结束前，均处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}状态。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This grisly molar hangs from a cord threaded through a hole just above its dried, exposed root. When you activate this talisman, make a melee Strike against an adjacent creature. That creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against the Strike and until the end of your turn.</p>"
            },
            "Jade Bauble": {
              "name": "翡翠小饰物 Jade Bauble",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p><hr /><p>这块小玉石通常被雕刻成决斗者的形状，有时也会是多臂生物的形象。当你启动这件小饰物时，它会以魔法吸引敌人的注意力。直到你下个回合开始前，位于该护符所附着的武器触及范围内的敌人都将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p><hr /><p>This bit of jade is usually carved in the shape of a duelist, or sometimes a multi-armed creature. When you activate the bauble, it magically draws the attention of foes. Until the start of your next turn, enemies within the reach of the weapon the talisman is affixed to are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}.</p>"
            },
            "Frost": {
              "name": "霜冻 Frost",
              "description": "<p>这把武器被寒冰之力强化。一次成功的打击会额外造成 1d6 点寒冷伤害。若造成重击，目标还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续至你下个回合结束，除非它在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:24|name:Frost Rune|showDC:all] 豁免中成功。</p>\n<p>This weapon is empowered with freezing ice. It deals an additional 1d6 cold damage on a successful Strike. On a critical hit, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until the end of your next turn unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|dc:24|name:Frost Rune|showDC:all] save.</p>"
            },
            "Silver and Sapphire Ring": {
              "name": "银与蓝宝石戒指 Silver and Sapphire Ring"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "疫鸟的报酬 Nosois' Payment"
        },
        "Ren Mei Li's Scroll": {
          "name": "任美璃的卷轴 Ren Mei Li's Scroll",
          "tokenName": "任美璃的卷轴 Ren Mei Li's Scroll",
          "items": {
            "Scroll of Sending (Rank 5)": {
              "name": "传讯卷轴（5环） Scroll of Sending (Rank 5)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R9xqCBblkS5KE4y7]{传讯术}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴施放一个法术需要你用一只手持握卷轴，并以施法（行动）来启用它，使用该法术正常所需数量的动作。</p>\n<p>该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。由于是你在施放法术，使用你的法术攻击调整与法术DC。该法术也会获得与你的根源相应的特征（奥术、神圣、异能或原初）。</p>\n<p>任何实体材料成本都会在制作卷轴时提供，因此你从卷轴施放时不需要再提供它们。若该法术需要法器，你必须拥有该法器才能从卷轴施放该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要制作某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料集或资料集浏览器拖入某个PC、NPC或战利品演员的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R9xqCBblkS5KE4y7]{Sending}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>The spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack modifier and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when casting from a scroll. If the spell requires a locus, you must have that locus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            }
          },
