          "items": {
            "Rising Waters": {
              "name": "涨潮之水 Rising Waters",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物游泳渡过河流超过一半、在桥上神龛内结束其回合，或踏上北侧桥面</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 幽灵般的手臂从河流中升起，抓住并摇晃两座桥。站在桥上的生物必须进行一次 @Check[reflex|dc:20] 豁免，否则会被击倒并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。一股河水在神龛内部喷涌而上，将两群幼水蛭群冲进神龛内。随后，作祟与水蛭群掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature swims more than halfway across the river, ends their turn in the bridge shrine, or sets foot onto the northern bridge</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Ghostly arms rise up from the river to grab and shake both bridges. Creatures standing on the bridge must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:20] save or be knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. A blast of river water sprays up inside the shrine to deposit two brood leech swarms in the shrine. The haunt and the leech swarms then roll initiative.</p>"
            },
            "Ghostly Arms": {
              "name": "幽魂之臂 Ghostly Arms",
              "description": "<p><strong>效果</strong> 擒拿</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> grapple</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[religion|dc:20]以进行宗教检定来献上祷告以平息作祟，或@Check[intimidation|dc:23]以恐吓那些不安的魂魄离去</p>\n<p>@Check[religion|dc:20] to offer prayers to calm the haunt, or @Check[intimidation|dc:23] to threaten the unquiet spirits away</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>幽魂般的手臂从水中升起，紧紧抓住并攫取，而一股充满水蛭的水柱喷涌而出，直冲中央神龛。</p>\n<p>Ghostly arms rise up from the water to clutch and grab, while a geyser of leech-infested water sprays up into the central shrine.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>作祟会在任意一轮开始时失效并重置，条件是PC不在河流中、不在桥上，也不在神龛内；但水蛭群会在神龛中停留10分钟，之后才会撤回到下方的水中。</p>\n<p>The haunt deactivates and resets at the start of any round in which the PCs aren't in the river, on the bridges, or in the shrines, but the leech swarms remain in the shrine for 10 minutes before retreating back into the water below.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（3 动作）幽灵般的手臂胡乱挥舞，试图抓住神龛内或任一桥上的生物。每轮，该作祟使用 3 动作尝试擒拿桥上或神龛内的一名 PC。若一名 PC 处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}，该作祟可以用其一个动作将该 PC 拖入河流。被束缚在河流中的 PC 有溺水风险。</p>\n<p>(3 actions) Ghostly arms flail about and attempt to grab creatures in the shrine or on either bridge. Each round, the haunt uses 3 actions to attempt to grapple a PC on the bridge or in the shrine. If a PC is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, the haunt can use one of its actions to drag a PC into the river. A PC who's restrained in the river risks drowning.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（专家）以瞥见下方水中溺水的幽灵身影。</p>\n<p>(expert) to catch glimpses of ghostly figures drowning in the water below.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "溺死鬼的邀请 Arms of the Drowned"
