        "Book Shelves": {
          "name": "书架 Book Shelves",
          "tokenName": "书架 Book Shelves",
          "items": {
            "Watchers of the Cycle": {
              "name": "循环的守望者 Watchers of the Cycle",
              "description": "<p>本书的前半部分收录了数百则短寓言与故事，摘选自众多宗教传统，并逐一编选，以传授善解的信徒可从中汲取的教诲。若角色在研究任何与善解或转生术相关的主题时引用此书，则其进行回忆知识的任何善解学识或宗教检定获得+1物品加值。本书的后半部分包含若干仪式的配方，包括@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yrsgOdj5oqp7lEQY]{食月}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.INEAWirvb8c1eAFD]{终夜守夜}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksJFGSGlNpUhwcsp]{掠夺黑夜}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FQZaQXiKtHdVjSc5]{招待失者}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wAJ8mXPYbyAg0qWX]{如蜜冬至}（以上所有仪式均详述于本卷的冒险工具箱中）。本书最后几页包含仪式@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gIVaSCrLhhBzGHQY]{转生术}的配方。</p>\n<p>The first half of this book contains hundreds of short parables and stories culled from a wide range of religions, each curated for the lessons they can impart to a follower of Sangpotshi. If a character references this book while researching any topic relating to Sangpotshi or reincarnation, they gain a +1 item bonus to any Sangpotshi Lore or Religion checks to Recall Knowledge. The second half of the book contains the formulas for several rituals, including @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yrsgOdj5oqp7lEQY]{Gnaw at the Moon}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.INEAWirvb8c1eAFD]{Last Night's Vigil}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksJFGSGlNpUhwcsp]{Ransack the Night}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FQZaQXiKtHdVjSc5]{Regale the Lost Ones}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wAJ8mXPYbyAg0qWX]{Sweetest Solstice} (all of these rituals are detailed in this volume’s Adventure Toolbox. The final pages of the book contain the formula for the ritual @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gIVaSCrLhhBzGHQY]{Reincarnate}.</p>"
