            "Accord Essence": {
              "name": "协调精华 Accord Essence",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 30英尺内一名在过去1小时内受益于幽光共鸣的盟友成为一次攻击的目标</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 幽光将自身引爆，引发一次元素爆炸。这使在过去1小时内受益于幽光共鸣、且位于 @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} 内的盟友，获得等同于幽光当前生命值一半的临时生命值。这些临时生命值持续1小时。</p>\n<p>使用此反应动作（）的幽光将被永久摧毁，且只能通过 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.6dDtGIUerazSHIOu]{Wish} 仪式或类似强大的效果恢复。若某项能力会阻止幽光被摧毁（例如，若幽光是被召唤而仅会被遣返），则Accord Essence没有效果。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within 30 feet that benefited from the wisp's resonance in the last hour is targeted by an attack</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The wisp detonates themself in an elemental explosion. This grants temporary Hit Points equal to half the wisp's current Hit Points to allies within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} who have benefited from the wisp's resonance in the last hour. These temporary Hit Points last 1 hour.</p>\n<p>A wisp that uses this reaction is permanently destroyed, and they can be restored by only a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.6dDtGIUerazSHIOu]{Wish} ritual or similarly powerful effect. If an ability would prevent the wisp's destruction (for instance, if the wisp is summoned and would merely be dismissed), Accord Essence has no effect.</p>"
            },
            "Resonance": {
              "name": "共鸣 Resonance",
              "description": "<p>30英尺。所有的飘火都以与其元素相契合的频率振动，与并强化所有具有该特征的生物与效果产生共鸣。</p>\n<p>区域内的生物在进行具有气（特征）的效果的攻击与伤害掷骰时获得+1状态加值；具有元素与气（特征）的生物将此加值应用于其所有攻击与伤害掷骰。</p>\n<p>30 feet. All wisps vibrate at a frequency attuned to their element, resonating with and empowering all creatures and effects sharing that trait.</p>\n<p>A creature in the area gains a +1 status bonus to attack and damage rolls for effects with the air trait; a creature with the elemental and air traits gains this bonus to all attack and damage rolls.</p>"
            },
            "In Concert": {
              "name": "协同行动 In Concert",
              "description": "<p>当气之微灵在进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HCl3pzVefiv9ZKQW]{协助}的检定时掷出大失败时，改为获得失败；当它掷出成功时，改为获得大成功。</p>\n<p>When an air wisp rolls a critical failure on a check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HCl3pzVefiv9ZKQW]{Aid}, they get a failure instead, and when they roll a success, they get a critical success instead.</p>"
            },
            "Plane of Air Lore": {
              "name": "气之位面传说 Plane of Air Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>空气小精灵是漂浮的云与风暴球体，持续嗡鸣着轻柔、细语般的音调。它们顽皮而反复无常，对陌生人怀有强烈的好奇。</p><hr /><p>小精灵是超小型的元素生物，诞生于元素位面的创造之时。最初的小精灵以变幻的交响在内海中游荡，每次相遇都会彼此交换成员。这些自由小精灵的交响通过共鸣的叠加创造出音乐；但当邪恶的元素领主意识到小精灵共鸣的价值后，便捕获整支交响，将其作为仆役驱使。</p>\n<p>小精灵会彼此调谐，也会与它们环绕的对象调谐。这种调谐使它们天生成为乐于扶持的盟友。自由小精灵至今仍在内海与宇宙中漫游，但通常很害羞，会对陌生人躲藏起来。然而，它们也会愉快地为向它们示以善意的人效劳。它们尤其容易被修习元素魔法的施法者吸引；这些小精灵通常在远处观察，但有时也会接近那些看起来安全的人，成为魔宠或同伴。</p>\n<p>彼此发现对方的自由小精灵几乎会立刻变得亲密。当它们遇到与自身元素不同的小精灵时会格外兴奋，丝毫不表现出不同位面的元素生物之间有时会出现的敌意。相反，它们会加入一场欢欣的舞蹈，散发出隐约回响远古交响的共鸣。</p>\n<p>Air wisps are floating spheres of cloud and storm, perpetually humming a light, whispery tone. They're playful and capricious, with great curiosity toward strangers.</p><hr /><p>Wisps are tiny elemental beings that emerged during the creation of the Elemental Planes. The first wisps roamed the Inner Sphere in shifting symphonies that traded members with their every meeting. These symphonies of free wisps created music out of their combined resonances, but when the wicked Elemental Lords realized the value of the wisps' resonance, they captured whole symphonies for use as servants.</p>\n<p>Wisps attune to each other and to those they surround themselves with. This attunement makes them naturally supportive allies. Free wisps still roam the Inner Sphere and the Universe, but they're usually shy and hide themselves from strangers. However, they happily offer their service to those who show them kindness. They especially find themselves drawn to spellcasters who practice elemental magic; these wisps usually watch from afar but sometimes approach those who seem safe to become familiars or comrades.</p>\n<p>Free wisps who find one another become close almost immediately. They get especially excited when they find wisps of elements other than their own, showing none of the animosity sometimes exhibited between elementals of different planes. Instead, they join in an excited dance, emitting resonances that faintly echo the symphonies of ancient days.</p>",
          "blurb": "精英空气微光妖\nElite Air Wisps",
          "prototypeToken": "气之磷光 Air Wisp"
        },
