          "items": {
            "Battle Axe": {
              "name": "战斧 Battle Axe",
              "description": "<p>这些斧头被明确设计为武器，而非工具。它们通常更轻，斧柄以金属箍或螺栓加固，斧刃也更锋利，使其更适合砍断肢体而非劈柴。</p>\n<p>These axes are designed explicitly as weapons, rather than tools. They typically weigh less, with a shaft reinforced with metal bands or bolts, and have a sharper blade, making them ideal for chopping limbs rather than wood.</p>"
