        "Vanth": {
          "name": "万斯 Vanth",
          "tokenName": "范斯 Vanth",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "传送 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你会立即将自己以及你穿戴和持有的所有物品，从你当前的空间传送到你能看见、且在射程内的一处未被占据的空间。若这会将另一个生物一并带上——即使你正将其装在一个异次元容器中携带——则该法术失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至1英里。你不需要能看见你的目的地，只要你过去曾去过那里，并知晓它相对于你的位置与距离即可。随后你在1小时内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Translocate (At Will)": {
              "name": "传送（随意） Translocate (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你会立刻将自己以及你穿戴和持有的所有物品，从你当前的空间传送到射程内一个你能看见的未被占据的空间。若这会让另一个生物与你一同传送——即使你将其装在一个异次元容器中携带——该法术会失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程提升至1英里。你不需要看见你的目的地，只要你过去曾到过那里，并且知道它相对于你的位置与距离即可。随后你获得持续1小时的暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Light": {
              "name": "圣光 Holy Light",
              "description": "<p>你射出一道炽烈的光线，带着神圣能量的微光。进行一次远程法术攻击。该光线造成5d6火焰伤害。若目标具有邪秽（特征），你额外造成5d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全额伤害。</p>\n<p>若光线穿过一片魔法黑暗区域，或以受魔法黑暗影响的生物为目标，圣光会尝试反制该黑暗。若你需要判定光线是否穿过一片黑暗区域，在你与法术目标之间画一条线。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 火焰伤害增加2d6，而对邪秽生物造成的魂魄伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You shine a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Locate": {
              "name": "定位 Locate",
              "description": "<p>你会得知目标的方向（如果你选择了某个特定的物体，例如“我母亲的剑”），或最近的目标（如果你选择了一类物体，例如“剑”）。如果目标是某个特定的物体，你必须曾用自己的感官直接观察过它。如果目标是一类物体，你仍需要对该类物体有准确的心灵图像。如果你与目标之间有铅或流动的水阻隔，此法术无法定位该物体。这意味着如果最近的那一个位于铅或流动的水之后，你可能会找到更远处的同类物体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 你可以以特定的生物或族裔作为目标，而非物体，但你必须曾与想要作为目标的该生物或族裔见过面，或近距离看见过。</p>\n<p>You learn the direction to the target (if you picked a specific object, such as \"my mother's sword\") or the nearest target (if you picked a type of object, such as \"swords\"). If the target is a specific object, you must have observed it directly with your own senses. If it's a type of object, you still need to have an accurate mental image of the type of object. If there's lead or running water between you and the target, this spell can't locate the object. This means you might find a type of object farther away if the nearest one is behind lead or running water.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target a specific creature or ancestry instead of an object, but you must have met or seen up close the creature or ancestry you want to target.</p>"
            },
            "Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)": {
              "name": "隐形（随意，自身限定） Invisibility (At Will, Self Only)",
              "description": "<p>幻术使光线绕过目标，使其变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。这使其对所有生物而言处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪} 状态，不过这些生物可以尝试寻找目标，使其改为对他们而言处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿} 状态。若目标使用敌对动作，则法术在该敌对动作完成后结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 法术持续1分钟，但目标使用敌对动作时不会结束。</p>\n<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"
