            "Frightful Presence": {
              "name": "气势凶猛 Frightful Presence",
              "description": "<p>20英尺 @Check[will|dc:22]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>\n<p>20 feet @Check[will|dc:22]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"
            },
            "Reactive Strike": {
              "name": "反应打击 Reactive Strike",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>"
            },
            "Infuse Weapon": {
              "name": "灌注武器 Infuse Weapon",
              "description": "<p>梵斯的长柄镰刀是其职务的象征，并获得了其部分个人力量。这把长柄镰刀成为一把<em>+1长柄镰刀</em>，且在梵斯持用期间视同精金。长柄镰刀被夺走或摧毁的梵斯可以花费1小时的工作为一把新的长柄镰刀注入力量。</p>\n<p>A vanth's scythe is its symbol of office and gains a measure of its personal power. This scythe becomes a <em>+1 scythe</em> and is treated as if it were adamantine while the vanth wields it. A vanth whose scythe is taken or destroyed can infuse a new one with an hour of work.</p>"
            },
            "Shepherd's Touch": {
              "name": "牧羊人的接触 Shepherd's Touch",
              "description": "<p>万斯的打击会以<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}</em>属性符文的效果影响虚体生物，并对活物造成 @Damage[2d6[void]] 伤害、对不死造成 @Damage[2d6[vitality]] 伤害。</p>\n<p>A vanth's Strikes affect incorporeal creatures with the effects of a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}</em> property rune and deal @Damage[2d6[void]] damage to living creatures and @Damage[2d6[vitality]] damage to undead.</p>"
            },
            "Vanth's Curse": {
              "name": "凡斯的诅咒 Vanth's Curse",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天三次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 范斯用它的长柄镰触碰一名生物，从而对其施加诅咒。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:25] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响，并在24小时内暂时免疫范斯的诅咒。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标感到一阵短暂的末日战栗，并因这令人分心的感觉而在1分钟内陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞（状态） 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标在接受自身不可避免的命运时变得郁郁寡欢、闷闷不乐。在1小时内，目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞（状态） 2}。每当目标获得濒死（状态）时，其呆滞（状态）的数值增加1，至多增加到 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞（状态） 4}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但效果为永久。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> three times per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The vanth bestows a curse on a creature by touching it with its scythe. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Vanth's Curse for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target feels a momentary shudder of doom and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute by the distracting sensation.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes morose and glum as it accepts its own inevitable fate. For 1 hour, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}. Each time the target gains the dying condition, the stupefied condition value increases by 1, to a maximum value of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 4}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the effect is permanent.</p>"
            },
            "Boneyard Lore": {
              "name": "骨园学识 Boneyard Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>作为骨园的守护者、严厉而坚定的亡者看守者，凡斯是招魂者的一种，外形类似长有渡鸦般翅膀的骷髅，戴着一副形如兀鹫头骨的面具。凡斯手持黑色长镰，专门对抗那些企图扰乱灵魂自然进程之人，并将任何来到骨园的访客都视为潜在的麻烦制造者。他们很少开口，更少显露除冷峻履行使命之外的任何情绪。</p>\n<p>当招魂者大军开赴战场时，凡斯会作为前线士兵。尤其是，魔神会不断对灵魂之河发动袭击，因此需要持续巡逻。作为毫不动摇的战士，凡斯会以完美的队形飞行。这也可能适得其反，因为他们在作战时往往压制自身所具备的任何应变能力。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>招魂者是骨园中亡者的守护者与引路人。骨园是一座广袤的坟墓位面，凡人灵魂在此接受审判，随后被送往永恒的奖励或诅咒。招魂者确保亡者能够接受从凡俗走向彼岸的转变，并被恰当地归入相应的来世。他们也会保护灵魂，使其不至于沦为超自然掠食者的猎物。几乎所有招魂者都会佩戴面具，尤其是在他们可能与凡人打交道时；尽管如此，他们所戴面具的类型也如同招魂者本身一样多种多样。骨园的法庭使用雷奎安语审理事务；这是一种庄重却富有旋律的语言，说话缓慢，并伴随多种音调变化。</p>\n<p>许多招魂者深度参与骨园庞大的官僚体系。很少有人追求仁慈、正义或个人利益；他们对法莱斯玛以及她的骨园所承担的使命至高无上。尽管如此，各个招魂者会以不同方式诠释自身的使命，这可能使他们与凡人、甚至彼此之间发生冲突。</p>\n<p>Protectors of the Boneyard, the stern and resolute guardians of the dead, vanths are psychopomps who resemble skeletons with raven-like wings and a mask resembling a vulture's skull. Vanths carry black scythes to fight against those who would disturb the natural progression of souls, and they consider any visitor to the Boneyard a potential troublemaker. They rarely speak and even more rarely show any emotion other than a grim adherence to duty.</p>\n<p>When the psychopomp armies go to war, vanths serve as front-line soldiers. In particular, daemons continually stage raids on the River of Souls, requiring constant patrol. Implacable warriors, vanths fly in perfect formation. This can backfire, as they often suppress any adaptability they possess as they wage war.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Psychopomps are guardians and shepherds of the dead in the Boneyard, the vast plane of graves where mortal souls are judged and sent on to their eternal rewards or damnations. Psychopomps ensure that the dead come to terms with their transition from mortality and are properly sorted into the appropriate afterlife. They also protect souls from being preyed upon by supernatural predators. Nearly all psychopomps wear masks, especially when they're likely to be interacting with mortals, although the types of masks they wear are as varied as the psychopomps themselves. The courts of the Boneyard preside in Requian, a somber yet melodic language spoken slowly with various tonal shifts.</p>\n<p>Many psychopomps are intimately involved with the Boneyard's massive bureaucracy. Few pursue mercy, justice, or personal gain; their duties to Pharasma and her Boneyard are supreme. Nevertheless, individual psychopomps interpret their duties in different ways, which might put them in conflict with mortals or even with each other.</p>",
          "allSaves": "+1 status to all saves vs. magic",
          "prototypeToken": "万斯 Vanth"
        },
        "Zoudou": {
          "name": "邹斗 Zoudou",
          "tokenName": "邹斗 Zoudou",
          "items": {
            "Zoudou's Tattered Leather-bound Ledger": {
              "name": "邹斗的破旧皮装账簿 Zoudou's Tattered Leather-bound Ledger",
              "description": "<p>邹斗随身携带的那本破旧皮装账本，曾被旧伐木营地的工头用来追踪利润与支出，但只有前四分之一的页面记录着这些日常注记。日志其余部分则写满了邹斗密密麻麻的笔记与理论，内容涉及苦迦菩提、鬼打墙，以及她逐渐深信存在于墙外的“天堂”。</p>\n<p>The tattered leather-bound ledger that Zoudou carries was once used by the lumber camp boss to track profits and expenditures, but only the first quarter of the pages contain these mundane annotations. The rest of the journal is filled with Zoudou’s dense notes and theories about the nature of Kugaptee, the Wall of Ghosts, and the “paradise” she has come to believe lies beyond the wall.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "邹斗 Zoudou"
        },
        "Storage Room": {
          "name": "储藏室 Storage Room",
          "tokenName": "储藏室 Storage Room",
          "items": {
            "Dragonfire Halfbow": {
              "name": "龙火半弓 Dragonfire Halfbow",
              "description": "<p>这把弓由竹片与从喷火巨龙身上采集并切片的鳞片条层层叠制而成，因此拥有极高的拉力强度。这种设计在弘古很常见，因为较短的弓臂便于在马背上更轻松地操控。当这把<em>+2 强击复合短弓</em>的持用者骑乘时，他们在进行用于命令你的坐骑的自然检定时，获得该弓的物品加值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将弓拉至最大满弓而不搭箭；当你松开弓弦时，<em>龙火半弓</em>施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.sxQZ6yqTn0czJxVd]{火球术}（升阶至5环；@Check[reflex|dc:29] 豁免），以法术射程内你选择的一点为目标。你和你的坐骑对该<em>火球术</em>的效果免疫。</p>\n<p>Crafted by layering bamboo with strips of sliced scales harvested from a fire-breathing dragon, this bow has a significant draw strength. This design is commonly seen in Hongal, as the shorter limbs allow for easier maneuvering on horseback. While the wielder of this <em>+2 striking composite shortbow</em> is mounted, they apply the bow's item bonus to Nature checks to Command your mount.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You draw the bow back to its maximum draw length without nocking an arrow, and as you release the string, the <em>dragonfire halfbow</em> casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.sxQZ6yqTn0czJxVd]{Fireball} (heightened to 5th-rank; @Check[reflex|dc:29] save), targeted at a point of your choosing within the spell's range. You and your mount are immune to the effects of this <em>fireball</em>.</p>"
            },
            "Four-Tiger Blade": {
              "name": "四虎刀 Four-Tiger Blade",
              "description": "<p>当一生仅有一次的群星连珠之光穿透一间隐秘铁匠铺的屋顶时，铁匠抓住了这个机会打造自己的杰作。两个小时里，他将一块普通钢锭锤炼成一柄神圣之刃，在其刃身上刻下星座与符文，随后在去世前将这件造物的配方分享给一小群亲近的同伴。</p>\n<p>这些武器便是四虎刀，而目前已知仅有一打存在——分别对应一年中的每个月。每把武器都是一柄<em>+2强击幽冥长剑</em>，挥舞时会从其上雕刻的星辰处拖曳出一条醒目的光迹。若有人仔细观察刃上闪耀的星纹图样，可能会注意到其所描绘的星座会随夜空中当下可见的星象而变化。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 凝神，交互（防护、神圣、无力化）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 尝试对一个你认为被附身的生物进行一次打击。这次攻击不会对该生物造成伤害，但若目标确实被附身，则附身的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:29] 豁免。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 附身的生物不受影响，而你仍然无法得知目标是否真的被附身。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 附身的生物不受影响，但你感知到该生物对目标的控制，并确认目标被附身。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你确认目标被附身。附身的生物在1分钟内无法控制目标。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 你在反制附身的瞬间确认目标被附身，使附身的生物离开目标的身体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> 命令术</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你使用<em>四虎刀</em>尝试一次打击</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 直到你下个回合开始前，你获得10点对虚无伤害的抗力。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.V7cIpoJL9Zm4TiUT]{效果：四虎刀}</p>\n<p>When a once-in-a-lifetime alignment of the stars shone through the roof of a secluded blacksmith's forge, the smith took advantage to craft their masterpiece. For two hours, they hammered a lump of ordinary steel into a divine blade, etching constellations and wards down its length, then shared their creation's formula with a small group of close associates before passing away.</p>\n<p>These weapons are the four-tiger blades, and currently, only a dozen are known to exist—one associated with each month of the year. Each weapon is a <em>+2 striking ghost touch longsword</em> that leaves a noticeable trail of light originating from the engraved stars when it's swung. Those who pay close attention to the pattern of stars that shine on the blade might note that the depicted constellations change according to those currently in the night sky above.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> envision, Interact (abjuration, divine, incapacitation)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Attempt a Strike against a creature you believe to be possessed. This attack deals no damage on the creature, but if the target is possessed, the possessing creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The possessing creature is unaffected, and you remain unaware of if the target is actually possessed or not.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The possessing creature is unaffected, but you sense that creature's control over the target and confirm that the target is possessed.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You confirm that the target is possessed. The possessing creature can't control the target for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You confirm the target is possessed an instant before you counteract the possession, causing the possessing creature to vacate the target's body.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> command</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt a Strike with the <em>four-tiger-blade</em></p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Until the start of your next turn, you gain resistance 10 to void damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.V7cIpoJL9Zm4TiUT]{Effect: Four-Tiger Blade}</p>"
            },
            "Thundering Fury Dadao": {
              "name": "雷怒大刀 Thundering Fury Dadao",
              "description": "<p>这把巨大而弯曲的刀刃在劈向敌人时会发出轰鸣，仿佛要以纯粹的力量将其压服。据说，最初的雷怒大刀的材料来自“有角之雷”约拉克的皮，这是一头游荡于闪光沙漠的传奇怪兽。此<em>+2 强击雷鸣巨剑</em>上缺乏装饰的外表，掩盖了其作为一件致命高效武器的本质。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 观想</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将闪电的速度与雷霆的力量注入<em>雷怒大刀</em>。该武器获得灵巧与强力特征，持续1轮。你可以维持此启动，最多持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.XEP4Ox6NZDGgba1r]{效果：雷怒大刀}</p>\n<p>This massive, curved blade roars when it crashes down on opponents, seemingly intent on subduing them with sheer force. It's said materials for the first thundering fury dadaos came from the hide of Yorak, the Horned Thunder, a legendary kaiju that roams the Shanguang desert. The lack of embellishments on this <em>+2 striking thundering greatsword</em> belies a weapon of deadly efficacy.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> envision</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You infuse the <em>thundering fury dadao</em> with the speed of lightning and the force of thunder. The weapon gains the agile and forceful traits for one round. You can Sustain this activation for up to 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.XEP4Ox6NZDGgba1r]{Effect: Thundering Fury Dadao}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "储藏室 Storage Room"
        },
