        "Cockroach Swarm": {
          "name": "蟑螂群 Cockroach Swarm",
          "tokenName": "蟑螂群 Cockroach Swarm",
          "items": {
            "Swarm Mind": {
              "name": "蜂群心智 Swarm Mind",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwarmMind]</p>"
            },
            "Swarming Bites": {
              "name": "蜂拥噬咬 Swarming Bites",
              "description": "<p>蜂群空间内的每个敌人受到 @Damage[1d8[piercing]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:18|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the swarm's space takes @Damage[1d8[piercing]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:18|basic] save).</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>虽然蟑螂往往聚集在狭窄的空间中，但受惊的群落有时会发生群集：成百上千，甚至数以千计的昆虫从藏身处窜出，化作一片闪亮的棕黑色甲壳之筏，在无数条飞快爬动的腿上翻涌而来。鉴于许多人觉得蟑螂令人作呕，遭遇这样的虫群即使对最老练的冒险者而言也足以令人心惊。这些生物一旦被惊扰就毫不罢休；与昆虫平日里胆怯无害的天性截然不同，它们在成群时会追逐激怒它们的生物或多个生物，并以成千上万带刺痛的啮咬对其纠缠不休。</p>\n<p>While cockroaches tend to gather in cramped spaces, a disturbed colony is sometimes prone to swarming, where hundreds or even thousands of the insects scurry out of their hiding places in a raft of shiny brown and black carapaces on thousands of skittering legs. Given how disgusting many find cockroaches to be, encountering such a swarm can be alarming to even the most seasoned adventurers. The creatures are relentless when disturbed; in contrast to the insects' normally skittish and harmless nature, as swarms they pursue the creature or creatures that provoked them and harry them with thousands of stinging bites.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "蟑螂虫群 Cockroach Swarm"
        },
        "Hu Lelong": {
          "name": "胡乐龙 Hu Lelong",
          "tokenName": "胡乐龙 Hu Lelong",
          "items": {
            "Cutlery": {
              "name": "餐具 Cutlery"
            },
            "Serving Platter": {
              "name": "盛菜盘 Serving Platter",
              "description": "<p>这种极小的盾牌是决斗者以及迅捷、轻甲战士的最爱。它通常由钢制成并绑在你的前臂上。只要你那只手空着，或那只手拿着一个不是武器的轻型物体，你就可以用你的圆盾进行举盾。</p>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>硬度</th>\n<th>HP</th>\n<th>BT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This very small shield is a favorite of duelists and quick, lightly armored warriors. It's typically made of steel and strapped to your forearm. You can Raise a Shield with your buckler as long as you have that hand free or are holding a light object that's not a weapon in that hand.</p>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hardness</th>\n<th>HP</th>\n<th>BT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
            },
            "Servant's Uniform": {
              "name": "仆役制服 Servant's Uniform",
              "description": "<p>普通服装实用且仅做了基本剪裁，例如农民装束、僧袍或工作服。</p>\n<p>Ordinary clothing is functional with basic tailoring, such as peasant garb, monk's robes, or work clothes.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Protective Platter": {
              "name": "防护拼盘 Protective Platter",
              "description": "<p>仆从可以使用举起护盾动作举起他们的托盘。该托盘具有与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.1k3AsSW7lpU0kEpY]{圆盾}相同的数据，但需要一只手持握。</p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.4hfQEMiEOBbqelAh]{举起护盾}</p>\n<p>The servant can raise their serving platter using the Raise a Shield action. The platter has the same statistics as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.1k3AsSW7lpU0kEpY]{Buckler} but requires a hand to hold.</p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.4hfQEMiEOBbqelAh]{Raise a Shield}</p>"
            },
            "Quick Catch": {
              "name": "快速接住 Quick Catch",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 仆役触及范围内，有一个仆役能单手拿起的物体被掉落</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 仆役至少有一只手空着</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 仆役在掉落的物体落地或离开其触及范围之前接住它。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An object the servant could hold in one hand is dropped within the servant's reach</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The servant has at least one hand free</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The servant catches the dropped object before it hits the floor or leaves their reach.</p>"
            },
            "Raise a Shield": {
              "name": "举起护盾 Raise a Shield",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 你正持用一面护盾。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你调整护盾的位置来保护自己。当你已抬起护盾时，你获得其列出的对AC的环境加值。你的护盾保持抬起状态，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a shield.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You position your shield to protect yourself. When you have Raised a Shield, you gain its listed circumstance bonus to AC. Your shield remains raised until the start of your next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Lore (any one subcategory related to their job, such as Alcohol Lore, Baking Lore, or Household Lore)": {
              "name": "学识（任何一个与其工作相关的子类别，例如酒精学识、烘焙学识或家务学识） Lore (any one subcategory related to their job, such as Alcohol Lore, Baking Lore, or Household Lore)"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>仆人可能是女仆或男管家，让家中维持井然有序；也可能是在旅店之类的场所工作的侍者，负责记下点单并为顾客上菜。</p><hr /><p>社会建立在劳动者的肩上。</p>\n<p>A servant might be a maid or butler, keeping a home in working order, or a server in an establishment like an inn, taking orders and serving customers.</p><hr /><p>Society is built upon the backs of laborers.</p>",
          "blurb": "有保护欲的年轻男性人类村民\nprotective male human young villager",
          "ac": "(15 with platter raised)",
          "prototypeToken": "胡乐龙 Hu Lelong"
        },
        "Spark Moth": {
          "name": "火花蛾 Spark Moth",
          "tokenName": "火花蛾 Spark Moth",
          "items": {
            "Wing": {
              "name": "翼 Wing"
            },
            "Arc Lightning": {
              "name": "弧形闪电 Arc Lightning",
              "description": "<p>火花蛾变形为闪电，跃向100英尺内的一大块金属，例如一套金属护甲或金属武器。随后，该元素回到其正常形态，出现在与该金属相邻的一个空间内。此次移动不会触发反应动作。</p>\n<p>The spark moth transforms into lightning that arcs to a large piece of metal within 100 feet, such as a suit of metal armor or metal weapon. The elemental then returns to its normal form in a space adjacent to the metal. This movement doesn't trigger reactions.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>电光蝙蝠聚集在气之位面中多变的天气周围。</p><hr /><p>一些元素生物体现了空气的性相，例如烟雾、闪电与浓雾。</p>\n<p>Spark bats congregate around volatile weather in the Plane of Air.</p><hr /><p>Some elementals embody aspects of air, such as smoke, lightning, and fog.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "火花蛾 Spark Moth"
        },
        "Lumber Storage North": {
          "name": "北侧木材储存区 Lumber Storage North",
          "tokenName": "北侧木材储存处 Lumber Storage North",
          "items": {
            "Saurian Spike": {
              "name": "蜥蜴尖刺 Saurian Spike",
              "description": "<p>这块锯齿状的骨质增生物收束成尖锐的尖端。其表面留有某场往昔战斗造成的深刻沟痕。携带<em>蜥蜴尖刺</em>的持有者常会感到力量与自信的骤然涌现。通过启动此物品施放的任何法术，其法术攻击调整为+15。</p><ul><li><strong>护甲</strong> 你获得不精确嗅觉，射程为30尺。</li><li><strong>武器</strong>（auditory, 情绪, 恐惧术, visual）当你通过启动尖刺施放一个变形法术时，你的战斗形态异常骇人。@Template[emanation|distance:30]内的每个敌人必须成功通过一次@Check[will|dc:27|traits:auditory,emotion,fear,visual]豁免检定，否则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}（大失败则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}）。</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.AYLthNtyUlWmKqhW]{效果：蜥蜴尖刺 - 护甲}</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.MPxbKoR54gkYkqLO]{Gouging Claw}。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KhM8MhoUgoUjBMIz]{Dinosaur Form}。</p>\n<p>This jagged, bony growth narrows to a sharp, pointed tip. Deep groves from some former battle scar its surface. The bearer of a <em>saurian spike</em> often feels a sudden surge in power and confidence. The spell attack modifier of any spell cast by activating this item is +15.</p><ul><li><strong>Armor</strong> You gain imprecise scent with a range of 30 feet.</li><li><strong>Weapon</strong> (auditory, emotion, fear, visual) When you cast a polymorph spell by activating the spike, your battle form is exceptionally fearsome. Each enemy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30] must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:27|traits:auditory,emotion,fear,visual] saving throw or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.AYLthNtyUlWmKqhW]{Effect: Saurian Spike - Armor}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.MPxbKoR54gkYkqLO]{Gouging Claw}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KhM8MhoUgoUjBMIz]{Dinosaur Form}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "北部木材储存区 Lumber Storage North"
        },
        "Dippers": {
          "name": "舀子 Dippers",
          "tokenName": "勺子 Dippers",
          "items": {
            "Delicate Clay Vial": {
              "name": "精致黏土小瓶 Delicate Clay Vial",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> 打击</p><hr /><p>这些弹簧装填的金属罐中装有化学品与盐类的混合物，能够汲取并瓦解附近的不死生物。</p><p><em>镇魂炸药</em>使攻击掷骰获得+1物品加值，造成2d8活力伤害与2点活力溅射伤害；不过与活力伤害的通常规则一致，这些伤害只会伤害不死生物与具有虚空治疗的生物。一个因<em>镇魂炸药</em>而受到伤害的主要目标会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，直到你下个回合开始。</p><p><em>镇魂炸药</em>被设计为即使接触到灵性物质也会爆炸，使其成为伤害虚体不死生物的理想选择。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p><hr /><p>These spring-loaded metal canisters contain a mixture of chemicals and salts that drain and disintegrate nearby undead creatures.</p><p>A <em>ghost charge</em> gives a +1 item bonus to attack rolls, deals 2d8 vitality damage and 2 vitality splash damage, though as usual for vitality damage, this damage harms only undead and creatures with void healing. A primary target that takes damage from a <em>ghost charge</em> becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p><p><em>Ghost charges</em> are designed to explode even on contact with a spiritual substance, making them ideal for damaging incorporeal undead.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "长柄勺 Dippers"
        },
        "Viper Swarm": {
          "name": "蝰蛇群 Viper Swarm",
          "tokenName": "蝰蛇群 Viper Swarm",
          "items": {
            "Swarm Mind": {
              "name": "虫群心智 Swarm Mind",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwarmMind]</p>"
            },
            "Venom Spritz": {
              "name": "毒液喷溅 Venom Spritz",
              "description": "<p>蝰蛇从獠牙中喷射毒液以示防御。@Template[type:cone|distance:10]内的每个生物都会暴露于蝰蛇群毒液之下，但对抗该毒素的初次豁免检定获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p>The vipers spray venom from their fangs in a defensive display. Each creature in a @Template[type:cone|distance:10] is exposed to viper swarm venom but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its initial saving throw against the poison.</p>"
            },
            "Venomous Fangs": {
              "name": "剧毒尖牙 Venomous Fangs",
              "description": "<p>蜂群空间内的每个敌人受到 @Damage[2d8[piercing]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic] 豁免）。豁免失败的生物还会暴露于蝰蛇群毒液。</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the swarm's space takes @Damage[2d8[piercing]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic] save). A creature that fails their save is also exposed to viper swarm venom.</p>"
            },
            "Viper Swarm Venom": {
              "name": "蝰蛇群毒液 Viper Swarm Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害，并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[2d4[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}，并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d4[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>由闪耀鳞片、发亮的眼睛以及滴着毒液的尖牙构成的可怖聚团——蝰蛇群——已终结了许多倒霉冒险者的性命。它们通常在夜间活动，这些以极端凶猛著称的蛇会对任何进入触及范围的东西发动打击，无论是肢体还是武器。它们的毒液是一种强效毒素，会让受害者战栗乏力。运气好的人可能会先遭到一次不带毒的警告性打击，随后才会遭到真正的攻击。</p><hr /><p>各种蛇类在所有非北极生态系统中都能繁衍生息，每一种都有其独特的狩猎模式与防御机制。</p>\n<p>The frightening mass of shining scales, gleaming eyes, and fangs dripping with venom that constitute a viper swarm has brought an end to many an unlucky adventurer. Normally nocturnal, these notoriously aggressive snakes strike at anything that comes within reach, be it limb or weapon. Their venom is a potent toxin that leaves victims shaky and weak. Those who are lucky may receive a warning strike without venom before being attacked in earnest.</p><hr /><p>Snakes of some variety thrive in every non-arctic ecosystem, each with their own particular hunting patterns and defense mechanisms.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "蝰蛇群 Viper Swarm"
        },
        "Snapping Flytrap": {
          "name": "猛咬捕蝇草 Snapping Flytrap",
          "tokenName": "猛咬捕蝇草 Snapping Flytrap",
          "items": {
            "Leaf": {
              "name": "叶子 Leaf"
            },
            "Tremorsense (Imprecise) 30 feet": {
              "name": "震动感知（不精确）30尺 Tremorsense (Imprecise) 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>"
            },
            "Quick Capture": {
              "name": "快速捕捉 Quick Capture",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物命中或触碰捕蝇草。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 捕蝇草以叶片对触发生物进行一次打击。若命中，该生物会在该叶片中陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature hits or touches the flytrap.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The flytrap makes a leaf Strike against the triggering creature. If it hits, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} in that leaf.</p>"
            },
            "Focused Assault": {
              "name": "专注突击 Focused Assault",
              "description": "<p>捕蝇草用它的两片叶子同时攻击一个目标。捕蝇草进行一次叶子打击。成功时，捕蝇草造成一次叶子打击的伤害，外加每多一片叶子（超过第一片）再额外造成1d8穿刺伤害。失败时，捕蝇草造成一次叶子打击的伤害，但它不能使用强化擒抱。大失败时不造成伤害。这在计算捕蝇草的多重攻击减值时，视为进行的攻击次数等于捕蝇草拥有的叶子数量。</p>\n<p>The flytrap attacks a single target with both its two leaves. The flytrap makes one leaf Strike. On a success, the flytrap deals the damage from one leaf Strike plus an additional 1d8 piercing damage for every leaf beyond the first. On a failure, the flytrap deals the damage from one leaf Strike, but it can't use Improved Grab. It deals no damage on a critical failure. This counts toward the flytrap's multiple attack penalty as a number of attacks equal to the number of leaves the flytrap has.</p>"
            },
            "Hungry Flurry": {
              "name": "饥饿乱舞 Hungry Flurry",
              "description": "<p>捕蝇草以-2减值进行两次叶片打击，每次针对不同的目标。这些攻击计入捕蝇草的多重攻击减值，但其多重攻击减值在它完成全部攻击之后才会增加。</p>\n<p>The flytrap makes two leaf Strikes at a -2 penalty, each against a different target. These attacks count toward the flytrap's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after it makes all its attacks.</p>"
            },
            "Swallow Whole": {
              "name": "吞噬整只 Swallow Whole",
              "description": "<p>中型，@Damage[(1d8+1)[bludgeoning],1d6[acid]]，破裂 5</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwallowWhole]</p>\n<p>Medium, @Damage[(1d8+1)[bludgeoning],1d6[acid]], Rupture 5</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwallowWhole]</p>"
            },
            "Improved Grab": {
              "name": "强化擒抱 Improved Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>猛咬捕蝇草通常有两组带齿边的叶片，每片宽3尺，长在10尺长的茎秆末端。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>捕蝇草会急切地以类人生物、巨型昆虫以及更大的猎物为食。</p>\n<p>Snapping flytraps typically have two sets of tooth-edged leaves, each measuring 3 feet wide, at the end of 10-foot-long stalks.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Flytraps eagerly feed on humanoids, monstrous insects, and larger prey.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "猛咬捕蝇草 Snapping Flytrap"
        },
        "Noppera-bo Occultist": {
          "name": "无面鬼秘术师 Noppera-bo Occultist",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼秘术师 Noppera-bo Occultist",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，用一次心灵冲击使其陷入震慑。该冲击造成 1d6 心灵伤害，进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，则它还会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加 1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧术 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你在目标心中种下恐惧；它必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑} 1轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个简单声音的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4点心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害但不承受持续伤害，且该法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。如果目标从恶心中恢复，持续伤害结束且该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Prestidigitation": {
              "name": "魔法伎俩 Prestidigitation",
              "description": "<p>最简单的魔法听从你的指挥。只要你维持该法术，你就能施展简单的魔法效果。每次你维持该法术时，你可以从四个选项中选择一个。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>烹饪</strong> 冷却、加热或为 1 磅的非生物材料调味。</li>\n<li><strong>提起</strong> 将一个无人看管、负载为轻或更低的物体缓慢抬离地面 1 英尺。</li>\n<li><strong>制造</strong> 创造一个临时物体，其负载可忽略不计，由凝结的魔法物质构成。该物体看起来粗糙且不自然，并且极其脆弱——它不能用作工具、武器或法器，也不能作为法术的代价。</li>\n<li><strong>整理</strong> 为一个负载为轻或更低的物体上色、清洁或弄脏。你可以用 10 轮的专注影响一个负载为 1 的物体；而更大的物体则每 1 负载需要 1 分钟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>魔法伎俩</em>不能造成伤害或导致不利状态。对物体造成的任何实际改变（超出上述内容者）仅在你维持该法术期间持续。</p>\n<p>The simplest magic does your bidding. You can perform simple magical effects for as long as you Sustain the spell. Each time you Sustain the spell, you can choose one of four options.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cook</strong> Cool, warm, or flavor 1 pound of nonliving material.</li>\n<li><strong>Lift</strong> Slowly lift an unattended object of light Bulk or less 1 foot off the ground.</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> Create a temporary object of negligible Bulk, made of congealed magical substance. The object looks crude and artificial and is extremely fragile-it can't be used as a tool, weapon, or locus or cost for a spell.</li>\n<li><strong>Tidy</strong> Color, clean, or soil an object of light Bulk or less. You can affect an object of 1 Bulk with 10 rounds of concentration, and a larger object a 1 minute per Bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Prestidigitation</em> can't deal damage or cause adverse conditions. Any actual change to an object (beyond what is noted above) persists only as long as you Sustain the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你专注于目标物体，敞开心扉以感知魔法灵光。施法完成时，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法。你或任何经你告知该灵光信息的人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得 +2 环境加值。若该物体为幻觉，你仅在该效果的环阶低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的环阶时才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以 10 个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "护盾 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你升起一道由力场构成的魔法护盾。这视为使用【举盾】动作，使你获得 +1 环境加值至 AC，持续到你下个回合开始，但使用它不需要空出一只手。</p>\n<p>在该法术的效果持续期间，你可以用你的魔法护盾使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} 反应动作（）。该护盾具有 硬度 5。你可以使用该法术的反应动作（）来减少来自任何法术或魔法效果的伤害，即使其不造成物理伤害也可以。在你使用 Shield Block 后，该法术结束，且你在 10 分钟内无法再次施放它。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 护盾的硬度提高 5。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. You can use the spell's reaction to reduce damage from any spell or magical effect, even if it doesn't deal physical damage. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The shield's Hardness increases by 5.</p>"
            },
            "Sleep": {
              "name": "睡眠术 Sleep",
              "description": "<p>区域内的每个生物都会变得昏昏欲睡，并可能入睡。因该法术而陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}的生物不会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}，也不会松开其所持之物。该法术不会阻止生物通过一次成功的察觉检定而醒来，这使其在战斗中的效用受限。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物的察觉检定承受-1状态减值，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物陷入Unconscious。若其在1分钟后仍处于Unconscious，则会自动醒来。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物陷入Unconscious。若其在1小时后仍处于Unconscious，则会自动醒来。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 在失败时，生物陷入Unconscious，持续1轮；在大失败时，持续1分钟。它们会倒地并松开其所持之物，且无法尝试察觉检定来醒来。当持续时间结束时，该生物会正常睡眠，而非自动醒来。</p>\n<p>Each creature in the area becomes drowsy and might fall asleep. A creature that falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} from this spell doesn't fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} or release what it's holding. This spell doesn't prevent creatures from waking up due to a successful Perception check, limiting its utility in combat.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes a -1 status penalty to Perception checks for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature falls Unconscious. If it's still Unconscious after 1 minute, it wakes up automatically.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature falls Unconscious. If it's still Unconscious after 1 hour, it wakes up automatically.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The creatures fall Unconscious for 1 round on a failure or 1 minute on a critical failure. They fall Prone and release what they're holding, and they can't attempt Perception checks to wake up. When the duration ends, the creature is sleeping normally instead of automatically waking up.</p>"
            },
            "Staff": {
              "name": "法杖 Staff"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30 尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉，但它们的听觉非常敏锐。它们不需要呼吸，并免疫于需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上会把双手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；它们也能以这种方式从消耗品（如药水或灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>Noppera-bos have no sense of vision, but their sense of hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}状态，他们就会处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>As long as a noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonate Shape": {
              "name": "乔装变形 Impersonate Shape",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼变成其在过去24小时内触碰过的一名小型或中型类人生物的样子，并获得该目标生物的面容与声音。变形期间，无面鬼在@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{乔装}该生物时获得+2环境加值，并失去其无面能力与所列免疫。无面鬼可以再次使用此能力以变回原状。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo changes into a version of a Small or Medium humanoid they've touched during the last 24 hours, and gains the target creature's face and voice. While transformed, the noppera-bo gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{Impersonate} that creature and loses its no face ability and listed immunities. The noppera-bo can change back by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Remove Face": {
              "name": "移除面容 Remove Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 无面鬼正在冒充一个有脸的生物</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 无面鬼的面部特征融化成虚无，并威吓30尺内的一个生物。该生物在一次失败的 @Check[will|dc:18] 豁免后变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}）。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The noppera-bo is Impersonating a creature with a face</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The noppera-bo's facial features melt into nothingness, and they menace a creature within 30 feet. The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} on a failed @Check[will|dc:18] save (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
            },
            "Steal Face": {
              "name": "窃取面容 Steal Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 无面鬼秘术师处于无面状态</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 无面鬼秘术师以30尺内的一个生物为目标。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:18] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩}，持续至其下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 无面鬼获得目标的脸。目标的脸消失，直到其下个回合结束。在此期间，其处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲}，无法说话或摄食，且无法闻到气味。目标还必须屏住呼吸，否则将开始窒息。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但该效果不会自动结束。目标可在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的豁免，且每次尝试的DC累积降低1。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The noppera-bo occultist is faceless</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The noppera-bo occultist targets one creature within 30 feet. The creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:18] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The noppera-bo gains the target's face. The target's face vanishes until the end of its next turn. Until then, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded}, can't speak or ingest, and can't smell. The target must also hold its breath or begin to suffocate.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the effect doesn't end automatically. The target can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such attempt.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>有些无面鬼会运用他们天生的魔法来进一步惊吓受害者。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>无面鬼从背后看起来就像普通人类，甚至可能长得像你认识的人，直到他们转过身来，露出一张毫无五官的脸。</p>\n<h2>炉火纯青的专业人士</h2>\n<p>典型的无面鬼残忍无情，并以惊吓或折磨类人生物为乐，但并非所有无面鬼都沉溺于邪恶。中立的无面鬼往往是爱恶作剧的捣蛋鬼，利用他们的能力来戏弄与逗弄他人；而罕见的善良无面鬼则会用他们的能力来敬重并崇拜他们钦佩的人，同时把自己的时间投入到提升艺术或手工制作技能上。</p>\n<h2>无面鬼起源</h2>\n<p>关于无面鬼的起源有许多理论——从化狸的变形能力出了差错，到被诅咒扭曲的类人生物，再到自然诞生的妖怪。有人甚至推测这种状态是一种可传播的诅咒，类似兽化症。大多数无面鬼不记得自己的来历，而且通常更感兴趣的是假扮成完全不同的另一个人。</p>\n<p>Some noppera-bos harness their natural magic to further frighten victims.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Noppera-bos appear to be regular humans from behind, and might even resemble someone you know, until they turn to reveal a featureless face.</p>\n<h2>Consummate Professionals</h2>\n<p>While the typical noppera-bo is cruel and revels in the act of frightening or tormenting humanoid creatures, not all of them wallow in evil. Neutral noppera-bos tend to be pranksters who use their abilities to trick and tease, while the rare good noppera- bos instead use their abilities to honor and idolize those they admire while focusing their own time on developing their skills at art or crafting.</p>\n<h2>Noppera-bo Origins</h2>\n<p>There are many theories on the origins of noppera-bos—from tanuki whose change shape ability went wrong, to humanoids who were warped by curses, to naturally spawning yokai. Some even theorize this condition is a transmissible curse like lycanthropy. Most noppera-bos don't recall their origins, and are often more interested in pretending to be someone else entirely.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼秘学师 Noppera-bo Occultist"
        },
        "Quarters": {
          "name": "宿舍 Quarters",
          "tokenName": "营房 Quarters",
          "items": {
            "Scroll of Cleanse Affliction (Rank 4)": {
              "name": "净化苦难卷轴（4环） Scroll of Cleanse Affliction (Rank 4)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{净化苦难}</p><hr /><p>使用卷轴施放法术需要将卷轴持在一只手中，并以施法（行动）来启动它，使用该法术正常所需的动作数量。</p>\n<p>该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。由于是你在施放法术，使用你的法术攻击调整和法术DC。该法术还会获得与你的根源相对应的适当特征（奥术、神圣、异能或原能）。</p>\n<p>任何实体成本都会在制作卷轴时提供，因此你在使用卷轴施放时不需要再提供它们。若该法术需要法器，你必须拥有该法器才能从卷轴施放法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要创建某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖拽到PC、NPC或战利品角色的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{Cleanse Affliction}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>The spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack modifier and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when casting from a scroll. If the spell requires a locus, you must have that locus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            },
            "Scroll of Clear Mind (Rank 4)": {
              "name": "澄心卷轴（4环） Scroll of Clear Mind (Rank 4)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{澄明心智}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴施放一个法术需要用一只手持握卷轴，并以施法（行动）将其启动，所需动作数与该法术正常所需的动作数相同。</p>\n<p>该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。由于是你在施法，使用你的法术攻击调整和法术DC。该法术还会获得与你的根源相应的特征（奥术、神圣、奥秘或原初）。</p>\n<p>卷轴在制作时就已提供任何物理成本，因此你在从卷轴施放时不需要再提供它们。若该法术需要法器，你必须拥有该法器才能从卷轴施法。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要制作某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入PC、NPC或战利品角色的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{Clear Mind}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>The spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack modifier and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when casting from a scroll. If the spell requires a locus, you must have that locus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            },
            "Scroll of Sending (Rank 5)": {
              "name": "传讯卷轴（5环） Scroll of Sending (Rank 5)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R9xqCBblkS5KE4y7]{传讯术}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴施放法术需要你一手持握卷轴，并以施法（行动）来启动卷轴，使用该法术通常所需数量的动作。</p>\n<p>该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。因为是你在施放该法术，使用你的法术攻击调整和法术DC。该法术也会获得与你的根源相对应的特征（奥术、神圣、奥秘或原初）。</p>\n<p>卷轴在制作时就已提供任何实体成本，因此你从卷轴施放时无需再提供这些成本。若该法术需要法器，你必须持有该法器才能从卷轴施放该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要创建某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从合集或合集浏览器拖入一名PC、NPC或战利品演员的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R9xqCBblkS5KE4y7]{Sending}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>The spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack modifier and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when casting from a scroll. If the spell requires a locus, you must have that locus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "宿舍 Quarters"
        },
        "Bed": {
          "name": "床 Bed",
          "tokenName": "床 Bed",
          "items": {
            "Skyfang Crystal": {
              "name": "天牙水晶 Skyfang Crystal",
              "description": "<p><em>天牙水晶</em>外观是一段柔和发光的蓝色水晶，形状如微微弯曲的獠牙；通常固定在一小段链条上，便于作为项链佩戴或缠绕在前臂上。它发出的光亮强度等同于一支蜡烛；这种光无法被熄灭，但只需用布包住水晶、把它戴在衣物下面，或将其放在容器里，就能将光遮住。人们相信最初的这些魔法水晶由一条濒死的天龙所创造，她一生都在与邪恶魂魄作战。她从自己的颌骨上拔下12颗最小的牙齿，将它们赠予她最信任的12位盟友，使他们即便在她逝去之后，仍能继续追踪邪恶魂魄，并在此过程中受到保护。<em>天牙水晶</em>提供无法被熄灭、如蜡烛般的照明，并且只要你将其灌注，你就获得心灵抗力10。若你为邪恶阵营，在你灌注<em>天牙水晶</em>期间，你处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 命令术，交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将<em>天牙水晶</em>接触到你的眉心，并说出你正在寻找的某个特定恶魔或魂魄的名字。若目标与你处于同一位面，当你面向该被点名生物的大致方向时，<em>天牙水晶</em>会以更强的光脉动，使你能够@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{追踪}该生物。此检定的DC等同于该生物的意志DC，你可以使用神秘学、宗教或生存来尝试该检定。只要你正在追踪该恶魔或魂魄，你对抗该生物所产生效果的豁免骰获得+2物品加值。该效果持续，直到你再次启动<em>天牙水晶</em>以追踪不同的目标为止。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Z7KzhGhAWzgXIEkp]{Effect: Skyfang Crystal}</p>\n<p>A <em>skyfang crystal</em> appears as a softly glowing length of blue crystal shaped like a gently curved fang; it's typically affixed to a short length of chain, allowing it to be worn as a necklace or wrapped around a forearm. The light it sheds is equal in strength to that of a candle; it can't be extinguished but can be blocked simply by wrapping the crystal in cloth, wearing it under clothing, or keeping it in a container. The first of these magical crystals was believed to have been created by a dying sky dragon who'd spent her life fighting against evil spirits. She plucked a dozen of her smallest teeth from her jaw and offered them to her 12 most trusted allies so that they could continue to track down evil spirits and remain protected as they did so, even after she was gone. A <em>skyfang crystal</em> provides illumination as a candle that can't be extinguished, and as long as you have it invested, you gain mental resistance 10. If you're evil, you're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} while you have a <em>skyfang crystal</em> invested.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> command, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You touch the <em>skyfang crystal</em> to your brow and utter the name of a specific fiend or spirit you seek. If the target is on the same plane as you, the <em>skyfang crystal</em> pulses stronger with light when you face in the approximate direction of the named creature, allowing you to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track} that creature. The DC for this check is equal to the creature's Will DC, and you can use Occultism, Religion, or Survival to attempt the check. As long as you're tracking this fiend or spirit, you gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws against effects that creature generates. This effect persists until you activate the <em>skyfang crystal</em> again to track a different target.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Z7KzhGhAWzgXIEkp]{Effect: Skyfang Crystal}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "床 Bed"
        },
