        "Ren Mei Li's Gift": {
          "name": "任美璃的赋礼 Ren Mei Li's Gift",
          "tokenName": "任美璃的赋礼 Ren Mei Li's Gift",
          "items": {
            "Spacious Pouch made of Spidersilk (Type II)": {
              "name": "蜘蛛丝制宽敞小袋（II型） Spacious Pouch made of Spidersilk (Type II)",
              "description": "<p>尽管它看起来像一个以色彩浓郁的丝绸拼片或时髦刺绣装饰的布袋，<em>宽敞袋</em>却会通向一个比其外部尺寸更大的魔法空间。袋中所装的负载不会改变<em>宽敞袋</em>本身的负载。该袋的超次元空间能容纳的负载量取决于其类型。</p>\n<p>你可以对<em>宽敞袋</em>进行交互，将物品收纳其中或取出，方式与普通麻袋无异。尽管该袋能容纳大量材料，任何物体仍必须能穿过袋口才能被存入其中。</p>\n<p>如果袋子超载或破损，它会破裂并彻底毁坏，导致其中的物品永远遗失。若将其翻转到里外颠倒，袋中的物品会完好无损地倾倒出来，但在再次使用前必须把袋子翻回正面。将一个活的生物放入袋中时，它在开始窒息前有10分钟的空气可用，并且它可以尝试以DC 13进行逃脱。袋内的物品除非先被取出，否则不会提供任何益处。袋中的物品无法被只能侦测同一位面上事物的魔法侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>容量</strong> 50 负载</p>\n<p>Though it appears to be a cloth bag decorated with panels of richly colored silk or stylish embroidery, a <em>spacious pouch</em> opens into a magical space larger than its outside dimensions. The Bulk held inside the bag doesn't change the Bulk of the <em>spacious pouch</em> itself. The amount of Bulk the bag's extradimensional space can hold depends on its type.</p>\n<p>You can Interact with the <em>spacious pouch</em> to stow items in it or remove them just like a mundane sack. Though the bag can hold a great amount of material, an object still needs to be able to fit through the opening of the sack to be stored inside.</p>\n<p>If the bag is overloaded or broken, it ruptures and is ruined, causing the items inside to be lost forever. If it's turned inside out, the items inside spill out unharmed, but the bag must be put right before it can be used again. A living creature placed inside the bag has enough air for 10 minutes before it begins to suffocate, and it can attempt to Escape against a DC of 13. An item inside the bag provides no benefits unless it's retrieved first. An item in the bag can't be detected by magic that detects only things on the same plane.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Capacity</strong> 50 Bulk</p>"
            },
            "Evil-Reflecting Shield": {
              "name": "辟邪盾 Evil-Reflecting Shield",
              "description": "<p>一个明亮的八角形边框环绕着这面圆形的拂晓银护盾，其表面打磨得如镜面般光亮，能清晰而真实地映照万物。只要你举起这面标准等级的拂晓银护盾（硬度 5，HP 20，BT 10），你便会在对抗带有不洁或虚能（特征）的法术时，获得它对豁免骰的环境加值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> 命令术（幸运）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你尝试对抗带有不洁或虚能特征的效果进行一次豁免骰</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你的豁免骰结果视为比实际结果好一个等级。若此效果将一次成功变为大成功，你可以将部分效果的力量作为一阵魔法反冲波反射回触发该效果的来源，只要该来源在 30 尺内。当你如此做时，目标必须在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:28] 豁免中成功，否则将变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<p>A bright, octagonal frame surrounds this circular dawnsilver shield, which itself is polished to a mirrorlike sheen that reflects clear and true. While you have this standard-grade dawnsilver shield (Hardness 5, HP 20, BT 10) raised, you gain its circumstance bonus to saving throws against spells with the unholy or void trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> command (fortune)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt a saving throw against an effect with the unholy or void traits</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Your saving throw result is considered one degree better than the actual result. If this effect turns a success into a critical success, you can reflect some of the effect's power as a wave of magical backlash back to the source of the triggering effect, as long as the source is within 30 feet. When you do so, the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Fortune Cord": {
              "name": "财富绳 Fortune Cord",
              "description": "<p>在天夏的许多地方，将钱币中心铸出方孔或圆孔是一项传统，目的是可以穿绳串起并打结，以确保安全并便于交易。这根编织得一丝不苟的红绳遵循该传统制作，任何时候最多可串起100枚钱币。只要你携带一根财富绳，你在进行用于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.QyzlsLrqM0EEwd7j]{赚取收入}的技能检定时获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>如果你在每日准备期间将至多100枚钱币串在一根<em>财富绳</em>上，只要串起的钱币全为同一类型，则在你下次进行每日准备之前，你可以用两种不同方式启用该魔法物品。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启用</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你的<em>财富绳</em>上至少串有50枚钱币</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将<em>财富绳</em>转化为一把<em>+2强击双节棍</em>，持续1分钟。绳上串起的钱币类型决定这把<em>+2强击双节棍</em>上显现的额外武器性质符文，如下所示。</p>\n<p><strong>铜币：</strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Wm0X7Pfd1bfocPSv]{侵蚀}武器</p>\n<p><strong>银币：</strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.NVst7e69agGG9Qwd]{电击}武器</p>\n<p><strong>金币：</strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.XszNvxnymWYRaoTp]{炽焰}武器</p>\n<p><strong>铂币：</strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.M5M1WJ5KzbYfRGsY]{冻寒}武器</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启用</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 操控，交互</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你挥甩财富绳，使其上串着的10枚钱币脱落并射向你能看见的100尺内的一名生物。该生物受到4d6伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic]豁免）；伤害类型取决于你串起的钱币类型。铜币造成@Damage[4d6[acid]]伤害，银币造成@Damage[4d6[electricity]]伤害，金币造成@Damage[4d6[fire]]伤害，铂币造成@Damage[4d6[cold]]伤害。</p>\n<p>In many parts of Tian Xia, it's tradition to mint coins with holes in the centers for the purpose of being able to thread a cord through them and tie them off for security and ease of transaction. This immaculately braided red cord is made in this tradition and can hold up to 100 coins at any given time. As long as you carry a fortune cord, you gain a +2 item bonus to skill checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.QyzlsLrqM0EEwd7j]{Earn Income}.</p>\n<p>If you load up to 100 coins onto a <em>fortune cord</em> as part of your daily preparations, you can Activate the magic item in two different ways until the next time you make your daily preparations, provided all the loaded coins are of the same type.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> you have at least 50 coins loaded onto the <em>fortune cord</em></p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You transform the <em>fortune cord</em> into a <em>+2 striking nunchaku</em> for 1 minute. The type of coin loaded onto the cord determines the additional weapon property rune that manifests on this <em>+2 striking nunchaku</em>, as follows.</p>\n<p><strong>Copper:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Wm0X7Pfd1bfocPSv]{Corrosive} weapon</p>\n<p><strong>Silver:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.NVst7e69agGG9Qwd]{Shock} weapon</p>\n<p><strong>Gold:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.XszNvxnymWYRaoTp]{Flaming} weapon</p>\n<p><strong>Platinum:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.M5M1WJ5KzbYfRGsY]{Frost} weapon</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> manipulate, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You whip the fortune cord, causing 10 coins loaded onto it to detach and fire at a creature within 100 feet that you can see. That creature takes 4d6 damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic] save); the damage type depends on the type of coins you've loaded. Copper coins deal @Damage[4d6[acid]] damage, silver coins deal @Damage[4d6[electricity]] damage, gold coins deal @Damage[4d6[fire]] damage, and platinum coins deal @Damage[4d6[cold]] damage.</p>"
            },
            "Purgatory Emissary's Staff": {
              "name": "地府鬼差法杖 Purgatory Emissary's Staff",
              "description": "<p>这根灰木法杖顶部系着一缕漂白成惨白色的马鬃长穗。在天夏历史上不同地区与时期中，它历来由最重要的朝廷官员携带；地府鬼差法杖也与执行惩罚性刑罚的招魂者有着强烈关联。人们认为，这种联系是在以一种诙谐的方式致意来世的官僚本质。</p>\n<p>当你携带<em>地府鬼差法杖</em>时，招魂者与魂魄往往会以一定程度的尊重对待你。当你挥持这根法杖时，你在所有用于调整招魂者或魂魄态度的技能检定中获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>作为武器使用时，地府鬼差法杖是一根<em>+2强击幽冥法杖</em>。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你从法杖中消耗一定数量的充能，以从其法术列表中施放一个法术。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>戏法</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kcelf6IHl3L9VXXg]{Vitality Lash}</li>\n<li><strong>1环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aIHY2DArKFweIrpf]{命令术}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8xRzLhwGL7Dgy3EZ]{圣域术}</li>\n<li><strong>2环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{Clear Mind}（仅限@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧}），@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9]{See the Unseen}</li>\n<li><strong>3环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.DyiD239dNS7RIxZE]{Holy Light}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aewxsale5xWEPKLk]{Ring of Truth}</li>\n<li><strong>4环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{解除魔法}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FM3SmEW8N1FCRjqt]{死者交谈}</li>\n<li><strong>5环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.bay4AfSu2iIozNNW]{放逐术}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K]{Truespeech}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This ash wood staff is topped by a long tassel of bleached-white horsehair. Historically carried by the most important of court officials throughout various regions and periods of Tian Xia's history, purgatory emissary's staves are also strongly associated with psychopomps serving punitive sentences. It's thought this connection is a comical nod to the bureaucratic nature of the afterlife.</p>\n<p>Psychopomps and spirits tend to regard you with a level of respect while you carry a <em>purgatory emissary's staff</em>. While you wield this staff, you receive a +2 item bonus to all skill checks made to adjust a psychopomp's or spirit's attitude.</p>\n<p>When used as a weapon, a purgatory emissary's staff is a <em>+2 striking ghost touch staff.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kcelf6IHl3L9VXXg]{Vitality Lash}</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aIHY2DArKFweIrpf]{Command}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8xRzLhwGL7Dgy3EZ]{Sanctuary}</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{Clear Mind} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened} only), @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9]{See the Unseen}</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.DyiD239dNS7RIxZE]{Holy Light}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aewxsale5xWEPKLk]{Ring of Truth}</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FM3SmEW8N1FCRjqt]{Talking Corpse}</li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.bay4AfSu2iIozNNW]{Banishment}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K]{Truespeech}</li>\n</ul>"
            },
            "Sensei's Parasol": {
              "name": "师父阳伞 Sensei's Parasol",
              "description": "<p>一位大师曾对弟子说，在技艺精湛者手中，即使是一把阳伞也能成为致命武器。次日归来，弟子兴奋地递上一把由金属伞骨打造的阳伞，解释说这能降低施展致命之力所需的技巧。大师叹了口气，意识到弟子没能领会要点，但仍然收下了这份赋礼。毕竟，巧思也是一种美德。</p>\n<p>自那以后，更多的<em>师父阳伞</em>被制作出来，并且极受追捧。这把武器的功能等同于一根<em>+2 强击长棍</em>。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你令阳伞的金属伞骨张开，使其变形为一面@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pNQJ9PTOEHxEZCgp]{中型坚固护盾}（硬度13，生命值104［破损阈值51］）。你可以维持此启动最多10分钟，之后<em>师父阳伞</em>会恢复为长棍形态。若其作为护盾时破损，则会恢复为未受损的长棍形态。若其作为护盾时被摧毁，则会恢复为长棍形态并变为破损状态。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> 想象</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> <em>师父阳伞</em>处于长棍形态且未破损</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物以近战打击未命中你</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将该次未命中的打击改道，使其以触发生物触及范围内的一个生物或物体为目标。触发生物对新目标进行一次新的打击掷骰，以决定该次改道攻击的结果。</p>\n<p>A master once said to his pupil that, in the hands of a skilled practitioner, even a parasol can become a deadly weapon. Returning the next day, the pupil excitedly turned over a parasol forged out of metal slats, explaining that it lowered the amount of skill one would need to exert deadly force. The master sighed, seeing that his pupil had failed to see the point, but accepted the gift nonetheless. Ingenuity was, after all, a virtue.</p>\n<p>Since then, additional <em>sensei's parasols</em> have been crafted, and they're very sought after. This weapon functions as a <em>+2 striking bo staff</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You cause the metal slats of the parasol to open up, transforming it into a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pNQJ9PTOEHxEZCgp]{Moderate Sturdy Shield} (Hardness 13, HP 104 [BT 51]). You can sustain this activation for up to 10 minutes, after which the <em>sensei's parasol</em> reverts back to bo-staff form. If it's broken as a shield, it reverts to its undamaged bo-staff form. If it's destroyed as a shield, it reverts to bo-staff form and becomes broken.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> envision</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The <em>sensei's parasol</em> is in bo-staff form and isn't broken</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature misses you with a melee Strike</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You redirect the missed Strike to target a creature or object within the triggering creature's reach. The triggering creature rolls a new Strike against the new target to determine the results of the redirected attack.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "任美璃的赋礼 Ren Mei Li's Gift"
        },
