        "Myna's Gift (Saved Two)": {
          "name": "米娜的赋礼（已救两人） Myna's Gift (Saved Two)",
          "tokenName": "米娜的赋礼（救下两人） Myna's Gift (Saved Two)",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Moderate)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（中等） Healing Potion (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色的液体，当饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时，会带来一阵刺痛感。当你喝下<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Smoke Ball (Greater)": {
              "name": "烟雾球（高等） Smoke Ball (Greater)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当你将这颗球猛砸在地面上时，你会立刻制造出一片浓厚、不透明的烟幕，形成一个以你所占空间的一个角为中心的 @Template[burst|distance:20]。该区域内的所有生物都处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}状态，并且所有其他生物对它们而言也处于隐蔽状态。烟雾持续 1 分钟，或直到被强风吹散。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Upon smashing this ball on the ground, you instantly create a screen of thick, opaque smoke in a @Template[burst|distance:20] centered on one corner of your space. All creatures within that area are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all other creatures are concealed to them. The smoke lasts for 1 minute or until dispersed by a strong wind.</p>"
            },
            "Everlasting Adhesive": {
              "name": "恒久黏胶 Everlasting Adhesive",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> 1分钟（操作）</p><hr /><p>这种古怪的琥珀色黏合剂能将两处表面几乎牢不可分地黏在一起。一瓶可覆盖至多1平方英尺的区域，且必须一次性全部用完，以在两处表面之间形成一次黏合。若启动被打断，则黏合失败，黏合剂也会被浪费。</p>\n<p>一旦两处表面用永恒黏合剂黏在一起，生物只能在成功通过一次DC 50的@Check[athletics|dc:50]检定后才能将其分开。除非被黏住的物体格外坚固，否则它们往往会在黏合剂之前先破损；不过，若有生物决心要把这些物体分开，它可以折断由永恒黏合剂连接的那部分，之后再修理这些物体。</p>\n<p>黏合剂只能在生物自愿的情况下影响生物；此外，通过剥脱最外层皮肤即可破坏其黏合。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> 1 minute (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>This peculiar amber adhesive bonds two surfaces together almost inseparably. A single flask covers an area up to 1 square foot and must be used all at once to form a single bond between two surfaces. If the activation is interrupted, the bond fails, and the adhesive is wasted.</p>\n<p>Once two surfaces are joined with everlasting adhesive, a creature can separate them only with a successful @Check[athletics|dc:50] check. The adhered objects tend to break before the adhesive does unless they're particularly durable, though a creature determined to separate the objects can break off the parts connected by the everlasting adhesive and later Repair the objects.</p>\n<p>The adhesive can affect creatures only if they're willing, and its bond can be broken by exfoliating the outermost layer of skin.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "玛娜的赋礼（拯救二人） Myna's Gift (Saved Two)"
        },
        "Shelf": {
          "name": "搁板 Shelf",
          "tokenName": "架子 Shelf",
          "items": {
            "Oil of Potency": {
              "name": "潜能油 Oil of Potency",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>当你将这种浓稠、黏滑的油涂抹在一把武器或一套护甲上时，该物品立刻变得具有魔法潜能。若该物品是武器，它会暂时变为一把<em>+1 强击武器</em>；若是护甲，它会暂时变为<em>+1 坚韧护甲</em>。此效果持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{效果：潜能油}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>When you apply this thick, viscous oil to a weapon or suit of armor, that item immediately becomes magically potent. If the item is a weapon, it temporarily becomes a <em>+1 striking weapon</em>, or, if it's armor, it temporarily becomes <em>+1 resilient armor</em>. This lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{Effect: Oil of Potency}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "架子 Shelf"
        },
        "Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Skilled)": {
          "name": "无面鬼模仿者（熟练） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Skilled)",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼模仿者（熟练） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Skilled)",
          "items": {
            "False Weapon": {
              "name": "虚假武器 False Weapon",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者携带一把看起来与其所模仿的PC偏好武器完全相同的<em>+1强击</em>武器。如果该PC偏好徒手打击，它看起来就像缠手布。如果该PC偏好远程武器，则无面鬼模仿者没有近战武器，而是改用上文的远程武器规则；否则，无面鬼模仿者没有远程武器。如果PC不偏好任何武器，则无面鬼会挥舞一根棍棒作为其虚假武器。此虚假武器仅部分真实，命中时只造成心灵伤害；它不会获得原武器的任何特征或魔法强化。如果无面鬼模仿者的虚假武器处于破损状态、被缴械或被放下，它会逐渐消失。无面鬼模仿者可以花费10分钟重新创造一把，以制作替代的虚假武器。</p>\n<p>A noppera-bo impersonator carries a <em>+1 striking</em> weapon that looks identical to the favored weapon of the PC being impersonated. If the PC favors unarmed strikes, it appears as hand wraps. If the PC favors a ranged weapon, then the noppera-bo impersonator has no melee weapon and instead uses the ranged weapon rules above; otherwise, the noppera-bo impersonator has no ranged weapon. If the PCs favors no weapon, then the noppera-bo wields a club as its false weapon. This false weapon is only partially real and inflicts only mental damage when it hits; it gains none of the original weapon's traits or magical enhancements. If a noppera-bo impersonator's false weapon is broken, disarmed, or set down, it fades away. The noppera-bo impersonator can craft a replacement false weapon by spending 10 minutes to recreate one.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉，但他们的听觉极为精准。他们不需要呼吸，并且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。他们通过皮肤吸收液体来获得养分——传统做法是将双手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；他们也可以用这种方式从消耗品（如药水或灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo has no sense of vision, but their hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{失聪}状态，它们就会处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>As long as the noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonated Abilities": {
              "name": "模仿能力 Impersonated Abilities",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者获得以下能力之一，由你选择。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.kkP0tagXmAYuSH3u]{效果：被模仿的能力}</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指挥者</strong> 无面鬼模仿者获得一个他们可以命令术的仆从。该生物呈现为被模仿PC的动物伙伴、幻灵或其他战斗伙伴生物的形态；选择一个4级生物，使其能力大致贴近被模仿的伙伴生物。该生物获得仆从（特征）。</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.6U04OKtvRURExkli]{元素攻击}</li>\n<li><strong>偷袭</strong> 无面鬼模仿者对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}的生物额外造成1d6精准伤害。</li>\n<li><strong>武器提升</strong> 无面鬼模仿者从以下武器特征中选择一个，添加到他们的虚假武器上：灵巧、背刺者、缴械、娴熟、横扫或绊摔。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The noppera-bo impersonator gains one of the following abilities of your choice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.kkP0tagXmAYuSH3u]{Effect: Impersonated Ability}</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Commander</strong> The noppera-bo impersonator gains a minion that they can command. This creature takes the form of the impersonated PC's animal companion, eidolon, or other fighting companion creature; choose a 4th-level creature that approximates the impersonated companion creature's abilities. This creature gains the minion trait.</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.6U04OKtvRURExkli]{Elemental Attack}</li>\n<li><strong>Sneak Attack</strong> The noppera-bo impersonator deals an additional 1d6 precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures.</li>\n<li><strong>Weapon Perk</strong> The noppera-bo impersonator chooses one of the following weapon traits to add to their false weapon: agile, backstabber, disarm, finesse, sweep, or trip.</li>\n</ul>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼模仿者（熟练） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Skilled)"
        },
