          "name": "紫 Murasaki",
          "tokenName": "紫 Murasaki",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Prestidigitation": {
              "name": "魔法伎俩 Prestidigitation",
              "description": "<p>最简单的魔法听从你的使唤。只要你维持该法术，你就能施展简单的魔法效果。每次你维持该法术时，你可以从以下四个选项中选择一个。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>烹饪</strong> 使1磅非生物材料变凉、变暖或调味。</li>\n<li><strong>提起</strong> 将一件无人持用、负载为轻或更低的物体缓慢抬离地面1英尺。</li>\n<li><strong>制作</strong> 创造一个临时物体，其负载可忽略不计，由凝结的魔法物质构成。该物体看起来粗糙且不自然，并且极其脆弱——不能用作工具、武器或法器，也不能作为施放法术的成本。</li>\n<li><strong>整理</strong> 为一件负载为轻或更低的物体上色、清洁或弄脏。你可以用10轮的专注影响一件负载为1的物体；更大的物体则每1负载需要1分钟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>魔法伎俩</em>无法造成伤害或引发不利状态。对物体所造成的任何实际改变（超出上文所述者）仅在你维持该法术期间持续。</p>\n<p>The simplest magic does your bidding. You can perform simple magical effects for as long as you Sustain the spell. Each time you Sustain the spell, you can choose one of four options.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cook</strong> Cool, warm, or flavor 1 pound of nonliving material.</li>\n<li><strong>Lift</strong> Slowly lift an unattended object of light Bulk or less 1 foot off the ground.</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> Create a temporary object of negligible Bulk, made of congealed magical substance. The object looks crude and artificial and is extremely fragile-it can't be used as a tool, weapon, or locus or cost for a spell.</li>\n<li><strong>Tidy</strong> Color, clean, or soil an object of light Bulk or less. You can affect an object of 1 Bulk with 10 rounds of concentration, and a larger object a 1 minute per Bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Prestidigitation</em> can't deal damage or cause adverse conditions. Any actual change to an object (beyond what is noted above) persists only as long as you Sustain the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>金精对处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} 状态的生物造成额外 1d6 点精准伤害。</p>\n<p>The jinkin deals 1d6 extra precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Tinker": {
              "name": "修补匠 Tinker",
              "description": "<p>一群六只金金可以协同工作1小时，在60尺射程内将一件物品灌注上诅咒。尽管这一过程耗时很长，但也不引人注目，并且可以在@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{躲藏}期间进行。金金更喜欢把这种能力用在魔法物品上。该诅咒会使物品变得不可靠（进行一次@Check[flat|dc:5]检定，否则浪费任何用来与该物品交互或启动该物品的动作），为使用该物品增添一项怪异的要求，或施加其他强度相近的诅咒。</p>\n<p>A group of six jinkins can work together for an hour to imbue an item with a curse at a range of 60 feet. While this process is lengthy, it's also unobtrusive and can be performed while @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hiding}. Jinkins prefer to use this ability on magic items. The curse makes the item unreliable (@Check[flat|dc:5] check or waste any action to Interact with or Activate the item), adds a bizarre requirement to use the item, or imparts some other curse of a similar caliber.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>金金怪是残忍成性的修补匠，专门偷窃并破坏物品，并以自己能诅咒珍贵物体的能力为傲。它们心怀怨念，一旦觉得受了冒犯——比如有生物竟敢移除它们施加的某个诅咒——就会制定曲折复杂的复仇计划。金金怪很少满足于制造简单的混乱；它们也从折磨与谋杀中获得极大快感，不过它们更偏好把受害者引入为捕获或使其失能而设计的陷阱，而不是直接将其杀死。深坑是它们偏爱的手段，因为在受害者侥幸跌落后生还时，仍将面临因饥饿和口渴而来的缓慢死亡，而金金怪则会聚集在坑边嘲弄并折磨他们。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>小魔怪（特征）是残酷的妖精恶作剧者与破坏者，已彻底适应了宇宙中的生活，并为其富于创造力的毁灭性找到了各自独特的定位。几乎所有小魔怪（特征）都乐于毁坏或弄坏东西——无论是装置或载具之类的有形之物，还是联盟或关系之类的无形之物。小魔怪（特征）最大的快乐，是看着复杂造物的崩塌，最好还是在它们经过小魔怪（特征）一次极其轻微、却精心针对的推动之后发生。小魔怪（特征）往往会贬低、欺凌，甚至屠杀它们更弱小的同族，尤其是米特弗利特；更强壮的小魔怪（特征）会轻蔑地称它们为“袋子”。</p>\n<p>Jinkins are sadistic tinkers who steal and sabotage items and take great pride in their power to curse precious objects. They hold grudges and create convoluted plans for revenge when they feel slighted, such as when a creature dares to remove one of their curses. Rarely content to wreak simple mayhem, jinkins also take immense pleasure in torture and murder, though they prefer to lead victims into traps designed to capture or incapacitate rather than just kill them outright. Deep pits are a preferred method, since victims who survive their fall face a slow death from starvation and thirst while jinkins gather at the edge of pits to tease and torment them.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Gremlins are cruel fey tricksters and saboteurs who have fully acclimated to life in the Universe, finding distinct niches for their inventive destructiveness. Nearly all gremlins delight in ruining or breaking things, whether it's something physical like a device or vehicle or something intangible such as an alliance or relationship. A gremlin's greatest joy is watching the collapse of complex creations, preferably after the slightest, carefully targeted nudge from the gremlin. Gremlins tend to denigrate, bully, or even slaughter their lesser kin, particularly mitflits, whom stronger gremlins derisively call \"baggies.\"</p>",
          "blurb": "女性蹑影小魔怪\nFemale jinkin gremlin",
          "prototypeToken": "紫 Murasaki"
        },
        "Minhwan": {
          "name": "珉焕 Minhwan",
          "tokenName": "珉焕 Minhwan",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog07turnin.JournalEntryPage.07week1anoffer00]{第1周——献给大狐女的贡品}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog07turnin.JournalEntryPage.07week1anoffer00]{Week 1 - An Offering for Daikitsu}</p>",
          "blurb": "和善的人类男孩\nkindly male human child",
          "prototypeToken": "珉焕 Minhwan"
        },
        "Noppera-bo": {
          "name": "无面鬼 Noppera-bo",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼 Noppera-bo",
          "items": {
            "Blasting Stone (Moderate)": {
              "name": "爆破石（中等） Blasting Stone (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 打击</p><hr /><p>当这颗卵石击中一个生物或一个坚硬表面时，它会伴随着震耳欲聋的巨响爆炸。爆破石造成 2d4 音波伤害和 2 音波飞溅伤害，并且石头爆炸所在空间 10 英尺内的每个生物必须以所列 DC 进行一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:20|name:Moderate Blasting Stone|showDC:all] 豁免检定，失败则会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋} 状态，直到其下个回合结束。你在攻击掷骰上获得 +1 物品加值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p><hr /><p>When this pebble hits a creature or a hard surface, it explodes with a deafening bang. A blasting stone deals 2d4 sonic damage and 2 sonic splash damage, and each creature within 10 feet of the space in which the stone exploded must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:20|name:Moderate Blasting Stone|showDC:all] saving throw with the listed DC or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} until the end of its next turn. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼 Noppera-bo"
        },
