          "tokenName": "艾奥梅娜 Aiomena",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w7silvermist00]{银雾斋}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w7silvermist00]{Silvermist Lodges}</p>",
