        "Isori's Gift": {
          "name": "伊索里之赠礼 Isori's Gift",
          "tokenName": "伊索里的赋礼 Isori's Gift",
          "items": {
            "Thousand-Year Dragonroot": {
              "name": "千年龙根 Thousand-Year Dragonroot",
              "description": "<p>龙根是一种根部呈浅金色的植物，生长于天夏各地。就像曼德拉草根或人参根有时会被认为具有近乎类人生物的形状一样，这种根看起来仿佛是龙。它们常用于调配治疗药水，但最受追捧的是那些生长了数百年的植株，因为它们适合被惑控系制作为千年龙根。</p>\n<p>当你启动千年龙根时，你的身体闪烁着金色光芒，像火把一样提供照明。你获得40尺的飞行速度，并获得火焰抗力5，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.p1pxUzwgWZ9l9jmD]{效果：千年龙根}</p>\n<p>Dragonroots are pale, golden-rooted plants that grow throughout Tian Xia. Just as mandrake roots or ginseng roots are sometimes regarded to have almost humanoid shapes, these roots appear as if they were dragons. They're commonly used in the formulation of healing potions, but the most sought-after have grown for centuries, for they're viable for enchantment into thousand-year dragonroots.</p>\n<p>When you activate a thousand-year dragonroot, your body shimmers with golden light, providing illumination as a torch. You gain a fly Speed of 40 feet and fire resistance 5 for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.p1pxUzwgWZ9l9jmD]{Effect: Thousand-Year Dragonroot}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "伊索里的赋礼 Isori's Gift"
        },
        "Rin": {
          "name": "凛 Rin",
          "tokenName": "凛 Rin",
          "items": {
            "Burning Touch": {
              "name": "灼烧之触 Burning Touch"
            },
            "Mindscape Bound": {
              "name": "思维空间束缚 Mindscape Bound",
              "description": "<p>琳与柳岸镇的思维空间绑定，可以在其边界内的任何地方旅行。</p>\n<p>Rin is bound to the Willowshore mindscape and can travel anywhere within its borders.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>当一只幽灵被摧毁时，它会在其所束缚的地点内，于[[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后重新形成，并完全恢复。只有当有人查明其存在的原因，并纠正一切阻止其魂魄休息的事物时，幽灵才能被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>When a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after [[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>琳变形为某个特定小型人类的无尾形态。该无尾形态无法被改变，并且类似于她的狐类类人生物形态。</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>Rin transforms into the tailless form of a specific small human. The tailless form can't be altered and resembles her fox-like humanoid form.</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Foxfire Curse": {
              "name": "狐火诅咒 Foxfire Curse",
              "description": "<p>被琳的灼热接触造成伤害的生物必须在一次 @Check[will|dc:25] 豁免中成功，否则将受到此诅咒影响。在受诅咒生物的得意时刻，他们会被幽魂般的火焰勾勒，这些火焰会惩罚他们的盟友。每当受诅咒生物打出大成功或大失败命中时，其触及范围内的每名盟友都会受到 @Damage[1d6[persistent,fire]] 伤害，因为受诅咒生物的傲慢将其灼烧。</p>\n<p>A creature damaged by Rin's burning touch must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:25] save or become affected by this curse. During a cursed creature's moments of triumph, they become limned with spectral flames that punish their allies. Whenever the cursed creature scores a critical hit, each ally within their reach takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,fire]] damage as the cursed creature's hubris sears them.</p>"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "女性狐妖幽灵（特征）\nFemale kitsune ghost",
          "hp": "negative healing, rejuvenation",
          "prototypeToken": "凛 Rin"
        },
        "Hunting Spider": {
          "name": "猎蛛 Hunting Spider",
          "tokenName": "猎蛛 Hunting Spider",
          "items": {
            "Fangs": {
              "name": "獠牙 Fangs"
            },
            "Web": {
              "name": "蛛网术 Web"
            },
            "Web Sense": {
              "name": "蛛网感知 Web Sense",
              "description": "<p>猎蛛拥有不精确的颤觉，可侦测到触碰其蛛网术的生物所产生的振动。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>\n<p>The hunting spider has imprecise tremorsense to detect the vibrations of creatures touching its web.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>"
            },
            "Spring Upon Prey": {
              "name": "扑向猎物 Spring Upon Prey",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 尚未掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 当猎蛛在蛛网上时，一名生物触碰到猎蛛的网。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 猎蛛会自动察觉该生物，并在其掷先攻前行走、攀爬或沿蛛网下降。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Initiative has not yet been rolled.</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature touches the hunting spider's web while the spider is on it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The hunting spider automatically notices the creature and Strides, Climbs, or Descends on a Web before it rolls initiative.</p>"
            },
            "Descend on a Web": {
              "name": "降入蛛网术 Descend on a Web",
              "description": "<p>猎蛛沿直线向下移动至多40尺，由一根蛛网丝悬吊。它可以悬挂在蛛网丝上或脱离下落。它以蛛网下行的距离不计入坠落伤害。</p>\n<p>成功打击蛛网的生物（AC 20，硬度 3，5 HP）会将其切断，使蜘蛛坠落。</p>\n<p>The hunting spider moves straight down up to 40 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage.</p>\n<p>A creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 3, 5 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall.</p>"
            },
            "Hunting Spider Venom": {
              "name": "猎蛛毒 Hunting Spider Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:16]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 6 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，并且措手不及（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}，并且措手不及（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:16]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, and off-guard (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, and off-guard (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Web Trap": {
              "name": "网缚 Web Trap",
              "description": "<p>被猎蛛的蛛网术打击命中的生物会陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}并粘在最近的表面上，直到其[[/act escape dc=17]]{逃脱}。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by the hunting spider's web Strike is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and stuck to the nearest surface until it [[/act escape dc=17]]{Escapes}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>猎蛛是巨型蜘蛛中最常见的类型，尽管并非体型最大。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>几乎没有哪种日常害虫能像臭名昭著的蜘蛛那样令人畏惧。</p>\n<p>Hunting spiders are the most common type of giant spider, though not the largest.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Few everyday vermin inspire as much dread as the infamous spider.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "猎蛛 Hunting Spider"
        },
        "Dorms": {
          "name": "宿舍 Dorms",
          "tokenName": "宿舍 Dorms",
          "items": {
            "Spiritsight Ring": {
              "name": "灵视戒指 Spiritsight Ring",
              "description": "<p>这枚雕工繁复的象牙戒指上镶嵌的蛋白石最终会变得半透明，并在附近有虚体生物时轻轻挠动你的手指。若附近存在虚体生物，即使它位于固体物体之内，你最终也会侦测到该生物，尽管你可能无法立刻侦测到，而且你无法精确定位其位置。这视为一种朦胧感官，类似于人类的嗅觉。试图对该感官躲藏其存在的虚体生物，会如同试图欺骗特殊感官的常规做法那样，尝试一次隐匿检定，对抗你的察觉DC，以躲避你的朦胧感官。当你使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 动作来寻找你30尺内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪} 状态的虚体生物时，你获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>The opal set in this intricately carved ivory ring eventually becomes translucent and tickles your finger whenever an incorporeal creature is nearby. When in the presence of a nearby incorporeal creature, even if it's within a solid object, you eventually detect the creature, though you might not do so instantly, and you can't pinpoint the location. This acts as a vague sense, similar to humans' sense of smell. An incorporeal creature trying to hide its presence from this sense attempts a Stealth check against your Perception DC to hide from your vague sense, as normal for attempting to foil special senses. You gain a +2 item bonus when using the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to find @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} incorporeal creatures within 30 feet of you.</p>"
            }
          },
          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-XjhVhleagwx7T2c8\" class=\"secret\"><p>如果一名PC在房间内进行搜寻时成功通过一次 @Check[perception|dc:22|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search] 检定，他们就会发现这枚戒指。</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-XjhVhleagwx7T2c8\" class=\"secret\"><p>A PC finds the ring if they succeed at a @Check[perception|dc:22|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search] check while Searching in the room.</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "宿舍 Dorms"
        },
