            "Scale Mail": {
              "name": "鳞甲 Scale Mail",
              "description": "<p>鳞甲由许多金属鳞片缝制在加固的皮革衬底上构成，通常为长衫的形式，保护躯干、手臂和腿部。</p>\n<p>Scale mail consists of many metal scales sewn onto a reinforced leather backing, often in the form of a long shirt that protects the torso, arms, and legs.</p>"
            },
