              "name": "弩矢 Bolts",
              "description": "<p>弩矢比传统箭矢更短，但结构相似，是弩所使用的弹药。</p>\n<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>"
