            "Legal Lore": {
              "name": "法律学识 Legal Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>卫兵是城镇巡逻队或城市卫队中的普通成员，受过训练以察觉麻烦、制服罪犯并服从命令。</p><hr /><p>更大的社会依赖那些有权威且有能力解读并执行法律的人。有些人公正地履行这些职责，但另一些人则严酷而残忍，对任何无力支付赦免金的人施以严厉惩罚。</p>\n<p>Guards are rank-and-file members of a town watch or city guard, trained to look for trouble, take down criminals, and follow orders.</p><hr /><p>Larger societies rely on those with the authority and the ability to interpret and enforce laws. Some carry out these duties fairly, but others are harsh and cruel, imposing severe punishments on anyone unable to pay for clemency.</p>",
