        "Hollow Space": {
          "name": "空洞空间 Hollow Space",
          "tokenName": "空洞空间 Hollow Space",
          "items": {
            "Lacquered Waist Drum": {
              "name": "漆面腰鼓 Lacquered Waist Drum",
              "description": "<p>这面沙漏形的鼓有两个鼓面，每个鼓面在敲击时都会发出不同的声音。当两者一同演奏时，两种声音的共鸣能有效驱逐邪恶的魂魄。这面鼓可作为乐器演奏，使你在表演上获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每小时一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你同时敲击鼓的两个鼓面，产生一道正能量脉冲，指定30尺内1个具有不死（特征）的生物为目标。这对该生物造成@Damage[5d8[vitality]]伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:28]豁免）；如果该不死生物同时具有幽灵（特征），则其在豁免失败时会变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每小时一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你喧闹地演奏鼓的两个鼓面，并伴随喊叫与舞蹈。此举在以你为中心的@Template[emanation|distance:30]内产生一道正能量脉冲。该区域内所有不死生物必须尝试一次@Check[fortitude|dc:28]豁免。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[2d8[vitality]]伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[5d8[vitality]]伤害；如果该生物具有幽灵（特征），则其变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到@Damage[10d8[vitality]]伤害；如果该生物具有幽灵（特征），则其变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>This hourglass-shaped drum has two heads, each of which produces a different sound when struck. When played together, the resonance of the two sounds is effective in repelling evil spirits. This drum can be played as an instrument, granting a +2 item bonus to Performance.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You play both heads of the drums, generating a pulse of positive energy that targets one creature within 30 feet that has the undead trait. This deals @Damage[5d8[vitality]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:28] save) to that creature; if the undead also has the ghost trait, the ghost becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} if it fails the save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You raucously play both heads of the drums, accompanied with shouting and dancing. This display generates a pulse of positive energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30] from you. All undead creatures within this area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature takes no damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[2d8[vitality]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[5d8[vitality]] damage; if the creature has the ghost trait, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[10d8[vitality]] damage; if the creature has the ghost trait, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>"
            }
          },
          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-Ez4AEweGsUvM6lUT\" class=\"secret\"><p>一名PC若对A7c区域进行一次10分钟的搜寻，并在一次@Check[perception|dc:28|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search]检定中成功，则会发现那件物品：它从一排架子后面掉进了地板上的一个洞，进入了一个中空的空间。</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-Ez4AEweGsUvM6lUT\" class=\"secret\"><p>A PC who conducts a 10-minute Search of area A7c, and who succeeds at a @Check[perception|dc:28|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search] check, reveals the item that fell behind a set of shelves into a hollow space through a hole in the floor.</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "中空空间 Hollow Space"
        },
        "Fourth Home": {
          "name": "第四家园 Fourth Home",
          "tokenName": "第四个家园 Fourth Home",
          "items": {
            "Cold Iron Chunk": {
              "name": "寒铁块 Cold Iron Chunk",
              "description": "<p>由冷铁制成的武器对恶魔与妖精同样致命。冷铁看起来像普通铁，但它从特别纯净的矿源中开采而来，并在极少或完全不加热的情况下锻造。这一工艺极其困难，尤其是对高等冷铁物品而言。</p><h2>冷铁物品</h2><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>冷铁物品</th><th>硬度</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>薄型物品</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>低等</td><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>标准等</td><td>7</td><td>28</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>高等</td><td>10</td><td>40</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><strong>物品</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>低等</td><td>9</td><td>36</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>标准等</td><td>11</td><td>44</td><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>高等</td><td>14</td><td>56</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td><strong>结构</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>低等</td><td>18</td><td>72</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>标准等</td><td>22</td><td>88</td><td>44</td></tr><tr><td>高等</td><td>28</td><td>112</td><td>56</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Weapons made from cold iron are deadly to demons and fey alike. Cold iron looks like normal iron but is mined from particularly pure sources and shaped with little or no heat. This process is extremely difficult, especially for high-grade cold iron items.</p><h2>Cold Iron Items</h2><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Cold Iron Items</th><th>Hardness</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Thin Items</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Low-grade</td><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Standard-grade</td><td>7</td><td>28</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>High-grade</td><td>10</td><td>40</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Items</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Low-grade</td><td>9</td><td>36</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>Standard-grade</td><td>11</td><td>44</td><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>High-grade</td><td>14</td><td>56</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structure</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Low-grade</td><td>18</td><td>72</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>Standard-grade</td><td>22</td><td>88</td><td>44</td></tr><tr><td>High-grade</td><td>28</td><td>112</td><td>56</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "第四家园 Fourth Home"
        },
        "Garden": {
          "name": "花园 Garden",
          "tokenName": "花园 Garden",
          "items": {
            "Primeval Mistletoe": {
              "name": "远古槲寄生 Primeval Mistletoe",
              "description": "<p>这枝缀满浆果的冬青与槲寄生不会枯萎或腐烂。它可以用作原初法器，并且在你佩戴它时，使你进行自然检定获得+1物品加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动—涂抹</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每10分钟一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你从其中一颗浆果中挤出汁液，并将其抹在一把主要由木头制成的武器上，以在其上施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TFitdEOpQC4SzKQQ]{符文武器}；或者抹在一个生物身上，以在其上施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EE7Q5BHIrfWNCPtT]{符文之躯}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动—束缚</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你接触这枝枝条，然后接触一棵树，以对你自己施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{与植物合一}，使你在被接触的树上变成一条藤蔓。</p>\n<p>This sprig of berry-festooned holly and mistletoe doesn't wilt or rot. It can be used as a primal locus, and it grants a +1 item bonus to Nature checks while you wear it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Anoint</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You squeeze juice from one of the berries and smear it onto a weapon made primarily of wood to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TFitdEOpQC4SzKQQ]{Runic Weapon} on it, or onto a creature to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EE7Q5BHIrfWNCPtT]{Runic Body} on it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Bind</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You touch the sprig, then a tree to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{One with Plants} upon yourself, turning into a vine on the touched tree.</p>"
            },
            "Verdant Staff": {
              "name": "翠绿法杖 Verdant Staff",
              "description": "<p>这根橡树枝在春季长出叶子，秋季变色，冬季落叶。持用它时，你在辨识植物与真菌的检定上获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你从法杖中消耗一定数量的充能，以施放其列表中的一个法术。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>戏法</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uZK2BYzPnxUBnDjr]{Tangle Vine}</li>\n<li><strong>1环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EE7Q5BHIrfWNCPtT]{Runic Body}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TFitdEOpQC4SzKQQ]{Runic Weapon}</li>\n<li><strong>2环</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA]{Entangling Flora}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.YWrfKetOqDwVFut7]{Oaken Resilience}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{One with Plants}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.CXICME10TkEJxz0P]{Shape Wood}</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>制作需求</strong> 提供所有列出法术之所有列出环阶的各一次施放。</p>\n<p>This oak branch grows leaves in spring that change color in autumn and shed in winter. While wielding it, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to identify plants and fungi.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrips</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uZK2BYzPnxUBnDjr]{Tangle Vine}</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EE7Q5BHIrfWNCPtT]{Runic Body}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TFitdEOpQC4SzKQQ]{Runic Weapon}</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA]{Entangling Flora}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.YWrfKetOqDwVFut7]{Oaken Resilience}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{One with Plants}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.CXICME10TkEJxz0P]{Shape Wood}</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "花园 Garden"
        },
        "Willow's Parting Gift": {
          "name": "柳的临别赠礼 Willow's Parting Gift",
          "tokenName": "柳别赋礼 Willow's Parting Gift",
          "items": {
            "Twisting Twine (Lesser)": {
              "name": "扭曲细绳（次等） Twisting Twine (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p>这一团麻绳线球抗拒用手将其解开。</p>\n<p><strong>启动—解开绳线</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你将线球掷向20尺内的一个方格。随后绳线解开并活化，尝试以总计+9的运动检定对该方格内的一个生物进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{缴械}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{绊摔}（由你选择）。在你回合结束时，绳线会自行卷回成一团并回到你手中；若你没有空着的手，则它改为回到你的空间中。</p>\n<p>This ball of hempen twine resists efforts to unravel it by hand.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Unravel Twine</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You toss the ball of twine into a square within 20 feet. The twine then unravels and animates, attempting to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{Disarm} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} (your choice) a creature in the square with a total of +9 to the Athletics check. At the end of your turn, the twine winds itself back into a ball and returns to your hand; if you don't have a free hand, it returns to your space instead.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "柳树的离别赠礼 Willow's Parting Gift"
        },
        "Nook": {
          "name": "角落 Nook",
          "tokenName": "角落 Nook",
          "items": {
            "Heh Shan-Bao’s Diary": {
              "name": "和善保的日记 Heh Shan-Bao’s Diary",
              "description": "<p>包含和善保对他所面临困境的反思、他对在魔法仪式中冒着自身生命危险的担忧，以及他最终决定修改该仪式，并用一种自我辩解的借口称：如果事情变糟，“大家都付出一些，没有人承担全部。”</p>\n<p>Contains Heh Shan-Bao’s reflections on the dilemma he faced, his fears about risking his own life in the magical ritual, and his ultimate decision to modify the ritual with the self-justifying excuse that, if things go bad, “all pay some, and none pays all.”</p>"
