        "Mercenary Enforcer": {
          "name": "佣兵执法者 Mercenary Enforcer",
          "tokenName": "佣兵执行者 Mercenary Enforcer",
          "items": {
            "Composite Longbow": {
              "name": "复合长弓 Composite Longbow"
            },
            "Longsword": {
              "name": "长剑 Longsword"
            },
            "Steel Shield": {
              "name": "钢盾 Steel Shield",
              "description": "<p>与木制盾牌类似，钢制盾牌也有多种形状和体型。尽管它们比木制盾牌更昂贵，但要耐用得多。</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>硬度</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Like wooden shields, steel shields come in a variety of shapes and sizes. Though more expensive than wooden shields, they are much more durable.</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Hardness</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            },
            "Scale Mail": {
              "name": "鳞甲 Scale Mail",
              "description": "<p>鳞甲由许多金属鳞片缝在加固的皮革衬底上制成，通常做成长衫的形式，用以保护躯干、手臂和腿部。</p>\n<p>Scale mail consists of many metal scales sewn onto a reinforced leather backing, often in the form of a long shirt that protects the torso, arms, and legs.</p>"
            },
            "Arrows": {
              "name": "箭矢 Arrows",
              "description": "<p>这些抛射物是弓的弹药。箭杆由木头制成。它在飞行时由一端的箭羽稳定，另一端则装有金属箭头。</p>\n<p>These projectiles are the ammunition for bows. The shaft of an arrow is made of wood. It is stabilized in flight by fletching at one end and bears a metal head on the other.</p>"
            },
            "Defensive Training": {
              "name": "防御训练 Defensive Training",
              "description": "<p>这名佣兵执法者在其回合开始时获得额外的1次反应动作，但只能用该反应动作来进行盾挡。</p>\n<p>The mercenary enforcer gains an additional reaction at the start of their turn but can only use this reaction to Shield Block.</p>"
            },
            "Fearful of Ghosts": {
              "name": "惧怕幽灵 Fearful of Ghosts",
              "description": "<p>所有这些关于闹鬼废墟的传言，让唐入的佣兵执法者们如临大敌。只要唐入的恐惧点数阈值至少为2，在与PC的任何战斗开始时，一名佣兵执法者必须通过一次 @Check[will|dc:20] 意志豁免，否则将变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}（若为大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}）。一旦唐入的恐惧点数阈值达到7或更高，佣兵执法者在变为惊惧时也会同时变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<p>All this talk about haunted ruins has the mercenary enforcers at Karahai on edge. At the start of any combat against the PCs while Karahai's Terror Point threshold is at least 2, a mercenary enforcer must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:20] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure). Once Karahai's Terror Point threshold is 7 or higher, a mercenary enforcer also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} whenever they become frightened.</p>"
            },
            "Reactive Strike": {
              "name": "反应打击 Reactive Strike",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>"
            },
            "Shield Block": {
              "name": "护盾格挡 Shield Block",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ShieldBlock]</p>"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>佣兵打手对处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及} 状态的生物造成额外 1d6 精确伤害。</p>\n<p>A mercenary enforcer deals 1d6 extra precision damage to creatures who are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}.</p>"
            }
          },
