        "Damihansig “Dami” Mababangloob": {
          "name": "Damihansig “达米” Mababangloob Damihansig “Dami” Mababangloob",
          "tokenName": "Damihansig “Dami” Mababangloob",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w27thehandof00]{妙手回春}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w27thehandof00]{The Hand of Spring}</p>",
          "blurb": "和蔼的男性人类医生\n kindly male human doctor",
          "prototypeToken": "达米汉西格“达米”·马巴邦洛奥布 Damihansig “Dami” Mababangloob"
        },
        "Amai": {
          "name": "阿迈 Amai",
          "tokenName": "阿迈 Amai",
          "items": {
            "Arcane Innate Spells": {
              "name": "奥术内在法术 Arcane Innate Spells"
            },
            "Dispelling Globe": {
              "name": "驱散法球 Dispelling Globe",
              "description": "<p>你在自己周围创造一个无法移动的球形力场，它会尝试反制任何来自球体外部、其区域或目标进入球体内的法术，如同该球体是一个比其实际法术环级低 1 环的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{解除魔法} 法术。</p>\n<p>如果反制尝试成功，它只会阻止原本会进入球体的那一部分法术（因此如果该法术也有位于球体外的目标，或其部分区域在球体之外，则那些目标或那部分区域仍会照常受到影响）。</p>\n<p>你必须在一处完整且没有遮挡的开放空间中形成此球体，使其边缘不会穿过任何生物或物体，否则该法术会失效（不过，在法术施放后，生物可以进入球体）。</p>\n<p>You create an immobile globe around yourself that attempts to counteract any spell from outside the globe whose area or targets enter into the globe, as if the globe were a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic} spell 1 rank lower than its actual spell rank.</p>\n<p>If the counteract attempt succeeds, it prevents only the portion of the spell that would have entered the globe (so if the spell also has targets outside the globe, or part of its area is beyond the globe, those targets or that area is affected normally).</p>\n<p>You must form the sphere in an unbroken open space, so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost (though creatures can enter the globe after the spell is cast).</p>"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "传送 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你会立刻将自己以及任何你穿戴或持有的物品，从你当前的空间传送到射程内一个你能看见的未被占据的空间。若这会让另一名生物和你一起被带走——即使你正把它装在一个异次元容器里携带——则该法术失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至1英里。你不需要看见你的目的地，只要你过去去过那里，并且知道它相对你的位置与距离即可。随后你会在1小时内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic (At Will)": {
              "name": "解除魔法（任意施放） Dispel Magic (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你解开法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标尝试一次反制检定。若你成功反制一件魔法物品，该物品会在10分钟内变为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你会自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道脉冲，登记魔法存在的迹象。除魔法是否存在之外，你不会获得任何信息。你可以选择忽略你已完全知晓的魔法，例如你与盟友的魔法物品和持续中的法术。你只有在该幻术魔法的效果位阶低于你的<em>侦测魔法</em>法术位阶时，才能侦测到幻术魔法。然而，具有幻术灵光但外观并不具欺瞒性的物品（例如@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{隐形药水}）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你会得知该法术所侦测到的最强大魔法效果的位阶或等级，由GM决定。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>同3环，但你还会精确定位最高位阶魔法的来源。与模糊感官类似，你不会得知确切位置，但可以将来源缩小到一个5尺立方体范围内（若目标大于该范围，则为最接近的等效范围）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Alter Dweomer": {
              "name": "改变魔法效果 Alter Dweomer",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 咒法猫成为某个法术的目标，或在法术施放时位于其区域内</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 咒法猫身上的符文状纹路开始发光，并获得一个与触发法术的根源相关的效果。该效果发生在咒法猫受到触发法术影响之前。该效果持续1分钟，直到咒法猫再次使用此能力，或直到咒法猫解消该效果，以先发生者为准。</p><ul><li><strong>奥术</strong> 魔法反馈对触发的施法者造成 @Damage[4d6[force]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:22|basic] 豁免）。</li><li><strong>神圣</strong> 咒法猫获得对所有技能检定的+1状态加值。</li><li><strong>秘传</strong> 咒法猫变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。除正常结束条件外，若咒法猫使用敌对动作，此效果也会结束。</li><li><strong>原初</strong> 咒法猫获得10点临时生命值。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dweomercat is targeted by a spell or is within the area of a spell as it's cast</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dweomercat's runelike patterns start to glow as it gains an effect related to the tradition of the triggering spell. This effect occurs before the dweomercat is affected by the triggering spell. The effect lasts for 1 minute, until the dweomercat uses this ability again, or until the dweomercat Dismisses the effect, whichever comes first.</p><ul><li><strong>Arcane</strong> Magical feedback deals @Damage[4d6[force]] damage to the triggering spellcaster (@Check[reflex|dc:22|basic] save).</li><li><strong>Divine</strong> The dweomercat gains a +1 status bonus to all skill checks.</li><li><strong>Occult</strong> The dweomercat becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This effect ends if the dweomercat uses a hostile action, in addition to the normal end conditions.</li><li><strong>Primal</strong> The dweomercat gains 10 temporary Hit Points.</li></ul>"
            },
            "Dweomer Leap": {
              "name": "魔法飞跃 Dweomer Leap",
              "description": "<p>先决条件 魔法猫至少还剩一次 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8]{Translocate} 法术</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 魔法猫施放<em>translocate</em>，然后在其传送结束时，可以对一个与其相邻的生物进行一次近战打击。若魔法猫在传送结束时与一个正处于持续中的法术效果影响下的生物相邻，或与一个自魔法猫上次回合以来施放过法术的生物相邻，则不会消耗一次<em>translocate</em>的施放次数。</p>\n<p>Prerequisites The dweomercat has at least one @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8]{Translocate} spell remaining</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dweomercat casts <em>translocate</em>, then can make a melee Strike against one creature adjacent to it at the end of its teleport. If the dweomercat ends its teleport adjacent to a creature under an ongoing spell effect or who cast a spell since the dweomercat's last turn, this does not expend a casting of <em>translocate</em>.</p>"
            },
            "Pounce": {
              "name": "猛扑 Pounce",
              "description": "<p>祈法猫行走并在该次移动结束时进行一次打击。如果祈法猫在开始此动作时处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿}，则它在此能力的打击结算后才会失去藏匿状态。</p>\n<p>The dweomercat Strides and makes a Strike at the end of that movement. If the dweomercat began this action @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden}, it remains hidden until after this ability's Strike.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>魔织猫是来自第一世界、天生具备魔法天赋的四眼猫科动物；在那里，它们以其他生物为猎物，并以其原初能量为食。在第一世界中，它们会组成群体共同狩猎，不过它们更喜欢独自照料幼崽，用魔法与魔法生物构成的饮食将其养大。它们是好奇的生物，有时会在宇宙中通往第一世界的帷幕变得稀薄的区域，或在魔法已被不可逆地扭曲的地区遭遇到。被这种独特的魔法共鸣所吸引，魔织猫希望获得无与伦比的食物来源。</p>\n<p>一旦有魔织猫的目击报告出现，专门的捕兽者往往很快就会现身，期望抓到此生难得的猎物。魔织猫深紫色的皮毛被魔法收藏家视为珍品，因为皮毛上流动的纹路看起来仿佛由人手绘制而成，螺旋与卷曲的图案宛如魔法符文。随后，这些毛皮要么被陈列展示，要么被作为稀有仪式的材料之一。魔织猫以其扭曲施放在它们身上或其附近的法术之隐喻“丝线”的能力而闻名；它们能将这些丝线转化为自身的防御魔法，或用来在战场上瞬间传送。</p>\n<p>Dweomercats are magically gifted, four-eyed felines from the First World, where they prey upon other creatures and feed on their primal energy. Within the First World, they form packs that hunt together, though they prefer to care for their cubs on their own, raising them on a diet of magic and magical creatures. Curious creatures, they're sometimes encountered in areas of the Universe where the veil to the First World is thin or in regions where magic has been irreparably warped. Drawn there by the unique magical resonance, the dweomercats hope to acquire incomparable sources of food.</p>\n<p>Where dweomercats sighting have been reported, specialized trappers will appear soon after, hoping for the catch of a lifetime. A dweomercat's dark purple fur is prized by magical collectors, as the patterns that flow through the fur appear as though they were hand-painted, with spirals and curls resembling magical runes. These coats are then either displayed or included as components in rare rituals. Dweomercats are famous for their ability to twist the metaphorical strings of spells cast on or near them, which they can transform into their own defensive magic or use to instantly teleport across the battlefield.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "天甜（Amai） Amai"
        },
        "Chambers": {
          "name": "厅室 Chambers",
          "tokenName": "密室 Chambers",
          "items": {
            "Scroll of Vampiric Exsanguination (Rank 6)": {
              "name": "血族驱命卷轴（6环） Scroll of Vampiric Exsanguination (Rank 6)",
              "description": "<p>夹在一本名为<em>《夸因大宗师》</em>的书里。</p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fd31tAHSSGXyOxW6]{血族驱命}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴上施放法术需要一只手握住卷轴，并以施法（行动）启动它，使用该法术正常所需的动作数量。</p><p>该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。因为是你在施法，使用你的法术攻击调整值与法术DC。该法术还会获得与你的根源相对应的适当特征（奥术、神圣、秘法或原初）。</p><p>任何实体成本都会在制作卷轴时提供，因此你在从卷轴施放时不需要再提供它们。若该法术需要法器，你必须拥有该法器才能从卷轴施法。</p><hr /><p><em>注：要制作某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入一名PC、NPC或战利品演员的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>Tucked into a book titled <em>Grandmasters of Quain.</em></p><hr /><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fd31tAHSSGXyOxW6]{Vampiric Exsanguination}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p><p>The spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack modifier and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p><p>Any physical costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when casting from a scroll. If the spell requires a locus, you must have that locus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p><hr /><p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            },
            "Skull": {
              "name": "骷髅 Skull"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "厅室 Chambers"
        },
        "Elizeth's Reward": {
          "name": "伊莉泽丝的奖赏 Elizeth's Reward",
          "tokenName": "伊丽泽丝的奖赏 Elizeth's Reward",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Lesser)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（次级） Healing Potion (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启用</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色的液体，当饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时，会带来一阵刺痒的感觉。当你喝下<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[(2d8+5)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(2d8+5)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Vitalizing": {
              "name": "活化 Vitalizing",
              "description": "<p>一把<em>活化</em>武器会脉动着活性能量，对不死额外造成 1d6 持续性活性伤害。若大成功，对方不死还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，持续至你下个回合结束。</p>\n<p>A <em>vitalizing</em> weapon pulses with vital energy, dealing an extra 1d6 persistent vitality damage to undead. On a critical hit, the undead is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the end of your next turn.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "伊丽泽丝的奖赏 Elizeth's Reward"
        },
        "Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Primal)": {
          "name": "无面鬼模仿者（原始） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Primal)",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼模仿者（原始） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Primal)",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Lightning Bolt": {
              "name": "闪电束 Lightning Bolt",
              "description": "<p>一道闪电从你手中射出，造成4d12点电击伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d12。</p>\n<p>A bolt of lightning strikes outward from your hand, dealing 4d12 electricity damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
            },
            "Wall of Thorns": {
              "name": "棘墙术 Wall of Thorns",
              "description": "<p>在1分钟的过程中，你使一堵厚实、布满尖刺的荆棘篱墙从地面生长出来。你创造一道5尺厚的荆棘与刺墙，呈一直线，最长60尺、高10尺。你必须在一段连续且开阔的空间中创造这堵墙，使其边缘不会穿过任何生物或物体，否则该法术失效。墙垂直矗立。若你愿意，墙可以具有更短的长度或高度。墙两侧的所有事物都能获得来自对侧生物的掩蔽，并且墙的空间为困难地形。每当一个生物使用一次移动动作进入至少一个墙的空间时，该生物受到3d4点穿刺伤害。</p>\n<p>墙每个10尺×10尺的区段具有AC 10、硬度10，以及20点生命值。它免疫大成功或大失败和精准伤害。被摧毁的区段可以被自由穿过。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 墙每个区段的生命值增加5点，且穿刺伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Over the course of a minute, you cause a thick wall of thorny brambles to grow from the ground. You create a 5-foot-thick wall of brambles and thorns in a straight line up to 60 feet long and 10 feet high. You must create the wall in an unbroken open space so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost. The wall stands vertically. If you wish, the wall can be of a shorter length or height. Everything on each side of the wall has cover from creatures on the opposite side, and the wall's spaces are difficult terrain. For every move action a creature uses to enter at least one of the wall's spaces, that creature takes 3d4 piercing damage.</p>\n<p>Each 10-foot-by-10-foot section of the wall has AC 10, Hardness 10, and 20 Hit Points. It's immune to critical hits and precision damage. A destroyed section can be moved through freely.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The Hit Points of each section of the wall increase by 5, and the piercing damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Floating Flame": {
              "name": "浮动火焰 Floating Flame",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一团无需燃料也能燃烧、并会听从你命令移动的火焰。火焰对其出现所在方格内的每个生物造成3d6点火焰伤害，并进行一次基础反射豁免。当你维持该法术时，你可以让火焰飘浮移动至多10英尺。随后，它会对其在飞行期间任意时刻与之共享空间的每个生物造成伤害。使用相同的伤害与豁免，并且你每次维持时只掷骰一次伤害。特定生物每轮只能从漂浮火焰中受到1次伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You create a fire that burns without fuel and moves to your commands. The flame deals 3d6 fire damage to each creature in the square in which it appears, with a basic Reflex save. When you Sustain this spell, you can levitate the flame up to 10 feet. It then deals damage to each creature whose space it shared at any point during its flight. This uses the same damage and save, and you roll the damage once each time you Sustain. A given creature can take damage from floating flame only once per round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Web": {
              "name": "蛛网术 Web",
              "description": "<p>你在区域内创造出一片黏稠的蛛网，每当生物试图穿过时都会阻碍其移动。被蛛网填满的方格为困难地形。每个方格的蛛网都可以被一次单独的攻击或效果清除：该攻击或效果必须造成至少5点挥砍伤害或1点火焰伤害。一个方格的AC为5，并且其豁免骰自动失败。</p>\n<p>每当一名处于蛛网中的生物开始使用一个移动动作，或在一个移动动作中进入蛛网时，它必须进行一次运动检定或反射豁免骰，对抗你的法术DC，以避免其速度受到环境减值，或变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}。生物一旦离开蛛网，便不再因蛛网而使其速度受到环境减值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong>该生物不受影响，且在本回合内无需再对蛛网进行进一步的运动检定或豁免骰。若其使用的是运动检定，则在离开某一方格后，会清除其离开的每个方格中的蛛网。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong>该生物在其动作期间不受影响。若其使用的是运动检定，则在离开某一方格后，会清除其离开的每个方格中的蛛网。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong>该生物的速度在其下回合开始前受到–10尺环境减值。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong>该生物在其下回合开始前处于禁足（状态）；之后其速度受到–10尺环境减值，持续1轮。它可以尝试逃脱以移除其禁足（状态）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>该法术的区域增加为20尺爆发，且其射程增加为60尺。</p>\n<p>You create a sticky web in the area that impedes creatures' movement each time they try to move through it. Squares filled with the web are difficult terrain. Each square can be cleared of the web by a single attack or effect that deals at least 5 slashing damage or 1 fire damage. A square has AC 5, and it automatically fails its saving throws.</p>\n<p>Each time a creature in the web begins to use a move action or enters the web during a move action, it must attempt an Athletics check or Reflex save against your spell DC to avoid taking a circumstance penalty to its Speeds or becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}. A creature that gets out of the web ceases to take a circumstance penalty to its Speed from the web.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected, and it doesn't need to attempt further Athletics checks or saving throws against the web this turn. If it used an Athletics check, it clears the web from every square it leaves after leaving the square.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected during its action. If it used an Athletics check, it clears the web from every square it leaves after leaving the square.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Immobilized until the start of its next turn, after which it takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape to remove its Immobilized condition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell's area increases to a 20-foot burst, and its range increases to 60 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Acid Splash": {
              "name": "酸液飞溅 Acid Splash",
              "description": "<p>你溅出一团酸液，酸液飞溅到你的目标以及附近的生物身上。进行一次法术攻击。若你命中，你造成 1d6 点酸性伤害外加 1 点飞溅酸性伤害。在大成功时，目标还会受到 @Damage[(ceil(@item.level/2))[persistent,acid]] 点持续酸性伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 初始伤害提升至 2d6，且持续伤害提升至 2。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 初始伤害提升至 3d6，持续伤害提升至 3，且飞溅伤害提升至 2。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 初始伤害提升至 4d6，持续伤害提升至 4，且飞溅伤害提升至 3。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 初始伤害提升至 5d6，持续伤害提升至 5，且飞溅伤害提升至 4。</p>\n<p>You splash a glob of acid that splatters your target and nearby creatures. Make a spell attack. If you hit, you deal 1d6 acid damage plus 1 splash acid damage. On a critical success, the target also takes @Damage[(ceil(@item.level/2))[persistent,acid]] damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The initial damage increases to 2d6, and the persistent damage increases to 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The initial damage increases to 3d6, the persistent damage increases to 3, and the splash damage increases to 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The initial damage increases to 4d6, the persistent damage increases to 4, and the splash damage increases to 3.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The initial damage increases to 5d6, the persistent damage increases to 5, and the splash damage increases to 4.</p>"
            },
            "Grease": {
              "name": "油腻术 Grease",
              "description": "<p>你召唤出油脂，选择一个区域或一个目标。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>区域</strong> <strong>[4个相邻的5尺方格]</strong> 区域内所有坚实地面都被油脂覆盖。每个站在油腻表面上的生物必须进行一次反射豁免或一次对抗你法术DC的特技检定，成功则无事，否则便会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。在法术的持续时间内，使用一个动作移动到油腻表面上的生物必须尝试一次反射豁免或一次特技检定以@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.M76ycLAqHoAgbcej]{保持平衡}。如果生物进行“跨步”或“匍匐”，则无需尝试检定或豁免。</li>\n<li><strong>目标</strong> <strong>[1个负载为1或更低的物体]</strong> 如果你将法术施放在一件无人持用的物体上，任何试图拾起该物体的人都必须成功进行一次特技检定或反射豁免（对抗你的法术DC）才能这么做。如果你以一件有人持用的物体为目标，持有该物体的生物必须尝试一次特技检定或反射豁免。失败时，持有者或使用者在所有涉及使用该物体的检定上承受–2环境减值；大失败时，持有者或使用者会松开该物品。该物体落在由GM选择的相邻方格中。如果你将此法术施放在一件穿戴的物体上，穿戴者在对抗试图擒拿他们的尝试时，其强韧豁免获得+2环境加值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You conjure grease, choosing an area or target.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Area</strong> <strong>[4 contiguous 5-foot squares]</strong> All solid ground in the area is covered with grease. Each creature standing on the greasy surface must succeed at a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check against your spell DC or fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. Creatures using an action to move onto the greasy surface during the spell's duration must attempt either a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.M76ycLAqHoAgbcej]{Balance}. A creature that Steps or Crawls doesn't have to attempt a check or save.</li>\n<li><strong>Target</strong> <strong>[1 object of Bulk 1 or less]</strong> If you Cast the Spell on an unattended object, anyone trying to pick up the object must succeed at an Acrobatics check or Reflex save against your spell DC to do so. If you target an attended object, the creature that has the object must attempt an Acrobatics check or Reflex save. On a failure, the holder or wielder takes a –2 circumstance penalty to all checks that involve using the object; on a critical failure, the holder or wielder releases the item. The object lands in an adjacent square of the GM's choice. If you Cast this Spell on a worn object, the wearer gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Fortitude saves against attempts to grapple them.</li>\n</ul>"
            },
            "Spider Sting": {
              "name": "蛛咬术 Spider Sting",
              "description": "<p>你以魔法复制蜘蛛的毒刺叮咬。你对被触碰的生物造成 1d4 穿刺伤害，并使其感染蜘蛛毒液。目标必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标感染第 1 阶段的蜘蛛毒液。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标感染第 2 阶段的蜘蛛毒液。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>蜘蛛毒液</strong>（毒素）</p>\n<p><strong>等级</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 4 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 1d4 毒素伤害并 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> 1d4 毒素伤害并 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}（1 轮）</p>\n<p>You magically duplicate a spider's venomous sting. You deal 1d4 piercing damage to the touched creature and afflict it with spider venom. The target must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is afflicted with spider venom at stage 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is afflicted with spider venom at stage 2.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Spider Venom</strong> (poison)</p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> 1d4 poison damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 1d4 poison damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Tangle Vine": {
              "name": "纠缠藤蔓 Tangle Vine",
              "description": "<p>一条藤蔓从虚空中出现，从你手中弹射而出并抽打着缠向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{法术效果：缠结藤蔓}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}，并在1轮内其各项速度承受–10尺的环境减值。它可以尝试以你的法术DC进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{逃脱}以移除该减值与禁足（状态）。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标在1轮内其各项速度承受–10尺的环境减值。它可以尝试以你的法术DC进行逃脱以移除该减值。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 这些效果持续2轮。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 这些效果持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>A vine appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack roll against the target.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{Spell Effect: Tangle Vine}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the immobilized condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "False Weapon": {
              "name": "虚假武器 False Weapon",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者携带一把<em>+1 强击</em>武器，其外观与被模仿的PC偏好的武器完全相同。若PC偏好徒手打击，则其外观为缠手布。若PC偏好远程武器，则无面鬼模仿者没有近战武器，而是改用上述远程武器规则；否则，无面鬼模仿者没有远程武器。若PC不偏好任何武器，则无面鬼会以一根木棒作为其虚假武器。这把虚假武器仅部分真实，命中时只造成心灵伤害；它不会获得原武器的任何特征或魔法强化。若无面鬼模仿者的虚假武器破损、被缴械或被放下，它就会消散。无面鬼模仿者可以通过花费10分钟重新塑造一把替代的虚假武器。</p>\n<p>A noppera-bo impersonator carries a <em>+1 striking</em> weapon that looks identical to the favored weapon of the PC being impersonated. If the PC favors unarmed strikes, it appears as hand wraps. If the PC favors a ranged weapon, then the noppera-bo impersonator has no melee weapon and instead uses the ranged weapon rules above; otherwise, the noppera-bo impersonator has no ranged weapon. If the PCs favors no weapon, then the noppera-bo wields a club as its false weapon. This false weapon is only partially real and inflicts only mental damage when it hits; it gains none of the original weapon's traits or magical enhancements. If a noppera-bo impersonator's false weapon is broken, disarmed, or set down, it fades away. The noppera-bo impersonator can craft a replacement false weapon by spending 10 minutes to recreate one.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30 尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉感官，但他们的听觉十分敏锐。他们不需要呼吸，并且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。他们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上是将手或无面的头浸入液体中，通过渗透作用“饮用”；他们也可以用这种方式从消耗品（如药水或炼金灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo has no sense of vision, but their hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋} 状态，它们就会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>As long as the noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonated Spellcasting": {
              "name": "模仿者施法 Impersonated Spellcasting",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者会获得一组先天法术，其根源与其所模仿的PC所使用的施法根源相匹配。你可以调整这些法术，使其更贴合这次伪装。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo impersonator gains a suites of innate spells, matching the spellcasting tradition utilized by the PC being impersonated. You can adjust the spells to make a more perfect fit for the impersonation.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼模仿者（原初） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Primal)"
        },
        "Kalen Bray": {
          "name": "卡伦·布雷 Kalen Bray",
          "tokenName": "卡伦·布雷 Kalen Bray",
          "items": {
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 该丧尸有一名生物处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}状态。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The zombie has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>丧尸蹒跚者是一种行动迟缓的恐怖之物，在大群出现时尤为危险。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>丧尸唯一的欲望就是吞食活人。丧尸不思考，永远蹒跚前行，是死亡的预兆；它们只会在被摧毁时才会停下。</p>\n<p>A zombie shambler is a slow-moving horror dangerous in larger groups.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A zombie's only desire is to consume the living. Unthinking and ever-shambling harbingers of death, zombies stop only when they're destroyed.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体丧尸\nVariant zombie",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "卡伦·布雷伊 Kalen Bray"
        },
        "Very Drunken Jinkin": {
          "name": "非常醉的金金 Very Drunken Jinkin",
          "tokenName": "醉醺醺的金金 Very Drunken Jinkin",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Prestidigitation": {
              "name": "魔法伎俩 Prestidigitation",
              "description": "<p>最简单的魔法会听从你的差遣。只要你维持法术，你就能施展简单的魔法效果。每次你维持法术时，你可以从以下四个选项中选择一个。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>烹调</strong> 冷却、加热或为1磅非生物材料调味。</li>\n<li><strong>提起</strong> 缓慢地将一个无主的轻负载或更轻的物体从地面抬起1英尺。</li>\n<li><strong>制造</strong> 创造一个临时的、可忽略负载的物体，由凝结的魔法物质构成。该物体看起来粗糙而不自然，并且极其脆弱——它不能用作工具、武器或法术材料。</li>\n<li><strong>整理</strong> 为一个轻负载或更轻的物体上色、清洁或弄脏。你可以用10轮专注影响一个1负载的物体；对于更大的物体，你每负载需1分钟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>魔法伎俩无法造成伤害或引发不利状态。对物体的任何实际改变（超出上述注明者）都只会在你维持法术期间持续。</p>\n<p>The simplest magic does your bidding. You can perform simple magical effects for as long as you Sustain the Spell. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can choose one of four options.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cook</strong> Cool, warm, or flavor 1 pound of nonliving material.</li>\n<li><strong>Lift</strong> Slowly lift an unattended object of light Bulk or less 1 foot off the ground.</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> Create a temporary object of negligible Bulk, made of congealed magical substance. The object looks crude and artificial and is extremely fragile-it can't be used as a tool, weapon, or spell component.</li>\n<li><strong>Tidy</strong> Color, clean, or soil an object of light Bulk or less. You can affect an object of 1 Bulk with 10 rounds of concentration, and a larger object a 1 minute per Bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Prestidigitation can't deal damage or cause adverse conditions. Any actual change to an object (beyond what is noted above) persists only as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>"
            },
            "Club (Table Leg or Bottle)": {
              "name": "木棒（桌腿或瓶子） Club (Table Leg or Bottle)",
              "description": "<p>这是一块结实的木头，被塑形或改造用来痛击敌人。木棒既可以是雕刻精美的武术艺术品，也可以简单到只是一根树枝或一截木头。</p>\n<p>This is a piece of stout wood shaped or repurposed to bludgeon an enemy. Clubs can be intricately carved pieces of martial art or as simple as a tree branch or piece of wood.</p>"
            },
            "Club": {
              "name": "木棒 Club"
            },
            "Far Too Drunk": {
              "name": "醉得离谱 Far Too Drunk",
              "description": "<p>金金怪的动作效率很低，而且总会在每轮花费1个动作来咯咯发笑、原地踉跄，或以其他方式做出无效的滑稽举动。</p>\n<p>The jinkins are inefficient with their actions and always spend one action each round to cackle, stumble in place, or otherwise perform ineffective antics.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>金金怪是施虐成性的修补匠，会偷窃并破坏物品，并以自己能诅咒珍贵物体的力量为傲。它们心怀怨念，每当觉得被冒犯时就会制定复杂的复仇计划——例如当某个生物竟敢解除它们的一道诅咒。金金怪很少满足于制造简单的混乱，它们也从酷刑与谋杀中获得巨大的快感，不过它们更喜欢把受害者引入旨在捕获或使其失能的陷阱，而不是当场直接杀死。深坑是它们的最爱，因为即便受害者跌落后幸存，也会因饥饿和口渴而缓慢死去。金金怪喜欢聚集在坑边，嘲弄、戏弄并折磨受害者。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>小魔怪（特征）是残忍的妖精恶作剧者与破坏者，早已完全适应了物质位面的生活，并为其富有创意的破坏性找到了明确的立足之处。所有小魔怪（特征）都乐于毁坏或弄坏东西——无论是装置或载具之类的有形之物，还是联盟或关系之类的无形之物。小魔怪（特征）最大的快乐，就是看着复杂造物崩塌，最好是只需小魔怪（特征）施加一次最轻微、最细小、精心针对的推动之后就发生。小魔怪（特征）往往会贬低、欺凌，甚至屠杀它们较为弱小的同族，尤其是米特弗利特；小魔怪（特征）（以及许多其他人）轻蔑地称它们为“螨虫”。</p>\n<p>Jinkins are sadistic tinkers who steal and sabotage items and take great pride in their power to curse precious objects. They hold grudges and create convoluted plans for revenge whenever they feel slighted, such as when a creature dares to remove one of their curses. Rarely content to wreak simple mayhem, jinkins also take immense pleasure in torture and murder, though they prefer to lead victims into traps designed to capture or incapacitate rather than kill outright. Deep pits are favorites, since victims who survive the fall face a slow death from starvation and thirst. Jinkins enjoy gathering at the edge of pits to mock, tease, and torment.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Gremlins are cruel fey tricksters and saboteurs who have fully acclimated to life on the Material Plane, finding distinct niches for their inventive destructiveness. All gremlins delight in ruining or breaking things, whether it's something physical like a device or vehicle or something intangible such as an alliance or relationship. A gremlin's greatest joy is watching the collapse of complex creations, preferably after the lightest and slightest, carefully targeted push from the gremlin. Gremlins tend to denigrate, bully, or even slaughter their lesser kin, particularly mitflits, whom gremlins (and many others) derisively call \"mites.\"</p>",
          "blurb": "变体金克斯\nVariant jinkins",
          "prototypeToken": "非常醉醺醺的金金 Very Drunken Jinkin"
        },
        "Ren Mei Li's Supplies": {
          "name": "任美璃的补给品 Ren Mei Li's Supplies",
          "tokenName": "任美璃的补给品 Ren Mei Li's Supplies",
          "items": {
            "Gossamer Sash": {
              "name": "罗网绶带 Gossamer Sash",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> 1小时（构想，交互，移动）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这条轻巧的蜘蛛丝绶带在完全展开时长达20尺。一端洁白，另一端渐变为紫罗兰色，绶带全长以银线缝有神秘学标记。当最多4人共同持握一条罗网绶带，并在神门的任意道路上于午夜至日出之间步行1小时后，他们会踏入一处拟真思维空间；那里看起来是一条寂寥的山坡道路，其间居住着行道女，她们（至少在最初时）乐于回答旅行者可能提出的问题。一旦行道女回答完这些问题，或被杀死（以先发生者为准），思维空间便会结束，走过其中的人会被送回他们最初启动罗网绶带时所在的道路位置。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> 1 hour (envision, Interact, move)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This lightweight sash of spidersilk measures 20 feet long when fully unfurled. White at one end and shading to violet at the other, occult markings in silver thread are stitched along the sash's length. When a gossamer sash is held by up to 4 people and they spend 1 hour walking along any road in Shenmen between midnight and sunrise, they step into an immersive mindscape that appears to be a lonely mountainside road inhabited by path maidens who are (at least initially) favorably disposed toward answering questions the travelers might have. Once the path maidens have answered their questions or are slain (whichever comes first), the mindscape ends, and those who traveled it are returned to the point on the road where they first activated the gossamer sash.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctified Beans": {
              "name": "圣豆 Sanctified Beans",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 交互</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这些烘烤过的大豆由祭司祝福，可用于抵御各种来自异界的影响，但对虚体邪恶最为有效，例如幽魂或行道女。活体生物可以安全食用，配上米酒风味绝佳。当你启动该物品时，选择一个相邻的方格并向其中呼气。你以安抚性的蒸汽充满该方格，持续接下来 1 分钟；任何在该方格内结束其回合的邪魔、精类、幽灵、魂魄或不死生物都会受到 @Damage[(4d8+4)[spirit]|traits:holy]（神圣）伤害（@Check[will|dc:28|basic] 意志豁免）。受到该伤害的虚体生物还必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:28] 强韧豁免，以抵抗如下影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} 状态，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} 状态，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} 状态，随后获得缓慢 1 状态，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>These roasted soybeans are blessed by a priest to ward against all various forms of otherworldly influence but are most effective against incorporeal evils, such as specters or path maidens. They can be safely eaten by living creatures and taste delicious when paired with rice wine. When you activate this item, choose an adjacent square to exhale into. You fill that square with soothing vapors that harm any fiend, fey, ghost, spirit, or undead creature that ends their turn in that square for the next minute, causing them to take @Damage[(4d8+4)[spirit]|traits:holy] (holy) damage (@Check[will|dc:28|basic] save). An incorporeal creature that takes this damage must also attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] save to resist being affected as follows.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} and is then slowed 1 for 1 round.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "任美璃的补给品 Ren Mei Li's Supplies"
        },
        "Yuni": {
          "name": "尤妮 Yuni",
          "tokenName": "尤妮 Yuni",
          "items": {
            "Ghostly Hand": {
              "name": "鬼魅之手 Ghostly Hand"
            },
            "Site Bound": {
              "name": "场地绑定 Site Bound",
              "description": "<p>典型的幽灵只能离开它被杀的地点或它作祟之处一小段距离。典型的限制是120尺。有些幽灵则并非束缚于某个地点，而是被束缚在对它而言很特别的一间房间、一栋建筑、一件物品或一个生物上。</p>\n<p>A typical ghost can stray only a short distance from where it was killed or the place it haunts. A typical limit is 120 feet. Some ghosts are instead bound to a room, building, item, or creature that was special to it rather than a location.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>归还她姐姐的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.KrmSuQIyu6OEi5ew]{神圣祈祷念珠}并揭示她的命运，使由妮得以继续前行（不过若PC们在此之前未能打破柳岸镇的思维空间，她将在明年以带有幽灵（特征）的形态归来）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一个幽灵被摧毁时，它会在其所束缚的地点于[[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后重新成形，并完全痊愈。只有当有人查明其存在的原因，并纠正一切阻止其魂魄休息的事物时，幽灵才能被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>Returning her sister's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.KrmSuQIyu6OEi5ew]{Holy Prayer Beads} and revealing her fate allows Yuni to move on (although she'll return as a ghost next year if the PCs don't break the Willowshore mindscape before then).</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after [[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Frightful Moan": {
              "name": "骇人悲叹 Frightful Moan",
              "description": "<p>幽灵哀叹自己的命运，迫使每个处于 @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30尺} 内的活着的生物尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:25|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] 意志豁免。失败时，该生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}（大失败时为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}）。成功时，该生物对该幽灵的骇人悲叹暂时免疫 1 分钟。</p>\n<p>The ghost laments its fate, forcing each living creature within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} to attempt a @Check[will|dc:25|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] save. On a failure, a creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to this ghost's frightful moan for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Tiger Attack": {
              "name": "猛虎攻击 Tiger Attack",
              "description": "<p>尤妮痛苦地叫喊着，一只幽灵般的老虎出现，似乎要撕咬撕裂她的身体，紧接着更多幽灵老虎现身，对@Template[emanation|distance:30]内的所有生物做出同样的事。该区域内的生物受到@Damage[4d6[slashing]|options:area-damage]伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:25|basic|options:area-effect]豁免）。</p>\n<p>Yuni cries out in pain as a ghostly tiger appears to rip and tear at her body, only for additional ghostly tigers to appear and do the same to all creatures in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. Creatures in this area take @Damage[4d6[slashing]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:25|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>平民幽灵是一位普通人，他们相信自己死得冤枉，通常源于阴谋诡计或背叛。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一些凡人因悲剧性的境遇而死或未能了结心愿时，他们可能会继续滞留于世。这些痛苦的灵魂会在生前对他们意义重大的地点作祟，不断试图纠正他们所认为的冤屈或过错。</p>\n<p>The ghost commoner is an ordinary person who believes they died unjustly, usually due to foul play or betrayal.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When some mortals die through tragic circumstances or without closure, they can linger on in the world. These anguished souls haunt a locale significant to them in life, constantly trying to right their perceived wrong or wrongdoings.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性人类幽灵（特征）\nFemale human ghost",
          "hp": "void healing, rejuvenation",
          "prototypeToken": "尤妮 Yuni"
        },
        "Manifestation": {
          "name": "显现 Manifestation",
          "tokenName": "显现 Manifestation",
          "items": {
            "Longsword": {
              "name": "长剑 Longsword",
              "description": "<p>长剑（也称为佩剑）可以是单刃剑或双刃剑。它们的剑刃很重，长度在3到4英尺之间。</p>\n<p>Longswords, also known as arming swords, can be one-edged or two-edged swords. Their blades are heavy and they're between 3 and 4 feet in length.</p>"
            },
            "Padded Armor": {
              "name": "衬垫护甲 Padded Armor",
              "description": "<p>这件护甲只是由一层厚重的绗缝布料构成，但有时会因为价格低廉而被使用。衬垫护甲比其他类型的护甲更容易受到损坏并被摧毁。重型护甲的价格中包含一件衬垫护甲内衬，不过当衬垫护甲穿在重型护甲下面时，会失去舒适特征。若你的重型护甲被摧毁，或在其他未穿戴整套重型护甲的情况下，你可以只穿这件衬垫护甲内衬来睡觉。这样你就能让魔法护甲保持灌注，并从与之关联的重型护甲上任何符文的力量中获益，但没有这件衬垫护甲内衬，其他人无法穿戴你的重型护甲。</p>\n<p>This armor is simply a layer of heavy, quilted cloth, but it is sometimes used because it's so inexpensive. Padded armor is easier to damage and destroy than other types of armor. Heavy armor comes with a padded armor undercoat included in its Price, though it loses the comfort trait when worn under heavy armor. You can wear just that padded armor undercoat to sleep in, if your heavy armor is destroyed, or when otherwise not wearing the full heavy armor. This allows you to keep magic armor invested and benefit from the power of any runes on the associated heavy armor, but no one else can wear your heavy armor without the padded undercoat.</p>"
            },
            "Choker of Elocution (Greater)": {
              "name": "雄辩项圈（高等） Choker of Elocution (Greater)",
              "description": "<p>这条白金项圈镌刻着三种语言的字母文字，并赋予你这些语言及其相关文化习俗的知识。</p>\n<p>你获得对社会检定的+2物品加值，以及理解、说出并书写所选语言的能力。</p>\n<p>你出色的口才使你在失聪时执行听觉动作所需的纯骰检定DC从5降低至3。</p>\n<p><strong>制作需求</strong>你必须懂得该项圈所赋予的语言。</p>\n<p>This platinum choker bears characters from three language's alphabet, and it gives knowledge of those languages and the associated culture's customs.</p>\n<p>You gain a +2 item bonus to Society checks and the ability to understand, speak, and write the chosen languages.</p>\n<p>Your excellent elocution reduces the DC of the flat check to perform an auditory action while deafened from 5 to 3.</p>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> You know the languages the choker grants.</p>"
            },
            "Sleeves of Storage (Greater)": {
              "name": "储物袖套（高等） Sleeves of Storage (Greater)",
              "description": "<p>这件宽松的长袍有着宽大、蓬松的袖子，每只袖子里都包含一个异次元空间。这些空间各自的运作方式如同一个 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.jaEEvuQ32GjAa8jy]{宽敞口袋（I型）}，每个最多可容纳20负载的物品（合计40负载），但任何单件物品的负载都不能超过1；当你接近最大容量时，袖子会变得略微沉重。你可以在空出一只手的情况下，以一个交互动作从袖子中取出或放入一件物品。</p>\n<p>如果某只袖子完全空着，你可以将你自己的魔宠放入那个异次元空间中。它可以在你的袖子里舒适地存活至多4小时，之后便会开始<em>窒息</em>。当它在你的袖子里时，它不会受到任何效果的影响，也不会成为任何效果的目标，但你也不会从任何主人能力中获益。魔宠可以自行离开袖子，花费一个带有<em>操作</em>与<em>移动</em>特征的单动作。你不能把任何其他生物放入你的袖子里；如果你的魔宠大于超小型，你也不能把它放入袖子中。如果你的魔宠在袖子里，你就不能在该袖子里放入任何物品。</p>\n<p>This loose robe has wide, voluminous sleeves that each contain an extradimensional space. These spaces each function as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.jaEEvuQ32GjAa8jy]{Spacious Pouch (Type I)} that can hold up to 20 Bulk of items (for a total of 40 Bulk), though no individual item can be of more than 1 Bulk; the sleeves grow slightly heavy as you reach maximum capacity. You can add or remove an item from a sleeve with a single hand free as an Interact action.</p>\n<p>If a sleeve is completely empty, you can place your own familiar into that extradimensional space. It can survive comfortably in your sleeve for up to 4 hours, after which it begins to <em>suffocate</em>. While in your sleeve, it can't be affected or targeted by any effects, but you don't benefit from any master abilities. A familiar can exit the sleeve of its own volition with a single action that has the <em>manipulate</em> and <em>move</em> traits. You can't place any other creature into your sleeves, nor can you place your familiar in a sleeve if it's larger than Tiny. If your familiar is in your sleeve, you can't place any items in the sleeve.</p>"
            },
            "Heh Shan-Bao’s Journal": {
              "name": "和善保的日志 Heh Shan-Bao’s Journal",
              "description": "<p>一本厚重的日志，里面塞满了散页和涂写的卷轴——总计是总督关于他希望能强化谭杉树的仪式的笔记，以及他在每个思维空间周期里钻研、用来创造一个<em>transmigrate</em>仪式以逃回生者世界的笔记。</p><p>回到这片思维空间的行为也改变了这本日志——它仍然包含数十张散页与卷轴，但日志本身已变成一本<em>中等复原净化典籍</em>。</p><hr /><p>这本书在新月之夜呈深蓝色，随着月亮渐盈逐渐转为鲜红色。</p><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注、治疗、活力）</p><p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><p><strong>需求</strong> 你的上一个动作是施放一个从这本魔导书中准备的法术，且该法术从你自己或一名盟友身上移除了一个有害状态或苦难</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 选择一个其状态被所需法术移除的生物。视版本而定，该生物获得2d8点持续1小时的临时生命值。</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.r1IsOaxM5tgVU29b]{效果：复原净化典籍}</p>\n<p>A thick journal filled with loose pages and scribbled scrolls—the total of the governor's notes on the ritual he hoped would strengthen the Tan Sugi tree as well as those he worked on each mindscape cycle to create a <em>transmigrate</em> ritual to escape back to the living world.</p><p>The act of returning to this mindscape has transformed the journal as well—it still contains dozens of loose sheets and scrolls, but the journal itself has become a <em>moderate tome of restorative cleansing</em>.</p><hr /><p>This book is dark blue on the night of the new moon, gradually shifting to bright red as the moon waxes.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate, healing, vitality)</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was to cast a spell prepared from this grimoire, and the spell removed a harmful condition or affliction from yourself or an ally</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Choose one creature whose condition was removed by the required spell. Depending on the version, that creature gains 2d8 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.r1IsOaxM5tgVU29b]{Effect: Tome of Restorative Cleansing}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "显现 Manifestation"
        },
        "Isori": {
          "name": "伊索里 Isori",
          "tokenName": "伊索里 Isori",
          "items": {
            "Divine Spontaneous Spells": {
              "name": "神术自发法术 Divine Spontaneous Spells"
            },
            "Breath of Life": {
              "name": "生命之息 Breath of Life",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 射程内的一个活体生物将要死亡。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你的祝福在生物死亡的瞬间使其复苏。你阻止目标死亡，并为目标恢复5d8点生命值。若触发的效果是死亡效果，或是不留任何遗骸的效果（例如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate}），则你无法使用“生命之息”。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 治疗量增加1d8。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A living creature within range would die.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your blessing revives a creature at the moment of its death. You prevent the target from dying and restore 5d8 Hit Points to the target. You can't use breath of life if the triggering effect was a death effect or an effect that leaves no remains, such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The healing increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Immolation": {
              "name": "神圣焚灭 Divine Immolation",
              "description": "<p>神圣烈焰灼烧区域内的生物。生物受到6d6火焰伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level -3)d6[persistent,fire]]伤害。烈焰中的神圣之力也会灼烧魂魄；若对该生物会造成更不利的效果（由GM判定），则生物因神圣焚化所受的伤害改为魂魄伤害，而非火焰伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半伤害且不受持续性伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全额伤害并受到持续性伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到双倍伤害并受到双倍持续性伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6，持续性伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>Divine flames scour creatures within the area. Creatures take 6d6 fire damage and @Damage[(@item.level -3)d6[persistent,fire]] damage. The divine power within the flames scorches the spirit as well; a creature takes spirit damage instead of fire damage from divine immolation if that would be more detrimental to the creature (as determined by the GM).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and no persistent damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and persistent damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and double persistent damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 and persistent damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Fly": {
              "name": "飞行 Fly",
              "description": "<p>目标可以在空中翱翔，获得等同于其速度或20尺（取较高者）的飞行速度。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.MuRBCiZn5IKeaoxi]{法术效果：飞行}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 持续时间增加至1小时。</p>\n<p>The target can soar through the air, gaining a fly Speed equal to its Speed or 20 feet, whichever is greater.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.MuRBCiZn5IKeaoxi]{Spell Effect: Fly}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration increases to 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Crisis of Faith": {
              "name": "信念崩塌 Crisis of Faith",
              "description": "<p>你攻击目标的信仰，使该生物充满疑虑与心灵动荡，造成6d6心灵伤害；若其能施放神圣法术，则改为造成6d8心灵伤害。其效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<p>对许多神祇而言，若无重大缘由，将此法术施放于你自身神祇的追随者身上属于禁忌。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到全额伤害；若目标能施放神圣法术，则其在1轮内为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标受到双倍伤害，在1轮内为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，且在1轮内无法施放神圣法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6（若目标为神圣施法者，则改为增加2d8）。</p>\n<p>You assault the target's faith, riddling the creature with doubt and mental turmoil that deal 6d6 mental damage, or 6d8 mental damage if it can cast divine spells. The effects are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<p>To many deities, casting this spell on a follower of your own deity without significant cause is anathema.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage; if the target can cast divine spells, it's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round, and can't cast divine spells for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6 (or by 2d8 if the target is a divine spellcaster).</p>"
            },
            "Holy Light": {
              "name": "圣光 Holy Light",
              "description": "<p>你射出一道炽烈的光线，带着神圣能量。进行一次远程法术攻击。该光线造成5d6火焰伤害。若目标具有邪秽（特征），你额外造成5d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全额伤害。</p>\n<p>若光线穿过一片魔法黑暗区域，或以受魔法黑暗影响的生物为目标，则神圣之光尝试反制黑暗。若你需要判定光线是否穿过一片黑暗区域，在你与该法术的目标之间画一条线。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 火焰伤害增加2d6，且对邪秽生物造成的魂魄伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You shine a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Lightning Bolt": {
              "name": "闪电束 Lightning Bolt",
              "description": "<p>一道闪电从你手中向外劈出，造成4d12电击伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d12。</p>\n<p>A bolt of lightning strikes outward from your hand, dealing 4d12 electricity damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
            },
            "Mind Reading": {
              "name": "读心术 Mind Reading",
              "description": "<p>通过一次粗略的心灵接触，你尝试读心术目标。它必须尝试一次意志豁免。随后，该目标在1小时内暂时免疫你的读心术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 当你施放法术时，目标会从你那里感知到模糊的表层思绪。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你会得知目标的智力调整值是高于、等于还是低于你的。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 当你施放法术时，你会从目标那里感知到模糊的表层思绪，并且你会得知它的智力是高于、等于还是低于你的。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，并且在法术持续时间内，你可以维持该法术以再次侦测目标的表层思绪。目标不会获得任何额外的豁免。</p>\n<p>With a cursory mental touch, you attempt to read the target's mind. It must attempt a Will save. The target then becomes temporarily immune to your mind reading for 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target perceives vague surface thoughts from you when you Cast the Spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You find out whether the target's Intelligence modifier is higher than, equal to, or lower than yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You perceive vague surface thoughts from the target when you Cast the Spell, and you find out whether its Intelligence is higher than, equal to, or lower than yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and for the duration of the spell, you can Sustain the spell to detect the target's surface thoughts again. The target doesn't receive any additional saves.</p>"
            },
            "Calm": {
              "name": "冷静 Calm",
              "description": "<p>你强行安抚区域内的生物，使其进入非暴力状态；每个生物必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 平静的冲动使该生物的攻击掷骰承受-1状态减值。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 任何将会影响该生物的情绪效果都会被压制，且该生物无法使用敌对动作。如果目标受到任何其他生物的敌对行为影响，则其不再受<em>calm</em>影响。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但敌对行为不会终止该效果。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Qr5rgoZvI4KmFY0N]{法术效果：平静术}</p>\n<p>You forcibly calm creatures in the area, soothing them into a nonviolent state; each creature must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Calming urges impose a -1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Any emotion effects that would affect the creature are suppressed and the creature can't use hostile actions. If the target is subject to hostility from any other creature, it ceases to be affected by <em>calm</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but hostility doesn't end the effect.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Qr5rgoZvI4KmFY0N]{Spell Effect: Calm}</p>"
            },
            "Cleanse Affliction": {
              "name": "净化苦难 Cleanse Affliction",
              "description": "<p>温和的复原魔法会击退毒素与更复杂病症的效果。选择目标身上的一种苦难，例如诅咒、疾病或毒素。若其已推进到第一阶段之后，则将阶段降低1。对某个具体苦难案例而言，此类降低只能应用一次；当其被完全治愈时，该案例结束。尽管无法再次降低阶段，但此法术的升阶版本在每次施放时都会尝试反制。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>若该苦难为疾病或毒素，则尝试反制该苦难。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>若该苦难为诅咒、疾病或毒素，则尝试反制该苦难。</p>\n<p>Gentle restorative magic pushes back the effects of toxins and more complex maladies. Choose an affliction on the target, such as a curse, disease, or poison. If it has advanced past stage one, reduce the stage by one. This reduction can be applied only once to a given case of an affliction, with the case ending when it's completely cured. Although the reduction can't occur again, heightened versions of this spell attempt to counteract with each casting.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a disease or poison.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a curse, disease, or poison.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你解开一个法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一件魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内变为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Noise Blast": {
              "name": "噪音爆发 Noise Blast",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音爆发而出，造成2d10音波伤害。每个生物都必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物承受一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物承受全部伤害，并在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物承受双倍伤害，在1分钟内耳聋，并且处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "See the Unseen": {
              "name": "见无形 See the Unseen",
              "description": "<p>你的目光能够穿透幻象，并发现@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的生物与魂魄。你可以看见隐形生物，如同它们并未隐形一般，尽管它们的细节会变得模糊，使其处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}状态且难以辨认。你也能看见虚体生物，例如幽灵，它们会以穿过物体的模糊形状显现出来，只要它们在距离某个物体表面10英尺以内并处于该物体内部。更细微的线索也会使你在进行识破幻象的检定时获得+2状态加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>该法术的持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{法术效果：看见不可见者}</p>\n<p>Your gaze pierces through illusions and finds @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} creatures and spirits. You can see invisible creatures as though they weren't invisible, although their features are blurred, making them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} and difficult to identify. You can also see incorporeal creatures, like ghosts, phased through an object from within 10 feet of an object's surface as blurry shapes seen through those objects. Subtler clues also grant you a +2 status bonus to checks you make to disbelieve illusions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> This spell has a duration of 8 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{Spell Effect: See the Unseen}</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，用一道心灵冲击使其晕眩。这道冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，并进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害提高1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你发出一道脉冲，能感知到魔法的存在。你获得的信息仅限于魔法是否存在。你可以选择忽略你已完全知晓的魔法，例如你和盟友的魔法物品以及持续中的法术。你只有在幻术魔法的效果阶位低于你的<em>侦测魔法</em>法术阶位时，才能侦测到该幻术魔法。不过，带有幻术灵光但外观并不具欺骗性的物品（例如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{隐形药水}）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>由GM判定，你得知该法术所侦测到的最强魔法效果的阶位或等级。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>同3环，但你还会锁定最高阶位魔法的来源。类似于模糊感官，你不会得知确切位置，但可以将来源缩小到一个5英尺的立方体范围内（或若来源大于该范围，则缩小到距离最近的等效范围）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Frostbite": {
              "name": "霜噬 Frostbite",
              "description": "<p>一团刺骨的寒冷之球在你的目标周围凝聚，冻结其身体。目标进行一次基本强韧豁免，承受2d4点寒冷伤害。在大失败时，目标还会获得1点钝击弱点，持续到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.DdqWMj7cuf4S1bgr]{法术效果：霜噬}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4，且在大失败时的弱点增加1点。</p>\n<p>An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.DdqWMj7cuf4S1bgr]{Spell Effect: Frostbite}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导活力能量来治疗活物或伤害不死。如果目标是自愿的活体生物，你恢复1d8点生命值。如果目标是不死，你对其造成等量的活力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>（专注）</strong> 该法术的射程为30尺。如果你在治疗一个活体生物，将恢复的生命值增加8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>（专注）</strong> 你在一个@Template[emanation|distance:30]内扩散活力能量。这以爆发内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值增加1d8，且2动作版本的额外治疗增加8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> You disperse vital energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Light": {
              "name": "光 Light",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个光球，它在你选择的颜色中，于20英尺半径内散发明亮光照（并在接下来的20英尺内提供昏暗光照）。如果你在某个自愿生物所在的同一空间内创造光照，你可以将光照附着在该生物身上，使其在该生物移动时漂浮在其附近。你可以维持该法术以将光照移动至多60英尺；你可以将其附着或从生物身上解除附着，作为此次移动的一部分。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。如果你在已有四个<em>光亮</em>法术处于生效状态时施放该法术，你必须选择其中一个现有效果结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{法术效果：光亮}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 光球在60英尺半径内散发光照（并在接下来的60英尺内提供昏暗光照）。</p>\n<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"
            },
            "Protection": {
              "name": "防护 Protection",
              "description": "<p>你为一个生物设下防护以抵御伤害。目标的护甲等级与豁免骰获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以选择让这些增益也影响目标周围@Template[emanation|distance:10]内的所有盟友。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.RawLEPwyT5CtCZ4D]{法术效果：防护}</p>\n<p>You ward a creature against harm. The target gains a +1 status bonus to Armor Class and saving throws.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can choose to have the benefits also affect all your allies in a @Template[emanation|distance:10] around the target.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.RawLEPwyT5CtCZ4D]{Spell Effect: Protection}</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你专注于目标物体，敞开心灵以感知魔法灵光。施放完成后，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法。你或任何你就该灵光提供建议的人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得+2环境加值。若该物体为幻觉，你仅在该效果的阶级低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的阶级时才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你最多可以以10个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong>你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Link": {
              "name": "魂魄链接 Spirit Link",
              "description": "<p>你与另一名生物建立起魂魄链接，替其承受痛苦。当你施放该法术以及在你每个回合开始时，若目标的生命值低于最大值，则其回复2点生命值（或回复其当前生命值与最大生命值之间的差值，若该差值更低）。你失去等同于目标所回复的生命值。</p>\n<p>这是一次魂魄转移，因此不会适用任何会提高目标回复生命值或减少你失去生命值的效果。该转移也会忽略你或目标拥有的任何临时生命值。由于该效果不涉及活力或虚无能量，<em>魂魄链接</em>即使在你或目标为不死时也能生效。在持续时间内，你不会从再生或快速治疗中获得任何益处。你可以解消该法术，并且若你在任何时候降至0点生命值，<em>魂魄链接</em>会自动结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 每次转移的生命值数量增加2点。</p>\n<p>You form a spiritual link with another creature, taking in its pain. When you Cast this Spell and at the start of each of your turns, if the target is below maximum Hit Points, it regains 2 Hit Points (or the difference between its current and maximum Hit Points, if that's lower). You lose as many Hit Points as the target regained.</p>\n<p>This is a spiritual transfer, so no effects apply that would increase the Hit Points the target regains or decrease the Hit Points you lose. This transfer also ignores any temporary Hit Points you or the target have. Since this effect doesn't involve vitality or void energy, <em>spirit link</em> works even if you or the target is undead. While the duration persists, you gain no benefit from regeneration or fast healing. You can Dismiss this spell, and if you're ever at 0 Hit Points, <em>spirit link</em> ends automatically.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The number of Hit Points transferred each time increases by 2.</p>"
            },
            "Stabilize": {
              "name": "稳定伤势 Stabilize",
              "description": "<p>生命能量关上死亡之门。目标失去@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死（状态）}状态，尽管其在生命值为0时仍保持@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}。</p>\n<p>Life energy shuts death's door. The target loses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} condition, though it remains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} at 0 Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一只漂浮的魔法之手，可以是隐形的或幽灵般的，它会抓住目标物体并使其缓慢悬浮，朝任意方向移动至多20英尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以使该物体额外移动20英尺。如果该法术结束时物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以以一件无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程提高至60英尺，且你可以以一件无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 射程提高至60英尺，且你可以以一件无人持用且负载为2或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Fangs": {
              "name": "尖牙 Fangs"
            },
            "Tail": {
              "name": "尾巴 Tail"
            },
            "Spit": {
              "name": "吐痰 Spit"
            },
            "Coils of Knowledge": {
              "name": "知识盘绕 Coils of Knowledge",
              "description": "<p>娜迦的钳制更偏向灵性而非肉体。被毗查罗牟尼的尾击命中的生物必须成功通过一次 @Check[will|dc:29] 豁免，否则会被其尾巴 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}，直到其 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{逃脱}、娜迦以一次交互动作释放目标，或娜迦死亡。</p>\n<p>被俘者进行逃脱时承受 –4 状态减值，但可以选择尝试一次神秘学或宗教检定来逃脱，以取代通常的选项，且不会承受此减值。</p>\n<p>The naga's grip is more spiritual than physical. A creature hit by a vicharamuni's tail must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} by the tail until they @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape}, the naga releases them with an Interact action, or the naga dies.</p>\n<p>A captive takes a –4 status penalty to Escape, but can choose to attempt an Occultism or Religion check to Escape instead of the usual options without taking this penalty</p>"
            },
            "Greater Constrict": {
              "name": "强效缠绕 Greater Constrict",
              "description": "<p>@Damage[(3d8+5)[钝击]], @Check[fortitude|dc:29|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.GreaterConstrict]</p>\n<p>@Damage[(3d8+5)[bludgeoning]], @Check[fortitude|dc:29|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.GreaterConstrict]</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Venom": {
              "name": "灵性毒液 Spiritual Venom",
              "description": "<p>毗查罗牟尼可以选择抵消其毒液对生物造成的任何伤害。此外，纳迦可以对任何受其毒液影响的生物施放其任意神圣法术，无论射程或效果线如何。</p>\n<p>A vicharamuni can choose to negate any damage that its venom does to a creature. In addition, the naga can cast any of its divine spells on a creature that is affected by its venom, regardless of range or line of effect.</p>"
            },
            "Vicharamuni Venom": {
              "name": "维查拉穆尼毒液 Vicharamuni Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免掷骰</strong> @Check[will|dc:29]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[3d6[spirit]]（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> 3d6魂魄伤害且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{汲取 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[will|dc:29]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[3d6[spirit]] (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 3d6 spirit and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Heaven Lore": {
              "name": "天堂学识 Heaven Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>觉醒者那伽是仁慈而睿智的师者，教导人群与守望之地。它们试图引导并滋养周遭世界，感知具有潜在超自然意义的凡人或地点。一旦找到目标，这些那伽便会提供教诲与神圣的试炼，锻造其守护对象走向强大，并传授更深刻的是非观。尽管在学生眼中，它们常被视为严苛而令人生畏的导师，但受毗遮罗牟尼教导之人往往会成长为伟大的英雄。</p>\n<p>觉醒者那伽同样细致地引导自己的幼子。幼那伽一旦成年，便会获得一次最终试炼，随后被鼓励离巢，去寻找属于自己的自然奇景或前途无量的凡人。有时，数代那伽会守护同一处地点或同一条家族血脉，将这份照护的荣耀代代相传。在这种情况下，亲代那伽会力求至少让其中一个孩子选择留下，成为其祖传守护之地的守护者，使父母得以安心——他们所保护的地点将继续由后代守卫。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>那伽是具备魔法力量与敏锐才智的蛇形生物。就体貌而言，它们酷似巨蛇，但常佩戴珠宝与其他饰物，明显将自己与动物亲族区分开来。那伽凭借与生俱来的魔法以及带毒的獠牙，使除最坚韧的敌人之外的所有对手不敢逼近。它们谨守自身机密，认为自己的宇宙职责神圣不可侵犯，非外来学者所能理解。它们不愿自我解释，也不愿接受结盟的暗示，因而与邻里之间长期冲突不绝；邻居们则将它们视作冷漠、傲慢或狡诈。</p>\n<p>那伽往往对自己所认定的宇宙职责怀有强烈的使命感，即便这份职责会将它们引向暴力或悲剧的结局。许多人因其奉献而认为它们严酷而严厉：威仪令人胆寒，却又带着一股超然的气息。</p>\n<p>Awakener nagas are benevolent and wise teachers of people and places. They seek to guide and nurture the world around them, sensing mortals or locales with potential supernatural significance. Once located, these nagas provide instruction and divine trials to forge their wards toward strength and to impart a deeper understanding of right and wrong. Though considered stern and intimidating taskmasters by their students, those taught by a vicharamuni often go on to become great heroes.</p>\n<p>Awakener nagas are similarly attentive in guiding their young. Upon reaching adulthood, a naga is provided a final trial before being encouraged to depart the nest and seek out their own natural wonders or promising mortals. Sometimes generations of nagas might guard the same place or family line, passing the honor of such care from parent to child. In such cases, the parent nagas aim to have at least one of their children elect to stay behind and become the guardian of their ancestral ward, giving the parents peace of mind that the site they protect will continue to be guarded by their descendants.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Nagas are serpentine beings with magical powers and keen intellects. Physically, they resemble massive snakes, though they often wear jewelry and other ornaments that clearly separate them from their animal kin. Nagas use their innate magic and poisonous fangs to keep all but the most stalwart foes at bay. They keep their own counsel, viewing their cosmic role to be sacrosanct and beyond the understanding of outside scholars. Their unwillingness to explain themselves or entertain the suggestion of alliances has led to a long history of conflict with their neighbors, who read them as aloof, arrogant, or duplicitous.</p>\n<p>Nagas often have a powerful sense of duty to their perceived role within the universe, even if this role leads them to violent or tragic ends. Many see them as harsh and stern due to their devotion, terrifying in their majesty yet possessed of an aura of transcendence.</p>",
          "blurb": "雄性觉醒那伽\nMale awakener naga",
          "prototypeToken": "伊索里 Isori"
        },
        "Boar": {
          "name": "野猪 Boar",
          "tokenName": "野猪 Boar",
          "items": {
            "Tusk": {
              "name": "长牙 Tusk"
            },
            "Ferocity": {
              "name": "凶暴性 Ferocity",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Ferocity]</p>"
            },
            "Boar Charge": {
              "name": "猪突 Boar Charge",
              "description": "<p>野猪行走两次，然后进行一次獠牙打击。只要它移动了至少20尺，它的攻击检定就获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p>The boar Strides twice and then makes a tusk Strike. As long as it moved at least 20 feet, it gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its attack roll.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>野猪是杂食性哺乳动物，由于其肉被视为美味佳肴而遭到大量捕猎。野猪最可能在自卫时或在冬季的交配季节对类人生物发起攻击；在此期间，雄性会长出额外一英寸的组织以保护其器官，好在与竞争对手搏斗时不受伤害。当然，在某些文化中，野猪会被训练得更加凶暴，以便担任战兽与守卫的角色。当这些野猪逃回野外后，便可能成为该地区真正的恐怖存在。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>虽然驯养猪是农场生活的支柱，但野生野猪要危险得多。性情恶劣的疣猪相对常见，而那些被称为戴奥冬的笨重、原始巨兽则较为少见。贪食的野猪能蹂躏其栖息的乡野，使其成为令农民尤为头痛的祸害。野猪繁殖不受约束，而一对野猪便能迅速扩展成一个庞大的家族。</p>\n<p>Boars are omnivorous mammals, hunted heavily because their meat is considered a delicacy. Boars are most likely to attack humanoids either in self-defense or during their mating season in the winter months, when the males grow an extra inch of tissue to protect their organs as they fight off rivals. Of course, in some cultures, boars are trained to become much more aggressive so they can fill the roles of warbeast and guardian. When such boars escape back into the wild, they can become true terrors in the region.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>While domesticated pigs are a staple of farm life, wild boars are much more dangerous. Foul-tempered warthogs are relatively common, while the lumbering, primeval beasts known as daeodons are less so. Voracious boars can ravage the countryside in which they live, making them a particular nuisance to farmers. Boars breed freely, and a pair of boars can rapidly grow to a large family.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "野猪 Boar"
        },
        "Kum Soon-Chong": {
          "name": "昆舜重 Kum Soon-Chong",
          "tokenName": "昆舜重 Kum Soon-Chong",
          "items": {
            "Composite Longbow": {
              "name": "复合长弓 Composite Longbow"
            },
            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger"
            },
            "Leather Armor": {
              "name": "皮甲 Leather Armor",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧的煮制皮革与定型煮制皮革混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时兼具最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
            },
            "Arrows": {
              "name": "箭矢 Arrows",
              "description": "<p>这些抛射物是弓所使用的弹药。箭杆由木头制成。它在飞行时由一端的箭羽保持稳定，另一端则装有金属箭头。</p>\n<p>These projectiles are the ammunition for bows. The shaft of an arrow is made of wood. It is stabilized in flight by fletching at one end and bears a metal head on the other.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Expert Subsistence": {
              "name": "专家级谋生 Expert Subsistence",
              "description": "<p>在使用生存技能进行[[/act subsist statistic=survival]]时，如果变体追踪者掷骰结果比成功更差，他们仍获得成功。成功时，他们可以为自己和额外8个生物提供求生所需的生活来源；大成功时，他们可以照顾的生物数量是成功时的两倍。</p>\n<p>While using Survival to [[/act subsist statistic=survival]], if the tracker rolls any result worse than a success, they get a success. On a success, they can provide subsistence living for themselves and 8 additional creatures, and on a critical success, they can take care of twice as many creatures as on a success.</p>"
            },
            "Master Tracker": {
              "name": "大师追踪者 Master Tracker",
              "description": "<p>追踪者可以在以全速移动时进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{追踪}。</p>\n<p>The tracker can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track} while moving at full speed.</p>"
            },
            "On the Hunt": {
              "name": "追猎中 On the Hunt",
              "description": "<p>变体追踪者指定一个他们正在观察或追踪的生物作为他们的猎物。</p>\n<p>变体追踪者在进行察觉检定以[[/act seek]]该猎物，以及进行生存检定以[[/act track]]该猎物时，获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p>在每一轮中，变体追踪者第一次命中被指定的猎物时，会造成额外1d4点精准伤害。这些效果持续到偷猎者再次使用On the Hunt为止。</p>\n<p>The tracker designates one creature they're observing or tracking as their prey.</p>\n<p>The tracker gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to [[/act seek]] the prey and to Survival checks to [[/act track]] the prey.</p>\n<p>The first time the tracker hits the designated prey in a round, they deal an additional 1d4 precision damage. These effects last until the poacher uses On the Hunt again.</p>"
            },
            "Forest Lore": {
              "name": "森林传说 Forest Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>未经训练的眼睛或许能发现一两处野生生物经过的迹象，但只有熟练的追踪者才能识别出多处此类迹象，并辨明它们彼此之间的关联，将前一处与后一处串联起来，直到它们形成一条由足迹、粪便、毛发、羽毛与血迹构成的痕迹线，引向猎物的巢穴。</p><hr /><p>探险者往往为应对任何类型的危害而装备精良、训练有素，并渴望带领他人进入荒野。</p>\n<p>An untrained eye might spot a sign or two of a wild creature's passing, but only a skilled tracker can identify several such signs and discern their relationship to each other, connecting one to the next until they form a trail of prints, scat, fur, feathers, and blood that leads to the quarry's lair.</p><hr /><p>Explorers are often well-equipped and well-trained for any type of hazard and are eager to lead others into the wild.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "昆舜重 Kum Soon-Chong"
        },
