        "Nosois' Vengeance": {
          "name": "疫鸟的复仇 Nosois' Vengeance",
          "tokenName": "疫鸟的复仇 Nosois' Vengeance",
          "items": {
            "Summon Vanths": {
              "name": "召唤范斯族 Summon Vanths",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名PC进入房间并被危害注意到</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 陷阱召唤四只vanth，它们随后掷先攻，并在法术结束前最多存在1分钟，之后vanth消失。与大多数被召唤的生物不同，被召唤的vanth每轮可以使用3个动作，并且可以使用反应动作。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> One of the PCs enters the room and is noticed by the hazard</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The trap summons four vanths, who then roll initiative and remain for up to 1 minute before the spell ends and the vanths disappear. The summoned vanths can use 3 actions each round and can use reactions, unlike most summoned creatures.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[thievery|dc:36]（迅速摧毁卷轴而不触发危害），@Check[religion|dc:33]（向法莱斯玛与疫鸟为先前的侮辱道歉），或解除魔法（6环；反制 DC 29）。</p>\n<p>@Check[thievery|dc:36] (to quickly destroy the scroll without triggering the hazard), @Check[religion|dc:33] (to apologize to Pharasma and the nosois for the previous insult), or dispel magic (6th level; counteract DC 29).</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>卷轴上的麻雀动了起来，用野口（来自<strong>事件11：疫鸟的早午餐</strong>中的一只疫鸟）的声音对PC们说话：“就是他们！他们就是那些连茶都不会好好奉的渎神者！把他们押去见夫人！”</p>\n<p>The sparrow on the scroll animates, speaking to the PCs in Noguchi's voice (one of the nosois from <strong>Event 11: Nosois' Brunch</strong>): \"They're the ones! They're the blasphemers who can't even properly serve tea! Send them along to the Lady!\"</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（大师）</p>\n<p>(master)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "疫鸟的复仇 Nosois' Vengeance"
        },
        "Jerky": {
          "name": "肉脯 Jerky",
          "tokenName": "肉脯 Jerky",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Pack Attack": {
              "name": "群体攻击 Pack Attack",
              "description": "<p>狗的打击对处于至少两名狗的盟友触及范围内的生物造成额外1d4伤害。</p>\n<p>The dog's Strikes deal 1d4 extra damage to creatures within the reach of at least two of the dog's allies.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>典型的看门犬忠诚可靠，深受许多社区喜爱。它们常被当作宠物饲养，既擅长守护也擅长追踪，在保卫心爱的主人或家人时甚至能无所畏惧。下方呈现的数值适用于多种体重在20到50磅之间的犬种。野犬也可以使用这些数值，但它们未驯化的天性使其更加难以预测。野化犬科动物或许更为危险，因为与野生的同类不同，野化犬往往缺乏对人类的本能畏惧——而这种畏惧会阻止野生生物与人接触。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>狗是值得信赖且忠诚的伙伴，既能充当守卫，也能作为追踪动物与宠物。它们凭借嗅觉侦测猎物或捕食者的能力，以及偏好陪伴类人生物的习性，使其成为大多数冒险者的理想宠物。世界上有数以百计的犬种——从超小型的膝上犬，对主人倾注满满的亲昵，到强壮的猎犬，肩高几乎达4英尺——几乎在人们居住的任何地方都能找到。体型更大的品种甚至可能被用作体型较小的冒险者的坐骑；还有一些文化将狗作为役用畜，能够在冰冷的苔原上拖拽载满补给的雪橇。无论如何，许多冒险者都能从养一条狗中获得价值。</p>\n<p>The typical guard dog is loyal and beloved by many communities. Often adored as pets, they excel as protectors and trackers, and can be fearless when defending a beloved master or family member. The statistics presented below work well for numerous breeds of dog ranging from 20 to 50 pounds in weight. Wild dogs can also use these statistics, but their untamed nature makes them far more unpredictable. Feral canines are perhaps even more dangerous, for unlike their wild cousins, feral dogs often lack the instinctual fear of humanity that stops wild creatures from interacting with people.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Dogs are trusted and loyal companions that serve as guardians, tracking animals, and pets. Their ability to detect prey or predators via scent and their predilection to accompany humanoids makes them ideal pets for most adventurers. There are hundreds of breeds of dogs in the world—from tiny lapdogs who shower their masters in affection to brawny hounds that stand nearly 4 feet high at the shoulder—and they can be found in nearly any place where people reside. Larger breeds might even be used as mounts for smaller adventurers, and some cultures use dogs as beasts of burden capable of pulling sleds loaded with supplies across the icy tundra. Regardless, many adventurers find value in having a dog.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "肉脯 Jerky"
        },
        "Provincial Jiang-shi": {
          "name": "省级僵尸 Provincial Jiang-shi",
          "tokenName": "行省僵尸 Provincial Jiang-shi",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Spirit Blast": {
              "name": "灵魂冲击 Spirit Blast",
              "description": "<p>你凝聚以太能量并攻击一个生物的魂魄，以一次基本强韧豁免为抵抗，造成16d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You concentrate ethereal energy and attack a creature's spirit, dealing 16d6 spirit damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Vampiric Exsanguination": {
              "name": "血族驱命 Vampiric Exsanguination",
              "description": "<p>你通过伸展的双臂汲取其他生物的鲜血与生命力。你对区域内的活体生物造成12d6虚空伤害，并进行一次基础强韧豁免。</p>\n<p>你获得等同于该法术对单一生物造成伤害一半的临时生命值；以受到伤害最高的那只生物为准来计算这些临时生命值。1分钟后，你失去任何剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You draw in the blood and life force of other creatures through your outstretched arms. You deal 12d6 void damage to living creatures in the area with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<p>You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage a single creature takes from this spell; calculate these temporary Hit Points using the creature that took the most damage. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Shadow Blast": {
              "name": "暗影爆破 Shadow Blast",
              "description": "<p>你将暗影位面的半真实物质塑造成一次爆发。选择酸蚀、钝击、寒冷、电击、火焰、力场、穿刺、挥砍或音波伤害，并选择一个30尺锥形、一个位于120尺内的15尺爆发，或一条50尺线形。该爆发对区域内的每个生物造成5d8点你所选类型的伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d8。</p>\n<p>You shape the quasi-real substance of the Shadow Plane into a blast. Choose acid, bludgeoning, cold, electricity, fire, force, piercing, slashing, or sonic damage, and choose a 30-foot cone, a 15-foot burst within 120 feet, or a 50-foot line. The blast deals 5d8 damage of the type you chose to each creature in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Enervation": {
              "name": "弱能术 Enervation",
              "description": "<p>伸出一根手指，你发射出一道虚空能量光束，削弱任何被其触及的生物的生命力。直线范围内的每个活体生物都必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 在成功时，持续性虚空伤害增加 1d8；在失败或大失败时，则增加 2d8。</p>\n<p>Extending a finger, you fire a beam of void energy that weakens the life force of any creature it touches. Each living creature in the line must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The persistent void damage increases by 1d8 on a success, or by 2d8 on a failure or critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Ghostly Tragedy": {
              "name": "幽魂悲剧 Ghostly Tragedy",
              "description": "<p>这个法术会强迫当地的魂魄重演你所知晓并在你@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.aBQ8ajvEBByv45yz]{施放法术}时点名的、近期过去发生的一起暴力事件。你将扮演主要受害者的角色。重演会展现受害者死亡或受伤前的最后9分钟，以及其死亡或受伤后的1分钟。魂魄不会改变形态，因此这无法通过外貌来确定加害者。事件所必需的失踪生物的灵体形态会按需显现，失踪的物品则会以朦胧的影子轮廓出现。</p>\n<p>场景结束后，你每有一个参与场景的幽灵幻影，就会受到@Damage[2d6[void]]伤害（通常等同于除受害者外参与其中的生物数量）。任何观察了这段幽灵重现的生物（包括你）都可以尝试进行检定来调查该事件，以发现新的线索与信息。</p>\n<p>This spell compels local spirits to reenact a violent event of the recent past that you're aware of and name as you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.aBQ8ajvEBByv45yz]{Cast the Spell}. You take the role of the primary victim. The reenactment plays out the final 9 minutes leading up to the death or injury of the victim and the minute after their death or injury. The spirits don't change form, so this doesn't help determine perpetrators by their look. Spiritual forms of missing creatures necessary for the event manifest as needed, and missing items appear as shadowy outlines.</p>\n<p>Once the scene ends, you take @Damage[2d6[void]] damage for each ghostly apparition that participated in the scene (typically equal to the number of creatures involved other than the victim). Any creature that observed the ghostly recreation, including you, can attempt checks to investigate the event to discover new clues and information.</p>"
            },
            "Bind Undead": {
              "name": "束缚不死生物 Bind Undead",
              "description": "<p>你以一句真言夺取对目标的控制。它获得仆从（特征）。如果你或一名盟友对目标使用任何敌对动作，该法术结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.rVkUzqS4rpZp9LS3]{法术效果：束缚不死}</p>\n<p>With a word of power, you seize control of the target. It gains the minion trait. If you or an ally uses any hostile actions against the target, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.rVkUzqS4rpZp9LS3]{Spell Effect: Bind Undead}</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你在目标心中种下恐惧；它必须进行一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并在 1 轮内获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以指定五个生物作为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Harm": {
              "name": "伤害术 Harm",
              "description": "<p>你引导虚无能量来伤害活物或治疗不死。若目标是活体生物，你对其造成1d8虚无伤害，且其必须进行一次基础强韧豁免。若目标是自愿的不死生物，你恢复等量的生命值。你在施放该法术时花费的动作数决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>（姿势）</strong>该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>（言语、姿势）</strong>该法术的射程为30尺。若你在治疗一个不死生物，将恢复的生命值提高8。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>（材料、言语、姿势）</strong>你在30尺散发中扩散虚无能量。这会以区域内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong>治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8，且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8。</p>\n<p>You channel void energy to harm the living or heal the undead. If the target is a living creature, you deal 1d8 void damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. If the target is a willing undead creature, you restore that amount of Hit Points. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(verbal, somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing an undead creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(material, verbal, somatic)</strong> You disperse void energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Mace": {
              "name": "钉头锤 Mace"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Breathsense (Precise) 60 feet": {
              "name": "呼吸感知（精确）60尺 Breathsense (Precise) 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>僵尸无法感知5尺以外的活体生物，除非通过其吐息感知。在所列射程内屏住呼吸的活体生物，在其屏息期间对僵尸而言处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} 状态。要以这种方式屏住呼吸，生物必须空出一只手，以完全捏住鼻子或捂住嘴巴。</p>\n<p>A jiang-shi can't perceive living creatures beyond 5 feet except with their breathsense. A living creature within the listed range who holds its breath is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} to the jiang-shi for as long as it holds its breath. To hold its breath in this way, a creature must have one hand free to fully plug its nose or cover its mouth.</p>"
            },
            "Fast Healing 10": {
              "name": "快速治疗 10 Fast Healing 10",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FastHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Jiang-Shi Vulnerabilities": {
              "name": "僵尸弱点 Jiang-Shi Vulnerabilities",
              "description": "<p>所有僵尸都具有以下弱点。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>厌恶</strong> 僵尸无法自愿接近到距离被高举的镜子或摇响的手铃10尺以内。生物可以用一个交互动作操控镜子或手铃，在1轮内将该物品高举或摇响（类似于举起盾牌）。如果僵尸非自愿地进入其所厌恶的物体10尺以内，它获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑（状态）}状态，远离其所厌恶的物体奔逃，直到与该物体的距离达到或超过10尺为止。在暴露于其所厌恶的物体1轮后，僵尸可以用一个带有专注（特征）的单动作尝试一次@Check[will|dc:25]意志豁免。成功时，它在[[/gmr 1d6 #rounds]]{1d6轮}内克服其厌恶（大成功时为1小时）。</li>\n<li><strong>苦涩顿悟</strong> 当僵尸被提醒其堕落的本性以及其与活物之间存在断绝的真相时，它会被严重的忧郁所折磨。当僵尸看见一座祭坛，上面摆有至少1负载的献给祖先魂魄的食物供品时，它必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:25]意志豁免。随后，它在1分钟内暂时免疫苦涩顿悟。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 僵尸不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 僵尸获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 僵尸获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 僵尸获得呆滞2以及@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>All jiang-shi possess the following vulnerabilities.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revulsion</strong> A jiang-shi can't voluntarily come within 10 feet of a brandished mirror or the sound of ringing handbells. A creature can Interact with a mirror or handbell to brandish or ring the item for 1 round (similar to Raising a Shield). If the jiang-shi involuntarily comes within 10 feet of an object of their revulsion, they gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition, running from the object of their revulsion until they are 10 feet or farther from the object. After 1 round of being exposed to the object of their revulsion, a jiang-shi can attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save as a single action, which has the concentrate trait. On a success, they overcome their revulsions for [[/gmr 1d6 #rounds]]{1d6 rounds} (or 1 hour on a critical success).</li>\n<li><strong>Bitter Epiphany</strong> A jiang-shi is afflicted by severe melancholia when reminded of their debased nature and the truth of their existential disconnection from living beings. When a jiang-shi sees an altar with at least 1 Bulk of food offerings to ancestor spirits, they must attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save. They are then temporarily immune to Bitter Epiphany for 1 minute.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The jiang-shi is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The jiang-shi is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The jiang-shi is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The jiang-shi is stupefied 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "One More Breath": {
              "name": "再多一口气 One More Breath",
              "description": "<p>不同于其他不死，僵尸在生命值降至0时不会被摧毁。相反，他们会陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}，并在1分钟后以1点生命值苏醒。将至少1负载的糯米或母鸡蛋撒在昏迷的僵尸身上，会永久摧毁他们。如果僵尸是被由暮木制成的武器的攻击将生命值降至0，则他们会立即被摧毁。</p>\n<p>Unlike other undead, a jiang-shi isn't destroyed at 0 HP. Instead, they fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} and awaken in 1 minute with 1 Hit Point. Scattering at least 1 Bulk of glutinous rice or hen eggs on an unconscious jiang-shi destroys them permanently. If the jiang-shi was reduced to 0 HP by an attack from a weapon made of duskwood, they're destroyed immediately.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Warped Fulu": {
              "name": "扭曲符箓 Warped Fulu",
              "description": "<p>僵尸已腐化了贴在其额头上的符箓。僵尸对由魔法物品施放且不消耗法术位的法术免疫，例如来自卷轴或魔杖的法术。一个生物可以 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{偷窃}该符箓以将其移除，并以对抗僵尸的察觉 DC 进行检定。这会立刻终止僵尸对这些效果的免疫。若某个生物随后以一个交互动作摧毁被移除的符箓，僵尸也会失去其快速治疗能力。僵尸可以花费连续不被打断的 1 小时，用书写工具在一条纸片（或类似材料）上题写，以制作一张替代符箓。</p>\n<p>The jiang-shi has corrupted the fulu attached to their brow. The jiang-shi is immune to spells cast from a magic item without expending a spell slot, such as from a scroll or wand. A creature can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.RDXXE7wMrSPCLv5k]{Steal} the fulu to remove it, rolling against the jiangshi's Perception DC. This immediately ends the jiang-shi's immunity to these effects. If a creature then destroys the removed fulu with an Interact action, the jiang-shi also loses their fast healing ability. A jiang-shi can create a replacement fulu by spending 1 uninterrupted hour inscribing a strip of paper (or similar) with a writing instrument.</p>"
            },
            "Drain Qi": {
              "name": "汲取气﻿ Drain Qi",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 一个位于僵尸触及范围内的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}或自愿的生物</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 僵尸通过其呼吸吸取受害者的生命能量，也就是气。这需要进行一次对抗受害者强韧DC的@Check[athletics|defense:fortitude]检定（若受害者处于受擒状态），而若受害者处于其他任一状态则自动成功。受害者陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{流失（状态） 1}，且僵尸恢复@Damage[13[healing]] HP，将任何溢出部分作为临时生命值获得。对已处于流失（状态）的生物吸取气不会为僵尸恢复任何HP，但会使受害者的流失（状态）值增加1；当其达到流失（状态）5时受害者死亡。若受害者具有施放气法术的能力，它可以花费1聚能点以避免陷入流失（状态）。这只能防护本次攻击，无法防护后续的吸取气尝试。</p>\n<p>受害者的流失（状态）值每周降低1。若该生物将饮食限制为糯米至少1天，并通过成功通过一次@Check[athletics|dc:25]检定，花费10分钟跳舞、慢跑或以其他方式进行剧烈的体能活动，则其流失（状态）降低1。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}, or willing creature is within the jiang-shi's reach</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The jiang-shi drains the victim's life energy, or qi, through their breath. This requires an @Check[athletics|defense:fortitude] check against the victim's Fortitude DC if the victim is grabbed and is automatic for any of the other conditions. The victim is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} and the jiang-shi regains @Damage[13[healing]] HP, gaining any excess as temporary Hit Points. Draining qi from a creature that's already drained doesn't restore any HP to the jiang-shi but increases the victim's drained condition value by 1, killing the victim when it reaches drained 5. If the victim has the ability to cast ki spells, it can spend 1 Focus Point to avoid becoming drained. This protects it only from the current attack, not from subsequent attempts to Drain Qi.</p>\n<p>A victim's drained condition value decreases by 1 every week. If the creature restricts their diet to glutinous rice for at least 1 day and spends 10 minutes dancing, jogging, or otherwise engaging in vigorous physical activity by succeeding at a @Check[athletics|dc:25] check, it reduces its drained condition by 1.</p>"
            },
            "Rigor Mortis": {
              "name": "尸僵 Rigor Mortis",
              "description": "<p>僵尸无视困难地形以及会使其 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地} 的效果。僵尸不能采取 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HYNhdaPtF1QmQbR3]{倒地} 动作。当其进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{跳跃} 时，不会触发通常由移动动作触发的反应动作（），例如借机攻击。</p>\n<p>The jiang-shi ignores difficult terrain and effects that would render them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. A jiang-shi can't take the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.HYNhdaPtF1QmQbR3]{Drop Prone} action. When they @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{Leap} they don't trigger reactions that are normally triggered by move actions, such as Attacks of Opportunity.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>僵尸是来自天夏、可怕的跳跃型吸血鬼。尽管它们与其他吸血鬼相似——它们是不死，会从活人身上汲取生命能量，并且只能用特定方式杀死——但僵尸啖食的是活人的呼吸，也称为气或 ki，而非血液。它们拥有独特的力量，包括能偏转魔法的符纸、惊人的跳跃能力，以及对阳光的免疫；同时僵尸也有独特的弱点，例如无法看见活着的生物（除非通过“呼吸感知”）、对铃与镜子的强烈厌恶，以及近乎令人麻木的忧郁。所幸，大多数僵尸无法制造吸血鬼眷属。</p>\n<p>从噩梦般的沉睡中被粗暴唤醒后，这只地方僵尸在其领地周围的村落与墓地游荡，寻找食粮以缓解饥渴。</p>\n<p>Jiang-shi are terrifying hopping vampires from Tian Xia. Though similar to other vampires—they are undead, drain vital energy from the living, and can be slain only in specific ways—jiang-shi feast upon the breath of the living, also known as qi or ki, instead of blood. While they possess unique powers, including their magic-deflecting paper fulus, extraordinary jumping ability, and immunity to sunlight, jiang-shi also possess unique vulnerabilities, such as the inability to see living creatures save through breathsense, a revulsion to bells and mirrors, and near-stupefying melancholia. Thankfully, most jiang-shi can't create vampiric spawn.</p>\n<p>Roused rudely from their nightmarish slumber, the provincial jiang-shi roams the villages and graveyards around their domain searching for sustenance to slake their hunger.</p>",
          "hp": "fast healing 10, void healing, one more breath",
          "prototypeToken": "行省僵尸 Provincial Jiang-shi",
          "speed": "rigor mortis"
        },
        "Heh Shan-Bao (Level 13)": {
          "name": "和善保（等级13） Heh Shan-Bao (Level 13)",
          "tokenName": "和善保 Heh Shan-Bao",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Phantasmal Calamity (Creates a Flesh-Eating Swarm of Red Nindoru Butterflies)": {
              "name": "魅影灾祸（制造一群食肉的红色灵堕魔蝴蝶群） Phantasmal Calamity (Creates a Flesh-Eating Swarm of Red Nindoru Butterflies)",
              "description": "<p>末日般的毁灭景象充斥区域内每个生物的心智。该景象造成11d6心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。在大失败时，该生物还必须在一次@Check[reflex]豁免中成功，否则就会相信自己被困住了（卡在裂隙中、在海上漂流，或其他与其景象相符的命运）。若其第二次豁免失败，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑（状态）}，持续1分钟。它可以在自己每个回合结束时尝试一次新的意志豁免；若成功，它便识破该幻觉，并从震慑（状态）中恢复。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a @Check[reflex] save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it disbelieves the illusion and recovers from the stunned condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Phantasmal Killer (Image Resembles Kugaptee)": {
              "name": "魅影杀手（图像类似苦迦菩提） Phantasmal Killer (Image Resembles Kugaptee)",
              "description": "<p>你为目标创造一个其所能想象到的最可怕生物的幻象。只有该法术的目标能看见这个杀手，不过你能看见那幻象模糊的轮廓疾驰而出发动攻击。杀手的效果取决于目标的意志豁免结果。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[4d6[mental]] 伤害并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] 伤害并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标害怕到可能会死。它必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] 豁免；若目标失败，则其死亡。若强韧豁免成功，目标受到 @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] 伤害，在其下个回合结束前陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，并陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 4}。此效果具有失能（特征）特征。</p><hr /><p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 在失败时伤害增加 2d6，在大失败时伤害增加 3d6。</p>\n<p>You create a phantasmal image of the most fearsome creature imaginable to the target. Only the spell's target can see the killer, though you can see the vague shape of the illusion as it races forth to attack. The effect of the killer is based on the outcome of the target's Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is so afraid it might die. It must attempt a @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] save; if the target fails, it dies. On a successful Fortitude save, the target takes @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} until the end of its next turn, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}. This effect has the incapacitation trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6 on a failure and by 3d6 on a critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "移位 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你立刻将自己以及你身上穿戴与手持的任何物品，从你当前的空间传送到射程内一处你能看见的未被占据的空间。若这会让另一名生物与你一同到达——即使你正将其装在一个异次元容器中携带——该法术失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程提升至1英里。你不需要能够看见目的地，只要你过去曾到过那里，并且知道其相对于你的位置与距离即可。随后你获得1小时的暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Death Knell": {
              "name": "死亡丧钟 Death Knell",
              "description": "<p>你将一个濒死的生物的生命彻底掐灭。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。若此举杀死了它，你获得10点临时HP，并在10分钟内于攻击与伤害掷骰获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死}数值增加1。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标死亡。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.98XT2QUk6wvXIqf7]{法术效果：死亡丧钟}</p>\n<p>You snuff the life out of a creature on the brink of death. The target must attempt a Will save. If this kills it, you gain 10 temporary HP and a +1 status bonus to attack and damage rolls for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} value increases by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target dies.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.98XT2QUk6wvXIqf7]{Spell Effect: Death Knell}</p>"
            },
            "Shatter": {
              "name": "粉碎音波 Shatter",
              "description": "<p>一次高频率的音波攻击会粉碎音波附近的一个物体。你对该物体造成2d10音波伤害；若该物体的硬度为4或更低，则无视其硬度。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10，且该法术所无视的硬度上限增加2。</p>\n<p>A high-frequency sonic attack shatters a nearby object. You deal 2d10 sonic damage to the object, ignoring the object's Hardness if it is 4 or lower.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10, and the Hardness the spell ignores increases by 2.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个简单声音的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时大喊。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "传讯术 Message",
              "description": "<p>你轻声用口型说出词句，但它们不会从你口中传出，而是直接传到目标的耳中。其他人听到你的话并不会比你正常用口型时更清楚，但目标听到你的话就像他们正站在你身旁一样。目标可以用反应动作给出简短回应，或者如果他们愿意，也可以在其下一回合用自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你并且处于射程内才能这么做。若他们作出回应，其回应会像最初的传讯一样，直接传到你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 该法术的射程增加至500英尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Claws": {
              "name": "幻爪 Illusory Claws"
            },
            "Telepathy 100 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 100 英尺 Telepathy 100 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Universal Language": {
              "name": "通识语言 Universal Language",
              "description": "<p>由“脑之子”说出的任何话语，听者都会以其母语感知到。</p>\n<p>Anything spoken by the brainchild is perceived by the listener in its native language.</p>"
            },
            "Urban Legend": {
              "name": "都市传说 Urban Legend",
              "description": "<p>可被识破的能力包括他对物理伤害的抗力、他的气势凶猛、他打击造成的挥砍伤害，以及他7环的天生法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>脑生子仅由先于他们的名声所维持。无心智生物对脑生子免疫，且无法感知他们。</p>\n<p>脑生子的体型、特征与物品，以及其攻击的外观，会与正在感知他们的敌人所预期的一致。若敌人预期看到不同的事物，脑生子选择要显现哪一种。若任何能感知脑生子的生物相信脑生子拥有下列某项能力，则脑生子便拥有该能力。</p>\n<p>生物可以使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1xRFPTFtWtGJ9ELw]{察言观色}（对抗脑生子的欺瞒DC）来尝试识破某一项单独的能力。若在任何时刻，所有正在感知脑生子的生物都不再相信该能力，脑生子会立刻失去该能力。若敌人预期的细节不同，例如一方相信脑生子免疫火焰而另一方相信其免疫预言系魔法，则脑生子选择其中一种来拥有。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW]{震动感知}</strong>（不精确）100英尺</li>\n<li><strong>免疫</strong> 一种伤害类型、魔法学派或状态</li>\n<li><strong>弱点</strong> 10：一种除心灵以外的伤害类型</li>\n<li><strong>抗力</strong> 10：物理伤害，但对冷铁或银其中之一为例外</li>\n<li><strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu]{气势凶猛}</strong>（光环、情绪、恐惧术、心灵）100英尺，DC 28</li>\n<li><strong>[[/r 1d6]]{1d6} 额外伤害</strong> 于打击上，类型为某个敌人所相信的一种</li>\n<li><strong>额外法术</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R8bqnYiThB6MYTxD]{幻痛术} 与 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IqJ9URobmJ9L9UBG]{暗影爆破}，为6环</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Abilities that can be disbelieved include his resistance to physical damage, his frightful presence, the slashing damage from his Strikes, and his 7th-rank innate spells.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A brainchild is sustained only by the reputation that precedes them. Mindless creatures are immune to a brainchild and can't perceive them.</p>\n<p>The brainchild's size, features, and items, as well as the appearance of their attacks, match what the foes perceiving them expect. If foes expect to see different things, the brainchild chooses which to manifest. If any creature that can perceive the brainchild believes the brainchild has one of the abilities below, the brainchild has that ability.</p>\n<p>A creature can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1xRFPTFtWtGJ9ELw]{Sense Motive} (against the brainchild's Deception DC) to attempt to disbelieve an individual ability. If at any point no creature perceiving the brainchild believes in the ability, the brainchild loses that ability immediately. If foes expect different particulars, such as one believing the brainchild is immune to fire and another believing they're immune to divinations, the brainchild chooses one to have.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW]{Tremorsense}</strong> (imprecise) 100 feet</li>\n<li><strong>Immunity</strong> to one damage type, magic school, or condition</li>\n<li><strong>Weakness</strong> 10 to one damage type other than mental</li>\n<li><strong>Resistance</strong> 10 to physical damage, with an exception for either cold iron or silver</li>\n<li><strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu]{Frightful Presence}</strong> (aura, emotion, fear, mental) 100 feet, DC 28</li>\n<li><strong>[[/r 1d6]]{1d6} Extra Damage</strong> on Strikes, of a type one foe believes in</li>\n<li><strong>Additional Spells</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R8bqnYiThB6MYTxD]{Phantom Pain} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IqJ9URobmJ9L9UBG]{Shadow Blast} at 6th rank</li>\n</ul>"
            },
            "Fear of Flutes": {
              "name": "恐惧长笛 Fear of Flutes",
              "description": "<p>在任意一轮中第一次有人在距离和善保30尺内吹奏长笛时，他必须尝试一次@Check[will|defense:performance]豁免，对抗吹笛者的表演DC。如果吹笛者是（由GM酌情决定）宗教信仰十分虔诚的人，则该DC提高4。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 和善保不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 和善保获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 和善保获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 和善保获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并在其下个回合结束前处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}状态。</p>\n<p>The first time in any round when someone plays a flute within 30 feet of Heh Shan-Bao, he must attempt a @Check[will|defense:performance] save against the flute player's Performance DC. This DC increases by 4 if the flute player is someone (at the GM's discretion) who's strongly religious.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Heh Shan-Bao is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Heh Shan-Bao becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Heh Shan-Bao becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Heh Shan-Bao becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} until the end of his next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Frightful Presence": {
              "name": "气势凶猛 Frightful Presence",
              "description": "<p>100英尺 @Check[will|dc:30]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>\n<p>100 feet @Check[will|dc:30]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"
            },
            "Persistence of Memory": {
              "name": "记忆存留 Persistence of Memory",
              "description": "<p>当一个脑生物被摧毁时，如果仍有人完全相信它存在，它就会回归，并在[[/br 2d4 #Persistance of Memory]]{2d4天}后于任意一名信徒100英尺内重新成形。</p>\n<p>When a brainchild is destroyed, it returns if anyone still fully believes it exists, re-forming within 100 feet of any believer after [[/br 2d4 #Persistance of Memory]]{2d4 days}.</p>"
            },
            "Steal Soul": {
              "name": "窃取灵魂 Steal Soul",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 和善保对一个10级或更低等级的生物施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dLdRqT6UxTKlsPgp]{死亡丧钟}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 如果<em>死亡丧钟</em>杀死了目标，目标的双眼消失，全身脂肪从体内流失，手腕周围显现出焦黑的烙印；与此同时，目标的灵魂被虹吸进入被腐化的柳岸镇思维空间。在被腐化的柳岸镇思维空间被摧毁之前，目标无法通过任何手段被复活，即便是像 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.AuIiqc7jjiy1GZ75]{Manifestation} 这样强大的魔法也不行。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Heh Shan-Bao casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dLdRqT6UxTKlsPgp]{Death Knell} on a 10th-or lower-level creature</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> If the <em>death knell</em> kills the target, the target's eyes vanish, all fat drains from its body, and burnt brands manifest around the wrists as the target's soul is siphoned into the corrupted Willowshore mindscape. The target can't be returned to life through any means, even powerful magic like @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.AuIiqc7jjiy1GZ75]{Manifestation}, until the corrupted Willowshore mindscape is destroyed.</p>"
            },
            "Willowshore Lore": {
              "name": "柳岸镇学识 Willowshore Lore"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "男性变体：脑之子\nMale variant brainchild",
          "prototypeToken": "和善保 Heh Shan-Bao"
        },
