              "name": "镰刀 Sickle"
            },
            "Rock": {
              "name": "岩石 Rock"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Power of the Mob": {
              "name": "暴民之力 Power of the Mob",
              "description": "<p>当三个或更多平民彼此相邻时，每名平民在进行运动检定以[[/act shove]]、攻击掷骰以及伤害掷骰时，获得+1环境加值。</p>\n<p>When three or more commoners are adjacent to each other, each commoner gets a +1 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to [[/act shove]], attack rolls, and damage rolls.</p>"
            },
            "Lore (any one related to their trade)": {
              "name": "学识（任何一个与其行当相关的学识） Lore (any one related to their trade)"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>许多平民过着辛苦劳作的艰难生活，他们工作以确保家人吃饱穿暖，能相对舒适地生活。</p><hr /><p>社会建立在劳动者的肩膀上。</p>\n<p>Many commoners live hard lives of toil as they work to keep their families fed and housed in relative comfort.</p><hr /><p>Society is built upon the backs of laborers.</p>",
          "blurb": "平民\nCommoner",
