        },
        "Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Occult)": {
          "name": "无面鬼模仿者（神秘） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Occult)",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼模仿者（异能） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Occult)",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Paralyze": {
              "name": "麻痹术 Paralyze",
              "description": "<p>你在目标的运动冲动离开其心智之前将其阻断，威胁要将目标冻结在原地。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标陷入麻痹，持续 4 轮。在其每个回合结束时，它可以尝试一次新的意志豁免，使剩余持续时间减少 1 轮，或在大成功或大失败时完全结束该效果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 你最多可以以 10 个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You block the target's motor impulses before they can leave its mind, threatening to freeze the target in place. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Paralyzed for 4 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, it can attempt a new Will save to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, or end it entirely on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Creature": {
              "name": "幻象生物 Illusory Creature",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一个大型或更小体型生物的幻象影像。它会发出相应的声音与气味，且触感足够逼真。若你与该影像之间的距离曾经超过500尺，则该法术结束。</p>\n<p>该影像无法说话，但你可以用你的动作通过该生物说话，且法术会适当地将你的声音伪装成相应的声音。你可能需要进行一次欺瞒或表演检定来模仿该生物，由GM决定。若你试图模仿某个特定人物，并与认识那个人的人互动，这尤其可能发生。</p>\n<p>在战斗中，该幻觉每回合可以使用2个动作，这些动作在你维持该法术时由其使用。它用你的法术攻击调整进行攻击检定，并以你的法术DC作为其AC。它的豁免调整值等于你的法术DC – 10。它足够具有实体感，因此可以与其他生物形成夹击。如果该影像被一次攻击命中或一次豁免失败，则该法术结束。</p>\n<p>该幻觉可以通过让目标相信幻觉的攻击是真实的来造成伤害，但除此之外它无法直接影响物理世界。若该幻象生物以一次打击命中，则目标受到@Damage[3d4[mental]]伤害。该幻觉的打击为非致命。若该伤害与怪物的影像不相符——例如，一个幻象大型巨龙只造成5点伤害——GM可能允许目标立即尝试一次察觉检定来识破该法术。若目标认为相关抗力与弱点适用，则它们生效，由GM裁定。例如，若该幻觉挥舞战锤并攻击一个对钝击伤害具抗力的生物，则该生物会受到更少的心灵伤害。然而，幻象伤害不会使再生失效，也不会触发其他需要特定伤害类型的效果。GM应当记录该幻觉造成的幻象伤害。</p>\n<p>任何接触该影像的生物，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}动作来检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻觉。当一个生物识破该幻觉时，它会从此前受到的该幻觉伤害中恢复一半（若有），并且不再受到其进一步伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 该影像打击的伤害提高1d4，且你能创造的生物最大体型提高一级（最大至超巨型）。</p>\n<p>You create an illusory image of a Large or smaller creature. It generates the appropriate sounds, smells, and feels believable to the touch. If you and the image are ever farther than 500 feet apart, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The image can't speak, but you can use your actions to speak through the creature, with the spell disguising your voice as appropriate. You might need to attempt a Deception or Performance check to mimic the creature, as determined by the GM. This is especially likely if you're trying to imitate a specific person and engage with someone that person knows.</p>\n<p>In combat, the illusion can use 2 actions per turn, which it uses when you Sustain the spell. It uses your spell attack modifier for attack rolls and your spell DC for its AC. Its saving throw modifiers are equal to your spell DC – 10. It is substantial enough that it can flank other creatures. If the image is hit by an attack or fails a save, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The illusion can cause damage by making the target believe the illusion's attacks are real, but it cannot otherwise directly affect the physical world. If the illusory creature hits with a Strike, the target takes @Damage[3d4[mental]] damage. The illusion's Strikes are nonlethal. If the damage doesn't correspond to the image of the monster—for example, if an illusory Large dragon deals only 5 damage—the GM might allow the target to attempt an immediate Perception check to disbelieve the spell. Any relevant resistances and weaknesses apply if the target thinks they do, as judged by the GM. For example, if the illusion wields a warhammer and attacks a creature resistant to bludgeoning damage, the creature would take less mental damage. However, illusory damage does not deactivate regeneration or trigger other effects that require a certain damage type. The GM should track illusory damage dealt by the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. When a creature disbelieves the illusion, it recovers from half the damage it had taken from it (if any) and doesn't take any further damage from it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage of the image's Strikes increases by 1d4, and the maximum size of creature you can create increases by one (to a maximum of Gargantuan).</p>"
            },
            "Paranoia": {
              "name": "偏执狂乱 Paranoia",
              "description": "<p>你使目标将所有其他生物都看作迫在眉睫的威胁。目标对周围所有生物产生强烈的偏执狂乱，并必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标认为它看到的每个人都是潜在威胁。它对所有尚未与其敌对的生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{不友善}，即使那些先前是盟友的生物也是如此。它不将任何人视为盟友。该法术在 1 轮后结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但效果持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标认为它看到的每个人都是死敌。由 GM 决定，它会对所有人使用其反应动作（）和自由动作（），不论对方先前是否为其盟友。除此之外，它仍会像平常一样理性行事，并且很可能更倾向于攻击那些正在攻击或妨碍它的生物，而不是那些不去招惹它的生物。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你最多可以以 5 个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You cause the target to see all other creatures as dire threats. The target is stricken by intense paranoia toward all creatures around it and must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target believes everyone it sees is a potential threat. It becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{Unfriendly} to all creatures to which it wasn't already hostile, even those that were previously allies. It treats no one as an ally. The spell ends after 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect lasts 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the target believes that everyone it sees is a mortal enemy. It uses its reactions and free actions against everyone, regardless of whether they were previously its allies, as determined by the GM. It otherwise acts as rationally as it normally does and likely prefers to attack creatures that are actively attacking or hindering it over those leaving it alone.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 5 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，用心灵冲击将其震慑。这次冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，目标进行一次基础意志豁免。如果目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Dizzying Colors": {
              "name": "眩目幻色 Dizzying Colors",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一股旋舞翻腾的万千色彩，依据生物的意志豁免使其不堪重负。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩} 1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲} 1轮，并目眩1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物陷入震慑1轮，并目盲1分钟。</p>\n<p>You unleash a swirling multitude of colors that overwhelms creatures based on their Will saves.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round, and dazzled for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is stunned for 1 round and blinded for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害但不承受持续伤害，且法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。如果目标从恶心中恢复，持续伤害结束且法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Soothe": {
              "name": "安抚术 Soothe",
              "description": "<p>你抚慰目标的心灵，增强其心灵防御并治疗其伤势。当你施放法术时，目标恢复 1d10+4 生命值，并在持续时间内对抗心灵效果的豁免获得 +2 状态加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.nkk4O5fyzrC0057i]{法术效果：安抚术}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗量增加 1d10+4。</p>\n<p>You grace the target's mind, boosting its mental defenses and healing its wounds. The target regains 1d10+4 Hit Points when you Cast the Spell and gains a +2 status bonus to saves against mental effects for the duration.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.nkk4O5fyzrC0057i]{Spell Effect: Soothe}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 1d10+4.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你朝目标掷出一个在射程内、无人持用且负载为1或更低的松散物体。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若命中，你造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——取决于你掷出的物体。被掷出物品的任何特定特征或魔法属性都不会影响该攻击或伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成全额伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "False Weapon": {
              "name": "虚假武器 False Weapon",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者携带一把<em>+1 强击</em>武器，其外观与其所模仿的PC偏好的武器完全相同。若该PC偏好徒手打击，它看起来就像手部缠带。若该PC偏好远程武器，则无面鬼模仿者没有近战武器，而改为使用以上的远程武器规则；否则，无面鬼模仿者没有远程武器。若PC不偏好任何武器，则无面鬼会挥舞一根木棒作为其虚假武器。此虚假武器只有部分真实，命中时只造成心灵伤害；它不会获得原本武器的任何特征或魔法强化。若无面鬼模仿者的虚假武器处于破损状态、被解除武装或被放下，它会逐渐消散。无面鬼模仿者可以花费10分钟重新制作一把替代的虚假武器。</p>\n<p>A noppera-bo impersonator carries a <em>+1 striking</em> weapon that looks identical to the favored weapon of the PC being impersonated. If the PC favors unarmed strikes, it appears as hand wraps. If the PC favors a ranged weapon, then the noppera-bo impersonator has no melee weapon and instead uses the ranged weapon rules above; otherwise, the noppera-bo impersonator has no ranged weapon. If the PCs favors no weapon, then the noppera-bo wields a club as its false weapon. This false weapon is only partially real and inflicts only mental damage when it hits; it gains none of the original weapon's traits or magical enhancements. If a noppera-bo impersonator's false weapon is broken, disarmed, or set down, it fades away. The noppera-bo impersonator can craft a replacement false weapon by spending 10 minutes to recreate one.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30英尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉，但听觉十分敏锐。他们不需要呼吸，并且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。他们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上会把手或无面的头浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；他们也可以用这种方式从消耗品（如药水或灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo has no sense of vision, but their hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}状态，它们就会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>As long as the noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonated Spellcasting": {
              "name": "模仿者施法 Impersonated Spellcasting",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者获得一组天生法术，其施法根源与其所模仿的PC所使用的施法根源一致。你可以调整这些法术，使其更贴合这次模仿。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo impersonator gains a suites of innate spells, matching the spellcasting tradition utilized by the PC being impersonated. You can adjust the spells to make a more perfect fit for the impersonation.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼模仿者（神秘） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Occult)"
        },
        "Yu Er’s Parents Thanks": {
          "name": "余儿的父母致谢 Yu Er’s Parents Thanks",
          "tokenName": "玉儿的父母致谢 Yu Er’s Parents Thanks",
          "items": {
            "Boots of Bounding": {
              "name": "跳跃之靴 Boots of Bounding",
              "description": "<p>这双结实的皮靴配有富有弹性的鞋底，为你的双脚提供缓冲，让每一步都更轻盈。这双靴子使你的速度获得+5英尺的物品加值，并使你为进行跳高与跳远而进行的运动检定获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>此外，当你使用腾跃动作时，如果是水平跳跃，你可以额外移动5英尺；如果是垂直跳跃，你可以跳得高3英尺。</p>\n<p>The springy soles of these sturdy leather boots cushion your feet and make each step lighter. These boots give you a +5-foot item bonus to your Speed and a +2 item bonus to Athletics checks to High Jump and Long Jump.</p>\n<p>In addition, when you use the Leap action, you can move 5 feet further if jumping horizontally or 3 feet higher if jumping vertically.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "玉儿的父母致谢 Yu Er’s Parents Thanks"
        },
        "Animated Cookware Swarm": {
          "name": "活化厨具虫群 Animated Cookware Swarm",
          "tokenName": "活化厨具虫群 Animated Cookware Swarm",
          "items": {
            "Construct Armor (Hardness 3)": {
              "name": "构装护甲（硬度 3） Construct Armor (Hardness 3)",
              "description": "<p>与普通物体一样，活化银器群具有硬度。该硬度会使群体受到的任何伤害减少一个等同于硬度的数值。一旦活化银器群的生命值降至其一半以下，或在被一次重击伤害后立刻，其构装护甲便会破损，移除硬度并将其护甲等级降至12。</p>\n<p>Like normal objects, an animated silverware swarm has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the swarm takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once an animated silverware swarm is reduced to fewer than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, its construct armor breaks, removing the Hardness and reducing its Armor Class to 12.</p>"
            },
            "Slice and Pound": {
              "name": "切砍与重击 Slice and Pound",
              "description": "<p>活动厨具虫群空间内的每个敌人受到1d6点@Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]]{钝击}或@Damage[1d6[slashing]]{挥砍}伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the animated cookware swarm's space takes 1d6 points of @Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]]{bludgeoning} or @Damage[1d6[slashing]]{slashing} damage (@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] save).</p>"
            },
            "Stick a Fork in It": {
              "name": "把叉子插进去 Stick a Fork in It",
              "description": "<p>活化银器群试图钉住单个生物。</p>\n<p>目标必须尝试一次 @Check[reflex|dc:17] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 银器将目标衣物与道具的部分钉住。只要目标仍处于该群的空间内，目标的速度承受 –10 尺环境减值。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，并且目标在离开该群的空间前也无法跨步。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标被银器彻底钉住，变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}，直到其 [[/act escape dc=17]]{逃脱} 或使用 2 个交互动作移除所有将其钉住的银器为止。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.K3r1lfbtCTf3dFhV]{效果：把叉子插上去}</p>\n<p>The animated silverware swarm attempts to pin a single creature.</p>\n<p>The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:17] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Silverware pins portions of the target's clothing and gear. The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds as long as it remains in the swarm's space.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, and the target also can't Step until it leaves the swarm's space.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is thoroughly pinned by the silverware, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} until it [[/act escape dc=17]]{Escapes} or uses 2 Interact actions to remove all of the silverware pinning them down.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.K3r1lfbtCTf3dFhV]{Effect: Stick a Fork in It}</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>众所周知，贵族会花大价钱让他们的银餐具动起来，既便于清洁，也能在晚宴上充当新奇玩意。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>许多活化物体都具备实用功能，但在失控时会变得危险。</p>\n<p>Nobles are known to pay great amounts to animate their silverware, both for ease in cleaning and to serve as novelties during dinner parties.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Many animated objects have useful functions but become dangers when uncontrolled.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体活化银器群\nVariant animated silverware swarm",
          "ac": "(12 when broken); construct armor",
          "prototypeToken": "活化炊具虫群 Animated Cookware Swarm"
        },
        "Noodles": {
          "name": "面条 Noodles",
          "tokenName": "面条 Noodles",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Lithe": {
              "name": "轻盈 Lithe",
              "description": "<p>黄鼠狼将任何它的头刚好能勉强伸入或更宽的狭窄空间视为困难地形，并且不需要进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt]{挤过} 就能通过其中移动。</p>\n<p>A weasel treats any tight space it can barely fit its head in or wider as difficult terrain and doesn't need to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt]{Squeeze} to move through it.</p>"
            },
            "Constrict": {
              "name": "缠勒 Constrict",
              "description": "<p>@Damage[1d4[穿刺]], @Check[强韧|dc:15|基础]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>\n<p>@Damage[1d4[piercing]], @Check[fortitude|dc:15|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>尽管身形矮小，黄鼠狼却是技艺高超的猎手。它们在追逐食物时几乎无所畏惧，经常猎杀体型达到自身五倍的生物。它们偏爱的战术是咬住受害者的后颈，用颌部持续勒紧，直到目标死亡。为了让自己始终吃得饱，黄鼠狼会猎杀超过所需数量的生物，并把受害者塞进中空的原木或空巢穴里，留待日后食用。</p>\n<p>学者们观察到，无论在野外还是在圈养环境中，黄鼠狼都会在猎物面前表现出一种怪异的行为。它们会难以预测地来回乱窜，扑倒在地，在洞穴之间钻进钻出，并且总体上看起来完全不合常理。作为回应，猎物会变得困惑，或仿佛被催眠一般，这就给了黄鼠狼一个机会，猛冲上前，给予致命一击。</p>\n<p>一只典型的黄鼠狼体长12英寸，体重不到一磅。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>黄鼠狼是身形灵巧、头脑聪明的掠食者，以其美丽、光滑的皮毛以及钻入狭窄空间的能力而闻名。按体重比例计算，几乎没有多少动物能像黄鼠狼一样贪食。它们饥肠辘辘、永不满足，几乎每天要吃下接近自身体重一半的食物，因此不得不不断寻找新的猎物来填饱肚子。</p>\n<p>Despite their small stature, weasels are skilled hunters. Nearly fearless in pursuit of food, they frequently kill creatures up to five times their own size. Their preferred tactic is to latch onto the back of their victim's neck and constrict with their jaws until the target dies. To keep themselves well fed, weasels kill more creatures than they need and stuff their victims into hollow logs or empty dens to eat later.</p>\n<p>Scholars have observed weasels, both in the wild and captivity, perform a bizarre behavior in front of their prey. They rush about unpredictably, throw themselves to the ground, wriggle into and out of burrows, and generally appear to behave entirely irrationally. In response, their prey becomes confused or seemingly hypnotized, which gives the weasel an opportunity to dash forward and strike a killing blow.</p>\n<p>A typical weasel is 12 inches long and weighs less than a pound.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Weasels are lithe, clever predators known for both their beautiful, sleek fur and their ability to crawl into tight spaces. Pound for pound, few animals are as voracious as weasels. Insatiably hungry, they eat almost half their own weight each day, leading them to constantly hunt for new prey to satisfy their hunger.</p>",
          "blurb": "黄鼠狼\nWeasel",
          "prototypeToken": "面条 Noodles"
        },
        "Midori": {
          "name": "青 Midori",
          "tokenName": "青 Midori",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Prestidigitation": {
              "name": "魔法伎俩 Prestidigitation",
              "description": "<p>最简单的魔法会听从你的命令。只要你维持该法术，你就可以施展简单的魔法效果。每次你维持该法术时，你可以从四个选项中选择一个。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>烹饪</strong> 使1磅非生物材料变凉、变暖或调味。</li>\n<li><strong>提起</strong> 缓慢将一件无人看管、负载为轻或更低的物体抬离地面1英尺。</li>\n<li><strong>制造</strong> 创造一个临时的、负载可忽略不计的物体，由凝结的魔法物质构成。该物体看起来粗糙而人造，并且极其脆弱——它不能被用作工具、武器或法器，也不能作为施放法术的花费。</li>\n<li><strong>整理</strong> 为一件负载为轻或更低的物体上色、清洁或弄脏。你可以用10轮的专注影响一件负载为1的物体，而影响更大的物体则需要每负载1分钟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>魔法伎俩</em>不能造成伤害或导致不利状态。对物体造成的任何实际改变（超出上述注明的部分）只会在你维持该法术期间持续。</p>\n<p>The simplest magic does your bidding. You can perform simple magical effects for as long as you Sustain the spell. Each time you Sustain the spell, you can choose one of four options.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cook</strong> Cool, warm, or flavor 1 pound of nonliving material.</li>\n<li><strong>Lift</strong> Slowly lift an unattended object of light Bulk or less 1 foot off the ground.</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> Create a temporary object of negligible Bulk, made of congealed magical substance. The object looks crude and artificial and is extremely fragile-it can't be used as a tool, weapon, or locus or cost for a spell.</li>\n<li><strong>Tidy</strong> Color, clean, or soil an object of light Bulk or less. You can affect an object of 1 Bulk with 10 rounds of concentration, and a larger object a 1 minute per Bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Prestidigitation</em> can't deal damage or cause adverse conditions. Any actual change to an object (beyond what is noted above) persists only as long as you Sustain the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Shortsword": {
              "name": "短剑 Shortsword"
            },
            "Sneak Attack": {
              "name": "偷袭 Sneak Attack",
              "description": "<p>精灵鼠对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}的生物造成额外1d6点精准伤害。</p>\n<p>The jinkin deals 1d6 extra precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Tinker": {
              "name": "修补匠 Tinker",
              "description": "<p>一群六只金金怪可以协同工作1小时，在60尺射程内为一件物品注入诅咒。虽然这个过程很漫长，但也不引人注意，并且可以在@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hiding}期间进行。金金怪更喜欢用这种能力对魔法物品下手。该诅咒会使该物品变得不可靠（进行一次@Check[flat|dc:5]检定，否则浪费任何用于交互或启动该物品的动作），为使用该物品增添一个怪诞的要求，或施加其他强度相近的诅咒。</p>\n<p>A group of six jinkins can work together for an hour to imbue an item with a curse at a range of 60 feet. While this process is lengthy, it's also unobtrusive and can be performed while @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hiding}. Jinkins prefer to use this ability on magic items. The curse makes the item unreliable (@Check[flat|dc:5] check or waste any action to Interact with or Activate the item), adds a bizarre requirement to use the item, or imparts some other curse of a similar caliber.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>金金斯是一群施虐成性的修补匠，会偷窃并破坏物品，并为自己能诅咒珍贵物体的力量而深感自豪。它们心怀怨念，一旦觉得受了轻慢——比如某个生物胆敢移除它们的一道诅咒——就会制定曲折复杂的复仇计划。金金斯很少满足于制造简单的混乱；它们也从折磨与谋杀中获得极大的快感，不过它们更偏好把受害者引入为捕获或使其失能而设计的陷阱，而不是当场直接杀死。深坑是它们偏爱的手段，因为那些坠落后仍活着的受害者将面临因饥饿和口渴而来的缓慢死亡，而金金斯则会聚集在坑边戏弄并折磨他们。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>小魔怪（特征）是残忍的妖精恶作剧者与破坏者，已完全适应了宇宙中的生活，并为其充满创造性的毁灭欲找到了各自明确的生态位。几乎所有小魔怪（特征）都以毁坏或弄坏事物为乐，不论那是装置或载具之类的有形之物，还是同盟或关系之类的无形之物。小魔怪（特征）最大的乐趣，是看着复杂造物崩溃瓦解，最好是在它们施加了最轻微、却精心瞄准的一推之后。小魔怪（特征）往往会贬低、欺凌，甚至屠杀它们较弱的同族，尤其是密特弗利特；更强大的小魔怪（特征）轻蔑地称它们为“袋子”。</p>\n<p>Jinkins are sadistic tinkers who steal and sabotage items and take great pride in their power to curse precious objects. They hold grudges and create convoluted plans for revenge when they feel slighted, such as when a creature dares to remove one of their curses. Rarely content to wreak simple mayhem, jinkins also take immense pleasure in torture and murder, though they prefer to lead victims into traps designed to capture or incapacitate rather than just kill them outright. Deep pits are a preferred method, since victims who survive their fall face a slow death from starvation and thirst while jinkins gather at the edge of pits to tease and torment them.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Gremlins are cruel fey tricksters and saboteurs who have fully acclimated to life in the Universe, finding distinct niches for their inventive destructiveness. Nearly all gremlins delight in ruining or breaking things, whether it's something physical like a device or vehicle or something intangible such as an alliance or relationship. A gremlin's greatest joy is watching the collapse of complex creations, preferably after the slightest, carefully targeted nudge from the gremlin. Gremlins tend to denigrate, bully, or even slaughter their lesser kin, particularly mitflits, whom stronger gremlins derisively call \"baggies.\"</p>",
          "blurb": "雌性蹑影小魔怪\nFemale jinkin gremlin",
          "prototypeToken": "青 Midori"
        },
        "Shinzo": {
          "name": "神藏 Shinzo",
          "tokenName": "神藏 Shinzo",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Bind Soul": {
              "name": "缚魂术 Bind Soul",
              "description": "<p>你在目标的灵魂来得及前往来世之前将其硬生生扯离，并将其囚禁于一颗黑色蓝宝石中。当灵魂被困在宝石里时，目标无法通过任何手段复活，即便是如祈愿术这般强大的魔法也不行。若宝石被摧毁，或宝石上的缚魂术被反制，灵魂便会获释。宝石的 AC 为 16，硬度为 10。一颗宝石无法容纳超过一个灵魂，任何尝试都会浪费该法术。</p>\n<p>You wrench the target's soul away before it can pass on to the afterlife and imprison it in a black sapphire. While the soul is in the gem, the target can't be returned to life through any means, even powerful magic such as wish. If the gem is destroyed or bind soul is counteracted on the gem, the soul is freed. The gem has AC 16 and Hardness 10. A gem can't hold more than one soul, and any attempt wastes the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Finger of Death": {
              "name": "死亡一指 Finger of Death",
              "description": "<p>你将手指指向目标，并说出一句杀戮之词。你对目标造成70点虚空伤害。如果来自<em>死亡一指</em>的伤害将目标降至0生命值，目标会立即死亡。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加10点。</p>\n<p>You point your finger toward the target and speak a word of slaying. You deal 70 void damage to the target. If the damage from <em>finger of death</em> reduces the target to 0 Hit Points, the target dies instantly.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 10.</p>"
            },
            "Plane Shift": {
              "name": "异界传送 Plane Shift",
              "description": "<p>你和你的盟友穿越存在位面的屏障。目标移动到另一个位面，例如火元素位面、冥界或外层裂隙。你必须对目的地位面有特定的了解，并使用一把由该位面的材料制作的魔法调谐音叉作为法术的法器。大多数著名位面的调谐音叉都很少见，正如法术异界传送一样；而更晦涩的位面与半位面往往有稀有的调谐音叉。该法术极其不精确，你会出现在距离某个目标（由你选择）上一次前往该位面时所在的最后地点1d20x25英里处。如果对所有目标而言这是第一次前往某个位面，你会出现在该位面的随机地点。异界传送不提供返程旅行的手段，不过再次施放异界传送能让你回到先前的位面，除非存在特殊情况。</p>\n<p>You and your allies traverse the barriers between planes of existence. The targets move to another plane, such as the Plane of Fire, the Netherworld, or the Outer Rifts. You must have specific knowledge of the destination plane and use a magic tuning fork created from material from that plane as a focus for the spell. While the tuning forks for most prominent planes are uncommon, just like the spell plane shift, more obscure planes and demiplanes often have rare tuning forks. The spell is highly imprecise, and you appear 1d20x25 miles from the last place one of the targets (of your choice) was located the last time that target traveled to the plane. If it's the first time traveling to a particular plane for all targets, you appear at a random location on the plane. Plane shift doesn't provide a means of return travel, though casting plane shift again allows you to return to your previous plane unless there are extenuating circumstances.</p>"
            },
            "Scrying": {
              "name": "探知 Scrying",
              "description": "<p>你以魔法窥视你所选择的一名生物。探知的运作方式与 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.zvKWclOZ7A53DObE]{Clairvoyance} 相同，但你所接收到的影像较不精确，不足以用于传送及类似法术。你不再是在500尺内的某个固定位置创造一只眼睛，而是创造一只显现于目标正上方的眼睛。你可以通过名字选择一个目标，或触碰其某件随身物品或其身体的一部分来选择目标。若你未曾亲自见过目标，探知的DC降低2；若你不知道目标的身份（例如你在犯罪现场发现了某个未知生物的獠牙），则DC改为降低10。探知的效果取决于目标的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该法术失败，且目标在1周内暂时免疫。目标也会瞥见你，并得知你与它之间的大致距离与方向。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该法术失败，且目标在1天内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该法术成功。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该法术成功，且若目标移动，这只眼睛会跟随目标，每轮最多移动60尺。</p>\n<p>You magically spy on a creature of your choice. Scrying works like @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.zvKWclOZ7A53DObE]{Clairvoyance}, except that the image you receive is less precise, insufficient for teleport and similar spells. Instead of creating an eye in a set location within 500 feet, you instead create an eye that manifests just above the target. You can choose a target either by name or by touching one of its possessions or a piece of its body. If you haven't met the target in person, scrying's DC is 2 lower, and if you are unaware of the target's identity (perhaps because you found an unknown creature's fang at a crime scene), the DC is instead 10 lower. The effect of scrying depends on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The spell fails and the target is temporarily immune for 1 week. The target also gains a glimpse of you and learns its rough distance and direction from you.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The spell fails and the target is temporarily immune for 1 day.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The spell succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The spell succeeds, and the eye follows the target if it moves, traveling up to 60 feet per round.</p>"
            },
            "True Seeing (Constant)": {
              "name": "真视术（恒定） True Seeing (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你能如其真实面貌般看见60英尺内的事物。GM会对区域内的任何幻术或变化效果进行一次秘密的反制检定，但仅用于判定你是否能看穿它（例如，若该检定成功对抗一个变形法术，你就能看见该生物的真实形态，但你不会终止该变形法术）。</p>\n<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion or transmutation in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>"
            },
            "Truespeech (Constant)": {
              "name": "真言（恒常） Truespeech (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>目标可以理解所有词语，无论其使用何种语言，并且还能说出其他生物的语言。当处于由不同生物组成的混合群体中时，每当目标开口说话，它都可以选择一个生物，并用该生物能理解的语言与之交谈，即使目标并不知道那是什么语言。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Enervation": {
              "name": "弱能术 Enervation",
              "description": "<p>伸出一根手指，你发射一道虚无能量光束，削弱其触及的任何生物的生命力。直线范围内的每个活着的生物都必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 成功时，持续性虚无伤害增加 1d8；失败或大失败时，持续性虚无伤害增加 2d8。</p>\n<p>Extending a finger, you fire a beam of void energy that weakens the life force of any creature it touches. Each living creature in the line must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The persistent void damage increases by 1d8 on a success, or by 2d8 on a failure or critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Alignment (Constant)": {
              "name": "侦测阵营（持续） Detect Alignment (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你的双眼发光，你感知到阵营灵光。选择混乱、邪恶、善良或守序。你侦测该阵营的灵光。除是否存在之外，你不获得更多信息。你可以选择不侦测你已知具有该阵营的生物或效果。</p>\n<p>只有6级或更高的生物——除非是神术施法者、不死或来自外环的存在——才有阵营灵光。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（2环）</strong> 你获知每个灵光的位置与强度。</p>\n<p>Your eyes glow as you sense aligned auras. Choose chaotic, evil, good, or lawful. You detect auras of that alignment. You receive no information beyond presence or absence. You can choose not to detect creatures or effects you're aware have that alignment.</p>\n<p>Only creatures of 6th level or higher-unless divine spellcasters, undead, or beings from the Outer Sphere-have alignment auras.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You learn each aura's location and strength.</p>"
            },
            "Naginata": {
              "name": "薙刀 Naginata"
            },
            "Pouch of Four Gems": {
              "name": "四玉袋 Pouch of Four Gems",
              "description": "<p>每个死神都携带一个小袋，里面装着四颗黑色蓝宝石，用于配合 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GYmXvS9NJ7QwfWGg]{Seize Soul}。每颗宝石都能够容纳一个最高等级等同于该死神的灵魂。若死神死亡，这些宝石也会随之被毁，且其中所包含的任何灵魂都会被无害地释放，前往骨园。</p>\n<p>Each shinigami carries a pouch containing four black sapphires for use with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GYmXvS9NJ7QwfWGg]{Seize Soul}. Each gem is capable of holding a soul of a maximum level equal to that of the shinigami. If the shinigami dies, the gems are destroyed as well, and any souls they contain are released harmlessly to travel to the Boneyard.</p>"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "恒定法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "+1 Status to All Saves vs. Magic": {
              "name": "对抗魔法的所有豁免获得+1状态加值 +1 Status to All Saves vs. Magic"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>死神呈现为某个特定的小型或中型类人生物的外貌。这不会改变其数据，除了会从其打击中移除触及特征。死神的人类形态为该死神所独有，不能用于乔装某个生物。</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>The shinigami takes on the appearance of a specific Small or Medium humanoid creature. This doesn't change their statistics, other than to remove the reach trait from their Strikes. The shinigami's human shape is unique to the shinigami and can't be used to Impersonate a creature.</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Release Soul": {
              "name": "释放灵魂 Release Soul",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 死神袋中的一颗宝石内含有来自缚魂术的灵魂</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 死神捏碎宝石，将灵魂送往骨园，同时释放一波死灵能量。所有位于 @Template[emanation|distance:30] 内的生物受到 @Damage[18d6[untyped]|options:area-damage] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:38|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:drained,inflicts:sickened] 豁免）；死神选择此伤害为活力伤害或虚无伤害。因该效果受到伤害且豁免检定失败的生物还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2} 与 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{枯竭 1}（若为大失败，则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 4} 与 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{枯竭 2}）。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> One of the gems in the shinigami's pouch contains a soul from bind soul</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The shinigami crushes the gem, sending the soul to the Boneyard while releasing a wave of necromantic energy. All creatures within a @Template[emanation|distance:30] take @Damage[18d6[untyped]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:38|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:drained,inflicts:sickened] save); the shinigami chooses whether this damage is vitality damage or void damage. A creature who takes damage from this effect and fails the saving throw is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 4} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Touch": {
              "name": "精魂接触 Spirit Touch",
              "description": "<p>死神的打击可以影响虚体生物，如同具有<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}</em>属性符文的效果。</p>\n<p>A shinigami's Strikes can affect incorporeal creatures with the effect of a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}</em> property rune.</p>"
            },
            "Boneyard Lore": {
              "name": "骨园学识 Boneyard Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>即便是神灵这样的不朽者，也无法免于死亡。当一位神灵或同等强大的存在拒绝骨园的召唤时，便会召来一位死神，将这些顽固的转世的灵魂制服。死神精准而迅捷，以高效且冷然无私的方式执行死亡的裁决而闻名。</p>\n<h2>循环的守护者</h2>\n<p>死神负责调查并处理那些扰乱生命自然流动的大范围现象。他们可能被指派去解决问题，也可能被要求等待、观察，并提供最低限度的协助。尽管大多数死神能在如此漫长的守望中保持公正无偏，但也有些死神远非无情无感，最终会在怜悯或残酷之间动摇。</p>\n<p>Even immortals such as kami aren't immune to death. When a kami or equally powerful entity refuses the call of the Boneyard, a shinigami is summoned to bring these stubborn souls to heel. Exact and swift, shinigami are known to dispense the judgment of death efficiently and dispassionately.</p>\n<h2>Guardians Of The Cycle</h2>\n<p>Shinigami are responsible for investigating and dealing with widespread phenomena that disrupt the natural flow of life. They might be tasked with solving the issue or be told to wait, observe, and provide minimal assistance. While most shinigami can retain their impartiality during such long vigils, some are far from emotionless and end up wavering toward mercy or cruelty.</p>",
          "blurb": "男性死神\nMale Shinigami",
          "hp": "fast healing 40",
          "allSaves": "+1 status to all saves vs. magic",
          "prototypeToken": "神藏 Shinzo"
        },
        "Kugaptee's Tree": {
          "name": "苦迦菩提之树 Kugaptee's Tree",
          "tokenName": "苦迦菩提之树 Kugaptee's Tree",
          "items": {
            "Pulse of Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧脉冲 Pulse of Fear",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名闯入修道院者在区域 <strong>E3</strong> 开始其回合</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 石像猛然苏醒，枝条抽打着空气，伴随一声骇人的咆哮贯穿整座修道院——那咆哮似乎来自地下。修道院内的所有闯入者都必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:21] 意志豁免。随后，此作祟掷骰先攻。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物惊惧 2，并在其仍处于惊惧状态期间获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An intruder to the monastery begins their turn in area <strong>E3</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The stone statue lurches to life, its branches whipping through the air as a horrifying roar rips through the monastery—a roar that seems to come from underground. All intruders within the monastery must attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save. The haunt then rolls initiative.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it remains frightened.</p>"
            },
            "Branch": {
              "name": "分支 Branch"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[religion|dc:25] 以驱除作祟，或 @Check[intimidation|dc:28] 以显得身心都强大到令人难以抗拒</p>\n<p>@Check[religion|dc:25] to exorcise the haunt, or @Check[intimidation|dc:28] to appear overwhelmingly strong of body and mind</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>石树雕像的枝条活化，延展并抽打闯入者。</p>\n<p>The branches of the stone tree statue animate, extend, and lash out at intruders.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>1小时</p>\n<p>1 hour</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（3 动作）苦迦菩提的树用枝条猛抽而出，花费其 3 个动作对触及范围内的任意生物尝试进行枝条打击。处于触及范围内但位于 <strong>E3</strong> 区域之外的目标，会因周围的拱门而获得掩蔽。该作祟偏好以 <strong>E3</strong> 区域内的目标为目标，但除此之外会随机选择其目标。</p>\n<p>(3 actions) Kugaptee's tree lashes out with its branches, using its three actions to attempt branch Strikes against any creature in reach. Targets that are within reach but are outside of area <strong>E3</strong> have cover from the surrounding archways. The haunt favors targets in area <strong>E3</strong> but otherwise selects its targets randomly.</p>",
