            "Construct Armor": {
              "name": "构装护甲 Construct Armor",
              "description": "<p>与普通物体一样，活化手斧具有硬度。该硬度会使手斧所受的任何伤害减少等同于硬度的数值。一旦活化手斧的生命值降至不足其一半，或在被一次重击造成伤害时立即，其构装护甲就会破裂，且其护甲等级降至19。</p>\n<p>Like normal objects, an animated hatchet has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the hatchet takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once an animated hatchet is reduced to fewer than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, its construct armor breaks, and its Armor Class is reduced to 19.</p>"
