        "Second Home": {
          "name": "第二个家 Second Home",
          "tokenName": "第二家园 Second Home",
          "items": {
            "Predictable Silver Piece": {
              "name": "可预见的银币 Predictable Silver Piece",
              "description": "<p>这枚看似不起眼、饱经风霜的银币，正面刻着一位无名君主的半身像，背面则是一只威严的鸟。你可以在不启动它的情况下抛掷硬币，此时它遵循正常的概率规律。</p>\n<p><strong>启动—欺瞒命运</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你以稍微拨弄命运之线的意图，用拇指在硬币的一侧摩挲，然后将硬币抛向空中进行一次掷硬币。无论你如何结束这次抛掷——让硬币落到地上、把它拍在手背上，或用张开的掌心接住——它总会以你摩挲过的那一面朝上落下。</p>\n<p>This seemingly unremarkable, weathered silver coin bears the bust of an unnamed monarch on the face and a majestic bird on the tail. You can toss the coin without activating it, in which case it follows the normal laws of probability.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Cheat Fate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You rub your thumb on one side of the coin with the intent of slightly tweaking the strands of fate, then flip the coin into the air in a coin toss. No matter how the toss is resolved- letting the coin fall to the ground, slapping it down on the back of your hand, or catching it on your open palm-it always lands with the side you rubbed face up.</p>"
            },
            "Oil of Potency": {
              "name": "潜能油 Oil of Potency",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>当你将这种浓稠、黏滑的油涂抹在一把武器或一套护甲上时，该物品立刻变得具有魔法潜能。若该物品是武器，则其暂时成为一把<em>+1 强击武器</em>；若该物品是护甲，则其暂时成为一套<em>+1 韧性护甲</em>。此效果持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{效果：潜能油}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>When you apply this thick, viscous oil to a weapon or suit of armor, that item immediately becomes magically potent. If the item is a weapon, it temporarily becomes a <em>+1 striking weapon</em>, or, if it's armor, it temporarily becomes <em>+1 resilient armor</em>. This lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{Effect: Oil of Potency}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "第二个家 Second Home"
        },
        "Lady Ren's Dust": {
          "name": "任女士的尘土 Lady Ren's Dust",
          "tokenName": "任女士之尘 Lady Ren's Dust",
          "items": {
            "Dust of Corpse Animation": {
              "name": "尸体活化粉尘 Dust of Corpse Animation",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>这个黑色小袋中装着看似细腻的骨粉。将骨粉以特定图案洒在一具尸体上，会将其转化为一名不死生物。所创造的不死类型取决于尸体的状态，结果会成为<em>骷髅</em>或<em>丧尸</em>。如果该不死生物的等级会高于3，骨粉就无法将其唤起。尸体的体型与种类必须适合你想要创造的不死生物——例如，你必须把骨粉洒在马的骨架上，才能唤起一匹<em>骷髅马</em>。如果在该等级范围内有不止一种合适的不死生物，例如对一具中型类人生物骨架而言可以是<em>骷髅卫士</em>或<em>骷髅勇士</em>，则由你选择。</p>\n<p>被唤起的不死拥有<em>仆从</em>特征，这意味着当你命令它时，它可以使用2个动作。你可以将对当前回合的命令作为启动的一部分下达。该不死生物会保持被唤起状态1分钟，之后坍塌回其尸体形态。与往常一样，你最多可以同时控制四个仆从。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>This black pouch contains what appears to be fine bone dust. Pouring the dust in a special pattern over a corpse turns it into an undead creature. The type of undead created depends on the condition of the corpse, resulting in either a <em>skeleton</em> or a <em>zombie</em>. If the undead's level would be greater than 3, the dust fails to animate it. The body must be of an appropriate size and type for the undead you wish to create-for example, you must sprinkle the dust on a horse's skeleton to animate a <em>skeletal horse</em>. If more than one undead in the level range is appropriate, such as <em>skeletal guard</em> or <em>skeletal champion</em> for a Medium humanoid skeleton, you choose.</p>\n<p>The animated undead has the <em>minion</em> trait, meaning it can use 2 actions when you Command it. You can issue a Command for the current turn as part of the activation. The undead creature remains animated for 1 minute before collapsing back into its corpse form. As usual, you can have a maximum of four minions under your control.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "任夫人的尘土 Lady Ren's Dust"
        },
        "Kugaptee's Blessing": {
          "name": "苦迦菩提的祝福 Kugaptee's Blessing",
          "tokenName": "苦迦菩提的祝福 Kugaptee's Blessing",
          "items": {
            "Slowed": {
              "name": "缓慢 Slowed",
              "description": "<p>你拥有更少的动作。缓慢总是包含一个数值。当你在自己回合开始时恢复动作时，将你恢复的动作数量减少等同于你的缓慢数值。由于缓慢在你回合开始时生效，如果你在自己的回合中变为缓慢，你不会立刻失去动作。</p>\n<p>You have fewer actions. Slowed always includes a value. When you regain your actions at the start of your turn, reduce the number of actions you regain by your slowed value. Because slowed has its effect at the start of your turn, you don't immediately lose actions if you become slowed during your turn.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Slow": {
              "name": "缓慢术 Slow",
              "description": "<p>丧尸永久处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1} 状态，且不能使用反应动作。</p>\n<p>A zombie is permanently @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} and can't use reactions.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Improved Push 5 feet": {
              "name": "强化推动 5 尺 Improved Push 5 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedPush]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>死灵法术的强化使这具丧尸的体型与力量得到了提升。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>丧尸唯一的欲望就是吞噬活物。它们毫无思考、永不停歇地蹒跚前行，是死亡的先兆；丧尸只会在被摧毁时才会停下。</p>\n<p>Necromantic augmentations have granted this zombie increased size and power.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A zombie's only desire is to consume the living. Unthinking and ever-shambling harbingers of death, zombies stop only when they're destroyed.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "苦迦菩提的祝福 Kugaptee's Blessing"
