            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>一具丧尸蹒跚者是行动缓慢的恐怖存在，在大规模群体中更为危险。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>丧尸唯一的渴望就是吞食活人。丧尸是不知思考、永远蹒跚前行的死亡预兆，唯有在被摧毁时才会停下。</p>\n<p>A zombie shambler is a slow-moving horror dangerous in larger groups.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A zombie's only desire is to consume the living. Unthinking and ever-shambling harbingers of death, zombies stop only when they're destroyed.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "蹒跚丧尸 Zombie Shambler"
        },
        "War Horse": {
          "name": "战马 War Horse",
          "tokenName": "战马 War Horse",
          "items": {
            "Hoof": {
              "name": "蹄子 Hoof"
            },
            "Buck": {
              "name": "鹿雄 Buck",
              "description": "<p>@Check[reflex|dc:17]</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Buck]</p>\n<p>@Check[reflex|dc:17]</p>\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Buck]</p>"
