            "Gallop": {
              "name": "疾驰 Gallop",
              "description": "<p>战马行走两次。在这些行走期间，它的速度获得+10英尺的环境加值。</p>\n<p>The war horse Strides twice. It has a +10-foot circumstance bonus to its Speed during these Strides.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>马在许多社会中既可用作坐骑，也可充当役畜。它们忠诚且通常温顺，对于需要长途旅行的人来说不可或缺。体型较小的族群，如侏儒与半身人，常以矮种马作为坐骑；而人类与其他中型类人生物则更偏爱马作为坐骑。普通类人生物在日常所遭遇到的大多数马都是驯化的，不过在野外也能找到规模庞大的马群。</p>\n<p>Horses serve as mounts and beasts of burden in many societies. They are loyal and typically gentle creatures, and they are invaluable to those looking to travel long distances. Smaller folk, like gnomes and halflings, often utilize ponies as mounts, while horses are the favored steeds for humans and other Medium humanoids. Most horses that the average humanoid encounters are domesticated, though large herds can be found in the wild.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "战马 War Horse"
        },
        "Hongrui’s Gratitude": {
          "name": "弘蕊酬恩 Hongrui’s Gratitude",
          "tokenName": "弘蕊酬恩 Hongrui’s Gratitude",
          "items": {
            "Hongrui's Gratitude": {
              "name": "弘蕊酬恩 Hongrui's Gratitude",
              "description": "<p>作为对你在柳岸腹地纪念三位不幸旅人悲惨结局的谢礼，这件红兜帽斗篷上装饰着一幅图像：一位衣着华丽的表演者，而她的两名伙伴分别为她举着一盏灯笼与一把雨伞。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> 命令术、观想、交互（塑能、光亮）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你未启用此斗篷的雨伞启动效果</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 将斗篷向左一挥，你使斗篷上那位手持灯笼的伙伴图像消失。一盏漂浮的红灯笼出现在你身旁，并在你身侧一臂距离处跟随你移动，如同火把一般在 20 尺半径内提供明亮光照（并在接下来的 20 尺提供昏暗光照）。持续 1 小时，在该灯笼的光照启用期间，你在交涉检定上获得 +1 物品加值。你可以再次启动斗篷以解消这支火把。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.o1Fzi94EODK3fa4A]{效果：弘蕊酬恩（灯笼）}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> 命令术、观想、交互（防护）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你未启用此斗篷的灯笼启动效果</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 将斗篷向右一挥，你使斗篷上那位手持雨伞的伙伴图像消失。一把牢不可摧的红色蜡纸伞出现在你头顶并跟随你，为你遮蔽天气效果，例如降雨或明亮日光。持续 1 小时，在该雨伞启用期间，你在求生检定上获得 +1 物品加值。你可以再次启动斗篷以解消雨伞。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.g1EdALRxZmmEkSd7]{效果：弘蕊酬恩（雨伞）}</p>\n<p>Given as thanks for honoring the memories of three unfortunate travelers who met a tragic end in the Willowshore Hinterlands, this red-hooded cloak is decorated with an image of an elaborately dressed performer whose two companions hold a lantern and umbrella for her.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> command, envision, Interact (evocation, light)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You don't have the umbrella activation of this cloak active</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> With a wave of the cloak to the left, you cause the image of the lantern-holding companion on the cloak to vanish. A floating red lantern appears at your side and follows you at an arm's length while casting bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) like a torch. For 1 hour, while the light from this lantern is active, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy checks. You can Activate the cloak again to dismiss the torch.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.o1Fzi94EODK3fa4A]{Effect: Hongrui's Gratitude (Lantern)}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> command, envision, Interact (abjuration)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You don't have the lantern activation of this cloak active</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> With a wave of the cloak to the right, you cause the image of the umbrella-holding companion on the cloak to vanish. An indestructible red wax paper umbrella appears above you and follows you, shielding you from weather effects, such as rain or bright sunlight. For 1 hour, while this umbrella is active, you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks. You can Activate the cloak again to dismiss the umbrella.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.g1EdALRxZmmEkSd7]{Effect: Hongrui's Gratitude (Umbrella)}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "弘蕊酬恩 Hongrui’s Gratitude"
        },
        "Gray Butcher": {
          "name": "灰屠 Gray Butcher",
          "tokenName": "灰屠 Gray Butcher",
          "items": {
            "Oil of Potency": {
              "name": "潜能油 Oil of Potency",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>当你将这种浓稠黏滑的油涂抹在一把武器或一套护甲上时，该物品会立刻变得具有魔法潜能。若该物品是武器，它会暂时成为<em>+1 强击武器</em>；若是护甲，它会暂时成为<em>+1 韧性护甲</em>。此效果持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{效果：潜能油}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>When you apply this thick, viscous oil to a weapon or suit of armor, that item immediately becomes magically potent. If the item is a weapon, it temporarily becomes a <em>+1 striking weapon</em>, or, if it's armor, it temporarily becomes <em>+1 resilient armor</em>. This lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1OLlwExJz7ii2Lu2]{Effect: Oil of Potency}</p>"
            },
            "Mesmerizing Opal": {
              "name": "迷心蛋白石 Mesmerizing Opal",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这枚镶银的欧泊吊坠闪耀着虹彩的火光。你启动它时，尝试一次欺瞒检定以@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.QNAVeNKtHA0EUw4X]{佯攻}。若结果为成功，则改为大成功。若结果为大失败，则改为失败。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This silver-bound opal pendant is afire with iridescence. When you activate it, attempt a Deception check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.QNAVeNKtHA0EUw4X]{Feint}. If the outcome is a success, you get a critical success instead. If the outcome is a critical failure, you get a failure instead.</p>"
            },
            "Potency Crystal": {
              "name": "潜能水晶 Potency Crystal",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你用已镶附的武器进行一次攻击，但你尚未掷骰</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这颗萤石水晶散发着奇异的磷光。当你启动该水晶时，该武器在此次打击以及直到本回合结束前，变为一把<em>+1 强击武器</em>，使攻击掷骰获得+1物品加值，并将伤害提高为两颗武器伤害骰。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{效果：潜能水晶}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You make an attack with the affixed weapon, but you haven't rolled yet</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This fluorite crystal glows with a strange phosphorescence. When you activate the crystal, the weapon becomes a <em>+1 striking weapon</em> on the Strike and until the end of this turn, gaining a +1 item bonus to the attack roll and increasing the damage to two weapon damage dice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{Effect: Potency Crystal}</p>"
            },
            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger",
              "description": "<p>这种小型刃器可单手持用，在近身战斗中用来刺击生物。它也可以投掷。</p>\n<p>This small, bladed weapon is held in one hand and used to stab a creature in close combat. It can also be thrown.</p>"
