            "Potency Crystal Talismans": {
              "name": "潜能水晶护符 Potency Crystal Talismans",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你用已装附的武器进行一次攻击，但你尚未掷骰</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这枚萤石水晶散发着奇异的磷光。当你启动水晶时，在进行该次打击时以及直到本回合结束，该武器成为一把<em>+1 强击武器</em>，使攻击掷骰获得+1物品加值，并将伤害提高为两颗武器伤害骰。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{效果：潜能水晶}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You make an attack with the affixed weapon, but you haven't rolled yet</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This fluorite crystal glows with a strange phosphorescence. When you activate the crystal, the weapon becomes a <em>+1 striking weapon</em> on the Strike and until the end of this turn, gaining a +1 item bonus to the attack roll and increasing the damage to two weapon damage dice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{Effect: Potency Crystal}</p>"
