            "Distracting Giggle": {
              "name": "分神讪笑 Distracting Giggle",
              "description": "<p>15尺。草人的咯咯笑声在脑海深处回荡。处于该灵光范围内的生物进行意志豁免时承受–1状态减值。</p>\n<p>15 feet. The thatchling's giggle echoes in the back of the mind. Creatures within the aura take a –1 status penalty to Will saves.</p>"
