              "description": "<p>当三个或更多平民彼此相邻时，每个平民在进行运动检定以[[/act shove]]、攻击掷骰和伤害掷骰时获得+1环境加值。</p>\n<p>When three or more commoners are adjacent to each other, each commoner gets a +1 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to [[/act shove]], attack rolls, and damage rolls.</p>"
