          "publicNotes": "<p>许多平民过着艰辛劳作的生活，他们努力工作，让家人能够吃饱穿暖，相对舒适地生活。</p><hr /><p>社会建立在劳动者的背上。</p>\n<p>Many commoners live hard lives of toil as they work to keep their families fed and housed in relative comfort.</p><hr /><p>Society is built upon the backs of laborers.</p>",
