            "Divine Wrath": {
              "name": "神圣狂怒 Divine Wrath",
              "description": "<p>你引导神性的狂怒对抗你的敌人。你对区域内的敌人造成4d10魂魄伤害，效果取决于他们的强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全部伤害并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物受到全部伤害并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}；在其处于恶心期间，它还获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}; while it's sickened, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一种类似生命的表象，使其用来回答你向它提出的三个问题。本法术唤起的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须大体完整，法术才能生效。尸体受到的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确或越支离破碎，而且它必须有咽喉和口腔才能开口说话。如果在过去一周内有人曾对这具尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以尝试一次意志豁免来抗拒回答问题，并使用该生物在死亡时的原始数据，其效果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，且目标的魂魄对你作祟24小时，纠缠你并使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实回答，但它的回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍能误导你或试图拖延，以使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且更少重复，不过仍然晦涩。它在进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Holy Light": {
              "name": "圣光 Holy Light",
              "description": "<p>你射出一道炽烈的光线，带着神圣能量的辉光。进行一次远程法术攻击。该光线造成 5d6 火焰伤害。若目标具有邪秽（特征），你额外造成 5d6 魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标承受双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部伤害。</p>\n<p>如果光线穿过一片魔法黑暗的区域，或以受魔法黑暗影响的生物为目标，则神圣之光会尝试反制该黑暗。若你需要判断光线是否穿过一片黑暗区域，则在你与该法术的目标之间画一条线。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 火焰伤害增加 2d6，且对邪秽生物的魂魄伤害增加 2d6。</p>\n<p>You shine a blazing ray of light tinged with holy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target has the unholy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, holy light attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against unholy creatures increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Consecrate": {
              "name": "加持术 Consecrate",
              "description": "<p><strong>区域</strong> 以一座你所信奉神祇的不可移动祭坛、神龛或固定圣物为中心的40尺半径爆发</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你将一处地点奉献给你的神祇，吟诵赞词并创造一片神圣空间。在该区域内，你的神祇的崇拜者在攻击掷骰、技能检定、豁免骰与察觉检定上获得+1状态加值；而与你的神祇禁忌相悖的生物（例如对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{法莱斯玛}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}而言的不死）则在这些掷骰上承受-1状态减值。若你的神祇的神圣祝圣允许你选择神圣或邪秽，你也可以选择让这片奉献之地同样为神圣或邪秽。若该神祇的祝圣<span class=\"fontstyle2\">必须</span>为神圣或邪秽，你必须让地点与该祝圣相符。在该区域内，你的神祇的崇拜者所进行的打击获得该地点的祝圣特性（若有）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献成功，且其持续时间改为10年而非1年，或其覆盖的区域半径翻倍。偶尔，在你的神祇的眷顾下，这可能产生更令人惊叹的效果，例如永久奉献的区域，或使效果覆盖整座大教堂。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 奉献成功。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 奉献失败。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献惨烈地失败并激怒你的神祇，祂会降下不悦的征兆。至少在1年内，对该地点进行进一步奉献的尝试都会失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 奉献区域还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{Planar Seal}法术的效果，但该效果不会尝试反制你的神祇的崇拜者所进行的传送。成本增加为200 gp × 法术环位。</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 40-foot-radius burst around an immobile altar, shrine, or fixture of your deity</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You consecrate a site to your deity, chanting praises and creating a sacred space. While within the area, worshippers of your deity gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, skill checks, saving throws, and Perception checks, and creatures anathema to your deity (such as undead for @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{Pharasma} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}) take a -1 status penalty to those rolls. If your deity's divine sanctification allows you to choose holy or unholy, you can choose to make the consecrated site holy or unholy as well. If the deity's sanctification <span class=\"fontstyle2\">must </span>be holy or unholy, you must make the site match that sanctification. Strikes made by worshippers of your deity within the area gain the site's sanctification trait, if any.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The consecration succeeds, and it either lasts for 10 years instead of 1 or covers an area with twice the radius. Occasionally, with your deity's favor, this might produce an even more amazing effect, such as a permanently consecrated area or the effect covering an entire cathedral.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The consecration succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The consecration fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The consecration fails spectacularly and angers your deity, who sends a sign of displeasure. For at least 1 year, further attempts to consecrate the site fail.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The consecrated area also gains the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{Planar Seal} spell, but the effect doesn't attempt to counteract teleportation by worshippers of your deity. The cost increases to 200 gp × the spell rank.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你瓦解一个法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一个魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内变为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是一件神器或类似物品，你自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Peaceful Rest": {
              "name": "安宁的休息 Peaceful Rest",
              "description": "<p>作为目标的尸体不会腐烂，也不能被转化为不死。若该尸体受到某个法术影响，而该法术要求尸体必须在一定时间内死亡（例如，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{死者复活}），则不要将<em>安宁休息</em>的持续时间计入该时间之内。该法术也会阻止普通的虫类与害虫（如蛆虫）啃食尸体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>该法术的持续时间为无限，但施放该法术需要多花费1个动作，且需要一项成本（价值6 gp的防腐液）。</p>\n<p>The targeted corpse doesn't decay, nor can it be transformed into an undead. If the corpse is subject to a spell that requires the corpse to have died within a certain amount of time (for example, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{Raise Dead}), do not count the duration of <em>peaceful rest</em> against that time. This spell also prevents ordinary bugs and pests (such as maggots) from consuming the body.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The spell's duration is unlimited, but the spell takes one more action to cast and requires a cost (embalming fluid worth 6 gp).</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Weapon": {
              "name": "灵能武器 Spiritual Weapon",
              "description": "<p>一把由纯粹魔法力构成的武器显现出来，并攻击你在射程内指定的敌人。此武器具有幽魂般的外观，可显现为一根棍棒、一把匕首，或你神祇的偏好武器。</p>\n<p>当你施放该法术时，武器会出现在你于射程内选择的一个敌人旁边，并对其进行一次打击。每次你维持该法术时，你都可以将武器移动到射程内的一个新目标旁（如有需要），并用其进行一次打击。灵能武器会使用并计入你的多重攻击减值。</p>\n<p>该武器的打击为近战法术攻击。无论其外观如何，武器造成2d8点力场伤害。你可以改为造成该武器通常造成的伤害类型，而不是力场伤害（或多用武器可用的任意一种伤害类型）。该武器的其他任何数据或特征都不适用，且即使是远程武器也只能攻击相邻的生物。尽管进行的是法术攻击，但就触发、抗力等用途而言，灵能武器仍视为一把武器。</p>\n<p>该武器不占用空间、不提供夹击，也不具备任何生物才会有的其他属性。该武器除了其打击之外不能进行任何攻击，并且影响武器的专长或法术都不适用于它。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 该武器的伤害增加1d8。</p>\n<p>A weapon made of pure magical force materializes and attacks foes you designate within range. This weapon has a ghostly appearance and manifests as a club, a dagger, or your deity's favored weapon.</p>\n<p>When you cast the spell, the weapon appears next to a foe you choose within range and makes a Strike against it. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can move the weapon to a new target within range (if needed) and Strike with it. The spiritual weapon uses and contributes to your multiple attack penalty.</p>\n<p>The weapon's Strikes are melee spell attacks. Regardless of its appearance, the weapon deals 2d8 force damage. You can deal damage of the type normally dealt by the weapon instead of force damage (or any of the available damage types for a versatile weapon). No other statistics or traits of the weapon apply, and even a ranged weapon attacks adjacent creatures only. Despite making a spell attack, the spiritual weapon is a weapon for purposes of triggers, resistances, and so forth.</p>\n<p>The weapon doesn't take up space, grant flanking, or have any other attributes a creature would. The weapon can't make any attack other than its Strike, and feats or spells that affect weapons do not apply to it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The weapon's damage increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Bane": {
              "name": "绝望术 Bane",
              "description": "<p>你用疑虑充斥敌人的心智。区域内的敌人必须成功通过一次意志豁免，否则只要它们仍在该区域内，就会在攻击掷骰上承受–1状态减值。在后续回合中，每轮一次，你可以维持该法术，使该发散的半径增加10尺，并迫使区域内尚未受到影响的敌人再尝试一次豁免。</p>\n<p>绝望术可以反制@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{法术效果：绝望术}</p>\n<p>You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt. Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.</p>\n<p>Bane can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{Spell Effect: Bane}</p>"
            },
            "Command": {
              "name": "命令 Command",
              "description": "<p>你大声喊出一道难以忽视的命令。你可以命令目标靠近你、逃跑（如同其具有 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} 状态）、放开它所持握的东西、倒地 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}，或原地不动。在它服从你的命令之前，它不能 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} 或进行任何反应动作。效果取决于目标的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 在其下个回合的第一个动作中，该生物必须使用一个单动作照你命令行事。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标必须在其下个回合使用其所有动作来服从你的命令。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（5环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你放出一道脉冲，用以感知魔法的存在。除魔法是否存在之外，你不会获得任何信息。你可以选择忽略你已完全知晓的魔法，例如你和盟友所持有的魔法物品，以及你和盟友身上的持续法术。你只有在幻术魔法的效果等级低于你的<em>侦测魔法</em>法术等级时，才能侦测到幻术魔法。然而，带有幻术灵光但外观并不具有欺骗性的物品（例如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{隐形药水}）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你会得知该法术所侦测到的最强魔法效果的环级或等级，由GM裁定。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 同3环升阶，但你还会锁定最高环级魔法的来源。与模糊感官类似，你不会得知精确位置，但可以将来源缩小到一个5英尺立方体范围内（若来源大于该范围，则缩小到最接近的范围）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道神圣能量光束。对目标的AC进行一次远程法术攻击。命中时，目标受到2d4点魂魄伤害（若为重击则伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害提高1d4。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导生命能量来治疗活物或伤害不死。若目标是自愿的活体生物，你恢复1d8生命值。若目标是不死，你对其造成等量的生命力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放该法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 该法术的射程为30尺。若你在治疗一个活体生物，将恢复的生命值提高8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 你在一个@Template[emanation|distance:30]中散布生命能量。这会以爆发内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8，而2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> You disperse vital energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Produce Flame": {
              "name": "制造火焰 Produce Flame",
              "description": "<p>一团小小的火焰球出现在你手掌中，你可以用它进行近战或远程挥击。对目标的AC进行一次法术攻击掷骰。通常这是一次远程攻击，但你也可以对处于你徒手触及范围内的生物进行一次近战攻击。</p>\n<p>成功时，你造成2d4点火焰伤害。大成功时，目标受到双倍伤害，并受到@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,fire]]伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4，且重击时的持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>A small ball of flame appears in the palm of your hand, and you lash out with it either in melee or at range. Make a spell attack roll against your target's AC. This is normally a ranged attack, but you can also make a melee attack against a creature in your unarmed reach.</p>\n<p>On a success, you deal 2d4 fire damage. On a critical success, the target takes double damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,fire]] damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 1d4 and the persistent damage on a critical hit by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你专注于目标物体，敞开心神以感知魔法灵光。施法完成后，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法。你或任何你向其讲解该灵光之人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得+2环境加值。若该物体为幻象，你仅在该效果的环位低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的环位时才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你最多可以以10个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong>你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctuary": {
              "name": "圣域术 Sanctuary",
              "description": "<p>你用保护性能量护卫一个生物，以阻止攻击。生物每次尝试攻击该目标时，都必须尝试一次意志豁免。若目标使用敌对动作，则法术结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> <em>圣域术</em>结束。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物可以进行其攻击，以及在本回合中对目标进行的任何其他攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物无法攻击目标并浪费该动作。它在本回合中无法再尝试对目标进行攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物浪费该动作，并且在<em>圣域术</em>剩余的持续时间内无法再尝试攻击目标。</p>\n<p>You ward a creature with protective energy that deters attacks. Creatures attempting to attack the target must attempt a Will save each time. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> <em>Sanctuary</em> ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can attempt its attack and any other attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't attack the target and wastes the action. It can't attempt further attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature wastes the action and can't attempt to attack the target for the rest of <em>sanctuary</em>'s duration.</p>"
            },
            "Sigil": {
              "name": "印记 Sigil",
              "description": "<p>你无害地将自己独特的魔法印记（约 1 平方英寸大小）置于所选的目标生物或物体上。该印记可以是可见或不可见的，你可以通过使用一个交互动作接触目标，将其从一种状态切换为另一种状态。该印记可以用 5 分钟的工作擦洗或刮除。若它在生物身上，则会在一周内自然消退。印记消退前的时间会随你以增幅施放的等级而增加。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>增幅（3环）</strong> 该印记改为在 1 个月后消退。</p>\n<p><strong>增幅（5环）</strong> 该印记改为在 1 年后消退。</p>\n<p><strong>增幅（7环）</strong> 该印记永不消退。</p>\n<p>You harmlessly place your unique magical sigil, which is about 1 square inch in size, on the targeted creature or object. The mark can be visible or invisible, and you can change it from one state to another by using an Interact action to touch the target. The mark can be scrubbed or scraped off with 5 minutes of work. If it's on a creature, it fades naturally over the course of a week. The time before the mark fades increases depending on your heightened level.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The sigil instead fades after 1 month.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The sigil instead fades after 1 year.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The sigil never fades.</p>"
            },
            "Spear": {
              "name": "矛 Spear"
            },
            "Hide Armor": {
              "name": "皮甲 Hide Armor",
              "description": "<p>这套护甲由毛皮、坚韧的兽皮构成，有时还会加入塑形的煮制皮革；它凭借多层皮革提供防护，但其笨重会拖慢穿戴者并降低机动性。</p>\n<p>A mix of furs, sturdy hide, and sometimes molded boiled leather, this armor provides protection due to its layers of leather, though its bulkiness slows the wearer down and decreases mobility.</p>"
            },
            "Torch": {
              "name": "火把 Torch"
            },
            "Key": {
              "name": "钥匙 Key"
            },
            "Purifying Flames": {
              "name": "净化之焰 Purifying Flames",
              "description": "<p>驱魔师尝试用火炬对一名生物进行打击，以极高的精准发动攻击，并使火炬的火焰猛然窜起。这次打击的攻击掷骰获得+2状态加值，且命中时额外造成2d6点火焰伤害，而非仅造成1d6点火焰伤害。被此攻击命中的不死、魂魄或转生生物还必须进行一次@Check[will|dc:26]豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受此额外效果影响，但部分火焰会反噬到驱魔师身上，对驱魔师造成@Damage[2d6[fire]]伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:26|basic]豁免）。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受此额外效果影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 净化之焰使该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续至其下个回合结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 如失败，但为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>The exorcist attempts to Strike a creature with their torch, attacking with great precision and causing the torch's fires to flare up. This Strike gains a +2 status bonus to its attack roll and inflicts an additional 2d6 fire damage on a hit instead of just 1d6 fire damage. An undead, spirit, or transmigrated creature hit by this attack must also attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by this additional effect, and some of the fire flares back onto the exorcist, inflicting @Damage[2d6[fire]] damage to the exorcist (@Check[reflex|dc:26|basic] save).</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by this additional effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The purifying flames cause the creature to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Torch Wielder": {
              "name": "火炬持用者 Torch Wielder",
              "description": "<p>驱魔师将火把视为一把轻型钉头锤，且命中时会额外造成1d6火焰伤害。</p>\n<p>The exorcist treats a torch as a light mace that deals an additional 1d6 fire damage on a hit.</p>"
            }
          },
          "blurb": "务实的男性人类精英驱魔师\nPragmatic male human elite exorcist",
