        "Quintessivore": {
          "name": "精粹食者 Quintessivore",
          "tokenName": "精髓噬者 Quintessivore",
          "items": {
            "Arcane Prepared Spells": {
              "name": "奥术准备法术 Arcane Prepared Spells"
            },
            "Black Tentacles": {
              "name": "黑色触手 Black Tentacles",
              "description": "<p><strong>区域</strong> 与一处平坦表面相邻的20尺爆发</p>\n<hr />\n<p>油腻的黑色触手升起，试图捕捉区域内的生物。对区域内每个生物的强韧DC进行法术攻击掷骰。你成功对抗的任何生物都会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}并受到3d6钝击伤害。每当一个生物在该区域内结束其回合时，触手会尝试擒抱该生物（若先前尚未擒抱），并对任何已经受擒的生物造成@Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]]伤害。</p>\n<p>触手的逃脱DC等于你的法术DC。生物可以攻击一根触手以尝试摆脱其擒抱。其AC等于你的法术DC，且若它受到12点或更多伤害则被摧毁。即使被摧毁，额外的触手仍会在持续时间结束前持续在该区域内生长。你可以解消该法术。</p>\n<p><strong>Area</strong> 20-foot burst adjacent to a flat surface</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Oily black tentacles rise up and attempt to capture creatures in the area. Make spell attack rolls against the Fortitude DC of each creature in the area. Any creature you succeed against is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} and takes 3d6 bludgeoning damage. Whenever a creature ends its turn in the area, the tentacles attempt to grab that creature if they haven't already, and they deal @Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]] damage to any creature already Grabbed.</p>\n<p>The tentacles' Escape DC is equal to your spell DC. A creature can attack a tentacle in an attempt to release its grip. Its AC is equal to your spell DC, and it is destroyed if it takes 12 or more damage. Even if destroyed, additional tentacles continue to grow in the area until the duration ends. You can Dismiss the spell.</p>"
            },
            "Passwall": {
              "name": "穿墙术 Passwall",
              "description": "<p>你在所选区域的墙体中创造一条可见的隧道，将该区域替换为空无一物的空间。如果墙体厚度超过10尺，隧道在深入10尺处结束。墙中哪怕只有一层很薄的金属也会阻止此法术发挥作用。此法术不会降低结构的完整性。法术结束时，隧道内的任何人都会被挤推出去，送至最近的出口。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 隧道最深可达20尺。包含你隧道入口的墙体区域看起来完全正常（除非以真视术或类似效果观察），尽管隧道确实存在。隧道入口如同坚实的墙体一样起作用，但你可以指定一个口令或触发条件，使生物能够自由进入隧道。</p>\n<p>You create a visible tunnel through the wall in the chosen area, replacing the area with empty space. If the wall is thicker than 10 feet, the tunnel ends 10 feet in. Even a small layer of metal in the wall prevents this spell from functioning. This spell doesn't reduce the integrity of the structure. When the spell ends, anyone inside the tunnel is shunted to the nearest exit.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The tunnel can be up to 20 feet deep. The areas of the wall that contain your tunnel's entrance appear completely normal (unless viewed with true seeing or a similar effect), despite the tunnel's existence. The tunnel's entrance functions as a solid wall, but you can specify a password or a trigger, allowing creatures to enter the tunnel freely.</p>"
            },
            "Clairvoyance": {
              "name": "千里眼 Clairvoyance",
              "description": "<p>你在射程内的一处位置创造一只@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}的漂浮眼睛（即使该位置在你的视觉线或效果线之外也可以）。这只眼睛无法移动，但你可以像使用你正常的视觉感官一样，从该点向所有方向观察。</p>\n<p>You create an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} floating eye at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). The eye can't move, but you can see in all directions from that point as if using your normal visual senses.</p>"
            },
            "Enervation": {
              "name": "弱能术 Enervation",
              "description": "<p>伸出一根手指，你发射出一道虚无能量光束，削弱任何被其触及的生物的生命力。直线中的每个活体生物都必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] 伤害，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 成功时的持续虚无伤害增加 1d8；失败或大失败时增加 2d8。</p>\n<p>Extending a finger, you fire a beam of void energy that weakens the life force of any creature it touches. Each living creature in the line must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d8[persistent,void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2)*2)d8[persistent,void]] damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The persistent void damage increases by 1d8 on a success, or by 2d8 on a failure or critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Slow": {
              "name": "缓慢 Slow",
              "description": "<p>你让目标周围的时间流动膨胀，使其动作变慢。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You dilate the flow of time around the target, slowing its actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Vampiric Touch": {
              "name": "吸血鬼之触 Vampiric Touch",
              "description": "<p>你的接触会从目标体内汲取生命之血以强化自己。你对目标造成6d6虚空伤害。你获得等同于目标所受虚空伤害一半的临时生命值（在应用抗力等因素之后）。1分钟后，你失去任何剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Comprehend Language": {
              "name": "通晓语言 Comprehend Language",
              "description": "<p>当你施放该法术时，目标可以理解它正在听到或阅读的一种语言的含义。这不会让它理解密码、以隐喻方式表达的语言等（由GM酌情裁定）。如果目标能听到多种语言并且知道这一点，它可以选择要理解哪一种语言；否则，随机选择其中一种语言。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 目标也可以说这种语言。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 你可以以最多10个生物为目标，且目标也可以说这种语言。</p>\n<p>The target can understand the meaning of a single language it is hearing or reading when you cast the spell. This doesn't let it understand codes, language couched in metaphor, and the like (subject to GM discretion). If the target can hear multiple languages and knows that, it can choose which language to understand; otherwise, choose one of the languages randomly.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The target can also speak the language.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures, and targets can also speak the language.</p>"
            },
            "See Invisibility": {
              "name": "识破隐形 See Invisibility",
              "description": "<p>你可以看见 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} 的生物与物体。它们在你眼中呈现为半透明的形体，并且对你而言处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} 状态。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 该法术的持续时间为 8 小时。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{法术效果：看见不可见}</p>\n<p>You can see @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} creatures and objects. They appear to you as translucent shapes, and they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} to you.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The spell has a duration of 8 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{Spell Effect: See the Unseen}</p>"
            },
            "Web": {
              "name": "蛛网术 Web",
              "description": "<p>你在区域内创造出一张黏稠的蛛网，每当生物尝试穿过它移动时都会阻碍其移动。被蛛网填满的方格为困难地形。每个方格都可以被一次造成至少5点挥砍伤害或1点火焰伤害的单次攻击或效果清除蛛网。一个方格的AC为5，并且它的豁免骰自动失败。</p>\n<p>每当蛛网中的生物开始使用一个移动动作，或在一次移动动作中进入蛛网时，它必须尝试一次运动检定或反射豁免骰，对抗你的法术DC，以避免其速度受到环境减值，或变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}。生物一旦离开蛛网，就不再因蛛网而使其速度受到环境减值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong>该生物不受影响，并且在本回合内不需要再对蛛网尝试进一步的运动检定或豁免骰。若它使用的是运动检定，则在离开一个方格后，会清除它离开过的每一个方格中的蛛网。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong>该生物在其动作期间不受影响。若它使用的是运动检定，则在离开一个方格后，会清除它离开过的每一个方格中的蛛网。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong>该生物的速度在其下个回合开始前受到–10尺环境减值。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong>该生物直到其下个回合开始前处于禁足（状态），之后其速度受到–10尺环境减值，持续1轮。它可以尝试逃脱以移除其禁足（状态）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>该法术的区域增加为20尺爆发，射程增加为60尺。</p>\n<p>You create a sticky web in the area that impedes creatures' movement each time they try to move through it. Squares filled with the web are difficult terrain. Each square can be cleared of the web by a single attack or effect that deals at least 5 slashing damage or 1 fire damage. A square has AC 5, and it automatically fails its saving throws.</p>\n<p>Each time a creature in the web begins to use a move action or enters the web during a move action, it must attempt an Athletics check or Reflex save against your spell DC to avoid taking a circumstance penalty to its Speeds or becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}. A creature that gets out of the web ceases to take a circumstance penalty to its Speed from the web.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected, and it doesn't need to attempt further Athletics checks or saving throws against the web this turn. If it used an Athletics check, it clears the web from every square it leaves after leaving the square.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected during its action. If it used an Athletics check, it clears the web from every square it leaves after leaving the square.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Immobilized until the start of its next turn, after which it takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape to remove its Immobilized condition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell's area increases to a 20-foot burst, and its range increases to 60 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标的心智蒙上阴影，并用一次心灵震击令其发昏。该震击造成等同于你施法关键属性调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，则它也会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你发出一道脉冲，登记魔法的存在。除魔法是否存在外，你不会获得任何信息。你可以选择忽略你完全知晓的魔法，例如你和盟友的魔法物品与持续中的法术。</p>\n<p>你只有在幻术魔法的效果等级低于你的侦测魔法法术的环阶时，才能侦测到幻术魔法。然而，具有幻术灵光但外观并不具欺骗性的物品（例如隐形药水）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你会得知该法术在射程内所侦测到的最高等级效果的魔法学派。若有多个效果同等强大，则由GM决定你得知哪一个。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 同3环，但你还会精确定位最高等级魔法的来源。与模糊感官类似，你不会得知确切位置，但可以将来源缩小到一个5尺立方体范围内（若来源大于此范围，则缩小到最接近的区域）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the rank of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Feather Fall": {
              "name": "羽落术 Feather Fall",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 射程内的一个生物正在坠落</p>\n<hr />\n<p>你使空气本身阻止坠落。目标的坠落速度减缓至每轮60英尺，并且在该法术持续时间内发生的坠落距离在计算坠落伤害时不计入其中。若目标在法术生效期间落地，则不会因这次坠落而受到任何伤害。目标一旦着地，法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> a creature within range is falling</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You cause the air itself to arrest a fall. The target's fall slows to 60 feet per round, and the portion of the fall during the spell's duration doesn't count when calculating falling damage. If the target reaches the ground while the spell is in effect, it takes no damage from the fall. The spell ends as soon as the target lands.</p>"
            },
            "Fleet Step": {
              "name": "迅捷步伐 Fleet Step",
              "description": "<p>你获得速度+30英尺的状态加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ThFug45WHkQQXcoF]{法术效果：疾步术}</p>\n<p>You gain a +30-foot status bonus to your Speed.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ThFug45WHkQQXcoF]{Spell Effect: Fleet Step}</p>"
            },
            "Grim Tendrils": {
              "name": "阴森触须 Grim Tendrils",
              "description": "<p>黑暗触须从你的指尖卷出，在空中疾驰。你对线内的活体生物造成2d4虚无伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)[bleed]]伤害。线内的每个活体生物必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半的虚无伤害，且不受持续流血伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全部伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到双倍虚无伤害以及双倍持续流血伤害。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 虚无伤害增加2d4，持续流血伤害增加1。</p>\n<p>Tendrils of darkness curl out from your fingertips and race through the air. You deal 2d4 void damage and @Damage[(@item.level)[bleed]] damage to living creatures in the line. Each living creature in the line must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half the void damage and no persistent bleed damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double void damage and double persistent bleed damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The void damage increases by 2d4, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.</p>"
            },
            "Mage Hand": {
              "name": "法师之手 Mage Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一只魔法之手，它可以是隐形的或如幽灵般的，这只手抓住目标物体并将其缓慢移动，最多移动20英尺。由于你是在使该物体漂浮，你可以让它朝任何方向移动。当你维持该法术时，你可以使该物体额外移动20英尺。若法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以以负载为1或更低的无主物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以负载为1或更低的无主物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以负载为2或更低的无主物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a single magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and moves it slowly up to 20 feet. Because you're levitating the object, you can move it in any direction. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Ray of Enfeeblement": {
              "name": "衰弱射线 Ray of Enfeeblement",
              "description": "<p>一道汲取敌人力量的射线从你手中闪现。对目标进行一次远程法术攻击。若你成功，该生物进行一次强韧豁免以决定该法术的效果。若你的攻击掷骰为大成功，则使用其豁免结果低一档的结果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 3}。</p>\n<p>A ray that saps a foe's strength flashes from your hand. Attempt a ranged spell attack against the target. If you succeed, that creature attempts a Fortitude save to determine the spell's effect. If your attack roll is a critical success, use the outcome for one degree of success worse than the result of its save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3}.</p>"
            },
            "Ray of Frost": {
              "name": "霜冻射线 Ray of Frost",
              "description": "<p>你发射一道冰冷射线。进行一次法术攻击掷骰。该射线造成2d4点寒冷伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标受到双倍伤害，并且其速度在1轮内承受–10英尺的状态减值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{法术效果：霜冻射线}</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到正常伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>You blast an icy ray. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals 2d4 cold damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{Spell Effect: Ray of Frost}</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes normal damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你将注意力集中在目标物体上，敞开心灵去感知魔法灵光。施法完成后，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法；若是，你还会得知其魔法学派。</p>\n<p>如果该物体是虚幻的，只有当该效果的等级低于你的阅读灵光法术的环阶时，你才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（3环）</strong>你最多可以以10个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>强化（6环）</strong>你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical, and if it is, you learn the school of magic.</p>\n<p>If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's level is lower than the rank of your read aura spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Scroll of Dimensional Anchor (Level 4)": {
              "name": "次元锚卷轴（4级） Scroll of Dimensional Anchor (Level 4)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksLCg62cLOojw3gN]{位面系缚}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴施放法术需要用一只手持握卷轴，并以该法术正常数量的动作，使用一次施法（行动）来启动它。</p>\n<p>要从卷轴施放法术，该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。因为是由你来施放法术，使用你的法术攻击掷骰和法术DC。该法术还会获得与你的根源相应的特征（奥术、神术、异能或原能）。</p>\n<p>卷轴在制作时就已提供任何实体的材料成分与花费，因此从卷轴施放法术时你不需要再提供它们。你必须将该法术所需的任何材料成分替换为姿势成分。如果该法术需要一个法器，你必须持有该法器才能从卷轴施放法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要制作某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入一名PC、NPC或战利品角色的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksLCg62cLOojw3gN]{Planar Tether}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>To Cast a Spell from a scroll, the spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack roll and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical material components and costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when Casting a Spell from a scroll. You must replace any required material component for that spell with a somatic component. If the spell requires a focus, you must have that focus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            },
            "Scroll of Fly (Level 4)": {
              "name": "飞行卷轴（等级 4） Scroll of Fly (Level 4)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.A2JfEKe6BZcTG1S8]{飞行术}</p><hr /><p>从卷轴施放法术需要你用一只手拿着卷轴，并以该法术正常所需的动作数，用一次施法（行动）来启用它。</p>\n<p>要从卷轴施放法术，该法术必须出现在你的法术列表上。因为是你在施放法术，使用你的法术攻击掷骰和法术DC。该法术也会获得与你的根源相应的特征（奥术、神圣、秘术或原初）。</p>\n<p>卷轴在制作时已提供任何实体的材料成分与费用，因此你在从卷轴施放法术时不需要再提供它们。你必须将该法术所需的任何材料成分替换为姿势成分。若该法术需要法器，你必须拥有该法器才能从卷轴施放该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注意：要制作某个特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入一名PC、NPC或战利品actor的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.A2JfEKe6BZcTG1S8]{Fly}</p><hr /><p>Casting a Spell from a scroll requires holding the scroll in one hand and activating it with a Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions for that spell.</p>\n<p>To Cast a Spell from a scroll, the spell must appear on your spell list. Because you're the one Casting the Spell, use your spell attack roll and spell DC. The spell also gains the appropriate trait for your tradition (arcane, divine, occult, or primal).</p>\n<p>Any physical material components and costs are provided when a scroll is created, so you don't need to provide them when Casting a Spell from a scroll. You must replace any required material component for that spell with a somatic component. If the spell requires a focus, you must have that focus to Cast the Spell from a scroll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            },
            "Blade-Leg": {
              "name": "刃腿 Blade-Leg"
            },
            "Instant Suspension": {
              "name": "瞬时悬浮 Instant Suspension",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 元素精华噬者将其15英尺内的一个生物的生命值降至0</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 元素精华噬者使用“悬置灵魂”，以该生物为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The quintessivore reduces a creature within 15 feet of it to 0 Hit Points</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The quintessivore uses Suspend Soul, targeting the creature.</p>"
            },
            "Feed on Quintessence": {
              "name": "啜饮第五精华 Feed on Quintessence",
              "description": "<p>在1小时的过程中，精粹噬者会移除并解构一个生物的灵魂。该生物必须要么被俘虏，要么在该过程开始前死亡不超过2小时。1小时结束时，精粹噬者会吞噬该生物灵魂的精粹。</p>\n<p>在接下来的一个月里，它的法术DC与法术攻击掷骰获得+1状态加值，并将6环@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.5BbU1V6wGSGbrmRD]{Never Mind}与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fd31tAHSSGXyOxW6]{血族驱命}加入其奥术已准备法术中。</p>\n<p>解构灵魂会将该生物灵魂的独特性质映射到精粹噬者的刀刃般的腿上。灵魂可以通过将其与精粹结合而被重构。一只死去的精粹噬者的灵魂会以纯粹的精粹形式逃离其躯体，适合作此用途。</p>\n<p>Over the course of 1 hour, the quintessivore removes and deconstructs the soul of a creature. The creature must either be captive or have been dead for no more than 2 hours before the start of the process. At the end of the hour, the quintessivore consumes the quintessence of the creature's soul.</p>\n<p>For the next month, it gains a +1 status bonus to its spell DC and spell attack roll, and it adds 6th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.5BbU1V6wGSGbrmRD]{Never Mind} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.fd31tAHSSGXyOxW6]{Vampiric Exsanguination} to its arcane prepared spells.</p>\n<p>Deconstructing a soul maps the unique properties of the creature's soul into the quintessivore's blade-legs. The soul can be reconstructed by binding it to quintessence. A dead quintessivore's soul flees its body as pure quintessence suitable for this purpose.</p>"
            },
            "Suspend Soul": {
              "name": "悬置灵魂 Suspend Soul",
              "description": "<p>精髓噬者会暂停其15尺内一个濒死生物的生命过程。该生物在10分钟内无法降低或提高其HP或濒死值。该生物可以尝试一次@Check[will|dc:29]豁免以避免此效果。若该生物接受魔法治疗，则其可以尝试一次新的豁免，若成功，则结束该效果并正常受到治疗。</p>\n<p>如果精髓噬者再次使用“暂停灵魂”，则该效果结束。</p>\n<p>The quintessivore suspends the life processes of a dying creature within 15 feet of it. The creature can't decrease or increase its HP or dying value for 10 minutes. The creature can attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save to avoid this effect. If the creature receives magical healing, it can attempt a new save, ending the effect and being healed normally on a success.</p>\n<p>The effect ends if the quintessivore uses Suspend Soul again.</p>"
            },
            "Tattered Soul": {
              "name": "破碎之魂 Tattered Soul",
              "description": "<p>被精髓噬者的刀刃腿打击命中的生物必须成功通过一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:29] 豁免，否则将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drain 2}）。如果该生物已处于Drain状态，则对该效果免疫。</p>\n<p>A creature hit by the quintessivore's blade-leg Strike must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure). If the creature is already drained, it's immune to this effect.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>精粹噬者是狡猾的生物，能施展奥术魔法，并拥有如手术刀般锋利的蜘蛛肢体，既能轻易撕裂血肉，也能同样轻易地撕裂灵魂。精粹噬者不会立刻杀死猎物——它会把生物拖拽到自己的巢穴，用带刃的肢体将受害者的灵魂与躯体分离。随后，那些弹动的刀刃会拉拽出生物的个体性，将灵魂削减为一种被称为“精粹”的纯粹灵魂物质，接着由精粹噬者将其吞噬。</p>\n<p>Quintessivores are cunning creatures that wield arcane magic and scalpel-sharp spider limbs that can rend one's soul just as easily as flesh. A quintessivore doesn't immediately kill its prey-it drags the creature to its lair and separates the victim's soul from their body with its bladed limbs. The flicking blades then pull out the creature's individuality, reducing the soul down to pure soul-stuff called quintessence, which the quintessivore then consumes.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "第五精质噬者 Quintessivore"
        },
        "Admiring the Moon Reward": {
          "name": "咏月诗会奖励 Admiring the Moon Reward",
          "tokenName": "咏月诗会奖励 Admiring the Moon Reward",
          "items": {
            "Cognitive Mutagen (Moderate)": {
              "name": "认知诱变剂（中等） Cognitive Mutagen (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>你的思绪变得清明，但肉体之事似乎变得虚无缥缈。</p>\n<p><strong>增益</strong> 你在奥术、制作、传承、秘学与社会的检定，以及所有用于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{回忆知识} 的检定中，获得+2物品加值。你在回忆知识检定中的大失败改为失败。</p>\n<p><strong>缺陷</strong> 你在武器与徒手攻击掷骰、运动检定以及特技检定中承受-2减值。在变为负荷过重之前，你能携带的负载上限比正常少2；你能携带的最大负载减少4。</p>\n<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 10分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.ztxW3lBPRcesF7wK]{效果：认知诱变剂（中等）}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>Your mind becomes clear, but physical matters seem ephemeral.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +2 item bonus to Arcana, Crafting, Lore, Occultism, and Society checks and all checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge}. Your critical failures on Recall Knowledge checks become failures instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You take a -2 penalty to weapon and unarmed attack rolls, Athletics checks, and acrobatics checks. You can carry 2 less Bulk than normal before becoming encumbered, and the maximum Bulk you can carry is reduced by 4.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.ztxW3lBPRcesF7wK]{Effect: Cognitive Mutagen (Moderate)}</p>"
            },
            "Serene Mutagen (Moderate)": {
              "name": "宁心诱变剂（中等） Serene Mutagen (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>你获得内心的宁静，但你会觉得暴力令人反感。</p>\n<p><strong>增益</strong> 你在意志豁免以及察觉、医疗、自然、宗教和生存检定上获得+2物品加值。当你尝试对抗心灵效果的意志豁免时，该加值提升至+3。</p>\n<p><strong>缺陷</strong> 你的攻击掷骰与进攻性法术的豁免DC受到-1减值，且你的所有武器、徒手攻击与法术伤害每个伤害骰受到-1减值。</p>\n<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 10分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.yrbz0rZzp8aZEqbv]{效果：宁心突变剂（中等）}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>You gain inner serenity, but you find violence off-putting.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +2 item bonus to Will saves and Perception, Medicine, Nature, Religion, and Survival checks. This bonus improves to +3 when you attempt Will saves against mental effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You take a -1 penalty to attack rolls and save DCs of offensive spells, and a -1 penalty per damage die to all weapon, unarmed attack, and spell damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.yrbz0rZzp8aZEqbv]{Effect: Serene Mutagen (Moderate)}</p>"
            },
            "Silvertongue Mutagen (Moderate)": {
              "name": "巧舌突变剂（中等） Silvertongue Mutagen (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>你的五官变得更加醒目，你的声音变得悦耳而富有号令力，不过情绪会蒙蔽你的理性。</p>\n<p><strong>益处</strong> 你在欺瞒、交涉、威吓与表演检定上获得+2物品加值。你在这些技能上的所有大失败改为失败。</p>\n<p><strong>缺陷</strong> 你在奥秘学、制作、学识、通灵学与社交检定上承受-2物品减值。选择一项你已受训的技能；在持续时间内，你在该技能上变为未受训。你所有对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{回忆知识}的失败都变为大失败。</p>\n<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 10分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.v5Ht1V4MZvRKRBjL]{效果：巧舌突变剂（中等）}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>Your features become striking, and your voice becomes musical and commanding, though emotion clouds your reason.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +2 item bonus to Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation and Performance checks. Your critical failures with any of these skills become failures instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You take a -2 item penalty to Arcana, Crafting, Lore, Occultism, and Society checks. Choose one skill in which you are trained; for the duration, you become untrained in that skill. All your failures to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge} become critical failures.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.v5Ht1V4MZvRKRBjL]{Effect: Silvertongue Mutagen (Moderate)}</p>"
            }
          },
          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-pktlnqVh1GgrI4b0\" class=\"secret\"><p>胜者从这些中选择一个。</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-pktlnqVh1GgrI4b0\" class=\"secret\"><p>The victor chooses one of these.</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "咏月诗会奖励 Admiring the Moon Reward"
        },
        "Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Divine)": {
          "name": "无面鬼模仿者（神术） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Divine)",
          "tokenName": "无面鬼模仿者（神圣） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Divine)",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Vampiric Feast": {
              "name": "吸血盛宴 Vampiric Feast",
              "description": "<p>你的接触从一个目标身上抽取生命力来强化自己。你对该目标造成 6d6 虚无伤害。你获得等于该目标所受虚无伤害一半的临时生命值（在应用抗力等效果之后）。1 分钟后，你失去任何剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 2d6。</p>\n<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Dispel Magic": {
              "name": "解除魔法 Dispel Magic",
              "description": "<p>你瓦解一个法术或效果背后的魔法。对目标进行一次反制检定。若你成功反制一个魔法物品，该物品在10分钟内变为其类型的普通物品。这不会改变该物品的非魔法属性。若目标是神器或类似物品，你会自动失败。</p>\n<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"
            },
            "Noise Blast": {
              "name": "噪音爆发 Noise Blast",
              "description": "<p>一阵刺耳的噪音轰然爆发，造成2d10点音波伤害。每个生物必须尝试一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到一半伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到全额伤害，并在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到双倍伤害，在1分钟内耳聋，并处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d10。</p>\n<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
            },
            "Bane": {
              "name": "绝望术 Bane",
              "description": "<p>你用疑虑充斥敌人的心智。区域内的敌人必须在意志豁免中成功，否则只要他们仍在该区域内，就会在攻击掷骰上承受–1状态减值。后续回合中每轮一次，你可以维持该法术，使该散发的半径增加10英尺，并迫使区域内那些尚未受影响的敌人再尝试一次豁免。</p>\n<p>绝望术可以反制 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{法术效果：绝望术}</p>\n<p>You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt. Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can Sustain the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.</p>\n<p>Bane can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{Spell Effect: Bane}</p>"
            },
            "Command": {
              "name": "命令 Command",
              "description": "<p>你高声喊出一道难以忽视的命令。你可以命令目标靠近你、逃跑（如同其具有 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} 状态）、放开其正握着的东西、倒下成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}，或原地不动。在其服从你的命令之前，它不能 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} 或进行任何反应动作。效果取决于目标的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 在其下一回合的第一个动作中，该生物必须使用一个单动作照你命令行事。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标必须在其下一回合使用其所有动作来服从你的命令。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 你最多可以以 10 个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导生命能量来治疗活物或伤害不死。若目标是一名自愿的活体生物，你恢复其1d8点生命值。若目标是不死，你对其造成等量的生命力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 该法术的射程为30尺。若你在治疗一个活体生物，使恢复的生命值提高8点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(专注)</strong> 你在一个@Template[emanation|distance:30]中散布生命能量。这会以爆发内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8点，且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(concentrate)</strong> You disperse vital energy in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "护盾 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你升起一面魔法力场护盾术。这算作使用“举起护盾术”动作，使你在直到你下个回合开始前获得AC+1环境加值，但不需要占用手来使用。</p>\n<p>当该法术生效时，你可以用你的魔法护盾术使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{盾牌格挡}反应动作（）。该护盾具有硬度5。你可以使用该法术的反应动作（）来减少任何法术或魔法效果造成的伤害，即使其不造成物理伤害也可以。在你使用盾牌格挡后，该法术结束，且你在10分钟内不能再次施放它。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 该护盾的硬度增加5。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. You can use the spell's reaction to reduce damage from any spell or magical effect, even if it doesn't deal physical damage. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The shield's Hardness increases by 5.</p>"
            },
            "Void Warp": {
              "name": "虚空扭曲 Void Warp",
              "description": "<p>你呼唤虚空来伤害生命力。目标进行一次基础强韧豁免，受到2d4点虚空伤害。若大失败，目标还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>You call upon the Void to harm life force. The target takes 2d4 void damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "False Weapon": {
              "name": "虚假武器 False Weapon",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者携带一把<em>+1 强击</em>武器，其外观与被模仿PC偏好的武器完全相同。若该PC偏好徒手打击，它看起来就像缠手布。若该PC偏好远程武器，则无面鬼模仿者没有近战武器，而改为使用上文的远程武器规则；否则，无面鬼模仿者没有远程武器。若PC不偏好任何武器，则无面鬼将木棒作为其虚假武器挥舞。此虚假武器仅部分真实，命中时只造成心灵伤害；它不会获得原本武器的任何特征或魔法强化。若无面鬼模仿者的虚假武器处于破损状态、被缴械或被放下，它就会消散。无面鬼模仿者可以花费10分钟重新制作一把替代的虚假武器。</p>\n<p>A noppera-bo impersonator carries a <em>+1 striking</em> weapon that looks identical to the favored weapon of the PC being impersonated. If the PC favors unarmed strikes, it appears as hand wraps. If the PC favors a ranged weapon, then the noppera-bo impersonator has no melee weapon and instead uses the ranged weapon rules above; otherwise, the noppera-bo impersonator has no ranged weapon. If the PCs favors no weapon, then the noppera-bo wields a club as its false weapon. This false weapon is only partially real and inflicts only mental damage when it hits; it gains none of the original weapon's traits or magical enhancements. If a noppera-bo impersonator's false weapon is broken, disarmed, or set down, it fades away. The noppera-bo impersonator can craft a replacement false weapon by spending 10 minutes to recreate one.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30英尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉感知，但它们的听觉十分精准。它们不需要呼吸，且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获得养分——传统上是将手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；它们也能以这种方式从消耗品（如药水或灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo has no sense of vision, but their hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
