        "Haphazard Wood Pile": {
          "name": "杂乱的木柴堆 Haphazard Wood Pile",
          "tokenName": "杂乱的木柴堆 Haphazard Wood Pile",
          "items": {
            "Collapse Inward": {
              "name": "向内坍塌 Collapse Inward",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 危害内的四名狂欢者中的任意一人执行任何具有移动（特征）的动作</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 堆垛坍塌到四名狂欢者身上，对他们每人造成 @Damage[(1d6+5)[bludgeoning]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] 豁免）。四人还会受到 @Damage[1d6[persistent,bludgeoning]] 伤害，直到他们以一次 @Check[athletics|dc:17] 检定被从瓦砾中拉出，或能 [[/act escape dc=17]]。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Any of the four revelers within the hazard perform any action with the Move trait</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The pile collapses onto the four revelers, dealing @Damage[(1d6+5)[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] save) to each of them. All four also take @Damage[1d6[persistent,bludgeoning]] damage until they're pulled from the rubble with a @Check[athletics|dc:17] check or can [[/act escape dc=17]].</p>"
            },
            "Collapse Outward": {
              "name": "向外坍塌 Collapse Outward",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 从柴堆外尝试解除该危害时大失败，或有人从柴堆外故意触发该危害</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 柴堆向外坍塌，对四名狂欢者造成 @Damage[(1d6+5)[bludgeoning]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:15|basic] 豁免），并对被困狂欢者所在的中央 10 尺见方周围 10 尺区域内的所有生物造成 @Damage[(2d6+5)[bludgeoning]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An attempt to disable the hazard from outside critically fails, or the hazard is intentionally triggered by someone from outside of the wood pile</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The pile collapses outward, inflicting @Damage[(1d6+5)[bludgeoning]] damage to the four revelers (@Check[reflex|dc:15|basic] save), and @Damage[(2d6+5)[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] save) to all creatures in a 10-foot area surrounding the central 10-foot-square where the revelers were trapped.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[thievery|dc:17]（受训）、制作（受训）或 @Check[Engineering Lore|dc:17]（受训），以弄清如何安全地拆解这堆东西而不让它坍塌砸到任何人。</p>\n<p>@Check[thievery|dc:17] (trained), Crafting (trained), or @Check[Engineering Lore|dc:17] (trained) to figure out how to safely dismantle the pile without it collapsing on anyone.</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>沉重而锋利的木梁彼此倚靠，组成一个摇摇欲坠的平衡牢笼，并与数条绊线和承受拉力的木销相连。</p>\n<p>Beams of heavy and sharp wood rest against one another to form a precariously balanced cage tied to several trip lines and tension-bearing dowels.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（受训）注意这堆东西可能如何倒在某人身上以使其失效；DC 0 用于看见这堆东西。</p>\n<p>(trained) to notice how the pile might fall on a person disabling it; DC 0 to see the pile.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "杂乱的木堆 Haphazard Wood Pile"
        },
        "Weakened Floor": {
          "name": "脆弱的地板 Weakened Floor",
          "tokenName": "脆弱的地板 Weakened Floor",
          "items": {
            "Collapse Floor": {
              "name": "地板坍塌 Collapse Floor",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一轮开始时，有一名小型或更大的生物站在<strong>A4</strong>区域的地板上</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 整个房间的地板在震耳欲聋的崩塌声中塌陷，将房间内所有生物都向下坠落5英尺，落入一片由泥浆、霉菌与有毒真菌构成的稀烂泥沼中，同时一团孢子云喷涌到上方空中。该房间变为高等困难地形。除非成功通过一次@Check[reflex|dc:34] 豁免，否则所有原本站在房间地板上的生物都会在下方的烂泥中变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}；若成功，则以双脚着地。随后该危害掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A round begins with a Small or larger creature standing on the floor in area <strong>A4</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The floor of the entire room collapses in a thunderous crash, dropping all creatures in the room 5 feet into a soupy morass of mud, mold, and toxic fungus while a cloud of spores spews up into the air above. The room becomes greater difficult terrain. All creatures who were standing on the floor in the room fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} in the mess below unless they succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:34] save, in which case they land on their feet. The hazard then rolls initiative.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[crafting|dc:33]（大师）进行三次检定，以在不触发孢子云的情况下在地板上凿出洞，同时减轻地板所承受的压力，使其能够被行走；@Check[stealth|dc:36]（专家）检定，以在你本回合剩余时间内小心穿过房间而不触发危害；或在陷阱被触发后，@Check[nature|dc:36]（专家）进行两次检定，以在附近墙壁上凿出足够的洞，使孢子散开</p>\n<p>@Check[crafting|dc:33] (master) three times to knock holes in the floor without triggering the spore cloud while simultaneously lightening the strain on the floor so it can be walked upon, @Check[stealth|dc:36] (expert) to move carefully through the room for the remainder of your turn without triggering the hazard, or @Check[nature|dc:36] (expert) twice once the trap is triggered to knock enough holes into the nearby walls to cause the spores to disperse</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>脆弱的地板在一声巨响中塌陷，将房间里的所有东西都坠入一片满是有毒霉菌的泥泞泥沼之中。</p>\n<p>The weakened floor gives way with a tremendous crash, dropping everything in the room into a muddy morass of toxic mold.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>房间里没有任何东西移动后的1分钟，孢子会沉降下来。地面仍然明显可见，且不会进一步塌陷，但任何穿过霉菌的生物一旦移动，都会使孢子再次腾起，重新触发陷阱。</p>\n<p>One minute after nothing moves in the room, the spores settle down. The floor remains obvious and won't collapse further, but any creature that moves through the mold causes the spores to plume up again, re-triggering the trap.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（1动作）每轮在其回合，现已充满区域 <strong>A4</strong> 的孢子会对房间内所有生物造成 @Damage[8d6[poison]] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:30|basic] 豁免），因为云雾会灼烧暴露的皮肤；屏住呼吸的生物在此豁免上获得+4环境加值。</p>\n<p>(1 action) Every round on its turn, the spores that now fill area <strong>A4</strong> inflict @Damage[8d6[poison]] damage to all creatures in the room (@Check[fortitude|dc:30|basic] save) as the cloud burns at exposed flesh; a creature that holds its breath gains a +4 circumstance bonus to this saving throw.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（大师）</p>\n<p>(master)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "脆弱的地板 Weakened Floor"
        },
        "Monk of Kugaptee": {
          "name": "苦迦菩提武僧 Monk of Kugaptee",
          "tokenName": "苦迦菩提武僧 Monk of Kugaptee",
          "items": {
