            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Brawling Critical": {
              "name": "徒手搏斗大成功 Brawling Critical",
              "description": "<p>当一名苦迦菩提的武僧用拳打击或带有武僧（特征）的武器打出大成功或大失败时，目标必须在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:24] 豁免中成功，否则将获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，直到该武僧下个回合结束。</p>\n<p>When a monk of Kugaptee scores a critical hit with a fist Strike or a weapon with the monk trait, the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:24] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until the end of the monk's next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Sagebane": {
              "name": "智者灾厄 Sagebane",
              "description": "<p>当苦迦菩提武僧用拳打击或带有武僧（特征）的武器对一名活体生物造成伤害时，目标必须成功通过一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:24] 豁免，否则将获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>苦迦菩提武僧后续造成的伤害会将持续时间重置为1分钟，并且在豁免失败时使呆滞数值提高1点，最大提高至 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 4}。</p>\n<p>When the monk of Kugaptee damages a living creature with a fist Strike or a weapon with the monk trait, the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:24] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Further damage dealt by the monk of Kugaptee resets the duration to 1 minute and increases the stupefied value by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 4}.</p>"
            },
            "Scarlet Apoxia": {
              "name": "猩红窒息症 Scarlet Apoxia",
              "description": "<p>目标无法从猩红缺氧导致的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} 状态中恢复，直到该疾病被治愈为止</p>\n<p><strong>豁免</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:24]</p><hr /><p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 携带者，无不良效果（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} 和疲乏（状态）（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} 和疲乏（状态）（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> 死亡（因猩红缺氧而死亡的生物，会在死亡后24小时转生术为一个等级等于或低于其原本等级的灵堕魔，除非遗体得到了恰当的葬礼；一旦转生术发生，在其所转生的灵堕魔首先被杀死之前，该死亡生物无法恢复为其原本的生命）</p>\n<p>The target can't recover from the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} condition caused by scarlet apoxia until the disease is cured</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:24]</p><hr /><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} and fatigued (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} and fatigued (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> dead (a creature that dies of scarlet apoxia reincarnates as a nindoru of equal or lower level 24 hours after death unless the body is given a proper funeral; once reincarnation occurs, the dead creature can't be restored to its original life until after the nindoru it reincarnates into is first slain)</p>"
            },
            "Steal Breath": {
              "name": "窃取呼吸 Steal Breath",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 苦迦菩提僧侣与一个活着的生物相邻，该生物处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}、缓慢、震慑或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 苦迦菩提僧侣俯身从目标口中吸走气息，目标必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:22] 豁免。无论结果如何，该生物都会暴露于猩红缺氧症，并且其呼吸会散发腐烂野花的恶臭，持续1分钟。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物在1分钟内无法说话。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}，并在1分钟内无法说话。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，外加该生物陷入昏迷并开始窒息。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The monk of Kugaptee is adjacent to a living creature that's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}, slowed, stunned, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The monk of Kugaptee leans over and sucks the breath from the target, who must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:22] save. Regardless of the result, the creature is exposed to scarlet apoxia and its breath reeks of rotting wildflowers for 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can't speak for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} and can't speak for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, plus the creature falls unconscious and begins suffocating.</p>"
            },
            "Stunning Flurry": {
              "name": "震慑连击 Stunning Flurry",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 苦迦菩提武僧进行两次拳击打击。若两次都命中同一个生物，则在计算抗力与弱点时将它们的伤害合并，且目标必须在一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:22|traits:incapacitation] 豁免中成功，否则将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}（若大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 3}）；此豁免具有失能（特征）特征。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The monk of Kugaptee makes two fist Strikes. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purposes of resistances and weaknesses, and the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:22|traits:incapacitation] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 3} on a critical failure); this save has the incapacitation trait.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>生前违背了自己僧院誓言的武僧，死后可能会再度爬起，化为一种名为黑坊主的不死恐怖。它们是以掠食为生的怪物，啜食凡人的呼吸，拖着扭曲的肢体悄然潜入卧室，从沉睡的受害者身上窃取生命。这样的进食会在受害者身上留下痕迹：受害者呼出的气息带着一股令人作呕的腐臭味，并感染上一种使人衰弱的疾病，最终导致精疲力竭，继而死亡。</p>\n<p>黑坊主仍保留着苦修训练的残响，使它们能在战斗中从虚弱的敌人身上吸走呼吸。它们恶毒的狡诈与苦修的纪律相结合，使其能够编织冗长而精密的阴谋，以施行其嫉妒的复仇。几乎没有黑坊主能有足够的说服力，去劝诱昔日的盟友违背他们自己的誓言，但这并不会阻止它们尝试。</p>\n<p>A monk who violated their monastic vows in life might arise after death to become an undead horror known as a kurobozu. These predators feast upon the breath of mortals, creeping on twisted limbs into bedrooms to steal the life from sleeping victims. This act of feeding leaves its mark on the victim in the form of a vile scent of rot on the victim's breath and a debilitating disease that eventually results in exhaustion and finally death.</p>\n<p>Kurobozus retain echoes of their ascetic training, enabling them to suck the breath from debilitated foes in the midst of battle. Their malevolent cunning combined with ascetic discipline helps them concoct elaborate and lengthy schemes to enact their jealous revenge. Few kurobozus are convincing enough to persuade their onetime allies to break their own oaths, but this doesn't stop them from making the attempt.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：黑坊主\nVariant kurobozu",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "苦迦菩提僧侣 Monk of Kugaptee"
        },
