            "Fan of Falling Words": {
              "name": "落语扇 Fan of Falling Words",
              "description": "<p>这把可折叠的手持纸扇在初次发现时似乎一片空白，但若持用者以<strong>交互</strong>动作展开扇叶，其上便会显现一幅由持用者自选的水墨画。扇子必须先合上再重新展开，才能显示不同的画作。持握期间，<em>落语扇</em>使你在进行用于表演或演出喜剧、演说或歌唱的表演检定时获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 命令术，交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你将言语编织成锦缎，使你在扇上描绘的图像从扇叶上一跃而出。扇子依照你的设定施放@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage}（@Check[type:will|dc:27] 意志豁免以识破）。尽管这只需要三个动作即可完成（而非该法术通常需要10分钟的施放时间），但该效果没有射程，且其创造的@Template[type:burst|distance:50]以你为中心。</p>\n<p>This folding handheld paper fan appears blank when first found, but if the wielder unfolds its leaves as an Interact action, they display an ink-brush painting of the wielder's choice. The fan must be closed and opened again to display a different painting. While held, the <em>fan of falling words</em> grants you a +2 item bonus to Performance checks to act or perform comedy, orate, or sing.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> command, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You manifest the tapestry of your words, causing the image you depict on the fan to leap off its leaves. The fan casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage} to your specifications (@Check[type:will|dc:27] save to disbelieve). While this only takes three actions to perform (as opposed to the spell's normal 10 minutes of casting), the effect has no range, and the @Template[type:burst|distance:50] it creates is centered on you.</p>"
            },
            "Panaceatic Salve": {
              "name": "万灵膏药 Panaceatic Salve",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这种气味刺鼻的草药软膏最初仅用于止痛。不过，围绕这种万灵膏药的民间传说宣称它无所不能，从退烧到驱赶吸血鬼（特征）都行；这种名声即便别无其他，也很容易让人随波逐流地相信。你通过将一剂万灵膏药涂抹在皮肤上来启动它时，你获得4d8+10点临时生命值，持续10分钟。在此持续时间结束时，若你仍保留至少1点此类临时生命值，你可以对一种你正受其影响且仍在持续的疾病或毒素苦难进行一次新的豁免检定；若你在该豁免检定中失败或大失败，你不会使该苦难的阶段提高。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.QBujqOaTXzqM13Cy]{效果：万灵膏药}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This pungent herbal ointment was originally only intended for use as an analgesic. That being said, popular folklore around this salve claims it can do anything from curing fevers to repelling vampires, a reputation that, if nothing else, is easy to get swept up in. When you activate a dose of panaceatic salve by rubbing it on your skin, you gain 4d8+10 temporary Hit Points for 10 minutes. At the end of this duration, if you still retain at least 1 of these temporary Hit Points, you can attempt a new saving throw against an ongoing disease or poison affliction you're afflicted with; if you fail or critically fail this saving throw, you don't increase the affliction's stage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.QBujqOaTXzqM13Cy]{Effect: Panaceatic Salve}</p>"
            },
            "Potion of Quickness": {
              "name": "迅捷药水 Potion of Quickness",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>饮用这瓶银色药水会使你获得<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.o6YCGx4lycsYpww4]{加速术}</em>的效果，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Drinking this silver potion grants you the effects of <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.o6YCGx4lycsYpww4]{Haste}</em> for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Healing Potion (Greater)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（强效） Healing Potion (Greater)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色的液体，饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时会感到一阵刺痛。你饮用一瓶<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复[[/r (6d8+20)[healing]]]{6d8+20 生命值}。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain [[/r (6d8+20)[healing]]]{6d8+20 Hit Points}.</p>"
            },
            "Wooden Potion Holder Carved to Look like a Coiled Dragon": {
              "name": "雕刻成盘绕巨龙造型的木制药水夹持器 Wooden Potion Holder Carved to Look like a Coiled Dragon"
            },
            "Cherry Wood Case Decorated with Images of Fish": {
              "name": "饰有鱼类图像的樱桃木匣 Cherry Wood Case Decorated with Images of Fish"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "毁坏的房间 Ruined Rooms"
        },
        "Giant Stag Beetle": {
          "name": "巨锹甲虫 Giant Stag Beetle",
          "tokenName": "巨锹甲虫 Giant Stag Beetle",
          "items": {
            "Mandibles": {
              "name": "颚骨 Mandibles"
            },
            "Foot": {
              "name": "足 Foot"
            },
            "Trample": {
              "name": "践踏 Trample",
              "description": "<p>中型或更小，足部，@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>\n<p>Medium or smaller, foot, @Check[reflex|dc:21|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>巨锹甲虫比马还大，而看到它挥动巨大的嗡鸣翅膀飞行（尽管缓慢且有些笨拙）会令人不安。它巨大的颚用于吸引配偶、威慑对手并驱退捕食者，因为它们能够造成致命打击。尽管巨锹甲虫是致命的捕食者，熟练的驯兽人仍能将其驯化。在这种情况下，这些甲虫很适合作为驮兽，甚至作为坐骑。</p>\n<p>在沼泽、洞窟群以及茂密森林中，巨锹甲虫可能构成严重威胁。不止一个伐木营地曾吸引来一群巨锹甲虫，最终不得不彻底弃置，把所有木材都让给这些巨型昆虫的饥饿。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>并非所有甲虫都是无害的生物，能轻易被踩在脚下碾碎。体型硕大且贪食的巨型甲虫遍布世界各处的温带与热带地区。它们往往性情温和，但一旦受到威胁或被激怒，巨型甲虫便相当危险。它们强有力的颚与坚韧的外骨骼，使其成为难缠的对手。</p>\n<p>The giant stag beetle is larger than a horse, and the sight of one flying (if slowly and somewhat clumsily) on great buzzing wings is unnerving. Its enormous mandibles are used to impress mates, intimidate rivals, and discourage predators, for they can deliver deadly blows. While giant stag beetles are deadly predators, skilled wranglers can domesticate them. In such a capacity, these beetles serve well as beasts of burden or even as mounts.</p>\n<p>Giant stag beetles can be a serious menace in marshes, cavern complexes, and heavy forests. More than one logging camp has attracted a cluster of giant stag beetles and had to be completely abandoned, yielding all its lumber to the hunger of the giant insects.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Not all beetles are harmless creatures that can be easily crushed underfoot. Oversized and ravenous giant beetles can be found throughout the temperate and tropical regions of the world. They are often benign creatures, though when threatened or roused, giant beetles are quite dangerous. Their powerful mandibles and tough exoskeletons make for a challenging combatant.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "巨锹甲虫 Giant Stag Beetle"
        },
        "Vulture's Nest": {
          "name": "秃鹫巢穴 Vulture's Nest",
          "tokenName": "秃鹫巢穴 Vulture's Nest",
          "items": {
            "Grim Trophy": {
              "name": "阴森战利品 Grim Trophy",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p><hr /><p>这枚护符有多种形态，最常见的是以某种骇人的方式展示的一段被切下的人形生物肢体。当你启动该战利品时，进行一次威吓检定，以 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{挫败士气}至多两个目标，将你的威吓检定结果与他们各自的 DC 进行比较。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p><hr /><p>This talisman comes in many forms, most often a severed piece of a humanoid creature displayed in some gruesome manner. When you activate the trophy, make an Intimidation check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} up to two targets, comparing your Intimidation check result to both of their DCs.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "秃鹫巢 Vulture's Nest"
        },
        "Shrine": {
          "name": "圣祠 Shrine",
          "tokenName": "圣坛 Shrine",
          "items": {
            "Thurible of Revelation (Lesser)": {
              "name": "启示香炉（次级） Thurible of Revelation (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p>这件启示香炉上装饰着杉树的图案。</p><hr /><p>这只黄铜香炉悬在一段链子上。大多数<em>启示香炉</em>都饰有盘旋的天界文字，不过也有一些是铁制的，并带有炼狱或地底文字。</p><p><strong>启动—焚香</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p><p><strong>花费</strong> 价值至少 5 gp 的香</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你点燃香炉内的香，香会燃烧 1 小时。在此期间，只要你持握该香炉，你在宗教检定上获得 +1 物品加值，并且当你进行宗教性质的破译文字时，你掷出的任何大失败改为失败。</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lO95TwgihBdTilAB]{效果：启示香炉}</p>\n<p>This thurible of revelation decorated with images of sugi trees.</p><hr /><p>This brass censer dangles on a length of chain. Most <em>thuribles of revelation</em> are adorned with swirling Empyrean text, though some are iron and feature Diabolic or Chthonian text.</p><p><strong>Activate—Burn Incense</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p><p><strong>Cost</strong> incense worth at least 5 gp</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You light the incense inside the censer, and it burns for 1 hour. During that time, as long you are holding the thurible, you gain a +1 item bonus to Religion checks, and any critical failure you roll when you Decipher Writing of a religious nature is a failure instead.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lO95TwgihBdTilAB]{Effect: Thurible of Revelation}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "圣坛 Shrine"
        },
        "Yeri's Bracelet": {
          "name": "耶里之手镯 Yeri's Bracelet",
          "tokenName": "耶里的神圣祈祷念珠 Yeri's Holy Prayer Beads",
          "items": {
            "Yeri's Bracelet": {
              "name": "耶里之手镯 Yeri's Bracelet",
              "description": "<p>这只手镯上装有一个护符，描绘着善解的轮状符号。这只手镯相当于一枚抗力护符，提供对心灵伤害的抗力5。</p><hr /><p>这枚护符通常挂在腰带上或戴在颈间，使你对一种能量伤害获得抗力5：酸、寒冷、电击、火焰或音波。每枚护符都被制作成用来防护某一种特定的能量伤害，其设计通常会以某种方式体现它所保护佩戴者免受的那种能量。比如，一枚<em>寒冷抗力护符</em>可能被雕刻成雪人的形状，而一枚<em>火焰抗力护符</em>则会由火山玻璃制成。</p>\n<p>This bracelet is fitted with a charm depicting the wheel-like symbol of Sangpotshi. This bracelet functions as a charm of resistance that provides resistance 5 against mental damage.</p><hr /><p>This charm, normally hung from the belt or worn around the neck, grants you resistance 5 against one type of energy damage: acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic. Each charm is crafted to protect against a particular type of energy damage, and its design usually embodies the type of energy it protects the wearer from in some way. For instance, a <em>charm of cold resistance</em> could be carved in the shape of a yeti, whereas a <em>charm of fire resistance</em> would be made from volcanic glass.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "耶里的神圣祈祷念珠 Yeri's Holy Prayer Beads"
        },
        "Yen Rui's Poltergeist": {
          "name": "严蕊的骚灵 Yen Rui's Poltergeist",
          "tokenName": "颜睿的骚灵 Yen Rui's Poltergeist",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Telekinetic Maneuver (At Will)": {
              "name": "念动战技（随意） Telekinetic Maneuver (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>伴随着一阵念动力量的冲击，你移动一个敌人或其所携带的某件东西。你可以尝试对目标进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{缴械}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.7blmbDrQFNfdT731]{推撞}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.lOE4yjUnETTdaf2T]{重新定位}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{绊摔}，并用法术攻击掷骰代替运动检定。</p>\n<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{Disarm}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.7blmbDrQFNfdT731]{Shove}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.lOE4yjUnETTdaf2T]{Reposition}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造一只漂浮的魔法手（可选择隐形或呈幽灵般半透明），它会抓住目标物体，并使其缓慢地向任意方向漂浮移动最多 20 尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以让该物体额外移动 20 尺。若该法术结束时物体仍在空中，则该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以一件无人持用且负载为 1 或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程提高至 60 尺，且你可以以一件无人持用且负载为 1 或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程提高至 60 尺，且你可以以一件无人持用且负载为 2 或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Invisible": {
              "name": "隐形 Invisible",
              "description": "<p>你无法被看见。你对所有人都处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪} 状态。生物可以使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 来侦测你；如果某个生物在其察觉检定中成功对抗你的隐匿DC，你会对该生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿} 状态，直到你使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{潜行} 再次变为无踪为止。如果你在有人已经能看见你时变为隐形，你起初对他们处于藏匿（而非无踪）状态，直到你成功潜行为止。隐形时，你无法变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.1wQY3JYyhMYeeV2G]{被观察} 状态，除非通过特殊能力或魔法。</p>\n<p>You can't be seen. You're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to everyone. Creatures can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} to detect you; if a creature succeeds at its Perception check against your Stealth DC, you become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to that creature until you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{Sneak} to become undetected again. If you become invisible while someone can already see you, you start out hidden to them (instead of undetected) until you successfully Sneak. You can't become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.1wQY3JYyhMYeeV2G]{Observed} while invisible except via special abilities or magic.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Object": {
              "name": "念动力物体 Telekinetic Object",
              "description": "<p>伤害类型取决于被投掷的物体</p>\n<p>Damage type depends on object thrown</p>"
            },
            "Site Bound": {
              "name": "场地束缚 Site Bound",
              "description": "<p>骚灵与某个地点相连，无法从其被创造或形成之处移动超过120英尺。有些骚灵则被束缚在特定的房间、建筑或类似区域内</p>\n<p>A poltergeist is tied to a location and can't travel more than 120 feet from the place where it was created or formed. Some poltergeists are instead bound to a specific room, building, or similar area</p>"
            },
            "Natural Invisibility": {
              "name": "自然隐形 Natural Invisibility",
              "description": "<p>骚灵天生处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}状态。只有当它使用“惊吓”时才会变得可见。</p>\n<p>A poltergeist is naturally @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. It becomes visible only when it uses Frighten.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>当骚灵被摧毁时，它会在[[/br 2d4 #Rejuvenation]]{2d4天}后于其被摧毁之处重组，并完全恢复。只有当有人查明其存在的原因，并纠正任何阻止其魂魄休息之事时，骚灵才会被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>When a poltergeist is destroyed, it reforms, fully healed, where it was destroyed after [[/br 2d4 #Rejuvenation]]{2d4 days}. A poltergeist can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Defense": {
              "name": "念动力防御 Telekinetic Defense",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物接近到骚灵10英尺内</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 骚灵对触发生物进行一次念动力物体打击。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature approaches within 10 feet of the poltergeist</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The poltergeist makes a telekinetic object Strike against the triggering creature.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Frighten": {
              "name": "恐吓 Frighten",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 骚灵必须处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 骚灵变得可见，显现为一个骷髅般、幽灵似的人形。30英尺内的每个生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:21] 意志豁免，失败则变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}。大失败时，只要其仍处于惊惧状态，它还会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing}。成功时，该生物在1分钟内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>在其下一个回合开始时，骚灵再次变为隐形。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The poltergeist must be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The poltergeist becomes visible, appearing as a skeletal, ghostlike humanoid. Each creature within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a failure. On a critical failure, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it's frightened. On a success, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>At the start of its next turn, the poltergeist becomes invisible again.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Storm": {
              "name": "念动力风暴 Telekinetic Storm",
              "description": "<p>骚灵用念动力投掷大量小物体，例如几十件银餐具或书本，要么将它们分散攻击多个敌人，要么将它们集中指向一个目标。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当该效果分散到多个敌人身上时，骚灵对位于 @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30尺} 内的每个生物，以-2减值进行一次念动力物体打击。这些打击对骚灵的多重攻击减值而言计作一次攻击，并且在所有攻击完成前，该减值不会增加。</li>\n<li>当该效果只有一个目标时，骚灵对该目标进行一次念动力物体打击，且伤害提高至3d12。若结果为失败，则造成 @Damage[1d12[untyped]] 伤害；若结果为大失败，则不造成伤害。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The poltergeist telekinetically throws numerous small objects, such as dozens of pieces of silverware or books, either spreading them out among multiple foes or directing them at one target.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When this effect is spread out among multiple foes, the poltergeist makes a telekinetic object Strike at a -2 penalty against each creature within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet}. These count as one attack for the poltergeist's multiple attack penalty, and the penalty doesn't increase until after all the attacks.</li>\n<li>When this effect has only one target, the poltergeist makes a telekinetic object Strike against the target, and the damage increases to 3d12. It deals @Damage[1d12[untyped]] damage on a failure, and no damage on a critical failure.</li>\n</ul>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>当一个生物死亡时，如果因任何原因其魂魄无法或不愿离开其死亡之地，该魂魄可能会显现为骚灵：一种躁动不安、看不见的魂魄，仍然能够操纵实体物体。许多骚灵的死亡方式源于或导致了极端的情感创伤。</p>\n<p>When a creature dies, and for whatever reason its spirit is unable or unwilling to leave the site of its death, that spirit may manifest as a poltergeist: a restless, invisible spirit that is still able to manipulate physical objects. Many poltergeists perished in a way that resulted from or led to extreme emotional trauma.</p>",
          "blurb": "精英骚灵\nElite poltergeist",
          "hp": "void healing, rejuvenation",
          "prototypeToken": "严锐的骚灵 Yen Rui's Poltergeist"
        },
