            "Lamellar Breastplate": {
              "name": "札甲胸甲 Lamellar Breastplate",
              "description": "<p>大多数札甲胸甲由上漆钢片或其他金属片组成，并用皮革或丝绳串联固定。上漆可防止金属腐蚀。</p>\n<p>Slats of lacquered steel or other metal held together with cord, whether leather or silk, make up most lamellar breastplates. The lacquering prevents the metal from corroding.</p>"
