              "description": "<p>孙海在背部和胸前刻有复杂的魔法纹身，以便更容易与他的幽灵主人交互。孙海使用的武器和徒手攻击视为幽冥武器，并且他以近战打击对抗虚体生物或转生的PC时会额外造成2d6点心灵伤害。</p>\n<p>Mago Kai had intricate magical tattoos inscribed on his back and chest to interact more easily with his ghostly masters. Weapons and unarmed attacks wielded by Mago Kai function as ghost touch weapons, and he inflicts an additional 2d6 mental damage with melee Strikes against incorporeal creatures or transmigrated PCs.</p>"
