        "Arboreal Reaper": {
          "name": "林木收割者 Arboreal Reaper",
          "tokenName": "树木死神 Arboreal Reaper",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Speak with Plants (Constant)": {
              "name": "植物交谈（恒常） Speak with Plants (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你可以向植物和真菌提问并获得回答，但该法术不会使它们比平常更友善或更聪明。大多数普通植物和真菌对周围世界有其独特的看法，因此它们无法识别关于生物的细节，也不了解其近旁范围之外的世界。狡猾的植物或真菌怪物很可能言辞简短且闪烁其词，而较不聪明的则常会发表一些愚蠢的评论。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>You can ask questions of and receive answers from plants and fungi, but the spell doesn't make them more friendly or intelligent than normal. Most normal plants and fungi have a distinctive view of the world around them, so they don't recognize details about creatures or know anything about the world beyond their immediate vicinity. Cunning plant or fungus monsters are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Vampiric Feast": {
              "name": "吸血盛宴 Vampiric Feast",
              "description": "<p>你的接触从一个目标身上汲取生命精华以强化自身。你对目标造成6d6虚空伤害。你获得等于目标所受虚空伤害一半的临时生命值（在结算抗力等之后）。1分钟后，你失去所有剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 void damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the void damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Branch": {
              "name": "分支 Branch"
            },
            "Root": {
              "name": "根源 Root"
            },
            "Thorns": {
              "name": "荆棘 Thorns"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "持续法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Axe Vulnerability": {
              "name": "斧类弱点 Axe Vulnerability",
              "description": "<p>树栖收割者会因斧类武器而额外受到5点伤害。</p>\n<p>An arboreal reaper takes 5 additional damage from axes.</p>"
            },
            "Leech Moisture": {
              "name": "汲取水分 Leech Moisture",
              "description": "<p>树木收割者停下动作，专注于50英尺内的一个敌人，从目标的身体中抽取水分。这造成 @Damage[10d6[void]] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:25|basic] 豁免）。</p>\n<p>树木收割者在 [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Leech Moisture]]{1d4轮} 内无法再次使用吸取水分。</p>\n<p>The arboreal reaper grows still and focuses intently on a single foe within 50 feet, draining moisture from the target's body. This deals @Damage[10d6[void]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:25|basic] save).</p>\n<p>The arboreal reaper can't Leech Moisture again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Leech Moisture]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            },
            "Knockdown": {
              "name": "击倒 Knockdown",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Knockdown]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>有些森林带着田园诗般的宁静与祥和，另一些却让人感到明显不友善，甚至阴森可怖——这些森林是树木收割者偏爱的作祟之地。有时，这些林地会吸引行事隐秘、钻研恶毒艺术的修行者前来，他们宣称这种令人不安的氛围能协助他们的能力；只要不损害森林的保持平衡，树木收割者就觉得没有理由干涉这类行径。</p>\n<p>所有树灵的外观都会随周遭环境而变化，但树木收割者无论守望的是阴郁的林地还是热带雨林，总显得隐约诡异。它们往往略微变形、扭曲，遍布尖刺状突起；树木收割者有时会在老旧废墟或其他永久性结构周围萌生，随着成长并变得更具机动性，它们会将这些结构打碎、分解，并将其纳入自身。</p>\n<p>树木收割者专注于森林生命周期中至关重要的腐朽阶段，在秋冬季节尤为活跃。它们的影响常可见于腐烂圆木上蘑菇的爆发式生长，或是一株繁盛食肉植物那诱人的叶片。与树木守卫者相似，这些林地的守护者比起更为审慎的摄政者或隐退的档案者，更快对自认为的威胁作出反应——至少以树灵的标准来说是如此。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>树灵是如树一般的远古森林守护者，培育新生长，并维持平衡的生态系统，仿佛广袤荒野就是它们的花园。树灵思虑周全、行事审慎——直到有什么威胁到它们的领地，招致它们的怒火。</p>\n<p>While some forests have an idyllic, peaceful quality to them, others feel distinctly unfriendly or even sinister-these forests are the favored haunts of arboreal reapers. Sometimes these woodlands are sought out by secretive practitioners of malicious arts who claim the unsettling ambiance aids their abilities; arboreal reapers see no reason to interfere with such practices as long as the balance of their forests isn't harmed.</p>\n<p>All arboreals vary in appearance based on their surroundings, but arboreal reapers always seem vaguely eerie, whether they watch over a grim weald or a tropical rain forest. Often slightly warped, twisted, and covered in spiky protrusions, arboreal reapers sometimes sprout around old ruins or other permanent structures, breaking down and incorporating the structures as they mature and become more mobile.</p>\n<p>Arboreal reapers focus on the essential decaying phase of a forest's life cycle, becoming especially active in autumn and winter seasons. Their influence can often be seen in the explosion of mushrooms on a rotting log or the enticing fronds of a flourishing carnivorous plant. Like arboreal wardens, these woodland guardians are quicker to react to perceived threats than the more deliberate regents or retiring archives-at least by arboreal standards.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Arboreals are tree-like ancient guardians of forests, nurturing new growth and maintaining a balanced ecosystem as if the vast wilderness were their garden. Arboreals are thoughtful and deliberate - until something threatens their realms and invites their wrath.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "树木收割者 Arboreal Reaper"
        },
        "Wooden Box": {
          "name": "木箱 Wooden Box",
          "tokenName": "木箱 Wooden Box",
          "items": {
            "Energizing Pill": {
              "name": "提神丹 Energizing Pill",
              "description": "<p>这种特殊调配的强效草药被制成紧实的小丸，便于含在口中，并可在口中保持1小时。提神丹起初味道苦涩，但含得越久，滋味就越发复杂甜美。它会提升你的反应能力，使你以察觉进行的先攻掷骰获得+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.YsgABP1Ya0QJoiKt]{效果：提神丹}</p>\n<p><strong>次要效果</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span></p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你将变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{枯竭}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 将你刚获得的该状态的数值降低1；如果这使其数值降至0，你不会获得该触发状态。</p>\n<p>This special blend of potent herbs comes in the form of a compact ball that allows it to be held in the mouth, where it remains for 1 hour. An energizing pill has a bitter taste at first, but the longer one lets it soak, the more complex and sweet its flavor grows. It heightens your reactions, granting you a +2 item bonus to initiative rolls with Perception.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.YsgABP1Ya0QJoiKt]{Effect: Energizing Pill}</p>\n<p><strong>Secondary Effect</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span></p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Reduce the value of the condition you just gained by 1; if this reduces the value to 0, you don't gain the triggering condition.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "木箱 Wooden Box"
        },
        "Pendant of the Occult": {
          "name": "异能吊坠 Pendant of the Occult",
          "tokenName": "异能吊坠 Pendant of the Occult",
          "items": {
            "Pendant of the Occult": {
              "name": "异能吊坠 Pendant of the Occult",
              "description": "<p>这枚护身符是中空的，外形如同一只不眨眼的眼睛。其空腔通常装着一些神秘学文本的残片。佩戴这枚坠饰时，你在神秘学检定上获得+1物品加值，并且你可以将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.izcxFQFwf3woCnFs]{神导术} 戏法作为一项神秘学天生法术施放。</p>\n<p>This amulet is hollow and shaped in the form of an unblinking eye. Its cavity typically holds some fragment of occult text. While wearing the pendant, you gain a +1 item bonus to Occultism checks, and you can cast the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.izcxFQFwf3woCnFs]{Guidance} cantrip as an occult innate spell.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "异能吊坠 Pendant of the Occult"
        },
        "Zheng Peng": {
          "name": "郑鹏 Zheng Peng",
          "tokenName": "郑鹏 Zheng Peng",
          "items": {
            "Crossbow": {
              "name": "弩 Crossbow"
            },
            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger",
              "description": "<p>这把小型带刃武器可单手持用，用于在近战中刺击一名生物。它也可以投掷。</p>\n<p>This small, bladed weapon is held in one hand and used to stab a creature in close combat. It can also be thrown.</p>"
            },
            "Warhammer": {
              "name": "战锤 Warhammer"
            },
            "Steel Shield": {
              "name": "钢盾 Steel Shield",
              "description": "<p>和木制盾牌一样，钢制盾牌也有多种形状与体型。尽管比木制盾牌更昂贵，但它们要耐用得多。</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>硬度</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Like wooden shields, steel shields come in a variety of shapes and sizes. Though more expensive than wooden shields, they are much more durable.</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Hardness</th><th>HP</th><th>BT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>10</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            },
            "Breastplate": {
              "name": "胸甲 Breastplate",
              "description": "<p>尽管被称为胸甲，这种护甲由数块板甲或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pRoikbRo5HFW6YUB]{半身板甲}的部件组成，用以保护躯干、胸部、颈部，有时也保护臀部和小腿。它在策略上提供了部分板甲的防护，同时允许更大的灵活性和速度。</p>\n<p>Though referred to as a breastplate, this type of armor consists of several pieces of plate or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pRoikbRo5HFW6YUB]{Half Plate} armor that protect the torso, chest, neck, and sometimes the hips and lower legs. It strategically grants some of the protection of plate while allowing greater flexibility and speed.</p>"
            },
            "Signal Whistle": {
              "name": "信号哨子 Signal Whistle",
              "description": "<p>吹响时，信号哨可在开阔地形中清晰地被听见，最远可达半英里。</p>\n<p>When sounded, a signal whistle can be heard clearly up to half a mile away across open terrain.</p>"
            },
            "Bolts": {
              "name": "弩矢 Bolts",
              "description": "<p>弩矢比传统箭矢更短，但结构相似，是弩使用的弹药。</p>\n<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "+1 to Sense Motive": {
              "name": "察言观色+1 +1 to Sense Motive"
            },
            "Air of Authority": {
              "name": "权威气场 Air of Authority",
              "description": "<p>10尺。光环内与守卫军官同等级或更低等级的生物，在对抗守卫军官试图对其进行[[/act coerce]]或[[/act demoralize]]的意志DC时，承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>10 feet. Creatures in the aura who are the same or lower level than the watch officer take a -2 status penalty to their Will DC against the watch officer's attempts to [[/act coerce]] or [[/act demoralize]] them.</p>"
            },
            "Bravery": {
              "name": "勇武 Bravery",
              "description": "<p>当瞭望军官在对抗一个恐惧效果的意志豁免中掷出成功时，改为获得大成功或大失败。此外，每当他们获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态）} 状态时，将其数值减少 1。</p>\n<p>When the watch officer rolls a success on a Will save against a fear effect, they get a critical success instead. In addition, any time they gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened} condition, reduce its value by 1.</p>"
            },
            "Reactive Strike": {
              "name": "反应打击 Reactive Strike",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>"
            },
            "Shield Block": {
              "name": "护盾格挡 Shield Block",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ShieldBlock]</p>"
            },
            "Sudden Charge": {
              "name": "突然冲锋 Sudden Charge",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 值勤军官行走两次。若其在移动结束时位于至少一个敌人的近战触及范围内，则其可以对该敌人进行一次近战打击。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The watch officer Strides twice. If they end their movement within melee reach of at least one enemy, they can make a melee Strike against that enemy.</p>"
            },
            "Legal Lore": {
              "name": "法律学识 Legal Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>通常带领一支由低阶卫兵组成的小队，巡逻官会在其负责的区域内巡逻，以维持秩序并执行法律。巡逻官会把事情办妥，尽管他们的方法并不总是温和或仁慈。</p><hr /><p>更大的社会依赖那些拥有权力且有能力解释并执行法律的人。有些人会公正地履行这些职责，但也有人严酷而残忍，对任何无力为宽恕买单的人施以严厉惩罚。</p>\n<p>Often leading a small team of lower-ranking guards, watch officers patrol their assigned areas to maintain order and enforce laws. Watch officers get the job done, though their methods aren't always gentle or kind.</p><hr /><p>Larger societies rely on those with the authority and the ability to interpret and enforce laws. Some carry out these duties fairly, but others are harsh and cruel, imposing severe punishments on anyone unable to pay for clemency.</p>",
          "ac": "(21 with shield raised)",
          "prototypeToken": "郑鹏 Zheng Peng"
        },
        "Xungu": {
          "name": "蕈菇 Xungu",
          "tokenName": "蕈菇 Xungu",
          "items": {
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Telepathy 100 feet (Myceloids and Those Afflicted by Purple Pox Only)": {
              "name": "心灵感应 100英尺（仅限菌体人及感染紫痘者） Telepathy 100 feet (Myceloids and Those Afflicted by Purple Pox Only)",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Spore Pop": {
              "name": "孢子爆裂 Spore Pop",
              "description": "<p>如果菌体人因大成功的攻击而降至 0 HP，它会爆裂，迫使它立即释放孢子，即使它当天已经使用过该能力。</p>\n<p>If a myceloid is reduced to 0 HP by a critical hit, it pops, forcing it to immediately Emit Spores, even if it has already used the ability that day.</p>"
            },
            "Emit Spores": {
              "name": "孢子迸发 Emit Spores",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 菌体人在以其自身空间的一个角为中心的 @Template[burst|distance:10] 内喷出孢子。这团云雾持续到菌体人下个回合开始。每个处于云雾中或进入云雾的生物都会暴露于紫痘。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The myceloid expels spores in a @Template[burst|distance:10] centered on a corner of its own space. This cloud lasts until the start of the myceloid's next turn. Each creature that is in the cloud or enters it is exposed to purple pox.</p>"
            },
            "Purple Pox": {
              "name": "紫痘 Purple Pox",
              "description": "<p>菌体人免疫</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:20]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>潜伏期</strong> 1分钟</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] 伤害并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[6d6[poison]] 伤害、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 3}，且该生物被驱使去寻找最近的菌体人殖民地——这种驱使是一种心灵情绪效果（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> 该生物死亡。在24小时内，它的尸体会膨胀并爆裂，释放出一个新生的、完全长成的菌体人。</p>\n<p>Myceloids are immune</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:20]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 minute</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[6d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 3}, and the creature is compelled to seek out the nearest myceloid colony-this compulsion is a mental emotion effect (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> The creature dies. Over 24 hours, its corpse becomes bloated and bursts, releasing a new, fully grown myceloid.</p>"
            },
            "Spore Domination": {
              "name": "孢子支配 Spore Domination",
              "description": "<p>菌体人选择60尺内一个受紫痘影响的生物作为目标。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:22] 意志豁免。</p>\n<p>然后该生物在10分钟内暂时免疫孢子支配。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 直到其下个回合结束，目标对菌体人处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{乐于帮助} 状态，且不能对其采取敌对动作。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同成功，但持续直到紫痘被治愈。</p>\n<p>The myceloid targets one creature affected by purple pox within 60 feet. That creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save.</p>\n<p>It is then temporarily immune to spore domination for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Until the end of its next turn, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.v44P3WUcU1j0115l]{Helpful} to myceloids and can't take hostile actions against them.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but until the purple pox is cured.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>被称为菌体人的可移动真菌生物因传播致命的紫痘、控制生物心智以及吞噬类人生物的血肉而臭名昭著。对一个菌体人菌落来说，与类人生物的任何战斗都令人兴奋，因为这些新鲜饲料带来了如此多美味的可能性。</p>\n<p>菌体人认为类人生物拥有由四个简单步骤构成的理想生命循环。童年时期，他们天真而畏惧地四处游荡，对菌体人菌落一无所知。成年之后，类人生物在品尝紫痘时发现了自己真正的使命，并因菌体人的孢子而沦为奴隶。接着，他们死去，孕育出新的菌体人。随后，他们在成为菌体人的一顿餐食后被送往来世。啃食类人生物的血肉并非必需——菌体人可以靠任何腐烂物质生存——但这无疑是一种享受。</p>\n<p>菌体人很少结盟，但一旦结盟，他们会邀请新盟友共进一餐以敲定盟约。很少有外来者会欣赏这种好客。</p>\n<p>大多数菌体人有着深紫色的菌盖，上面点缀着灰白色的疙瘩。他们的颈部与躯体形似坚韧、皮革般真菌的菌柄。较小的蘑菇常常生长在菌体人的身上，生物将其视为装饰品或格外便利的啃食。他们大致与矮人一般高，体格也同样敦实。</p>\n<p>The ambulatory fungus creatures called myceloids are notorious for spreading deadly purple pox, controlling creatures' minds, and devouring humanoid flesh. For a myceloid colony, any battle with humanoids is cause for excitement, as this new fodder presents so many delicious possibilities.</p>\n<p>Myceloids consider humanoids to have an ideal life cycle of four simple steps. During childhood, they wander naive and afraid, unaware of myceloid colonies. In adulthood, humanoids discover their true purpose as they taste purple pox and become enslaved by the myceloids' spores. Next, they die, giving rise to a new myceloid. They're then sent on to the afterlife upon becoming a myceloid meal. Eating humanoid flesh is not a necessity-a myceloid can survive on any decaying matter-but it's certainly a pleasure.</p>\n<p>Myceloids rarely make alliances, but when they do, they invite their new allies to share a meal to seal the pact. Few outsiders appreciate this hospitality.</p>\n<p>Most myceloids have deep purple caps studded with off-white lumps. Their necks and bodies bear resemblance to the stipes of tough, leathery fungi. Smaller mushrooms often grow on a myceloid's body, which the creatures view as either adornments or particularly convenient snacks. They stand roughly as tall as a dwarf, with comparably stout builds.</p>",
          "blurb": "无性别菌体人\nAgender myceloid",
          "prototypeToken": "蕈菇 Xungu"
        },
        "Kappa": {
          "name": "河童 Kappa",
          "tokenName": "河童 Kappa",
          "items": {
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Head Bowl": {
              "name": "头碗 Head Bowl",
              "description": "<p>河童头顶的凹陷处盛着水。若将河童头顶的水泼洒、蒸发或以其他方式全部移除，则其所有速度降至5尺，直到该水盆再次被水填满为止。倒地的河童必须在一次@Check[reflex|dc:15]豁免中成功，否则会洒出其水；陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious}的河童会自动洒出其水。</p>\n<p>如果河童被擒抱、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}或震慑，另一名生物可以花费单动作尝试从其碗中洒出水；该动作具有攻击和操作（特征）特征，并进行一次运动检定，对抗河童的强韧DC。成功时，该生物洒出河童的水。</p>\n<p>The depression atop a kappa's head is filled with water. Spilling, evaporating, or otherwise removing all the water from the top of a kappa's head reduces all their Speeds to 5 feet until the basin is again filled with water. A kappa who becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:15] save or spill their water, and a kappa who becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} automatically spills their water.</p>\n<p>If a kappa is grappled, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, or stunned, another creature can attempt to spill the water from their bowl by spending a single action, which has the attack and manipulate traits, to attempt an Athletics check against the kappa's Fortitude DC. On a success, the creature spills the kappa's water.</p>"
            },
            "Pull Arm": {
              "name": "拉拽手臂 Pull Arm",
              "description": "<p>河童拉拽他们的一只手臂，使该手臂获得10尺触及。另一侧的手臂会缩小到几乎只剩一只手，从他们的壳中伸出。河童仍然可以用这只缩短的手拿取物品，但不能用这只手持用护盾术或武器。河童可以花费一个单动作拉拽他们的另一只手臂，使双臂恢复到原本的长度。</p>\n<p>The kappa pulls one of their arms, gaining 10-foot reach with that arm. The opposing arm shrinks to little more than a hand extending from their shell. The kappa can still use their shortened hand to hold things, but they can't use that hand to wield a shield or weapon. By spending a single action to pull their opposing arm, the kappa can return their arms to their original length.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>河童天性顽皮，乐于对毫无防备的旅人开些恶作剧。它们通常并非公然恶毒，但也会造成不小的麻烦，比如从不知情的沐浴者那里偷走衣物，或从篝火旁抢走无人看管的食物。河童也喜欢在力量竞赛中证明自己的价值；尽管它们倾向于耍些花招，却也以作为守信、讲礼数的对手而闻名，在交谈中依然彬彬有礼。</p>\n<p>河童的外貌因地域而异，但它们全都是两栖的、形似海龟的人形生物：喙状口器，带蹼的手脚，以及黏滑的鳞片，颜色从蓝绿色到淡黄色不等。它们常有黑发，围成一圈，以便让头顶中央的凹陷露出。来自河童栖身的湖泊、溪流或河流的水会盛在这处凹陷里，也就是它们的头碗；人们相信这正是它们力量的源泉。年轻的河童很容易被哄骗得鞠躬，从而不慎把自己头碗里的水倒空。失去这水会让河童变得倦怠无力；头碗空着的时间越久，它们就越虚弱。对生活在自家水域附近的河童而言，这很少会构成严重危险，但对那些更爱冒险、远游在外的河童来说，这却可能致命。</p>\n<p>河童并非天生敌对；有人见过它们与孤独的孩子结为朋友，也会通过指路或进行些许简单的医疗处理来协助受困的冒险者。尽管如此，许多河童出没的区域都会张贴告示，警告它们的存在，并鼓励靠近水边的旅人丢下一根黄瓜——河童最爱的食物——以换取平安通行。河童有时会自己竖起这些告示，以提高获得美味点心的机会。</p>\n<p>Mischievous by nature, kappas delight in playing pranks on unsuspecting travelers. While usually not overtly malicious, they can be a significant nuisance, stealing clothes from unsuspecting bathers or snatching unattended food from campfires. Kappas also enjoy proving their worth in competitions of strength and, despite their propensity for trickery, are known to be honorable competitors who keep their word and remain polite in conversation.</p>\n<p>While kappas vary in physical attributes from region to region, they're all amphibious, turtle-like humanoids with beaked mouths, webbed hands and feet, and slimy scales that range in color from bluish green to pale yellow. They often have black hair, arranged in a ring to accommodate the central depression atop their head. Water from a kappa's home lake, stream, or river fills this depression, or head bowl, which is believed to be the source of their strength. Younger kappas are easily tricked into bowing and accidentally emptying the water from their own head bowls. Losing this water makes a kappa lethargic. The longer a kappa's head bowl remains empty, the weaker they grow. While this rarely poses a serious danger for a kappa living near their home body of water, it can prove fatal to a more adventurous kappa wandering afar.</p>\n<p>Kappas aren't inherently hostile and have been known to befriend lonely children and lend aid to stranded adventurers by providing directions or minor medical treatment. Still, many areas where kappas dwell feature posted signs warning of their presence that encourage travelers venturing near water to toss in a cucumber—kappas' favorite food—in exchange for safe passage. Kappas sometimes put up these signs themselves to increase the likelihood of receiving a tasty treat.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "河童 Kappa"
        },
        "Myna's Gift (Saved Three)": {
          "name": "米娜的赋礼（拯救三人） Myna's Gift (Saved Three)",
          "tokenName": "米娜的赋礼（救下三人） Myna's Gift (Saved Three)",
          "items": {
            "Healing Potion (Moderate)": {
              "name": "治疗药水（中等） Healing Potion (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色的液体，当饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时，会带来一种刺痛的感觉。饮用<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[(3d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Smoke Ball (Greater)": {
              "name": "烟雾球（高等） Smoke Ball (Greater)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>将这个球砸向地面后，你立刻制造出一道浓厚、不透明的烟幕，其范围为以你所占空间的一个角为中心的 @Template[burst|distance:20]。该区域内的所有生物都处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽} 状态，并且所有其他生物对他们也处于隐蔽状态。这团烟雾持续 1 分钟，或直到被强风吹散。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Upon smashing this ball on the ground, you instantly create a screen of thick, opaque smoke in a @Template[burst|distance:20] centered on one corner of your space. All creatures within that area are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all other creatures are concealed to them. The smoke lasts for 1 minute or until dispersed by a strong wind.</p>"
            },
            "Everlasting Adhesive": {
              "name": "永恒胶黏剂 Everlasting Adhesive",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> 1分钟（操作）</p><hr /><p>这种奇特的琥珀色黏合剂几乎能将两个表面牢不可分地黏在一起。一瓶可覆盖最多 1 平方英尺的区域，且必须一次性全部使用，以在两个表面之间形成单一黏结。若启动过程被打断，则黏结失败，黏合剂也会被浪费。</p>\n<p>一旦两个表面用永恒黏合剂黏在一起，生物只能在成功通过一次 @Check[athletics|dc:50] 检定后才能将其分开。除非这些被黏住的物体特别耐用，否则它们往往会在黏合剂失效之前先行破损；不过，若有生物下定决心要把这些物体分开，它可以把被永恒黏合剂连接的部分直接掰断，之后再修理这些物体。</p>\n<p>黏合剂只能在生物自愿的情况下影响生物；其黏结也可以通过剥脱最外层皮肤来解除。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> 1 minute (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>This peculiar amber adhesive bonds two surfaces together almost inseparably. A single flask covers an area up to 1 square foot and must be used all at once to form a single bond between two surfaces. If the activation is interrupted, the bond fails, and the adhesive is wasted.</p>\n<p>Once two surfaces are joined with everlasting adhesive, a creature can separate them only with a successful @Check[athletics|dc:50] check. The adhered objects tend to break before the adhesive does unless they're particularly durable, though a creature determined to separate the objects can break off the parts connected by the everlasting adhesive and later Repair the objects.</p>\n<p>The adhesive can affect creatures only if they're willing, and its bond can be broken by exfoliating the outermost layer of skin.</p>"
            },
            "Potion of Quickness": {
              "name": "迅捷药水 Potion of Quickness",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>饮用这瓶银色药水会使你获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.o6YCGx4lycsYpww4]{加速术} 的效果，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Drinking this silver potion grants you the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.o6YCGx4lycsYpww4]{Haste} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Resilient": {
              "name": "坚韧 Resilient",
              "description": "<p><em>坚韧</em>符文为护甲注入额外的防护魔法。这使穿戴者在豁免骰上获得+1物品加值。</p>\n<p>你可以使用升级物品与符文的常规流程，来升级已经蚀刻在一套护甲上的<em>坚韧</em>符文。</p>\n<p><em>Resilient</em> runes imbue armor with additional protective magic. This grants the wearer a +1 item bonus to saving throws.</p>\n<p>You can upgrade the <em>resilient</em> rune already etched on a suit of armor using the normal process for upgrading items and runes.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "玛娜的赋礼（拯救三人） Myna's Gift (Saved Three)"
        },
        "Shimmerthief": {
          "name": "窃光者 Shimmerthief",
          "tokenName": "窃光者 Shimmerthief",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Blur": {
              "name": "朦胧术 Blur",
              "description": "<p>目标的形体看起来模糊不清。它变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}。由于该效果的性质仍使目标的位置一目了然，目标无法利用该隐蔽来进行躲藏或潜行。</p>\n<p>The target's form appears blurry. It becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to Hide or Sneak.</p>"
            },
            "Darkness": {
              "name": "黑暗 Darkness",
              "description": "<p>你创造一片黑暗帷幕，阻止光线在区域内穿透或发散。光线无法进入该区域，且任何非魔法光源（如火把或提灯）在区域内也不会发出任何光，即使其照明半径本应延伸到黑暗之外亦然。这也会压制你黑暗术的环阶或更低环阶的魔法光。光无法穿透，因此区域内的生物无法看见外面。从外部看去，它仿佛是一个纯粹黑暗的球体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 即使拥有黑暗视觉（但不包括高等黑暗视觉）的生物，也只能勉强透过黑暗看清。他们将透过黑暗看见的目标视为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}。</p>\n<p>You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a torch or lantern, do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical light of your darkness spell's rank or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}.</p>"
            },
            "Darkness (At Will)": {
              "name": "黑暗（意志） Darkness (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你制造出一层黑暗帷幕，阻止光线在区域内穿透或向外散发。光线无法进入该区域，且任何非魔法光源（如火把或提灯）在区域内都不会发出任何光，即使它们的照明半径本应延伸到黑暗之外。这也会压制你黑暗术的环阶或更低的魔法光。光无法穿过，因此区域内的生物无法看见外面。从外部看去，它如同一个纯粹黑暗的球体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 即使是具有黑暗视觉（但不包括高等黑暗视觉）的生物，也只能勉强透过黑暗看清。他们将透过黑暗看见的目标视为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}。</p>\n<p>You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a torch or lantern, do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical light of your darkness spell's rank or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}.</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Echolocation 120 feet": {
              "name": "回声定位 120尺 Echolocation 120 feet",
              "description": "<p>窃光者可以在所列射程内将其听觉作为精确感官使用。</p>\n<p>A shimmerthief can use their hearing as a precise sense at the listed range.</p>"
            },
            "Shimmervision": {
              "name": "光源视觉 Shimmervision",
              "description": "<p>窃光者的视觉使其能在与具备标准视觉的生物相同的距离内感知光源，但无法辨清细节。他们使用这种视觉时，除了光源之外无法侦测到任何事物。</p>\n<p>A shimmerthief's sight allows them to sense sources of light from the same distance as creatures with standard vision but doesn't allow them to make out details. They can't detect anything other than light sources using this vision.</p>"
            },
            "Gleam Theft": {
              "name": "窃光 Gleam Theft",
              "description": "<p>10英尺。窃光者会持续吸收周围的光线。他们灵光范围内的明亮光照会变为昏暗光照，而昏暗光照会变为黑暗。窃光者可以以带有专注（特征）的单动作来压制或启动该灵光。</p>\n<p>10 feet. A shimmerthief constantly absorbs ambient light. Bright light in their aura becomes dim light, and dim light becomes darkness. A shimmerthief can suppress or activate this aura as a single action with the concentrate trait.</p>"
            },
            "Drain Light": {
              "name": "汲取光照 Drain Light",
              "description": "<p>窃光者以30尺内的一个光源为目标，然后尝试用一次法术攻击掷骰来反制它。如果成功，窃光者恢复 @Damage[(2d8+10)[healing]] 生命值（大成功则恢复 @Damage[(4d8+20)[healing]] 生命值）。</p>\n<p>The shimmerthief targets a light source within 30 feet, then attempts to counteract it with a spell attack roll. If they succeed, the shimmerthief regains @Damage[(2d8+10)[healing]] Hit Points (@Damage[(4d8+20)[healing]] Hit Points on a critical success).</p>"
            },
            "Lasting Darkness": {
              "name": "持久黑暗 Lasting Darkness",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 窃光者将 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4GE2ZdODgIQtg51c]{Darkness} 作为2环法术施放</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 窃光者的<em>黑暗术</em>持续时间增加至24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The shimmerthief casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4GE2ZdODgIQtg51c]{Darkness} as a 2nd-rank spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The duration of the shimmerthief's <em>darkness</em> increases to 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Unnerving Shriek": {
              "name": "惊悚尖叫 Unnerving Shriek",
              "description": "<p>窃光者发出一声超凡的哀嚎，迫使60尺内的生物尝试进行一次 @Check[will|dc:24] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物陷入惊惧 2，并在其保持惊惧状态期间陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<p>The shimmerthief releases an unearthly wail, forcing creatures within 60 feet to attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as it remains frightened.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>窃光者是失明、形似蜥蜴的穴居洞穴住民，怀着对吞食稀有美味“光”的难以餍足的渴望。这份饥饿驱使它们离开地下巢穴前往地表觅食，并在行进途中留下片片黑暗。</p>\n<p>它们绝非愚钝，却更愿意避开其他有智生物，因为它们知道许多生物觉得它们令人不适。它们在年幼时便会独立，但也会保护同类；在条件允许时，它们会结成小群体一同行动。谨慎的窃光者会尽量避免在繁忙区域吞食光，但这类地方也最具诱惑力，因为熙攘的人口意味着更多光源。</p>\n<h2>额外学识替代饮食</h2>\n<p>一些窃光者会对比光更为阴险的能量形式产生嗜好并获得吞食它们的能力，使其能以生命能量或思维能量替代光来进食。大多数窃光者认为这种行为极其怪物化，也是放逐的理由。具有这些癖好的窃光者是危险的掠食者：它们仍保有吞食光的能力，并会刻意制造一片片黑暗来困住并吞食受害者。以生命能量为食的窃光者会用其颚部造成负能量伤害；以思维能量为食的窃光者则会用其颚部造成心灵伤害。</p>\n<p>Shimmerthieves are blind, lizard-like cave dwellers with an insatiable yearning to consume the rare delicacy of light. This hunger compels them to travel beyond their subterranean lairs to the surface to feed, leaving pockets of darkness behind as they go.</p>\n<p>They're far from unintelligent yet prefer to avoid other sapient creatures, aware that many find them off-putting. They become independent at a young age but are protective of their kind, and they travel in small groups when able. Prudent shimmerthieves try to avoid feeding on light in busy areas, but such places are also the most tempting, as bustling populations mean more light sources.</p>\n<h2>Alternate Diets</h2>\n<p>Some shimmerthieves develop a taste for and the capacity to consume energy forms far more insidious than light, allowing them to feed on life energy or thought energy instead of light. Such behavior is considered monstrous by most shimmerthieves and a reason for exile. Shimmerthieves with these proclivities are dangerous predators that maintain the ability to feed on light and purposely create pockets of darkness to trap and feed on victims. A shimmerthief that feeds on life energy deals negative damage with their jaws, while one that feeds on thought energy deals mental damage with their jaws.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "窃光者 Shimmerthief"
        },
