            "Escape Fulu": {
              "name": "逃脱符箓 Escape Fulu",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你尝试进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{逃脱}。</p><hr /><p><em>逃脱符箓</em>是一种在富人中常见的护符，他们佩戴这种护身符以防遭到绑架。当你启动该符箓时，在接下来的1分钟内，你进行逃脱尝试时获得+2状态加值，并且在进行用于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{躲藏} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{潜行} 的隐秘检定时也获得+2状态加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.eWDmS4QTwmwPbBTb]{效果：逃脱符箓}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape}.</p><hr /><p>The <em>escape fulu</em> is a charm common among wealthy people, who wear the talisman in case of kidnapping. When you Activate this fulu, for 1 minute, you gain a +2 status bonus to your attempts to Escape as well as to Stealth checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{Sneak}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.eWDmS4QTwmwPbBTb]{Effect: Escape Fulu}</p>"
            },
            "Stumbling Fulu": {
              "name": "蹒跚符箓 Stumbling Fulu",
              "description": "<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 1小时</p>\n<p>最早制作<em>踉跄符箓</em>的狐妖建议使用者将符箓塞在目标的腰带下，以获得最大效果。当贴附符箓的生物完成一次行走动作时，该生物必须尝试一次@Check[reflex|dc:17]豁免。失败时，符箓所贴附的护甲上的某个部件会松开，使穿戴者获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙（状态）1}。大失败时，目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙（状态）2}。笨拙（状态）会持续，直到目标花费总计1次交互动作，再加上笨拙（状态）数值每高于1点就额外花费1次交互动作，来正确整理穿着。一旦符箓启动，它就会烧毁，其魔法仅会持续到其施加的状态结束为止。</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 hour</p>\n<p>The kitsune who first created a <em>stumbling fulu</em> advised the user to tuck the fulu under the target's belt for maximum effect. When the creature to which the fulu is affixed completes a Stride action, the creature must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:17] save. On a failure, some element of the armor the fulu is affixed to comes undone, making the wearer @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}. On a critical failure, the target falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}. The clumsy condition remains until the target takes a total of 1 Interact action, plus 1 additional Interact action per value of the clumsy condition above 1, to properly reclothe itself. Once the fulu activates, it burns up, its magic lasting only as long as the conditions it has imposed.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "门 Gate"
        },
        "Matsuki Shou": {
          "name": "松木胜 Matsuki Shou",
          "tokenName": "松木胜 Matsuki Shou",
          "items": {
            "Staff": {
