            "Carpenter's Toolkit (Sterling)": {
              "name": "木匠工具包（纯银） Carpenter's Toolkit (Sterling)",
              "description": "<p>你需要这些工具，才能用制作技能将原始材料制成物品。专家级工匠工具在检定中给予你+1物品加值。</p>\n<p>不同的工作需要不同的工具套装，由GM决定；例如，铁匠的工具包与木匠的工具包不同。若你穿戴着你的工匠工具包，你可以在使用它的动作中一并将其抽出并收回。</p>\n<p>You need these tools to create items from raw materials with the Craft skill. Sterling artisan's tools give you a +1 item bonus to the check.</p>\n<p>Different sets are needed for different work, as determined by the GM; for example, a blacksmith's toolkit differs from a woodworker's toolkit. If you wear your artisan's toolkit, you can draw and replace it as part of the action that uses it.</p>"
            },
            "Calabash Bottle": {
              "name": "葫芦瓶 Calabash Bottle"
            },
            "Cataracts": {
              "name": "白内障 Cataracts",
              "description": "<p>老松木日渐恶化的视力会使基于视觉的察觉检定受到–2环境减值。</p>\n<p>Old Matsuki's deteriorating eyesight imposes a –2 circumstance penalty to vision-based Perception checks.</p>"
            },
            "Wood-Grain Speaker": {
              "name": "木纹有语 Wood-Grain Speaker",
              "description": "<p>老松木在检查木质物品、结构与树木时，察觉获得+2环境加值。他可以使用工艺来对主要由木材制成的物品进行辨识魔法。该能力不受老松木的白内障影响。</p>\n<p>Old Matsuki gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception when examining wood items, structures, and trees. He can use Crafting to Identify Magic for items primarily made of wood. This ability isn't affected by Old Matsuki's cataracts.</p>"
            },
            "You Know, They Say...": {
              "name": "你知道，他们说…… You Know, They Say...",
              "description": "<p>老松木可以用柳岸镇学识替代奥秘、医术、秘学或宗教，以承受–2减值来尝试进行回忆知识检定。他在以这种方式尝试的回忆知识检定上，具有诡异知识专长的效果。</p>\n<p>Old Matsuki can use Willowshore Lore in place of Arcana, Medicine, Occultism, or Religion to attempt Recall Knowledge checks with a –2 penalty. He has the effects of the Dubious Knowledge feat for Recall Knowledge checks attempted in this way.</p>"
            },
            "A Drink for Good Luck": {
              "name": "为好运，干杯。 A Drink for Good Luck",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每个季节一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 老松木手中拿着一杯饮品</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 老松木为好运举杯祝酒，然后在他喝下饮品之前，选择30尺内至多六个其他生物。他，以及所有在各自下个回合结束前喝下饮品的生物，都会被注入好运。在当前季节结束前，每个目标都可以在一次失败的豁免检定上以自由动作（）重骰，并采用第二次结果。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per season</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Old Matsuki has a drink in hand</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Old Matsuki toasts to good fortune, then selects up to six other creatures within 30 feet before he drinks his drink. He, and all creatures that drink before the end of their next turn, become infused with good luck. Once before the end of the current season, each target can reroll a failed saving throw as a free action, taking the second result.</p>"
            },
            "Respect Your Elders!": {
              "name": "尊重长辈！ Respect Your Elders!",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 老松木会当众斥责一名他能看见且在30尺内的角色，指责其不敬——不仅是对他或柳岸镇的其他长辈不敬，也是对柳岸镇的传统不敬。无论他的训斥是否合情合理，这番怒斥的目标都必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:22] 意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响，并在1周内免疫于 尊重长辈！</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物感到一阵短暂的羞愧，变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 羞愧与疑虑的情绪不断萦绕该生物，使其分心到足以变为呆滞1，持续1小时。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Old Matsuki publicly chastises a character he can see and who's within 30 feet for being disrespectful, not just against him or Willowshore's other elders, but against Willowshore's traditions. Whether or not his reprimands are justified, the target of this tirade must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and immune to Respect Your Elders! for 1 week.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature feels a momentary bout of shame, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Feelings of shame and doubt nag at the creature, distracting them enough that they become stupefied 1 for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Wait, Give Me a Moment...": {
              "name": "且慢，吾尚需片刻……. Wait, Give Me a Moment...",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 老松木在一次回忆知识检定中失败</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 老松木意识到自己的错误，然后以+2环境加值重骰触发的检定。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Old Matsuki fails a check to Recall Knowledge</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Old Matsuki realizes his error, then rerolls the triggering check with a +2 circumstance bonus.</p>"
