            "Oil of Mending": {
              "name": "修复油 Oil of Mending",
              "description": "<p><strong>激活</strong> 1分钟（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>一小瓶修复油看起来内部有无数半透明的丝线在旋转。将这种油涂抹在一件物品上，会施放一个2环 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY]{Mending} 法术来修理该物品。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> 1 minute (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A vial of oil of mending appears to have countless translucent threads swirling within. Applying this oil to an item casts a 2nd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY]{Mending} spell to repair the item.</p>"
