            "Desertation Documents": {
              "name": "弃逃文件 Desertation Documents",
              "description": "<p>散落在房间各处的文件表明，尽管旧伐木营地在最后几个月仍在生产，但龙华的崩溃所引发的动荡导致了纷争与逃离，最终使该地点被遗弃。</p>\n<p>The documents strewn about the room indicate that while the lumber camp was still producing in its final months, upheaval from the collapse of Lung Wa was resulting in discord and desertion that ultimately led to the site being abandoned.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "营地办公室 Camp Office"
