        "Revenant": {
          "name": "亡魂 Revenant",
          "tokenName": "亡魂 Revenant",
          "items": {
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Sense Murderer": {
              "name": "感知凶手 Sense Murderer",
              "description": "<p>复仇亡魂知道其凶手的方向（只要双方在同一位面上），但不知道距离。</p>\n<p>A revenant knows the direction of their murderer (as long as both are on the same plane), but not the distance.</p>"
            },
            "Self-Loathing": {
              "name": "自我厌恶 Self-Loathing",
              "description": "<p>如果复仇亡魂看到自己的倒影或任何他们生前重视的物体，他们必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:25] 意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 复仇亡魂不受影响，且不会再以这种方式受到该倒影或物体影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 复仇亡魂因自我厌恶而分心，获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 复仇亡魂被引发其自我厌恶的源头所 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{着迷}，并在直到复仇亡魂下个回合结束为止竭尽所能摧毁它。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 只要其自我厌恶的源头仍清晰可见，复仇亡魂便会陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}，直到他们受到攻击，或直到他们看到自己的杀人凶手。</p>\n<p>If a revenant sees their own reflection or any object that was important to them in life, they must attempt a @Check[will|dc:25] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The revenant is unaffected and can no longer be affected by that reflection or object in this way.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The revenant is distracted by self-loathing and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The revenant becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} by the source that triggered their self-loathing and does everything they can to destroy it until the end of the revenant's next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The revenant becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} as long as the source of their self-loathing is apparent, until they're attacked, or until they see their murderer.</p>"
            },
            "Undying Vendetta": {
              "name": "不死复仇 Undying Vendetta",
              "description": "<p>如果复仇亡灵的凶手死亡，复仇亡灵会立刻被摧毁。无法感知其凶手的复仇亡灵必须每 24 小时进行一次 @Check[flat|dc:11] 检定，以避免陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}；一旦他们能够感知到凶手，就会立刻再次起身。成为不死的凶手不会触发复仇亡灵的摧毁，直到该凶手最终被摧毁为止。复仇亡灵在针对其凶手的检定与 DC 上获得 +2 状态加值。</p>\n<p>If the revenant's murderer dies, the revenant is immediately destroyed. A revenant that can't sense their murderer must attempt a @Check[flat|dc:11] check once every 24 hours to avoid becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}; they immediately rise again once they can sense their murderer. A murderer who becomes undead does not trigger the revenant's destruction until the murderer is finally destroyed. The revenant gains a +2 status bonus to checks and DCs against their murderer.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Baleful Shriek": {
              "name": "恶毒尖啸 Baleful Shriek",
              "description": "<p>复生者发出骇人的哀嚎。每个处于@Template[burst|distance:60]内的生物都必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:23]意志豁免。无论其豁免结果如何，受影响的生物随后在1小时内对「不祥尖啸」免疫。复生者的凶手永远不会因该能力的失能（特征）而提升其成功等级。</p>\n<p>复生者在[[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Baleful Shriek]]{1d4轮}内无法再次使用「不祥尖啸」。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧2}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物惊惧2并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{麻痹}，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧3}并麻痹，持续[[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4轮}。</p>\n<p>The revenant wails horribly. Each creature within a @Template[burst|distance:60] must attempt a @Check[will|dc:23] save. Regardless of the outcome of their saving throw, affected creatures are then immune to Baleful Shriek for 1 hour. The revenant's murderer never improves their degree of success due to this ability's incapacitation trait.</p>\n<p>The revenant can't use Baleful Shriek again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Baleful Shriek]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and paralyzed for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            },
            "Constrict": {
              "name": "缠绕 Constrict",
              "description": "<p>@Damage[(2d6+5)[钝击]], @Check[fortitude|dc:24|基础]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>\n<p>@Damage[(2d6+5)[bludgeoning]], @Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Constrict]</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>亡魂是执念深重的不死跟踪者，他们因自身被杀而出现，且只受一件事驱使：向杀害他们的人复仇。一般的看法认为，亡魂只会由那些被彻底背叛或被遗弃而不得不痛苦死去的人出现，但即便如此，这些受害者也未必会从坟墓中爬起。在其他情况下，如果亡魂不了解自己死亡的全部缘由，他们甚至可能因本可合理视为意外的事件而出现。在这类情况下，“凶手”是否有意杀人并不重要，因为亡魂不懂怜悯，也永远不会原谅。亡魂对自己生前的记忆所剩无几，除了为达成其复仇目标所需回想的一切。</p>\n<p>Revenants are obsessed, undead stalkers who arise from their own murders and are driven by only one thing: revenge against their killers. The common wisdom is that revenants arise only from individuals who have been utterly betrayed or abandoned to die a grueling death, but even then, such victims might not rise from their graves. In other cases, revenants might even rise from what might legitimately be considered an accident if the revenant doesn't understand the full circumstances of their demise. In such cases, it doesn't matter that the \"murderer\" may not have intended to kill, for revenants understands no pity and can never forgive. Revenants have little memory of their lives other than anything they might need to recall in order to achieve their goal of vengeance.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "亡魂 Revenant"
        },
        "Nadoya's Thanks": {
          "name": "纳多娅的感谢 Nadoya's Thanks",
          "tokenName": "纳多娅的感谢 Nadoya's Thanks",
          "items": {
            "Crying Angel Pendant": {
              "name": "泪天使垂饰 Crying Angel Pendant",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（专注）</p><hr /><p>当你启动这枚雪花石膏坠饰时，尝试以医疗技能进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.MHLuKy4nQO2Z4Am1]{实施急救}，且该检定获得+1物品加值。若你成功，且你正试图稳定伤势，则目标恢复1点生命值，失去濒死（状态）并如常恢复意识。若你成功，且你正试图止血，则流血结束。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate)</p><hr /><p>When you activate this alabaster pendant, attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.MHLuKy4nQO2Z4Am1]{Administer First Aid} using Medicine with a +1 item bonus to the check. If you succeed, and you were trying to stabilize, the target regains 1 Hit Point, losing the dying condition and becoming conscious as normal. If you succeed, and you were trying to stop bleeding, the bleeding ends.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "纳多娅的感谢 Nadoya's Thanks"
        },
        "Shelves": {
          "name": "搁板 Shelves",
          "tokenName": "搁板 Shelves",
          "items": {
            "The Wisdom of the Seven Sages": {
              "name": "七贤的智慧 The Wisdom of the Seven Sages",
              "description": "<p>一部龙华著名的古典论著。</p><p>卷轴里夹着一封信。</p><img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-wisdomofthesevensages.webp\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\n<p>A famous classical treatise of Lung Wa.</p><p>Folded into the scroll is a letter.</p><img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-wisdomofthesevensages.webp\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />"
            },
            "Letter from Shan-Bao’s Parents": {
              "name": "来自山宝父母的信 Letter from Shan-Bao’s Parents",
              "description": "<p>卷轴里夹着一封来自善宝父母的信，信中表达了他们对儿子的自豪，并坚信他将证明自己是龙座明智而公正的臣仆，配得上他们教给他的所有理想。</p>\n<p>Folded into the scroll is a letter from Shan-Bao’s parents expressing their pride in their son and their conviction that he’ll prove to be a wise, fair servant of the Dragon Throne, worthy of all the ideals they taught him.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "架子 Shelves"
        },
        "Chest": {
          "name": "箱子 Chest",
          "tokenName": "箱子 Chest",
          "items": {
            "Gold Pieces": {
              "name": "金币 Gold Pieces"
            },
            "Silver Pieces": {
              "name": "银币 Silver Pieces"
            },
            "Copper Pieces": {
              "name": "铜币 Copper Pieces"
            },
            "Assorted Bits of Jewelry": {
              "name": "各式珠宝首饰碎件 Assorted Bits of Jewelry"
            },
            "Emerald Grasshopper": {
              "name": "翡翠蚱蜢 Emerald Grasshopper",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 你受训于运动</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这只镶嵌祖母绿的金属蚱蜢通常扣在一套护甲的腿部。</p>\n<p>当你启动它时，进行一次@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{跳跃}，水平移动至多40尺，垂直移动至多10尺。</p>\n<p>如果你未在坚实地面上结束跳跃，你会在空中扑扇停留直到你回合结束，之后以每轮60尺的速度无害地落下，直到到达地面。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're trained in Athletics</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This metal grasshopper studded with emeralds is usually clasped to the legs of a suit of armor.</p>\n<p>When you activate it, make a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{Leap}, traveling up to 40 feet horizontally and up to 10 feet vertically.</p>\n<p>If you don't end your jump on solid ground, you flutter in the air until the end of your turn, then fall harmlessly at a rate of 60 feet per round until you reach the ground.</p>"
            },
            "+1 Bloodstained Chain Shirt": {
              "name": "+1 血迹斑斑的链甲衫 +1 Bloodstained Chain Shirt",
              "description": "<p>有时也被称为锁子甲长衫，这是一件由与链甲相同的金属环构成的长衫。然而，它比链甲轻得多，并且只保护穿戴者的躯干、上臂和大腿。</p>\n<p>Sometimes called a hauberk, this is a long shirt constructed of the same metal rings as chain mail. However, it is much lighter than chain mail and protects only the torso, upper arms, and upper legs of its wearer.</p>"
            },
            "Wand of Clear Mind (Rank 2)": {
              "name": "清明心智魔杖（2环） Wand of Clear Mind (Rank 2)",
              "description": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{清明心智}</p><hr /><p>这根短杖长约一英尺，内含一个法术。其外观通常与其中的法术有关。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 施放法术</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日1次，另加过载</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你以所示的环位施放该法术。</p>\n<p><strong>制作需求</strong> 提供一次以所列环位施放该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>注：要创建特定法术的卷轴或魔杖，将该法术从资料库或资料库浏览器拖入PC、NPC或战利品角色的物品栏中。</em></p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EfFMLVbmkBWmzoLF]{Clear Mind}</p><hr /><p>This baton is about a foot long and contains a single spell. The appearance typically relates to the spell within.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day, plus overcharge</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You Cast the Spell at the indicated rank.</p>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply a casting of the spell at the listed rank.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: To create a scroll or wand of a specific spell, drag the spell from the compendium or compendium browser into the inventory of a PC, NPC, or loot actor.</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "胸膛 Chest"
        },
        "Kazuma Oono, Shackled Spirit": {
          "name": "大野和马，被镣铐束缚的魂魄 Kazuma Oono, Shackled Spirit",
          "tokenName": "大野和马，被镣铐束缚的魂魄 Kazuma Oono, Shackled Spirit",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog15afiend.JournalEntryPage.15thesilenceds00]{沉默的鸣禽}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog15afiend.JournalEntryPage.15thesilenceds00]{The Silenced Songbird}</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "大野和马，枷锁魂魄 Kazuma Oono, Shackled Spirit"
        },
        "Writhing Hair": {
          "name": "缠怨之发 Writhing Hair",
          "tokenName": "缠怨之发 Writhing Hair",
          "items": {
            "Cyclone of Hair": {
              "name": "发缕缠绕 Cyclone of Hair",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物试图与作祟进行交互或对其说话</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 幽魂女子发出尖叫并升到空中，她的头发迅速生长，如蛇般穿过店铺，缠上椽子或在座位区间编织穿行。店内所有生物必须尝试一次 @Check[reflex|dc:22] 豁免，以避免陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}（若大失败则改为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}）。随后作祟掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts to interact with or speak to the haunt</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ghostly woman shrieks and rises into the air as her hair grows swiftly, snaking through the shop to tangle into the rafters or weave through the seating area. All creatures in the shop must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:22] save to avoid becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} on a critical failure). The haunt then rolls initiative.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[交涉|dc:23]以安抚愤怒的魂魄，或 @Check[宗教|dc:21]以通过祷告派说服魂魄放弃作祟。若PC使用日出明里的名字，或以其他方式让作祟知晓他们理解她的故事，则用于解除此作祟的检定获得+2环境加值。</p>\n<p>@Check[diplomacy|dc:23] to calm the upset spirit down, or @Check[religion|dc:21] to convince the spirit to abandon the haunting via prayer. If the PCs use Hinode Akari's name or otherwise let the haunt know that they understand her story, checks to Disable this haunt gain a +2 circumstance bonus.</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一名幽灵般的女子静静地飘过店铺，拔下头发，把它们蜿蜒送进椽梁间，或放出去侵扰未熟的蒸包子。</p>\n<p>A ghostly woman floats quietly through the shop, plucking hair and sending it slithering into the rafters or out to infest uncooked steamed buns.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（1动作）该作祟随机以商店内的一名生物为目标，优先选择处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}状态的目标。幽灵般的身影移动到受害者身旁，用她的发丝盘绕并开始勒住对方，同时她伸爪在目标的头发间抓挠，仿佛一把把地将头发撕扯下来。尽管目标实际上并未在肉体上被勒住或失去头发，但由于承受被勒颈与头发被拔扯的痛苦感受，目标受到@Damage[(2d8+7)[mental]]伤害（@Check[will|dc:22|basic]意志豁免）。</p>\n<p>(1 action) The haunt targets one creature in the shop at random, preferring targets who are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}. The ghostly figure moves over to the victim and begins to strangle them with coils of her hair while she begins clawing through the target's hair as if ripping it out by the handful. The target takes @Damage[(2d8+7)[mental]] damage (@Check[will|dc:22|basic] save) from enduring the painful sensations of being strangled and having their hair plucked out, even though they're not actually being physically strangled or losing their hair.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（受训）</p>\n<p>(trained)</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "缠怨之发 Writhing Hair"
        },
        "Giant Centipede": {
          "name": "巨蜈蚣 Giant Centipede",
          "tokenName": "巨蜈蚣 Giant Centipede",
          "items": {
            "Mandibles": {
              "name": "颚钳 Mandibles"
            },
            "Giant Centipede Venom": {
              "name": "巨蜈蚣毒液 Giant Centipede Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免掷骰</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{疲乏}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} (1 round)</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>大多数巨蜈蚣（在城市中发现时被称为下水道蜈蚣）会以小群体筑巢，但在它们外出觅食时通常独自狩猎。试图将巨蜈蚣驯化用作守卫或宠物的做法一般都以糟糕的结果告终，不过一些地精、狗头人和米特弗利特的社群已经发展出有效的方法，将这些害虫用作守卫。还有些群体会把蜈蚣烤来吃，常配以辛辣的辣椒作为咸香的美味；不过在准备这道菜时必须小心，以免生物的毒液污染肉质。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>蜈蚣栖身于粪污与残渣之间，是以此为生的猎食者与食腐者；它们相当常见，也常令冒险者厌恶并视为威胁。它们那细长、分节的身体上长着数十条腿，能以惊人的速度四处窜动；蜈蚣会用带毒的颚部发动打击，以凶狠的毒素使猎物缓慢并受尽折磨，然后才安顿下来，以缓慢而令人作呕的悠闲姿态开始进食。</p>\n<p>Most giant centipedes (known as sewer centipedes when found in cities) nest in small groups but hunt alone when they seek out food. Attempts to domesticate giant centipedes for use as guardians or pets generally end poorly, but some communities of goblins, kobolds, and mitflits have developed effective methods of utilizing these vermin as guardians. Other groups roast and eat centipedes, often with pungent peppers as a savory delicacy, although care must be taken in preparing the meal to avoid tainting the flesh with the creature's venom.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Hunters and scavengers that live amid dung and detritus, centipedes are a relatively common and often reviled threat faced by adventurers. Scurrying about with surprising speed on the scores of legs attached to their long, segmented bodies, centipedes strike with poisoned mandibles to slow and torment their prey with a vicious toxin before they settle down to feed in slow and disgusting leisure.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "巨蜈蚣 Giant Centipede"
        },
