        "Willowshore Waldgeist": {
          "name": "柳岸镇林鬼 Willowshore Waldgeist",
          "tokenName": "柳岸镇林灵 Willowshore Waldgeist",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Speak with Plants (Constant)": {
              "name": "植物交谈（恒定） Speak with Plants (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你可以向植物提问并从它们那里获得回答，但该法术不会让它们变得比平常更友善或更聪明。大多数普通植物对周围世界有着独特的看法，因此它们不会识别有关生物的细节，也不了解其近旁环境之外的世界。狡猾的植物怪物很可能言辞简短且闪烁其词，而不那么聪明的则常常会发表一些愚蠢的评论。</p>\n<p>You can ask questions of and receive answers from plants, but the spell doesn't make them more friendly or intelligent than normal. Most normal plants have a distinctive view of the world around them, so they don't recognize details about creatures or know anything about the world beyond their immediate vicinity. Cunning plant monsters are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>"
            },
            "Wall of Thorns": {
              "name": "棘墙术 Wall of Thorns",
              "description": "<p>在一分钟内，你使一堵厚实、布满尖刺的荆棘灌木墙从地面生长出来。你创造一道厚5英尺的荆棘与刺墙，呈直线，最长60英尺，高10英尺。你必须在一段连续不中断的开阔空间内创造这道墙，使其边缘不会穿过任何生物或物体，否则该法术将失效。墙体竖直矗立。若你愿意，墙也可以更短或更矮。墙两侧的所有事物都能从对侧的生物处获得掩蔽，且墙的空间属于困难地形。每当一个生物使用一次移动动作进入至少一个墙的空间时，该生物会受到3d4点穿刺伤害。</p>\n<p>墙每个5英尺×5英尺的区段具有AC 10、硬度10以及20点生命值。它免疫大成功或大失败造成的重击与精准伤害。被摧毁的区段可以被自由穿过。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 墙的每个区段的生命值增加5点，且穿刺伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Over the course of a minute, you cause a thick wall of thorny brambles to grow from the ground. You create a 5-foot-thick wall of brambles and thorns in a straight line up to 60 feet long and 10 feet high. You must create the wall in an unbroken open space so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost. The wall stands vertically. If you wish, the wall can be of a shorter length or height. Everything on each side of the wall has cover from creatures on the opposite side, and the wall's spaces are difficult terrain. For every move action a creature uses to enter at least one of the wall's spaces, that creature takes 3d4 piercing damage.</p>\n<p>Each 5-foot-by-5-foot section of the wall has AC 10, Hardness 10, and 20 Hit Points. It's immune to critical hits and precision damage. A destroyed section can be moved through freely.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The Hit Points of each section of the wall increase by 5, and the piercing damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Tanglefoot": {
              "name": "绊足术 Tanglefoot",
              "description": "<p>一根覆满黏稠树脂的藤蔓凭空出现，从你手中甩出并缠向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong>目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}，并在1轮内其各项速度承受–10英尺的环境减值。它可以尝试以你的法术DC为基准进行逃脱，以移除该减值与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{禁足（状态）}。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong>目标在1轮内其各项速度承受–10英尺的环境减值。它可以尝试以你的法术DC为基准进行逃脱，以移除该减值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{法术效果：纠缠藤蔓}</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong>目标不受影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong>这些效果持续2轮。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>这些效果持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>A vine covered in sticky sap appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack against the target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{Spell Effect: Tangle Vine}</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Lignifying Hand": {
              "name": "木质化之手 Lignifying Hand"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "恒定法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Fleeting Existence": {
              "name": "短暂存在 Fleeting Existence",
              "description": "<p>这些林魂只是一次失败驱魔仪式的短暂显现。自它们首次在思维空间中显现起经过1分钟后，便会消散。</p>\n<p>These waldgeists are only fleeting manifestations of a failed exorcism. They vanish after 1 minute has passed from their first manifestation in the mindscape.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Lignify": {
              "name": "木质化 Lignify",
              "description": "<p>林精的接触会将血肉转化为木材。被林精的木质化之手打击伤害到的活体生物必须通过一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:22] 豁免，否则变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（若为大成功或大失败中的大失败，则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}）。之后对木质化的豁免若进一步失败，会使缓慢（状态）加剧。一旦某生物的动作因木质化而减少至 0，该生物便成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dTwPJuKgBQCMxixg]{石化}，但会被变成木头而非石头。</p>\n<p>The touch of a waldgeist transforms flesh into wood. A living creature damaged by the waldgeist's lignifying hand Strike must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:22] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} on a critical failure). Further failed saves against lignify increases the slowed condition. Once a creature's actions are reduced to 0 by lignify, that creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dTwPJuKgBQCMxixg]{Petrified}, except they're transformed into wood instead of stone.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>沃尔德盖斯特充当自然的化身，会为环境遭到滥用（如污染与滥伐）而寻求复仇。这些由被摧毁树木所化成的不死魂魄，会在其毁灭之地形成；若原址已被彻底夷平，则会在附近的林地成形。它们成为森林的守护者，掌控其边界内的植物。沃尔德盖斯特对任何破坏其所绑定林地的人都毫不留情，会一视同仁地攻击伐木者、妖精、旅人以及入侵物种。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当灾害降临自然世界时，可能会出现另一种不死，完全不同于复苏的人形生物。大多数植物、鱼类、昆虫与其他动物并不具备足够复杂的心理，无法在没有外力介入的情况下经历成为不死所需的情感宣泄。大规模灭绝就能充当这种外力。</p>\n<p>人形生物将整片森林皆伐，或是海滨社群消灭了对其生态系统至关重要的某个物种，都可能催生出翠岩魔。垂死生物群落的集体魂魄能量与情绪痛苦为这些不死提供动力，使其以聚合体或代表者的形式成形。</p>\n<p>Waldgeists act as avatars of nature that seek vengeance for environmental abuse, such as pollution and deforestation. These undead spirits of destroyed trees form at the site of their destruction or in a nearby woodland, if the original location was entirely razed. They become guardians of the forest, possessing power over the plants within its boundaries. Waldgeists show no mercy to anyone caught damaging their bonded woodland, attacking loggers, fey, travelers, and invasive species with equal prejudice.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When disaster befalls the natural world, a different kind of undead may rise, entirely unlike risen humanoids. Most plants, fish, insects, and other animals don't possess a psychology complex enough to experience the emotional catharsis required to return as undead without intervention from an outside force. Mass extinction can serve as that outside force.</p>\n<p>Humanoids clear-cutting an entire forest or a seaside community wiping out a species critical to their ecosystem can spawn a verdorite. The collective spiritual energy and emotional distress of a dying biome powers these undead, formed as conglomerates or representatives.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：森林灵鬼\nVariant waldgeist",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "柳岸镇林灵 Willowshore Waldgeist"
        },
