        "Cacodaemon": {
          "name": "狂躁邪魔 Cacodaemon",
          "tokenName": "狂躁邪魔 Cacodaemon",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Read Omens": {
              "name": "解读预兆 Read Omens",
              "description": "<p>你窥探未来。选择一个你计划在1周内参与的特定目标或行动，或一个你预计可能在1周内发生的事件。你会得知一个晦涩的线索或一条建议，可能有助于所选事件，通常以押韵或预兆的形式出现。</p>\n<p>You peek into the future. Choose a particular goal or activity you plan to engage in within 1 week, or an event you expect might happen within 1 week. You learn a cryptic clue or piece of advice that could help with the chosen event, often in the form of a rhyme or omen.</p>"
            },
            "Invisibility (At Will) (Self Only)": {
              "name": "隐形（随意）（仅自身） Invisibility (At Will) (Self Only)",
              "description": "<p>幻术使光线在目标周围弯折，使其成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。这使其对所有生物而言处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{无踪} 状态，不过这些生物可以尝试寻找目标，从而使其对他们而言改为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿}。如果目标使用敌对动作，则法术在该敌对动作完成后结束。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 法术持续1分钟，但目标使用敌对动作时不会结束。</p>\n<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你放出一道脉冲，登记周围是否存在魔法。你获得的信息仅限于是否存在魔法。你可以选择忽略你完全知晓的魔法，例如你与盟友的魔法物品和持续中的法术。你只有在幻术魔法的效果阶位低于你的<em>侦测魔法</em>法术的阶位时，才能侦测到幻术魔法。然而，具有幻术灵光但外观并不具欺骗性的物品（例如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{隐形药水}）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你得知该法术所侦测到的最强魔法效果的阶位或等级，由GM决定。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 同3环，但你还会锁定最高阶魔法的来源。与模糊感官相同，你不会得知确切位置，但能将来源缩小到一个5尺立方体之内（若其大于该范围，则缩小到最接近的范围）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧术 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你将恐惧植入目标体内；它必须尝试进行一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以指定最多五个生物作为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Telepathy 100 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 100英尺 Telepathy 100 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "At-Will Spells": {
              "name": "随意法术 At-Will Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Cacodaemonia": {
              "name": "恶魔祸乱 Cacodaemonia",
              "description": "<p>狂躁邪魔可以在同一位面上，以心灵感应与受折磨的生物在任何距离进行交流。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:17]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 携带者（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}（1天）</p>\n<p>The cacodaemon can telepathically communicate with the afflicted creature at any distance on the same plane.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:17]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (1 day)</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<ul><li><p><strong>蜥蜴</strong></p><ul><li><strong>速度</strong> 20尺</li><li><strong>近战</strong> 颚 +8（灵巧，娴熟），<strong>伤害</strong> 1d8+1 穿刺</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>章鱼</strong></p><ul><li><strong>体型</strong> 小型</li><li><strong>速度</strong> 20尺，游泳 30尺</li><li><strong>技能</strong> 运动 +6</li><li><strong>近战</strong> 触手 +8（娴熟），<strong>伤害</strong> 1d8+1 钝击外加 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr]{抓取}</li><li><strong>近战</strong> 喙 +8（灵巧，娴熟），<strong>伤害</strong> 1d6 穿刺外加 2 毒素</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>蝎子</strong></p><ul><li><strong>体型</strong> 小型</li><li><strong>速度</strong> 30尺</li><li><strong>技能</strong> 运动 +6</li><li><strong>近战</strong> 螯 +8（灵巧，娴熟），<strong>伤害</strong> 1d6+1 钝击外加 抓取</li><li><strong>近战</strong> 螫刺 +8（灵巧，娴熟），<strong>伤害</strong> 1d6+1 穿刺外加 1d4 毒素</li></ul></li></ul><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<ul><li><p><strong>Lizard</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Speed</strong> 20 feet</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> jaws +8 (agile, finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 1d8+1 piercing</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Octopus</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Size</strong> Small</li><li><strong>Speed</strong> 20 feet, swim 30 feet</li><li><strong>Skills</strong> Athletics +6</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> tentacle +8 (finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 1d8+1 bludgeoning plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr]{Grab}</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> beak +8 (agile, finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6 piercing plus 2 poison</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Scorpion</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Size</strong> Small</li><li><strong>Speed</strong> 30 feet</li><li><strong>Skills</strong> Athletics +6</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> pincer +8 (agile, finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6+1 bludgeoning plus Grab</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> stinger +8 (agile, finesse), <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6+1 piercing plus 1d4 poison</li></ul></li></ul><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
