            "Jiang-Shi Bell": {
              "name": "僵尸铃 Jiang-Shi Bell",
              "description": "<p>这只华丽的手铃摇响时会发出浑厚的低音，仿佛声音来自一只比手持铃大得多的钟。铃身由白银制成并抛光至可反光的光泽，而铃的木质握柄上则雕刻着多种食材的精细图案。你可以与僵尸铃进行<strong>交互</strong>，将其对准一名僵尸吸血鬼（特征）挥舞。若某名僵尸因僵尸铃被挥舞而获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑（状态）}状态，他们必须奔跑，直到距离至少达到20尺为止。他们在任何试图克服对该物体之厌恶的意志豁免上承受-2减值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 构想，交互（嗅觉，视觉）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你摇响铃铛，在你可见且距离你30尺内的任意一点，于一个5尺见方的区域内制造出摆放在祭坛上的、看起来美味的食物茶饭的幻象影像。任何必须进食才能生存、且在幻象食物出现位置30尺内的生物，必须成功通过一次 @Check[will|dc:28] 意志豁免，否则会因食物的视觉与气味而分心，对其陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{着迷} 状态，持续10分钟。</p>\n<p>这种食物的外观可触发任何僵尸的“苦涩顿悟”弱点；若食物确实如此，该僵尸在进行意志豁免以抗拒该弱点的效果时，承受–2物品减值。</p>\n<p>This ornate handbell creates a sonorous low-pitched tone when rung, as if sounding from a much larger bell than one carried in the hand. The bell is crafted of silver and polished to a reflective sheen, while the bell's wooden handle is carved with detailed images of various foodstuffs. You can interact with a jiang-shi bell to brandish it against a jiang-shi vampire. If a jiang-shi gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition as a result of a jiang-shi bell being brandished, they must run until they're at least 20 feet away. They take a -2 penalty to the Will save to any attempt to overcome their revulsion toward this object.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> envision, Interact (olfactory, visual)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You ring the bell and create an illusory image of a delicious-looking banquet of food laid out on an altar in a 5-foot-square at any point within 30 feet of you that you can see. Any creature that must eat food to survive that's within 30 feet of the appearance of the illusory food must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:28] save or be so distracted by the food's sight and smell that they become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} by it for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>This food's appearance can trigger any jiang-shi's Bitter Epiphany weakness; if the food does so, the jiang-shi takes a –2 item penalty to its Will save to resist the effects of this weakness.</p>"
