            "Fireball": {
              "name": "火球术 Fireball",
              "description": "<p>一阵咆哮的火焰爆炸在你指定的位置引爆，造成 6d6 火焰伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 2d6。</p>\n<p>A roaring blast of fire detonates at a spot you designate, dealing 6d6 fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Slow": {
              "name": "缓慢 Slow",
              "description": "<p>你将目标周围的时间流动膨胀，使其动作变慢。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标在1分钟内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You dilate the flow of time around the target, slowing its actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Acid Arrow": {
              "name": "强酸箭 Acid Arrow",
              "description": "<p>你召唤出一支酸箭，在命中后仍会持续腐蚀目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击。命中时，你造成3d8酸性伤害外加@Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d6[persistent,acid]]伤害。大成功时，初始伤害翻倍，但持续伤害不翻倍。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 初始伤害增加2d8，持续酸性伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You conjure an arrow of acid that keeps corroding the target after it hits. Make a spell attack against the target. On a hit, you deal 3d8 acid damage plus @Damage[(floor(@item.rank/2))d6[persistent,acid]] damage. On a critical hit, double the initial damage, but not the persistent damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The initial damage increases by 2d8, and the persistent acid damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Mirror Image": {
              "name": "镜影术 Mirror Image",
              "description": "<p>三个你的幻象在你的空间周围盘旋，可能导致那些攻击你的人击中其中一个幻象而非你。任何本会命中你的攻击，都有一定的随机概率改为命中你的某个幻象而非你。若三个幻象都仍在，则有 1/4 的概率命中你（[[/r 1d4]] 掷出 1）。若还剩两个幻象，则有 1/3 的概率命中你（[[/r 1d6]] 掷出 1-2）。若只剩一个幻象，则概率为 1/2（[[/r 1d6]] 掷出 1-3）。</p>\n<p>一旦某个幻象被命中，它就会被摧毁。若一次攻击掷骰未能命中你的 AC 但没有大失败，则会摧毁一个幻象，但没有额外效果（即使该攻击通常会在失败时产生效果）。若一次攻击掷骰为大成功且本会命中某个幻象，则摧毁一个幻象，并且该次攻击掷骰改为对你为成功。所有幻象都被摧毁后，该法术结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.0PO5mFRhh9HxGAtv]{法术效果：镜影术}</p>\n<p>Three illusory images of you swirl about your space, potentially causing those who attack you to hit one of the images instead of you. Any attack that would hit you has a random chance of hitting one of your images instead of you. If all three images remain, there is a 1 in 4 chance of hitting you (1 on [[/r 1d4]]). With two images remaining, there is a 1 in 3 chance of hitting you (1-2 on [[/r 1d6]]). With only one image, the chances are 1 in 2 (1-3 on [[/r 1d6]]).</p>\n<p>Once an image is hit, it is destroyed. If an attack roll fails to hit your AC but doesn't critically fail, it destroys an image but has no additional effect (even if the attack would normally have an effect on a failure). If an attack roll is a critical success and would hit one of the images, one of the images is destroyed and the attack roll becomes a success against you. Once all the images are destroyed, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.0PO5mFRhh9HxGAtv]{Spell Effect: Mirror Image}</p>"
            },
            "Electric Arc": {
              "name": "电弧击 Electric Arc",
              "description": "<p>一道闪电弧从一个目标跃向另一个目标。每个目标承受2d4点电击伤害，并进行一次基础反射豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes 2d4 electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Enfeeble": {
              "name": "虚弱﻿ Enfeeble",
              "description": "<p>你削弱目标的力量，效果取决于其强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}，直到你下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}，持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 3}，持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p>You sap the target's strength, depending on its Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3} for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Force Barrage": {
              "name": "力场弹幕 Force Barrage",
              "description": "<p>你向一名你能看见的生物发射一枚凝固的魔法碎片。它自动命中并造成 1d4+1 力场伤害。你在施放该法术时每额外使用 1 个动作，便使你发射的碎片数量增加 1 枚；使用 3 个动作时最多可发射 3 枚碎片。你分别为每枚碎片选择目标。若你将多枚碎片射向同一目标，在应用伤害加值或减值、抗力、弱点等之前，先将伤害合并。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 你每花费 1 个动作，便额外发射 1 枚碎片。</p>\n<p>You fire a shard of solidified magic toward a creature that you can see. It automatically hits and deals 1d4+1 force damage. For each additional action you use when Casting the Spell, increase the number of shards you shoot by one, to a maximum of three shards for 3 actions. You choose the target for each shard individually. If you shoot more than one shard at the same target, combine the damage before applying bonuses or penalties to damage, resistances, weaknesses, and so forth.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> You fire one additional shard with each action you spend.</p>"
            },
            "Ray of Frost": {
              "name": "霜冻射线 Ray of Frost",
              "description": "<p>你发射一道冰冷射线。进行一次法术攻击掷骰。该射线造成 2d4 点寒冷伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标受到双倍伤害，并在 1 轮内其速度承受 –10 尺状态减值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{法术效果：霜冻射线}</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到正常伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d4。</p>\n<p>You blast an icy ray. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals 2d4 cold damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{Spell Effect: Ray of Frost}</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes normal damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "False Weapon": {
              "name": "虚假武器 False Weapon",
              "description": "<p>一名无面鬼模仿者携带一把<em>+1 强击</em>武器，其外观与被模仿的PC偏好的武器完全相同。若该PC偏好徒手打击，则其呈现为手部缠带。若该PC偏好远程武器，则无面鬼模仿者没有近战武器，改为使用上述远程武器规则；否则，无面鬼模仿者没有远程武器。若该PC不偏好任何武器，则无面鬼挥舞一根棍棒作为其虚假武器。该虚假武器仅部分真实，命中时只造成心灵伤害；它不会获得原武器的任何特征或魔法强化。若无面鬼模仿者的虚假武器处于破损状态、被缴械或被放下，它便会消散。无面鬼模仿者可以花费10分钟重塑一把，以制作一把替代的虚假武器。</p>\n<p>A noppera-bo impersonator carries a <em>+1 striking</em> weapon that looks identical to the favored weapon of the PC being impersonated. If the PC favors unarmed strikes, it appears as hand wraps. If the PC favors a ranged weapon, then the noppera-bo impersonator has no melee weapon and instead uses the ranged weapon rules above; otherwise, the noppera-bo impersonator has no ranged weapon. If the PCs favors no weapon, then the noppera-bo wields a club as its false weapon. This false weapon is only partially real and inflicts only mental damage when it hits; it gains none of the original weapon's traits or magical enhancements. If a noppera-bo impersonator's false weapon is broken, disarmed, or set down, it fades away. The noppera-bo impersonator can craft a replacement false weapon by spending 10 minutes to recreate one.</p>"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30 尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼没有视觉，但听觉十分敏锐。它们不需要呼吸，并且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上会将双手或无脸的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用来“饮用”；它们也能以这种方式从消耗品（如药水或灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo has no sense of vision, but their hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋} 状态，它们就会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>As long as the noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonated Spellcasting": {
              "name": "模仿者施法 Impersonated Spellcasting",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼模仿者获得一套先天法术，其根源与其所模仿的PC所使用的施法根源相匹配。你可以调整这些法术，使其更贴合该次伪装。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo impersonator gains a suites of innate spells, matching the spellcasting tradition utilized by the PC being impersonated. You can adjust the spells to make a more perfect fit for the impersonation.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "无面鬼模仿者（奥术） Noppera-Bo Impersonator (Arcane)"
        },
        "Will-o'-Wisp": {
          "name": "鬼火 Will-o'-Wisp",
          "tokenName": "鬼火 Will-o'-Wisp",
          "items": {
            "Shock": {
              "name": "震慑 Shock"
            },
            "Glow": {
              "name": "发光 Glow",
              "description": "<p>20英尺。</p>\n<p>鬼火自身天生隐形，但会散发有色光芒，在灵光内投下明亮光照并使其可见。</p>\n<p>20 feet.</p>\n<p>A will-o'-wisp is itself naturally invisible, but glows with a colored light, casting bright light in the aura and making it visible.</p>"
            },
            "Magic Immunity": {
              "name": "魔法免疫 Magic Immunity",
              "description": "<p>鬼火免疫所有法术，唯有 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{Force Barrage}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Oj1PJBMQD9vuwCv7]{Quandary} 和 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.0qaqksrGGDj74HXE]{Revealing Light} 例外。</p>\n<p>A will-o'-wisp is immune to all spells except @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{Force Barrage}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Oj1PJBMQD9vuwCv7]{Quandary}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.0qaqksrGGDj74HXE]{Revealing Light}.</p>"
            },
            "Feed on Fear": {
              "name": "以恐惧为食 Feed on Fear",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 15尺内的一名敌人处于恐惧效果影响下或濒死</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 鬼火以生物的恐惧为食。它恢复 @Damage[2d4[healing]]{2d4 生命值}，并且若它已进入 Gone Dark 状态，则其光辉重新点亮。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An enemy within 15 feet is under a fear effect or dying</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The will-o'-wisp feeds on the creature's terror. It regains @Damage[2d4[healing]]{2d4 Hit Points}, and if it has Gone Dark, its glow reignites.</p>"
            },
            "Go Dark": {
              "name": "变暗 Go Dark",
              "description": "<p>鬼火熄灭自身的光辉，变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{隐形}。它可以再次使用此动作来结束该效果。如果它在隐形时使用其电击攻击，电弧会让任何观察者确定其位置，使鬼火在其移动前对所有观察者仅处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{藏匿}状态。</p>\n<p>The will-o'-wisp extinguishes its glow, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. It can end this effect with another use of this action. If it uses its shock attack while invisible, the arc of electricity lets any observer determine its location, making the will-o'-wisp only @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to all observers until it moves.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>恶意的彩色光球，鬼火会在荒僻的沼泽与森林中作祟，引诱毫无戒心的旅人坠入险境。鬼火能改变自身散发的颜色与亮度，并乐于模仿上下浮动的提灯或远处的火光，把迷路或迷失方向的旅人从安全的小路上引开。它们还能将光芒完全熄灭，使自己变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}，而且尤其喜欢在受害者彻底迷失、并意识到远处那摇曳的光点其实并未引领他们走向安全时这么做。不过即便隐形，鬼火也很少远离自己的目标，因为它以受害者感受到的惊恐与惧意为食。</p>\n<p>在光芒之下，鬼火的身体是一个海绵状的球体，直径约1英尺，重量不足5磅。虽然大多数鬼火只是半透明、毫无特征的球体，只在它们制造的变幻光照中才显出轮廓，但也有少数带着深色斑驳，近看时像一颗骷髅头。鬼火不需要任何世俗的食物，事实上，它们甚至没有摄取任何物质的能力；它们所需的一切养分都来自附近生物的恐惧。正因如此，它们喜欢与能让受害者产生恐惧的不死并肩行动。鬼火寿命极长，若非近乎不朽；它们记忆力也很好。一个被震慑或被击败的鬼火可以成为传闻与信息的良好来源，但要让这样一只阴险的怪物合作绝非易事。</p>\n<p>鬼火栖息在荒凉的沼泽与森林，通常在暮色时分与入夜后活动。因此，它们不太愿意把受害者引向立刻致命的区域，例如陷阱坑，而更偏好那些能让受害者长时间受苦的危害，比如滞浊或有毒空气的囤积区、流沙地带，以及更大型怪物的巢穴。依鬼火所言，不同类型的恐惧在“味道”上有微妙差别：那种盘踞在胃底、啃噬着逐渐意识到自己迷路之人的隐约惧意，与面对高耸怪物、濒临死亡时突如其来而凛然的惊恐，品尝起来截然不同。正因如此，鬼火会设法变化引发猎物恐惧的方式，确保自己不会对某些恐惧的“风味”感到厌倦。</p>\n<p>Malevolent balls of colored light, will-o'-wisps haunt lonely marshes and forests, where they lure unsuspecting travelers into danger. Will-o'-wisps can vary the color and illumination they shed, and delight in mimicking bobbing lanterns or distant fires to draw lost or disoriented travelers off of safe trails. They can extinguish their illumination entirely to become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}, and they enjoy doing so once their victims are wholly lost and have realized that the bobbing light in the distance isn't, in fact, leading them to safety. Even invisible, however, a will-o'-wisp rarely ventures far from its target, as it feasts upon the panic and dread felt by its victims.</p>\n<p>Beneath its glow, a will-o'-wisp's body is a spongy ball approximately 1 foot in diameter and weighing less than 5 pounds. Although most will-o'-wisps are merely translucent, featureless orbs, gaining definition only in the shifting illumination they create, a few have dark mottling that makes them resemble a skull when viewed closely. Will-o'-wisps have no need for mundane nourishment, and in fact, lack the ability to consume matter of any kind; they find all the sustenance they need in the terror of nearby creatures. For this reason, they like to work alongside undead that produce terror in their victims. Will-o'-wisps are long-lived, if not effectively immortal, and they have good memories. A cowed or defeated will-o'-wisp can be a good source of lore and information, though acquiring such cooperation from such a sinister monster is no easy feat.</p>\n<p>Will-o'-wisps inhabit desolate swamps and forests and are generally active at twilight and after dark. They are therefore reluctant to lead victims into immediately fatal areas such as deadfalls, but instead prefer hazards where their victims suffer over a long time, such as pockets of stale or poisonous air, patches of quicksand, and dens of bigger monsters. According to will-o'-wisps, different types of fear have subtle differences in flavor. The lurking dread in the pit of the stomach that gnaws at those who slowly become aware of the fact that they're lost produces a much different taste than the sudden, stark terror of imminent death in the face of a towering monster. Because of this, will-o'-wisps try to vary the ways in which they induce terror in their prey, to ensure they don't tire of certain flavors of fear.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "鬼火 Will-o'-Wisp"
        },
        "Large Suite": {
          "name": "大型套房 Large Suite",
          "tokenName": "大型套房 Large Suite",
          "items": {
            "Moonsilver Necklace": {
              "name": "月银项链 Moonsilver Necklace",
              "description": "<p>与自然同调之人深知生命的短暂与灵魂的迁徙。正如月有盈亏，生命之烛亦有燃起与熄灭。制造此物品的仪式需要在月光直照之下献祭一只动物，人们相信以这种方式牺牲的生物会受到祝福，得以转生术进入更好的来世。佩戴这条银质新月形项链时，你的徒手近战打击视为银质武器，并具有@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch}符文的特性。</p>\n<p>Those who are in tune with nature understand well the transience of life and the migration of souls. Just as the moon waxes and wanes, so too are the candles of life lit and extinguished. The ritual for creating this item requires an animal sacrifice in direct moonlight, the belief being that creatures sacrificed in this way are blessed to reincarnate into better lives. While wearing this silver, crescent-shaped necklace, your unarmed melee Strikes are silver weapons with the properties of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch} rune.</p>"
            },
            "Destroyed Skyfang Crystal": {
              "name": "被毁坏的天牙水晶 Destroyed Skyfang Crystal",
              "description": "<p>一枚被毁的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.vSctvZGoJYTHjpZV]{天牙水晶}，这是一件用于护卫以抵御恶魔与不死的魔法物品；这枚水晶被一种强大到超出其庇护能力的力量所摧毁，如今不过是一件价值 5 gp 的好奇之物。</p>\n<p>A destroyed @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.vSctvZGoJYTHjpZV]{Skyfang Crystal}, a magical item used to ward against fiends and undead; this crystal was ruined by a potent force beyond its power to shelter against and is now merely a curiosity worth 5 gp.</p>"
