            "Sporesight (Imprecise) 60 feet": {
              "name": "孢子视界（不精确）60英尺 Sporesight (Imprecise) 60 feet",
              "description": "<p>龙蕈蜥会散发一团孢子云，并用其进行视物。这是一种模糊感官，只能在没有强风气流的区域内发挥作用。孢子视界在水下无法发挥作用。</p>\n<p>The drakauthix exudes a cloud of spores that it uses to see. This is an imprecise sense that functions only in areas without strong wind currents. Sporesight does not function underwater.</p>"
            },
            "Obscuring Spores": {
              "name": "遮蔽孢子 Obscuring Spores",
              "description": "<p>每当德拉考西克斯受到至少 @Damage[10[slashing]] 伤害时，它会在一个 @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] 内释放一团棕色孢子云，持续 1 分钟（或直到被强风吹散）。所有处于孢子云内的生物都会变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}，而所有处于孢子云外的生物对孢子云内的生物而言也会变为隐蔽。在这团孢子云内，德拉考西克斯的孢子视界变为精确感官。孢子云不会随德拉考西克斯一起移动，也不会因其移动而被推移。</p>\n<p>Whenever the drakauthix takes at least @Damage[10[slashing]] damage, it releases a cloud of brown spores in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20] that persists for 1 minute (or until dispersed by a strong wind). All creatures within the spores become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all creatures outside the spores become concealed to creatures within it. Within this cloud of spores, the drakauthix's sporesight becomes a precise sense. The spore cloud does not move with the drakauthix nor is it displaced by its movement.</p>"
            },
            "Reel In": {
              "name": "卷回 Reel In",
              "description": "<p>德拉卡乌希克斯将所有它已使其@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}的生物拉拽到距离自身近15英尺的位置。</p>\n<p>The drakauthix pulls all creatures it has @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} 15 feet closer to itself.</p>"
