            "Spore Tendrils": {
              "name": "孢子触须 Spore Tendrils",
              "description": "<p>覆盖在德拉考西克斯身体上的触须伸出并侵染相邻的生物，造成 @Damage[4d6[poison]] 伤害和 @Damage[1d6[persistent,poison]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:27|basic] 豁免；被德拉考西克斯 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒} 的生物在此次豁免上承受 –4 环境减值）。</p>\n<p>The tendrils that cover the drakauthix's body reach out and infest adjacent creatures, dealing @Damage[4d6[poison]] damage and @Damage[1d6[persistent,poison]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:27|basic] save; a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} by the drakauthix takes a –4 circumstance penalty to this save).</p>"
