            "Whirlwind of Hooks": {
              "name": "钩旋风 Whirlwind of Hooks",
              "description": "<p>德拉寇西斯旋转挥舞，将周围的生物甩动。它对触及范围内的每个生物各进行一次触手打击。这些攻击计入德拉寇西斯的多重攻击减值，但在德拉寇西斯完成所有攻击之前，多重攻击减值不会增加。</p>\n<p>The drakauthix whirls, whipping creatures around it. It makes a tentacle Strike against every creature within reach. These attacks count toward the drakauthix's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after the drakauthix makes all its attacks.</p>"
