            "Marvelous Miniature (Ladder)": {
              "name": "奇妙微缩模型（梯子） Marvelous Miniature (Ladder)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>每个<em>奇妙微缩模型</em>都是对真实生物或物体的异常微小的复制品。该微缩模型由木头、白镴或其他简单材料制成，并在复制品底座的底面刻有一枚符文。<em>奇妙微缩模型</em>有时会成套包装在一起；例如，露营套装包含小船、篝火和马的微缩模型。启动一个<em>奇妙微缩模型</em>会使其变形为另一种生物或物体，随后便可像正常使用该物体一样使用它。每个微缩模型只能启动一次，其中大多数会永久变成其描述中的物品。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>启动后，该微缩模型会永久变形为一架长20英尺的木梯。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Every <em>marvelous miniature</em> is an exceptionally small replica of a real creature or object. The miniature is made from wood, pewter, or other simple materials, and features a rune etched into the underside of the replica's base. <em>Marvelous miniatures</em> sometimes come packaged together; for example, the camping set features the boat, campfire, and horse miniatures. Activating a <em>marvelous miniature</em> causes it to transform into another creature or object, which then can be used as normal for that object. Each miniature can be activated only once, with most of them permanently becoming the item in their description.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When activated, this miniature transforms permanently into a 20-foot-long wooden ladder.</p>"
