              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一个生物在蝰蛇相邻处或在蝰蛇的空间内结束其移动。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 蝰蛇行走、攀爬或游泳至多10尺（或至多等于相应的速度，若该速度低于10尺）。它必须在一个不在敌人5尺范围内的位置结束其移动。此移动不会触发反应动作。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature ends its movement adjacent to the viper or within the viper's space.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The viper Strides, Climbs, or Swims up to 10 feet (or up to the relevant Speed, if that Speed is less than 10 feet). It must end its movement in a location that isn't within 5 feet of a foe. This movement doesn't trigger reactions.</p>"
