          "publicNotes": "<p>这个毒蛇家族的每个成员都长着细长的铰接毒牙，能将强效毒液注入猎物体内。不同的蝰蛇会注入不同类型的毒液，可能导致麻痹、剧烈疼痛与肿胀、血液凝结，甚至让受害者的心脏突然停止跳动。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>蛇的形态多种多样，从生活在丛林中的缠绕型蛇类——它们会缠住猎物——到拥有致命毒咬的毒蝰。无论哪一种，所有蛇都会通过使下颚脱臼将猎物整吞下去，并用强壮的肌肉把食物推送着沿喉咙进入胃里。</p>\n<p>Each member of this family of venomous snakes has long, hinged fangs that inject potent venom into their prey. Different vipers inject different types of venom, which might result in paralysis, extreme pain and swelling, blood clotting, or even the sudden stopping of the victim's heart.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Snakes come in an array of forms, from jungle-dwelling constrictors that wrap around their prey to venomous vipers with deadly bites. Regardless, all snakes consume their prey whole by unhinging their jaws and using powerful muscles to move the food down their throats and into their stomachs.</p>",
