            "Legerdemain Handkerchief": {
              "name": "戏法手帕 Legerdemain Handkerchief",
              "description": "<p>这条带褶边、银灰色的手帕表面上看是用于个人卫生的时髦工具，但它也可以用来暗中让非常小的物品消失。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 手帕必须完全覆盖一件负载可忽略的物品</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 手帕将其覆盖的物品传送进它的异次元空间。手帕的异次元空间一次只能容纳一件物品，因此每当取走一件物品时，都会被空间内原本存在的物品替换。你也可以用此动作将异次元空间内已有的物品排出而不进行替换。除非持有该物品的生物允许，否则此启动不能用于有人持用的物品。将手帕盖到物品上通常需要一个交互动作。</p>\n<p>This frilled, silvery-gray handkerchief is a stylish tool for personal hygiene by all appearances, but it can be used to covertly make very small items vanish.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The handkerchief is entirely covering an item of negligible Bulk</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The handkerchief transports the item it covers into its extradimensional space. The handkerchief can hold only one item within its extradimensional space at a time, so any item taken is replaced by any item already within the space. You can also use this action to expel an item already within the extradimensional space without replacing it. This activation can't be used on an attended item unless the creature with that item allows it. Placing the handkerchief over an item typically takes an Interact action.</p>"
