        "Path Maiden": {
          "name": "行道女 Path Maiden",
          "tokenName": "行道女 Path Maiden",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Phantasmal Calamity": {
              "name": "魅影灾祸 Phantasmal Calamity",
              "description": "<p>一幅末日毁灭的景象充斥区域内每个生物的心智。该景象造成11d6心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。在大失败时，该生物还必须在一次@Check[reflex]豁免中成功，否则会相信自己被困住（卡在裂隙中、在海上漂流，或其他与其所见景象相符的命运）。如果第二次豁免失败，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑（状态）}，持续1分钟。它可以在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的意志豁免；成功时，它会识破幻觉并从震慑（状态）中恢复。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a @Check[reflex] save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it disbelieves the illusion and recovers from the stunned condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Blast": {
              "name": "灵魂冲击 Spirit Blast",
              "description": "<p>你凝聚以太能量并攻击一名生物的魂魄，造成16d6魂魄伤害，目标需进行一次基础强韧豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You concentrate ethereal energy and attack a creature's spirit, dealing 16d6 spirit damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Scene": {
              "name": "幻象场景 Illusory Scene",
              "description": "<p>你构筑一个虚构的场景，其中包含至多10个彼此独立的生物或物体，体型可各不相同，但都必须位于该法术的区域内。这些要素会产生恰当的声音与气味，触感也与真实无异。幻象场景中的要素无法说话。不同于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature}法术，你场景中的生物没有战斗能力与数据。你的场景不会包含对其周围环境的改变，不过你可以将该场景置于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage}法术所创造的幻象环境之中。</p>\n<p>当你创造该场景时，你可以选择让它静止或按照程序运行。静止场景虽然固定不动，但会包含基本的自然移动。例如，风吹动一张幻象纸片时会使其沙沙作响。程序最长可达1分钟，并在结束后重复。比如，你可以创造两个兽人互相战斗的场景，而每次重复时战斗都会以同样的方式进行。若你创造的是循环，这两名战士在场景开始与结束时会处于相同的位置，但你可以平滑该程序，使人难以分辨循环在何时结束与开始。任何人观察该场景超过几分钟后，几乎总会注意到它在循环。你在创造该幻觉后无法更改该程序。</p>\n<p>任何生物只要接触影像的任意部分，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}动作检查它，就可以尝试识破你的幻觉。若他们与幻觉的某一部分进行交互，则只会识破该部分。只有在大成功或大失败时，他们才会识破整个场景。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你场景中的生物或物体可以说话。你在创造程序时必须为每个角色说出其特定台词。该法术会为每个角色伪装你的声音。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 同6环版本，且持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You craft an imaginary scene that includes up to 10 discrete creatures or objects of various sizes, all of which must be within the spell's area. These elements generate appropriate sounds and smells, and they feel right to the touch. Elements of an illusory scene are incapable of speech. Unlike with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature} spell, creatures in your scene lack combat abilities and statistics. Your scene doesn't include changes to the environment around it, though you can place your scene within the illusory environment of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage} spell.</p>\n<p>When you create the scene, you can choose to have it be static or follow a program. Though a static scene is stationary, it includes basic natural movement. For example, wind blowing on an illusory piece of paper would rustle it. A program can be up to 1 minute long and repeats when finished. For instance, you could create a scene of two orcs fighting each other, and the fight would go the same way for each repetition. If you create a loop, the two fighters end up in the same place at the start of the scene and at the end of it, but you can smooth the program so it's hard to tell when the loop ends and begins. Anyone observing the scene for more than a few minutes almost always notices it looping. You're unable to alter the program after you create the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches any part of the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. If they interact with a portion of the illusion, they disbelieve only that portion. They disbelieve the entire scene only on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Creatures or objects in your scene can speak. You must speak the specific lines for each actor when creating your program. The spell disguises your voice for each actor.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As the 6th-rank version, and the duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Wave of Despair": {
              "name": "绝望之波 Wave of Despair",
              "description": "<p>你使区域内的生物陷入绝望。每个生物所受的影响由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续 1 轮，该生物不能使用反应动作，且必须在其回合开始时再次尝试一次豁免；若失败，则它在该回合中获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，因为它无法控制地抽泣。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续时间为 1 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物在 1 分钟内自动获得缓慢 1。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为 60 尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically slowed 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Outcast's Curse": {
              "name": "流放诅咒 Outcast's Curse",
              "description": "<p>你用一道诅咒折磨目标，使其存在感令人不快且惹人厌。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续10分钟，当目标尝试欺瞒、交涉、威吓或表演检定时，必须掷骰两次并取较差结果；并且其所遭遇的生物对其的初始态度会降低一级（例如，用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{不友善}取代@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{不关心}）。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但该效果为永久。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败：失败</strong> 同失败，并且目标所遭遇的生物对其的初始态度会降低两级。</p>\n<p>You afflict the target with a curse that makes its presence abrasive and off-putting. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 10 minutes, the target must roll twice and use the worse result whenever attempting a Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, or Performance check, and creatures they encounter have an initial attitude toward them of one step worse (for instance, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{Unfriendly} instead of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{Indifferent}).</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect is permanent.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and creatures that the target encounters have an initial attitude toward them of two steps worse.</p>"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "传送 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你立刻将自己以及你穿戴和持有的任何物品从你当前的空间传送到射程内你能看见的一处未被占据的空间。若这会将另一个生物一并带上——即使你把它装在一个异次元容器里携带——则该法术失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至1英里。你不需要能看见目的地，只要你过去曾到过那里，并且知道它相对你的位置与距离即可。随后你获得持续1小时的暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Create Undead": {
              "name": "唤起死灵 Create Undead",
              "description": "<p>你将目标转化为一个不死生物，其等级上限如“生物创造仪式”表所示。此仪式有许多版本，每个版本都对应一种特定类型的不死（例如：一个用于所有丧尸的仪式、一个用于骷髅（特征）的仪式、一个用于食尸鬼（特征）的仪式，等等），而能创造稀有不死的仪式本身也同样稀有。某些不死形态（例如巫妖）会用其自身独特的方法形成，无法通过任何版本的<em>唤起死灵</em>来创造。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标成为相应类型的不死生物。若其等级至少比你低4级，你可以使其成为你的仆从。这会使其获得仆从（特征），意味着当你对其施加命令术时，它可以使用2个动作；而对其施加命令术是一个带有听觉与专注（特征）的单动作。你最多可以控制四个仆从。若其具有智能且未成为仆从，该不死会因你唤醒它而对你乐于帮助，尽管它仍是可憎而邪恶的生物。若其不具智能且未成为仆从，你可以给予它一个简单的命令。它会一心一意地追求该目标，无视你之后的任何命令。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功或大失败，但未成为你仆从的有智能不死仅对你友善；而未成为你仆从的无智能不死会放过你，除非你攻击它。它会在当地区域横行肆虐，而非遵从你的命令。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你未能创造不死。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 你创造了不死，但其灵魂被你邪恶的死灵术折磨，对你只剩下仇恨。它会试图毁灭你。</p>\n<h2>生物创造仪式</h2>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生物等级</th>\n<th>所需法术环阶</th>\n<th>花费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-1或0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>15 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>60 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>105 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>180 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>300 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>480 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>750 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1,080 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2,100 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>4,200 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>13,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>30,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>45,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>You transform the target into an undead creature with a level up to that allowed in the Creature Creation Rituals table. There are many versions of this ritual, each specific to a particular type of undead (one ritual for all zombies, one for skeletons, one for ghouls, and so on), and the rituals that create rare undead are also rare. Some forms of undead, such as liches, form using their own unique methods and can't be created with a version of <em>create undead</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes an undead creature of the appropriate type. If it's at least 4 levels lower than you, you can make it a minion. This gives it the minion trait, meaning it can use 2 actions when you command it, and commanding it is a single action that has the auditory and concentrate traits. You can have a maximum of four minions under your control. If it's intelligent and doesn't become a minion, the undead is helpful to you for awakening it, though it's still a horrid and evil creature. If it's unintelligent and doesn't become a minion, you can give it one simple command. It pursues that goal single-mindedly, ignoring any of your subsequent commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, except an intelligent undead that doesn't become your minion is only friendly to you, and an unintelligent undead that doesn't become your minion leaves you alone unless you attack it. It marauds the local area rather than following your command.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to create the undead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You create the undead, but its soul, tortured by your foul necromancy, is full of nothing but hatred for you. It attempts to destroy you.</p>\n<h2>Creatures Creation Rituals</h2>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Creature Level</th>\n<th>Spell Rank Required</th>\n<th>Cost</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-1 or 0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>15 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>60 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>105 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>180 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>300 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>480 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>750 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1,080 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2,100 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>4,200 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>13,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>30,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>45,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一种由简单声音构成的听觉幻觉，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时大喊。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可辨识的词语或其他精细的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Know the Way": {
              "name": "知晓道路 Know the Way",
              "description": "<p>在你的心眼中，你以魔法重新校准自身。你立刻知道北方是哪边（若你当前所在地存在北方），并且你可以选择一个你在过去24小时内曾到过的地点，并得知它位于哪个方向。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以选择一个你在过去一周内曾到过的地点。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>你可以选择一个你曾到过的地点，无论那是在多久以前。</p>\n<p>In your mind's eye, you magically reorient yourself. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location), and you can choose a location you were at within the last 24 hours and learn what direction it lies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can choose a location you were at within the last week.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can choose a location you were at regardless of how long ago you were there.</p>"
            },
            "Light": {
              "name": "光 Light",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个光球，在你选择的颜色下，于20英尺半径内散发明亮光照（并在接下来的20英尺内提供昏暗光照）。如果你在与一个自愿生物相同的空间内创造光照，你可以将光照附着在该生物身上，使其在该生物移动时漂浮在其附近。你可以维持法术以将光照最多移动60英尺；你可以将其作为此次移动的一部分附着到某个生物上或从其身上解除附着。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。如果你在已经有四个<em>光</em>法术处于激活状态时施放该法术，你必须选择一个现存法术使其结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{法术效果：光}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 光球在60英尺半径内散发光照（并在接下来的60英尺内提供昏暗光照）。</p>\n<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造一只漂浮的魔法之手，它可以是隐形的或幽魂般的，抓住作为目标的物体，并使其缓慢地向任意方向飘浮最多20英尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以让该物体额外移动20英尺。如果法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为2或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将射程内一件松散、无人持用且负载不超过1的物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若命中，你造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——以你掷出的物体适用者为准。被掷出的物品不具有任何会影响此次攻击或伤害的特定特征或魔法属性。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成完整伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Apostate's Shroud": {
              "name": "叛教者寿衣 Apostate's Shroud"
            },
            "Telepathy 100 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 100 英尺 Telepathy 100 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Limited Flight": {
              "name": "有限飞行 Limited Flight",
              "description": "<p>行道女拥有等同于其速度的飞行速度，但不能飞到离地面超过10英尺的高度；如果她在非坚实表面上方结束其回合，她会消失并在她最后一次位于坚实地面上方的空间中重新显现，并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<p>A path maiden has a fly Speed equal to her Speed but can't fly higher than 10 feet above the ground, and if she ends her turn above a nonsolid surface, she vanishes and rematerializes on the last space she occupied over solid ground and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>"
            },
            "+1 Status to All Saves vs. Vitality": {
              "name": "对所有对抗活力的豁免获得+1状态加值 +1 Status to All Saves vs. Vitality"
            },
            "Imprisoning Grave": {
              "name": "监禁坟墓 Imprisoning Grave",
              "description": "<p>30英尺。在行道女光环范围内死亡的生物，其灵魂会被困在其尸体内，直到其身体在光环范围外度过1分钟为止。在被困期间，灵魂无法前往来世，但仍可以被复活或转化为不死生物。</p>\n<p>30 feet. The soul of a creature that dies within the path maiden's aura is trapped within its corpse until its body spends 1 minute outside the aura. While trapped, the soul can't move on to the afterlife but can still be brought back to life or transformed into an undead creature.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Scorn Fate": {
              "name": "蔑视命运 Scorn Fate",
              "description": "<p>行道女以她能看见的一个生物为目标。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:32] 意志豁免。失败时，该生物的下一次掷骰会被诅咒。如果该次掷骰的结果为大成功，则变为普通成功。成功变为失败，而失败变为大失败。随后，该生物在24小时内暂时免疫于蔑视命运。</p>\n<p>The path maiden targets a creature she can see. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save. On a failure, the creature's next roll is cursed. If the result of the roll is a critical success, it becomes a regular success. A success becomes a failure, and a failure becomes a critical failure. That creature is then temporarily immune to Scorn Fate for 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Vengeful Frenzy": {
              "name": "复仇狂暴 Vengeful Frenzy",
              "description": "<p>行道女选择一个她能看见且在60尺内的生物作为目标。目标必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:32]意志豁免。若失败，目标将陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}直到其下个回合结束，但该困惑不会导致其攻击行道女或自身。</p>\n<p>The path maiden targets a creature within 60 feet that she can see. The target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save. On a failure, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} until the end of its next turn, but it can't attack path maidens or itself as the result of this confusion.</p>"
            },
            "Pharasma Lore": {
              "name": "法莱斯玛学识 Pharasma Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>神门的崇拜者将自己的一呼一吸都献给法莱斯玛，却在临终之际反抗这位女神；这样的人有时会在死后化为行道女。所有行道女所穿的衣装，是她们昔日信仰残存的最后痕迹，也是对其耻辱的永久提醒。</p>\n<h2>行道游民</h2>\n<p>行道女几乎总是以女性形态显现。以男性形态显现者则被称为行道游民。这些不死拥有相同的能力，但往往会走得更远；它们更象征着背弃法莱斯玛作为预言者与命运操纵者的职责，而非背弃她掌管生与死的职责。</p>\n<p>Worshippers in Shenmen who devote their every breath to Pharasma only to defy the goddess with their last sometimes transform, upon death, into path maidens. The garments all path maidens wear are the last vestiges of their former faith, a permanent reminder of their disgrace.</p>\n<h2>Path Nomads</h2>\n<p>Path maidens almost always manifest in feminine forms. Those who manifest in masculine forms are instead known as path nomads. These undead have the same abilities but tend to travel more widely; they represent turning one's back on Pharasma's role as a prophet and manipulator of destiny than of her roles over birth and death.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "行道女 Path Maiden"
        },
        "Kitchen": {
          "name": "厨房 Kitchen",
          "tokenName": "厨房 Kitchen",
          "items": {
            "Sticky Residue": {
              "name": "黏性残留物 Sticky Residue",
              "description": "<p>5剂毒素，其作用与猎蛛毒相同。</p><hr /><p>这种毒液会侵蚀其目标的防御，帮助蜘蛛捕获猎物。</p><hr /><p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">D</span> 交互（伤害）</p><p><strong>豁免</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:21]</p><p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 6轮</p><p><strong>阶段1</strong> @Damage[1d10[poison]] 伤害且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{措手不及}（1轮）</p><p><strong>阶段2</strong> @Damage[1d12[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，且措手不及（1轮）</p><p><strong>阶段3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] 伤害，@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 2}，且措手不及（1轮）</p>\n<p>5 doses of poison that functions the same as hunting spider venom.</p><hr /><p>This venom erodes its target's defenses, aiding the spider in securing prey.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">D</span> Interact (Injury)</p><p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:21]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d10[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d12[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, and off-guard (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, and off-guard (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Sterling Artisan's Tools (Brewing and Serving Tea)": {
              "name": "专家级工匠工具（泡茶与奉茶） Sterling Artisan's Tools (Brewing and Serving Tea)",
              "description": "<p>你需要这些工具才能用制作技能将原材料制成物品。专家级工匠工具使你在该次检定中获得+1物品加值。</p>\n<p>不同的工作需要不同的工具套装，由GM决定；例如，铁匠的工具包与木匠的工具包不同。如果你穿戴你的工匠工具包，你可以在使用它的动作中将其抽出并收起，作为该动作的一部分。</p>\n<p>You need these tools to create items from raw materials with the Craft skill. Sterling artisan's tools give you a +1 item bonus to the check.</p>\n<p>Different sets are needed for different work, as determined by the GM; for example, a blacksmith's toolkit differs from a woodworker's toolkit. If you wear your artisan's toolkit, you can draw and replace it as part of the action that uses it.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "厨房 Kitchen"
        },
