            "Frightening Visage": {
              "name": "骇人幻象 Frightening Visage",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物看向水面</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 该生物看见自己在水面上的倒影扭曲成一个恶魔般的自己；它必须在一次 @Check[will|dc:20] 豁免中成功，否则将变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}（若大失败，则在其保持惊惧期间还将获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}）。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature looks at the water</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature sees its reflection on the water's surface distort into a fiendish version of themselves; they must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:20] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} (and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for as long as they remain frightened on a critical failure).</p>"
