          "disable": "<p>@Check[religion|dc:20]以驱逐作祟，或@Check[intimidation|dc:23]将恐惧反施于作祟并将其压倒</p>\n<p>@Check[religion|dc:20] to exorcise the haunt, or @Check[intimidation|dc:23] to turn the fear back on the haunt and overwhelm it</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>在这里，水中的倒影看起来显得怪物般、如恶魔般可怖。</p>\n<p>Reflections viewed in the water here appear monstrous and fiendish.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>作祟会立刻重置，并能在下一轮再次触发。</p>\n<p>The haunt resets immediately and can trigger again the next round.</p>",
