            "Work Clothes (Functions as Leather Armor)": {
              "name": "工作服（功能等同于皮甲） Work Clothes (Functions as Leather Armor)",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧与定型的煮皮混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时具备最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
