            "Pitch Bale": {
              "name": "草垛 Pitch Bale",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 农民的上一个动作是一次成功的干草叉打击</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 农民将其用干草叉击中的生物移动最多5英尺，且目标 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。目标可以尝试一次 @Check[reflex|dc:13] 豁免以避免倒地，并在大成功或大失败时完全避免被移动。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The farmer's last action was a successful pitchfork Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The farmer moves the creature they hit with their pitchfork up to 5 feet, and the target falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. The target can attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:13] save to avoid falling prone and avoids being moved altogether on a critical success.</p>"
