              "description": "<p>这些斧子被明确设计为武器，而非工具。它们通常更轻，斧柄以金属箍或铆钉加固，且刃口更锋利，使其更适合砍断肢体而非木材。</p>\n<p>These axes are designed explicitly as weapons, rather than tools. They typically weigh less, with a shaft reinforced with metal bands or bolts, and have a sharper blade, making them ideal for chopping limbs rather than wood.</p>"
