        "Yami": {
          "name": "小暗 Yami",
          "tokenName": "小暗 Yami",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Create Undead (Zombie Only)": {
              "name": "唤起死灵（仅限丧尸） Create Undead (Zombie Only)",
              "description": "<p>你将目标转化为一个不死生物，其等级上限如表7-1所示。此仪式有许多版本，每个版本都对应某一种特定类型的不死（例如：所有丧尸使用同一种仪式、骷髅使用一种、食尸鬼使用一种，等等），而能制造稀有不死的仪式本身也同样稀有。某些不死形态，例如巫妖，会以其自身独有的方法形成，无法通过任何版本的<em>唤起死灵</em>来制造。</p>\n<h2>表7-1：生物创造仪式</h2>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生物等级</th>\n<th>所需法术阶位</th>\n<th>费用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-1或0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>15 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>60 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>105 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>180 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>300 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>480 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>750 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1,080 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2,100 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>4,200 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>13,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>30,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>45,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标成为适当类型的不死生物。若它的等级至少比你低4级，你可以让它成为一个仆从。这会使其获得仆从（特征），意味着当你命令它时，它可以使用2个动作；而命令它是一个带有听觉与专注（特征）的单动作。你最多可以同时控制四个仆从。若它具有智能且未成为仆从，则该不死会因你将其唤醒而对你乐于帮助，尽管它依然是可怖且邪恶的生物。若它没有智能且未成为仆从，你可以给予它一个简单命令。它会一心一意地追逐该目标，无视你之后的任何命令。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功或大失败，但具有智能且未成为你仆从的不死仅对你友善；而没有智能且未成为你仆从的不死会放任你不管，除非你攻击它。它会在本地区域内肆虐，而不是遵从你的命令。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你未能创造该不死。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 你创造了该不死，但它的灵魂被你污秽的死灵法术所折磨，心中对你只剩仇恨。它会试图毁灭你。</p>\n<p>You transform the target into an undead creature with a level up to that allowed in Table 7-1. There are many versions of this ritual, each specific to a particular type of undead (one ritual for all zombies, one for skeletons, one for ghouls, and so on), and the rituals that create rare undead are also rare. Some forms of undead, such as liches, form using their own unique methods and can't be created with a version of <em>create undead</em>.</p>\n<h2>Table 7-1: Creatures Creation Rituals</h2>\n<table class=\"pf2e\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Creature Level</th>\n<th>Spell Rank Required</th>\n<th>Cost</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-1 or 0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>15 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>60 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>105 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>180 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>300 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>480 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>750 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1,080 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>2,100 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>4,200 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>6,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>13,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19,500 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>30,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>45,000 gp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes an undead creature of the appropriate type. If it's at least 4 levels lower than you, you can make it a minion. This gives it the minion trait, meaning it can use 2 actions when you command it, and commanding it is a single action that has the auditory and concentrate traits. You can have a maximum of four minions under your control. If it's intelligent and doesn't become a minion, the undead is helpful to you for awakening it, though it's still a horrid and evil creature. If it's unintelligent and doesn't become a minion, you can give it one simple command. It pursues that goal single-mindedly, ignoring any of your subsequent commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, except an intelligent undead that doesn't become your minion is only friendly to you, and an unintelligent undead that doesn't become your minion leaves you alone unless you attack it. It marauds the local area rather than following your command.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to create the undead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You create the undead, but its soul, tortured by your foul necromancy, is full of nothing but hatred for you. It attempts to destroy you.</p>"
            },
            "Animate Dead (Zombie Only)": {
              "name": "操纵死尸（仅限丧尸） Animate Dead (Zombie Only)",
              "description": "<p>你的魔法从坟冢中挖掘出一具尸体或骷髅，并以死灵的生命力充盈其身，你强迫死者在你的命令下作战。你召唤一个常见生物，该生物具有不死（特征）且其等级为 -1；该生物获得被召唤（特征）。升阶该法术会提高你能够召唤的生物的最高等级。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 等级 1。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 等级 2。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 等级 3。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 等级 5。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 等级 7。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 等级 9。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 等级 11。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 等级 13。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（10环）</strong> 等级 15。</p>\n<p>Your magic dredges up a corpse or skeleton and fills it with necromantic life, and you force the dead to fight at your command. You summon a common creature that has the undead trait and whose level is -1; this creature gains the summoned trait. Heightening the spell increases the maximum level of creature you can summon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> Level 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> Level 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Level 3.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> Level 5.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Level 7.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> Level 9.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> Level 11.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> Level 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> Level 15.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标心智混沌，并以一次心灵冲击令其晕眩。该冲击造成等同于你施法能力调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在该豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加 1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个由简单声音构成的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四个普通人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一只漂浮的魔法之手，它可以是隐形的或幽灵般的，抓住目标物体并使其缓慢悬浮，向任意方向移动至多20英尺。每当你维持该法术时，你可以使该物体额外移动20英尺。若该法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以负载为1或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程提升至60英尺，且你可以以负载为1或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程提升至60英尺，且你可以以负载为2或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Cat at Heart": {
              "name": "心中猫 Cat at Heart",
              "description": "<p>当一只化猫被杀死时，它会立刻通过转生术转生为一只普通家猫，并且永远无法再次变成化猫。</p>\n<p>When a bakeneko is killed, they immediately reincarnate into a normal house cat who can never again become a bakeneko.</p>"
            },
            "Feel the Beat": {
              "name": "感受节拍 Feel the Beat",
              "description": "<p>化猫喜欢跳舞。如果一只化猫在其回合开始时位于某个音乐来源30英尺范围内，它会变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，直到其下个回合开始，因为它会顺从其强迫冲动，跟随曲调的节奏移动：甩动尾巴打着拍子、用后腿从一条换到另一条跺步，或拍打前爪。</p>\n<p>Bakenekos love to dance. If a bakeneko begins their turn within 30 feet of a source of music, they become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until the start of their next turn as they follow their compulsion to move to the rhythm of the tune by swishing their tail in time, stomping from one hind leg to the other, or clapping their front paws.</p>"
            },
            "Flammable": {
              "name": "易燃 Flammable",
              "description": "<p>由于高脂肪饮食，化猫会从皮肤分泌易燃油脂，覆盖在它们的毛发上。如果化猫受到任何火焰伤害，它们的全身就会燃起火焰，使其变成一颗毛茸茸的火球术，直到其下个回合结束。当以这种方式燃烧时，化猫的打击会额外造成1d6点火焰伤害。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.insc09aslLptd0dN]{效果：易燃}</p>\n<p>Thanks to their high-fat diets, bakenekos secrete flammable oils from their skin that coats their fur. If a bakeneko takes any fire damage, their entire body lights up in flame, turning them into a furry fireball until the end of their next turn. While burning in this way, a bakeneko's Strikes inflict an additional 1d6 fire damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.insc09aslLptd0dN]{Effect: Flammable}</p>"
            },
            "Skilled Ritualist": {
              "name": "娴熟主祭 Skilled Ritualist",
              "description": "<p>化猫只能通过 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.c3b6LdLlQDPngNIb]{唤起死灵} 来创造丧尸，但可以在没有次级施法者的情况下进行该仪式，并将施法时间降低至4小时。</p>\n<p>Bakenekos can only create zombies with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.c3b6LdLlQDPngNIb]{Create Undead} but can perform the ritual without secondary casters and lower the casting time to 4 hours.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>化猫会在猫的寿命被延长到超出正常寿限时诞生，无论是因为难以置信的好运、魔法，还是其他手段。随着岁月流逝，这种猫科会变得越来越怪物化——体型增长、智力提升，并对魔法产生亲和力。最终，它们能够用后腿直立行走，培养新的兴趣爱好，并学习语言。尽管智识大幅扩展，许多化猫仍更愿意在飞升后的最初几十年里继续像往常一样生活，充当一只（尤其是格外巨大的）家猫。对有些化猫而言，这是为了获得它们作为猫时无法理解的世界知识；而对另一些化猫来说，这只是想在迈向下一阶段之前，继续与当前的家人和所爱之人共度余生。</p>\n<p>在所有享乐之中，化猫最喜欢跳舞，听到音乐就忍不住随节奏点头、用爪子打拍子，或甩动尾巴。它们常常只是为了看尸体跳舞而将其动起来——而一旦这些不死之物脱离化猫的控制，这种消遣往往会给附近的聚居地带来麻烦。化猫通常举止顽皮又爱恶作剧；虽然它们并非天生邪恶的生物，但由于能够让尸体动起来并命令火焰，仍然令人畏惧。村民经常被一只浑身燃火的猫与一具行走的尸体并肩漫步的景象吓得半死；而化猫与邪恶和秘法的关联，也导致天夏的某些村庄将所有猫都妖魔化。</p>\n<h2>猫又</h2>\n<p>化猫大多把自己操纵的、会动却没有心智的丧尸当作玩物，不过它们也会将这些丧尸用作守卫，甚至用作复仇的代理人。即便如此，它们也会尽力确保自己动起来的不死之物不会被放任自由游荡。多数关于“邪恶化猫”的传说，其实指的是一种相似但危险得多的生物——猫又：一种6等级、中型体型的化猫变种，其咬击会导致一种使心智衰弱的疾病。</p>\n<p>A bakeneko comes into existence when the life of a cat is extended past its normal lifespan, whether through incredible fortune, magic, or other means. With each passing year, the feline becomes more and more monstrous—growing in size, becoming more intelligent, and gaining an affinity for magic. Eventually, they become able to walk upright on their rear legs, pursue new hobbies, and learn languages. Despite this expanded intellect, many bakenekos prefer to enjoy the first decades of their ascension continuing their lives as usual as a (particularly oversized) house cat. For some, they do so because they want to acquire knowledge of the world that they couldn't comprehend as cats, but for others, it's just a desire to live out their lives with their current families and loved ones before moving on to what comes next.</p>\n<p>Bakenekos enjoy dancing above all other pleasures and can't resist nodding their heads, tapping their paws, or swishing their tails in time to music. They often animate corpses simply to watch them dance—a pastime that often spells trouble for nearby settlements should the undead get free from the bakeneko's control. Bakenekos typically have a playful and mischievous demeanor, and while they aren't inherently evil creatures, they're still feared for their ability to animate corpses and command fire. Villagers are often frightened half to death by the sight of a flaming cat strolling alongside a walking corpse, and bakenekos' association with evil and the occult has caused some villages in Tian Xia to vilify all cats.</p>\n<h2>Nekomatas</h2>\n<p>Bakenekos mostly see their animated but mindless zombies as amusements, though they also use them as guardians or even as agents for revenge. Still, they do their best to ensure that undead they animate aren't left to wander free. Most tales of \"evil bakenekos\" in fact refer to a similar and much more dangerous creature, the nekomata—a level 6 Medium-sized variant of the bakeneko whose bite causes a debilitating disease of the mind.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "小暗 Yami"
        },
        "Kugaptee's Centipede": {
          "name": "苦迦菩提的蜈蚣 Kugaptee's Centipede",
          "tokenName": "苦迦菩提的蜈蚣 Kugaptee's Centipede",
          "items": {
            "Mandibles": {
              "name": "颚钳 Mandibles"
            },
            "Foot": {
              "name": "脚 Foot"
