            "Impaling Critical": {
              "name": "穿刺大成功 Impaling Critical",
              "description": "<p>当苦迦菩提的蜈蚣以其颚部造成大成功命中时，目标会被带倒刺的棘刺与刚毛痛苦地刺穿，受到 @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] 伤害，并在流血伤害持续期间一直处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} 状态。</p>\n<p>When Kugaptee's centipede scores a critical hit with his mandibles, the target is painfully pierced with barbed spines and bristles, taking @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage and becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for as long as the bleed damage continues.</p>"
