            "Trample": {
              "name": "践踏 Trample",
              "description": "<p>大型或更小，脚，@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>\n<p>Huge or smaller, foot, @Check[reflex|dc:28|basic]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>"
            },
            "Undulate": {
              "name": "起伏 Undulate",
              "description": "<p>苦迦菩提的蜈蚣行走，距离至多等同于他的速度，或进行步行。进行此移动时，他可以穿过窄至10英尺的空间，而无需 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt]{挤压通过}。</p>\n<p>Kugaptee's centipede Strides up to his Speed or Steps. During this movement, he can pass through spaces as narrow as 10 feet without @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt]{Squeezing}.</p>"
            },
            "Void Venom": {
              "name": "虚空毒液 Void Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段1</strong> @Damage[2d6[void]]伤害并且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段2</strong> @Damage[2d8[void]]伤害，呆滞2，并且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段3</strong> @Damage[2d10[void]]伤害，呆滞2，并且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[void]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[2d8[void]] damage, stupefied 2, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d10[void]] damage, stupefied 2, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} (1 round)</p>"
