          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-nIb8zFdCKkgdz7mg\" class=\"secret\"><p>一名PC若花费10分钟搜寻这间储藏室，并在一次@Check[perception|dc:27|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search]检定中成功，便会在房间西南角一块松动的地砖下发现一份藏得极其巧妙的宝藏</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-nIb8zFdCKkgdz7mg\" class=\"secret\"><p>A PC who takes 10 minutes Searching this storeroom and succeeds at a @Check[perception|dc:27|traits:concentrate,exploration,secret,action:search|name:Search] check discovers a very cleverly hidden treasure under a loose floor stone in the southwest corner of the room</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "松动的地板石块 Loose Floor Stone"
