            "Poisonous Warts": {
              "name": "毒疣 Poisonous Warts",
              "description": "<p>任何用徒手打击命中疣儿或以其他方式触碰这只蟾蜍的生物，都会暴露于巨蟾蜍毒素。</p>\n<p>Any creature that hits the Warty with an unarmed Strike or otherwise touches the toad is exposed to giant toad poison.</p>"
