            "Giant Toad Poison": {
              "name": "巨蟾蜍毒素 Giant Toad Poison",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:19]</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}以及 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:19]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} (1 round)</p>"
