              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p><em>治疗药水</em>是一小瓶宝石红色的液体，饮用者的伤口迅速愈合时会带来一种刺痛的感觉。饮用<em>治疗药水</em>时，你恢复 @Damage[1d8[healing]] 生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>A <em>healing potion</em> is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a <em>healing potion</em>, you regain @Damage[1d8[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"
