        "Meokdan": {
          "name": "莫啖魔 Meokdan",
          "tokenName": "莫啖魔 Meokdan",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Illusory Disguise": {
              "name": "幻象伪装 Illusory Disguise",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个幻觉，使你看起来像另一只体型相同、身高（相差不超过6英寸）与体重（相差不超过50磅）大致相近的生物。该伪装通常足以隐藏你的身份，但不足以乔装成某个特定个体。该法术不会改变你的声音、气味或举止。你可以改变你的衣着与穿戴物品的外观，例如让你的护甲看起来像一件连衣裙。手持物品不受影响，而你移除的任何穿戴物品都会恢复其真实外观。</p>\n<p>施放幻象伪装视为为使用欺瞒进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{乔装}而设置伪装；它会忽略你因把自己伪装成不同类生物而可能承受的任何环境减值，它使你在进行欺瞒检定以防止他人看穿你的伪装时获得+4状态加值，并且即使你未受训也要加上你的等级。你可以解消此法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 该法术也会伪装你的声音与气味，并获得听觉与嗅觉（特征）特征。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以看起来像任何体型相同的生物，甚至是某个特定个体。你必须见过该个体才能呈现其外貌。该法术也会伪装你的声音与气味，并获得听觉与嗅觉（特征）特征。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{法术效果：幻象伪装}</p>\n<p>You create an illusion that causes you to appear as another creature of the same body shape, and with roughly similar height (within 6 inches) and weight (within 50 pounds), as yourself. The disguise is typically good enough to hide your identity, but not to impersonate a specific individual. The spell doesn't change your voice, scent, or mannerisms. You can change the appearance of your clothing and worn items, such as making your armor look like a dress. Held items are unaffected, and any worn item you remove returns to its true appearance.</p>\n<p>Casting illusory disguise counts as setting up a disguise for the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{Impersonate} use of Deception; it ignores any circumstance penalties you might take for disguising yourself as a dissimilar creature, it gives you a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to prevent others from seeing through your disguise, and you add your level even if you're untrained. You can Dismiss this spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell also disguises your voice and scent, and it gains the auditory and olfactory traits.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can appear as any creature of the same size, even a specific individual. You must have seen an individual to take on their appearance. The spell also disguises your voice and scent, and it gains the auditory and olfactory traits.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{Spell Effect: Illusory Disguise}</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你使目标物体在外观与触感上看起来仿佛其物理状况好得多或差得多。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。被伪装成破败的物品看起来处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}状态且做工粗劣。完好的物品若被伪装得更好，则看起来仿佛全新一般，并且高度抛光或保养良好。一件破损物品则看起来完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品不能受到该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻象般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害，但不承受持续伤害，且该法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。若目标从恶心中恢复，持续伤害结束且该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，且持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
