            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将一件松散的、无人持用且在射程内、负载为1或更低的物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若你命中，则你造成钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害（视你投掷的物体而定），其数值等于1d6加上你的施法关键属性调整值。被投掷的物品不具有任何会影响此次攻击或伤害的特定特征或魔法属性。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成全额伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage-as appropriate for the object you hurled-equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
