            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被莫啖魔杀死的生物很难被复活或作为不死生物被唤起。莫啖魔会自动尝试反制任何复活或唤起它所杀死的任何生物的尝试（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+7 #Counteract]]{+7}，反制阶位 2）。如果杀死该生物的莫啖魔本身也被杀死，则该生物可以正常从死亡中被带回或变为不死生物。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by a meokdan are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The meokdan automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+7 #Counteract]]{+7}, counteract rank 2). If the meokdan who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
