            "Consecrate": {
              "name": "加持术 Consecrate",
              "description": "<p>你将一处地点奉献给你的神祇，吟诵赞词并创造一片圣洁空间。在该区域内，你的神祇的信徒在攻击检定、技能检定、豁免骰和察觉检定上获得+1状态加值；而对你的神祇而言属禁忌的生物（例如对@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{法莱斯玛}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{萨伦莱}而言的不死生物）在这些检定上承受-1状态减值。在该区域内由你的神祇的信徒进行的攻击会额外造成1点属于你神祇阵营类型之一的伤害（由你选择）；若你的神祇为绝对中立，你不会获得该项增益。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献成功，并且其持续时间改为10年而非1年，或覆盖半径加倍的区域。偶尔，在你的神祇的恩宠下，这可能产生更为惊人的效果，例如永久奉献的区域，或使该效果覆盖整座大教堂。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 奉献成功。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 奉献失败。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 奉献以灾难性的方式失败并激怒你的神祇，祂会降下不悦的征兆。至少在1年内，进一步尝试奉献该地点都会失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 被奉献的区域也获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{位面封印}法术的效果，但该效果不会尝试反制你的神祇的信徒所进行的传送。成本提高为200 gp × 法术环位。</p>\n<p>You consecrate a site to your deity, chanting praises and creating a sacred space. While within the area, worshippers of your deity gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, skill checks, saving throws, and Perception checks, and creatures anathema to your deity (such as undead for @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.QZD0u1jxwz0kj8uI]{Pharasma} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.deities.Item.BNycwu3I21dTh4D9]{Sarenrae}) take a -1 status penalty to those checks. Attacks made by worshippers of your deity within the area deal 1 damage of one of your deity's alignment types (your choice); if your deity is true neutral, you don't gain this benefit.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The consecration succeeds, and it either lasts for 10 years instead of 1 or covers an area with twice the radius. Occasionally, with your deity's favor, this might produce an even more amazing effect, such as a permanently consecrated area or the effect covering an entire cathedral.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The consecration succeeds.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The consecration fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The consecration fails spectacularly and angers your deity, who sends a sign of displeasure. For at least 1 year, further attempts to consecrate the site fail.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The consecrated area also gains the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XZE4BawIlTf88Yl9]{Planar Seal} spell, but the effect doesn't attempt to counteract teleportation by worshippers of your deity. The cost increases to 200 gp × the spell rank.</p>"
            },
            "Darkness": {
              "name": "黑暗 Darkness",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一层黑暗帷幕，阻止光线在区域内穿透或发散。光线无法进入该区域，任何非魔法光源（例如火把或提灯）在区域内也不会发出任何光，即使其照明半径本应延伸到黑暗范围之外亦是如此。这也会压制你黑暗术的环阶或更低环阶的魔法光。光线无法穿过，因此区域内的生物无法看见外面。从外部看去，它如同一个纯粹黑暗的球体。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 即使拥有黑暗视觉（但不包括高等黑暗视觉）的生物也只能勉强看穿黑暗。它们将透过黑暗所见的目标视为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}。</p>\n<p>You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a torch or lantern, do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical light of your darkness spell's rank or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}.</p>"
            },
            "Bane": {
              "name": "绝望术 Bane",
              "description": "<p>你使敌人的心智充满疑虑。</p>\n<p>区域内的敌人必须在意志豁免中成功，否则只要他们仍在该区域内，其攻击掷骰就会承受-1状态减值。</p>\n<p>每回合一次，从你施放绝望术后的下个回合开始，你可以使用一个具有专注（特征）的单动作，将该散发的半径增加5尺，并迫使区域内那些尚未受到影响的敌人再尝试一次豁免。</p>\n<p>绝望术可以反制 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{法术效果：绝望术}</p>\n<p>You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt.</p>\n<p>Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a -1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area.</p>\n<p>Once per turn, starting the turn after you cast bane, you can use a single action, which has the concentrate trait, to increase the emanation's radius by 5 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.</p>\n<p>Bane can counteract @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XSujb7EsSwKl19Uu]{Bless}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.UTLp7omqsiC36bso]{Spell Effect: Bane}</p>"
            },
            "Chill Touch": {
              "name": "恐吓之触 Chill Touch",
              "description": "<p>将虚空能量虹吸入体内，你的手散发出淡淡的黑暗。你的接触会削弱活物并扰乱不死，甚至可能使其逃跑。效果取决于目标是活物还是不死。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>活物生物</strong> 该法术造成等同于1d4加上你的施法调整值的虚空伤害。目标进行一次基础强韧豁免，但若大失败，则还会在1轮内陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</li>\n<li><strong>不死生物</strong> 若强韧豁免失败，目标在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}。若大失败，目标还会在1轮内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，除非其意志豁免成功。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 对活物生物造成的虚空伤害提高1d4。</p>\n<p>Siphoning void energy into yourself, your hand radiates a pale darkness. Your touch weakens the living and disorients undead, possibly even causing them to flee. The effect depends on whether the target is living or undead.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Living Creature</strong> The spell deals void damage equal to 1d4 plus your spellcasting modifier. The target attempts a basic Fortitude save, but is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round on a critical failure.</li>\n<li><strong>Undead Creature</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round on a failed Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round unless it succeeds at a Will save.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The void damage to living creatures increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标的思维迷乱，并以一次心灵冲击令其晕眩。该冲击造成等同于你施法能力调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须尝试一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放出一道神圣能量光束。对目标的AC进行一次远程法术攻击检定。命中时，目标受到2d4魂魄伤害（大成功时伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Fear": {
              "name": "恐惧 Fear",
              "description": "<p>你在目标心中种下恐惧；它必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Harm": {
              "name": "伤害术 Harm",
              "description": "<p>你引导虚空能量来伤害活物或治疗不死。若目标为活体生物，你对其造成 1d8 点虚空伤害，且其进行一次基础强韧豁免。若目标为自愿的不死生物，你恢复等量的生命值。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域与其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(躯体)</strong> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(言语，躯体)</strong> 该法术的射程为 30 尺。若你在治疗一个不死生物，将恢复的生命值提高 8 点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(材料，言语，躯体)</strong> 你在 30 尺迸发中散布虚空能量。这会以区域内所有活体与不死生物为目标。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗量或伤害量提高 1d8，且 2 动作版本的额外治疗提高 8 点。</p>\n<p>You channel void energy to harm the living or heal the undead. If the target is a living creature, you deal 1d8 void damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. If the target is a willing undead creature, you restore that amount of Hit Points. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(verbal, somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing an undead creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(material, verbal, somatic)</strong> You disperse void energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导活力能量来治疗活物或伤害不死。若目标是自愿的活体生物，你恢复1d8点生命值。若目标是不死，你对其造成等量的活力伤害，且它必须进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数量决定其目标、射程、区域及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(姿势)</strong> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(言语，姿势)</strong> 该法术的射程为30英尺。若你在治疗一个活体生物，将恢复的生命值提高8点</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(材料，姿势，言语)</strong> 你在30英尺的散发中散布活力能量。这以爆发为目标，影响爆发中的所有活体与不死生物。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害量提高1d8，且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vitality energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(verbal, somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(material, somatic, verbal)</strong> You disperse vitality energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你专注于目标物体，敞开心智以感知魔法灵光。施放完成后，你会知道该物品是否为魔法物品。你或任何接受你关于该灵光建议的人，在对该物品进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得 +2 环境加值。若该物体是幻象，只有当该效果的阶位低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的阶位时，你才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以 10 个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Shield": {
              "name": "护盾 Shield",
              "description": "<p>你举起一面由力场构成的魔法护盾。这算作使用“举起护盾”动作，使你的 AC 获得 +1 环境加值，直到你下个回合开始为止，但使用它不需要占用一只手。</p>\n<p>在该法术的效果持续期间，你可以用你的魔法护盾使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{盾牌格挡} 反应动作（）。该护盾具有 硬度 5。在你使用“盾牌格挡”后，法术结束，并且你在 10 分钟内不能再次施放它。与普通的“盾牌格挡”不同，你可以用该法术的反应动作（）来对抗 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{力场弹幕} 法术。</p>\n<p>升阶该法术会提高护盾的硬度。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{法术效果：护盾术}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{效果：护盾术免疫}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 护盾具有 硬度 10。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 护盾具有 硬度 15。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 护盾具有 硬度 20。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 护盾具有 硬度 25。</p>\n<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.jM72TjJ965jocBV8]{Shield Block} reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes. Unlike a normal Shield Block, you can use the spell's reaction against the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM]{Force Barrage} spell.</p>\n<p>Heightening the spell increases the shield's Hardness.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QF6RDlCoTvkVHRo4]{Effect: Shield Immunity}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The shield has Hardness 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 20.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 25.</p>"
            },
            "Fiend's Hunger": {
              "name": "魔族之饥 Fiend's Hunger"
            },
            "Twisted Knot of Wood (Religious Symbol of Kugaptee)": {
              "name": "扭曲的木结（苦迦菩提的宗教圣徽） Twisted Knot of Wood (Religious Symbol of Kugaptee)",
              "description": "<p>这件木制或银制物品上刻有代表某位神祇的图像。一些神圣施法者，例如牧师，可以将其神祇的宗教圣徽作为神圣法器，以使用某些能力并施放某些法术。使用宗教圣徽时，必须将其持于一只手中。</p>\n<p>This piece of wood or silver is emblazoned with an image representing a deity. Some divine spellcasters, such as clerics, can use a religious symbol of their deity as a divine focus to use certain abilities and cast some spells. A religious symbol must be held in one hand to use it.</p>"
            },
            "Tattered Ledger": {
              "name": "破旧账本 Tattered Ledger"
            },
            "Telepathy 30 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 30 尺 Telepathy 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "No Face": {
              "name": "无面 No Face",
              "description": "<p>无面怪没有视觉，但它们的听觉十分敏锐。它们不需要呼吸，且免疫于需要呼吸的效果。它们通过皮肤吸收液体来获取养分——传统上是将双手或无面的头部浸入液体中，通过渗透作用“饮用”；它们也可以用这种方式从消耗品（例如药水或炼金灵药）中获益。</p>\n<p>Noppera-bos have no sense of vision, but their sense of hearing is precise. They don't breathe and are immune to effects that require breathing. They gain sustenance by absorbing fluids through their skin—traditionally by immersing their hands or faceless head into the fluid to \"drink\" through osmosis; they can also benefit from consumables, such as potions or elixirs, in this way.</p>"
            },
            "Identity Crisis": {
              "name": "身份危机 Identity Crisis",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 邹斗成功偷取一名相邻生物的面孔</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 当邹斗偷取该生物的面孔时，她以心灵感应触及该生物的身份与自我认知。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:20] 意志豁免。若失败，该生物会怀疑自身的身份，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续 1 轮。若大失败，则缓慢 1 持续 1 分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Zoudou successfully Steals the Face of an adjacent creature</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> As Zoudou Steals the creature's Face, she telepathically draws at the creature's sense of identity and self. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:20] save. On a failure, the creature questions their own identity and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round. On a critical failure, they're slowed 1 for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Oath of Anonymity": {
              "name": "无面誓约 Oath of Anonymity",
              "description": "<p>当邹斗有脸时，她无法施放神术准备型法术。</p>\n<p>When Zoudou has a face, she can't cast divine prepared spells.</p>"
            },
            "Sensitive Hearing": {
              "name": "听觉感官 Sensitive Hearing",
              "description": "<p>只要无面鬼处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋} 状态，他们就会处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1} 状态。</p>\n<p>As long as a noppera-bo is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened}, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
            },
            "Impersonate Shape": {
              "name": "乔装变形 Impersonate Shape",
              "description": "<p>无面鬼变成他们在过去24小时内触碰过的一名小型或中型类人生物的样子，并获得该目标生物的面容和声音。处于变形状态时，无面鬼在对该生物进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{乔装}时获得+2环境加值，并失去其无面能力以及列出的免疫。无面鬼可以再次使用此能力来变回原形。</p>\n<p>The noppera-bo changes into a version of a Small or Medium humanoid they've touched during the last 24 hours, and gains the target creature's face and voice. While transformed, the noppera-bo gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.AJstokjdG6iDjVjE]{Impersonate} that creature and loses its no face ability and listed immunities. The noppera-bo can change back by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Regain Anonymity": {
              "name": "重归无面 Regain Anonymity",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 邹斗有一张脸</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 邹斗融化她正在戴着的那张脸，并获得[[/br 3d6 #Temp HP]]临时生命值。她在[[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Regain Anonymity]]{1d4 轮}内无法再次重归无面。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Zoudou has a face</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Zoudou melts the face she's wearing and gains [[/br 3d6 #Temp HP]] temporary Hit Points. She can't Regain Anonymity again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Regain Anonymity]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            },
            "Silent Casting": {
              "name": "静默施法 Silent Casting",
              "description": "<p>当邹斗没有面孔时，她可以用一个额外的姿势成分来替代一个言语成分。</p>\n<p>When Zoudou is faceless, she can substitute an additional somatic component for a verbal component.</p>"
            },
            "Steal Face": {
              "name": "窃取面容 Steal Face",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 邹斗没有脸</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 邹斗以30英尺内的一名生物为目标。该生物必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:20] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩} 状态，持续到其下个回合开始。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 无面鬼获得目标的脸。目标的脸消失，直到其下个回合结束为止。在此期间，它处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{失明} 状态，无法说话或吞咽，也无法闻到气味。目标还必须屏住呼吸，否则将开始窒息。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，但效果不会自动结束。目标可以在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的豁免，并且在每次此类尝试中DC累计降低1。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Zoudou is faceless</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Zoudou targets one creature within 30 feet. The creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:20] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The noppera-bo gains the target's face. The target's face vanishes until the end of its next turn. Until then, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded}, can't speak or ingest, and can't smell. The target must also hold its breath or begin to suffocate.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the effect doesn't end automatically. The target can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such attempt.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>这些无面鬼已经精通伪装的艺术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>无面鬼从背后看起来就像普通人类，甚至可能像你认识的某个人——直到它们转过身来，露出一张毫无五官的脸。</p>\n<h2>老练的专业人士</h2>\n<p>典型的无面鬼残忍无情，并以惊吓或折磨类人生物为乐，但并非所有无面鬼都沉溺于邪恶。中立的无面鬼往往是恶作剧者，会用自己的能力来欺骗与戏弄；而罕见的善良无面鬼则会用自己的能力去致敬并崇拜自己钦佩的人，同时把自己的时间投入到磨练艺术或手工制作技能上。</p>\n<h2>无面鬼起源</h2>\n<p>关于无面鬼的起源有许多理论——从变形能力出错的化狸，到被诅咒扭曲的类人生物，再到自然诞生的妖怪。甚至有人推测这种状态是一种可传播的诅咒，类似于兽化症。大多数无面鬼不记得自己的起源，而且往往更有兴趣假扮成完全不同的另一个人。</p>\n<p>These noppera-bos have mastered the art of disguise.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Noppera-bos appear to be regular humans from behind, and might even resemble someone you know, until they turn to reveal a featureless face.</p>\n<h2>Consummate Professionals</h2>\n<p>While the typical noppera-bo is cruel and revels in the act of frightening or tormenting humanoid creatures, not all of them wallow in evil. Neutral noppera-bos tend to be pranksters who use their abilities to trick and tease, while the rare good noppera- bos instead use their abilities to honor and idolize those they admire while focusing their own time on developing their skills at art or crafting.</p>\n<h2>Noppera-bo Origins</h2>\n<p>There are many theories on the origins of noppera-bos—from tanuki whose change shape ability went wrong, to humanoids who were warped by curses, to naturally spawning yokai. Some even theorize this condition is a transmissible curse like lycanthropy. Most noppera-bos don't recall their origins, and are often more interested in pretending to be someone else entirely.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性无面鬼\nFemale noppera-bo",
          "prototypeToken": "狂热的邹斗 Zoudou The Zealous"
        },
        "Peg": {
