          "tokenName": "钉子 Peg",
          "items": {
            "Thurible of Revelation (Moderate)": {
              "name": "启示香炉（中等） Thurible of Revelation (Moderate)",
              "description": "<p>这只黄铜香炉用一段链子悬挂着。大多数<em>启示香炉</em>都饰有旋绕的天界文字，不过也有一些是铁制的，并刻有恶魔语或冥渊语文字。</p>\n<p><strong>启动——焚香</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>花费</strong> 价值至少 5 gp 的香</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你点燃香炉内的香，使其燃烧 1 小时。在这段时间内，只要你正持握该香炉，你的宗教检定获得 +2 物品加值；此外，当你进行与宗教相关的破译文字时，你掷出的任何大失败改为失败。</p>\n<p>每天一次，当你启动该香炉时，你可以增强其启示。在那次启动期间，你可以用一个交互动作将香炉举到眼前，通过烟雾窥视，从而获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9]{See the Unseen} 的效果，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lO95TwgihBdTilAB]{效果：启示香炉}</p>\n<p>This brass censer dangles on a length of chain. Most <em>thuribles of revelation</em> are adorned with swirling Empyrean text, though some are iron and feature Diabolic or Chthonian text.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Burn Incense</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Cost</strong> incense worth at least 5 gp</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You light the incense inside the censer, and it burns for 1 hour. During that time, as long you are holding the thurible, you gain a +2 item bonus to Religion checks, and any critical failure you roll when you Decipher Writing of a religious nature is a failure instead.</p>\n<p>Once per day, when you activate the thurible, you can increase its revelations. During that activation, you can hold the thurible up to your eyes with an Interact action to gain the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9]{See the Unseen} for 1 round by peering through the smoke.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lO95TwgihBdTilAB]{Effect: Thurible of Revelation}</p>"
            }
          },
