            "Bands of Force": {
              "name": "力场束带 Bands of Force",
              "description": "<p>这些厚重的金属臂环以透明宝石装饰，能在你全身铺展开一层坚韧不屈的力场。该力场使你获得AC与豁免骰+1物品加值，并作为护甲将你的敏捷调整值上限设为+5。你可以将护符系附在臂环上，如同它们是轻甲一般。</p>\n<p><strong>启动—返还力场</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span>（力场，操作）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物以近战打击对你造成重击失手</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你使用臂环的运动调整值[[/r d20+14]]{+14}对该生物进行推撞。</p>\n<p>Decorated with clear gemstones, these thick metal bands spread an inflexible layer of force over your body. The force grants you a +1 item bonus to AC and saving throws, and a maximum Dexterity modifier of +5 as armor. You can affix talismans to the bands as though they were light armor.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Return Force</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> (force, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature critically misses you with a melee Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You Shove the creature using the bands' Athletics modifier of [[/r d20+14]]{+14}.</p>"
