        "Path Maiden (Spring's Path)": {
          "name": "行道女（春之道） Path Maiden (Spring's Path)",
          "tokenName": "行道女 Path Maiden",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Phantasmal Calamity": {
              "name": "魅影灾祸 Phantasmal Calamity",
              "description": "<p>末日般的毁灭景象充斥区域内每个生物的心智。该景象造成11d6心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。在大失败时，该生物还必须在一次@Check[reflex]豁免中成功，否则会相信自己被困住了（卡在裂缝中、在海上随波漂流，或其他与其幻象相符的命运）。如果它第二次豁免失败，它还会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑（状态）}1分钟。它可以在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的意志豁免，并在成功时识破幻术并从震慑状态中恢复。</p><hr /><p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a @Check[reflex] save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it disbelieves the illusion and recovers from the stunned condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Spirit Blast": {
              "name": "灵魂冲击 Spirit Blast",
              "description": "<p>你凝聚以太能量并攻击一个生物的魂魄，以一次基础强韧豁免造成16d6魂魄伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You concentrate ethereal energy and attack a creature's spirit, dealing 16d6 spirit damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Scene": {
              "name": "幻象场景 Illusory Scene",
              "description": "<p>你制作一幅想象中的场景，其中最多包含10个彼此独立的生物或物体，体型可各不相同，但都必须位于该法术的区域内。这些要素会产生恰当的声音与气味，并且触感也与真实一致。幻象场景的要素无法说话。与@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature}法术不同，你场景中的生物缺乏战斗能力与数据。你的场景不包含对其周围环境的改变，不过你可以将你的场景置于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage}法术所创造的幻象环境之中。</p>\n<p>当你创造该场景时，你可以选择让它保持静止或遵循一段程序。静止场景虽不移动，但仍包含基本的自然运动。例如，风吹过一张幻象纸片会让它沙沙作响。一段程序最长可达1分钟，并在结束后重复。例如，你可以创造两个兽人互相战斗的场景，而每次重复时战斗都会以相同方式进行。如果你创建了循环，这两名战士在场景开始与结束时都会处于同一位置，但你可以将程序衔接得很平滑，使人难以分辨循环何时结束与开始。任何人若观察该场景超过几分钟，几乎总会注意到它在循环。你在创造幻象后无法改变这段程序。</p>\n<p>任何生物只要触碰影像的任意部分，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索}动作对其进行检查，都可以尝试识破你的幻象。若他们与幻象的某一部分进行交互，则只会识破那一部分。只有在大成功或大失败时，他们才会识破整个场景。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你场景中的生物或物体可以说话。你在创建程序时必须为每个演员说出其特定台词。该法术会为每个演员伪装你的声音。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 同6环版本，且持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You craft an imaginary scene that includes up to 10 discrete creatures or objects of various sizes, all of which must be within the spell's area. These elements generate appropriate sounds and smells, and they feel right to the touch. Elements of an illusory scene are incapable of speech. Unlike with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature} spell, creatures in your scene lack combat abilities and statistics. Your scene doesn't include changes to the environment around it, though you can place your scene within the illusory environment of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage} spell.</p>\n<p>When you create the scene, you can choose to have it be static or follow a program. Though a static scene is stationary, it includes basic natural movement. For example, wind blowing on an illusory piece of paper would rustle it. A program can be up to 1 minute long and repeats when finished. For instance, you could create a scene of two orcs fighting each other, and the fight would go the same way for each repetition. If you create a loop, the two fighters end up in the same place at the start of the scene and at the end of it, but you can smooth the program so it's hard to tell when the loop ends and begins. Anyone observing the scene for more than a few minutes almost always notices it looping. You're unable to alter the program after you create the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches any part of the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. If they interact with a portion of the illusion, they disbelieve only that portion. They disbelieve the entire scene only on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Creatures or objects in your scene can speak. You must speak the specific lines for each actor when creating your program. The spell disguises your voice for each actor.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As the 6th-rank version, and the duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Wave of Despair": {
              "name": "绝望之波 Wave of Despair",
              "description": "<p>你使区域内的生物陷入绝望。每个生物的效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续1轮，该生物不能使用反应动作，且必须在其回合开始时再尝试一次豁免；若失败，则其在该回合中因无法控制地抽泣而成为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物在1分钟内自动为缓慢 1。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为60尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically slowed 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Outcast's Curse": {
              "name": "流放诅咒 Outcast's Curse",
              "description": "<p>你使目标承受一道诅咒，使其存在感变得令人烦躁且让人反感。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 在10分钟内，目标每当尝试欺瞒、交涉、威吓或表演检定时必须掷骰两次并采用较差的结果，并且他们在遭遇到的生物眼中其初始态度会差一级（例如用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{不友善}取代@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{不关心}）。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.hlgCesYXXHG8r9X4]{法术效果：流放诅咒（成功）}</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但该效果为永久。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QccOlLHtnVEmD67m]{法术效果：流放诅咒（失败）}</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，并且目标所遭遇的生物对其的初始态度会差两级。</p>\n<p>You afflict the target with a curse that makes its presence abrasive and off-putting. The target must attempt a Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 10 minutes, the target must roll twice and use the worse result whenever attempting a Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, or Performance check, and creatures they encounter have an initial attitude toward them of one step worse (for instance, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.I1ffBVISxLr2gC4u]{Unfriendly} instead of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fuG8dgthlDWfWjIA]{Indifferent}).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.hlgCesYXXHG8r9X4]{Spell Effect: Outcast's Curse (Success)}</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect is permanent.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.QccOlLHtnVEmD67m]{Spell Effect: Outcast's Curse (Failure)}</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and creatures that the target encounters have an initial attitude toward them of two steps worse.</p>"
            },
            "Translocate": {
              "name": "传送 Translocate",
              "description": "<p>你立刻将自己以及你穿戴与持握的任何物品，从你当前的空间传送到射程内一个你能看见的未被占据的空间中。若这会让另一名生物随你一同前往——即使你将其装在一个异次元容器里携带——则该法术失效。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至1英里。你不必能看见目的地，只要你过去曾到过那里，并且知道它相对你的位置与距离即可。随后你在1小时内暂时免疫。</p>\n<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Create Undead": {
              "name": "唤起死灵 Create Undead",
              "description": "<p>你将目标转化为一个不死生物，其等级最高不超过“生物创生仪式”表格所允许的等级。此仪式有许多版本，每个版本都对应一种特定类型的不死（例如：所有丧尸使用一种仪式、骷髅使用一种、食尸鬼使用一种，等等），而用于创造稀有不死的仪式本身也同样稀有。某些不死形态（如巫妖）会以其独有的方法形成，无法通过任何版本的<em>唤起死灵</em>来创造。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标成为相应类型的不死生物。若其等级至少比你低4级，你可以使其成为你的仆从。这会使其获得仆从（特征），意味着当你命令术它时，它可以使用2个动作，而命令术它是一个带有听觉与专注（特征）的单动作。你最多可以同时控制四个仆从。若其具有智能且未成为仆从，则该不死会因你将其唤醒而对你乐于帮助，尽管它仍是可怖而邪恶的生物。若其不具智能且未成为仆从，你可以给予它一个简单命令。它会一心一意追逐该目标，无视你之后的任何命令。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 同大成功，但未成为你仆从的有智能不死对你仅为友善；未成为你仆从的无智能不死会放任你不管，除非你攻击它。它会在当地区域肆虐，而不是遵从你的命令。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你未能唤起不死。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 你创造出了不死，但其灵魂因你污秽的死灵术而受尽折磨，心中除对你的仇恨外别无他物。它会试图摧毁你。</p><h2>生物创生仪式</h2><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>生物等级</th><th>所需法术阶位</th><th>花费</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-1或0</td><td>2</td><td>15 gp</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>60 gp</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>105 gp</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>180 gp</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>300 gp</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>480 gp</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>750 gp</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>1,080 gp</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>1,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>6</td><td>2,100 gp</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>7</td><td>3,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>7</td><td>4,200 gp</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>6,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>8</td><td>9,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>9</td><td>13,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>9</td><td>19,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>10</td><td>30,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>10</td><td>45,000 gp</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>You transform the target into an undead creature with a level up to that allowed in the Creature Creation Rituals table. There are many versions of this ritual, each specific to a particular type of undead (one ritual for all zombies, one for skeletons, one for ghouls, and so on), and the rituals that create rare undead are also rare. Some forms of undead, such as liches, form using their own unique methods and can't be created with a version of <em>create undead</em>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes an undead creature of the appropriate type. If it's at least 4 levels lower than you, you can make it a minion. This gives it the minion trait, meaning it can use 2 actions when you command it, and commanding it is a single action that has the auditory and concentrate traits. You can have a maximum of four minions under your control. If it's intelligent and doesn't become a minion, the undead is helpful to you for awakening it, though it's still a horrid and evil creature. If it's unintelligent and doesn't become a minion, you can give it one simple command. It pursues that goal single-mindedly, ignoring any of your subsequent commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, except an intelligent undead that doesn't become your minion is only friendly to you, and an unintelligent undead that doesn't become your minion leaves you alone unless you attack it. It marauds the local area rather than following your command.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to create the undead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You create the undead, but its soul, tortured by your foul necromancy, is full of nothing but hatred for you. It attempts to destroy you.</p><h2>Creatures Creation Rituals</h2><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Creature Level</th><th>Spell Rank Required</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>-1 or 0</td><td>2</td><td>15 gp</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>60 gp</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>105 gp</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>180 gp</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>300 gp</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>480 gp</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>750 gp</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>1,080 gp</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>1,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>6</td><td>2,100 gp</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>7</td><td>3,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>7</td><td>4,200 gp</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>6,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>8</td><td>9,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>9</td><td>13,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>9</td><td>19,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>10</td><td>30,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>10</td><td>45,000 gp</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            },
            "Figment": {
              "name": "虚像 Figment",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个简单的幻觉声音或影像。声音会为该法术添加听觉（特征），且该声音不能包含可理解的词句或复杂的音乐。影像会添加视觉（特征），大小不能超过一个5尺立方体，并且若在15尺内观看，会显得明显粗糙且缺乏细节。当你施放或维持该法术时，你可以用该幻觉尝试进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.GkmbTGfg8KcgynOA]{制造佯动}，使你的欺瞒检定获得+2环境加值。若该尝试对某个生物失败，该生物会识破该<em>拟像</em>。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.2Hg3a06gZCSnUgSA]{法术效果：拟像}</p>\n<p>You create a simple illusory sound or vision. A sound adds the auditory trait to the spell and the sound can't include intelligible words or elaborate music. A vision adds the visual trait, can be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and is clearly crude and undetailed if viewed from within 15 feet. When you Cast or Sustain the Spell, you can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.GkmbTGfg8KcgynOA]{Create a Diversion} with the illusion, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception check. If the attempt fails against a creature, that creature disbelieves the <em>figment</em>.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.2Hg3a06gZCSnUgSA]{Spell Effect: Figment}</p>"
            },
            "Know the Way": {
              "name": "知晓道路 Know the Way",
              "description": "<p>在你的心眼中，你用魔法重新定向自己。你立刻知道北方在哪个方向（如果你当前位置存在北方），并且你可以选择一个你在过去24小时内去过的地点，并得知它位于哪个方向。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你可以选择一个你在过去一周内去过的地点。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 你可以选择一个你去过的地点，无论你是什么时候去过那里。</p>\n<p>In your mind's eye, you magically reorient yourself. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location), and you can choose a location you were at within the last 24 hours and learn what direction it lies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can choose a location you were at within the last week.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can choose a location you were at regardless of how long ago you were there.</p>"
            },
            "Light": {
              "name": "光 Light",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个光球，以你选择的颜色在20尺半径内提供明亮光照（并在接下来的20尺内提供昏暗光照）。如果你在与一个自愿的生物相同的空间内创造该光照，你可以将光照附着在该生物上，使其在该生物移动时漂浮在其附近。你可以维持该法术来将光照移动至多60尺；你可以将其附着在一个生物身上或从其身上解除附着，作为此次移动的一部分。</p>\n<p>你可以解消该法术。如果你在已有四个<em>光亮</em>法术生效时施放该法术，你必须选择一个现有效果使其结束。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{法术效果：光亮}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 光球在60尺半径内提供光照（并在接下来的60尺内提供昏暗光照）。</p>\n<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造一只漂浮的魔法手，可以是隐形的或幽灵般的，它抓住目标物体并使其缓慢地向任意方向悬浮移动至多20尺。当你维持法术时，你可以使该物体额外移动20尺。如果法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以负载为1或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程增加至60尺，且你可以以负载为1或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程增加至60尺，且你可以以负载为2或更低的无人持用物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将一个射程内松散、无人持用且负载不超过1的物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若命中，你造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害——由你掷出的物体决定。被掷出物品的任何特定特征或魔法属性都不会影响此次攻击或伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成完整伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Apostate's Shroud": {
              "name": "叛教者寿衣 Apostate's Shroud"
            },
            "Telepathy 100 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 100尺 Telepathy 100 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Limited Flight": {
              "name": "有限飞行 Limited Flight",
              "description": "<p>行道女获得等同于其速度的飞行速度，但她不能飞得高于地面以上10英尺；并且若她在不坚实的表面上方结束其回合，她会消失并在其最后一个位于坚实地面上方所占据的空间中重新显现，且获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<p>A path maiden has a fly Speed equal to her Speed but can't fly higher than 10 feet above the ground, and if she ends her turn above a nonsolid surface, she vanishes and rematerializes on the last space she occupied over solid ground and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>"
            },
            "+1 Status to All Saves vs. Vitality": {
              "name": "对所有对抗活力的豁免获得+1状态加值 +1 Status to All Saves vs. Vitality"
            },
            "Imprisoning Grave": {
              "name": "监禁坟墓 Imprisoning Grave",
              "description": "<p>30英尺。一个生物的灵魂若在行道女的灵光范围内死亡，会被困在其尸体中，直到其身体在灵光之外停留1分钟为止。在被困期间，该灵魂无法前往来世，但仍可被复活或被转化为不死生物。</p>\n<p>30 feet. The soul of a creature that dies within the path maiden's aura is trapped within its corpse until its body spends 1 minute outside the aura. While trapped, the soul can't move on to the afterlife but can still be brought back to life or transformed into an undead creature.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Blasphemous Aura": {
              "name": "亵渎灵光 Blasphemous Aura",
              "description": "<p>30尺。当灵光中的一名生物使用带有治疗（特征）的法术或能力时，它必须进行一次意志豁免，对抗行道女的法术DC – 3。若失败，该法术或能力恢复的生命值减半。若大失败，活力能量变为虚无能量，会伤害一个活体目标而非治疗它。</p>\n<p>30 feet. When a creature in the aura uses a spell or ability with the healing trait, it must succeed at a Will save against the path maiden's spell DC – 3. On a failure, the amount of Hit Points restored by the spell or ability is halved. On a critical failure, the vitality energy becomes void energy, harming a living target instead of healing it.</p>"
            },
            "Corrupting Doubt": {
              "name": "腐化疑心 Corrupting Doubt",
              "description": "<p>被行道女之手打击造成伤害的生物必须通过一次意志豁免，否则将变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}，持续1轮（大失败则为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 2}）。</p>\n<p>A creature damaged by the path maiden's hand Strike must succeed at a Will save to avoid becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
            },
            "Pharasma Lore": {
              "name": "法莱斯玛学识 Pharasma Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>神门的崇拜者有时会将每一次呼吸都奉献给法莱斯玛，却在临终之际违逆女神；他们死后有时会转化为行道女。所有行道女所穿的衣饰，是她们昔日信仰的最后残余，也是对其耻辱的永久提醒。</p>\n<h2>行道游民</h2>\n<p>行道女几乎总是以女性形态显现。那些以男性形态显现者则被称为行道游民。这些不死拥有相同的能力，但往往会更广泛地旅行；与其说他们象征着背弃法莱斯玛对生与死的权能，不如说象征着背弃她作为先知与命运操弄者的角色。</p>\n<p>Worshippers in Shenmen who devote their every breath to Pharasma only to defy the goddess with their last sometimes transform, upon death, into path maidens. The garments all path maidens wear are the last vestiges of their former faith, a permanent reminder of their disgrace.</p>\n<h2>Path Nomads</h2>\n<p>Path maidens almost always manifest in feminine forms. Those who manifest in masculine forms are instead known as path nomads. These undead have the same abilities but tend to travel more widely; they represent turning one's back on Pharasma's role as a prophet and manipulator of destiny than of her roles over birth and death.</p>",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "行道女 Path Maiden"
        },
