            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Earth Glide": {
              "name": "掘地潜行 Earth Glide",
              "description": "<p>活体巨砾可以@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.H6v1VgowHaKHnVlG]{掘地}穿过土质物质，包括岩石。当它这么做时，它以其全掘地速度移动，不会留下任何隧道或其经过的痕迹。</p>\n<p>A living boulder can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.H6v1VgowHaKHnVlG]{Burrow} through earthen matter, including rock. When it does so, it moves at its full burrow Speed, leaving no tunnels or signs of its passing.</p>"
            },
            "Rolling Charge": {
              "name": "滚动冲锋 Rolling Charge",
              "description": "<p>活体巨石行走两次，之后可以用它的颚进行一次打击。这次颚打击获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.BCLvAx4Pz4MLa2pu]{击倒}。</p>\n<p>The living boulder Strides twice, and can then make a Strike with its jaws. This jaws Strike gains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.BCLvAx4Pz4MLa2pu]{Knockdown}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>活体巨石在土位面翻滚滑行，收集宝石与金属碎片，直到它们的表面看起来就像一艘长满藤壶的船壳。活体巨石的智慧几乎不比许多动物高多少，在土位面中承担的角色，与宇宙诸世界上那些大型群居动物相差无几。</p><hr /><p>某些土元素会以特定材质的形态显现，无论是巨石、沙砾还是水晶。</p>\n<p>Living boulders roll and glide through the Plane of Earth, gathering gemstones and metal shards until their surfaces resemble a ship's hull covered in barnacles. Barely more intelligent than many animals, living boulders fill much the same role on the Plane of Earth as the great herd animals found on worlds in the Universe.</p><hr /><p>Certain earth elementals manifest as specific types of material, be they boulders, sand, or crystals.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "活体巨石 Living Boulder",
          "speed": "earth glide"
        },
        "Main Hall": {
          "name": "主大厅 Main Hall",
          "tokenName": "主厅 Main Hall",
          "items": {
            "Spellguard Shield": {
              "name": "护法盾 Spellguard Shield",
              "description": "<p>这面钢盾刻有诡秘符文，用以防御魔法。当你举起这面钢盾（硬度 6，HP 24，BT 12）时，你在对抗以你为目标的法术所做的豁免骰上获得其环境加值（同样适用于 AC），并且如果你拥有该动作，你可以用护盾格挡以你为目标的法术。</p>\n<p>This shield bears eldritch glyphs to guard against magic. While you have this steel shield (Hardness 6, HP 24, BT 12) raised, you gain its circumstance bonus to saving throws against spells that target you (as well as to AC), and you can Shield Block spells that target you if you have that action.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "主大厅 Main Hall"
        },
        "Warding Bell": {
          "name": "守护铃 Warding Bell",
          "tokenName": "守护铃 Warding Bell",
          "items": {
            "Flare Up": {
              "name": "再度爆发 Flare Up",
              "description": "<p>守护铃的光芒从微弱的闪烁增强到足以让整个房间明亮照明。然后该危害掷骰先攻。</p>\n<p>The warding bell's light increases from a faint flickering to luminous enough that the whole room is brightly lit. The hazard then rolls initiative.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>在连续三轮内，使用仪式鸣铃者（由孙海携带）以一个交互动作连续敲响钟八次，会自动停用该危害；或者进行@Check[thievery|dc:36]以熄灭钟内的火焰，进行@Check[religion|dc:36]以祈求法莱斯玛熄灭火焰，或施放解除魔法或使用窃光者的汲取光照（6级；反制DC 29）</p>\n<p>Ringing the bell as an Interact action eight times in succession with the ceremonial ringer (carried by Mago Kai) over the course of three consecutive rounds automatically deactivates the hazard, @Check[thievery|dc:36] to extinguish the flame within the bell, @Check[religion|dc:36] to appeal to Pharasma to extinguish the flame, or dispel magic or a shimmerthief's Drain Light (6th level; counteract DC 29)</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>神龛的中心悬挂着一口巨大的青铜寺钟。</p>\n<p>At the heart of the shrine hangs a massive bronze temple bell.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>重新激活守护铃需要一场复杂的仪式，耗时数日。</p>\n<p>Reactivating the warding bell requires a complicated rite taking several days.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（1动作；神圣、情绪、惑控系、恐惧术、心灵）守卫铃发出一声令人毛骨悚然的铃响，只有<strong>C11</strong>区域内的不死生物或转生的PC才能听见；受影响的角色必须尝试一次@Check[will|dc:30|traits:divine,emotion,enchantment,fear,mental]意志豁免。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>大成功</strong>该生物不受影响，并在24小时内暂时免疫守卫铃的该常规效果。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong>该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong>该生物变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}并受到@Damage[6d6[mental]]伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong>该生物变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}，受到@Damage[12d6[mental]]伤害，且只要其仍处于惊惧状态，就会@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑}。</p>\n<p>(1 action; divine, emotion, enchantment, fear, mental) The warding bell emits a harrowing ring that can be heard only by undead or transmigrated PCs in area <strong>C11</strong>; affected characters must attempt a @Check[will|dc:30|traits:divine,emotion,enchantment,fear,mental] save.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to the warding bell's routine for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} and takes @Damage[6d6[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}, takes @Damage[12d6[mental]] damage, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} as long as it remains frightened.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "守护铃 Warding Bell"
        },
