            "Innkeeper's Apron (Functions as Leather Armor)": {
              "name": "旅店老板的围裙（视为皮甲） Innkeeper's Apron (Functions as Leather Armor)",
              "description": "<p>这种护甲由柔韧与定型的煮制皮革混合制成，在提供一定防护的同时也具备最大的灵活性。</p>\n<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"
