            },
            "Font of Gossip": {
              "name": "流言喷泉 Font of Gossip",
              "description": "<p>旅店老板的生意使其能洞察街区里发生的事情。一个人可以在30分钟内从旅店老板那里@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.plBGdZhqq5JBl1D8]{搜集信息}，而不必走访整个街区。每个人每天只能从旅店老板那里打听一次流言，而且只有当旅店老板对该个体态度为友善或乐于帮助时才行。旅店老板对某个话题所知的任何信息，在其他人也来询问该话题时并不会改变，除非旅店老板此后又学到了更多。</p>\n<p>The innkeeper's business gives them insight into the neighborhood's happenings. A person can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.plBGdZhqq5JBl1D8]{Gather Information} from an innkeeper in 30 minutes rather than canvassing an entire neighborhood. Each person can learn gossip from an innkeeper only once per day, and only if the innkeeper is friendly or helpful to that individual. Whatever information the innkeeper knows about a given topic doesn't change if someone else asks the innkeeper about that topic, unless the innkeeper has since learned more.</p>"
            },
            "Innkeeper's Advice": {
              "name": "旅店老板的建议 Innkeeper's Advice",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每天一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 旅店老板向除自己以外的一个生物给出一些切实有用的建议。在24小时内，当该生物技能检定或豁免投掷失败时，它可以回想起这条建议并重骰该检定，且必须改用第二次的结果。一旦该生物使用了此能力，其效果即结束。获得“旅店老板的建议”的生物在1个月内对该能力暂时免疫。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The innkeeper gives some pertinent advice to a single creature other than themself. For 24 hours, when that creature fails a skill check or saving throw, they can recall this advice and reroll the check, using the second result instead. Once that creature uses this ability, its effect ends. A creature that receives the Innkeeper's Advice is temporarily immune to the ability for 1 month.</p>"
            },
            "Home Base Brawler": {
              "name": "主基地斗士 Home Base Brawler",
              "description": "<p>旅店老板知道如何平息爆发的斗殴。当旅店老板在自己的店里战斗时，他们的打击在攻击掷骰上获得+1环境加值，造成额外1d4伤害，并在其尚未拥有时获得非致命（特征）。旅店老板可以选择不获得此增益。</p>\n<p>The innkeeper knows how to settle fights that break out. When the innkeeper is fighting in their establishment, their Strikes gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the attack roll, deal an additional 1d4 damage, and gain the nonlethal trait if they don't already have it. The innkeeper can choose not to gain this benefit.</p>"
            },
