              "name": "会计学识 Accounting Lore"
            },
            "Alcohol Lore": {
              "name": "酒精学识 Alcohol Lore"
            },
            "Cooking Lore": {
              "name": "烹饪学识 Cooking Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w19downtownw00]{柳岸镇镇区}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w19downtownw00]{Downtown Willowshore}</p>",
          "blurb": "男澡堂老板\nMale bathhouse owner",
