        "Argyrzei": {
          "name": "稽折魔 Argyrzei",
          "tokenName": "稽折魔 Argyrzei",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Dominate": {
              "name": "支配术 Dominate",
              "description": "<p>你夺取对目标的指挥权，迫使其服从你的命令。如果你下达明显会自我毁灭的命令，目标不会行动，直到你下达新的命令。其效果取决于它的意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标在抵抗你的命令时陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 你控制目标。它获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} 状态，但它可以在其每个回合结束时尝试一次意志豁免。成功时，该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标只有在你下达一个违背其天性的新的命令时（例如杀死其盟友），才会获得一次新的豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（10环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You take command of the target, forcing it to obey your orders. If you issue an obviously self-destructive order, the target doesn't act until you issue a new order. The effect depends on its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} as it fights off your commands.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You control the target. It gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} condition, but it can attempt a Will save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As a failure, but the target receives a new save only if you give it a new order that is against its nature, such as killing its allies.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Scene": {
              "name": "幻象场景 Illusory Scene",
              "description": "<p>你制作一幅虚构的场景，其中包含至多10个彼此独立的生物或物体，体型可各不相同，但都必须位于该法术的区域内。这些要素会产生恰当的声音与气味，且触感也与真实无异。幻象场景中的要素无法说话。不同于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature}法术，你场景中的生物不具备战斗能力与数据。你的场景不包含对其周围环境的改变，不过你可以将该场景置于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage}法术所创造的幻象环境之中。</p>\n<p>当你创造该场景时，你可以选择使其静止，或按一段程序运作。静止场景虽然不会移动位置，但会包含基础的自然移动。例如，风吹过一张幻象纸片会让它沙沙作响。一段程序最长可达1分钟，结束后会重复。比如，你可以创造两名兽人互相战斗的场景，而每次重复时战斗都会以同样的方式进行。如果你创造的是循环，那么两名战斗者会在场景开始与结束时都处于同一位置，不过你可以将程序衔接得更平滑，使人难以分辨循环何时结束、何时开始。任何观察该场景超过几分钟的人几乎总会注意到它在循环。你在创造该幻术后无法更改该程序。</p>\n<p>任何生物只要接触图像的任意部分，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索}动作对其进行检查，便可尝试识破你的幻术。若其与幻术的一部分进行交互，则只会识破那一部分。只有在大成功或大失败时，他们才会识破整个场景。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你场景中的生物或物体可以说话。你在创建程序时必须为每个角色说出其特定台词。该法术会为每个角色伪装你的声音。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 同6环版本，且持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You craft an imaginary scene that includes up to 10 discrete creatures or objects of various sizes, all of which must be within the spell's area. These elements generate appropriate sounds and smells, and they feel right to the touch. Elements of an illusory scene are incapable of speech. Unlike with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly]{Illusory Creature} spell, creatures in your scene lack combat abilities and statistics. Your scene doesn't include changes to the environment around it, though you can place your scene within the illusory environment of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX]{Mirage} spell.</p>\n<p>When you create the scene, you can choose to have it be static or follow a program. Though a static scene is stationary, it includes basic natural movement. For example, wind blowing on an illusory piece of paper would rustle it. A program can be up to 1 minute long and repeats when finished. For instance, you could create a scene of two orcs fighting each other, and the fight would go the same way for each repetition. If you create a loop, the two fighters end up in the same place at the start of the scene and at the end of it, but you can smooth the program so it's hard to tell when the loop ends and begins. Anyone observing the scene for more than a few minutes almost always notices it looping. You're unable to alter the program after you create the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches any part of the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. If they interact with a portion of the illusion, they disbelieve only that portion. They disbelieve the entire scene only on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Creatures or objects in your scene can speak. You must speak the specific lines for each actor when creating your program. The spell disguises your voice for each actor.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As the 6th-rank version, and the duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Subconscious Suggestion": {
              "name": "深层暗示 Subconscious Suggestion",
              "description": "<p>你在目标心灵深处植入一道深层暗示，使其在你指定的触发发生时遵循。你向目标提出一条行动方案。你的指令必须以一种在目标看来合乎逻辑的方式措辞，且不能是自我毁灭的或明显违背目标自身利益的。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败 成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并且知道你试图控制它。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并认为你只是正常与它交谈，而不是对它施放法术。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该暗示会留在目标的潜意识中，直到你下次准备为止。若在此之前触发发生，目标会立刻遵循你的暗示。该效果的持续时间为1分钟，或直到目标完成一条有限的暗示，或该暗示变得自我毁灭，或出现其他明显的负面效果为止。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败 失败</strong> 同失败，但持续时间为1小时。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 你最多可以以10个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>You implant a subconscious suggestion deep within the target's mind for them to follow when a trigger you specify occurs. You suggest a course of action to the target. Your directive must be phrased in such a way as to seem like a logical course of action to the target, and it can't be self-destructive or obviously against the target's self-interest. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and knows you tried to control it.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected and thinks you were talking to them normally, not casting a spell on them.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The suggestion remains in the target's subconscious until the next time you prepare. If the trigger occurs before then, the target immediately follows your suggestion. The effect has a duration of 1 minute, or until the target has completed a finite suggestion or the suggestion becomes self-destructive or has other obvious negative effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，用一次心灵冲击使其晕眩。该冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标豁免大失败，它还会陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Disguise (At Will)": {
              "name": "幻象伪装（随意） Illusory Disguise (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个幻觉，使目标看起来像另一名体型相同、且身高（相差不超过6英寸）与体重（相差不超过50磅）大致相近的生物。这种伪装通常足以隐藏其身份，但不足以乔装成某个特定个体。该法术会改变其外貌与声音，但不会改变举止习惯。你可以改变其衣物与穿戴物品的外观，例如让其护甲看起来像一件连衣裙。手持物品不受影响，并且任何从生物身上移除的穿戴物品都会恢复其真实外观。</p>\n<p>施放幻象伪装算作已为使用欺瞒进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{乔装}设定好伪装；它会忽略目标因将自己伪装成不相似的生物而可能承受的任何环境减值，使其用于防止他人看穿伪装的欺瞒检定获得+4状态加值，并让目标即使未受训，也能将其等级加到此类欺瞒检定中。你可以解消该法术。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>目标可以看起来像任何同体型的生物，甚至是某个特定个体。你必须见过该个体才能复制其外貌，并且必须听过其声音才能复制其声音。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong>你最多可以以10个自愿生物为目标。若你以多个生物为目标，你可以为每个目标选择不同的伪装，但都不能乔装成某个特定个体。你可以分别解消每个伪装，或一并全部解消。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>同4环，但你可以选择能乔装成特定个体的伪装。你必须见过该个体才能复制其外貌，并且必须听过其声音才能复制其声音。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{法术效果：幻象伪装}</p>\n<p>You create an illusion that causes the target to appear as another creature of the same body shape, and with roughly similar height (within 6 inches) and weight (within 50 pounds). The disguise is typically good enough to hide their identity, but not to impersonate a specific individual. The spell changes their appearance and voice, but not mannerisms. You can change the appearance of its clothing and worn items, such as making its armor look like a dress. Held items are unaffected, and any worn item removed from the creature returns to its true appearance.</p>\n<p>Casting illusory disguise counts as setting up a disguise for the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.k5nW4jGyXD0Oq9LR]{Impersonate} use of Deception; it ignores any circumstance penalties the target might take for disguising itself as a dissimilar creature, gives a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to prevent others from seeing through the disguise, and lets the target add its level to such Deception checks even if untrained. You can Dismiss this spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The target can appear as any creature of the same size, even a specific individual. You must have seen an individual to replicate its appearance, and must have heard its voice to replicate its voice.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can target up to 10 willing creatures. If you target multiple creatures, you can choose a different disguise for each target, but none can impersonate a specific individual. You can Dismiss each disguise individually or all collectively.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> As 4th, but you can choose disguises that impersonate specific individuals. You must have seen an individual to replicate its appearance, and must have heard its voice to replicate its voice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3Ktyd5F9lOPo4myk]{Spell Effect: Illusory Disguise}</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你使目标物体在外观与触感上看起来仿佛其物理状况要好得多或差得多。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。被做得看起来破败的物品会呈现为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}且粗劣。完好无损的物品若被做得看起来更好，会显得如同全新并高度抛光，或保养得当。破损的物品则会显得完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品不能受到该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻象。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛苦折磨着目标，造成2d4心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须进行一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害，但不承受持续伤害，且该法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续伤害，且目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。如果目标从恶心中恢复，持续伤害结束且该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4，且持续伤害增加1d4。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Hand": {
              "name": "念动力之手 Telekinetic Hand",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一只漂浮的魔法手，它可以是隐形的或如幽灵般半透明，抓住目标物体并使其缓慢地向任意方向漂浮移动，最多20英尺。当你维持该法术时，你可以让该物体额外移动20英尺。如果法术结束时该物体仍在空中，该物体会坠落。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>射程增加至60英尺，且你可以以一个无人持用且负载为2或更低的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"
            },
            "Telekinetic Projectile": {
              "name": "念动射弹 Telekinetic Projectile",
              "description": "<p>你将射程内一个松散、无人持用且负载为1或更低的物体掷向目标。对目标进行一次法术攻击掷骰。若你命中，则根据你掷出的物体的合适类型，造成2d6钝击、穿刺或挥砍伤害。被掷出的物品的任何特定特征或魔法属性都不会影响这次攻击或伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 你造成双倍伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 你造成完整伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Silver Blade": {
              "name": "银刃 Silver Blade"
            },
            "Cursesense": {
              "name": "诅咒感知 Cursesense",
              "description": "<p>稽折魔能够通过其所诅咒的任意银制物体进行视听，只要该物体位于1英里范围内。</p>\n<p>The argyrzei can see and hear through any silver object it cursed, as long as the object is within 1 mile.</p>"
            },
            "Headless": {
              "name": "无头 Headless",
              "description": "<p>稽折魔没有头，但仍能像有头一样听、说、看和闻。稽折魔免疫斩首效果，例如由斩首武器造成的效果。</p>\n<p>An argyrzei is headless but can still hear, speak, see, and smell as if it had a head. The argyrzei is immune to decapitation effects, such as those caused by vorpal weapons.</p>"
            },
            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被稽折魔杀死的生物很难被复活，或被驱使为不死。稽折魔会自动尝试反制任何将其所杀死的生物复活或驱使为不死的尝试（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+23 #Counteract]]{+23}，反制等级第7）。如果杀死该生物的稽折魔本身也被杀死，则该生物可以正常地从死亡中被带回，或正常地成为不死。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by an argyrzei are difficult to bring back to life or to animate as undead. The argyrzei automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+23 #Counteract]]{+23}, counteract level 7th). If the argyrzei who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
            },
            "Infect Silver": {
              "name": "染银 Infect Silver",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 稽折魔将注意力集中在一件相邻的银质物体上，该物体的大小不超过负载2。该物体变为诅咒；若该物体正被携带，则携带者可以用一次 @Check[will|dc:33] 豁免来抵抗该物体变为诅咒。稽折魔最多可同时维持五个诅咒；若其感染第六件银质物品，则最早被诅咒的物品解除诅咒。</p>\n<h2><strong>感染的白银</strong></h2>\n<section class=\"traits\">\n<p><strong>稀有</strong></p>\n<p><strong>诅咒</strong></p>\n<p><strong>魔法</strong></p>\n</section>\n<p><strong>用法</strong> 诅咒银质物品</p>\n<p>携带感染的白银1分钟后，它会与你纠缠在一起。你获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，并在诅咒持续期间保持该状态。只要你仍处于诅咒状态，你对抗由灵堕魔制造的心灵效果的所有豁免骰承受–2状态减值。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The argyrzei concentrates on an adjacent silver object that's no larger than Bulk 2. That object becomes cursed; if the object is being carried, the object's carrier can resist the object becoming cursed with a @Check[will|dc:33] save. The argyrzei can maintain up to five curses simultaneously; if it infects a sixth silver item, the oldest cursed item becomes uncursed.</p>\n<h2><strong>Infected Silver</strong></h2>\n<section class=\"traits\">\n<p><strong>RARE</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CURSED</strong></p>\n<p><strong>MAGICAL</strong></p>\n</section>\n<p><strong>Usage</strong> curses silver item</p>\n<p>After 1 minute of carrying infected silver, it fuses to you. You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} and remain so as long as the curse persists. As long as you remain cursed, you take a –2 status penalties to all saving throws against mental effects created by nindorus.</p>"
            },
            "Manifest Silver Blade": {
              "name": "具现银剑 Manifest Silver Blade",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 稽折魔没有携带银刃</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 稽折魔从自己颈部的残桩中拉拽出一把破损的银制武器，将其转化为一把<em>+1 强击 伤口 银制私生剑</em>。如果这把武器离开稽折魔的持有，它会崩解成沙。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The argyrzei isn't carrying a silver blade</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The argyrzei pulls one of the broken silver weapons from the stump of its neck, transforming it into a <em>+1 striking wounding silver bastard sword</em>. This weapon crumbles into sand if it leaves the argyrzei's possession.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>大多数灵堕魔会被银所伤害，但稽折魔不会。相反，稽折魔把银当作传播疾病与痛苦的手段，也用来帮助它们操控那些在不知不觉间落入其受感染赋礼诅咒之下者的心智。它们乐于伪装自己，然后将被感染的银卖给或赠予受害者。其他灵堕魔尤其畏惧稽折魔对银的精通，因为它们知道稽折魔能够用银刃造成痛苦的创伤。</p>\n<p>稽折魔外表类人，但它们的脚是向后长的，而且没有头。它们发着红光的断颈里塞满了各式各样的刀、刃与金属碎片。这些灵堕魔象征着艺术被创造、被摧毁，并被回收再造为新艺术的循环。</p>\n<p>Most nindorus are harmed by silver, but not the argyrzei. Instead, argyrzeis use silver as a method of spreading sickness and pain, and to help them manipulate the minds of those who unwittingly fall under the curse of their infected gifts. They delight in disguising themselves and then selling or giving infected silver to victims. Other nindorus particularly fear argyrzeis for their mastery over silver, knowing that they're capable of causing painful wounds with their silver blades.</p>\n<p>Argyrzeis appear humanoid, but their feet point backwards and they have no heads. Their glowing red neck stumps are stuffed with a wide assortment of knives, blades, and shards of metal. These nindorus represent the cycle of art being created, destroyed, and recycled into new art.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "稽折魔 Argyrzei"
        },
        "Dami's Extra Thanks": {
          "name": "达米的额外致谢 Dami's Extra Thanks",
          "tokenName": "达米的额外致谢 Dami's Extra Thanks",
          "items": {
            "Darkvision Elixir (Lesser)": {
              "name": "黑暗视觉药剂（次级） Darkvision Elixir (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span>（操作）</p>\n<hr />\n<p>在你饮下这瓶灵药后，你在黑暗中的视力变得更加敏锐。你获得黑暗视觉，持续10分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.7UL8belWmo7U5YGM]{效果：黑暗视觉灵药（次级）}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>After you drink this elixir, your sight becomes sharper in darkness. You gain darkvision for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.7UL8belWmo7U5YGM]{Effect: Darkvision Elixir (Lesser)}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "达米的额外感谢 Dami's Extra Thanks"
        },
        "Shrine Caretaker": {
          "name": "圣坛看护者 Shrine Caretaker",
          "tokenName": "圣坛看守者 Shrine Caretaker",
          "items": {
            "Fire Fist": {
              "name": "火焰拳 Fire Fist"
            },
            "Fire Mote": {
              "name": "火焰微粒 Fire Mote"
            },
            "Intense Heat": {
              "name": "酷热 Intense Heat",
              "description": "<p>5尺。@Damage[2d6[fire]]，@Check[reflex|dc:17|basic]</p>\n<p>5 feet. @Damage[2d6[fire]], @Check[reflex|dc:17|basic]</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Water Vulnerability": {
              "name": "水之弱点 Water Vulnerability",
              "description": "<p>当神龛看守者受到水效果造成的伤害时，这个不死生物会被痛苦折磨，变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。水无法扑灭神龛看守者的火焰。神龛看守者一旦置身于暴雨中，只要仍在倾盆大雨下，其运作方式就如同处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2（状态）}。他们无法自行降低该恶心状态，但如果他们在遮蔽处结束其回合（例如<strong>C3b</strong>或<strong>C3d</strong>等区域），该状态会自动结束。</p>\n<p>When a shrine caretaker is dealt damage by a water effect, the undead is wracked by pain, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}. Water can't douse the shrine caretaker's flames. A shrine caretaker who emerges into the rainstorm functions as if @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} as long as they remain in the downpour. They can't lower this sickened condition on their own, but it ends automatically if they end their turn in shelter (such as areas <strong>C3b</strong> or <strong>C3d</strong>).</p>"
            },
            "Blazing Howl": {
              "name": "炽焰嚎叫 Blazing Howl",
              "description": "<p>神龛看守者痛苦地尖叫，使一个@Template[type:emanation|distance:15]内的生物突然燃起火焰，对区域内每个生物造成@Damage[4d6[fire]]伤害（@Check[will|dc:17|basic]豁免）。在豁免中大失败的生物会陷入@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧（状态） 1}；此惊惧（状态）属于情绪、恐惧术与心灵效果。</p>\n<p>看守者在[[/br 1d4 #Recharge Blazing Howl]]{1d4轮}内无法再次使用“炽焰嚎叫”。</p>\n<p>The shrine caretaker screams in agony, causing creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:15] to burst into flame, which deals @Damage[4d6[fire]] damage to each creature in the area (@Check[will|dc:17|basic] save). A creature that critically fails its save is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}; this frightened condition is an emotion, fear, and mental effect.</p>\n<p>The caretaker can't use Blazing Howl again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge Blazing Howl]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>生命终结于烈焰的生物，可能会以一种名为焚身尸的不死之姿归来。即便死亡，它们仍在燃烧，被永恒的苦痛所吞噬，因而被驱使去实施不计后果的暴力。</p>\n<p>虽然焚身尸不再会真正被火焰所伤，它们却永无止境地承受着临死前的最后时刻，无尽的灼烧之痛不断炙烤着它们。许多焚身尸会试图把自己浸入湖泊或河流中，认为缠绕其形体的火焰必定是痛苦的源头。然而，水带来的阻碍多于帮助，浸没其中只会放大它们的折磨。</p>\n<p>焚身尸已不再拥有用痛苦哀嚎以外的方式进行交流的能力，但它们仍保有感官与记忆。然而，它们很少试图依循过往行事，因为疼痛淹没了对友谊、家庭与复仇的念头。随着时间推移，焚身尸会被驱使将痛苦施加给他人；因为当它们的火焰在另一个活体生物身上引燃的瞬间，它们会感到一次短暂而转瞬即逝的解脱。这种解脱使焚身尸常与活物发生冲突，尽管那些攻击大型聚居地的焚身尸很少能存活太久。</p>\n<p>有些焚身尸源自死于自燃之人：它们突然变得炽热到爆燃成火。这一神秘过程尚未被完全理解，但有些学者将其归因于火之位面的力量变动，致使物质位面出现足以致死的高热“热点”。更为罕见的是，在某些具有格外强烈魔法火焰的区域周围也会出现焚身尸，例如用于打造魔法武器的熔炉；当火焰点燃生物之身，使其被活活烧死，并在短短片刻间超越死亡、化为不死。</p>\n<p>无论其烈焰从何而来，焚身尸所遭受的恐怖死亡都会在死后作祟。它们焦黑炭化的尸体仍燃着火焰，时刻提醒着它们在痛苦中迎来终末的那一刻。燃烧血肉的恶臭预示着它们的到来，每一具焚身尸都会在身后留下黑烟。</p>\n<p>Creatures whose lives end in flames can return as undead called combusted. Still burning even in death, they're consumed by everlasting anguish that drives them to reckless violence.</p>\n<p>Although combusted can no longer be truly harmed by fire, they endure the final moments of their death eternally, searing them with endless burning pain. Many combusted attempt to douse themselves in lakes or rivers, believing the flames that wreath their forms must be the source of their pain. However, water is more hindrance than help, and being immersed in it only amplifies their agony.</p>\n<p>No longer possessing the ability to communicate in anything other than agonized wails, combusted nonetheless retain their senses and memories. Yet they rarely seek to act on their past, for the pain drowns out thoughts of friendships, family, and vengeance. In time, combusted are driven to share their pain with others, for the instant their flames catch fire on another living being, they feel a single, fleeting moment of relief. This relief leads combusted into conflict with living creatures often, although those that attack large settlements rarely survive long.</p>\n<p>Some combusted form from those who died via spontaneous combustion, suddenly becoming so hot they burst into flames. This mysterious process isn't fully understood, though some scholars attribute it to shifts in power in the Plane of Fire causing hot spots in the Material Plane powerful enough to kill. Much more rarely, combusted arise around areas with especially intense magical flames, such as forges used to create magic weapons, when the fire sets creatures ablaze, so they burn to death and transcend into undeath in mere moments.</p>\n<p>Regardless of the source of their conflagration, the horrifying deaths that combusted suffered haunt them in the afterlife. Their charred, blackened corpses alight with flames are a constant reminder of their final moments in pain. The stench of burning flesh heralds their presence, each combusted leaving black smoke in their wake.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：焚身尸\nVariant combusted",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "圣坛看护者 Shrine Caretaker"
        },
