            "Absorb Wraith": {
              "name": "吸收缚灵 Absorb Wraith",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 战争缚灵将手伸向100尺内的另一名缚灵生物。目标缚灵溶解并沿直线疾冲向战争缚灵，对直线上的每个生物造成 @Damage[3d10[void]] 伤害，且可进行一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:28|basic] 豁免。战争缚灵吸收目标缚灵的精华，获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} 状态，持续1分钟。其额外动作只能用于飞行或打击。若目标不愿意，它若在一次 @Check[will|dc:28] 豁免中成功，则可以抗拒被吸收。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The war wraith extends their hand toward another wraith creature within 100 feet. The target wraith dissolves and streaks toward the war wraith in a straight line, dealing @Damage[3d10[void]] damage to each creature along the line with a @Check[fortitude|dc:28|basic] save. The war wraith absorbs the essence of the target wraith, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} for 1 minute. They can use their extra action only to Fly or Strike. An unwilling target can resist being absorbed if it succeeds at a @Check[will|dc:28] save.</p>"
