              "name": "虚空之拥 Void's Embrace",
              "description": "<p>如果受害者在阳光下对该诅咒的豁免成功，则诅咒结束。只要一个生物带有该诅咒，它就会无视对其施加诅咒的缚灵的抗力</p>\n<p><strong>豁免</strong> @Check[will|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> 受害者在任何光照下都处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩} 状态（1小时）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> 受害者获得30尺生命感知，但在任何光照下都处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲} 状态（1小时）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> 同阶段2，但该生物还具有虚无治疗（1小时）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> 受害者变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷} 且无法醒来（1天）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 5</strong> 该生物死亡并变为一只处于战缚灵命令下的缚灵，其躯体崩解为灰烬</p>\n<p>If the victim succeeds at a saving throw against this curse while in sunlight, the curse ends. While a creature has this curse, it bypasses the resistance of the wraith that cursed it</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[will|dc:28]</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> the victim is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} in any light (1 hour)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> the victim gains lifesense 30 feet but is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} in any light (1 hour)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> as stage 2, but the creature also has void healing (1 hour)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> the victim becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} and can't awaken (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> the creature dies and becomes a wraith under the command of the war wraith, its body crumbling to ash</p>"
