            "Vampiric Exsanguination": {
              "name": "血族驱命 Vampiric Exsanguination",
              "description": "<p>你伸出双臂，汲取其他生物的鲜血与生命力。你对区域内的活体生物造成12d6虚体伤害，且其需进行一次基础强韧豁免。</p>\n<p>你获得等同于该法术对单一生物造成伤害一半的临时生命值；以受到伤害最高的生物来计算这些临时生命值。1分钟后，你失去任何剩余的临时生命值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d6。</p>\n<p>You draw in the blood and life force of other creatures through your outstretched arms. You deal 12d6 void damage to living creatures in the area with a basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<p>You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage a single creature takes from this spell; calculate these temporary Hit Points using the creature that took the most damage. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "Hallucination": {
              "name": "镜花水月 Hallucination",
              "description": "<p>目标会始终如一地将某物侦测为另一物，无法侦测到确实存在的事物，或侦测到并不存在的事物，但这不会改变其信念。你选择适用上述哪一种效果，并由你决定镜花水月的具体内容。例如，你可以让目标把所有精灵都看成是人类、无法侦测到其兄弟的存在、即使幸运护符不在身上也会看见它在自己身上，或看见一座位于镇中心的高塔。</p>\n<p>目标可以尝试一次初始的意志豁免检定，效果如下。此后，每当目标进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜寻} 或直接与镜花水月交互时，也会获得一次意志豁免检定以识破镜花水月。例如，目标每次与精灵交互、意外撞上其兄弟、试图检查其护符，或研究高塔时，都可以尝试识破镜花水月。在 GM 决定的情境下，目标可以带有很大的环境加值来尝试识破，例如目标试图攀爬那座并不存在的高塔时。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物会感知你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止，但它知道镜花水月是什么。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物会感知你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物会感知你所选择的内容，直到它识破为止，且它信任自己虚假的感官，对用于识破的豁免检定承受 -4 环境减值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 选择以下之一：以最多 10 个生物为目标，或将法术的持续时间改为直到你下次每日准备。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（8环）</strong> 选择以下之一：以任意数量的生物为目标，或将法术的持续时间改为无限。</p>\n<p>The target consistently detects one thing as another, can't detect something that's there, or detects something that's not there, though it doesn't alter their beliefs. You choose which of these effects applies, and you determine the specifics of the hallucination. For example, you could make the target see all elves as humans, be unable to detect the presence of their brother, see their beloved good luck charm on their person even when it isn't, or see a tower in the center of town.</p>\n<p>The target can attempt an initial Will save, with effects below. They also receive a Will save to disbelieve the hallucination every time they @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} or directly interact with the hallucination. For example, the target could attempt to disbelieve the hallucination each time they interacted with an elf, bumped into their brother accidentally, tried to check their charm, or studied the tower. The target can attempt to disbelieve with a large circumstance bonus in situations determined by the GM, such as if the target attempted to climb the nonexistent tower.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, but it knows what the hallucination is.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, and it trusts its false senses, taking a -4 circumstance penalty to saves to disbelieve.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Choose to either target up to 10 creatures or change the spell's duration to until your next daily preparations.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> Choose to either target any number of creatures or change the spell's duration to unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Phantasmal Killer": {
              "name": "魅影杀手 Phantasmal Killer",
              "description": "<p>你为目标创造出一幅其所能想象到的最可怕生物的幻影。只有该法术的目标能看见这个杀手，不过当它疾驰而出发动攻击时，你也能看见幻象那模糊的轮廓。杀手的效果取决于目标的意志豁免结果。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[4d6[mental]] 伤害，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到 @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] 伤害，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标恐惧到可能会死去。它必须尝试一次 @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] 豁免；若目标失败，它死亡。若强韧豁免成功，目标受到 @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] 伤害，获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{逃跑} 直到其下个回合结束，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 4}。此效果具有失能（特征）。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 在失败时伤害增加 2d6，在大失败时伤害增加 3d6。</p>\n<p>You create a phantasmal image of the most fearsome creature imaginable to the target. Only the spell's target can see the killer, though you can see the vague shape of the illusion as it races forth to attack. The effect of the killer is based on the outcome of the target's Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(max(8,@item.rank*2))d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is so afraid it might die. It must attempt a @Check[fortitude|traits:incapacitation] save; if the target fails, it dies. On a successful Fortitude save, the target takes @Damage[(max(12,@item.rank*3))d6[mental]] damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} until the end of its next turn, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}. This effect has the incapacitation trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6 on a failure and by 3d6 on a critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Death Knell (At Will)": {
              "name": "死亡丧钟（随意施放） Death Knell (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你掐灭一名濒死生物的生命。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。若该法术杀死目标，你获得10点临时HP，以及在10分钟内对攻击与伤害掷骰获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死} 值增加1。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标死亡。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.98XT2QUk6wvXIqf7]{法术效果：死亡丧钟}</p>\n<p>You snuff the life out of a creature on the brink of death. The target must attempt a Will save. If this kills it, you gain 10 temporary HP and a +1 status bonus to attack and damage rolls for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} value increases by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target dies.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.98XT2QUk6wvXIqf7]{Spell Effect: Death Knell}</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你探入目标的心智，用一次心灵冲击使其眩晕。该冲击造成1d6点心灵伤害，目标进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一种由简单声音构成的听觉幻觉，其最大音量相当于四个正常人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可辨识的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120英尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你让目标物体看起来和摸起来仿佛其物理状况要好得多或糟得多。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。被弄得看起来破败不堪的物品显得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损} 且粗制滥造。一件完好的物品若被弄得看起来更好，会显得仿佛崭新且高度抛光，或保养良好。一件破损物品则看起来完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品无法受到该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong> 持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "传讯术 Message",
              "description": "<p>你悄声动着嘴唇，但这些话语并不会从你口中发出，而是直接传到目标的耳中。其他人听不见你的话，效果不会比你平时只动嘴不出声更好；但目标能听见你的话，就像他们正站在你身旁一样。目标可以用反应动作（）作出简短回应；或者如果他们希望，也可以在其下个回合以自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你且处于射程内才能这么做。若他们回应，其回应会像原本的传讯术一样，直接传到你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（3环）</strong> 该法术的射程增加至500英尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被煞星魔杀死的生物很难复活或作为不死被唤起。煞星魔会自动尝试反制任何试图复活或将其杀死的任何生物唤起为不死的行为（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+21 #Counteract]]{+21}，反制等级第6级）。如果杀死该生物的煞星魔本身也被杀死，该生物就可以正常地从死亡中被带回或变为不死。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by an shisagishin are difficult to bring back to life or to animate as undead. The shisagishin automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+21 #Counteract]]{+21}, counteract level 6th). If the shisagishin who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
            },
            "Attack of Opportunity": {
              "name": "借机攻击 Attack of Opportunity",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AttackOfOpportunity]</p>"
            },
            "Burst From Death": {
              "name": "死中暴起 Burst From Death",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 尚未掷先攻，且煞星魔以具现尸壳伪装成一具尸体</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物触碰伪装的煞星魔，或触碰煞星魔被放入的棺材或其他容器</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 煞星魔猛烈展开成其真实形态，撕碎其腐烂的尸壳，并在掷先攻之前尝试对一个相邻目标进行一次爪击打击。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Initiative hasn't yet been rolled, and the shisagishin is disguised as a corpse with Manifest Corpse Shell</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature touches the disguised shisagishin or a coffin or other container the shisagishin has been placed into</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The shisagishin violently unfolds into its true form, shredding its decaying corpse shell, and attempts a claw Strike on an adjacent target before it rolls initiative.</p>"
            },
            "Manifest Corpse Shell": {
              "name": "具现尸壳 Manifest Corpse Shell",
              "description": "<p>煞星魔将手臂和双腿蜷入体内，使自己变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}，并在持续专注10分钟的过程中在自身周围显化出一具腐烂和/或残缺的人形尸体。煞星魔可以通过以欺瞒进行冒充，将这具尸体伪装成它先前见过的某个特定生物的遗骸。一旦其尸体外壳显化完成，直到煞星魔下一次行动前，它看起来都像是一具尸体。它在用于伪装成尸体的欺瞒检定与DC上具有44的自动结果。</p>\n<p>The shisagishin tucks its arms and legs into its body, drops @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, and manifests a decaying and/or mutilated humanoid corpse around itself over the course of 10 minutes of concentration. The shisagishin can cause this corpse to appear to be the remains of a specific creature it has seen before by Impersonating that creature with Deception. Once its corpse shell has manifested, until the next time the shisagishin acts, it appears to be a corpse. It has an automatic result of 44 on Deception checks and DCs to pass as a corpse.</p>"
            },
            "Spread Decay": {
              "name": "散播腐败 Spread Decay",
              "description": "<p>煞星魔使任何数量被它@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}的生物的血肉迅速开始腐烂。上述每个生物都必须进行一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:32] 豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[2d8[void]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[4d8[void]] 伤害并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物受到 @Damage[6d8[void]] 伤害并获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭 2}</p>\n<p>The shisagishin causes the flesh of any number of creatures @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} by it to swiftly begin to decay. Each of those creatures must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:32] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[2d8[void]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[4d8[void]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[6d8[void]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>煞星魔乐于潜入一个社群，随后伪装成某位挚爱之人或受人敬仰的公众人物那可怖地腐烂或残缺的遗骸，并只在葬礼服务期间才以其真实形态骤然复苏。煞星魔体现了腐朽孕育新生的循环。</p>\n<h2>手工打造的栖息地</h2>\n<p>煞星魔偏好在本就充斥冲突与潜在事故的区域游荡，但如有需要，它也乐于亲手制造这样的地点。它们可能会在水井中投放毒素，把疾病带给健康的牲畜，甚至与堕落的人类合作——只要这意味着拥有杀戮的自由。被诅咒的城镇或闹鬼的道路，有时就是这类煞星魔的游乐场。</p>\n<p>The shisagishin takes delight in infiltrating a community and then disguising itself as the horribly decayed or mutilated remains of a loved one or adored public figure, only to spring to life in its true form during funeral services. A shisagishin epitomizes the cycle of decay giving rise to new life.</p>\n<h2>Handmade Habitats</h2>\n<p>A shisagishin prefers to roam areas already rife with conflict and potential accidents, but it will happily create such a location if needed. They might poison wells, introduce disease to healthy livestock, or even collaborate with corrupt humans if it means the freedom to kill. Cursed towns or haunted roads are sometimes the playground of such a shisagishin.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "煞星魔 Shisagishin"
        },
        "Garden Shrine": {
          "name": "园圃圣祠 Garden Shrine",
          "tokenName": "园圃圣祠 Garden Shrine",
          "items": {
            "Fine Lavender Incense Cone": {
              "name": "优质薰衣草线香锥 Fine Lavender Incense Cone"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "园圃圣祠 Garden Shrine"
        },
        "Zhi Hui": {
          "name": "智惠 Zhi Hui",
          "tokenName": "智惠 Zhi Hui",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Life's Fresh Bloom": {
              "name": "生命花开 Life's Fresh Bloom",
              "description": "<p>你周围的地面绽放出生命，长出闪烁的草地、花朵和小灌木。每个在该区域内、其回合开始时站在地面上的活体且非灵堕魔生物，恢复1d6生命值，并在其下个回合结束前获得速度+5英尺的状态加值。其回合开始时位于生命花开区域内的灵堕魔邪魔和不死生物则会变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}，除非它们通过一次强韧豁免。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.yYDj0G4O3q5iGexx]{法术效果：生命花开}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong>将恢复的生命值提高至1d8，且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（10环）</strong>将恢复的生命值提高至1d10，且@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 3}。</p>\n<p>The ground around you blooms with life, sprouting sparkling grass, flowers, and small shrubs. Each living and non-nindoru creature that starts its turn standing on the ground in the area recovers 1d6 Hit Points and gains a +5-foot status bonus to its Speed until the end of its next turn. Nindoru fiends and undead that start their turn in the area of life's fresh bloom instead become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} unless they succeed at a Fortitude saving throw.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.yYDj0G4O3q5iGexx]{Spell Effect: Life's Fresh Bloom}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> Increase the Hit Points restored to 1d8 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (10th)</strong> Increase the Hit Points restored to 1d10 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 3}.</p>"
            },
            "Remove Curse": {
              "name": "移除诅咒 Remove Curse",
              "description": "<p>你的接触给予受诅咒的生物片刻喘息。你尝试反制一个影响目标的诅咒。如果该诅咒来自受诅咒的物品或其他外部来源，则成功表示目标生物可以摆脱该受诅咒的物品，但不会移除该物品上的诅咒。</p>\n<p>Your touch grants a reprieve to a cursed creature. You attempt to counteract one curse afflicting the target. If the curse comes from a cursed item or other external source, a success indicates that the target creature can rid itself of the cursed item, but it doesn't remove the curse from the item.</p>"
            },
            "Remove Disease": {
              "name": "移除疾病 Remove Disease",
              "description": "<p>治疗魔法会将疾病从生物的身体中净化。你尝试反制一种正在折磨目标的疾病。</p>\n<p>Healing magic purges disease from a creature's body. You attempt to counteract one disease afflicting the target.</p>"
            },
            "Restoration": {
              "name": "复原术 Restoration",
              "description": "<p>复原性的魔法能对抗毒素的影响，或妨碍生物发挥最佳状态的状态。当你施放复原术时，选择以下之一：降低一种状态，或减轻一种毒素的效果。生物每天只能从一道复原术法术中获益一次，并且对于同一种毒素的同一次暴露，它不能多次从复原术中获益以降低其阶段。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>减轻一种毒素</strong> 将目标所遭受的一种毒素的阶段降低1个阶段。这不能将阶段降低到第1阶段以下，也不能治愈该苦难。</li>\n<li><strong>降低一种状态</strong> 将目标的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{力竭}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞（状态）}状态值降低2。你也可以改为将上述列表中的两种状态各降低1。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 将@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{枯竭}加入你能降低的状态列表中。当你减轻一种毒素时，将其阶段降低2个阶段。你还获得第三个选项，使你能将目标的@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭（状态）}值降低1。你不能用此方式降低永久性的毁灭（状态）。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 同4环复原术，但如果你在施放法术时额外加入一个施法动作和一个材料成分（期间你提供价值100 gp的钻石粉作为成本），则你可以降低永久性的毁灭（状态）。</p>\n<p>Restorative magic counters the effects of toxins or conditions that prevent a creature from functioning at its best. When you cast restoration, choose to either reduce a condition or lessen the effect of a toxin. A creature can benefit from only one restoration spell each day, and it can't benefit from restoration more than once to reduce the stage of the same exposure to a given toxin.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lessen a Toxin</strong> Reduce the stage of one toxin the target suffers from by one stage. This can't reduce the stage below stage 1 or cure the affliction.</li>\n<li><strong>Reduce a Condition</strong> Reduce the value of the target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied} condition by 2. You can instead reduce two of the listed conditions by 1 each.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained} to the list of conditions you can reduce. When you lessen a toxin, reduce the stage by two. You also gain a third option that allows you to reduce the target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed} value by 1. You can't use this to reduce a permanent Doomed condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> As the 4th-rank restoration, but you can reduce a permanent Doomed condition if you add a spellcasting action and a material component while Casting the Spell, during which you provide 100 gp worth of diamond dust as a cost.</p>"
            },
            "Restore Senses": {
              "name": "复原感官 Restore Senses",
              "description": "<p>你尝试反制一个施加在目标身上的单一效果，该效果会导致目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{耳聋（状态）} 状态，从而恢复其视力或听力。此法术既能反制暂时性的魔法，也能反制魔法造成的永久后果，但它无法治愈因某种自然状态或效果而缺失该感官的人，例如先天如此，或由于非魔法的创伤或毒素所致。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 该法术的射程增加至30英尺，且你可以以最多10个生物为目标。你可以为每个被选中的生物分别选择要反制的效果。</p>\n<p>You attempt to counteract a single effect imposing the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} conditions on the target, restoring its vision or hearing. This can counteract both temporary magic and permanent consequences of magic, but it doesn't cure someone who does not have the sense due to some natural state or effect, such as from birth or from a non-magical wound or toxin.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The spell's range increases to 30 feet, and you can target up to 10 creatures. You can choose the effect to counteract separately for each selected creature.</p>"
            },
            "Divine Lance": {
              "name": "圣枪术 Divine Lance",
              "description": "<p>你释放一道神圣能量光束。对目标的 AC 进行一次远程法术攻击。命中时，目标受到 2d4 魂魄伤害（大成功则伤害加倍）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害增加 1d4。</p>\n<p>You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Heal": {
              "name": "治疗术 Heal",
              "description": "<p>你引导生命力能量来治疗活物或伤害不死生物。若目标是自愿的活体生物，你回复1d8生命值。若目标是不死生物，你对其造成等量的生命力伤害，并且它进行一次基础强韧豁免。你在施放此法术时花费的动作数决定其目标、射程、区域以及其他参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(姿势)</strong> 该法术的射程为接触。</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(语言, 姿势)</strong> 该法术的射程为30尺。若你正在治疗一个活体生物，将回复的生命值提高8点</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(材料, 姿势, 语言)</strong> 你在30尺散发中扩散生命力能量。这会以爆发为目标影响其中所有活体与不死生物。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 治疗或伤害的数值提高1d8，且2动作版本的额外治疗提高8点。</p>\n<p>You channel vitality energy to heal the living or damage the undead. If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> <strong>(somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of touch.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(verbal, somatic)</strong> The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> <strong>(material, somatic, verbal)</strong> You disperse vitality energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.</p>"
            },
            "Read Aura": {
              "name": "阅读灵光 Read Aura",
              "description": "<p>你将注意力集中在目标物体上，打开思维以感知魔法灵光。施法完成后，你会知道该物品是否具有魔法。你或任何接受你关于该灵光建议的人，在该物品上进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{辨识魔法} 时获得 +2 环境加值。若该物体是幻象，只有当该效果的阶级低于你的<em>阅读灵光</em>法术的阶级时，你才能侦测到这一点。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 你最多可以以 10 个物体为目标。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（6环）</strong> 你可以以任意数量的物体为目标。</p>\n<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"
            },
            "Sanctuary": {
              "name": "圣域术 Sanctuary",
              "description": "<p>你用防护能量护住一个生物，阻止敌人的攻击。生物每次试图攻击目标时，都必须进行一次意志豁免。若目标使用敌对动作，则法术结束。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 圣域术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物可以尝试进行其攻击，以及本回合中对目标的任何其他攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物不能攻击目标，并浪费该动作。该生物本回合不能再尝试对目标进行进一步攻击。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物浪费该动作，且在圣域术的剩余持续时间内都不能尝试攻击目标。</p>\n<p>You ward a creature with protective energy that deters enemy attacks. Creatures attempting to attack the target must attempt a Will save each time. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Sanctuary ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature can attempt its attack and any other attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't attack the target and wastes the action. It can't attempt further attacks against the target this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature wastes the action and can't attempt to attack the target for the rest of sanctuary's duration.</p>"
            },
            "Stabilize": {
              "name": "稳定伤势 Stabilize",
              "description": "<p>活力能量关上死亡之门。目标失去@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{濒死（状态）}状态，但在0生命值时仍保持@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}。</p>\n<p>Vitality energy shuts death's door. The target loses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} condition, though it remains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} at 0 Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Ghostly Hand": {
              "name": "鬼魅之手 Ghostly Hand"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>净化四尊雕像并在谭杉寺下方的苦迦菩提之墓中击败欣玥，会让智惠的幽灵（特征）消散。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一个幽灵（特征）被摧毁时，它会在其所束缚的地点于[[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后重新成形，并完全痊愈。只有当有人查明其存在的原因，并纠正一切阻碍魂魄休息的事物时，幽灵（特征）才能被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>Purifying the four statues and defeating Xin Yue in Kugaptee's Grave below the Tan Sugi monastery allows Zhi Hui's ghost to fade.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after [[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Incarnate Skill": {
              "name": "先天之技 Incarnate Skill",
              "description": "<p>智惠凝视一名自愿生物的灵魂，并在其前世中搜寻。该生物永久地将自己选择的一项其当前为专家的技能的熟练度等级，与自己选择的一项其未受训的技能的熟练度等级进行交换。智惠每个角色只能进行此行动一次。</p>\n<p>Zhi Hui peers into a willing creature's soul and searches through their past lives. That creature permanently trades proficiency rank from one skill they're currently expert in with a skill in which they're untrained, both of their choice. Zhi Hui can only perform this activity once per character.</p>"
            }
          },
          "hp": "void healing, rejuvenation",
          "prototypeToken": "智惠 Zhi Hui"
        },
        "Safe": {
          "name": "安全 Safe",
          "tokenName": "安全 Safe",
          "items": {
            "Gold Pieces": {
              "name": "金币 Gold Pieces"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "安全 Safe"
        },
        "Black Bean": {
          "name": "黑豆 Black Bean",
          "tokenName": "黑豆 Black Bean",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog10oblivi.JournalEntryPage.10knowanddespa00]{知晓与绝望}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog10oblivi.JournalEntryPage.10knowanddespa00]{Know and Despair}</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "黑豆 Black Bean"
        },
        "The Peddler of Glories": {
          "name": "荣耀小贩 The Peddler of Glories",
          "tokenName": "荣耀小贩 The Peddler of Glories",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog15afiend.JournalEntryPage.15curiositiesa00#the-peddler-of-glories]{荣耀的商贩}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog15afiend.JournalEntryPage.15curiositiesa00#the-peddler-of-glories]{The Peddler of Glories}</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "荣耀商贩 The Peddler of Glories"
        },
        "Fungus Leshy": {
          "name": "真菌莱西 Fungus Leshy",
          "tokenName": "真菌莱西 Fungus Leshy",
          "items": {
            "Primal Innate Spells": {
              "name": "原能内在法术 Primal Innate Spells"
            },
            "Speak with Plants (Constant, Fungi Only)": {
              "name": "植物交谈（持续，限真菌） Speak with Plants (Constant, Fungi Only)",
              "description": "<p>你可以向植物和真菌提问并得到回答，但该法术不会让它们比平常更友善或更聪明。大多数普通植物和真菌对周围世界有其独特的看法，因此它们无法辨识生物的细节，也不知道其直接邻近范围之外的世界。狡猾的植物或真菌怪物很可能言辞简短且闪烁其词，而较不聪明的则常会做出愚蠢的评论。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>You can ask questions of and receive answers from plants and fungi, but the spell doesn't make them more friendly or intelligent than normal. Most normal plants and fungi have a distinctive view of the world around them, so they don't recognize details about creatures or know anything about the world beyond their immediate vicinity. Cunning plant or fungus monsters are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Spore Pod": {
              "name": "孢子荚 Spore Pod"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "恒定法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Verdant Burst": {
              "name": "翠绿迸发 Verdant Burst",
              "description": "<p>当一只真菌莱西死亡时，一股原初能量从其身体中爆发，为@Template[emanation|distance:30]内的每个真菌生物恢复 @Damage[2d8[healing]] 生命值。该区域充满真菌，变为困难地形。</p>\n<p>如果该地形不是这种真菌适宜的环境，它们会在24小时后枯萎。</p>\n<p>When a fungus leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from its body, restoring @Damage[2d8[healing]] Hit Points to each fungi creature in a @Template[emanation|distance:30]. This area is filled with fungi, becoming difficult terrain.</p>\n<p>If the terrain is not a viable environment for this fungi, they wither after 24 hours.</p>"
            },
            "Change Shape": {
              "name": "变形 Change Shape",
              "description": "<p>真菌莱西变成一朵巨型蘑菇或一片菌类丛。这项能力在其他方面使用 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{One with Plants} 的效果。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>\n<p>The fungus leshy transforms into a giant mushroom or patch of fungi. This ability otherwise uses the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{One with Plants}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"
            },
            "Spore Cloud": {
              "name": "孢子云 Spore Cloud",
              "description": "<p>真菌莱西可以释放一团孢子云，刺激@Template[emanation|distance:15]内非真菌生物的眼睛与喉咙。每个生物必须在@Check[fortitude|dc:16|options:area-effect,damaging-effect]豁免中成功，否则受到@Damage[1[persistent,poison]|options:area-damage]伤害。</p>\n<p>只要持续性伤害仍在继续，该生物的视力就会降低，并且只能看见20英尺内的事物。</p>\n<p>A fungus leshy can unleash a cloud of spores that irritates the eyes and throats of non-fungus creatures in a @Template[emanation|distance:15]. Each creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:16|options:area-effect,damaging-effect] save or take @Damage[1[persistent,poison]|options:area-damage] damage.</p>\n<p>A creature has its vision reduced as long as the persistent damage continues and can see only within 20 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Spores": {
              "name": "孢子 Spores",
              "description": "<p>因真菌莱西的孢子囊打击而受到伤害的生物必须进行一次与其孢子云能力具有相同DC（@Check[fortitude|dc:16]）与效果的豁免检定</p>\n<p>A creature that takes damage from a fungus leshy's spore pod Strike must attempt a saving throw with the same DC (@Check[fortitude|dc:16]) and effect as its Spore Cloud ability</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>真菌莱希守卫洞穴、沼泽，以及潮湿阴暗之处。以大多数标准来看，他们的真菌园圃古怪离奇，但真菌莱希对自己的作品极为自豪。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>莱希是聪慧的植物生物，守卫着原始荒野或大地伟力的区域。它们最初由强大的精类创造；当一位精通原初魔法的施术者——通常是德鲁伊——将一个自然魂魄与一具由当地植被精心培育并塑造的身躯结合时，它们便会显现。创造莱希所需的仪式与材料会因莱希的类型而异。它们通常在具有重大自然意义的区域获得生命，例如树人的林地、德鲁伊结社之环、仙灵圈，或一处伟大的自然奇观。</p>\n<p>Fungus leshies guard caves, bogs, and damp, dark places. Their fungus gardens are bizarre by most standards, but fungus leshies are extremely proud of their works.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Leshies are intelligent plant creatures who guard areas of primeval wilderness or earthly power. Originally created by powerful fey, they manifest when a skilled practitioner of primal magic—typically a druid—combines a nature spirit with a body carefully grown and crafted from local vegetation. The rites and materials required to create a leshy vary depending on the type of leshy. They are typically given life in an area of great natural significance, such as an arboreal's grove, a druidic circle, a fairy ring, or a great natural wonder.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "真菌莱西 Fungus Leshy"
        },
        "Farmer's Gift": {
          "name": "农民的赋礼 Farmer's Gift",
          "tokenName": "农民的赋礼 Farmer's Gift",
          "items": {
            "Crafter's Eyepiece": {
              "name": "工匠目镜 Crafter's Eyepiece",
              "description": "<p>这副粗犷的金属目镜上蚀刻着方形纹路，设计为戴在单只眼睛上。旋转镜片会显现出你计划制作或修理的物品的淡淡三维轮廓，并在各个组件上标注有乐于帮助的标签。</p>\n<p>你在工艺检定中获得+1物品加值。当你修理一件物品时，成功时将恢复的生命值提高至10 + 每个熟练度阶级10，或在大成功时提高至15 + 每个熟练度阶级15。</p>\n<p>This rugged metal eyepiece etched with square patterns is designed to be worn over a single eye. Twisting the lens reveals a faint three-dimensional outline of an item you plan to build or repair, with helpful labels on the component parts.</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 item bonus to Crafting checks. When you Repair an item, increase the Hit Points restored to 10 + 10 per proficiency rank on a success or 15 + 15 per proficiency rank on a critical success.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "农民的礼物 Farmer's Gift"
        },
        "Taunting Monk's Skull": {
          "name": "嘲讽僧侣的头骨 Taunting Monk's Skull",
          "tokenName": "嘲弄武僧之颅 Taunting Monk's Skull",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚部 Jaws"
            },
            "Ectoplasmic Spit": {
              "name": "灵质唾液 Ectoplasmic Spit"
            },
            "Bite Back": {
              "name": "反咬一口 Bite Back",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 骷髅被其触及范围内的一名生物攻击</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 骷髅对该生物进行一次颌部打击。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The skull is attacked by a creature within their reach</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The skull makes a jaws Strike against that creature.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Behold the Promises of Kugaptee!": {
              "name": "见证苦迦菩提的承诺！ Behold the Promises of Kugaptee!",
              "description": "<p>骷髅选择60尺内的一个生物，并对其诉说：若将灵魂交予苦迦菩提，他们将被赐予遗忘。目标必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:24] 意志豁免。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响，并获得1分钟的暂时免疫。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标在1轮内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} 状态。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标因绝望在1轮内处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} 状态，随后再额外1轮处于off-guard状态。</p>\n<p>The skull chooses one creature within 60 feet and speaks to them about the oblivion they'll be granted if they cede their soul to Kugaptee. The target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and is temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} by despair for 1 round, and is then off-guard for 1 additional round.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>有些断头者被复生时，其心智能力大多仍保持完好。这些狡猾的不死生物常常挑衅受害者，让对方愚蠢地追赶它们或伤害自己。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>断头者是脱离躯体、漂浮在空中的头颅，被转化为不死生物。由于制造成本低廉且可无穷定制，它们是死灵法师“实验仆从”的天然人选。在那些被修习死灵术的死灵法师长期占据的巢穴中，常能见到少量漂浮头颅四处游荡；它们各自展现出完全不同的特征，甚至在其被制造时所投入的技艺水准上也不尽相同。</p>\n<p>Some beheaded are raised with their mental faculties mostly intact. These clever undead often provoke their victims into foolishly giving chase or harming themselves.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Beheaded are disembodied floating heads transformed into undead. They are natural candidates for a necromancer's \"project minion,\" due to the inexpensive cost of creation and endlessly customizable nature. In any lair occupied for long by practicing necromancers, it isn't uncommon to find a handful of floating heads roaming about, each exhibiting completely different characteristics and even degrees of expertise in their creation.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：嘲弄颅骨\nVariant taunting skull",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "嘲弄武僧的头骨 Taunting Monk's Skull"
        },
        "Wardrobe": {
          "name": "衣橱 Wardrobe",
          "tokenName": "衣橱 Wardrobe",
          "items": {
            "Withered Camellia Flower Carefully Preserved in a Cushioned Box": {
              "name": "精心保存在衬垫盒中的枯萎山茶花 Withered Camellia Flower Carefully Preserved in a Cushioned Box",
              "description": "<p>花朵的茎被一条金色、书法题字的丝带缠绕着，其上有一只纤巧的手写下：“夏日的美德永不褪色。”</p><img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-flowerandribbon.webp\" />\n<p>The flower’s stem is wrapped in a gold, calligraphed ribbon, upon which a delicate hand has written: “Summer’s virtues never fade.”</p><img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-flowerandribbon.webp\" />"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "衣橱 Wardrobe"
        },
        "Elizeth Candora": {
          "name": "伊丽丝·堪多拉 Elizeth Candora",
          "tokenName": "伊丽丝·堪多拉 Elizeth Candora",
          "publicNotes": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w9ladyofsoul00]{司魂娘娘}</p>\n<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog02willow.JournalEntryPage.02w9ladyofsoul00]{Lady of Souls}</p>",
          "blurb": "富有同理心的人类女性法莱斯玛牧师\nempathetic female human cleric of Pharasma",
          "prototypeToken": "伊丽丝·堪多拉 Elizeth Candora"
        },
        "Point Tracking": {
          "name": "点数追踪 Point Tracking",
          "tokenName": "点数追踪 Point Tracking",
          "items": {
            "Northridge Reputation": {
              "name": "北岭人声望 Northridge Reputation"
            },
            "Southbank Reputation": {
              "name": "南岸声望 Southbank Reputation"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>使用此角色，通过在其上放置点数追踪效果来记录诸如声望点之类的资源。</p>\n<p>当选中该角色的指示物时，这些效果会显示在右上角的效果面板中，并且可以分别通过左键和右键单击来增加和减少。</p>\n<p>Use this actor to keep track of resources like Reputation Points by placing Point Tracking effects on it.</p>\n<p>The effects will show up in the effect panel in the top right when the token of this actor is selected, and can be incremented and decremented with left and right click, respectively.</p>",
          "privateNotes": "<p>如果你希望玩家能够看到这些点数，请将该角色的所有权授予他们。不过请注意，这也会允许他们修改这些数值。</p>\n<p>If you want players to be able to see these points, give them ownership of this actor. Do note though that this will also allow them to modify these values.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "点数追踪 Point Tracking"
        },
        "Shop": {
          "name": "商店 Shop",
          "tokenName": "商店 Shop",
          "items": {
            "So-Jin’s Journal": {
              "name": "素珍的日记 So-Jin’s Journal",
              "description": "<p>包含一个稀有的炼金武器配方：@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.oE3fHS3CUs15bZ4r]{银魂炸弹}。</p>\n<p>Contains a rare formula for an alchemical weapon: a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.oE3fHS3CUs15bZ4r]{Silversoul Bomb}.</p>"
            },
            "Powdered Silver and other Alchemical Supplies": {
              "name": "银粉及其他炼金补给品 Powdered Silver and other Alchemical Supplies",
              "description": "<p>若用于制作额外的银魂炸弹，则为制作检定提供+2物品加值。</p>\n<p>If used to craft additional silversoul bombs, grants a +2 item bonus to the Crafting check.</p>"
            },
            "Silversoul Bomb": {
              "name": "银魂炸弹 Silversoul Bomb",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 交互</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这种稀有炼金炸弹会收集并凝聚一处墓地中萦绕的情绪——那里的历代挚爱祖先长眠于此——并将这股强烈的情绪能量注入炸弹内部经炼金处理的银粉之中。该能量会散发柔和的银色光辉；若装在透明容器中，银魂炸弹可当作火把使用，以照亮一个区域。</p>\n<p>你获得+1物品加值于攻击掷骰，且炸弹造成2d4心灵伤害，对灵堕魔造成1d6持续性心灵伤害，并造成2点心灵溅射伤害。一名因该炸弹受到溅射伤害且未能通过一次@Check[fortitude|dc:17]豁免的生物，会因发光的银色微粒黏附在其脸上而@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩}1轮。</p>\n<p>灵堕魔会受到银魂炸弹的格外伤害，并承受1d6持续性心灵伤害。对抗灵堕魔时，炸弹的物品加值也适用于其豁免DC，以抵抗陷入目眩或目盲（@Check[fortitude|dc:18]）。由于银被注入其中的能量之内，对银具有弱点的生物（包括大多数灵堕魔）也会对银魂炸弹造成的心灵伤害具有等量的弱点。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This rare alchemical bomb gathers and concentrates the emotions that linger in a burial ground where generations of beloved ancestors have been interred, infusing that powerful emotional energy into the alchemically prepared powdered silver stored within the bomb. This energy glows with a soft, silver radiance and, if contained in a clear container, allows a silversoul bomb to be used as a torch to illuminate an area.</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls, and the bomb deals 2d4 mental damage, 1d6 persistent mental damage to nindorus, and 2 mental splash damage. A creature that takes splash damage from the bomb and fails a @Check[fortitude|dc:17] save is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round as glowing silver particles cling to its face.</p>\n<p>Nindorus are particularly harmed by silversoul bombs and take 1d6 persistent mental damage. Against nindorus, the bomb's item bonus also applies to its save DC to resist being resist being dazzled or blinded (@Check[fortitude|dc:18]). Creatures that have weakness to silver (including most nindorus) have an equal amount of weakness to the mental damage caused by a silversoul bomb, due to the silver infused into the energy within.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "商店 Shop"
        },
        "Hell Hound": {
          "name": "地狱犬 Hell Hound",
          "tokenName": "地狱犬 Hell Hound",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Hellfire Breath": {
              "name": "地狱火吐息 Hellfire Breath",
              "description": "<p>地狱犬喷吐烈焰，对一个@Template[cone|distance:15]内的所有生物造成 @Damage[4d6[fire]|options:area-damage] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:19|basic|options:area-effect] 豁免）。</p>\n<p>地狱犬在[[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Hellfire Breath]]{1d4轮}内无法再次使用“地狱火吐息”。如果地狱犬将要受到火焰伤害或成为火焰效果的目标，它的“地狱火吐息”会恢复可用。</p>\n<p>The hell hound breathes flames that deal @Damage[4d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:15] (@Check[reflex|dc:19|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>\n<p>The hell hound can't use Hellfire Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Hellfire Breath]]{1d4 rounds}. If the hell hound would take fire damage or be targeted by a fire effect, their Hellfire Breath recharges.</p>"
            },
            "Pack Attack": {
              "name": "集群攻击 Pack Attack",
              "description": "<p>地狱犬的打击对处于至少两名地狱犬盟友触及范围内的生物造成1d4点额外伤害。</p>\n<p>The hell hound's Strikes deal 1d4 extra damage to creatures within the reach of at least two of the hell hounds' allies.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>地狱犬的外貌足以打消任何关于其炼狱起源的疑虑——燃烧沥青般颜色的皮肉、如同任何恶魔的干草叉般锋利的牙齿，以及一层永不熄灭的地狱火裹身，都是其标志性特征。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>地狱犬是来自深坑的邪魔、异界犬类，能追猎猎物，并喷吐超自然的火焰喷流。它们性情暴躁，且很快就会表现出攻击性行为。</p>\n<p>A hell hound's appearance dismisses any doubts as to their infernal origins—flesh the color of burning pitch, teeth as sharp as any fiend's pitchfork, and a shroud of ever-burning hellfire are all trademark features.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Hell hounds are fiendish, extraplanar canines hailing from the Pit that can hunt down quarry and breathe supernatural gouts of flame. They are temperamental and quick to exhibit aggressive behavior.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "地狱犬 Hell Hound"
        },
        "Shinzo's Parting Gift": {
          "name": "神藏的临别赠礼 Shinzo's Parting Gift",
          "tokenName": "神藏的临别赋礼 Shinzo's Parting Gift",
          "items": {
            "Phoenix Fulu Holder": {
              "name": "凤凰符箓匣 Phoenix Fulu Holder",
              "description": "<p>这个优雅的木制框架装饰着大量蓬松的红色羽毛，摸上去几乎热得令人不适。<em>凤凰符箓匣</em>能为放入其框架中一段时间的任意符箓赋予某种“第二次生命”，同时也为符箓的使用者提供一种时髦且吸睛的方式来展示这件宝藏。你可以以一个交互动作将任意符箓放入<em>凤凰符箓匣</em>中。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> 交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> <em>凤凰符箓匣</em>中存放着一张11级或更低等级的符箓</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你从<em>凤凰符箓匣</em>中取出符箓，而在片刻之后，你取出的那张符箓的发光影像会在框架中显现。如果先前存放的符箓在接下来24小时内被消耗，凤凰符箓匣内闪烁的影像会变为一张实体且完全可用的该符箓复制品。这张复制符箓的运作方式与原符箓完全相同，但若未在其形成后24小时内被贴附，它就会褪去并消失。</p>\n<p>This elegant wooden frame is decorated with numerous downy red feathers that feel almost uncomfortably hot to the touch. A <em>phoenix fulu holder</em> grants a sort of second \"life\" to any fulu placed for a time within its frame, but also gives the fulu wielder a stylish and eye-catching way of displaying such a treasure. You can place any fulu into a <em>phoenix fulu holder</em> as an Interact action.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An 11th- or lower-level fulu is stored in the <em>phoenix fulu holder</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You take the fulu from the <em>phoenix fulu holder</em>, and an instant later, a glowing image of the fulu you removed manifests in the frame. If the previously stored fulu is consumed within the next 24 hours, the flickering image within the phoenix fulu holder becomes a solid and fully functional duplicate of that fulu. This duplicated fulu functions identically to the original fulu, but if not affixed within 24 hours of its formation, it fades away and vanishes.</p>"
            },
            "Anathema Fulu": {
              "name": "禁忌符箓 Anathema Fulu",
              "description": "<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 1小时</p><hr /><p>最初由天景的受天界之触的奈菲林用来削弱古魔（特征），禁忌符箓由四片组成，分别放置在四个基本方位各一片。启动符箓时，从下列特征中选择一种：天界、元素、精类、邪魔、监察者或不死。若具有该特征的生物在该区域内开始其回合，则必须通过一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:30] 豁免，否则直到其下个回合开始前变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。若大成功，该生物在1小时内对任何禁忌符箓暂时免疫。无论豁免结果如何，若你随后在该区域内对这类生物施放 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.bay4AfSu2iIozNNW]{放逐术}，则该生物承受该法术中所述的–2减值（相当于为该法术加入一项特殊代价：一件对该生物而言属于禁忌的物体）。该符箓视为那件物体；你无需额外加入它。若受此减值影响的生物针对<em>放逐术</em>掷骰进行豁免，施法者可以使用自由动作（）使结果降低一级。如此会将整张符箓烧尽，从而结束效果。若符箓的任何一片在启动后被移动或摧毁，效果结束。</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 hour</p><hr /><p>First used by celestial-touched nephilim of Tianjing to weaken qlippoth, an anathema fulu comes in four pieces, one placed in each cardinal direction. Choose one of the following traits when activating the fulus: celestial, elemental, fey, fiend, monitor, or undead. If a creature with that trait starts its turn in the area, it must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:30] saving throw or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} until the start of its next turn. On a critical success, the creature becomes temporarily immune to any anathema fulus for 1 hour. Regardless of the save result, if you subsequently cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.bay4AfSu2iIozNNW]{Banishment} on such a creature in the area, the creature takes the –2 penalty described in that spell for adding a special cost of an object that's anathema to that creature. The fulu acts as that object; you don't need to add it. If a creature affected by this penalty rolls a saving throw against <em>banishment</em>, the caster can use a free action to force the result one step lower. Doing so burns the whole fulu out, ending the effect. If any of the fulu's pieces are moved or destroyed after activation, the effect ends.</p>"
            },
            "Thousand-Pains Fulu (Needle)": {
              "name": "千痛符箓（针） Thousand-Pains Fulu (Needle)",
              "description": "<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 1分钟</p>\n<p>由一名为追求无尽生命而抛弃道德的外科医师创造，<em>千痛符箓</em>会阻断体内元素的自然流动。被贴上该符箓的生物必须进行一次@Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic]。失败或大失败会使目标为持续伤害做好准备；该持续伤害由某个必须在符箓持续时间内满足的特定状态所触发。</p>\n<p>拾起这张白色符箓时，你会感觉像是用针刺穿了手。符箓造成@Damage[7d6[piercing]]，因为头发、指甲与结缔组织向内刺入。若为失败或大失败，则当目标随后执行一个带有移动（特征）的动作时，它会受到@Damage[2d6[persistent,piercing]]。</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute</p>\n<p>Created by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a <em>thousand-pains fulu</em> blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic]. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.</p>\n<p>Picking up this white fulu feels like you've stabbed your hand with a pin. The fulu deals @Damage[7d6[piercing]] as hair, nails, and connective tissues stab inward. On a failure or critical failure, if the target then takes an action with the move trait, it takes @Damage[2d6[persistent,piercing]].</p>"
            },
            "Potency Crystal (Greater)": {
              "name": "潜能水晶（强效） Potency Crystal (Greater)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启用</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span>（专注）</p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你使用所附着的武器进行一次攻击，但你尚未掷骰</p><hr /><p>这块萤石水晶散发着奇异的磷光。当你启用这块水晶时，该武器在进行打击时以及直到本回合结束前，成为一把<em>+2强效强击武器</em>，使攻击掷骰获得+2物品加值，并将伤害提高为3个武器伤害骰。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{效果：潜能水晶}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You make an attack with the affixed weapon, but you haven't rolled yet</p><hr /><p>This fluorite crystal glows with a strange phosphorescence. When you activate the crystal, the weapon becomes a <em>+2 greater striking weapon</em> on the Strike and until the end of this turn, gaining a +2 item bonus to the attack roll and increasing the damage to three weapon damage dice.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.R5ugeFK3MPwkbv0s]{Effect: Potency Crystal}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "神藏的临别赠礼 Shinzo's Parting Gift"
        },
        "Mo Douqiu the Hedonist": {
          "name": "享乐主义者莫都求 Mo Douqiu the Hedonist",
          "tokenName": "享乐主义者莫都求 Mo Douqiu the Hedonist",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Drink Oil": {
              "name": "饮用油剂 Drink Oil",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 莫都求成为一次炼金炸弹打击的目标</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 莫都求知晓该攻击，且不会因此而处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 莫都求试图用嘴接住飞来的炸弹。他对抗触发攻击的AC获得+4环境加值。若该攻击未命中，他便用嘴接住炸弹，并无害地将其内容物喝下，回复等同于该炸弹物品等级的生命值。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Mo Douqiu is the target of an alchemical bomb Strike</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Mo Douqiu is aware of the attack and is not @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to it</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Mo Douqiu attempts to catch the flung bomb in his mouth. He gains a +4 circumstance bonus to his AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, he catches the bomb in his mouth and harmlessly drinks down its contents down, regaining Hit Points equal to the bomb's item level.</p>"
            },
            "Reactive Strike (Jaws Only)": {
              "name": "反应打击（仅颌） Reactive Strike (Jaws Only)",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>"
            },
            "Drop Corpse": {
              "name": "弃尸 Drop Corpse",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 一具悬挂的尸体位于莫都求的颚部打击触及范围内</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 莫都求咬住一具尸体所悬挂的绳索并将其咬断，使尸体落到正下方的方格中。该空间内的一名生物受到 @Damage[(1d6+3)[bludgeoning]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:15|basic] 豁免），且在失败或大成功或大失败时被击倒至 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A hanging corpse is within reach of Mo Douqiu's jaws Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Mo Douqiu chomps onto a rope dangling a dead body and bites through it, causing the body to fall to the ground in the square directly below. A creature in that space takes @Damage[(1d6+3)[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:15|basic] save), and is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} on a failure or critical failure.</p>"
            },
            "Extend Neck": {
              "name": "延伸颈部 Extend Neck",
              "description": "<p>辘轳首伸长自己的脖子，使其颚部打击的触及从10尺增加到20尺，直到其下个回合结束。</p>\n<p>The rokurokubi extends their neck, increasing the reach of their jaws Strike from 10 feet to 20 feet until the end of their next turn.</p>"
            },
            "Threatening Lunge": {
              "name": "威吓猛扑 Threatening Lunge",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 莫都求的脖子当前未伸长</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 莫都求的头在强击前会先凑近到距离其目标面部一英寸之内。他伸长脖子，尝试对20英尺内的一名对手进行一次[[/act demoralize]]，然后对该对手进行一次颚部打击。他的挫败士气检定是视觉而非听觉效果，且如果目标不理解他的语言，他也不会承受减值。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Mo Douqiu's neck is not currently extended</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Mo Douqiu's head comes within an inch of his target's face before striking. He Extends his Neck, attempts to [[/act demoralize]] one opponent within 20 feet, and then makes a jaws Strike against that opponent. His Demoralize check is a visual rather than auditory effect, and he doesn't take a penalty if the target doesn't understand his language.</p>"
            },
            "Alcohol Lore": {
              "name": "酒精学识 Alcohol Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>辘轳首往往源于凡人因某种恶行而遭诅咒而生；然而，承受诅咒的人常常并非犯下过错者本人，而是其子女或配偶。诅咒会在其睡眠时缓慢地将其转化为辘轳首。起初，他们的脖子会伸长，甚至彻底与身体分离，让头颅得以自由游荡，做些简单的恶作剧，比如吓唬邻居或动物。沉睡者也许会在次日清晨从一个朦胧的梦中醒来，梦见自己饮尽了附近灯笼里的灯油，却发现那些灯笼果然空了。</p>\n<p>随着时间推移，这些怪异行径会发展成愈发顽劣、甚至暴力的罪行。新生的辘轳首只有一段很短的时期仍可能通过解除诅咒而获救，但不久之后，他们就会被彻底吞没，从此再也无法入睡。</p>\n<p>大多数辘轳首对自身境况感到绝望，试图借酒消愁，或干脆躲避他人视线。少数邪恶的辘轳首则拥抱自己的命运，试图通过完全屈服于诅咒来增强力量。这会赋予他们施放强力秘法法术的能力，但也不可避免地将他们进一步扭向邪恶。</p>\n<p>Rokurokubi come into being when mortals are cursed for some misdeed, though often the one who bears the curse is not the one who committed the offense, but instead their child or spouse. The curse slowly transforms the individual into a rokurokubi as they sleep. At first, their neck extends, or even detaches altogether, to let their head roam freely and engage in simple mischief like scaring neighbors or animals. The sleeper may awaken the next morning from a hazy dream of drinking the oil from nearby lanterns, only to find them indeed empty.</p>\n<p>Over time, the bizarre acts progress to increasingly mischievous or even violent crimes. There's only a brief period during which the nascent rokurokubi might still be saved by dispelling the curse, but before long, they are fully consumed, never to sleep again.</p>\n<p>Most rokurokubi despair at their state, seeking to drown their sorrows in drink or simply stay out of sight. A nefarious few rokurokubi embrace their fate and seek to enhance their power by completely giving in to the curse. This grants them the ability to cast potent occult spells but inevitably twists them even more toward evil.</p>",
          "blurb": "辘轳首（男性变体）\nMale variant rokurokubi",
          "prototypeToken": "享乐主义者莫都求 Mo Douqiu the Hedonist"
        },
        "Yong Wu-Xiu": {
          "name": "雍武秀 Yong Wu-Xiu",
          "tokenName": "雍武秀 Yong Wu-Xiu",
          "blurb": "勤劳的狐妖女铁匠\nindustrious female kitsune blacksmith",
          "prototypeToken": "雍武秀 Yong Wu-Xiu"
