        "Ugly Cute's Thanks & Apology": {
          "name": "丑小乖的感谢与道歉 Ugly Cute's Thanks & Apology",
          "tokenName": "丑小乖的感谢与道歉 Ugly Cute's Thanks & Apology",
          "items": {
            "Ugly Cute's Gift": {
              "name": "丑小乖的赠礼 Ugly Cute's Gift",
              "description": "<p>这块从丑小乖甲壳上脱落的多刺石质碎片，戴在手上相当舒适。尽管比常见的护手稍显厚重，但它仍然作为一副<em>+1 带刺铁手套</em>来运作。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> 命令术，交互</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你汲取丑小乖潜藏的灵性能量，将强劲的力量灌注进这副铁手套。持续1分钟，<em>丑小乖的赠礼</em>获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{幽冥}符文的优势，并在成功的打击时额外造成2点力场伤害。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.6enQGnnlgGY6ZWgS]{效果：丑小乖的赠礼}</p>\n<p>This spiky, stony fragment shed from Ugly Cute's carapace fits quite comfortably over the hand. Though a little bulkier than the typical gauntlet, it still functions as a <em>+1 spiked gauntlet</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> command, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You draw upon Ugly Cute's latent spiritual energy to infuse the gauntlet with forceful power. For 1 minute, <em>Ugly Cute's gift</em> gains the advantages of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JQdwHECogcTzdd8R]{Ghost Touch} property rune and deals an additional 2 force damage on a successful Strike.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.6enQGnnlgGY6ZWgS]{Effect: Ugly Cute's Gift}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "丑小乖的感谢与道歉 Ugly Cute's Thanks & Apology"
        },
        "Living Rune (Occult)": {
          "name": "活体符文（灵术） Living Rune (Occult)",
          "tokenName": "活体符文 Living Rune",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Visions of Danger": {
              "name": "危险幻象 Visions of Danger",
              "description": "<p>由恐怖生物构成的幻觉充满法术的区域。这些生物看起来像你选择的具有特定外观的超小型成群怪物，例如地狱蝇群或会动的锯片。当爆发被创造时、任何生物进入爆发时，或在爆发内开始其回合时，爆发会对爆发内的每个生物造成8d8心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。意志豁免大成功的生物可以立即尝试识破该幻觉。尝试与这些怪物进行交互的生物，或以搜索动作观察其中一只的生物，也可以尝试识破该幻觉。识破该幻觉的生物此后不会再受到该幻觉造成的任何伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 心灵伤害增加1d8。</p>\n<p>An illusion of horrific creatures fills the spell's area. The creatures look like Tiny swarming monsters with a specific appearance of your choice, such as Hellish flies or animated saw blades. The burst deals 8d8 mental damage (basic Will save) to each creature that's inside the burst when it's created, enters the burst, or starts its turn inside the burst. A creature that critically succeeds at its will save can immediately attempt to disbelieve the illusion. A creature that tries to Interact with the monsters or observes one with a Seek action can attempt to disbelieve the illusion. Creatures that disbelieve the illusion take no damage from the illusion thereafter.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The mental damage increases by 1d8.</p>"
            },
            "Feeblemind": {
              "name": "弱智术 Feeblemind",
              "description": "<p>你会大幅削弱目标的心智能力。目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。该诅咒的效果只能通过移除诅咒或其他以诅咒为目标的效果来移除。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}，持续 1 轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 4}，持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 目标的智力被永久降低到低于动物的水平，并将其魅力、智力和感知调整值视为 -5。它失去所有需要心智能力的职业能力，包括所有施法能力。若目标是 PC，则其变为由 GM 控制的 NPC。</p>\n<p>You drastically reduce the target's mental faculties. The target must attempt a Will save. The effects of this curse can be removed only through remove curse or another effect that targets curses.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 4} with an unlimited duration.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's intellect is permanently reduced below that of an animal, and it treats its Charisma, Intelligence, and Wisdom modifiers as -5. It loses all class abilities that require mental faculties, including all spellcasting. If the target is a PC, they become an NPC under the GM's control.</p>"
            },
            "Phantasmal Calamity": {
              "name": "魅影灾祸 Phantasmal Calamity",
              "description": "<p>一幅末日般毁灭的幻象充斥区域内每个生物的心智。该幻象造成 11d6 心灵伤害（基础意志豁免）。在大失败时，该生物还必须在一次 @Check[reflex] 豁免中成功，否则会相信自己被困住了（卡在裂缝中、漂泊海上，或其他与其幻象相符的命运）。若其第二次豁免也失败，它还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} 状态，持续 1 分钟。它可以在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的意志豁免；若成功，它会识破该幻觉并从震慑（状态）中恢复。</p><hr /><p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 伤害提高 2d6。</p>\n<p>A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a @Check[reflex] save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned} for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it disbelieves the illusion and recovers from the stunned condition.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
            },
            "True Seeing (Constant)": {
              "name": "真视术（恒定） True Seeing (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你能看清60尺内的事物真实模样。GM会对区域内任何幻觉或变化效果进行一次秘密的反制检定，但仅用于判断你是否能看穿它（例如，若该检定成功对抗一个变形法术，你可以看见该生物的真实形态，但你不会终止该变形法术）。</p>\n<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion or transmutation in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>"
            },
            "Vibrant Pattern": {
              "name": "绚丽图纹 Vibrant Pattern",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一片光之图样，随强度脉动。在图样内部的生物处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{目眩} 状态。此外，若生物在你施放时位于图样内、进入图样、在图样内结束其回合，或对图样使用一次搜索或交互动作，则必须进行一次意志豁免骰。当前已被该图样造成 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{目盲（状态）} 的生物不需要再进行新的豁免骰。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物被图样造成目盲（状态）。若其离开图样，则可在其每个回合结束时尝试一次新的豁免以从目盲（状态）中恢复，持续时间至多为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 该生物目盲（状态）1分钟。</p>\n<p>You create a pattern of lights that pulses with intensity. Creatures are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} while inside the pattern. In addition, a creature must attempt a Will saving throw if it's inside the pattern when you cast it, enters the pattern, ends its turn within the pattern, or uses a Seek or Interact action on the pattern. A creature currently @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} by the pattern doesn't need to attempt new saving throws.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Blinded by the pattern. If it exits the pattern, it can attempt a new save to recover from the Blinded condition at the end of each of its turns, to a maximum duration of 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Blinded for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Crushing Despair": {
              "name": "极度绝望 Crushing Despair",
              "description": "<p>你使区域内的生物陷入绝望。每个生物的效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续1轮，该生物无法使用反应动作，并且必须在其回合开始时再尝试一次豁免；若失败，则其在该回合中因无法控制地啜泣而成为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 如成功，但持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 如失败，且该生物在1分钟内自动成为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为60尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Synesthesia": {
              "name": "联觉 Synesthesia",
              "description": "<p>目标的感官突然以意想不到的方式被重新接线，导致其将噪音处理为色彩爆发、将气味处理为声音，诸如此类。这会产生三个效果，且目标必须尝试一次意志豁免。由于分心，目标每次使用带有专注的动作时都必须在一次 @Check[flat|dc:5] 中成功，否则该动作失败并被浪费。目标难以处理视觉输入，使所有生物与物体对其而言均为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{隐蔽}。该生物移动困难，使其获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 3}，并使其各项速度承受–10英尺的状态减值。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标受到影响，持续1轮。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标受到影响，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 同失败，并且目标在试图处理感官的转变时成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（9环）</strong> 你最多可以以五个生物为目标。</p>\n<p>The target's senses are suddenly rewired in unexpected ways, causing them to process noises as bursts of color, smells as sounds, and so on. This has three effects, and the target must attempt a Will save. Due to the distraction, the target must succeed at a @Check[flat|dc:5] each time it uses a concentrate action, or the action fails and is wasted. The target's difficulty processing visual input makes all creatures and objects @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} from it. The creature has trouble moving, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 3} and giving it a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is affected for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is affected for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2} as it attempts to process the sensory shifts.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"
            },
            "Glyph of Warding (At Will)": {
              "name": "守卫刻文（随意） Glyph of Warding (At Will)",
              "description": "<p>你通过将一个敌对法术束缚进符文来制作一个陷阱。施放本法术时，你还要施放一个更低法术环阶的法术以储存在符文中。被储存的法术必须施放所需不超过3个动作，具有敌对效果，并以一个生物为目标或具有一个区域。你可以为符文设定一个口令、一个触发条件，或两者皆有。任何生物只要移动、打开或触碰目标容器，或进入目标区域，若其未说出口令或其行为符合触发条件，就会启动符文，释放其中的有害法术。</p>\n<p>一旦有法术被储存在符文中，该符文获得该法术的所有特征。若被储存的法术以一个或多个生物为目标，它将以触发符文的生物为目标。若该法术具有区域，则该区域以触发符文的生物为中心。守卫符文的持续时间在符文被触发时结束。该符文视为一个魔法陷阱：用于察觉检定以发现它，以及用于解除它的盗窃检定，两者均使用你的法术DC；这两项检定都要求尝试者受训，才能成功。</p>\n<p>你可以解消守卫符文。你在同一时间能维持生效的守卫符文最大数量等于你的施法能力调整值。</p>\n<p>You craft a trap by binding a hostile spell into a symbol. While Casting this Spell, you also Cast a Spell of a lower spell rank to store in the glyph. The stored spell must take 3 actions or fewer to cast, have a hostile effect, and target one creature or have an area. You can set a password, a trigger, or both for the glyph. Any creature that moves, opens, or touches the target container or enters the target area that doesn't speak the password or that matches the trigger activates the glyph, releasing the harmful spell within.</p>\n<p>Once a spell is stored in the glyph, the glyph gains all the traits of that spell. If the stored spell targets one or more creatures, it targets the creature that set off the glyph. If it has an area, that area is centered on the creature that set off the glyph. Glyph of warding's duration ends when the glyph is triggered. The glyph counts as a magical trap, using your spell DC for both the Perception check to notice it and the Thievery check to disable it; both checks require the creature attempting them to be trained in order to succeed.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss glyph of warding. The maximum number of glyphs of warding you can have active at a time is equal to your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>"
            },
            "Detect Magic": {
              "name": "侦测魔法 Detect Magic",
              "description": "<p>你放出一道脉冲，用以登记周围是否存在魔法。除魔法是否存在之外，你不会获得任何信息。你可以选择忽略你已完全知晓的魔法，例如你和盟友身上的魔法物品以及持续中的法术。</p>\n<p>只有当幻术魔法的效果等级低于你的侦测魔法法术的环阶时，你才能侦测到幻术魔法。不过，具有幻术灵光但外观并不具欺骗性的物品（例如隐形药水）通常仍会被正常侦测到。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（第3阶）</strong>你会得知该法术在射程内所侦测到的最高等级效果的魔法学派。若有多个效果同样强大，则由GM决定你得知哪一个。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（第4阶）</strong>同第3阶，但你还会精确锁定最高等级魔法的来源。与模糊感官类似，你不会得知确切位置，但你可以将来源缩小至一个5英尺立方体范围内（若来源大于此范围，则为最接近的那个立方体）。</p>\n<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the rank of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"
            },
            "Electrical Blast": {
              "name": "电击冲击波 Electrical Blast"
            },
            "Truescript": {
              "name": "真言文字 Truescript",
              "description": "<p>活体符文无法说话，但它可以将自身形态塑造成复杂的文字与象形图，任何具有阅读书面语言能力的生物都能理解。活体符文也能理解任何书面或口头语言。</p>\n<p>A living rune can't speak, but it can sculpt its form into complicated scripts and pictographs that can be understood by any creature with the ability to read written language. A living rune can also understand any written or spoken language.</p>"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "持续法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Backdrop": {
              "name": "背景 Backdrop",
              "description": "<p>当一名生物试图对活化符文进行打击并大失败时，攻击者会击中活化符文后方的表面（画布、墙壁或类似物）。在GM裁量下，这可能会对该表面或攻击者的武器造成伤害。</p>\n<p>When a creature attempts to Strike a living rune and critically misses, the attacker hits the surface (a canvas, wall, or so on) behind the living rune. This might damage the surface or the attacker's weapon, at the GM's discretion.</p>"
            },
            "Surface-Bound": {
              "name": "缚于地表者 Surface-Bound",
              "description": "<p>活化符文只能沿着平坦表面移动。如果它所在的表面被摧毁（例如一幅肖像被@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.sxQZ6yqTn0czJxVd]{火球术}法术击中，或一面墙被砸碎），符文受到@Damage[7d6[untyped]]伤害，并被转移到最近的平坦表面上。如果在5英尺内没有平坦表面，符文被摧毁。</p>\n<p>A living rune can move only along flat surfaces. If the surface it's on is destroyed (such as a portrait hit by a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.sxQZ6yqTn0czJxVd]{Fireball} spell or a wall being smashed), the rune takes @Damage[7d6[untyped]] damage and is shunted to the nearest flat surface. If there is no flat surface within 5 feet, the rune is destroyed.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>现存最著名的活体符文，莫过于古代瑟西隆的符文领主们所创造的那些；随着瑟西隆在现代纪元的重建，它们也再度兴起。然而，其他活体符文也能被发现，每一种都拥有各自独特的能力。活体符文也可以被制造出来，使其打击能够造成不同类型的能量伤害。</p>\n<p>这些符文由不明之手制作，且常被遗留在偏僻之处。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>魔法本就复杂，而当其精妙程度达到某一等级时，法术与自主生物之间的差异便愈发模糊。活体符号是由具象化并被强化的魔法构筑而成的生物，由雕文、符文与玄奥的公式将其维系在一起。</p>\n<p>The most famous living runes are those of the ancient Runelords of Thassilon, resurging as Thassilon rebuilds in the modern era. Other living runes can be found, however, each with its own particular abilities. Living runes can also be crafted to deal different types of energy damage with their Strikes.</p>\n<p>These runes are crafted by unknown hands and often left in out-of-the-way places.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Magic is a complex thing to begin with, and at a certain level of sophistication, the differences between a spell and an autonomous creature become increasingly blurry. Living symbols are constructed creatures of reified and reinforced magic, held together by glyphs, runes, and eldritch formulae.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "活符文 Living Rune"
        },
        "Corpse Sugi": {
          "name": "尸杉 Corpse Sugi",
          "tokenName": "尸根 Corpseroot",
          "items": {
            "Branch": {
              "name": "分支 Branch"
            },
            "Root": {
              "name": "根系 Root"
            },
            "Rotten Fruit": {
              "name": "腐烂的水果 Rotten Fruit"
            },
            "Sugi Tree": {
              "name": "苏吉树 Sugi Tree",
              "description": "<p>当它没有处于危险之中时，尸杉会花费 1 分钟扎根于大地，使自己固定在原地。只要尸杉已扎根且无法移动，生物就必须主动进行 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{搜索} 并在一次 @Check[perception|dc:38] 察觉检定中成功，才能侦测出尸杉的真实本质。</p>\n<p>When it isn't in danger, the corpse sugi spends 1 minute rooting to the earth, becoming planted in place. While the corpse sugi is planted and immobile, creatures must actively @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} and succeed at a @Check[perception|dc:38] Check to detect the Corpse Sugi's true nature.</p>"
            },
            "Axe Vulnerability": {
              "name": "斧类易伤 Axe Vulnerability",
              "description": "<p>尸体杉树精会因斧类武器而额外受到10点伤害。</p>\n<p>The corpse sugi takes 10 additional damage from axes.</p>"
            },
            "Thoughtblight": {
              "name": "思枯病 Thoughtblight",
              "description": "<p>30英尺。任何进入尸骸栎光环内或在光环内开始其回合的、非灵堕魔的有感知活体生物，其心智会被残酷与痛苦的侵入性念头所侵扰，并且必须成功进行一次 @Check[will|dc:29] 意志豁免，否则会陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（若大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 2}）。该状态在生物离开光环后仍持续1分钟。成功通过该豁免的生物会对思维疫病暂时免疫1分钟。</p>\n<p>30 feet. The mind of a non-nindoru sapient living creature that enters or starts their turn in the corpse sugi's aura becomes infested with invasive thoughts of cruelty and anguish, and must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure). This condition persists for 1 minute after the creature leaves the aura. A creature that succeeds on the saving throw is temporarily immune to thoughtblight for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Take Root": {
              "name": "扎根 Take Root",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮一次</p>\n<p><strong>需求</strong> 尸杉使一名生物处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 尸杉将其根系深埋入该生物体内，造成 @Damage[(1d6+13)[piercing]] 伤害，并汲取目标的生命力（@Check[fortitude|dc:32|basic] 豁免）。在一次失败时，该生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}（若已处于 drained，则将其数值提高 1），且尸杉恢复 10 HP。若这会使一名生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 5}，则该生物死亡。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The corpse sugi has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The corpse sugi buries its roots into the creature, dealing @Damage[(1d6+13)[piercing]] damage and draining the target's life force (@Check[fortitude|dc:32|basic] save). On a failure, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (or increases the value by 1 if already drained), and the corpse sugi regains 10 HP. If this would make a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 5}, the creature dies.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>尸根树是腐烂的不死树木，会结出鲜红的剧毒果实，并将枯萎病扩散到周围植物上，把健康的树转化为新的尸根树。这些狡猾的杀手通过其根系从生物身上汲取生命力，伪装成枯死的树木，直到受害者进入触及范围。</p>\n<p>尸根树最常见于因超自然枯萎病而死的树木腐朽残壳，因此在獠木林与菲尔安尼森林中是常见威胁。最强大的尸根树来自被用作神龛与献祭祭坛的古树，其根系吸收了在枝桠下被宣判之人的鲜血、血肉与恐惧。其中一些古老的尸根树仍能获得那些无意间创造它们的教团的敬畏与虔信。</p>\n<p>Corpseroots are rotten, undead trees that grow bright-red poisonous fruit and spread blight to surrounding plants, transforming healthy trees into new corpseroots. These cunning killers drain the life from creatures through their root systems, posing as dead trees until their victims come within reach.</p>\n<p>Corpseroots most commonly form from rotten husks of trees that died from supernatural blights, making them common threats in the Fangwood and Fierani forests. The most powerful are ancient trees used as shrines and sacrificial altars, their roots absorbing the blood, flesh, and terror of those condemned under their boughs. Some of these ancient corpseroots still command the respect and devotion of the cults that inadvertently created them.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体：尸根\nVariant corpseroot",
          "hp": "void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "尸根 Corpseroot"
        },
        "Vitumniar": {
          "name": "维图姆尼亚尔 Vitumniar",
          "tokenName": "维图姆尼亚尔 Vitumniar",
          "blurb": "脾气暴躁的男性纳迦吉制革匠\ncantankerous male nagaji tanner",
          "prototypeToken": "维图姆尼亚尔 Vitumniar"
        },
        "Treasury": {
          "name": "宝库 Treasury",
          "tokenName": "金库 Treasury",
          "items": {
            "Collection of Silver Ingots, Ivory, and Silk": {
              "name": "一批银锭、象牙与丝绸的收藏 Collection of Silver Ingots, Ivory, and Silk"
            },
            "Fire-Jump Ring": {
              "name": "火焰跳跃戒指 Fire-Jump Ring",
              "description": "<p>这枚黑色金属戒指镶嵌着红宝石，红宝石偶尔会逸出缕缕烟雾。它给予你运动检定+2物品加值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动—火焰跳跃</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（专注，操作，传送）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 你行走（或掘地或飞行，若你拥有对应的速度）进入任何足以容纳你的火焰之中，包括魔法火焰。你消失在火焰里，并且不会受到其伤害。你可以感知到你消失位置100尺内所有足够大的火焰，并从其中任意一处火焰中重新出现，出现在火焰内部或其相邻格。若你在火焰中结束移动，则该火焰如常影响你。</p>\n<p>This black, metal ring is inset with rubies that occasionally give off wisps of smoke. It grants you a +2 item bonus to Athletics checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Fire Jump</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate, manipulate, teleportation)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You Stride (or Burrow or Fly, if you have the corresponding Speed) into any fire large enough to contain you, including magical fires. You vanish into the fire and take no damage from it. You can sense all sufficiently large fires within 100 feet of where you vanish, and you reemerge from any of those fires, either within the fire or adjacent to it. If you end your movement in the fire, it affects you as normal.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "金库 Treasury"
        },
        "Akashti": {
          "name": "恪尸魔 Akashti",
          "tokenName": "恪尸魔 Akashti",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Crushing Despair": {
              "name": "极度绝望 Crushing Despair",
              "description": "<p>你对区域内的生物施加绝望。每个生物的效果由其意志豁免决定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 持续1轮，该生物不能使用反应动作（），并且必须在其回合开始时再尝试一次豁免；若失败，则在该回合中因无法控制地抽泣而处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 同成功，但持续时间为1分钟。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，且该生物在1分钟内自动处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（7环）</strong> 区域增加为一个60尺锥形。</p>\n<p>You inflict despair on creatures in the area. The effects for each creature are determined by its Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the creature can't use reactions and must attempt another save at the start of its turn; on a failure, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for that turn as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is automatically @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The area increases to a 60-foot cone.</p>"
            },
            "Glibness": {
              "name": "花言巧语 Glibness",
              "description": "<p>虚言从你唇间滑出，如丝绸般顺畅。你在进行用于说谎的欺瞒检定，以及对抗用于辨别你是否在说真话的察觉检定时，获得+4状态加值，并且即使你未受训也要加上你的等级。若你谎言的不可信导致环境减值或DC提高，则将该减值或提高量减半。</p>\n<p>Falsehoods pass your lips as smoothly as silk. You gain a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to Lie and against Perception checks to discern if you are telling the truth, and you add your level even if you're untrained. If the implausibility of your lies prompts a circumstance penalty or a DC increase, reduce that penalty or increase by half.</p>"
            },
            "Talking Corpse": {
              "name": "死者交谈 Talking Corpse",
              "description": "<p>你赋予目标尸体一丝生命的表象，使其开口回答你向它提出的三个问题。该法术调用的是肉体潜藏的记忆，而非将死者的魂魄召回，因此尸体必须基本完整该法术才能生效。尸体所受的伤害越多，它的回答就越不准确、越支离破碎；并且它必须有喉咙与嘴才能开口说话。若在过去一周内有人曾对该尸体施放过此法术，则该法术自动失败。尸体可以使用其死亡时原本生物的数据尝试进行一次意志豁免，以抗拒回答问题，结果如下。</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标可以说谎或拒绝回答你的问题，并且目标的魂魄将作祟你24小时，纠缠你，使你在这段时间内无法获得任何休息。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标可以提供虚假信息或拒绝回答你的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标必须如实作答，但它的回答可以简短、晦涩且重复。它仍可以误导你，或试图拖延，使法术的持续时间在你问完所有问题之前耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标的回答更直接且较少重复，不过仍然晦涩。它在进行欺瞒检定以欺骗或误导你时承受-2状态减值。</p>\n<p>You grant the target corpse a semblance of life, which it uses to speak the answers to three questions posed to it. This spell calls on the physical body's latent memories rather than summoning back the deceased's spirit, so the corpse must be mostly intact for the spell to function. The more damage the corpse has taken, the more inaccurate or patchwork its answers are, and it must have a throat and mouth to speak at all. If anyone has previously cast this spell on the corpse in the last week, the spell automatically fails. The corpse can attempt a Will save to resist answering the questions using the statistics of the original creature at its time of death, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target can lie or refuse to answer your questions, and the target's spirit haunts you for 24 hours, bothering you and causing you to be unable to gain any rest for that time.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can provide false information or refuse to answer your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target must answer truthfully, but its answers can be brief, cryptic, and repetitive. It can still mislead you or attempt to stall so that the spell's duration runs out before you can ask all your questions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target's answers are more direct and less repetitive, though still cryptic. It takes a -2 status penalty to Deception checks to deceive or mislead you.</p>"
            },
            "Illusory Creature": {
              "name": "幻象生物 Illusory Creature",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个大型或更小的生物的幻象影像。它会产生相应的声音与气味，并且触感也足以令人信服。若你与该影像之间的距离曾经超过500尺，法术结束。</p>\n<p>该影像不能说话，但你可以用你的动作通过该生物说话，而法术会将你的声音适当地伪装。你可能需要进行一次欺瞒或表演检定来模仿该生物，由GM决定。若你试图模仿某个特定人物并与认识那个人的人互动，这尤其可能发生。</p>\n<p>在战斗中，该幻象每回合可使用2个动作，你在维持该法术时它便使用这些动作。它的攻击检定使用你的法术攻击调整；它的AC使用你的法术DC。它的豁免调整值等于你的法术DC – 10。它足够有实体感，因此可以与其他生物夹击。若该影像被一次攻击命中或一次豁免失败，法术结束。</p>\n<p>该幻象可以通过让目标相信幻象的攻击是真实的来造成伤害，但除此之外无法直接影响物理世界。若该幻象生物以一次打击命中，目标受到@Damage[3d4[mental]]伤害。该幻象的打击为非致命。若伤害与怪物的影像不相符——例如，一个大型的幻象巨龙只造成5点伤害——GM可能允许目标立即尝试一次察觉检定以识破该法术。若目标认为相关的抗力与弱点适用，则如GM裁定般适用。例如，若该幻象挥舞战锤并攻击一名对钝击伤害有抗力的生物，该生物将承受更少的心灵伤害。然而，幻象伤害不会使再生失效，也不会触发其他需要特定伤害类型的效果。GM应记录该幻象造成的幻象伤害。</p>\n<p>任何接触该影像的生物，或使用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}动作来检查它的生物，都可以尝试识破你的幻象。当一名生物识破该幻象时，它从先前因该幻象受到的伤害中恢复一半（若有），并且不再受到其进一步的伤害。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+1）</strong> 该影像打击的伤害提高1d4，且你能创造的生物的最大体型提高一级（最大至超巨型）。</p>\n<p>You create an illusory image of a Large or smaller creature. It generates the appropriate sounds, smells, and feels believable to the touch. If you and the image are ever farther than 500 feet apart, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The image can't speak, but you can use your actions to speak through the creature, with the spell disguising your voice as appropriate. You might need to attempt a Deception or Performance check to mimic the creature, as determined by the GM. This is especially likely if you're trying to imitate a specific person and engage with someone that person knows.</p>\n<p>In combat, the illusion can use 2 actions per turn, which it uses when you Sustain the spell. It uses your spell attack modifier for attack rolls and your spell DC for its AC. Its saving throw modifiers are equal to your spell DC – 10. It is substantial enough that it can flank other creatures. If the image is hit by an attack or fails a save, the spell ends.</p>\n<p>The illusion can cause damage by making the target believe the illusion's attacks are real, but it cannot otherwise directly affect the physical world. If the illusory creature hits with a Strike, the target takes @Damage[3d4[mental]] damage. The illusion's Strikes are nonlethal. If the damage doesn't correspond to the image of the monster—for example, if an illusory Large dragon deals only 5 damage—the GM might allow the target to attempt an immediate Perception check to disbelieve the spell. Any relevant resistances and weaknesses apply if the target thinks they do, as judged by the GM. For example, if the illusion wields a warhammer and attacks a creature resistant to bludgeoning damage, the creature would take less mental damage. However, illusory damage does not deactivate regeneration or trigger other effects that require a certain damage type. The GM should track illusory damage dealt by the illusion.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the image or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion. When a creature disbelieves the illusion, it recovers from half the damage it had taken from it (if any) and doesn't take any further damage from it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage of the image's Strikes increases by 1d4, and the maximum size of creature you can create increases by one (to a maximum of Gargantuan).</p>"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你侵入目标的心智，以一次心灵冲击使其恍惚。该冲击造成1d6心灵伤害，进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，它还会获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（+2）</strong> 伤害增加1d6。</p>\n<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造出一种简单声音的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四名普通人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可辨识的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>增幅（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60尺。</p>\n<p><strong>增幅（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Item Facade": {
              "name": "伪装物件 Item Facade",
              "description": "<p>你使目标物体在外观与触感上看起来仿佛处于好得多或糟得多的物理状况。当你施放该法术时，决定你要让该物体看起来破败不堪还是完美无瑕。被弄得看起来破败的物品会显得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{破损}且粗制滥造。原本完好的物品若被弄得看起来更好，会显得仿佛崭新且高度抛光，或保养得当。破损物品则会显得完好且可正常使用。被摧毁的物品不受该法术影响。与该物品进行交互的生物可以尝试识破该幻觉。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（2环）</strong>持续时间为24小时。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong>持续时间为无限。</p>\n<p>You make the target object look and feel as though it were in much better or worse physical condition. When you cast this spell, decide whether you want to make the object look decrepit or perfect. An item made to look decrepit appears @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} and shoddy. An intact item made to look better appears as though it's brand new and highly polished or well maintained. A Broken item appears to be intact and functional. Destroyed items can't be affected by this spell. A creature that Interacts with the item can attempt to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration is 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The duration is unlimited.</p>"
            },
            "Message": {
              "name": "传讯术 Message",
              "description": "<p>你轻声做出口型，但这些话并不会从你口中发出，而是直接传到目标的耳中。其他人听到你的话不会比你平时做口型时更清楚，但目标能像站在你身旁一样听见你的话。目标可以以反应动作（）给出简短回应，或者如果他们愿意，也可以在其下一回合以自由动作（）回应，但他们必须能看见你且处于射程内才能这么做。若他们回应，他们的回应会像最初的传讯术一样，直接传到你的耳中。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（3环）</strong> 该法术的射程增加至500英尺。</p>\n<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Phantom Pain": {
              "name": "幻痛术 Phantom Pain",
              "description": "<p>幻觉般的痛楚折磨着目标，造成2d4点心灵伤害以及@Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]伤害。目标必须进行一次意志豁免。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功</strong> 目标不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害但不承受持续性伤害，且该法术立即结束。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 目标承受全部初始伤害与持续性伤害，并且目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。若目标从恶心中恢复，持续性伤害结束且该法术结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，但目标获得@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+1）</strong> 伤害增加2d4点，持续性伤害增加1d4点。</p>\n<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Soul Shred": {
              "name": "灵魂撕裂 Soul Shred",
              "description": "<p>被恪尸魔杀死的生物很难被复活或作为不死被唤起。恪尸魔会自动尝试反制任何试图复活或将其杀死的任何生物唤起为不死的行为（反制调整值 [[/r 1d20+19 #Counteract]]{+19}，反制等级 5）。如果杀死该生物的恪尸魔被杀死，该生物便可正常从死亡中被带回或变为不死。</p>\n<p>Creatures killed by an akashti are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The akashti automatically attempts to counteract any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+19 #Counteract]]{+19}, counteract rank 5). If the akashti who slew the creature is slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally.</p>"
            },
            "Manifest Body": {
              "name": "具现身躯 Manifest Body",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 恪尸魔在10分钟的专注期间，使一具空心的人形躯体在其纤细的骷髅骨架外显现成形。若这段时间是在距离一具死亡未满一周的人形生物尸体10尺内度过，则恪尸魔显现出的躯体外观与该死去的人形生物生前完全一致，并作为该生物的乔装。若恪尸魔能吞食其所复制的尸体的一部分，则其以该生物为对象进行乔装的欺瞒检定获得+4环境加值。穿戴显现出的躯体期间，恪尸魔失去其爪打击，且其声音听起来与死去的生物相同；它不具备死者的任何记忆或技能，必须依靠欺瞒在遭受审视时继续维持伪装。若恪尸魔不每日一次花费10分钟维持这层虚假血肉的显现，其显现出的躯体会迅速腐坏。该躯体有10点生命值，且防御与恪尸魔相同。当该躯体被摧毁时，恪尸魔会毫发无伤地现身，而留下的血肉外壳会散作一团红色蝴蝶的云雾，并迅速消散为红色薄雾。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The akashti manifests a hollow humanoid body around its slender skeletal frame over the course of 10 minutes of concentration. If this time is spent within 10 feet of a humanoid body that has been dead for less than a week, the akashti's manifested body looks identical to that of the dead humanoid when they lived and functions as a disguise of that creature. If the akashti can consume a portion of the body it's duplicating, it gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Deception checks to Impersonate the creature. While wearing a manifested body, the akashti loses its claw Strike, and its voice sounds like that of the dead creature; it doesn't possess any of the dead creature's memories or skills and must rely on deception to continue the charade in the face of scrutiny. An akashti's manifested body decays swiftly if it doesn't take 10 minutes once per day to maintain the manifestation of the false flesh. The body has 10 Hit Points and the same defenses as the akashti. When the body is destroyed, the akashti emerges unharmed and the fleshy shell left behind scatters into a cloud of red butterflies that swiftly fade into red mist.</p>"
            },
            "Stunning Despair": {
              "name": "震慑绝望 Stunning Despair",
              "description": "<p>恪尸魔释放出压倒性的绝望啜泣。30英尺内的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:29] 豁免，否则将变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}（大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 3}）。恪尸魔在 [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4 轮}内无法再次使用震慑绝望。</p>\n<p>The akashti unleashes overwhelming sobs of despair. Creatures within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:29] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 3} on a critical failure). The akashti can't use Stunning Despair again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Stunning Despair]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>恪尸魔是善于操纵的邪魔，专以哀悼之人为食；它们会化作最近去世的挚爱之人，以便潜入家中，随后杀害并吞噬悲痛家庭成员的转世的灵魂。有时它们也被称为“复制尸”，而恪尸魔在其真实形态下看起来像一具披着皮肤的骷髅（特征），手指上长着尖锐的利爪，无眼睑的双眼淌下血泪。它的头骨像碗一样敞开，里面栖着一把把猩红色的蝴蝶。当恪尸魔躲藏在其显现的躯体之内时，细致调查有时能揭露真相：那名“起死回生”的挚爱者的头皮会微微起伏鼓动，仿佛其中的蝴蝶正在扭动翻滚。恪尸魔体现了悲伤这一复杂循环。</p>\n<h2>额外学识已死的入侵者</h2>\n<p>有时，恪尸魔伏击并杀害目标，并非为了沉浸在其亲友的悲痛之中，而是为了冒充其形貌，从内部渗透某个组织，腐化既有的同袍情谊纽带。然而终究，这些恪尸魔会对欺骗感到厌倦，并将它们的新盟友引入陷阱，屠戮殆尽。</p>\n<p>Akashtis are manipulative fiends who prey on those in mourning; they assume the form of a recently deceased loved one so they can infiltrate homes, then murder and consume the souls of grieving families. Sometimes called a \"copycorpse,\" an akashti in its true form appears as a skin-covered skeleton with sharp talons on its fingers and tears of blood dripping from its lidless eyes. Its skull appears open like a bowl, and inside nest handfuls of crimson butterflies. When an akashti hides within its manifested body, close investigation can sometimes reveal the truth when the scalp of the supposed beloved one returned to life seems to subtly ripple and bulge as the butterflies within writhe. Akashtis embody the complex cycle of grief.</p>\n<h2>Deathly Invaders</h2>\n<p>Sometimes, akashtis ambush and murder targets not to bask in the grief of their loved ones, but instead to assume their form and infiltrate an organization from within to corrupt established bonds of camaraderie. Inevitably, though, these akashtis grow bored with deception and lead their new allies into a trap for slaughter.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "恪尸魔 Akashti"
        },
        "Grasping Currents": {
          "name": "攫握激流 Grasping Currents",
          "tokenName": "攫握水流 Grasping Currents",
          "items": {
            "Ghostly Grasp": {
              "name": "幽灵之握 Ghostly Grasp",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 一名生物试图通过游泳或载具操作一艘船来穿越湖泊</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 幽魂般的手臂伸上来抓住并紧紧攫住该生物或船只，使触发此次作祟的运动或载具操作检定承受–2减值。随后，此作祟掷先攻。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts to cross the lake by swimming or piloting a boat</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Ghostly arms reach up to grab and clutch at the creature or the boat, causing a –2 penalty to the Athletics or Piloting check that triggered the haunt. The haunt then rolls initiative.</p>"
            }
          },
          "disable": "<p>@Check[宗教|dc:23] 以安抚水中不安的魂魄一小时，或点亮<em>长明灯</em>（自动解除该作祟）</p>\n<p>@Check[religion|dc:23] to calm the unquiet spirits in the waters for an hour, or light the <em>Eternal Lantern</em> (automatically disables the haunt)</p>",
          "hazarddescription": "<p>一群溺死的魂魄试图把某人拉进水里，让对方加入他们。</p>\n<p>A swath of drowned spirits tries to pull someone down into the water to join them.</p>",
          "reset": "<p>攫握的水流会迅速积聚力量，并且在经过10分钟后可以再次触发。</p>\n<p>The grasping currents quickly build up power and can trigger again after 10 minutes have passed.</p>",
          "routine": "<p>（1动作）在其先攻轮到时，攫握水流会尝试用@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{擒拿}来对付一名正在游泳的生物，或尝试用一次运动检定以[[/r 1d20+12 #Athletics]]{+12}调整值来使一艘划艇倾覆。被攫握水流@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}的生物会被拖到水下，并有溺水风险。要使一艘划艇倾覆，将该作祟的运动检定结果与驾驶员的运动或航海学识DC对抗，取更高者。</p>\n<p>(1 action) On its initiative, the grasping currents attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{Grapple} a swimming creature or capsize a rowboat by attempting an Athletics check with a [[/r 1d20+12 #Athletics]]{+12} modifier. A creature that's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} by the grasping currents is pulled underwater and risks drowning. To capsize a rowboat, the haunt's Athletics check is rolled against the pilot's Athletics or Sailing Lore DC, whichever is higher.</p>",
          "stealthdetails": "<p>（受训）注意到水下水流中一道怪异、微微发光的涟漪。</p>\n<p>(trained) to notice a weird, faintly glowing ripple of the current beneath the water.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "攫握水流 Grasping Currents"
        },
