        "Phantom Raven": {
          "name": "魅影渡鸦 Phantom Raven",
          "tokenName": "魅影渡鸦 Phantom Raven",
          "items": {
            "Occult Innate Spells": {
              "name": "异能内在法术 Occult Innate Spells"
            },
            "Daze": {
              "name": "晕眩术 Daze",
              "description": "<p>你使目标的思维陷入迷雾，并以一次心灵冲击使其昏沉。该冲击造成等同于你施法能力调整值的心灵伤害；目标必须进行一次基础意志豁免。若目标在豁免中大失败，则其还会获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（+2）</strong> 伤害提高 1d6。</p>\n<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
            },
            "Ghost Sound": {
              "name": "幻音术 Ghost Sound",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个由简单声音构成的听觉幻象，其最大音量相当于四名普通人同时喊叫。声音从你在射程内指定的一个方格中发出。你无法创造可理解的词语或其他复杂的声音（例如音乐）。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（3环）</strong> 射程增加至60英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>升阶（5环）</strong> 射程增加至120英尺。</p>\n<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Beak": {
              "name": "喙 Beak"
            },
            "Walk the Ethereal Line": {
              "name": "游于两界 Walk the Ethereal Line",
              "description": "<p>该魅影在灵界与物质位面之间行走于细微的界线之上，从而得以同时存在于两个位面。</p>\n<p>他们也可以再次使用该能力，转而仅回到灵界。</p>\n<p>The phantom walks the thin line between the Ethereal and Material Planes in order to exist on both planes simultaneously.</p>\n<p>They can shift back to solely the Ethereal Plane by using this ability again.</p>"
            },
            "Susceptible to Death": {
              "name": "易于死亡 Susceptible to Death",
              "description": "<p>尽管魅影并非活物，但它们也不是不死，并且会特别容易受到死亡效果的影响。</p>\n<p>若一名魅影的生命值因死亡效果（例如来自如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute} 这样的法术）而降至 0，它会立刻被带往灵魂之河，其灵魂将重新踏上通往来世的常规道路。</p>\n<p>Though phantoms aren't alive, neither are they undead, and they are uniquely vulnerable to the effects of death.</p>\n<p>A phantom whose Hit Points are reduced to 0 as a result of a death effect (such as from a spell like @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute}) is immediately whisked away to the River of Souls, where their soul resumes the usual path to the afterlife.</p>"
            },
            "Vulnerable to Kindness": {
              "name": "友善易伤 Vulnerable to Kindness",
              "description": "<p>魅影能看见且听见的、30尺内的任何生物，都可以用一个具有听觉、专注、语言和心灵（特征）的两动作行动向它发出冷静且友善的问候。以这种方式向魅影问候的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[diplomacy|dc:15] 交涉检定。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[4d8[mental]] 伤害，且陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{震慑 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[2d8[mental]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 魅影受到 @Damage[1d8[mental]] 伤害。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 魅影不受影响，且在1轮内不受该弱点影响。</p>\n<p>Any creature within 30 feet that the phantom can see and hear can issue a calm and friendly greeting to it as a two-action activity with the auditory, concentrate, linguistic, and mental traits. A creature greeting the phantom in this manner must attempt a @Check[diplomacy|dc:15] check.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[4d8[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[2d8[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The phantom takes @Damage[1d8[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The phantom is unaffected, and is not affected by this weakness for 1 round.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>据大多数神学家所言，魂魄通往来世的典型轨迹相当直接。当凡人死亡时，其魂魄进入灵魂之河，并最终抵达骨园，在那里接受法莱斯玛的审判。被审判的魂魄随后前往其适当的终极安息之域——天堂、地狱、阿巴顿等等——并在那里成为祈求者。</p>\n<p>然而，当一名排队等待审判的魂魄过早地离开灵魂之河并被转移到灵界时，就会出现复杂情况。无论是由于夜鬼婆之类的邪恶闯入者、恶性的位面魔法，甚至是命运本身所致，这些魂魄都会从生死的自然秩序中被撬离，并在某种炼狱般的状态中徘徊。与祈求者不同，这些灵界的魅影仍保有其生前的记忆；而与幽灵等魂魄不同，魅影并未染上不死的污秽影响——至少起初并非如此，尽管腐化的威胁始终沉重地笼罩着魅影的存在。有些最终屈从于那般命运，另一些则终将重归灵魂之河。在那之前，这些游荡的魂魄自成一类——一种没有真正归宿、图谋或目的的存在。</p>\n<p>许多魅影并不愿意维持这般诡异的炼狱状态，要么因为他们渴望继续穿行于灵魂之河的旅程，要么因为他们畏惧不死的腐化。为了完成自然的灵性循环并接受审判、从而继续前往来世，魅影只需设法回到灵魂之河即可。然而，这样的寻求绝非易事——灵界朦胧的迷雾甚至会令最有经验的旅者迷失，而众多掠食者也在该领域中游荡，搜寻离群的魂魄以将其束缚或吞噬。</p>\n<p>The typical trajectory for souls passing to the afterlife is fairly straightforward, according to most theologians. When a mortal dies, their soul enters the River of Souls and eventually reaches the Boneyard, where it is judged by Pharasma. The judged soul moves onto its appropriate domain of final rest-Heaven, Hell, Abaddon, and so forth-where it becomes a petitioner.</p>\n<p>Complications arise, however, when a soul in queue for judgment prematurely departs from the River of Souls and is shunted into the Ethereal Plane. Whether as a result of nefarious interlopers like night hags, malignant planar magic, or even fate, these souls become dislodged from the natural order of life and death and linger in a sort of purgatory. Unlike petitioners, these ethereal phantoms retain memories of their life before death, and unlike spirits such as ghosts, phantoms aren't tinged with the foul influences of undeath-at least, not at first, though the threat of corruption hangs heavy over a phantom's existence. Some eventually succumb to that fate, while others eventually rejoin the River of Souls. Until then, these wandering souls are a kind unto themselves-one without a true home, agenda, or purpose.</p>\n<p>Many phantoms have no desire to remain in their strange state of purgatory, either because they seek to continue their journey through the River of Souls or because they fear the corruption of undeath. In order to complete the natural spiritual cycle and become judged so they can continue to the afterlife, a phantom must simply find a way back into the River of Souls. Such a quest is no easy feat, however-the hazy mists of the Ethereal Plane can befuddle even the most experienced traveler, and numerous predators prowl the realm in search of stray souls to bind or devour.</p>",
          "blurb": "变体魅影\nVariant phantom",
          "prototypeToken": "魅影渡鸦 Phantom Raven"
        },
        "Mandragora": {
          "name": "曼陀罗草 Mandragora",
          "tokenName": "曼陀罗草 Mandragora",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颚 Jaws"
            },
            "Thorny Vine": {
              "name": "荆棘藤蔓 Thorny Vine"
            },
            "Blood Scent": {
              "name": "血之气味 Blood Scent",
              "description": "<p>曼陀罗草能以30尺射程用模糊感官嗅到有血的生物；并且它能以30尺射程用精确感官嗅到有血的恶魔、精类与术士。</p>\n<p>A mandragora can smell creatures with blood as an imprecise sense at a range of 30 feet, and it can smell demons, fey, and sorcerers with blood as a precise sense at a range of 30 feet.</p>"
            },
            "Vulnerability to Supernatural Darkness": {
              "name": "对超自然黑暗的弱点 Vulnerability to Supernatural Darkness",
              "description": "<p>每当一株曼陀罗草在魔法黑暗术的区域中开始其回合时，它在该回合中获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}。</p>\n<p>Whenever a mandragora begins its turn in an area of magical darkness, it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} on that turn.</p>"
            },
            "Blood Drain": {
              "name": "吸血 Blood Drain",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 曼陀罗草有一个生物处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 曼陀罗草从其受擒或束缚的生物身上吸取血液，造成 @Damage[2d6[piercing]] 伤害（@Check[fortitude|dc:21|basic] 豁免）。如果该生物是恶魔、妖精或术士，曼陀罗草获得等于所造成伤害的临时生命值，持续1分钟。任何因被曼陀罗草吸血而受到任意伤害的生物，都会成为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{枯竭 1} 状态，直到其接受任意种类或数量的治疗。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The mandragora has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The mandragora drains blood from the creature it has grabbed or restrained, dealing @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:21|basic] save). If the creature is a demon, fey, or sorcerer, the mandragora gains temporary Hit Points equal to the damage dealt for 1 minute. A creature that takes any damage from having its blood drained by a mandragora is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} until it receives any kind or amount of healing.</p>"
            },
            "Mandragora Venom": {
              "name": "曼陀罗草毒液 Mandragora Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免投掷</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 6 轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] 伤害、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}，并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] 伤害、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{困惑}，并且 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{呆滞 1}（1 轮）</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 round)</p>"
            },
            "Piercing Shriek": {
              "name": "穿刺尖啸 Piercing Shriek",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 曼陀罗草发出一声令人不安的尖啸。30尺内每个非曼陀罗草的生物必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:23] 意志 豁免。</p><hr /><p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功或大失败</strong> 该生物恶心 2并 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1（状态）}。只要该生物仍处于恶心状态，这个缓慢状态的数值就不能被降低到1以下。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The mandragora emits an unsettling shriek. Each non-mandragora creature within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:23] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is sickened 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}. As long as the creature remains sickened, this slowed condition value can't be reduced below 1.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>曼陀罗草看起来像是一根刚从土里拔出的块根，长成了一个畸形成孩童模样的东西：面容怪诞，身体可怖地臃肿。这些阴险的小植物通常在曼德拉草根被恶魔之血浇灌后形成。根吸收了恶魔之血的异界性质后便会活动起来，并被迫去寻找血液作为食粮，否则就会因干渴而死。</p>\n<p>曼陀罗草总是饥饿、不断寻找养分，过着被阴影纠缠、痛苦不堪的生活，并会为了获得渴求的血而做出卑劣而绝望的行为。尽管曼陀罗草偏好注入魔力的血液，比如独角兽、妖精或术士的血；而且也能以药水、炼金炸弹与魔法灵药求生；但迫不得已时，它们也会以非魔法生物的血作为最后手段。它们觉得凡俗之血的味道寡淡而苦涩，并且毫不避讳地把这些抱怨直接说给自己吸食的生物听。</p>\n<p>典型的曼陀罗草体型与人类孩童相仿，但有些会不断生长，甚至长到可与巨人比拟的大小。有时它们在变大时会长出额外的肢体或粗陋的脸孔，最终变成对人形真正骇人的丑恶嘲弄。</p>\n<p>A mandragora looks like a freshly pulled tuber that has grown into the malformed shape of a child with a grotesque face and hideously bloated body. These insidious little plants typically form when a mandrake root is watered with a demon's blood. Upon absorbing the otherworldly properties of the demon's blood, the root animates and is forced to seek out blood to feast from, lest it die of thirst.</p>\n<p>Always famished and in search for sustenance, mandragoras live haunted, pained lives and perform vile and desperate acts to acquire the blood they crave. Though mandragoras prefer magically infused blood such as that of unicorns, fey, or sorcerers, and they can subsist on potions, alchemical bombs, and magical elixirs, they'll settle for the blood of non-magical creatures as a last resort. They find the flavor of mundane blood to be bland and bitter, and they don't blanch at voicing these complaints to the creatures on whom they feed.</p>\n<p>While the typical mandragora is the size of a human child, some continue to grow and grow, even reaching sizes comparable to giants. Sometimes as they get larger, they form additional limbs or rudimentary faces, eventually transforming into truly hideous mockeries of the human form.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "曼陀罗草 Mandragora"
        },
