            "Dagger": {
              "name": "匕首 Dagger",
              "description": "<p>这种小型刃器单手持握，用于在近战中刺击一名生物。它也可以投掷。</p>\n<p>This small, bladed weapon is held in one hand and used to stab a creature in close combat. It can also be thrown.</p>"
            },
