            "Scale Mail": {
              "name": "鳞甲 Scale Mail",
              "description": "<p>鳞甲由许多金属甲片缝在加固的皮革衬底上组成，通常做成长衫的形式，保护躯干、手臂和腿部。</p>\n<p>Scale mail consists of many metal scales sewn onto a reinforced leather backing, often in the form of a long shirt that protects the torso, arms, and legs.</p>"
            },
            "Signal Whistle": {
              "name": "信号哨 Signal Whistle",
              "description": "<p>吹响信号哨时，在开阔的地形上，最远半英里外都能清晰听见。</p>\n<p>When sounded, a signal whistle can be heard clearly up to half a mile away across open terrain.</p>"
            },
            "Bolts": {
              "name": "弩矢 Bolts",
              "description": "<p>弩矢比传统箭矢更短，但结构相似，是弩使用的弹药。</p>\n<p>Shorter than traditional arrows but similar in construction, bolts are the ammunition used by crossbows.</p>"
