            "Legal Lore": {
              "name": "法律学识 Legal Lore"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>守卫是城镇巡逻队或城市卫队的基层成员，受过训练以察觉麻烦、制服罪犯并服从命令。</p><hr /><p>规模更大的社会依赖于那些拥有权威与能力、能够解释并执行法律的人。有些人公正地履行这些职责，但也有些人严苛残忍，对任何无力支付赦免金的人施以严厉惩罚。</p>\n<p>Guards are rank-and-file members of a town watch or city guard, trained to look for trouble, take down criminals, and follow orders.</p><hr /><p>Larger societies rely on those with the authority and the ability to interpret and enforce laws. Some carry out these duties fairly, but others are harsh and cruel, imposing severe punishments on anyone unable to pay for clemency.</p>",
          "blurb": "人类守卫\nHuman guard",
          "prototypeToken": "城镇卫兵 Town Guard"
        },
        "Great Willow": {
          "name": "大尊柳 Great Willow",
          "tokenName": "大尊柳 Great Willow",
          "items": {
            "Divine Innate Spells": {
              "name": "神术内在法术 Divine Innate Spells"
            },
            "Nature's Pathway": {
              "name": "通身入林 Nature's Pathway",
              "description": "<p>你迈入一棵活树之中，其树干大到足以容纳你在其中，并立刻传送至5英里内任何一棵同样拥有足够粗大树干的树。你一进入第一棵树，便会立刻知晓射程内其他足够粗大的树的大致位置；若你愿意，也可以从原本那棵树退出。你无法将异次元空间随身携带；若你试图这么做，则该法术失败。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>强化（6环）</strong> 你离开的那棵树最远可以在50英里外。</p>\n<p><strong>强化（8环）</strong> 你离开的那棵树最远可以在500英里外。</p>\n<p><strong>强化（9环）</strong> 你离开的那棵树可以位于同一颗星球上的任何地方。</p>\n<p>You step into a living tree with a trunk big enough for you to fit inside it and instantly teleport to any tree within 5 miles that also has a sufficiently large trunk. Once you enter the first tree, you instantly know the rough locations of other sufficiently large trees within range and can exit from the original tree, if you prefer. You can't carry extradimensional spaces with you; if you attempt to do so, the spell fails.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The tree you exit can be up to 50 miles away.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The tree you exit can be up to 500 miles away.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The tree you exit can be anywhere on the same planet.</p>"
            },
            "Speak with Plants (Constant)": {
              "name": "植物交谈（恒定） Speak with Plants (Constant)",
              "description": "<p>你可以向植物和真菌提问并获得它们的回答，但该法术不会让它们比平常更友善或更聪明。大多数普通植物和真菌对其周遭世界有独特的看法，因此它们无法识别有关生物的细节，也不了解其紧邻区域之外的任何事情。狡猾的植物或真菌怪物很可能言辞简短且闪烁其词，而不那么聪明的则经常发表些愚蠢的评论。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>升阶（4环）</strong> 持续时间为8小时。</p>\n<p>You can ask questions of and receive answers from plants and fungi, but the spell doesn't make them more friendly or intelligent than normal. Most normal plants and fungi have a distinctive view of the world around them, so they don't recognize details about creatures or know anything about the world beyond their immediate vicinity. Cunning plant or fungus monsters are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"
            },
            "One with Plants": {
              "name": "与植物为一 One with Plants",
              "description": "<p>你可以选择要么变形为一株植物，要么与植物物质融合。处于变形状态时，你无法移动或影响植物外的任何事物，但你仍可施放法术，只要这些法术不需要穿出植物之外的效果线。你可以【解消】此法术。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>与植物融合</strong>该法术的持续时间为10分钟。施放该法术时，你必须接触一株体积足以容纳你和你随身物品的植物，否则该法术会被打断。融合期间，你能听到但无法看到植物外发生的事情。若你在植物体内时该植物受到伤害，你会被从植物中排出并承受10d6伤害。<em>魔法通行</em>会将你排出但不会造成伤害。只要你曾经处于植物之外，该法术就会结束。</li>\n<li><strong>变成植物</strong>该法术的持续时间为8小时。你变成一株大型植物——通常是一棵树。察觉检定不会揭示你的真实本性，但以你的法术DC为DC进行一次成功的自然或求生检定，会发现你看起来像是一株对该区域而言奇怪地全新的植物。处于此形态时，你可以使用你正常的感官观察周围的一切。作为植物，你的AC为20，且只有状态加值、状态减值、环境加值与环境减值会影响你。你在反射豁免上掷出的任何成功与大成功都视为失败\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can either transform into a plant or merge with plant matter. While transformed, you can't move or affect anything outside the plant, but you can cast spells as long as they don't require line of effect beyond the plant. You can Dismiss this spell.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Merge with Plants</strong> The spell's duration is 10 minutes. While casting the spell, you must touch a plant with enough volume to fit you and your possessions or the spell is disrupted. While merged, you can hear, but not see, what's going on outside the plant. If the plant takes damage while you're inside it, you're expelled from the plant and take 10d6 damage. <em>Magic passage</em> expels you without dealing damage. The spell ends if you're ever outside the plant.</li>\n<li><strong>Turn into a Plant</strong> The spell's duration is 8 hours. You become a Large plant—typically a tree. Perception checks don't reveal your true nature, but a successful Nature or Survival check against your spell DC reveals that you appear to be a plant that is strangely new to the area. While in this form, you can observe everything around you, using your normal senses. As a plant, your AC is 20, and only status bonuses, status penalties, circumstance bonuses, and circumstance penalties affect you. Any successes and critical successes you roll on Reflex saves are failures\n</li>\n</ul>"
            },
            "Figment": {
              "name": "幻象 Figment",
              "description": "<p>你创造一个简单的虚幻声音或影像。声音会为该法术添加听觉（特征），且该声音不能包含可理解的词语或精致的音乐。影像会添加视觉（特征），其大小不超过一个 5 尺立方体，并且若在 15 尺内观看，会明显显得粗糙且缺乏细节。当你施放或维持该法术时，你可以尝试用该幻象进行一次 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.GkmbTGfg8KcgynOA]{制造佯动}，使你的欺瞒检定获得 +2 环境加值。若该尝试对某个生物失败，则该生物识破该<em>拟像</em>。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.2Hg3a06gZCSnUgSA]{法术效果：拟像}</p>\n<p>You create a simple illusory sound or vision. A sound adds the auditory trait to the spell and the sound can't include intelligible words or elaborate music. A vision adds the visual trait, can be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and is clearly crude and undetailed if viewed from within 15 feet. When you Cast or Sustain the Spell, you can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.GkmbTGfg8KcgynOA]{Create a Diversion} with the illusion, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception check. If the attempt fails against a creature, that creature disbelieves the <em>figment</em>.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.2Hg3a06gZCSnUgSA]{Spell Effect: Figment}</p>"
            },
            "Spiritual Rope": {
              "name": "魂魄之绳 Spiritual Rope",
              "description": "<p>木灵神花费1分钟，用附近的材料编制一条附魔草绳。这条绳子可以缠绕在其他神灵生物身上，保护它们免受邪恶力量侵害。佩戴魂魄之绳的神灵获得对邪恶生物与效果造成的伤害的抗力5，并且在对抗邪恶效果以及来自邪恶生物的攻击与效果时，AC与豁免骰获得+1状态加值。</p>\n<p>木灵神总是佩戴一条魂魄之绳，并且它们在同一时间还能额外维持另一条魂魄之绳的存在。若要制造超出这两条之外的新绳，木灵神必须选择令另外两条中的一条释放其魔法。缠在非木灵神生物身上的魂魄之绳会在24小时后失去魔法，或在被带离木灵神的森林时失去魔法。</p>\n<p>The kodama spends 1 minute to fashion an enchanted straw rope out of nearby materials. The rope can be wrapped around other kami creatures to protect them from fell forces. A kami who wears a spiritual rope gains resistance 5 to damage from unholy creatures and effects and a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws against unholy effects and attacks and effects from unholy creatures.</p>\n<p>A kodama always wears a spiritual rope, and they can have one other spiritual rope in existence at a time. Creating a new rope beyond these two releases the magic of one of the other two ropes of the kodama's choosing. A spiritual rope around a creature other than a kodama loses its magic after 24 hours or if it's taken outside the kodama's forest.</p>"
            },
            "Fist": {
              "name": "拳头 Fist"
            },
            "Telepathy 50 feet": {
              "name": "心灵感应 50英尺 Telepathy 50 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"
            },
            "Ward": {
              "name": "护 Ward",
              "description": "<p>每个神灵都与一处护绑定：某个特定的动物、植物、物体或地点。神灵可以以单动作与其护融合或从中现身，该动作具有专注（特征）。融合期间，神灵可以用其通常的感官以及其护的感官来观察周围环境，但不能移动、与其护交流，或控制其护。此外，与其护融合的神灵每分钟回复生命值，如同其进行了整整一天的休息一般。</p>\n<p>木灵神的护是一棵特定的树。</p>\n<p>Every kami is bound to a ward: a specific animal, plant, object, or location. A kami can merge with or emerge from their ward as a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While merged, the kami can observe their surroundings with their usual senses as well as the senses of their ward, but can't move, communicate with, or control their ward. Additionally, a kami merged with their ward recovers Hit Points each minute as if they spent an entire day resting.</p>\n<p>A kodama's ward is a specific tree.</p>"
            },
            "Constant Spells": {
              "name": "持续法术 Constant Spells",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"
            },
            "Distracting Gaze": {
              "name": "扰乱凝视 Distracting Gaze",
              "description": "<p>30英尺。当一个生物在灵光中结束其回合时，它必须尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:21] 意志豁免。木灵神可以使用一个带有专注（特征）的单动作来启用或停用该灵光。</p>\n<p><strong>成功</strong> 该生物不受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>失败</strong> 该生物对木灵神处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} 状态。若该生物在灵光外结束其回合，则该状态结束。</p>\n<p><strong>大失败</strong> 同失败，另该生物在其保持着迷状态期间，处于 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} 状态。</p>\n<p>30 feet. When a creature ends its turn in the aura, it must attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save. The kodama can activate or deactivate this aura by using a single action, which has the concentrate trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} with the kodama. This condition ends if the creature ends its turn outside the aura.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, plus the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} as long as it remains fascinated.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>木灵神是一类栖居于树木之中的神灵。木灵神常见于天夏的古老森林，尤其是远离文明的原始老林。例如在敏凯的魂魄之森中，被木灵神附身的树木多到惊人，旅人穿行于区区一英亩的林地时，可能就会与数百、甚至数千个这类存在擦肩而过。</p>\n<p>木灵神竭尽全力守护它们的圣树，但单个木灵神对大多数恶鬼或其他毫不忌讳亵渎森林、或为获取自然资源而采伐森林者来说，不过是个小障碍。正如森林中的树木一般，木灵神在数量庞大、并与其他神灵共同行动时最为强大：它们能用带有魔力的稻草绳强化同伴，同时以摄人心魄的存在感分散强敌的注意。另一方面，木灵神对尊重其护的人并无恶意，甚至会允许德鲁伊和其他恭敬的生物在其范围内栖居。它们甚至可能会悄然引导迷路的旅人走出森林或回到安全之处。</p><hr /><p>神灵是来自天夏诸国的神圣自然魂魄，位于内海地区以东的遥远之地。它们担任自己所守护的自然物体与地点——其护——的守卫者，并且是恶鬼的古老宿敌（Pathfinder Monster Core 252–255）。神灵可以与其护融合，使它们能够暗中观察任何踏入其圣地之人。神灵会放任它们认为无害的人，但会警觉地战斗，以吓退任何被视为威胁者。</p>\n<p>A kodama is a type of kami who inhabits a tree. Kodama commonly appear in old Tian forests, especially old-growth forests far removed from civilization. In the Forest of Spirits in Minkai, for example, so many trees are possessed by kodama that a traveler might pass by hundreds, if not thousands, of these beings while journeying through a single acre of woodland.</p>\n<p>Kodama try their utmost to protect their sacred trees, but a single kodama is a minor obstacle to most oni or others who have no qualms about desecrating forests or harvesting them for natural resources. Like trees in a forest, kodama are most powerful in great numbers and among other kami, whom they can bolster with their magical straw ropes while distracting strong enemies with their mesmerizing presence. On the other hand, kodama bear no ill will toward those who respect their wards, even allowing druids and other deferential creatures to dwell within their bounds. They might even subtly guide lost travelers out of the forest or back to safety.</p><hr /><p>Kami are divine nature spirits from the lands of Tian Xia, far to the east of the Inner Sea region. They serve as guardians of natural objects and places they protect—their wards—and are ancient enemies of oni (Pathfinder Monster Core 252–255). Kami can merge with their wards, allowing them to surreptitiously watch anyone who treads upon their sacred grounds. Kami leave those who they deem harmless alone, but fight vigilantly to scare away anyone perceived as a threat.</p>",
          "allSaves": "+1 status to all saves vs. evil creatures",
          "ac": "+1 status vs. unholy creatures",
          "prototypeToken": "大尊柳 Great Willow"
        },
        "Tree Hollow": {
          "name": "树洞 Tree Hollow",
          "tokenName": "树洞 Tree Hollow",
          "items": {
            "Thousand-Year Dragonroot": {
              "name": "千年龙根 Thousand-Year Dragonroot",
              "description": "<p>龙根是一种根部呈浅金色的植物，遍布天夏各地生长。正如曼德拉草根或人参根有时被认为具有近似人形的形状一样，这些根看起来仿佛是龙。它们常用于调配治疗药水，但最受追捧的是那些已生长数百年的个体，因为它们可用于惑控系，制成千年龙根。</p>\n<p>当你启动一根千年龙根时，你的身体闪耀着金色光芒，提供如同火把般的照明。你获得40英尺的飞行速度与火焰抗力5，持续1分钟。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.p1pxUzwgWZ9l9jmD]{效果：千年龙根}</p>\n<p>Dragonroots are pale, golden-rooted plants that grow throughout Tian Xia. Just as mandrake roots or ginseng roots are sometimes regarded to have almost humanoid shapes, these roots appear as if they were dragons. They're commonly used in the formulation of healing potions, but the most sought-after have grown for centuries, for they're viable for enchantment into thousand-year dragonroots.</p>\n<p>When you activate a thousand-year dragonroot, your body shimmers with golden light, providing illumination as a torch. You gain a fly Speed of 40 feet and fire resistance 5 for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.p1pxUzwgWZ9l9jmD]{Effect: Thousand-Year Dragonroot}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "树心空洞 Tree Hollow"
        },
        "Brood Leech Swarm": {
          "name": "幼水蛭群 Brood Leech Swarm",
          "tokenName": "幼水蛭群 Brood Leech Swarm",
          "items": {
            "Tremorsense 30 feet": {
              "name": "震动感知 30 尺 Tremorsense 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>"
            },
            "Swarm Mind": {
              "name": "虫群心智 Swarm Mind",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwarmMind]</p>"
            },
            "Blood Draining Bites": {
              "name": "吸血噬咬 Blood Draining Bites",
              "description": "<p>虫群空间内的每个敌人受到 @Damage[2d6[piercing]] 伤害（@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic] 豁免）。反射豁免失败的生物还会受到 @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] 伤害，并暴露于幼水蛭群毒液之下。</p>\n<p>Each enemy in the swarm's space takes @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:21|basic] save). A creature who fails the Reflex save also takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage and is exposed to brood leech swarm venom.</p>"
            },
            "Brood Leech Swarm Venom": {
              "name": "幼水蛭群毒液 Brood Leech Swarm Venom",
              "description": "<p><strong>豁免检定</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>最长持续时间</strong> 6轮</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}，以及速度-5尺状态减值（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}、@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}，以及速度-10尺状态减值（1轮）。</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}, and -5-foot status penalty to Speed (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}, and -10-foot status penalty to Speed (1 round).</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>大多数体型较小的水蛭物种通常不会成群结队，但育雏水蛭却很容易聚集成翻腾起伏的蠕动肉毯，尽显贪食本性。当它们聚集到足以形成虫群的数量时，便会摒弃独行水蛭那种隐秘的吸食方式，转而以迅捷而无情的方式进食。在这种情况下，它们温和的毒液能影响到比其平常猎物大得多的生物。</p>\n<p>Most smaller species of leeches do not tend to swarm, but brood leeches are prone to gathering in seething, undulant mats of squirming gluttony. When they gather in sufficient numbers to swarm, they eschew the stealth of a lone leech's feeding methods in favor of swift and merciless feeding. In these situations, their mild venom can affect much larger creatures than their usual prey.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "幼水蛭群 Brood Leech Swarm"
        },
        "Giant Cockroach": {
          "name": "巨蟑螂 Giant Cockroach",
          "tokenName": "巨蟑螂 Giant Cockroach",
          "items": {
            "Mandibles": {
              "name": "颚钳 Mandibles"
            },
            "Scurry": {
              "name": "急奔 Scurry",
              "description": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 巨蟑螂成为一次近战攻击的目标</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 巨蟑螂在对抗触发攻击的AC上获得+2环境加值。在该攻击结算后，这只蟑螂可行走、攀爬或飞行至多10英尺。</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The giant cockroach is targeted by a melee attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The giant cockroach gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. After the attack resolves, the cockroach Strides, Climbs, or Flies up to 10 feet.</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>蟑螂是群居生物，除非在寻找食物，否则很少会独自出行。若冒险者在探索时遭遇一只巨蟑螂，他们最好提防其他同类，因为附近很可能有一整个巢群。</p>\n<p>Cockroaches are communal creatures, rarely setting out on their own unless they are searching for food. If an adventurer encounters a single giant cockroach while exploring, they had best take precautions against others, as there is likely an entire colony nearby.</p>",
          "prototypeToken": "巨蟑螂 Giant Cockroach"
        },
        "Roots": {
          "name": "根系 Roots",
          "tokenName": "根系 Roots",
          "items": {
            "Bright Blue Orchid": {
              "name": "亮蓝兰花 Bright Blue Orchid",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span>（操控）</p><hr /><p>治疗蒸汽是一种通过散布注入多种通常用于治疗与恢复的试剂之雾气，以加速自然恢复过程的物质。当从密封容器中释放时，蒸汽会充满一个 @Template[burst|distance:5]，持续 10 分钟，并且在同一时间最多能影响四个活体生物。超过最初四个的任何生物都不会获得益处；但若某个生物在持续时间结束前离开，则后来进入的一个新生物可以从雾气中获益。从蒸汽中获益的生物每 2 分钟回复 1 点生命值。受影响期间，该生物对抗疾病与毒素的豁免骰获得 +1 物品加值。若多个治疗蒸汽的区域重叠，只有最强的效果适用于重叠区域内的生物。强风会吹散雾气，使其在风吹拂期间失效。</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>Healing vapor is a substance that accelerates natural recovery processes by dispersing a mist infused with a variety of reagents typically used for healing and recovery. When deployed from a sealed container, the vapors fill a @Template[burst|distance:5], last for 10 minutes, and can affect up to four living creatures at one time. Any creatures beyond the first four gain no benefit, though if a creature leaves before the duration is over, a new creature that enters can benefit from the mist. A creature benefiting from the vapors regains 1 Hit Point every 2 minutes. While affected, a creature also gains a +1 item bonus to saving throws against diseases and poisons. If the areas of more than one healing vapor overlap, only the strongest applies to creatures inside overlapping areas. Strong wind disperses the mist, rendering it ineffective while the wind blows.</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "根系 Roots"
        },
        "Antechamber": {
          "name": "前厅 Antechamber",
          "tokenName": "前厅 Antechamber",
          "items": {
            "Thousand-Pains Fulu (Needle)": {
              "name": "千痛符箓（针） Thousand-Pains Fulu (Needle)",
              "description": "<p><strong>持续时间</strong> 1分钟</p>\n<p>由一名为了追求无尽生命而抛弃道德的外科医师所创造，<em>千痛符箓</em>会阻断体内元素的自然流动。被贴上符箓的生物必须进行一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic]。失败或大失败会使目标为持续性伤害埋下引线；该持续性伤害会在符箓持续时间内满足某个特定状态时被触发。</p>\n<p>拾起这张白色符箓的感觉就像用针扎了一下手。符箓会造成 @Damage[7d6[piercing]]，因为毛发、指甲与结缔组织向内刺入。在失败或大失败时，若目标随后使用带有移动（特征）的动作，它会受到 @Damage[2d6[persistent,piercing]]。</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute</p>\n<p>Created by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a <em>thousand-pains fulu</em> blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic]. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.</p>\n<p>Picking up this white fulu feels like you've stabbed your hand with a pin. The fulu deals @Damage[7d6[piercing]] as hair, nails, and connective tissues stab inward. On a failure or critical failure, if the target then takes an action with the move trait, it takes @Damage[2d6[persistent,piercing]].</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "前厅 Antechamber"
        },
        "Unlived Life": {
          "name": "未曾活过的生命 Unlived Life",
          "tokenName": "未竟之生 Unlived Life",
          "items": {
            "Jaws": {
              "name": "颌骨 Jaws"
            },
            "Claw": {
              "name": "爪击 Claw"
            },
            "Lifesense 30 feet": {
              "name": "生命感知 30 尺 Lifesense 30 feet",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Lifesense]</p>"
            },
            "Meant to Live": {
              "name": "注定要活下去 Meant to Live",
              "description": "<p>每当未复生者将要受到源自活力能量的伤害时，它改为恢复该数值一半的生命值。</p>\n<p>Whenever an unrisen would take damage from vitality energy, it instead heals half that number of Hit Points.</p>"
            },
            "Resurrection Vulnerability": {
              "name": "复活弱点 Resurrection Vulnerability",
              "description": "<p>拥有已准备或自发的、能够使死者复生的法术的生物（例如 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hnc7eGi7vyZenAIm]{Breath of Life} 或 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{死者复活}）可以消耗一个合适的法术位，以2行动摧毁30尺内的一个未复生者。若该未复生者在对抗该生物的法术DC进行意志豁免时成功，则此次尝试失败。</p>\n<p>A creature with a prepared or spontaneous spell that can restore the dead to life (such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hnc7eGi7vyZenAIm]{Breath of Life} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IkGYwHRLhkuoGReG]{Raise Dead}) can expend an appropriate spell slot as a 2-action activity to destroy an unrisen within 30 feet. The attempt fails if the unrisen succeeds at a Will save against the creature's spell DC.</p>"
            },
            "Rise Again": {
              "name": "再度崛起 Rise Again",
              "description": "<p>如果该未起者因火焰伤害、瓦解或其复生弱点以外的方式被降至0生命值，它会在其下个回合开始时回到不死状态。它拥有100生命值，并在其被摧毁的空间内处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{倒地}。该未起者在1小时内无法再次通过此能力返回。</p>\n<p>If the unrisen is reduced to 0 Hit Points by means other than fire damage, disintegration, or its resurrection vulnerability, it returns to unlife at the start of its next turn. It has 100 Hit Points and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} in the space in which it was destroyed. The unrisen can't be returned by this ability again for 1 hour.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚无治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Agonized Howl": {
              "name": "痛苦嚎叫 Agonized Howl",
              "description": "<p>未起者因其被诅咒的存在而痛苦嚎叫。处于@Template[type:emanation|distance:30]内的生物受到@Damage[9d8[mental]|options:area-damage]伤害，并进行一次@Check[will|dc:30|basic]豁免。未起者在[[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Agonized Howl]]{1d4轮}内无法再次使用“痛苦嚎叫”。</p>\n<p>The unrisen howls in pain at its cursed existence. Creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] take @Damage[9d8[mental]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[will|dc:30|basic] save. The unrisen can't use Agonized Howl again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Agonized Howl]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
            },
            "Awful Approach": {
              "name": "可怕的接近方式 Awful Approach",
              "description": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每10分钟一次</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> 未升者重塑其怪诞的形体以迅捷移动。它行走两次。任何在此次移动期间能看见未升者的活体生物必须成功通过一次 @Check[fortitude|dc:28] 豁免，否则将陷入 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 1}（若大失败则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{恶心 2}）；这是一个心灵与视觉效果。</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The unrisen reshapes its grotesque form to move swiftly. It Strides twice. Any living creature that can see the unrisen during this movement must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure); this is a mental and visual effect.</p>"
            },
            "Death Grip": {
              "name": "死亡之握 Death Grip",
              "description": "<p><strong>需求</strong> unrisen有一个活体生物处于@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{受擒}或@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{束缚}</p><hr /><p><strong>效果</strong> unrisen试图摧毁其受害者的生命力，使其与unrisen的命运相连。该生物必须在一次@Check[fortitude|dc:30]豁免中成功，否则变为@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{毁灭 1}。在诅咒持续期间，该生物从同时具有治疗与命能（特征）特征的效果中恢复的HP只有一半；若其死亡，任何试图将其从死亡中复活的尝试都会使其以unrisen的形态归来。若该生物的毁灭值降低至0，则诅咒自动结束。</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The unrisen has a living creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The unrisen attempts to destroy its victim's life force so it shares in the unrisen's fate. The creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:30] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1}. While the curse lasts, the creature regains only half as many HP from effects with both the healing and vitality traits; if it dies, any attempt to raise it from the dead causes it to return as an unrisen. The curse ends automatically if the creature's doomed value is reduced to 0.</p>"
            },
            "Grab": {
              "name": "抓取 Grab",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>未复生者是一团被撕裂的碎骨、腐败的脏器与溃烂的血肉拼凑而成的畸形聚合体，源于诸如复生这类仪式发生灾难性失误。必须极其谨慎，因为若这类仪式彻底失败，就可能产生未复生者——许多仪式施法者都曾在惊骇中领教过这一点。</p>\n<p>未复生者几乎没有智慧，只意识到其缺陷造物不断施加的痛苦，以及对生者的怨恨。它们往往会先攻击参与那场失败仪式的施法者，然后才会对周围其他所有人发起攻击。尽管未复生者扭曲的形体已无法辨认为复活所意图的目标，但它无言的嚎叫常常令人不安地与死者的声音极其相似。若在未复生者再次复起之前将其摧毁，它就会化作一小撮金属般的蓝绿色盐粒，被称为精华盐。</p>\n<p>An unrisen is a mangled conglomeration of splintered bones, decaying organs, and rotting flesh, created when a ritual such as resurrect goes catastrophically wrong. Immense care must be taken, for if such a ritual fails utterly, an unrisen can be the result—as many a ritualist has learned to their horror.</p>\n<p>Unrisen are barely intelligent, aware only of the agony constantly inflicted by their flawed creation and their resentment for the living. They tend to attack the casters involved in the botched ritual first before lashing out at everyone else around them. Though an unrisen's twisted form is unrecognizable as the intended target of the resurrection, its wordless howls are often disturbingly similar to the deceased's voice. If an unrisen is destroyed before it can rise again, it's reduced to a handful of metallic blue-green salts referred to as essential salts.</p>",
          "blurb": "未复苏者\nUnrisen",
          "hp": "meant to live, void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "未竟之生 Unlived Life"
        },
        "Lantern Making Reward": {
          "name": "制作天灯奖励 Lantern Making Reward",
          "tokenName": "制作天灯奖励 Lantern Making Reward",
          "items": {
            "Elixir of Life (Lesser)": {
              "name": "生命灵药（次级） Elixir of Life (Lesser)",
              "description": "<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span>（操作）</p><hr /><p>生命灵药会加速活体生物的自然治疗过程与免疫系统。饮用该灵药后，你恢复 @Damage[(3d6+6)[healing]] 生命值，并在10分钟内获得对抗疾病与毒素的豁免骰+1物品加值。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lPRuIRbu0rHBkoKY]{效果：生命灵药}</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>Elixirs of life accelerate a living creature's natural healing processes and immune system. Upon drinking this elixir, you regain @Damage[(3d6+6)[healing]] Hit Points and gain +1 item bonus to saving throws against diseases and poisons for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lPRuIRbu0rHBkoKY]{Effect: Elixir of Life}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "制作天灯奖励 Lantern Making Reward"
        },
        "Psychopomp's Boon": {
          "name": "招魂者的恩赐 Psychopomp's Boon",
          "tokenName": "招魂者的恩赐 Psychopomp's Boon",
          "hazarddescription": "<section id=\"secret-ORA6OcFSEfx6Pvuv\" class=\"secret\"><p>选择该PC最能派上用场的物品：一瓶<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.c21stU5rhN4F2fZl]{生命灵药（中等）}</em></p><p>、一个装有<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.aSRUX4WGfalK4A5J]{潜能水晶（强效）}</em>的小袋、一个<em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.TWSdWjp6dpodZkeV]{灵性号角（中等）}</em>，或一张来自该PC的魔法根源、实用的5环法术卷轴。</p></section>\n<section id=\"secret-ORA6OcFSEfx6Pvuv\" class=\"secret\"><p>Choose the item that the PC will gain the most use out of: a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.c21stU5rhN4F2fZl]{Elixir of Life (Moderate)}</em></p><p>, a pouch containing a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.aSRUX4WGfalK4A5J]{Potency Crystal (Greater)}</em>, a <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.TWSdWjp6dpodZkeV]{Spiritual Warhorn (Moderate)}</em>, or a scroll of a useful 5th-rank spell from that PC’s magical tradition.</p></section>",
          "prototypeToken": "招魂者的恩赐 Psychopomp's Boon"
        },
        "Partially Collapsed Display": {
          "name": "部分折叠显示 Partially Collapsed Display",
          "tokenName": "部分折叠显示 Partially Collapsed Display",
          "items": {
            "Lumber Lord's Axe": {
              "name": "木业大亨之斧 Lumber Lord's Axe",
              "description": "<p>这件不起眼的工具放在勤劳工人的腰带上也毫不违和。木质握柄上因多年使用而磨出的沟槽，以及一片打磨得不甚规整的刃口，使它给人一种被珍视的强烈印象；无论怎样清洁或试图去除气味，新劈木材的浓烈清香总是萦绕在斧刃上不散。持握或携带这把<em>+2强击冷铁真菌与植物绝望术战斧</em>的生物，会感到有义务讲真话，并且在尝试进行@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ewwCglB7XOPLUz72]{说谎}时承受–4状态减值。</p>\n<p><strong>启动</strong> 1分钟（交互）</p>\n<p><strong>频率</strong> 每日一次</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 你打磨并磨利这把斧头，之后其气味变得更为强烈，并且斧刃在1小时内转化为你所选择的标准级精金或标准级曙银；随后在持续时间结束后，樵夫之斧会恢复为冷铁。</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.8WnFg5HMKX8JEDLl]{效果：木业大亨之斧}</p>\n<p>This unassuming tool wouldn't look out of place on the belt of an industrious laborer. Grooves worn into the wooden handle over years of use and an irregularly sharpened blade give it the distinct impression of being cherished, and the potent scent of freshly chopped wood always clings to the axe's blade despite any attempt to clean it or remove the odor. A creature that holds or carries this <em>+2 striking cold iron fungus and plant bane battle axe</em> feels an obligation to tell the truth and receives a –4 status penalty to its attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ewwCglB7XOPLUz72]{Lie}.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> 1 minute (Interact)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You polish and sharpen the axe, after which its scent grows even more powerful and the axe's blade transforms into your choice of standard-grade adamantine or standard-grade dawnsilver for 1 hour; then after this duration, the woodcutter's axe reverts to cold iron.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.8WnFg5HMKX8JEDLl]{Effect: Lumber Lord's Axe}</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "部分折叠显示 Partially Collapsed Display"
        },
        "Dami's Poison": {
          "name": "达米的毒素 Dami's Poison",
          "tokenName": "达米的毒素 Dami's Poison",
          "items": {
            "Lethargy Poison": {
              "name": "昏睡毒素 Lethargy Poison",
              "description": "<p>昏睡毒素常被用于袭扰战术，供那些希望让受害者活着的袭击者使用；伏击者会撤退，直到毒素发作、受害者陷入昏迷。进一步接触昏睡毒素不需要目标再尝试额外的豁免骰；只有在对持续暴露进行的豁免骰中失败，才会使其阶段推进。</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>启动</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span>（操作）</p>\n<p><strong>豁免骰</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<p><strong>最大持续时间</strong> 4小时</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{缓慢 1}（1分钟）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}，无法进行察觉检定来醒来（1轮）</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{昏迷}，无法进行察觉检定来醒来（[[/gmr 1d4 #hours]]{1d4小时}）。</p>\n<p>Lethargy poison is commonly used in hit-and-run tactics by attackers who want their victims alive; the ambusher retreats until the poison sets in and the victim falls unconscious. Further exposure to lethargy poison does not require the target to attempt additional saving throws; only failing an saving throw against an ongoing exposure can progress its stage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 hours</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} (1 minute)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} with no Perception check to wake up (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} with no Perception check to wake up ([[/gmr 1d4 #hours]]{1d4 hours}).</p>"
            }
          },
          "prototypeToken": "达米的毒素 Dami's Poison"
        },
        "Forgotten Spirit": {
