          "items": {
            "Ghostly Hand": {
              "name": "幽灵之手 Ghostly Hand"
            },
            "Site Bound": {
              "name": "场地束缚 Site Bound",
              "description": "<p>一只典型的幽灵只能离它被杀害之处或其作祟之地很短的距离。一个典型的限制是120英尺。有些幽灵并非被束缚在某个地点，而是被束缚在一间房间、一栋建筑、一件物品或一只对它而言意义非凡的生物上。</p>\n<p>A typical ghost can stray only a short distance from where it was killed or the place it haunts. A typical limit is 120 feet. Some ghosts are instead bound to a room, building, item, or creature that was special to it rather than a location.</p>"
            },
            "Rejuvenation": {
              "name": "复苏 Rejuvenation",
              "description": "<p>纠正导致平民死亡的不公正，使其得以迈向来世。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一个幽灵被摧毁时，它会在其所束缚的地点内，于[[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4天}后重新成形，并完全痊愈。只有当有人查明其存在的原因，并纠正任何阻止其魂魄休息的事物时，幽灵才能被永久摧毁。</p>\n<p>Setting right the injustice that led to the commoner's death allows it to move on to the afterlife.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after [[/br 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>"
            },
            "Void Healing": {
              "name": "虚空治疗 Void Healing",
              "description": "<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"
            },
            "Frightful Moan": {
              "name": "骇人悲叹 Frightful Moan",
              "description": "<p>幽灵哀叹自己的命运，迫使每个在 @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30尺} 内的活体生物尝试一次 @Check[will|dc:21|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] 意志豁免。失败时，生物变为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 2}（大失败时则为 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{惊惧 3}）。成功时，生物在1分钟内暂时免疫此幽灵的骇人悲叹。</p>\n<p>The ghost laments its fate, forcing each living creature within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} to attempt a @Check[will|dc:21|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] save. On a failure, a creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to this ghost's frightful moan for 1 minute.</p>"
            },
            "Dwelling Lore (applies to the place the ghost is bound to)": {
              "name": "居所传说（适用于幽灵所束缚的地点） Dwelling Lore (applies to the place the ghost is bound to)"
            }
          },
          "publicNotes": "<p>平民幽灵是一个相信自己死得不公的普通人。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>当一些凡人因悲惨的境遇而死或未能了结心愿时，他们的灵魂可能会徘徊不去，并在一个对他们生前意义重大的地点作祟。</p>\n<p>The ghost commoner is an ordinary person who believes they died unjustly.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When some mortals die through tragic circumstances or without closure, their souls can linger and haunt a locale significant to them in life.</p>",
          "blurb": "女性平民幽灵\nFemale Ghost Commoner",
          "hp": "rejuvenation, void healing",
          "prototypeToken": "遗忘的魂魄 Forgotten Spirit"
        }
