              "name": "着陆 Landing",
              "text": "<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90198-blackbean.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">更改着陆页</span>\n    <span class=\"keepme\">宏</span>\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"link\">@UUID[Macro.rBIb5pBQjnN580WN]{着陆艺术选择器} @UUID[Macro.GGqWSOaEpZB9ahxt]{切换PC指示物显示（4个角色）} @UUID[Macro.bHJEPuGqZpkYoBTX]{（6个角色）}</span>\n</div>\n<p>你可以使用这些宏更改着陆场景。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px black)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/metamorphic-logo.svg\" alt=\"MetaMorphic Digital Studio\" data-tooltip=\"MetaMorphic Digital Studio\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">模组支援</span>\n    <span class=\"keepme\">联系</span>\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"link\">\n    <strong>\n      <a href=\"https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/\"> https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/ </a>\n    </strong>\n  </span>\n</div>\n<p>如需报告本产品的漏洞或其他问题，请通过我们的服务台填写一份支援请求。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring-combined.webp\" alt=\"The blank token art\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">指示物环</span>\n    <span class=\"keepme\">动态指示物</span>\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"link\"> @UUID[Macro.jj1tg19fPA6JUI1P]{启用动态环与回合标记} </span>\n</div>\n<p>该模组使用动态指示物环。使用上面的宏来启用为该AP设计的环，以及它的战斗回合标记。</p>\n<p>\n  该模组中使用的\n  <strong>\n    <a href=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring.webp\"> 空白指示物环 </a>\n  </strong>\n  和\n  <strong>\n    <a href=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring-background.webp\"> 背景 </a>\n  </strong>\n  也一并包含在内，方便你制作同风格的静态指示物。\n</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(2.4)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90196-great-willow.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">模组更新日志</span>\n    <span class=\"keepme\">网站</span>\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"link\">\n    <strong>\n      <a href=\"https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/changelog/pf2e-season-of-ghosts\"> 鬼季 </a>\n    </strong>\n  </span>\n</div>\n<p>查看该模组的最新改动。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90196-ugly-cute.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">屋顶控制</span>\n    <span class=\"keepme\">宏</span>\n  </h2>\n  <span class=\"link\">@UUID[Macro.BWWblcGuSnns1YdA]{屋顶控制}</span>\n</div>\n<p>你可以使用此宏在顶部屋顶的不同显示模式之间切换。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <img style=\"transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px black)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/sog-dice-thumbnail.webp\" />\n  <h2 class=\"split no-toc no-toc\"><span class=\"keepme\">额外功能</span><span class=\"keepme\">音乐与骰子</span></h2>\n  <span class=\"link\"><a href=\"https://www.michaelghelfistudios.com/\">Michael Ghelfi Studios</a> <a href=\"https://foundryvtt.com/packages/dice-so-nice\">Dice so Nice</a></span>\n</div>\n<p>为庆祝该冒险之路的合集与重制版发布，本模组加入了额外功能：由 Michael Ghelfi Studios 为《鬼季》冒险之路专门创作的一张音乐专辑，以及可与广受欢迎的 FoundryVTT 模组 Dice so Nice 一起使用的定制 3D 骰子！</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90198-blackbean.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Change Landing Pages</span>\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Macros</span>\n    </h2>\n    <span class=\"link\">@UUID[Macro.rBIb5pBQjnN580WN]{Landing Art Picker} @UUID[Macro.GGqWSOaEpZB9ahxt]{Toggle PC Token Display (4 Characters)} @UUID[Macro.bHJEPuGqZpkYoBTX]{(6 Characters)}</span>\n  </div>\n  <p>You can change the Landing scene with these Macros.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px black)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/metamorphic-logo.svg\" alt=\"MetaMorphic Digital Studio\" data-tooltip=\"MetaMorphic Digital Studio\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n      <span class=\"keepme\">MODULE SUPPORT</span>\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Contact</span>\n    </h2>\n    <span class=\"link\">\n      <strong>\n        <a href=\"https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/\"> https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/ </a>\n      </strong>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <p>To report bugs or other issues with this product, please fill out a support request with our service desk.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring-combined.webp\" alt=\"The blank token art\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Token Ring</span>\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Dynamic Token</span>\n    </h2>\n    <span class=\"link\"> @UUID[Macro.jj1tg19fPA6JUI1P]{Enable Dynamic Ring and Turn Marker} </span>\n  </div>\n  <p>This module makes use of Dynamic Token Rings. Use the Macro above to enable the ring designed for this AP alongside it's combat turn marker.</p>\n  <p>\n    The\n    <strong>\n      <a href=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring.webp\"> Blank Token Ring </a>\n    </strong>\n    and\n    <strong>\n      <a href=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/ring/sog-ring-background.webp\"> Background </a>\n    </strong>\n    used in the module are also included to enable you to make your own static tokens in the same style.\n  </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(2.4)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90196-great-willow.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Module Changelog</span>\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Website</span>\n    </h2>\n    <span class=\"link\">\n      <strong>\n        <a href=\"https://support.metamorphic-digital.com/changelog/pf2e-season-of-ghosts\"> Season of Ghosts </a>\n      </strong>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <p>Check out the latest changes made to the module.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(1.2)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/tokens/pzo90196-ugly-cute.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc\">\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Roof Control</span>\n      <span class=\"keepme\">Macro</span>\n    </h2>\n    <span class=\"link\">@UUID[Macro.BWWblcGuSnns1YdA]{Roof Control}</span>\n  </div>\n  <p>You can toggle between different display modes for Overhead Roofs with this macro.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"encounter\">\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <img style=\"transform:scale(1);filter:drop-shadow(1px 1px 2px black)\" src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/sog-dice-thumbnail.webp\" />\n    <h2 class=\"split no-toc no-toc\"><span class=\"keepme\">EXTRA FEATURES</span><span class=\"keepme\">Music &amp; Dice</span></h2>\n    <span class=\"link\"><a href=\"https://www.michaelghelfistudios.com/\">Michael Ghelfi Studios</a> <a href=\"https://foundryvtt.com/packages/dice-so-nice\">Dice so Nice</a></span>\n  </div>\n  <p>To celebrate the compilation and remaster of the Adventure Path, this module includes extra features: an album of music specifically created for the Season of Ghosts Adventure Path composed by Michael Ghelfi Studios, as well as custom made 3D dice usable with the popular add-on FoundryVTT module Dice so Nice!</p>\n</section>"
            }
