              "name": "转生族裔专长 Reincarnation Ancestry Feats",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Reincarnation Ancestry Feats\">转世血统专长</h1>\n<p>很少有人记得自己的前世，除了那些通过仪式转世的人；但凡在今生之前曾经历过其他人生者，其灵魂中都承载着过往存在的经验之重。当某人确实回想起那些前世时，便能以大多数血统做不到的方式汲取记忆与经验。不论境遇如何，你对生命的新契约，都因你回忆起的灵魂往昔冒险的点滴而扩展了心智。</p>\n<p>\n  以下稀有血统专长，适用于任何至少转世过一次的角色——无论这是其背景故事的一部分，还是在游戏过程中发生的转世；这也包括所有在进入最终幕后的<em>鬼季冒险路径</em>中的PC。\n</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.XKAPPvPpS4b8rSFp]{重整旗鼓} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">r</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">专长 1</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">命运</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">转世的灵魂</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.uUSCoVhn5pWbkLgm]{像蟑螂一样}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">专长 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">休整</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">转世的灵魂</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.rGU4nKAPCkC0lK4Z]{经验之重}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">专长 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">转世的灵魂</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.2HkagmqG9rsQfyfR]{隔世智慧}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">专长 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">转世的灵魂</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-animal-soul-siblings.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Animal Soul Siblings\" data-tooltip=\"Animal Soul Siblings\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-animal-soul-siblings.webp'