ackstory or because of a reincarnation that took place during play—which includes all PCs in the\n  <em>Season of Ghosts Adventure Path</em> once they begin the final act.\n</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.XKAPPvPpS4b8rSFp]{Let's Try That Again} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">r</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Feat 1</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fortune</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Reincarnated</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.uUSCoVhn5pWbkLgm]{Like a Roach}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Feat 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Downtime</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Reincarnated</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.rGU4nKAPCkC0lK4Z]{Weight of Experience}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Feat 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Reincarnated</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.2HkagmqG9rsQfyfR]{Wisdom from Another Life}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Feat 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Reincarnated</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-animal-soul-siblings.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Animal Soul Siblings\" data-tooltip=\"Animal Soul Siblings\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-animal-soul-siblings.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<br />\