            "Major Spirit Powers": {
              "name": "上等魂力 Major Spirit Powers",
              "text": "<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Major Spirit Powers\">上等魂力</h2>\n<p>\n      这些魂力进一步挖掘英雄们近似不死的状态，赋予他们幽灵以及其他魂魄的能力。这些能力在PC手中可能极为强大，并能为标准的冒险难题提供富有创意的解决方案。由于上等魂力旨在赋予更重要的幽灵主题能力，且不与情绪和人格特征相关，玩家在选择上等魂力时不太会遇到主题脱节的问题；不过，就像次等魂力一样，你也应当随时按需调整名称与主题，好让你的玩家拥有更合心意的选项。\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.DVILYNQVB2hx9Chl]{刺骨麻痹} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">寒冷</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">失能</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.pHXGTgjwWY3OBRF2]{蜕变} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.0HChyDaXdpXN11q4]{闪烁身形} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">幻术</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">视觉</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.SnIvcCNASDzgevQK]{飞行} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n     <img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-grudge.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Grudge\" data-tooltip=\"Grudge\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-grudge.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-2em;clear:both\" />\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"pf2-icon\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.3yYlHV7GBrafsDwE]{怨念} 1</span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">情绪</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">恐惧术</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">失能</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.KtqDsKBuOmCkbDcR]{抵御死亡}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.KbQXDTBi5MKtHbpU]{魂河倒影} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">法术塑形</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"pf2-icon\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.sjLNgLFyDvTt6VVV]{抽取生命} 2</span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">虚无</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.UnQ8oHYc0dBJHZv9]{不灭肉身}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">上等魂力</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Major Spirit Powers\">Major Spirit Powers</h2>\n<p>\n      These spirit powers tap further into the heroes’ undead-adjacent state, giving them the abilities of ghosts and\n      other spirits. These abilities can be extremely potent in the hands of PCs and allow for creative solutions to\n      standard adventuring problems. Since major spirit powers are about granting more significant ghost-themed\n      abilities and aren’t associated with emotions and personality traits, players shouldn’t run into thematic\n      disconnects when choosing a major spirit power, but just as with minor spirit ones, you should feel free to\n      change\n      names and themes as you see fit to give your players more appealing choices for them to make.\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.DVILYNQVB2hx9Chl]{Chilling Paralysis} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Cold</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Incapacitation</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.pHXGTgjwWY3OBRF2]{Dematerialize} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.0HChyDaXdpXN11q4]{Flickering Figure} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Illusion</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Visual</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.SnIvcCNASDzgevQK]{Flight} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n     <img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-grudge.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Grudge\" data-tooltip=\"Grudge\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-grudge.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-2em;clear:both\" />\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"pf2-icon\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.3yYlHV7GBrafsDwE]{Grudge} 1</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Emotion</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Fear</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Incapacitation</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.KtqDsKBuOmCkbDcR]{Resist Death}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.KbQXDTBi5MKtHbpU]{River's Reflection} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Spellshape</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"pf2-icon\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.sjLNgLFyDvTt6VVV]{Sap Life} 2</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Void</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.UnQ8oHYc0dBJHZv9]{Undying Flesh}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Major Spirit Power</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>"
