            "Minor Spirit Powers": {
              "name": "次要魂魄之力 Minor Spirit Powers",
              "text": "<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Minor Spirit Powers\">次要魂魄力量</h2>\n<p>以下力量代表PC的情绪或意志力以极端方式影响现世。这些力量在显现时往往令人不安：从字面意义上来说，它们就是对物体、地点与人的作祟之举。鼓励每位玩家选择与其角色的个人欲望与怨念相对应的力量。如果你的某位玩家所扮演的角色，其个性与这些选项都不太契合，你可以调整这些能力的名称与风味，让这些玩家能为其角色获得更合适的选择。或者，你也可以把这些魂魄力量当作灵感，自行设计新的选项。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.VMpc8QWEZxSH8Mr4]{好奇} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">语言</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.fsxCcyWpag5iuWOU]{妄想}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">听觉</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">幻术</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">嗅觉</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">视觉</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.ekiKKfsBDFEeVmun]{使命} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">失能</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">语言</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-obsession.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Obsession\" data-tooltip=\"Obsession\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-obsession.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-2em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.w4t0ElpqNQRFCaPJ]{爱情}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.g6iKvH7Y3InQtZ8K]{痴迷}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.w1nzN61S6NfkDH7Y]{热情} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">火焰</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.YdG3UwVBia5AyLjO]{恨意} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">次要魂魄力量</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">诅咒</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">神秘</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Minor Spirit Powers\">Minor Spirit Powers</h2>\n<p>The following powers represent the extreme force of a PC’s emotions or willpower affecting the living realm. These powers are often unsettling in manifestation: they’re, quite literally, acts of haunting objects, places, and people. Encourage each player to pick powers that correspond with their character’s personal desires and grudges. If one of your players has a character whose personality doesn’t quite match any of these options, you can adjust the names and flavor of these abilities to give those players more appropriate choices for their characters. Alternatively, you can use these spirit powers as inspiration for new options of your own design.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.VMpc8QWEZxSH8Mr4]{Curiosity} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Linguistic</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.fsxCcyWpag5iuWOU]{Delusion}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Auditory</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Illusion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Olfactory</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Visual</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.ekiKKfsBDFEeVmun]{Duty} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Incapacitation</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Linguistic</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-obsession.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Obsession\" data-tooltip=\"Obsession\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-obsession.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-2em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.w4t0ElpqNQRFCaPJ]{Love}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.g6iKvH7Y3InQtZ8K]{Obsession}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.w1nzN61S6NfkDH7Y]{Passion} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fire</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\">\n    <span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.adventure-specific-actions.Item.YdG3UwVBia5AyLjO]{Spite} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Minor Spirit Power</span>\n  </h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Curse</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Occult</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
            },
            "Haunting the Living": {
              "name": "纠缠生者 Haunting the Living",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Haunting the Living\">萦绕生者</h1>\n<aside class=\"sidebar float-right\">\n  <h1>给GM的注记</h1>\n  <p>\n    此处呈现的灵体力量并不打算在第10章之外使用——它们会让PC获得超出其正常能力的额外力量，因此不应在该章之外用于游戏中。出自\n    <em>《死者之书》</em>的 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.52nzskpmUt9AjUf8]{Ghost} 变体，是更长期战役中你想允许鬼魂PC时的绝佳选项。\n  </p>\n</aside>\n<p>\n      当PC在第3幕期间转生进入生者世界时，他们显现为被困在生命与不死之间某处的存在。处于这种状态时，PC大多能正常行动，但外观会像是自身的半固态灵质版本。他们并非完全透明，但其实体躯壳的边缘似乎会摇曳闪烁，使他们看起来诡异而令人不安。处于这种状态时，他们仍是活体生物，但会获得以下部分与不死生物共有的类似能力。作为更接近魅影的活体生物，他们依旧易受虚空伤害影响，并会被活力效果治疗。\n    </p>\n<p><strong>不死视觉：</strong>他们获得昏暗视觉；若其族裔已拥有昏暗视觉，则改为获得黑暗视觉。</p>\n<p>\n      <strong>转生存续：</strong>处于该状态的PC永远不会获得受伤（状态），但会在从濒死（状态）恢复时暴露于灵魂衰退（见下文）。如果PC在转生期间死亡，他们会在柳岸镇思维空间中苏醒且仍然活着，并获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1} 状态。\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>转生庇护：</strong>他们对抗疾病、毒素、睡眠，以及任何会施加麻痹（状态）的效应时的豁免骰（或任何其他防御），获得+2环境加值。\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>灵体力量：</strong>处于该状态时，PC可以通过其新获得的灵体力量与生者世界交互。当PC在生者世界中显现其转生躯体时，他们每人从后续页面所列的灵体力量中获得两个次要灵体力量与一个主要灵体力量。每次PC进行每日准备时，他们都可以重新选择自己选定的灵体力量。当灵体力量要求进行豁免骰时，使用该PC职业DC或法术DC中较高者。任何要求进行攻击检定的灵体力量，使用该DC–10。进行任何反制检定以决定效果时，使用PC自身的等级。\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>灵魂衰退：</strong>起初，PC很可能会沉醉于他们新获得的灵体力量。然而，每当转生PC濒临死亡时，他们就有可能彻底迷失于其鬼魂本性之中。每当处于濒死（状态）的转生PC本应获得受伤（状态）时，他们改为暴露于灵魂衰退，并必须再进行一次新的豁免骰，以抵抗提升该诅咒的阶段。\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 data-no-toc class=\"split\"><span class=\"keepme\">灵魂衰退</span> <span class=\"keepme\">诅咒\n          7</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n\n      <li class=\"trait\">诅咒</li>\n\n      <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    </ul>\n<p class=\"no-indent\">\n      PC的自我感被鬼魂般的欲望所吞没，最终使其沦为没有意识的空壳。灵魂衰退不会因时间流逝而提升或降低其阶段。相反，每当转生PC从濒死（状态）恢复时，他们必须对抗该诅咒再进行一次新的豁免骰。PC在第10章中可能遭遇的某些事件或效应，也会迫使他们对抗灵魂衰退进行豁免骰。一旦某名PC身上的转生仪式效果结束，他们会立刻并完全从灵魂衰退中恢复。\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type:none\">\n    <li><strong>豁免骰</strong> @Check[will|dc:23|traits:curse,magical];</li>\n    <li><strong>阶段1</strong>\n      灵体弱点5；</li>\n    <li><strong>阶段2</strong>\n      灵体弱点10；</li>\n    <li><strong>阶段3</strong>\n      灵体弱点10，并且每当PC在一次攻击检定或技能检定中大失败时，他们会 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}，因为其思绪沉溺于这次失败； </li>\n    <li><strong>阶段4</strong>\n      同阶段3；</li>\n    <li><strong>阶段5</strong>\n      同阶段3；</li>\n    <li><strong>阶段6</strong>\n      PC沦为没有思考能力的闹鬼之物。在诅咒被移除或\n      <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8Lk9K3tRnV68MQPW]{Transmigrate}</em> 仪式的持续时间结束之前，他们会重复一段短小的行动循环，不再受玩家控制（持续时间：无限）。</li>\n  <p></p>\n\n    </ul></section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Haunting the Living\">Haunting the Living</h1>\n<aside class=\"sidebar float-right\">\n  <h1>A Note For GMs</h1>\n  <p>\n    The spirit powers presented here aren’t intended for play outside of Chapter 10—they grant additional powers to\n    PCs beyond their normal capabilities and shouldn’t be used in play beyond that chapter. The @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.52nzskpmUt9AjUf8]{Ghost} archetype from\n    <em>Pathfinder Book of the Dead</em> is an excellent option for longer-term games where you want to allow\n    ghostly PCs.\n  </p>\n</aside>\n<p>\n      When the PCs transmigrate into the living world during Act 3, they manifest as beings trapped somewhere between\n      life and undeath. While in this state, the PCs function mostly normally but appear as semisolid ectoplasmic\n      versions of themselves. They aren’t quite transparent, but their solid bodies seem to waver and shimmer along\n      the edges, giving them an eerie, unsettling appearance. While in this state, they’re living creatures but gain some\n      of the following abilities similar to those shared by undead creatures. As living creatures more akin to phantoms,\n      they remain susceptible to void damage and are healed by vitality effects.\n    </p>\n<p><strong>Undead Vision:</strong> They gain low-light vision, or darkvision if their ancestry already has low-light vision.</p>\n<p>\n      <strong>Transmigrated Survival:</strong> A PC in this state never gains the wounded condition but instead becomes exposed to soul\n      degradation upon recovering from the dying condition (see below). If a PC dies while transmigrated, they awaken,\n      alive, in the Willowshore mindscape and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed 1} condition.\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>Transmigrated Protection:</strong> They gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws (or any other defense) against\n      disease, poison, sleep, and any effects that would impose the paralyzed condition.\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>Spirit Powers:</strong> While in this state, the PCs can interact with the living world via their newfound spirit powers.\n      When the PCs manifest their transmigrated bodies in the living world, they each gain two minor spirit powers and\n      one major spirit power from the spirit powers listed on the following pages. Every time the PCs do their daily\n      preparations, they can reselect their chosen spirit powers. When a spirit power calls for a saving throw, use\n      the\n      higher of that PC’s class DC or spell DC. Any spirit powers calling for attack rolls use this DC – 10. Use the\n      PC’s own level for determining the effects of any counteract checks.\n    </p>\n<p>\n      <strong>Soul Degradation:</strong> Initially, PCs will likely revel in their newfound spirit powers. Whenever a transmigrated PC\n      comes close to death, however, they risk losing themselves entirely to their ghostly nature. Each time a dying\n      transmigrated PC would normally gain the wounded condition, they’re instead exposed to soul degradation and must\n      attempt a new saving throw to resist increasing the stage of this curse.\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 data-no-toc class=\"split\"><span class=\"keepme\">Soul Degradation</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Curse\n          7</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">rare</li>\n\n      <li class=\"trait\">Curse</li>\n\n      <li class=\"trait\">magical</li>\n    </ul>\n<p class=\"no-indent\">\n      The PC’s sense of self becomes subsumed by ghostly desires, eventually rendering them a senseless shell. Soul\n      degradation doesn’t increase or decrease its stage over the passage of time. Instead, each time a transmigrated\n      PC recovers from the dying condition, they must attempt a new saving throw against this curse. Certain events or\n      effects that the PCs might encounter in Chapter 10 can also force them to save against soul degradation. Once\n      the effects of transmigrate ritual end for a PC, they immediately and fully recover from soul degradation.\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type:none\">\n    <li><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[will|dc:23|traits:curse,magical];</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 1</strong>\n      spirit weakness 5;</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 2</strong>\n      spirit weakness 10;</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 3</strong>\n      spirit weakness 10, and each time the PC critically fails an attack roll or skill check, they’re @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} as their mind obsesses over\n      the failure; </li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 4</strong>\n      as stage 3;</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 5</strong>\n      as stage 3;</li>\n    <li><strong>Stage 6</strong>\n      The PC is reduced to an unthinking haunt. Until the curse is removed or the duration of the\n      <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8Lk9K3tRnV68MQPW]{Transmigrate}</em> ritual ends, they repeat a short loop of actions and are no longer under the\n      control of the player (unlimited duration).</li>\n  <p></p>\n\n    </ul></section>"
            },
            "New Rituals": {
              "name": "新仪式 New Rituals",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"New Rituals\">新仪式</h1>\n<p>请注意，成功施放其中一些仪式（尤其是洞开鬼打墙与移魂迁体）是推进本战役故事所必需的——如果你发现PC在成功施放这些仪式方面遇到困难，考虑在每次重复尝试时将施放DC降低2至5，并向玩家解释：随着练习，他们在那个特定仪式上的表现正在变得更好。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yrsgOdj5oqp7lEQY]{食月}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.INEAWirvb8c1eAFD]{终夜守夜}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">治疗</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VJgSQBYwXGDbMmiW]{思维空间转移}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">传送</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-ransack-the-night.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Ransack the Night\" data-tooltip=\"Ransack the Night\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-ransack-the-night.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.PvkEzzCaDT07DcJb]{洞开鬼打墙}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">祝圣</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksJFGSGlNpUhwcsp]{掠夺黑夜}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">黑暗</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FQZaQXiKtHdVjSc5]{招待失者}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wAJ8mXPYbyAg0qWX]{如蜜冬至}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8Lk9K3tRnV68MQPW]{移魂迁体}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 4</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">独特</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">治疗</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.oYxxcgszpT242sEi]{冬之息}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">仪式 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"New Rituals\">New Rituals</h1>\n<p>Note that successfully casting some of these rituals (particularly open the wall of ghosts and transmigrate) is required to progress this campaign’s story—if you find the PCs are struggling with succeeding at these, consider reducing the DCs to cast by 2 to 5 with each repeated attempt, explaining to the players that, with practice, they’re getting better at that particular ritual.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yrsgOdj5oqp7lEQY]{Gnaw at the Moon}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.INEAWirvb8c1eAFD]{Last Night's Vigil}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Healing</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VJgSQBYwXGDbMmiW]{Mindscape Shift}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Teleportation</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-ransack-the-night.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Ransack the Night\" data-tooltip=\"Ransack the Night\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-ransack-the-night.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.PvkEzzCaDT07DcJb]{Open the Wall of Ghosts}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consecration</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.ksJFGSGlNpUhwcsp]{Ransack the Night}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Darkness</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.FQZaQXiKtHdVjSc5]{Regale the Lost Ones}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wAJ8mXPYbyAg0qWX]{Sweetest Solstice}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.8Lk9K3tRnV68MQPW]{Transmigrate}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 4</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">Unique</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Healing</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.oYxxcgszpT242sEi]{Winter's Breath}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Ritual 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
            },
            "New Spells": {
              "name": "新法术 New Spells",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"New Spells\">新法术</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-lifes-fresh-bloom.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Life's Fresh Bloom\" alt=\"Life's Fresh Bloom\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-lifes-fresh-bloom.webp');width:60%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n\n<p>\n      据说以下六个法术最初由谭杉寺的创立者智惠创造。\n      事实上，这些法术早在智惠之前就已存在，而她在世时只是提倡使用它们。尽管她缺乏施放这六个法术全部的技能，但她仍特别注重保存相关知识，并让她的追随者能够使用它们。在她死后，随着谭杉寺的根源一同，这些法术的知识也逐渐消逝。在这场冒险中，它们仅以六张脆弱卷轴的形式存在，被藏匿在谭杉寺废墟中一间密室里。\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.11haL5O9KMpY5Fv7]{纠缠命运} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.2TVc8NabmGpc092W]{生命花开} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">治疗</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">活力</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.n2CM3NeRuq5RSY19]{预言家之运} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">r</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GabRQPc9qD86jDGI]{神圣雨云}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术\n          4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">神圣</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.a0MfDnUa33oWM74s]{明日黎明}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术 4</span>\n      </h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">光亮</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.eONVFSbBiqaDLGey]{镜墙术}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">法术\n          4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">专注</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">操作</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"New Spells\">New Spells</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-lifes-fresh-bloom.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Life's Fresh Bloom\" alt=\"Life's Fresh Bloom\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-lifes-fresh-bloom.webp');width:60%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n\n<p>\n      The following six spells are said to have been originally created by Zhi Hui, founder of the Tan Sugi monastery.\n      In truth, the spells predate Zhi Hui, and their use was merely advocated by her in life. Even though she lacked\n      the skill to cast all six of these spells, she made a point of preserving their knowledge and making them\n      available to her followers. After her death, knowledge of these spells faded alongside the Tan Sugi monastery’s\n      traditions. In this adventure, they exist only in the form of six fragile scrolls hidden away in a secret room\n      in the Tan Sugi monastery ruins.\n    </p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.11haL5O9KMpY5Fv7]{Entangle Fate} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.2TVc8NabmGpc092W]{Life's Fresh Bloom} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Healing</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Vitality</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.n2CM3NeRuq5RSY19]{Prophet's Luck} <span class=\"pf2-icon\">r</span></span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell 4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GabRQPc9qD86jDGI]{Sacred Nimbus}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell\n          4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Holy</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.a0MfDnUa33oWM74s]{Tomorrow's Dawn}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell 4</span>\n      </h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Light</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>\n    <br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n      <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.eONVFSbBiqaDLGey]{Wall Of Mirrors}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Spell\n          4</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"traits\">\n      <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Concentrate</li>\n      <li class=\"trait\">Manipulate</li>\n    </ul>\n    </section>"
            },
            "Pilgrimage Gifts": {
              "name": "朝圣礼物 Pilgrimage Gifts",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Pilgrimage Gifts\">朝圣礼物</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-branchofthegreatsugi.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Branch of the Great Sugi\" data-tooltip=\"Branch of the Great Sugi\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-branchofthegreatsugi.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<p>以下物品代表PC们在@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther]{第7章}开始时可能获得的奖励。你应当为每名PC分配其中一件物品作为报酬。未使用的物品要么可以放在谭杉寺的@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther.JournalEntryPage.09e14storagero00]{E14}区域，供PC们之后发现；要么也可以在PC们完成@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther]{第7章}的职责并返回柳岸镇后，由神秘商人神藏拿出来出售。</p>\n\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.h7RtjyqHouB3pGgr]{大杉枝}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.VMYiP4xRd1hPa5ny]{幽灵围巾}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">灌注</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EHMGDwY0oSZAHz8Y]{繁花发夹}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">灌注</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-rootboots.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Root Boots\" data-tooltip=\"Root Boots\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-rootboots.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JrvrGairz2itBqhj]{红绳结}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">灌注</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.azZNewz2sEWwZwtZ]{明心头巾}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">灌注</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.kQiO32jZmuxAiqGV]{根靴}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">灌注</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.SNF8g7u8JYzqvsU1]{魂扇}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Pilgrimage Gifts\">Pilgrimage Gifts</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-branchofthegreatsugi.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Branch of the Great Sugi\" data-tooltip=\"Branch of the Great Sugi\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-branchofthegreatsugi.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<p>The following items represent possible gifts the PCs can earn at the start of @UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther]{Chapter 7}. You should assign one of these items as a reward to each PC. Items not used can either be placed in area @UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther.JournalEntryPage.09e14storagero00]{E14} of the Tan Sugi monastery for the PCs to discover later or instead might be offered for sale by the mysterious merchant Shinzo after the PCs return to Willowshore once they complete their duties in @UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog09inther]{Chapter 7}.</p>\n\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.h7RtjyqHouB3pGgr]{Branch of the Great Sugi}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.VMYiP4xRd1hPa5ny]{Ghost Scarf}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EHMGDwY0oSZAHz8Y]{Hairpin of Blooming Flowers}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-rootboots.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Root Boots\" data-tooltip=\"Root Boots\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-rootboots.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JrvrGairz2itBqhj]{Red Thread Knot}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.azZNewz2sEWwZwtZ]{Resolute Mind Wrap}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.kQiO32jZmuxAiqGV]{Root Boots}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.SNF8g7u8JYzqvsU1]{Spirit Fan}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
            },
            "Heroic Legacies": {
              "name": "英雄传承 Heroic Legacies",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Heroic Legacies\">英雄遗产</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-kinburissandalsofbounding.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Kinburi’s Sandals of Bounding\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-kinburissandalsofbounding.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n\n<p>以下这些稀有魔法物品曾被天夏过往的英雄人物使用。神秘商人神藏设法收集到了这四件物品可正常运作的复制品，并在@UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog11faceto]{第9章}开始时将它们作为礼物赠予PC。虽然PC使用其中任何一件物品都不需要了解其历史过往，但你可能会发现，将这段传说揭示给玩家能让这些遗产更具分量。你可以让神藏在把物品交给PC时讲述这些传说，或允许PC自己通过在一次@Check[society|dc:26|traits:concentrate,secret,skill,action:recall-knowledge|name:Recall Knowledge]检定中成功，或进行一次合乎逻辑关联的传闻学检定来回忆知识，从而想起这些英雄壮举与传奇成就的故事。尽管这些物品都是独一无二的复制品，但若你愿意，也可以将它们作为稀有物品整合进自己的游戏中；若你这么做，考虑将它们改名，去掉每件宝藏所关联的NPC名字。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.MV9tQYR5vsjPeyar]{莓莓的怀抱}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">独特</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-vashusninthlife.webp\" class=\"float-right\" data-tooltip=\"Vashu’s Ninth Life\" alt=\"Vashu’s Ninth Life\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-vashusninthlife.webp');width:40%;margin-right:-4em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.LuW0KcoGUJ49dFCJ]{金布里的弹跳木屐}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">独特</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">注入</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.kDbL1zbqf76odwlU]{重文的千篇诗}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">独特</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔契书</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.8pFegnc8KTHsvQZ0]{瓦修的第九条命}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">独特</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Heroic Legacies\">Heroic Legacies</h1>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-kinburissandalsofbounding.webp\" class=\"float-right\" alt=\"Kinburi’s Sandals of Bounding\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-kinburissandalsofbounding.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n\n<p>The following rare magic items were once used by heroic figures in Tian Xia’s past. The mysterious merchant Shinzo managed to gather working replicas of these four items, and he offers them as gifts to the PCs at the start of @UUID[JournalEntry.pf2apsog11faceto]{Chapter 9}. While knowledge of any of these items’ historic past isn’t required for a PC to use them, you might find that revealing this lore to the players can help to make these legacies more impactful. You can have Shinzo relate these legends to the PCs as he gives them the items, or you can allow the PCs a chance to recall these stories of heroic deeds and legendary accomplishments themselves by succeeding at a @Check[society|dc:26|traits:concentrate,secret,skill,action:recall-knowledge|name:Recall Knowledge] check or a logically associated Lore check to Recall Knowledge. While these items are unique replicas, you can integrate them into your own game as rare items if you wish. If you do so, consider renaming them by omitting the NPC name associated with each treasure.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.MV9tQYR5vsjPeyar]{Injigo's Loving Embrace}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">Unique</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-vashusninthlife.webp\" class=\"float-right\" data-tooltip=\"Vashu’s Ninth Life\" alt=\"Vashu’s Ninth Life\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-vashusninthlife.webp');width:40%;margin-right:-4em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.LuW0KcoGUJ49dFCJ]{Kinburi's Sandals of Bounding}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">Unique</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Invested</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.kDbL1zbqf76odwlU]{Juubun's One Thousand Poems}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">Unique</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Grimoire</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.8pFegnc8KTHsvQZ0]{Vashu's Ninth Life}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">Unique</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
            },
            "Trappings of Power": {
              "name": "力量象征 Trappings of Power",
