            "Willowshore Fulus": {
              "name": "柳岸镇符箓 Willowshore Fulus",
              "text": "<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Willowshore Fulus\">柳岸镇符箓</h2>\n<p>柳岸镇的工匠将善解理念与泛灵论、神门根源及当地习俗相融合，开发出许多在他处罕见的符箓。在该镇灾难性地转变为思维空间之前，柳岸镇符箓曾是冒险者最渴求的资源之一。关于符箓的额外规则见《Pathfinder 宝藏宝库》第218页。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.GZo6icE8v07xQKKc]{动物退避符箓}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">符箓</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">护符</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90196-firecrackerfulu.webp\" class=\"float-right\" data-tooltip=\"Firecracker Fulu\" alt=\"Firecracker Fulu\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90196-firecrackerfulu.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-6em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.G3EIZLApRwt3hq13]{鞭炮符箓}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">符箓</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">护符</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">隐私结界符箓</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 1+</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">符箓</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.UaSVmCl0JQ76kiYY]{隐私结界符箓（走廊）}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 1</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.PfVTTuTsErku7vss]{隐私结界符箓（房间）}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 5</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pDbWjlhIoQpUIvLb]{隐私结界符箓（室厅）}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 9</strong></span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5DiekAhNEjr6Vwi3]{旅者符箓}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">符箓</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">护符</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Willowshore Fulus\">Willowshore Fulus</h2>\n<p>Mixing Sangpotshi concepts with animism, Shenmen traditions, and local practices, Willowshore crafters have developed a number of fulus rarely found elsewhere. Before the town’s disastrous transformation into a mindscape, Willowshore fulus were one of the town’s most sought-after resources by adventurers. Additional rules for fulus appear on page 218 of <em>Pathfinder Treasure Vault</em>.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.GZo6icE8v07xQKKc]{Animal-Turning Fulu}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fulu</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Talisman</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90196-firecrackerfulu.webp\" class=\"float-right\" data-tooltip=\"Firecracker Fulu\" alt=\"Firecracker Fulu\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90196-firecrackerfulu.webp');width:50%;margin-right:-6em;clear:both\" />\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.G3EIZLApRwt3hq13]{Firecracker Fulu}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 1</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fulu</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Talisman</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">Privacy Ward Fulu</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 1+</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fulu</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.UaSVmCl0JQ76kiYY]{Privacy Ward Fulu (Hallway)}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 1</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.PfVTTuTsErku7vss]{Privacy Ward Fulu (Room)}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 5</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.pDbWjlhIoQpUIvLb]{Privacy Ward Fulu (Chamber)}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 9</strong></span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5DiekAhNEjr6Vwi3]{Traveler's Fulu}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 2</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Fulu</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Talisman</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
