            "Magic Tea": {
              "name": "魔茶 Magic Tea",
              "text": "<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Magic Tea\">魔茶</h2>\n<p>特殊原料、独特的冲泡方法与魔法强化会将寻常的茶转化为可消耗物品，并提供额外好处。在第2幕中，PC们在款待柳岸镇的神灵后，将获得本节所详述全部魔茶的配方作为奖励。</p>\n<p><strong>茶（特征）：</strong>魔茶是一种药水。你在饮用时将其启动，并会将其消耗殆尽。魔茶具有药水与茶特征。当你制作一剂魔茶时，你提供的原材料是形态特殊且昂贵的茶叶。制作魔茶的流程包括用魔法试剂浸润茶叶、净化水源，并将茶叶浸泡于水中，产出的本质上是一种格外美味的药水。你可以在饮用魔茶或将其喂给另一名生物时，以一个交互行动启动它，如同它是一瓶药水。你也可以用一项10分钟行动来启动魔茶，该行动需要上等茶具（此工匠工具包最多可供四人同时进行该行动时共用）来准备茶饮，然后饮用之或在一次简短的茶道仪式中将其呈给他人；在仪式结束后，魔茶的效果开始生效；以这种方式启动魔茶会增强其效果，详见下方各物品的“茶道仪式”条目。</p>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-teapot.webp\" alt=\"Covenant Tea\" data-tooltip=\"Covenant Tea\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-teapot.webp')\" />\n<p>一旦你饮用了一剂魔茶，你会在24小时内对该种特定的魔茶获得暂时免疫。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ByaYlK0QmnqEbCE2]{立契茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.RK03uy9os4H0dUfS]{精力茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 4</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.n5xlR7ApXgfJRkbF]{长夜茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sq4MIaXhb2zcCT6y]{月花茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Cz0XxRVMma7cllCd]{安梦茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 6</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qyjaueXduvCUeDbp]{复活茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 5</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EMviiUBFb5hB1X5Q]{灵视茶}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">罕见</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">药水</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">茶</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<h2 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Magic Tea\">Magic Tea</h2>\n<p>Special ingredients, unique brewing methods, and magical enhancements transform common teas into consumable items that provide additional benefits. The PCs are rewarded with the formulas for all of the magic tea detailed in this section after they entertain Willowshore’s kami in Act 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Tea (trait): </strong>Magic tea is a type of potion. It activates when you drink it, which uses it up. Magic tea has the potion and tea traits. When you craft a dose of magic tea, the raw materials you supply are in the form of unusual and costly tea leaves. The process of crafting magic tea includes infusing the leaves with magical reagents, purifying the water, and steeping the tea in the water, resulting in what’s essentially a particularly delicious potion. You can activate magic tea with an Interact action as you drink it or feed it to another creature, as if it were a potion. You can also activate magic tea with a 10-minute activity that requires sterling tea ware (this artisan’s toolkit can be shared by up to four people who take this activity simultaneously) to prepare the tea and then consume it or present it to someone during a short tea ceremony, after which the magic tea’s effects begin; activating magic tea in this way enhances its effect, as detailed in each item’s Tea Ceremony entry below.</p>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-teapot.webp\" alt=\"Covenant Tea\" data-tooltip=\"Covenant Tea\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90197-teapot.webp')\" />\n<p>Once you drink a dose of magic tea, you’re temporarily immune to that particular type of magic tea for 24 hours.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ByaYlK0QmnqEbCE2]{Covenant Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.RK03uy9os4H0dUfS]{Energizing Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 4</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.n5xlR7ApXgfJRkbF]{Longnight Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sq4MIaXhb2zcCT6y]{Moon Blossom Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 9</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Cz0XxRVMma7cllCd]{Peace in Dreams Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 6</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qyjaueXduvCUeDbp]{Resurrection Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 5</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EMviiUBFb5hB1X5Q]{Spiritsight Tea}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 7</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Magical</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Potion</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Tea</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"
