            "Armor & Armaments": {
              "name": "护甲与军备 Armor & Armaments",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Armor &amp; Armaments\">护甲与军备</h1>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.YFAaJntmFK2fPqi5]{龙龟甲}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 12</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">非普通</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">已注能</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ergvi4pLRMndtiQj]{龙火半弓}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 12</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">非普通</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">火焰</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.eZximo6owpLhQPZ7]{辟邪盾}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 11</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">非普通</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-four-tigerblade.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Four-Tiger Blade\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-four-tigerblade.webp');width:40%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<section class=\"action\">\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ZwJXdOdnE8TcSHK1]{魔族之饥}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 4</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait unique\">唯一</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">魔法</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.05L6c6B8XuU8imfM]{四虎刀}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 12</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n    <li 