            "Alchemy": {
              "name": "炼金术 Alchemy",
              "text": "<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Alchemy\">炼金</h1>\n<p>这些炼金物品中的两件（提神丹和提神香皂）使用与炼金食物相关的特征：锭剂与加工。关于这些特征的完整规则见<em>《探路者：宝藏库》</em>第46页。</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.u4R5KKvgKU0jOkjb]{提神丹}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 10</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">非普通</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">炼金</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">锭剂</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qrgUIr4PAvLvHn5C]{提神香皂}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 5</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">非普通</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">炼金</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">治疗</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">加工</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5lhQ79p0Z3j1VsY3]{松木药酒}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">稀有</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">炼金</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">摄入</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">毒素</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-silversoulbomb.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Silversoul Bomb\" alt=\"Silversoul Bomb\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-silversoulbomb.webp');width:30%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">银魂炸弹</span> <span class=\"keepme\">物品 3+</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait\">稀有</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">炼金</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">炸弹</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">消耗品</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">心灵</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">飞溅</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.oE3fHS3CUs15bZ4r]{银魂炸弹}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 3</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.mfc9IT94CPnKKBG8]{银魂炸弹（强效）}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 11</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.R7I0KwKM3PNZn0zJ]{银魂炸弹（极效）}</span>\n    <span><strong>物品 17</strong></span>\n  </p>\n</section>\n<h1 data-no-toc data-split-here=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</h1>\n<p>Two of these alchemical items (the energizing pill and invigorating soap) use traits associated with alchemical food: lozenge and processed. Full rules for these traits can be found in <em>Pathfinder Treasure Vault</em>, page 46.</p>\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.u4R5KKvgKU0jOkjb]{Energizing Pill}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 10</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Alchemical</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Lozenge</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.qrgUIr4PAvLvHn5C]{Invigorating Soap}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 5</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait uncommon\">Uncommon</li>\n    <li class=\"trait\">Alchemical</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Healing</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Processed</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5lhQ79p0Z3j1VsY3]{Matsuki's Medicinal Wine}</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 3</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait rare\">Rare</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Alchemical</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Ingested</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Poison</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n<br />\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-silversoulbomb.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Silversoul Bomb\" alt=\"Silversoul Bomb\" class=\"float-right\" style=\"shape-outside:url('modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90199-silversoulbomb.webp');width:30%;margin-right:unset;clear:both\" />\n<section class=\"action\">\n  <h2 class=\"no-toc split\"><span class=\"keepme\">Silversoul Bomb</span> <span class=\"keepme\">Item 3+</span></h2>\n  <ul class=\"traits\">\n    <li class=\"trait\">RARE</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Alchemical</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Bomb</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Consumable</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Mental</li>\n\n    <li class=\"trait\">Splash</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.oE3fHS3CUs15bZ4r]{Silversoul Bomb}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 3</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.mfc9IT94CPnKKBG8]{Silversoul Bomb (Greater)}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 11</strong></span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"split\" style=\"padding-left:4ch;gap:2.5ch\">\n    <span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.R7I0KwKM3PNZn0zJ]{Silversoul Bomb (Major)}</span>\n    <span><strong>Item 17</strong></span>\n  </p>\n</section>"
            },
            "Adventure Toolbox": {
              "name": "冒险工具箱 Adventure Toolbox",
              "text": "<h1 class=\"chapter-heading no-toc\" data-split-here=\"Adventure Toolbox\">\n  <span>冒险工具箱</span>\n</h1>\n<p>在这条冒险路径中，随着季节展开，等待PC们发现的有各式各样的魔法物品、法术、仪式，以及其他供玩家角色选择的选项。其中一些只是旅途中可找到的新宝藏，而另一些则是在游戏过程中通过达成成就所获得的特定奖励。</p>\n<img src=\"modules/pf2e-season-of-ghosts/assets/art/pzo90198-being-a-ghost.webp\" data-tooltip=\"Being a Ghost\" class=\"chapter-image\" />\n<h1 class=\"chapter-heading no-toc\" data-split-here=\"Adventure Toolbox\">\n  <span>Adventure Toolbox</span>\n</h1>\n<p>A wide range of magic items, spells, rituals, and other player character options await discovery by PCs as the seasons unfold in this Adventure Path. Some of these are simply new treasures to find during the journey, while others are specific rewards earned through achievements during play.</p>"
